
#bookname=benfey (sa-en)
#stripmethod=keep
#sametypesequence=h
#description=Data from https://www.sanskrit-lexicon.uni-koeln.de/ as on 2026-07-29

अ|अं|अः
अऽ अ-, a negative prefix, corresponding to the अ᳓- privative in Greek; see अन्-.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंश्
अंश् अंश्, see अम्स्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंश|अंशः
अंश अंश, rarely अंस, m.<BR> 1. A part, a share.<BR> 2. Booty.<BR> 3. Inheritance, Man. 9, 47.<BR> 4. See अंस.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनंश
अन्- + अंश अन्- + अंश, adj. excluded from a share of the heritage, Man. 9, 201.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकांश|एकांशः
एक- + अंश एक- + अंश, m. 1. a single part, Man. 9, 150. 2. a part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थांश|चतुर्थांशः
चतुर्थ- + अंश चतुर्थ- + अंश, 1. m. a fourth. 2. adj. entitled to a quarter, Man. 8, 210.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयांश
तृतीय- + अंश तृतीय- + अंश, adj. entitled to a third part, Man. 8, 210.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यंश|त्र्यंशः
त्रि- + अंश त्रि- + अंश, (m.) sing. three shares, Man. 9, 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्व्यंश
द्वि- + अंश द्वि- + अंश, (m.) sing. two shares, Man. 9, 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशु|अंशुः
अंशु अंशु (cf. शो), m. A ray of light, a sunbeam.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ἀκτίν.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मांशु|घर्मांशुः
घर्म- + अंशु घर्म- + अंशु, m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मांशु|तिग्मांशुः
तिग्म- + अंशु तिग्म- + अंशु, m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीक्ष्णांशु|तीक्ष्णांशुः
तीक्ष्ण- + अंशु तीक्ष्ण- + अंशु,<BR> I. adj. having hot beams.<BR> II. m. 1. the sun. 2. fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनांशु|दशनांशुः
दशन- + अंशु दशन- + अंशु, m. the brightness of the teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिव्यांशु|दिव्यांशुः
दिव्य- + अंशु दिव्य- + अंशु, m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीप्तांशु|दीप्तांशुः
दीप्त- + अंशु दीप्त- + अंशु, m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयांशु|प्रालेयांशुः
प्रालेय- + अंशु प्रालेय- + अंशु, m. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रांशु|सहस्रांशुः
सहस्र- + अंशु सहस्र- + अंशु, m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधांशु|सुधांशुः
सुधा- + अंशु सुधा- + अंशु, m. 1. the moon. 2. camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंसांशु
हंस- + अंशु हंस- + अंशु, adj. white.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमांशु|हिमांशुः
हिम- + अंशु हिम- + अंशु, m. 1. the moon. 2. camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशुक|अंशुकं
अंशुक अंशु + क, n.<BR> 1. A leaf.<BR> 2. Fine cloth; cloth; leaf and cloth, Ṛt. 6, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीनांशुक
चीन- + अंशुक चीन- + अंशुक, n. silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्वंशुक
तनु- + अंशुक तनु- + अंशुक, n. a thin cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पताकांशुक
पताका- + अंशुक पताका- + अंशुक, n. a flag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सितांशुक
सित- + अंशुक सित- + अंशुक, adj., f. का, dressed in a white cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तनांशुक
स्तन- + अंशुक स्तन- + अंशुक, n. a cloth covering the bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंशुमन्त्|अंशुमत्
अंशुमन्त् अंशु + मन्त्.<BR> I. adj., f. मती. Radiant.<BR> II. m. The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंस्
अंस् अंस्, also अंश् अंश्, i. 10, Par. To divide.<BR> --With वि वि.<BR> 1. To break asunder.<BR> 2. To deceive, Pañc. 202, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंस|अंसः
अंस अंस, also अंश अंश, probably from अम् (originally, To be strong), m. and n. The shoulder.<BR> --Cf. Goth. amsa; ἄσιλλα; Lat. humerus and ansa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंसल|अंसलः
अंसल अंस + ल, adj., f. ला. Strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंह्
अंह् अंह्, i. 1, Ātm. To go.<BR> --Caus. To send.<BR> --† i. 10, Par. To shine, or to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहस्
अंहस् अंहस् (ह् instead of घ्, cf. अघ; from a lost vb. अङ्घ् = ἄγχω), n.<BR> 1. Pain.<BR> 2. Sin.<BR> --Cf. ἄχνυμαι, ἄχος, ἀκαχεῖν, ἄγος and έγγύ corresponding to Ved. अंहु; Goth. aggvus Lat. angustus, angere, anxius, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंह्रि|अंह्रिः
अंह्रि अंह्रि (ह् instead of घ्, cf. अङ्घ्रि), m. The foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्
† अक् अक्, i. 1, Par. To wind or move tortuously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकरुणत्व
अकरुणत्व अ-करुण + त्व (cf. करुणा), n. Cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकर्णक
अकर्णक अ-कर्ण + क, adj., f. णिका. Having no ears. Rām. 5, 17, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकल्कता
अकल्कता अ-कल्क + ता, f. Honesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकामता
अकामता अ-काम + ता, f. Exemption from love, Man. 2, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकिंचित्कर
अकिंचित्कर अकिंचित्कर, i. e. अ-किम्-चिद्-कर, adj. Innocent, Pañc. 187, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुतोभय|अकुतोभयः
अकुतोभय अकुतोभय, i. e. अ-कुतस्-भय, adj., f. या. Free from any danger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुलता
अकुलता अ-कुल + ता, f. Low state, Man. 3, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुह
अकुह अकुह, adj. s. One who does not deceive, an honest man, Rām. 2, 109, 27.<BR> --Cf. अ-कुहक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकृत|अकृतं
अकृत अ-कृत.<BR> I. adj., f. ता.<BR> 1. Not done.<BR> 2. Undone, Man. 8, 117.<BR> 3. Not cultivated, Man. 10, 114.<BR> 4. Wavering, MBh. 14, 34.<BR> II. f. ता. A daughter who is not by a formal declaration, but only mentally, appointed to supply an heir for her father, MBh. 9, 136.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृताकृत|कृताकृतः
कृत- + अकृत कृत- + अकृत, adj. 1. wrought and unwrought. 2. prepared and not prepared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकृतबुद्धित्व
अकृतबुद्धित्व अकृत-बुद्धि + त्व, n. Rudeness of mind, Bhag. 18, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्तु|अक्तुः
अक्तु अक्तु, m. Night, Chr. 289, 2 = Rigv. 1, 50, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्ष्
अक्ष् अक्ष् (probably an old desiderat. of 1. अश्), i. 1. and ii. 5, अक्ष्णु, Par. To pervade, to fill, to accumulate.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To disperse.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To pervade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्ष|अक्षं|अक्षः
1. अक्ष अक्ष, probably from a lost vb. अक्ष्, corresponding to ὀσσ in ὄσσομαι<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. The eye; particularly as latter part of comp. adj., f. क्षी.<BR> 2. An organ of sense, Pañc. ii, d. 164.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A die, Man. 4, 74.<BR> 2. The name of a plant, Terminalia Bellerica, of which the nuts are used as dice, and the seed for making rosaries.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ὄσσομαι, ὄκκος; Lat. oculus; and see अक्षि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलपत्राक्ष
कमल-पत्र- + अक्ष कमल-पत्र- + अक्ष, adj., f. क्षी, adj. having eyes like lotus-leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटाक्ष|कूटाक्षः
कूट- + अक्ष कूट- + अक्ष, m. a false die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालाक्ष|जालाक्षः
जाल- + अक्ष जाल- + अक्ष, m. a lattice window.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्राक्ष|ताम्राक्षः
ताम्र- + अक्ष ताम्र- + अक्ष, adj. red-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकाक्ष
तारक- + अक्ष तारक- + अक्ष, 1. adj. having stars for eyes. 2. m. a proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यक्ष|त्र्यक्षः
त्र्यक्ष त्र्यक्ष, i. e. त्रि-,<BR> I. adj. having three eyes.<BR> II. m. a name of Rudra-Śiva, and of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाक्ष
दशाक्ष दशाक्ष, i. e. दशन्-, m. the name of a spell or charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माक्ष|पद्माक्षं|पद्माक्षः
पद्म- + अक्ष पद्म- + अक्ष, adj. lotus-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुण्डरीकाक्ष|पुंडरीकाक्ष|पुण्डरीकाक्षं|पुण्डरीकाक्षः
पुण्डरीक- + अक्ष पुण्डरीक- + अक्ष, m. a name of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कराक्ष|पुष्कराक्षः
पुष्कर- + अक्ष पुष्कर- + अक्ष, adj. lotus-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्दाक्ष|मंदाक्ष|मन्दाक्षं
मन्द- + अक्ष मन्द- + अक्ष, n. modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोहिताक्ष|लोहिताक्षः
लोहित- + अक्ष लोहित- + अक्ष, adj. red-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्राक्ष|सहस्राक्षः
सहस्र- + अक्ष सहस्र- + अक्ष,<BR> I. adj. thousand-eyed.<BR> II. m. a name of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वक्ष
सु- + अक्ष सु- + अक्ष, adj. 1. handsome-eyed. 2. acute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्ष|अक्षं|अक्षः
2. अक्ष अक्ष, probably akin to अज्, m.<BR> 1. The axle of a wheel.<BR> 2. A wheel.<BR> 3. A car.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ἄξων; O.H.G. ahsa; A.S. eax; Lat. axis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्ष|एकाक्षः
एक- + अक्ष एक- + अक्ष, adj. having one axle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षन्
अक्षन् अक्षन्, see अक्षि.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यक्षन्
त्र्यक्षन् त्र्यक्षन्, i. e. त्रि-, and हरि-, adj. epithets of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षयत्व
अक्षयत्व अ-क्षय + त्व, n. Imperishableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षर|अक्षरं|अक्षरः
अक्षर अ-क्षर.<BR> I. adj., f. रा. Imperishable.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A word.<BR> 2. A syllable.<BR> 3. The holy syllable ॐ.<BR> 4. A letter.<BR> 5. A vowel.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनक्षर|अनक्षरं
अन्- + अक्षर अन्- + अक्षर, adj. one who utters what ought not to be said.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्षर
एक- + अक्षर एक- + अक्षर, adj. monosyllabic, Man. 2, 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुणाक्षर
घुण- + अक्षर घुण- + अक्षर, n. a figure bored by a woodworm, and by accident [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a " target="_blank">Page0003-a + 39</a>] resembling a letter, Rājat. 4, 167 (Pañc. 42, 12, read घुणाक्षर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरक्षर
चतुर्- + अक्षर चतुर्- + अक्षर, n. four syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यक्षर|त्र्यक्षरः
त्र्यक्षर त्र्यक्षर, i. e. त्रि-, adj. triliteral, Man. 11, 265.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडक्षर
षडक्षर षडक्षर, i. e. षष्-, adj. containing six syllables, Pañc. i. d. 184.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षवती
अक्षवती अक्षवती, i. e. अक्ष + वन्त् + ई, f. Gaming with dice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षि
अक्षि अक्षि (cf. 1. अक्ष), n., in some cases अक्षन् is substituted. The eye.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ὀσσι in ὄσσει, ὄκταλλος, ὀϕθαλμός; Goth. augo; A.S. aegh, eag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्राक्षि
अग्र- + अक्षि अग्र- + अक्षि, n. the first look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षिगत|अक्षिगतः
अक्षिगत अक्षि-गत (vb. गम्) adj., f. ता.<BR> 1. Present, Śiś. 5, 81.<BR> 2. Hated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षौहिणी
अक्षौहिणी अक्षौहिणी, i. e. अक्ष-ऊह् + इन् + ई, f. A complete army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्
† अग् अग्, i. 1, Par. To wind, or move tortuously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग|अगः
अग अ-ग, m.<BR> 1. A mountain.<BR> 2. A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगतीक
अगतीक अगतीक, i. e. अ-गति + क (इ is lengthened on account of the metre), adj. Impervious, MBh. 12, 3078.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगम्यागमनीय
अगम्यागमनीय अगम्यागमनीय, i. e. अ-गम्य-आगमन + ईय (cf. गम्), adj. Caused by illicit intercourse, Man. 11, 169.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगस्ति|अगस्तिः
अगस्ति अगस्ति, and अगस्त्य अगस्त्य, m. The name of a Ṛṣi, or saint, the son of Mitra and Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगात्मजा
अगात्मजा अगात्मजा, i. e. अग-आत्मजा, f. A name of Pārvatī, the daughter of the Himālaya, Kir. 5, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगार|अगारं
अगार अगार (probably akin to अग्नि, and originally a hearth), n. A house, Man. 9, 265.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्यगार|अग्न्यगारः
अग्न्यगार अग्न्यगार, i. e. अग्नि-, n. the place where the sacred fire is kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगुरु|अगुरुः
अगुरु अ-गुरु.<BR> I. adj. Short.<BR> II. n. Aloe wood (Aquilaria Agallocum रोxब्.)<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालागुरु
काल- + अगुरु काल- + अगुरु, n. a black sort of Agallocum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नि|अग्निः
अग्नि अग्नि (probably from अञ्ज् in its original signification, To shine), m.<BR> 1. Fire.<BR> 2. The sacrificial fire.<BR> 3. The deity of fire.<BR> 4. The digestive power.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. ignis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनग्नि|अनग्निः
अन्- + अग्नि अन्- + अग्नि, adj. without fire, Man. 6, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहिताग्नि|आहिताग्निः
आहित- + अग्नि आहित- + अग्नि (vb. धा), adj. one who keeps up a consecrated fire, Man. 3, 282.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाहिताग्नि
अन्-आहित- + अग्नि अन्-आहित- + अग्नि, adj. one who neglects to keep up a consecrated fire, Man. 11, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटाग्नि|कटाग्निः
कट- + अग्नि कट- + अग्नि, m. a fire of dry grass, Man. 8, 377.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपाग्नि
कोप- + अग्नि कोप- + अग्नि, and क्रोध-, m. the fire of wrath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानाग्नि|ज्ञानाग्निः
ज्ञान- + अग्नि ज्ञान- + अग्नि, m. the flame of knowledge, Man. 11, 246.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणाग्नि|तृणाग्निः
तृण- + अग्नि तृण- + अग्नि, m. a fire of dry grass, Man. 3, 168.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणाग्नि|दक्षिणाग्निः
दक्षिण- + अग्नि दक्षिण- + अग्नि, m. one kind of sacred fire, that which is taken from the domestic fire and is placed to the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दावाग्नि|दावाग्निः
दा̆व- + अग्नि दा̆व- + अग्नि, m. the fire of a forest conflagration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवाग्नि|दवाग्निः
दा̆व- + अग्नि दा̆व- + अग्नि, m. the fire of a forest conflagration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाग्नि|पंचाग्नि|पञ्चाग्निः
पञ्चाग्नि पञ्चाग्नि, i. e. पञ्चन्-, adj. one who keeps the five fires constantly burning, Man. 3, 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजाग्नि|राजाग्निः
राजाग्नि राजाग्नि, i. e. राजन्-, m. the fire of a king (in wrath), Man. 7, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाग्नि
विष- + अग्नि विष- + अग्नि, m. the fire of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोकाग्नि|शोकाग्निः
शोक- + अग्नि शोक- + अग्नि, m. the fire of grief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हुताग्नि
हुत- + अग्नि हुत- + अग्नि (vb. हु), and होम-, m. the sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निक|अग्निकः
ऽअग्निक -अग्नि + क. A substitute for -अग्नि at the end of many comp. adj.: e. g. स-, adj., with Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचित्
अग्निचित् अग्नि-चि + त्, adj. One who has arranged a sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निद
अग्निद अग्नि-द, m. An incendiary, Man. 9, 278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभु
अग्निभु अग्नि-भु (vb. भू), n. Water, Man. 9, 321.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमन्त्|अग्निमत्
अग्निमन्त् अग्नि + मन्त्, adj., f. मती.<BR> 1. One who maintains a sacrificial fire, Man. 3, 122.<BR> 2. Having a good digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निष्टुत्
अग्निष्टुत् अग्निष्टुत्, i. e. अग्नि-स्तु + त्, m. The name of a sacrifice, Man. 11, 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निष्टोम|अग्निष्टोमः
अग्निष्टोम अग्निष्टोम, i. e. अग्नि-स्तोम, m. The name of a series of offerings to Agni, forming the first part of the Jyotiṣṭoma sacrifice, Man. 2, 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निष्वात्त|अग्निष्वात्तः
अग्निष्वात्त अग्निष्वात्त, also अग्नि-स्वात्त अग्नि-स्वात्त (vb. स्वाद्), m. A class of Pitṛs or Manes, viz. those of the Devas and Brāhmaṇas, Man. 3, 195. 199.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निसात्
अग्निसात् अग्नि-सात् (सात् is the original abl. of स), adv. Completely reduced to fire; with कृ, To burn, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निहोत्रिन्
अग्निहोत्रिन् अग्निहोत्रिन्, i. e. अग्नि-होत्र + इन्, m. One who keeps the holy fire, Man. 11, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नीषोम|अग्नीषोमः
अग्नीषोम अग्नीषोम, i. e. अग्नि-सोम, m. du. Agni and Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्याधेय|अग्न्याधेयः
अग्न्याधेय अग्न्याधेय, i. e. अग्नि-आधेय (vb. धा), n. Preparing the holy fire, Man. 2, 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्न्याहित
अग्न्याहित अग्न्याहित, i. e. अग्नि-आहित (vb. धा), m. One who has arranged a sacred fire, Rām. 6, 93, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्र|अग्रं|अग्रः
अग्र अग्र.<BR> I. adj. First, Megh. 4.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Point, Man. 2, 167.<BR> 2. Summit, top.<BR> 3. Forepart, front.<BR> 4. Beginning, Man. 2, 161.<BR> 5. The first, or best.<BR> III. acc. sing. अग्रम्, adv. Before, दिष्ट्यासि मे राघव चक्षुषो ऽग्रं प्राप्तः, ‘fortunately, O descendant of Raghu, are you come before my eyes.’ Rām. 6, 36, 72.<BR> IV. loc. sing. अग्रे.<BR> 1. Before.<BR> 2. First; with abl. Sooner, Man. 3, 114.<BR> 3. Forward, Pañc. 245, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR> As former part of a comp. 1. the forepart, the tip: e. g. अग्र-नख, the tip of the nail. 2. in front: e. g. अग्र-यायिन्, adj. going in front, Śāk. d. 185. 3. best: e. g. अग्र-वाजिन्, m. an excellent horse. As latter [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b " target="_blank">Page0004-b + 42</a>] part: e. g. एक-, adj. 1. one whose mind is fixed on one object, Bhag. 6, 12. 2. intent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकाग्र
अन्-एक- + अग्र अन्-एक- + अग्र, adj. inattentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्र
कुश- + अग्र कुश- + अग्र, n. the point of a blade of kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्राग्र
दंष्ट्रा- + अग्र दंष्ट्रा- + अग्र, n. the point of a tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणाग्र
दक्षिणा- + अग्र दक्षिणा- + अग्र, adj. that of which the points are directed southward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमाग्र
द्रुम- + अग्र द्रुम- + अग्र, m. the top of a tree, Rām. 5, 60, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नखाग्र
नख- + अग्र नख- + अग्र, n. the tip of the nails, Man. 2, 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगाग्र
नग- + अग्र नग- + अग्र, n. the summit of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासिकाग्र
नासिका- + अग्र नासिका- + अग्र, n. the tip of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाग्र|मण्डलाग्रः
मण्डल- + अग्र मण्डल- + अग्र, m. a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रग|अग्रगः
अग्रग अग्र-ग, adj.<BR> 1. Going in presence of somebody, Rājat. 5, 196.<BR> 2. Going in front, a leader.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेनाग्रग
सेना- + अग्रग सेना- + अग्रग, m. the leader of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रगण्य|अग्रगण्यः
अग्रगण्य अग्र-गण्य (vb. गण्), adj. One who must be considered as the first, Daśak. in Chr. 184, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रज|अग्रजः
अग्रज अग्र-ज.<BR> I. adj., f. जा. Firstborn.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. An elder brother, Man. 3, 171.<BR> 2. A Brāhmaṇa, Man. 2, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाग्रज|गदाग्रजः
गद- + अग्रज गद- + अग्रज, m. the elder brother of Gada, a name of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रणी
अग्रणी अग्रणी, i. e. अग्र-नी, m. A leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रतस्
अग्रतस् अग्र + तस्.<BR> I. adv.<BR> 1. Before.<BR> 2. In front.<BR> 3. Forward.<BR> II. preposition with the gen.<BR> 1. Before, Man. 3, 244.<BR> 2. In presence of.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भैरवाग्रतस्
भैरव- + अग्रतस् भैरव- + अग्रतस्, adv. in the presence of Bhairava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रसर|अग्रसरः
अग्रसर अग्रसर, i. e. अग्र-सृ + अ, adj., f. री. First.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राग्रसर
प्र- + अग्रसर प्र- + अग्रसर, adj. First, Śāk. d. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रसरता
अग्रसरता अग्रसर + ता, f. Going in front, Ragh. 5, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रहार|अग्रहारः
अग्रहार अग्र-हार, m. A grant of land or villages conferred upon Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्राह्यक
अग्राह्यक अ-ग्राह्य + क (vb. ग्रह्), adj. Incomprehensible, MBh. 12, 1024.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0004-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्राह्यनामकता
अग्राह्यनामकता अग्राह्यनामकता, i. e. अ-ग्राह्य-नामन् + क + ता (vb. ग्रह्), f. Condition of having a name not fit to be assumed, Lass. 75, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रेदिधिषू
अग्रेदिधिषू अग्रेदिधिषू, i. e. अग्र + इ-दिधिषू, f. A younger sister married before her elder, Man. 3, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रेसर|अग्रेसरः
अग्रेसर अग्रेसर, i. e. अग्र + इ-सृ + अ, adj., f. री. Going in front, first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्र्य|अग्र्यः
अग्र्य अग्र्य, i. e. अग्र + य, adj., f. या.<BR> 1. First.<BR> 2. Best, Man. 12, 30.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विजाग्र्य
द्विज- + अग्र्य द्विज- + अग्र्य, m. a Brāhmaṇa, Man. 3, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघ्
† अघ् अघ्, i. 10, अघय, Par. To sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघ|अघं|अघः
अघ अघ (from a vb. अङ्घ्, see अंहस्), n.<BR> 1. Sin, Man. 3, 118.<BR> 2. Impurity, Man. 5, 63.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनघ|अनघः
अन्- + अघ अन्- + अघ, adj., f. घा, 1. sinless, Man. 12, 1. 2. pure. 3. unblamable. Śāk. d. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघशंसिन्
अघशंसिन् अघशंसिन्, i. e. अघ-शंस + इन्, adj. Wicked, Daśak. 2, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघायु
अघायु अघायु, i. e. Ved. अघाय + उ, adj. Mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्क्|अंक्
अङ्क् अङ्क्, i. 10 (rather a denominat. derived from अङ्क), Par. and i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To mark, Pañc. 46, 8.<BR> 2. To adorn, Rājat. 5, 230.<BR> 3. To brand, Man. 9, 240.<BR> 4. To stigmatise, Bhartṛ. 2, 44.<BR> 5. † To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्क|अंक|अंकः|अङ्कः
अङ्क अङ्क, i. e. अञ्च् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A hook.<BR> 2. A mark.<BR> 3. A cipher.<BR> 4. An act in a drama.<BR> 5. The flank.<BR> 6. The lap.<BR> 7. The arm, Vikr. d. 147.<BR> 8. Proximity, Bhartṛ. 2, 23.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ἄγκη, ἀγκών, ἀγκύλος, ὄγκος; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b " target="_blank">Page0005-b + 41</a>] Lat. uncus; O.H.G. ango, anga, angul; A.S. angel, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृताङ्क|कृतांक|कृताङ्कः
कृत- + अङ्क कृत- + अङ्क, adj. branded, Man. 8, 281.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बालाङ्क
जम्बाल- + अङ्क जम्बाल- + अङ्क, adj. full of swamps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराङ्क|मकरांक|मकराङ्कः
मकर- + अङ्क मकर- + अङ्क, m. the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगाङ्क|मृगांक|मृगाङ्कः
मृग- + अङ्क मृग- + अङ्क, m. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गाङ्क
वल्गा- + अङ्क वल्गा- + अङ्क, adj. holding a bridle, Rājat. 5, 342.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वनामाङ्क
स्वनामाङ्क स्वनामाङ्क, i. e. स्वनामन्-, adj. called after his name, 243.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्कभाज्|अंकभाज्
अङ्कभाज् अङ्क-भाज् (vb. भज्), adj. Approaching, Kir. 5, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्कुर|अंकुर|अंकुरं|अंकुरः|अङ्कुरः
अङ्कुर अङ्कुर (from अञ्च्, cf. अङ्क), m.<BR> 1. A shoot, or sprout, Pañc. i. d. 251.<BR> 2. Intumescence.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषाङ्कुर
अभिलाष- + अङ्कुर अभिलाष- + अङ्कुर, m. the germ of desire, Rājat. 5, 376.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाङ्कुर|कुलाङ्कुरः
कुल- + अङ्कुर कुल- + अङ्कुर, m. offspring, a young child, Śāk. d. 178.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्राङ्कुर
दंष्ट्रा- + अङ्कुर दंष्ट्रा- + अङ्कुर, m. the point of a tooth, Bhartṛ. 2, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदाङ्कुर
रद- + अङ्कुर रद- + अङ्कुर, m. the point of a tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाङ्कुर|विषांकुर|विषाङ्कुरः
विष- + अङ्कुर विष- + अङ्कुर, m. a spear, a dart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीजाङ्कुर
वीज- + अङ्कुर वीज- + अङ्कुर, m. a seedling, Pañc. i. d. 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मराङ्कुर
स्मर- + अङ्कुर स्मर- + अङ्कुर, m. 1. a lover, a lecher. 2. a finger nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्कुरित|अंकुरित
अङ्कुरित अङ्कुरित, i. e. अङ्कुर + इत, adj. Furnished with shoots, Vikr. d. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्कुश|अंकुश|अंकुशः|अङ्कुशः
अङ्कुश अङ्कुश, i. e. अङ्कु (in the Ved. अङ्कूय from अञ्च्, cf. अङ्क) + श, m. and n.<BR> 1. A hook.<BR> 2. A goad for driving elephants with.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्यङ्कुश|अत्यंकुश
अति- + अङ्कुश अति- + अङ्कुश, adj. unmanageable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनङ्कुश|अनंकुश
अन्- + अङ्कुश अन्- + अङ्कुश, adj. unruly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरङ्कुश|निरंकुश|निरङ्कुशः
निरङ्कुश निरङ्कुश, i. e. निस्-, adj. 1. unchecked. 2. unruly. 3. independent, free.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्कोठ|अंकोठ|अङ्कोठः
अङ्कोठ अङ्कोठ, and अङ्कोल अङ्कोल, m. A plant, Alangium hexapetalum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्ख्|अंख्
अङ्ख् अङ्ख्, i. 10.<BR> 1. To take hold.<BR> 2. To stop.<BR> --With the prepos. परि परि, To surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्ग्|अंग्
अङ्ग् अङ्ग्, i. 1, Par. and † i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To go, Nalod. 1, 23.<BR> 2. † i. 10, To mark.<BR> --With the prepos. पलि पलि for परि परि, Caus. To stir up. Pass. To go round.<BR> --With विपलि वि-पलि, Caus. Ātm. To cover one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्ग|अंग|अंगं|अङ्गं|अङ्गः
1. अङ्ग अङ्ग, n.<BR> 1. A limb, Man. 3, 178.<BR> 2. The penis, Man. 8, 374.<BR> 3. A part, Man. 11, 11.<BR> 4. A supplementary part.<BR> 5. A division of Hindu learning, comprehending such sciences [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-a " target="_blank">Page0006-a + 47</a>] as are considered dependent upon the Vedas; cf. अङ्गविद्या.<BR> 6. An expedient.<BR> 7. The body.<BR> --Comp.<BR> In comp. adj. the fem. ends generally in गी, sometimes also in गा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनङ्ग|अनंग|अनङ्गं|अनङ्गः
अन्- + अङ्ग अन्- + अङ्ग, m. Kāma, the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्याङ्ग
अन्-अ-वद्य- + अङ्ग अन्-अ-वद्य- + अङ्ग (vb. वद्), adj., f. गी, of faultless form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टाङ्ग|अष्टांग
अष्टाङ्ग अष्टाङ्ग, i. e. अष्टन्-, adj. consisting of eight parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमाङ्ग|उत्तमांग|उत्तमाङ्गं
उत्तम- + अङ्ग उत्तम- + अङ्ग, n. the head, Man. 1, 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्ग|एकांग|एकाङ्गं|एकाङ्गः
एक- + अङ्ग एक- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. n. one part only.<BR> II. m. pl. body-guards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाङ्ग|कालांग
काल- + अङ्ग काल- + अङ्ग, adj. having a dark-blue blade, MBh. 4, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठाङ्ग
कुष्ठ- + अङ्ग कुष्ठ- + अङ्ग, adj. leprous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृशाङ्ग|कृशाङ्गः
कृश- + अङ्ग कृश- + अङ्ग, adj., f. गी, meagre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वाङ्ग|खट्वांग|खट्वाङ्गं|खट्वाङ्गः
खट्वा- + अङ्ग खट्वा- + अङ्ग, n. one of Śiva's weapons (a club with a skull at the top), also carried by devotees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरङ्ग|चतुरंग|चतुरङ्गं
चतुर्- + अङ्ग चतुर्- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. adj. consisting of four parts; with बल, a complete army, consisting of chariots, elephants, horse, and foot.<BR> II. n. 1. a complete army. 2. chess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्राङ्ग|चित्रांग|चित्राङ्गं|चित्राङ्गः
चित्र- + अङ्ग चित्र- + अङ्ग, m. a proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्वङ्ग|तन्वंग
तनु- + अङ्ग तनु- + अङ्ग, f. गी, a delicate woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनूजाङ्ग
तनू-ज- + अङ्ग तनू-ज- + अङ्ग, n. a wing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरङ्ग|निरंग
निरङ्ग निरङ्ग, i. e. निस्-, adj. deprived of expedients.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाङ्ग|पंचांग|पञ्चाङ्गं|पञ्चाङ्गः
पञ्चाङ्ग पञ्चाङ्ग, i. e. पञ्चन्-, adj. consisting of five parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाङ्ग|महांग|महाङ्गः
महा- + अङ्ग महा- + अङ्ग, m. a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ताङ्ग|रक्तांग|रक्ताङ्गं|रक्ताङ्गः
रक्त- + अङ्ग रक्त- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. m. 1. a bug. 2. planet Mars.<BR> II. n. 1. coral. 2. saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाङ्ग|रथांग|रथाङ्गं|रथाङ्गः
रथ- + अङ्ग रथ- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. n. 1. any part of a carriage. 2. a wheel.<BR> II. m. the ruddy goose, Anas casarca.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्राङ्ग|वक्रांग|वक्राङ्गः
वक्र- + अङ्ग वक्र- + अङ्ग, m. 1. the ruddy goose. 2. a goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वराङ्ग|वरांग|वराङ्गं|वराङ्गः
वर- + अङ्ग वर- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. m. an elephant.<BR> II. n. 1. an elegant body. 2. the head. 3. pudendum, male or female.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्राङ्ग|विचित्रांग|विचित्राङ्गः
वि-चित्र- + अङ्ग वि-चित्र- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. adj. 1. handsome. 2. having the body of various colours.<BR> II. m. 1. a tiger. 2. a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हीनाङ्ग|हीनांग|हीनाङ्गः
हीन- + अङ्ग हीन- + अङ्ग (vb. 2. हा),<BR> I. adj. maimed, Man. 4, 141.<BR> II. f. गी, an ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमाङ्ग|हेमांग|हेमाङ्गः
हेम- + अङ्ग हेम- + अङ्ग,<BR> I. adj. golden, Rām. 3, 55, 32.<BR> II. m. 1. a lion. 2. Brahman. 3. Garuḍa, a fabulous bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्ग|अंग|अंगं|अङ्गं|अङ्गः
2. अङ्ग अङ्ग (an old instr. sing. of the last, signifying ‘by my body’), particle:<BR> 1. Of asseveration, Indeed, to be sure.<BR> 2. Of solicitation, invocation, Rām. 2, 97, 16.<BR> 3. Of interrogation, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 7.<BR> 4. Again, further, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्ग|अंग|अंगं|अङ्गं|अङ्गः
3. अङ्ग अङ्ग, m.<BR> 1. The name of a country, Bengal proper, and its inhabitants.<BR> 2. The name of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गक|अंगक|अंगकं
अङ्गक अङ्ग + क.<BR> 1. = 1. अङ्ग, e. g. Body, Śiś. 4, 66.<BR> 2. A substitute for 1. अङ्ग at the end of comp. adj., f. गिका, e. g. आलिङ्गित- (vb. लिङ्ग्), One whose body is embraced, Rājat. 5, 410.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गज|अंगज|अङ्गजं|अङ्गजः
अङ्गज अङ्ग-ज, adj. Produced from the body, bodily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गण|अंगण|अंगणं|अङ्गणं
अङ्गण अङ्गण, for अङ्गन (q. cf.), n. A court, a yard. Dev. 5, 50.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गाङ्गण|रंगांगण
रङ्ग- + अङ्गण रङ्ग- + अङ्गण, n. the area of an amphitheatre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हर्म्याङ्गण
हर्म्य- + अङ्गण हर्म्य- + अङ्गण, n. the court of a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गतस्
अङ्गतस् अङ्ग + तस्, adv. From the body, Man. 4, 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0006-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गत्व
