कुलाङ्गार|कुलांगार|कुलाङ्गारः
कुल- + अङ्गार कुल- + अङ्गार, m. or n., an enemy to his own family, Pañc. 211, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0007-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृताङ्गार
