अधिकारिन्
अधिकारिन् अधिकारिन्, i. e. अधि-कार + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. One who holds an office, Pañc. i. d. 180.<BR> 2. A superintendent, Hit. 61, 7.<BR> 3. One who is entitled to, or fit for, something, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 9.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0015-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्माधिकारिन्|धर्म्माधिकारिन्
