अधिक्षेप|अधिक्षेपः
अधिक्षेप अधिक्षेप, i. e. अधि-क्षिप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Detraction, Rājat. 5, 234.<BR> 2. Censure, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 3.<BR> 3. Sneer, 184, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0015-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

