दुरधिगम
दुस्- + अधिगम दुस्- + अधिगम, adj. 1. hard to be attained, Mālav. 10, 8. 2. difficult to be learned, Kir. 5, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0015-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगमन|अधिगमनं
