अधिष्ठान|अधिष्ठानं
अधिष्ठान अधिष्ठान, i. e. अधि-स्था + अन, n.<BR> 1. A resting-place.<BR> 2. A seat, Man. 12, 4.<BR> 3. An abode.<BR> 4. A place, Pañc. 10, 3.<BR> 5. A town, a capital, Rājat. 5, 266.<BR> 6. Dignity, Nal. 26, 28.<BR> 7. Power, Rām. 4, 14, 30.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यधिष्ठान|त्र्यधिष्ठानः
त्रि- + अधिष्ठान त्रि- + अधिष्ठान, adj. having three bases, Man. 12, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्माधिष्ठान
धर्म- + अधिष्ठान धर्म- + अधिष्ठान, n. a court of justice, Pañc. 237, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरधिष्ठान
निस्- + अधिष्ठान निस्- + अधिष्ठान, adj. being without a solid base, Rām. 5, 82, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साधिष्ठान
स- + अधिष्ठान स- + अधिष्ठान, adj. having a solid base, ib.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वधिष्ठान
सु- + अधिष्ठान सु- + अधिष्ठान, adj., having a solid base, Chr. 25, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीकार|अधीकारः
अधीकार अधीकार; see अधिकार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0016-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीतिन्
अधीतिन् अधीतिन्, i. e. अधि-इत + इन् (vb. इ), adj., Conversant with, Daśak. 140, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीन|अधीनः
अधीन अधीन, i. e. अधस् + ईन, adj. Subject, dependent, Ragh. 1, 72. It is generally the latter part of compound words: e. g. अधि-, adj. Wholly dependent, Man. 8, 66.<BR> त्वद्-, adj. Subject to thee, Rām. 2, 72, 52.<BR> पर-, adj. Depending on another, Rām. 3, 37, 6.<BR> स्व-, adj.<BR> 1. Independent.<BR> 2. Dependent on ourselves, belonging to us, faithful, Pañc. i. d. 196.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीरता
अधीरता अ-धीर + ता (cf. धीर), f.<BR> 1. Unsteadiness.<BR> 2. Pusillanimity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीश|अधीशः
अधीश अधीश, m. A lord, Śiś. 9, 38. A chief, Rājat. 5, 300.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यधीश
त्रि- + अधीश त्रि- + अधीश, m. epithet of Kṛṣṇa-Viṣṇu (the lord over the three primary qualities), Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनाधीश|दिनाधीशः
दिन- + अधीश दिन- + अधीश, m. the sun, Pañc. i. d. 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधुना
अधुना अधुना, adv. Now.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधोवेक्षिन्
अधोवेक्षिन् अधोवेक्षिन्, i. e. अधस्-अव-ईक्ष् + इन्, adj., f. इणी, With downcast eyes, Pañc. i. 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यक्ष|अध्यक्षः
अध्यक्ष अध्यक्ष, i. e. अधि-अक्ष.<BR> I. adj. Perceptible, Bhāṣāp. 48.<BR> II. n. Perception, ib. 56; 149.<BR> III. m. A superintendent, Daśak. in Chr. 186, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्यक्ष|अनध्यक्षः
अन्- + अध्यक्ष अन्- + अध्यक्ष, adj. imperceptible, Bhāṣāp. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वाध्यक्ष|अश्वाध्यक्षः
अश्व- + अध्यक्ष अश्व- + अध्यक्ष, m. a superintendent of the horses, Pañc. 156, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशाध्यक्ष|कोशाध्यक्षः
कोश- + अध्यक्ष कोश- + अध्यक्ष, m. a treasurer, Pañc. 156, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजाध्यक्ष|गजाध्यक्षः
गज- + अध्यक्ष गज- + अध्यक्ष, m. a superintendent of the elephants, Pañc. 156, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाराध्यक्ष
द्वार- + अध्यक्ष द्वार- + अध्यक्ष, m. a porter, a chamberlain, Rām. 1, 20, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदाध्यक्ष|सूदाध्यक्षः
सूद- + अध्यक्ष सूद- + अध्यक्ष, m. a superintendent of the kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यग्नि
अध्यग्नि अध्यग्नि, i. e. अधि-अग्नि, adv. Before the nuptial fire, Man. 9, 194.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्ययन|अध्ययनं
अध्ययन अध्ययन, i. e. अधि-इ + अन, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b " target="_blank">Page0017-b + 41</a>] n. Reading, study, especially of the sacred books, Man. 1, 88.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्ययन|अनध्ययनं
अन्- + अध्ययन अन्- + अध्ययन, n. neglecting to read the sacred books, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1260.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यर्ध|अध्यर्धः
अध्यर्ध अध्यर्ध, i. e. अधि-अर्ध, adj. One and a half, Man. 9, 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यवसाय|अध्यवसायः
अध्यवसाय अध्यवसाय, i. e. अधि-अव-सो + अ, m. Perseverance, Pañc. 60, 6. Constancy, ib. iii. d. 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यात्म
अध्यात्म अध्यात्म, i. e. अधि-आत्मन्, n. The supreme soul, Bhag. 8, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यात्मिक
अध्यात्मिक अध्यात्मिक, Man. 6, 83, read आध्य्˚, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यापक|अध्यापकः
अध्यापक अध्यापक, i. e. अधि-इ, Caus. + अक, m. A teacher, Man. 3, 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यापकता
अध्यापकता अध्यापक + ता, f. Condition of a teacher, Rājat. 5, 469.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यापन|अध्यापनं
अध्यापन अध्यापन, i. e. अधि-इ, Caus. + अन, n.<BR> 1. Instructing.<BR> 2. Teaching the sacred books, Man. 8, 340.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्याय|अध्यायः
अध्याय अध्याय, i. e. अधि-इ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Reading, recitation.<BR> 2. The time when the sacred books ought to be read, Man. 4, 102.<BR> 3. A section of a book, e. g. the subdivisions of the Rām., MBh.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्याय|अनध्यायः
अन्- + अध्याय अन्- + अध्याय, m. the time when the sacred books ought not to be read, Man. 2, 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वाध्याय|स्वाध्यायः
स्व- + अध्याय स्व- + अध्याय, m. 1. perusal or study of the Vedas, Man. 2, 105. 2. the Veda. 3. inaudible reading or muttering of prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःस्वाध्याय
निःस्व- + अध्याय निःस्व- + अध्याय, i. e. निस्-स्व-, adj. not muttering prayers, Hariv. 11187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यारोप|अध्यारोपः
अध्यारोप अध्यारोप, i. e. अधि-आ-रुह्, Caus. + अ, m. Erroneous predication, Vedāntas. in Chr. 204, 7; 9; 210, 10; 211, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यावाहनिक|अध्यावाहनिकं
अध्यावाहनिक अध्यावाहनिक, i. e. अधि-आ-वह् + अन + इक, n. What was [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a " target="_blank">Page0018-a + 41</a>] given to a wife on the bridal procession, Man. 9, 194.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0017-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यास|अध्यासः
अध्यास अध्यास, i. e. अधि- 2. अस् + अ, m. Putting on; पादाध्यासे, ‘for putting the foot on a person,’ Yājñ. 2, 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यासिन्
अध्यासिन् अध्यासिन्, i. e. अधि-आस् + इन्, adj., f. नी. Sitting on, Pañc. iii. d. 270.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्रिगु|अध्रिगुः
अध्रिगु अध्रिगु, i. e. probably अ-धृ + इ-गम् + उ, ved. adj. Of unrestrained course, Chr. 290, 3 = Rigv. i. 64, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वग|अध्वगः
अध्वग अध्वग, i. e. अध्वन्-ग.<BR> I. adj. f. गा, Being on the road, travelling, Rājat. 5, 9.<BR> II. m. A traveller, Man. 11, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वन्
अध्वन् अध्वन्, m. A road, Man. 4, 60.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गताध्वन्
गत- + अध्वन् गत- + अध्वन् (vb. गम्), adj. versed, skilled, MBh. 12, 11876.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वनीन|अध्वनीनः
अध्वनीन अध्वन् + ईन and अध्वन्य अध्वन् + य, m. A traveller, Yājñ. 1, 111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वर|अध्वरः
अध्वर अध्वर, i. e. perhaps अ-ध्वृ + अ or अध्वन् + अ (with र् for न्, cf. अङ्घ्रि), m. A sacrifice, Chr. 288, 11 = Rigv. i. 48, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वरग
अध्वरग अध्वर-ग, adj. Belonging to a sacrifice, Draup. 6, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वर्यु|अध्वर्युः|अध्वर्य्यु|अध्वर्य्युः
अध्वर्यु अध्वर्यु (i. e. अध्वर्य, a ved. denominat., derived from अध्वर + उ), m. A special priest versed in the Yajurveda, Man. 3, 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्
अन्ऽ अन्-, before consonants अऽ अ-, an inseparable prefix, implying<BR> I. negation, e. g. अ-ब्राह्मण, m. One who is not a Brāhmaṇa, Man. 7, 85.<BR> अ-ज्ञान, n. Ignorance, Man. 11, 145.<BR> अन्-अन्त, adj. Endless, Man. 4, 149. In this use it produces very often the opposite signification, e. g. अ-गद, m. Health, Man. 11, 237.<BR> अ-क्रूर, adj. Soft, Man. 2, 34.<BR> अ-सक्रित्, adv. Often, Man. 3, 233.<BR> II. deterioration.<BR> 1. Wrong, e. g. अ-काल, m. Unseasonable time, Man. 3, 105. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b " target="_blank">Page0018-b + 43</a>]<BR> 2. Bad, अ-क्स्केत्र, n. A bad field, Man. 10, 71.<BR> --Cf. Lat. in-; Goth. and A.S. un-; ἀν- and ἀ-.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्
अन् अन्, ii. 1, Par. † i. 4, Ātm.<BR> 1. To breathe.<BR> 2. To blow (as wind).<BR> 3. To live.<BR> --Cf. ἄνεμος; Lat. animus, ânus (cf. Sskr. अपान); Goth. uz-ana; see प्रान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन|अनः
अन अन, cf. इदम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनडुद्द
अनडुद्द अनडुद्द, i. e. अनडुह् द, m. The giver of a bull, Man. 4, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनडुह्
अनडुह् अनडुह्, i. e. अनस्-वह्, m. (nom. sing. अनड्वान्, voc. वन्; the acc. sing., N.V.A. du. and N.V. pl. have as base वाह्, the rest उह्, the final of which becomes ट् in the loc. pl. and ड् before भ्). A bull, or ox, Man. 11, 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनतिप्रकाशकत्व
अनतिप्रकाशकत्व अन्-अति-प्रकाशक + त्व, adj. Having the nature of a somewhat insufficient illustrator, Vedāntas. in Chr. 205, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अननुभावकता
अननुभावकता अननुभावकता, i. e. अन्-अनु-भू + अक + ता, f. Unintelligibility, Bhāṣāp. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तकर
अनन्तकर अनन्तकर, i. e. अन्-अन्त-कृ + अ, adj. Making endless or infinite, Rām. 5, 20, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तर|अनंतर|अनन्तरं
अनन्तर अन्-अन्तर,<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Having nothing intermediate, Man. 2, 19.<BR> 2. Immediately bordering, next, Nal. 22, 16.<BR> 3. Immediately following, Bhāṣāp. 123.<BR> 4. Of an immediately following caste, Man. 10, 14.<BR> 5. Allowing no delay, necessary, Chr. 10, 6.<BR> II. रम्, acc.<BR> 1. adv. Next in space, Rām. 2, 87, 5. Next in time, immediately afterwards, then, Rām. 1, 3, 7. Especially compounded with preceding तद्-, after that, Pañc. 70, 17.<BR> 2. prep. with abl. and gen. Immediately after, Bhag. 12, 12; Rām. 5, 73, 28. After, Pañc. 108, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनन्तरम्
सम्-अनन्तर + म् सम्-अनन्तर + म्, adv. immediately after, Chr. 14, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0018-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरज|अनन्तरजः
अनन्तरज अनन्तर-ज (vb. जन्), m. A son, born by a wife belonging to a caste next to that of her husband, except the fourth, Man. 10, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकर्मन्|अनपकर्म्मन्
अनपकर्मन् अन्-अप-कर्मन्, n. Subtraction (of what has been given), Man. 8, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपक्रिया
अनपक्रिया अन्-अप क्रिया, f. Nonpayment, Man. 8, 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसर|अनपसरः
अनपसर अन्-अपसर, m. One who has no claims (properly: no outlets), Man. 8, 198.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाकर्मन्|अनपाकर्म्मन्
अनपाकर्मन् अनपाकर्मन् = अनपकर्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायिन्
अनपायिन् अनपायिन्, i. e. अन्-अप-इ + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Not going away, Kathās. 12, 33.<BR> 2. Lasting, Rājat. 5, 32.<BR> 3. Immovable.<BR> 4. Imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिस्नेह
अनभिस्नेह अनभिस्नेह, i. e. अन्-अभि-स्निह् + अ, adj., Without attachment, Bhag. 2, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनय|अनयः
अनय,<BR> I. अ-नय, m.<BR> 1. Bad conduct, Pañc. 259, 16.<BR> 2. Sin, Rām. 5, 24, 28.<BR> 3. Wrong, Rām. 6, 40, 5 (न स वेद नयानयौ. Such a man knows neither right nor wrong).<BR> 4. Lewdness, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1260.<BR> II. अन्-अय, m.<BR> 1. Distress, Man. 10, 95.<BR> 2. Ill-luck, Chr. 8, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घ्यत्व
अनर्घ्यत्व अन्-अर्घ्य + त्व, n. Invaluableness, Hit. Pr. d. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थ|अनर्थः
अनर्थ अन्-अर्थ.<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Disadvantage, Man. 8, 24; भवत्य् अनर्थाय, It becomes prejudicial, Man. 4, 193.<BR> 2. Misfortune, Śāk. 81, 8.<BR> II. adj., f. था.<BR> 1. Useless, Pañc. 248, 6.<BR> 2. Prejudicial, Rām. 6, 21, 5.<BR> 3. Poor, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 1.<BR> 4. Unhappy, Rām. 3, 75, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थक|अनर्थकं
अनर्थक अनर्थ + क, adj.<BR> 1. Useless, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b " target="_blank">Page0019-b + 40</a>] Pañc. 183, 2.<BR> 2. Vain, Brāhmaṇav. 1, 14.<BR> 3. Unmeaning, nonsensical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थत्व
अनर्थत्व अन्-अर्थ + त्व, n. Pañc. i. d. 158, read अनर्थित्व; see अर्थित्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्ह्यता
अनर्ह्यता अन्-अर्ह्य + ता (vb. अर्ह्), f. Disproportionateness, Vedāntas. in Chr. 215, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनल|अनलं|अनलः
अनल अन् + अल, m.<BR> 1. Fire, Man. 3, 261.<BR> 2. The deity of fire, Man. 5, 1.<BR> 3. The digestive power.<BR> 4. The proper name of a monkey, Rām. 6, 13, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालानल|कालानलः
काल- + अनल काल- + अनल, m. the fire of all-destroying Time, Rām. 3, 69, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दावानल|दावानलः
दाव- + अनल दाव- + अनल, m. the fire of a forest conflagration, Pañc. 142, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बडवानल|बडवानलः
बडवा- + अनल बडवा- + अनल, m. submarine fire, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 419.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलद
अनलद अनल द, adj. Quenching fire, Kirāt. 5, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवगाहिन्
अनवगाहिन् अन् अव गाह् + इन्, adj. f. नी. Not entering, Bhāṣāp. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्यता
अनवद्यता अन्-अ-वद्य + ता (cf. अवद्य), f. Blamelessness, Mālav. 20, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवेक्षक
अनवेक्षक अनवेक्षक, i. e. अन्-अव-ईक्ष् + अक, adj. One who does not take care, Rām. 4, 17, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनस्
अनस् अनस्, n. A cart, Man. 8, 209.<BR> --Cf. Lat. onus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनसूयितृ
अनसूयितृ अनसूयितृ, i. e. अन्-असूय + तृ, m. Free from a spirit of detraction, MBh. 1, 5611.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनसूयु
अनसूयु अनसूयु, i. e. अन्-असूय + उ, adj. Free from a spirit of detraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनस्थन्
अनस्थन् अन्-अस्थन् (cf. अस्थि), adj. Boneless, Man. 11, 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनागत|अनागतं
अनागत अन्-आ-गत, (vb. गम्), adj., f. ता.<BR> 1. Not arrived, Rājat. 5, 171.<BR> 2. Future, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 89.<BR> अनागतं कृ, To make dispositions for the future, ib. 88.<BR> 3. Not mentioned, Rām. 3, 56, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0019-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनागतवन्त्|अनागतवत्
अनागतवन्त् अनागत + वन्त्, adj., f. वती. Full of schemes concerning the future, Pañc. v. d. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनात्मज्ञ
अनात्मज्ञ अनात्मज्ञ, i. e. अन्-आत्मन्-ज्ञ (vb. ज्ञा), adj. Foolish, Śāk. 78, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनामिका
अनामिका अनामिका, i. e. अ-नामन् + क, f. The ring-finger, Yājñ. 3, 278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनावृष्टि|अनावृष्टिः
अनावृष्टि अनावृष्टि, i. e. अन्-आ-वृष् + ति, f. Drought, Lass. 62, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाश्रव
अनाश्रव अनाश्रव, i. e. अन्-आ-श्रु + अ, adj., f. वा. Not obeying, Daśak. in Chr. 191, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाहिताग्निता
अनाहिताग्निता अनाहिताग्नि + ता (cf. अग्नि), f. Neglecting to keep up the consecrated fire, Man. 11, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमेषता
अनिमेषता अ-निमेष + ता (cf. निमेष), f. Not winking, Śiś. 9, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिल|अनिलः
अनिल अन् + इल, m.<BR> 1. Wind.<BR> 2. The deity of wind, Man. 5, 96.<BR> 3. Wind as one of the humors of the body.<BR> 4. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिवर्तित्व
अनिवर्तित्व अनिवर्तित्व, i. e. अ-निवर्तिन् + त्व, n. Not running away, courageous resistance, Man. 7, 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिवेदक
अनिवेदक अनिवेदक, i. e. अ-नि-विद्, Caus. + अक, adj. Not reporting, MBh. 13, 2385.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनीक|अनीकं|अनीकः
अनीक अन् + ईक, m. n.<BR> 1. The face (ved.), front (ved.).<BR> 2. An army, Rājat. 5, 452.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रानीक|अग्रानीकः
अग्र- + अनीक अग्र- + अनीक, the van of an army, Man. 7, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानीकम्
यथा-अनीक + म् यथा-अनीक + म्, adv. as far as the host extended, MBh. 3, 15715.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनीरसन
अनीरसन अनीरसन, i. e. अ-निस्-रसना, adj. Girded, Kir. 5, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनु|अनुः
अनु अनु.<BR> I. adv. Afterwards, then, Rām. 2, 84, 4.<BR> II. prep.<BR> 1. with acc.<BR> a. Along, Rām. 2, 83, 6.<BR> b. After, Pañc. 165, 5.<BR> c. According to, like, Vikr. d. 110.<BR> 2. with abl. In consequence of, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b " target="_blank">Page0020-b + 40</a>] Rām. 6, 10, 23.<BR> III. combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives.<BR> IV. former part of compounded nouns and adverbs, implying. After, according to, along, again secondary, every.<BR> --Cf. ἀνά; Goth. ana; N.H.G. an.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकम्पक|अनुकंपक
अनुकम्पक अनु-कम्प् + अक, adj. Having tender affection, Man. 6, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकम्पन|अनुकंपन
अनुकम्पन अनु-कम्प् + अन, n. Compassion, Rām. 2, 45, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकम्पा|अनुकंपा
अनुकम्पा अनु-कम्प् + आ, f. Compassion, Bhartṛ. 2, 60.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सानुकम्प|सानुकंप
स-अनु-कम्प स-अनु-कम्प,<BR> I. adj. kind.<BR> II. पम्, adv. kindly, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकम्पिन्|अनुकंपिन्
अनुकम्पिन् अनु-कम्प् + इन्, adj. Having tender affection, Rām. 6, 70, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकल्प|अनुकल्पः
अनुकल्प अनु-कल्प, m. A substituted rule, Man. 11, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकाङ्क्षिन्
अनुकाङ्क्षिन् अनु-काङ्क्ष् + इन्, adj. Striving for, eager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकार|अनुकारः
अनुकार अनुकार, i. e. अनु-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Imitation.<BR> 2. Resemblance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकारिन्
अनुकारिन् अनुकारिन्, i. e. अनु-कृ or अनुकार + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Acting conformably.<BR> 2. Imitating, Śāk. d. 49. Like, Śāk. 104, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हितानुकारिन्
हित- + अनुकारिन् हित- + अनुकारिन्, adj. kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकार्य|अनुकार्य्य
अनुकार्य अनु-कार्य, n. What must be done later, Rām. 6, 40, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकीर्तन|अनुकीर्तनं|अनुकीर्त्तन
अनुकीर्तन अनुकीर्तन, i. e. अनु-कॄत् + अन, n. Proclaiming, Kathās. 4, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकूल|अनुकूलः
अनुकूल अनु-कूल, adj.<BR> 1. Suitable, Rām. 1, 17, 26.<BR> 2. Agreeable, Rām. 5, 31, 45.<BR> 3. Favourable, Pañc. 120, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकूलता
अनुकूलता अनुकूल + ता, f.<BR> 1. Favour, Pañc. 263, 13.<BR> 2. Proneness, Bhāṣāp. 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकूलत्व|अनुकूलत्वं
अनुकूलत्व अनुकूल-त्व, n. Favour, Ragh. 1, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुकृति|अनुकृतिः
अनुकृति अनु-कृ + ति, f. Imitation, Megh. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुक्रम|अनुक्रमः
अनुक्रम अनु-क्रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Regular order, Yājñ. 1, 19.<BR> 2. Table (of contents), MBh. 1, 2294.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवतानुक्रम
देवता- + अनुक्रम देवता- + अनुक्रम, m. table of the deities, Bhāg. P. 2, 6, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुक्रमणिका
अनुक्रमणिका अनुक्रमणिका, i. e. अनु-क्रम् + अन + ई + क, f. Table of contents, MBh. 1, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुक्रोश|अनुक्रोशः
अनुक्रोश अनुक्रोश, i. e. अनु-क्रुश् + अ, m. Compassion, Chr. 21, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुक्रोश|निरनुक्रोशः
निस्- + अनुक्रोश निस्- + अनुक्रोश,<BR> I. m. unmercifulness, Rām. 4, 19, 21.<BR> II. adj. merciless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सानुक्रोश
स- + अनुक्रोश स- + अनुक्रोश, 1. adj. f. शा, compassionate. 2. शम्, adv. compassionately, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुक्षणम्
अनुक्षणम् अनु-क्षण + म्, adv. Every moment, perpetually, Hit. 59, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुक्षपम्
अनुक्षपम् अनु-क्षप + म् (cf. क्षपा), adv. Every night, Kirāt. 5, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुग|अनुगः
ऽअनुग -अनु-ग (vb. गम्),<BR> I. adj., f. गा.<BR> 1. Following, Pañc. i. d. 63.<BR> 2. Corresponding, Man. 8, 239.<BR> II. m. A follower, a servant, Rām. 1, 12, 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदानुग|पदानुगः
पद- + अनुग पद- + अनुग, m. a follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रपदानुग
श्रोत्र-पद- + अनुग श्रोत्र-पद- + अनुग, adj. agreeable to the ear, Rām. 2, 100, 25, Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वशानुग
वश- + अनुग वश- + अनुग, adj. 1. obedient, submissive. 2. subject, Man. 2, 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सानुग
स- + अनुग स- + अनुग, adj. with one's attendants, Rām. 3, 55, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबलानुग
स-बल- + अनुग स-बल- + अनुग, adj. with (his) army and followers, Chr. 54, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगति|अनुगतिः
अनुगति अनुगति, i. e. अनु-गम् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Following, Rām. 5, 81, 23.<BR> 2. Assent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगतिक
ऽअनुगतिक -अनुगति + क, adj. Following, Pañc. i. d. 889.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगम|अनुगमः
अनुगम अनु-गम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Following, pursuing.<BR> 2. Penetrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगमन|अनुगमनं
अनुगमन अनु-गम् + अन, n. Following, Rām. 1, 28, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगामिन्
अनुगामिन् अनुगामिन्, i. e. अनु-गम् + इन्-.<BR> I. adj., f. नी. Following, pursuing, Rām. 5, 5, 31.<BR> II. m. A servant, Chr. 62, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुगुण|अनुगुणः
अनुगुण अनु-गुण, adj. f. णा. Corresponding, conformable, Mṛcch. 43, 16. Suitable, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुग्रह|अनुग्रहः
अनुग्रह अनु-ग्रह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Promoting, Rām. 6, 11, 22.<BR> 2. Favour, Pañc. 34, 2.<BR> 3. Help, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1643.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुग्रहण|अनुग्रहणं
अनुग्रहण अनुग्रहण, i. e. अनु-ग्रह् + अन n.<BR> 1. Showing favour, Rām. 2, 1, 19.<BR> 2. Favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुग्राहक
अनुग्राहक अनुग्राहक, i. e. अनु-ग्रह् + अक, m. A supporter, Rājat. 5, 259.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुचर|अनुचरः
अनुचर अनु-चर्-अ,<BR> I. adj. f. रा. Following, Ragh. 2, 4.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A servant, an attendant, Pañc. 68, 11.<BR> 2. A supporter, Rājat. 5, 288.<BR> III. f. रा (ved. also री), A female servant, Rām. 6, 38, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मणानुचर
लक्ष्मण- + अनुचर लक्ष्मण- + अनुचर, adj. accompanied by Lakṣmaṇa, Rām. 1, 24, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुचिन्तन|अनुचिंतनं
अनुचिन्तन अनु-चिन्त् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Thinking, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 22.<BR> 2. Regretful remembrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज|अनुजं|अनुजः
अनुज अनु-ज (vb. जन्),<BR> I. adj., f. जा. Younger, Man. 9, 57.<BR> II. m. A younger brother.<BR> III. f. जा. A younger sister, Rām. 3, 4, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजीविन्
अनुजीविन् अनु-जीव् + इन्, m. A dependent, a servant, Pañc. i. d. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज्ञा
अनुज्ञा अनु-ज्ञा, f.<BR> 1. Permission.<BR> 2. Dismission.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तानुज्ञ
प्राप्त- + अनुज्ञ प्राप्त- + अनुज्ञ (vb. आप्), adj. having received the permission to withdraw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुताप|अनुतापः
अनुताप अनुताप, i. e. अनु-तप् + अ, m. Repentance, Man. 11, 227.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चानुताप|पश्चानुतापः
पश्च- + अनुताप पश्च- + अनुताप (cf. पश्चात्), m. repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुतापन
अनुतापन अनुतापन, i. e. अनु-तप् + अन, adj. Afflicting, Rām. 4, 2, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सेकिन्
अनुत्सेकिन् अनुत्सेकिन्, i. e. अन्-उत्सेक + इन्, f. नी. Humble, Śāk. d. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदर्शन|अनुदर्शनं
अनुदर्शन अनुदर्शन, i. e. अनु-दृश् + अन, n. Consideration, Bhag. 13, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदर्शिन्
अनुदर्शिन् अनुदर्शिन्, i. e. अनु-दृच् + इन्, adj. Considering, Pañc. iii. d. 169.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदिनम्
अनुदिनम् अनु-दिन + म्, adv. Every day, Kirāt. 5, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदिवसम्
अनुदिवसम् अनु-दिवस + म् adv. Every day, Śāk. 47, 2 (C.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदेहम्
अनुदेहम् अनु-देह + म्, adv. From behind, Śiś. 9, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुधावन|अनुधावनं
अनुधावन अनु-धाव् + अन, n. Cleansing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुध्यान
अनुध्यान अनुध्यान, i. e. अनु ध्यै + अन, n. Meditation, Śāk. 57, 13 v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनय|अनुनयः
अनुनय अनुनय, i. e. अनु-नी + अ, m.<BR> 1. Reconcilement, Hit. ii. d. 117.<BR> 2. Courtesy, Vikr. d. 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सानुनय
स- + अनुनय स- + अनुनय,<BR> I. adj. kind.<BR> II. यम्, adv. tenderly, Daśak. in Chr. 190, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनयम्
अनुनयम् अनु-नय + म्, adv. According to propriety, Rām. 4, 26, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनाद|अनुनादः
अनुनाद अनुनाद, i. e. अनु-नद् + अ m. Consequent sound; echo.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सवेणुवीणापणवानुनादम्
स-वेणु-वीणा-पणव-अनुनाद + म् स-वेणु-वीणा-पणव-अनुनाद + म्, adv. re-echoing with flutes, lutes, and tabors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनादिन्
अनुनादिन् अनुनादिन्, i. e. अनु-नद् + इन्, adj., f. नी. Echoing, Rām. 6, 69, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदम्
अनुपदम् अनु-पद + म्, adv.<BR> 1. Immediately after, Pañc. 198, 11.<BR> 2. In a moment, Śāk. 5, 11.<BR> 3. At every step, Śiś. 9, 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदिन्
अनुपदिन् अनु-पद् + इन्, m. A searcher, Śiś. 9, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपरोधतस्
अनुपरोधतस् अन्-उपरोध + तस्, adv. Without inconvenience, Man. 4, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपसंहारिन्
अनुपसंहारिन् अनुपसंहारिन्, i. e. अन्-उप-सम्-हृ + इन्, adj., f. इणी. Nonexclusive (a subdivision of one of the forms of fallacious middle term), Bhāṣāp. 71; 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपातिन्
अनुपातिन् अनुपातिन्, i. e. अनु-पत् + इन्, adj. f. नी. Following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपालन|अनुपालनं
अनुपालन अनुपालन, i. e. अनु-पा, Caus. + अन, n. Observance, Rām. 5, 24, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरनुपालन
दुस्- + अनुपालन दुस्- + अनुपालन, adj. hard to be preserved, MBh. 13, 1929.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपालिन्
अनुपालिन् अनुपालिन्, i. e. अनु-पा, Caus. + इन्, adj. Cherishing, Man. 9, 204.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्व|अनुपूर्वं|अनुपूर्व्व
अनुपूर्व अनु-पूर्व, adj. f. वा.<BR> 1. Following whoever or whatever precedes.<BR> 2. Regular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्वशस्|अनुपूर्व्वशस्
अनुपूर्वशस् अनुपूर्व + शस्, adv. In regular order, Man. 1, 2; with gen. Man. 8, 142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रवेश|अनुप्रवेशः
अनुप्रवेश अनु-प्रवेश, m.<BR> 1. Entering after.<BR> 2. Entering (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रश्न|अनुप्रश्नः
अनुप्रश्न अनु-प्रश्न, m. A question, MBh. 12, 4924.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्ध|अनुबंधः|अनुबन्धः
अनुबन्ध अनु-बन्ध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Beginning, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 5.<BR> 2. A motive, Man. 8, 126.<BR> 3. An indispensable element, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 8.<BR> 4. Uninterrupted succession, Rām. 5, 3, 13.<BR> 5. Consequence.<BR> 6. Posterity, Rām. 2, 7, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्धन|अनुबंधनं
ऽअनुबन्धन -अनु-बन्ध् + अन, n. Uninterrupted connection, Vikr. 55, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्धिन्|अनुबंधिन्
ऽअनुबन्धिन् अनुबन्धिन्, i. e. अनुबन्ध + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Connected with, Bhag. 15, 2; Daśak. in Chr. 193, 6.<BR> 2. Lasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबल|अनुबलं
अनुबल अनु-बल, n. The rear of an army, Rām. 1, 1, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबुभूषु
अनुबुभूषु अनुबुभूषु, i. e. अनु-बुभूष, desider. of भू + उ, adj. Desiring to enjoy, Daśak. in Chr. 201, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभर्तृ
अनुभर्तृ अनुभर्तृ, i. e. अनु-भृ + तृ, m., f. त्री, n. One who imitates, Chr. 294, 6 = Rigv. i. 88, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभव|अनुभवः
अनुभव अनुभव, i. e. अनु-भू + अ, m.<BR> 1. Apprehension, Vedāntas. in Chr. 210, 14.<BR> 2. Understanding, Rām. 4, 42, 9 (Hanuman knows well how to finish the work).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाव|अनुभावः
अनुभाव अनुभाव, i. e. अनु-भू + अ, m.<BR> 1. Dignity, authority, Daśak. 196, 14.<BR> 2. Power, Śāk. 31, 2.<BR> 3. A sign, Kathās. 4, 117; Ragh. 2, 75.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानुभाव|महानुभावः
महा- + अनुभाव महा- + अनुभाव, adj. pre-eminent, just, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाविन्
अनुभाविन् अनुभाविन्. i. e. अनु-भू + इन्.<BR> I. adj. Seeing, Śāk. 89, 3 (Prākṛ.).<BR> II. m. A witness, Man. 8, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूति|अनुभूतिः
अनुभूति अनु-भू + ति, f. Apprehension, perception, Bhāṣāp. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमति|अनुमतिः
अनुमति अनुमति, i. e. अनु-मन् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Assent, Daśak. in Chr. 186, 3.<BR> 2. The goddess of the fifteenth day of the moon's age, Man. 3, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्तृ|अनुमंतृ
अनुमन्तृ अनु-मन् + तृ, m. One who assents, Man. 5, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरण|अनुमरणं
अनुमरण अनुमरण, i. e. अनु-मृ + अन, n. Following in death, Hit. iii. d. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमा
अनुमा अनु-मा, f. Conclusion, Bhāṣāp. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमान|अनुमानं
अनुमान अनुमान, i. e. अनु-मा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Inferring, Bhāṣāp. 139; 140.<BR> 2. Argument, Man. 8, 144; Rām. 6, 23, 2.<BR> 3. Analogy, Vikr. 63, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमानन
अनुमानन अनुमानन, i. e. अनु-मन्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b " target="_blank">Page0023-b + 38</a>] Caus. + अन, n. Inducing to confess, Chr. 53, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमार्दव
अनुमार्दव अनु-मार्दव, n. Compassion, Rām. 5, 37, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमिति|अनुमितिः
अनुमिति अनुमिति, i. e. अनु-मा + ति, f. Conclusion, Bhāṣāp. 51; 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयातृ
अनुयातृ अनु-या + तृ, m. A companion, Rām. 2, 91, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात्र|अनुयात्रं
अनुयात्र अनु-या-त्र, n. and fem. त्रा.<BR> 1. Retinue.<BR> 2. Attendance, Rām. 4, 36, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

