अनुयोग|अनुयोगः
अनुयोग अनुयोग, i. e. अनु-युज्-अ, m.<BR> 1. Question, Śāk. 15, 17.<BR> 2. Inquiry, Daśak. in Chr. 193, 2; 195, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जक|अनुरंजक
अनुरञ्जक अनु-रञ्ज् + अक, adj. Gratifying, Rām. 2, 1, 20, Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जन|अनुरंजनं|अनुरञ्जनं
अनुरञ्जन अनु-रञ्ज् + अन, n. Loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरथ्या
अनुरथ्या अनु-रथ्या, f. A by-way running along the main street, Rām. 2, 6, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराग|अनुरागः
अनुराग अनुराग, i. e. अनु-रञ्ज् + अ m.<BR> 1. Redness, Śiś. 9, 1.<BR> 2. Love, Daśak. in Chr. 183, 18.<BR> 3. Good will, Man. 7, 154.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतानुराग
कृत- + अनुराग कृत- + अनुराग, adj. f. गा, loving, Rām. 2, 12, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सानुराग
स- + अनुराग स- + अनुराग, adj. impassioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरागवन्त्|अनुरागवत्
अनुरागवन्त् अनुराग + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Enamoured, Hit. 28, 9.<BR> 2. Enamoured or red, Śiś. 9, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरागिता
अनुरागिता अनुरागिता, i. e. अनुरागिन् + ता. f. Attachment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरागिन्
अनुरागिन् अनुरागिन्, i. e. अनुराग + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Attached, Sāh. D. 76, 21.<BR> 2. Causing affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूप|अनुरूपः
अनुरूप अनु-रूप, adj., f. पा. Suitable, Sāv. 2, 10; instr. पेण, In proportion, Man. 8, 206.<BR> पम्, adv. According to Daśak. in Chr. 197, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वानुरूप
स्व- + अनुरूप स्व- + अनुरूप, adj. Innate, natural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूपतस्
अनुरूपतस् अनुरूप + तस्, adv. In proportion, M. 7, 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोध|अनुरोधः
अनुरोध अनुरोध, i. e. अनु-रुध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Compliance, Hit. 106, 17.<BR> 2. Obligation, Man. 2, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोधन|अनुरोधनं
अनुरोधन अनुरोधन, i. e. अनु-रुध् + अन, n. Compliance, Hit. ii. d. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोधिता
अनुरोधिता अनुरोधिता, i. e. अनुरोधिन् + ता, f. Compliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोधिन्
अनुरोधिन् अनुरोधिन्, i. e. अनुरोध + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Compliant, Rām. 2, 75, 36.<BR> 2. Acting in conformity with, Rām. 3, 2, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेप|अनुलेपः
अनुलेप अनुलेप, i. e. अनु-लिप् + अ, m. Unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेपन|अनुलेपनं
अनुलेपन अनुलेपन, i. e. अनु-लिप् + अन, n. Ointment, Śiś. 9, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमन|अनुलोमनं
अनुलोमन अनुलोमन, i. e. अनुलोमय + अन, I, adj.<BR> 1. Putting in due order.<BR> 2. (In medicine) Correcting the vitiated air of the body, or obviating excretory obstructions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमय
अनुलोमय अनुलोमय (a denominat. derived from अनु-लोम), Par.<BR> 1. To go or touch with the [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-b " target="_blank">Page0024-b + 40</a>] grain.<BR> 2. (In medicine) To direct into the proper channel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवंश|अनुवंशः
अनुवंश अनु-वंश, m. A genealogical table, MBh. 1, 3762.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवंश्य
अनुवंश्य अनुवंश्य, i. e. अनुवंश + य, adj., f. या, Referring to genealogical lists, MBh. 3, 8330.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0024-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवचन|अनुवचनं
