अनुस्मरण अनुस्मरण, i. e. अनु-स्मृ + अन, n. Recollection, Rām. 6, 82, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0025-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

