अवक्षेपण|अवक्षेपणं
अवक्षेपण अवक्षेपण, i. e. अव-क्षिप् + अन, n. Throwing down. Bhāṣāp. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगति|अवगतिः
