अवगाह|अवगाहः
अवगाह अव-गाह् + अ, m. Bathing, Ragh. 5, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगाहन|अवगाहनं
