अवघर्षण|अवघर्षणं
अवघर्षण अवघर्षण, i. e. अव-घृष् + अन, n. Rubbing off, Yājñ. 3, 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवघात|अवघातः
अवघात अवघात, i. e. अर-हन्, Caus. + अ, m. A violent blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचय|अवचयः
अवचय अवचय, i. e. अव-चि + अ, m. Gathering, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

