अवच्छद|अवच्छदः
अवच्छद अवच्छद, i. e. अव-छद् + अ, m. A cover, Rām. 3, 56, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छेद|अवच्छेदः
अवच्छेद अवच्छेद, i. e. अव-छिद् + अ, m. Distinction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजय|अवजयः
अवजय अवजय, i. e. अव-जि + अ, m. Conquering, Ragh. 6, 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञा
