सावज्ञम्
सावज्ञम् सावज्ञम्, adv. with contempt, Rām. 3, 29, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञान|अवज्ञानं
अवज्ञान अवज्ञान, i. e. अव-ज्ञा + अन, n. Contempt, Hit. 103, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवट|अवटः
