अवतर्पण|अवतर्पणं
अवतर्पण अवतर्पण, i. e. अव-तृप् + अन, n. A soothing remedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवतस्
