अवतान|अवतानः
अवतान अवतान, i. e. अव-तन् + अ, m. A cover, Rām. 5, 16, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवतार|अवतारः
अवतार अवतार, i. e. अव-तॄ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Descent.<BR> 2. Entering into, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 6.<BR> 2. Descent of a deity from heaven, Ragh. 10, 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवतारण|अवतारणं
अवतारण अवतारण, i. e. अव-तॄ Caus. + अन, n. Causing to descend, Rām. 4, 56, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदान|अवदानं
अवदान अवदान, i. e. अव-दै + अन, n. A heroic deed, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 24.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीर्यावदान
वीर्य- + अवदान वीर्य- + अवदान, n. effecting any thing by prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदारण|अवदारणं
अवदारण अवदारण, i. e. अव-दॄ + अन, n. Bursting, Rām. 2, 77, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवद्य|अवद्यं
अवद्य अ-वद् + य, n. Blame, Kathās. 24, 235.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्य
अन्- + अवद्य अन्- + अवद्य, adj., f. या, blameless, Bhartṛ. 2, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवद्य
निस्- + अवद्य निस्- + अवद्य,<BR> I. adj. blameless, Rām. 6, 99, 51.<BR> II. f. blamelessness(?), Indr. 5, 11 (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधान|अवधानं
अवधान अवधान, i. e. अव-ध + अन, n.<BR> 1. Attention. Vikr. d. 2.<BR> 2. Staring at, Śiś. 9, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सावधान|सावधानः
स- + अवधान स- + अवधान, adj. careful, attentive, Yājñ. 3, 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधारण|अवधारणं
