सावधि
स- + अवधि स- + अवधि, adj. with the end, Kathās. 9, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधीर्
