अवधीरण|अवधीरणं
अवधीरण अवधीरण, i. e. अवधीर् + अन, n. and f. णा. Refusal, Ragh. 8, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधीरिन्
