अवधूनन|अवधूननं
अवधूनन अवधूनन, i. e. अव-धू, Caus. + अन, n. Shaking, Man. 3, 230.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवध्यता
