अवनति|अवनतिः
अवनति अवनति, i. e. अव-नम् + ति, f. Setting (of the sun), Śiś. 9, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवनम्र
अवनम्र अव-नम् + र, adj., f. रा, Bent, Ṛt. 6, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवनि|अवनिः
