अवनेजन|अवनेजनं
अवनेजन अवनेजन, i. e. अव-निज् + अन, n. Washing, Man. 2, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवन्ति|अवंति|अवंतिः|अवन्तिः
