अवन्ती|अवंती
अवन्ती अवन्ती, f. The name of a city, the modern Oujein, Megh. 31 v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवपात|अवपातः
अवपात अवपात, i. e. अव-पत् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Falling down.<BR> 2. Descent.<BR> 3. A pit for catching game in, Ragh. 16, 78. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b " target="_blank">Page0057-b + 39</a>]<BR> 4. (From the causal of पत्) Striking, wounding, Yājñ. 2, 277.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवपातन|अवपातनं
अवपातन अवपातन, i. e. अव-पत्, Caus. + अन, n. Cutting down, Man. 11, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवपीडन|अवपीडनं
अवपीडन अव-पीड् + अन, n. Hurting, Man. 8, 287.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबोध|अवबोधः
अवबोध अवबोध, i. e. अव-बुध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Being awake, Bhag. 6, 17.<BR> 2. Full knowledge, Vedāntas. in Chr. 219, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरवबोध
दुस्- + अवबोध दुस्- + अवबोध, adj. hard to be understood, Bhāg. P. 6, 9, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबोधन|अवबोधनं
अवबोधन अवबोधन, i. e. अव-बुध्, Caus. + अन, n. Instruction, Pañc. 5, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभास|अवभासः
