अनवभास
अन्- + अवभास अन्- + अवभास, m. non-appearance, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 11; 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासक
अवभासक अव-भास् + अक, m. An illuminator, Vedāntas. in Chr. 219, 11; cf. 215, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासकत्व
अवभासकत्व अवभासक + त्व, n. Illuminating, Vedāntas. in Chr. 204, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासना
अवभासना अव-भास् + अना, f. Illuminating, shining, Vedāntas. in Chr. 215, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभृथ|अवभृथः
अवभृथ अव-भृ + थ, m. The name of certain ceremonies at the close of a sacrifice, e. g. bathing, Man. 11, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवम|अवमं|अवमः
अवम अव + म, adj., f., मा, Low.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवम
अन्- + अवम अन्- + अवम, adj. high, illustrious, Draup. 5, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमन्तृ|अवमंतृ
अवमन्तृ अव-मन् + तृ, m. A scorner, Man. 2, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्द|अवमर्दः|अवमर्द्द
अवमर्द अवमर्द, i. e. अव-मृद् + अ, m. Devastation, Rām. 5, 43, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्दन
अवमर्दन अवमर्दन, i. e. अव-मृद् + अन.<BR> I. adj. Destroying, Rām. 3, 35, 114.<BR> II. n. Destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्दिन्
अवमर्दिन् अवमर्दिन्, i. e. अव-मृद् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Destroying, Kathās. 23, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमान|अवमानः
अवमान अवमान, m., and अवमानन अवमानन, n., i. e. अव-मन् + अ or अन, Disrespect, Man. 2, 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमानिन्
अवमानिन् अवमानिन्, i. e. अव-मन् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. One who despises, Rām. 5, 81, 6.<BR> 2. One who undervalues, Śāk. 91, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयव|अवयवः
अवयव अवयव, i. e. अव-यु + अ, m.<BR> 1. A limb, Daśak. in Chr. 190, 16.<BR> 2. A part, Man. 1, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयवशस्
अवयवशस् अवयव + शस्, adv. Limb by limb, Bhāg. P. 3, 30, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयविन्
अवयविन् अवयविन्, i. e. अवयव + इन्, adj., f. नी, Consisting of parts, Bhāṣāp. 155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर|अवरं|अवरः
अवर अव + र.<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Posterior, Man. 3, 23.<BR> 2. Inferior, Rām. 2, 106, 22.<BR> 3. Low, Rājat. 5, 203.<BR> II. m. A Śūdra, or one of the fourth caste, Man. 2, 238.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Preceded by a numeral it implies ‘at least,’ e. g. त्रि-, three at least, Man. 8, 60; at least three times, Man. 11, 80; also, after कार्षापण-, a kārṣāpaṇa at least, Man. 8, 274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरावर
अवर-अवर अवर-अवर, adj. lowest, Rām. 5, 53, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरज|अवरजः
अवरज अवर-ज (vb. जन्).<BR> I. adj., f. जा, Younger, Rām. 3, 75, 10.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A younger brother, Rājat. 5, 26.<BR> 2. A Śūdra, or one of the fourth caste, Man. 2, 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोध|अवरोधः
अवरोध अवरोध, i. e. अव-रुध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Hindrance.<BR> 2. Blocking up.<BR> 3. The seraglio of a palace, Rājat. 5, 357.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधक|अवरोधकः
अवरोधक अवरोधक, i. e. अव-रुध् + अक, adj. Being about to block up, Rām. 1, 71, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधन|अवरोधनं
अवरोधन अवरोधन, i. e. अव-रुध् + अन, n. Blocking up, Rām. 1, 3, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोह|अवरोहः
अवरोह अवरोह, i. e. अव-रुह् + अ, m. A pendant branch, one that strikes fresh roots into the earth, as those of the Indian fig-tree, Rām. 2, 52, 96.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरवरोह
दुस्- + अवरोह दुस्- + अवरोह, adj. whither it is difficult to descend, Rājat. 6, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोहण|अवरोहणं
अवरोहण अवरोहण, i. e. अव-रुह् + अन, n. Descending, Kathās. 20, 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवलक्ष|अवलक्षः
अवलक्ष अव-लक्ष, adj. White.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवलम्ब|अवलंबः|अवलम्बः
अवलम्ब अव-लम्ब् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Depending, hanging on or from.<BR> 2. A prop.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालावलम्ब
जाल- + अवलम्ब जाल- + अवलम्ब, adj. supported, i. e. borne by a net, Megh. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवलम्ब|निरवलंब
निस्- + अवलम्ब निस्- + अवलम्ब, adj. 1. unsupported. 2. not granting any support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सावलम्ब
