आरम्भिन्|आरंभिन्
आरम्भिन् आरम्भिन्, i. e. आरम्भ + इन्, adj. One who begins many things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरव|आरवः
आरव आरव, i. e. आ-रु + अ, m. Sound, Rām. 4, 50, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरा
आरा आरा, f. An awl.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. âla; A.S. âl, ael.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरात्
