आराधन|आराधनं
आराधन आ-राध् + अन.<BR> I. adj. Who or what conciliates, wins.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Acquirement, Bhartṛ. 3, 5.<BR> 2. Accomplishment (representation), Śāk. 12, 1.<BR> 3. Gratification.<BR> 4. Adoration, Kathās. 17, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराधयितृ
आराधयितृ आराधयितृ, i. e. आ-राध्, Caus. + तृ, m. An adorer, Śāk. 39, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराधयिष्णु
