आराम|आरामः
आराम आराम, i. e. आ-रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Pleasure, Bhag. 3, 16.<BR> 2. A garden, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराराम
अन्तर्- + आराम अन्तर्- + आराम, adj. one who finds his pleasure in his soul, Bhag. 5, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराव|आरावः
आराव आराव, i. e. आ-रु + अ, m.<BR> 1. Sound, Nal. 13, 16.<BR> 2. Scream, MBh. 1, 6846.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरिराधयिषु
आरिराधयिषु आरिराधयिषु, i. e. आ-रिराधयिष (desider. of the Caus. of राध्) + उ, adj. Desirous of conciliating or winning, MBh. 1, 4784.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरुणि|आरुणिः
आरुणि आरुणि, i. e. अरुण + इ, patronym. m. A descendant of Aruṇa, surname of Uddalaka, MBh. 1, 684, and of Vainateya, MBh. 1, 2548.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरुणी
आरुणी आरुणी, i. e. अरुण + अ + ई, f. Tawny, viz. an antelope, Chr. 290, 7 = Rigv. i. 64, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरुरुक्षु
आरुरुक्षु आरुरुक्षु, i. e. आ-रुरुक्ष (desider. of रुह्) + उ, adj. Desiring to ascend, MBh. 3, 11108; to acquire, Bhag. 6, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरुह|आरुहः
ऽआरुह -आ-रुह् + अ. Latter part of comp. words: e. g. गज-, m. The rider of an elephant, Rām. 5, 12, 31 (in पर-, adj. Having excellent riders, etc.).<BR> दुस्-, adj. Hard to be ascended, Rām. 2, 117, 13 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोग्य|आरोग्यं
आरोग्य आरोग्य, i. e. अ-रोग + य, n. Health, Rām. 1, 15, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनारोग्य
अन्- + आरोग्य अन्- + आरोग्य, adj. prejudicial to health, Man. 2, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहारोग्य|सहारोग्यः
सह- + आरोग्य सह- + आरोग्य, adj. convalescent, well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोढृ
आरोढृ आरोढृ, i. e. आ-रुह् + तृ, m. One who mounts, Yājñ. 2, 303.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोप|आरोपः
आरोप आरोप, i. e. आ-रुह्, Caus. + अ, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a " target="_blank">Page0086-a + 42</a>] m. Attributing to, predication, Śāk. d. 35 Sch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोपक
आरोपक आरोपक, i. e. आ-रुह्, Caus. + अक, m. A planter, Man. 3, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोपण|आरोपणं
आरोपण आरोपण, i. e. आ-रुह्, Caus. + अन n.<BR> 1. Causing to ascend, Kathās. 17, 84 (viz. to heaven, i. e. to die); Rām. 5, 15, 46.<BR> 2. Putting on, Ragh. 7, 25.<BR> 3. Stringing (a bow), Rām. 1, 66, 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृक्षारोपण
वृक्ष- + आरोपण वृक्ष- + आरोपण, n. planting trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोह|आरोहः
आरोह आरोह, i. e. आ-रुह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A rider, Hariv. 13464.<BR> 2. Mounting, Kathās. 25, 142; Rājat. 5, 310.<BR> 3. A heap, Rām. 1, 5, 14.<BR> 4. The buttocks, Rām. 3, 52, 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वारोह|अश्वारोहः
अश्व- + आरोह अश्व- + आरोह, m. a horseman, Kathās. 10, 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजारोह|गजारोहः
गज- + आरोह गज- + आरोह, and हस्त्य्-आरोह, i. e. हस्तिन्-, m. a rider on an elephant, Rām. 3, 57, 23; Draup. 8, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरारोह|दुरारोहः
दुस्- + आरोह दुस्- + आरोह, adj., f. हा, hard to be ascended, Rām. 2, 105, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरारोह|वरारोहः
वर- + आरोह वर- + आरोह,<BR> I. m. 1. a rider on an elephant or horse. 2. an elephantdriver.<BR> II. f. हा, 1. an elegant woman. 2. the hip or flank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारोह
स- + आरोह स- + आरोह, adj., f. हा, rising, Rām. 5, 73, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यन्दनारोह|स्यंदनारोह|स्यन्दनारोहः
स्यन्दन- + आरोह स्यन्दन- + आरोह, m. a warrior who fights in a car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहक|आरोहकः
आरोहक आरोहक, i. e. अ-रुह् + अक, m. A rider, Pañc. 129, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहण|आरोहणं
आरोहण आरोहण, i. e. आ-रुह् + अन,<BR> 1. Ascending, MBh. 1, 372.<BR> 2. A stage, MBh. 14, 282.<BR> 3. A ladder, Rām. 5, 14, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्गारोहण
दुर्ग- + आरोहण दुर्ग- + आरोहण, adj. of difficult ascent, Rām. 3, 76, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रारोहण|पवित्रारोहणं
पवित्र- + आरोहण पवित्र- + आरोहण, n. the name of a festival, Pañc. 34, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखारोहण
सुख- + आरोहण सुख- + आरोहण, adj. of easy ascent, MBh. 2, 1281.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहणिक
आरोहणिक आरोहणिक, i. e. आरोहण + इक, adj. Referring to the ascension (viz. to heaven), MBh. 1, 353.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहिन्
आरोहिन् आरोहिन्, i. e. आ-रुह् + इन्, adj. f. इणी, Ascending, Pañc. iii. d. 264.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्जव|आर्जवं
आर्जव आर्जव, i. e. ऋजु + अ, n. Candour, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b " target="_blank">Page0086-b + 42</a>] Man. 11, 222; Bhartṛ. 2, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनार्जव|अनार्जवं|अनार्ज्जव
अन्- + आर्जव अन्- + आर्जव, n. dishonesty, Man. 9, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्जुनेय|आर्ज्जुनेय
आर्जुनेय आर्जुनेय, i. e. अर्जुन + एय, patronym. m. A descendant of Arjuna (?), Chr. 298, 23 = Rigv. i. 112, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तव|आर्तवः|आर्त्तव|आर्त्तवं|आर्त्तवः
आर्तव आर्तव, i. e. ऋतु + अ.<BR> I. adj., f. वा, Seasonable, Rām. 2, 30, 16.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. The menstrual discharge, Man. 4, 40; Rājat. 5, 391.<BR> 2. The approved time for cohabitation, Man. 3, 48, cf. 46.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनार्तव|अनार्त्तव
अन्- + आर्तव अन्- + आर्तव, adj. unseasonable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्त्त|आर्त|आर्त्तः
आर्त्त आर्त्त, written आर्त अर्त, (an anomalous ptcple. of the pf. pass. of आ-अर्द्) adj., f. ता.<BR> 1. Injured Man. 4, 236; hurt, Yājñ. 3, 248.<BR> 2. Distressed, Man. 6, 16.<BR> 3. Afflicted, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भयार्त्त|भयार्त
भय- + आर्त्त भय- + आर्त्त, adj., distressed with fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्त्तता|आर्तता
आर्त्तता आर्त्त + ता (written आर्तता) f. Painfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्त्ति|आर्ति|आर्तिः|आर्त्तिः
आर्त्ति (आर्ति) आर्त्ति, i. e. आ-अर्द् + ति (cf. आर्त्त), f. Pain, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत्रिमार्त्ति|कृत्रिमार्ति
कृत्रिम- + आर्त्ति कृत्रिम- + आर्त्ति, adj. feigning sorrow, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्त्ति|आर्ति|आर्तिः|आर्त्तिः
आर्त्ति (आर्ति) आर्त्ति, i. e. आ-अर्द् + ति (cf. आर्त्त), f. Pain, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्र|आर्द्रं
आर्द्र आर्द्र, adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Wet, Megh. 87.<BR> 2. Fresh, Amar. 2.<BR> 3. Mild, Pañc. 8, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. probably ἄρδω (although beginning with Ϝ, Ϝαρδ, Ϝραδ), ῥαίνω, ῥαθάμιγξ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्द्र|सार्द्रं
स- + आर्द्र स- + आर्द्र, adj. Wet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रय
आर्द्रय आर्द्रय, a denomin. derived from the last, Par. To moisten, Bhartṛ. Suppl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धिक|आर्धिकः
आर्धिक आर्धिक, (i. e. probably अर्ध + इक), m. A labourer in tillage, Man. 4, 253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्य|आर्यः|आर्य्य|आर्य्यः
आर्य आर्य.<BR> I. m., f. या,<BR> 1. Originally the name of the immigrated Indian people in opposition to the old inhabitants. In later times, the name of the three upper castes in opposition to the fourth, Yājñ. 2, 294; or to barbarians, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a " target="_blank">Page0087-a + 42</a>] MBh. 14, 2137.<BR> II. fem. या, The name of a metre. Rājat. 5, 35.<BR> III. adj., f. या.<BR> 1. Respectable, venerable, Man. 8, 75; Daśak. in Chr. 186, 17.<BR> 2. Apposite, Rām. 2, 115, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनार्य|अनार्यः|अनार्य्य|अनार्य्यः
अन्- + आर्य अन्- + आर्य, adj. and subst. 1. A barbarian, Man. 9, 260.<BR> 2. Unworthy, Rām. 3, 51, 25.<BR> 3. Inhabited by barbarians, Śāk. C. 139, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यक|आर्यकः|आर्य्यक|आर्य्यकं|आर्य्यकः
आर्यक आर्य + क, m.<BR> 1. A grandfather, Rām. 5, 61, 15.<BR> 2. A proper name, Mṛcch. 35, 22; MBh. 1, 1552.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यता
आर्यता आर्य + ता, f. and आर्यत्व आर्य + त्व, n. Venerableness, Man. 7, 211; Rājat. 1, 110.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनार्यता|अनार्य्यता
अन्- + आर्यता अन्- + आर्यता, f. Want of virtuous dignity, Man. 10, 58. Dishonourableness, Hit. iv. d. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ष|आर्षः
आर्ष आर्ष, i. e. ऋषि + अ,<BR> I. adj. f. षी.<BR> 1. Referring to the Ṛṣis.<BR> 2. Ordained by or practised by the Ṛṣis, Man. 3, 21; 12, 106.<BR> II. m. A form of marriage, Man. 3, 53.<BR> III. n. Holy lineage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्षभ
आर्षभ आर्षभ i. e. ऋषभ + अ, adj. Proceeding from a bull, Man. 9, 50 (n. its strength).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलक्षण्य|आलक्षण्यं
आलक्षण्य आलक्षण्य, i. e. अ-लक्षण + य, n. Inclination to sin, Man. 9, 19 (Kull.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलङ्घन
आलङ्घन आ-लङ्घ् + अन, n. Covering, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलम्ब|आलंब|आलम्बः
