आवलि|आवलिः
आवलि and ली आवली̆, f. A row, Hit. i. d. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0088-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

