आवास|आवासः
आवास आवास, i. e. आ-वस् + अ, m. A house.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भोगावास|भोगावासः
भोग- + आवास भोग- + आवास, m. the harem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवाहन|आवाहनं
आवाहन आवाहन, i. e. आ-वह् + अन, n. Invitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविक|आविकः
आविक आविक, i. e. अवि + क,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Coming from a sheep, e. g. क्षीर, ‘the milk of an ewe,’ Man. 5, 8.<BR> 2. Woollen, Man. 2, 41.<BR> II. n. A woollen cloth, Man. 5, 120.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

