साशङ्क|साशंक
स- + आशङ्क स- + आशङ्क, adj. disheartened, Pañc. 47, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

