आशय|आशयः
आशय आशय, i. e. आ-शी + अ, m.<BR> 1. A seat, Kathās. 20, 128.<BR> 2. A den, MBh. 3, 1387.<BR> 3. An asylum, Pañc. 141, 1.<BR> 4. The stomach, Daśak. 189, 11 (Wils.).<BR> 5. The heart, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 1; Mind, Bhag. 10, 20.<BR> 6. Intention, Kathās. 12, 73.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आमाशय|आमाशयः
आम- + आशय आम- + आशय, m. the part of the belly about the navel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराशय
