दुराशय
दुस्- + आशय दुस्- + आशय,<BR> I. m. a bad abode, Bhāg. P. 3, 24, 36.<BR> II. adj. having wicked intentions, Kathās. 20, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्टाशय
दुष्ट- + आशय दुष्ट- + आशय (vb. दुष्), adj. having wicked intentions, Pañc. 51, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वाशय|पक्वाशयः
पक्व- + आशय पक्व- + आशय, m. the abdomen, MBh. 3, 13973.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशय|महाशयः
महा- + आशय महा- + आशय,<BR> I. adj. 1. magnanimous; 2. liberal.<BR> II. m. a gentleman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूत्राशय|मूत्राशयः
मूत्र- + आशय मूत्र- + आशय, m. the lower belly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरताशय
वि-रत- + आशय वि-रत- + आशय (vb. रम्), adj. resigning worldly intentions, Pañc. ii. d. 189.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाशय
सुख- + आशय सुख- + आशय, adj. hoping for pleasure, Pañc. ii. d. 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशा
आशा आशा, f.<BR> I. i. e. 1. अश् + अ, A quarter, a region, Rām. 3, 22, 8.<BR> II. i. e. आ-शंस्,<BR> 1. Desire, Hit. d. 105.<BR> 2. Hope, Daśak. 191, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुराशा
दुस्- + आशा दुस्- + आशा, f. want of hope, Rājat. 3, 213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनाशा
धन- + आशा धन- + आशा, f. desire of wealth, Hit. i. d. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशा
निस्- + आशा निस्- + आशा, adj., f. शा, hopeless, Rām. 4, 19, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भग्नाश|भग्नाशः
भग्न- + आश भग्न- + आश (vb. भञ्ज्), adj. disappointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हताश|हताशः
हत- + आश हत- + आश (vb. हन्), adj. hopeless, desperate, Mālav. 36, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशावन्त्|आशावत्
आशावन्त् आशा + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Full of hope, Hit. i. d. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशित्व
ऽआशित्व -आशित्व, i. e. आशिन् + त्व, n. Eating, e. g. अन्-आचित्व, Hunger, MBh. 3, 13477.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिन्
ऽआशिन् -आशिन्, i. e. 2. अश् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Eating, Man. 2, 118.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामिषाशिन्
निरामिष- + आशिन् निरामिष- + आशिन्, i. e. निस्-, adj. not feeding on meat. Hit. 19, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनाशिन्
पवन- + आशिन् पवन- + आशिन्, m. a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाशिन्
पूर्व- + आशिन् पूर्व- + आशिन्, adj., eating before (others), MBh. 5, 1291.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिस्
आशिस् आशिस्, i. e. आ-शास्, f. Benediction, Rām. 2, 32, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयाशिस्
जय- + आशिस् जय- + आशिस्, f. cheering, congratulation, Rām. 3, 35, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीविष|आशीविषः
आशीविष आशी-विष (आशी, according to the grammarians, a serpent's fang), m. A snake, MBh. 3, 544.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशु|आशुः
आशु आशु, i. e. probably अश् (see शो) + उ, adv. Quickly.<BR> --Cf. ὠκύς; Lat. ocius, accipiter = ved. आशुपत्वन्, aquila.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुग|आशुगः
आशुग आशु-ग (vb. गम्),<BR> I. adj., f. गा, Moving quickly, Man. 4, 68.<BR> II. m. An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुत्व|आशुत्वं
आशुत्व आशु + त्व, n. Quickness, Arj. 6, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशौच|आशौचं
आशौच आशौच, i. e. अ-शुचि + अ, n. Impurity, Man. 5, 59.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्याशौच|सूत्याशौचं
सूत्याशौच सूत्याशौच, i. e. सूति-, n. impurity from child-birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्चर्य|आश्चर्य्य|आश्चर्य्यं
आश्चर्य आश्चर्य, i. e. आ-चर् + य<BR> I. adj., f. या, Astonishing, wonderful, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 11.<BR> II. n. A surprising phenomenon, Rām. 5, 49, 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साश्चर्य|साश्चर्य्य
स- + आश्चर्य स- + आश्चर्य, adj. wonderful, Bhartṛ. 2, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्
-यम् -यम्, adv. with surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्चर्यमय
आश्चर्यमय आश्चर्य + मय, adj., f. यी, Wonderful, Kathās. 26, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्च्योतन
आश्च्योतन आश्च्योतन, i. e. आ-श्च्युत् + अन, Sprinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रम|आश्रमं|आश्रमः
आश्रम आ-श्रम् + अ, m. and n.<BR> 1. An hermitage.<BR> 2. A religious order of which there are four (or only [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a " target="_blank">Page0091-a + 44</a>] three, Man. 2, 230) kinds referable to the different periods of a Brāhmaṇa's life, Man. 3, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामाश्रम|कामाश्रमः
काम- + आश्रम काम- + आश्रम, m. and n. the hermitage of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्रम|गृहाश्रमः
गृह- + आश्रम गृह- + आश्रम, m. the second order, that of the householder, Man. 6, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्येष्ठाश्रम|ज्येष्ठाश्रमः
ज्येष्ठ- + आश्रम ज्येष्ठ- + आश्रम, adj. being in the most eminent order, Man. 3, 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिन्
आश्रमिन् आश्रमिन्, i. e. आश्रम + इन्, adj. Belonging to one of the religious orders, Man. 6, 91.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्रमिन्
गृह- + आश्रमिन् गृह- + आश्रमिन्, m. a Brāhmaṇa fulfilling the duties of a householder, Mārk. P. 29, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रय|आश्रयः
आश्रय आश्रय, i. e. आ-श्रि + अ, m.<BR> 1. A seat, Pañc. 51, 20; Ragh. 11, 26 (a quiver).<BR> 2. An abode.<BR> 3. A retreat, Man. 7, 27.<BR> 4. An asylum, Pañc. 211, 4.<BR> 5. Protection, Pañc. i. d. 43.<BR> 6. Recourse, Man. 2, 11; refuge, Ragh. 12, 35.<BR> 7. Dependence, Yājñ. 2, 48.<BR> 8. Support, Pañc. 155, 8; help, Pañc. 95, 14.<BR> 9. Base, Vedāntas. in Chr. 212, 3; the subject (in Logic), Bhāṣāp. 74.<BR> 10. Reference, Yājñ. 3, 143; Daśak. in Chr. 185, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ताश्रय|गर्ताश्रयः
गर्त- + आश्रय गर्त- + आश्रय, adj. living in holes, Man. 7, 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराश्रय
निस्- + आश्रय निस्- + आश्रय, adj., f. या, having no support, MBh. 8, 1905.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराश्रय|पराश्रयः
पर- + आश्रय पर- + आश्रय, m. 1. dependence from another, Hariv. 5154. 2. the refuge of the enemies, Bhāg. P. 1, 4, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाश्रय|वनाश्रयः
वन- + आश्रय वन- + आश्रय,<BR> I. adj. who or what is in a forest.<BR> II. m. a raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाणाश्रय|वाणाश्रयः
वाण- + आश्रय वाण- + आश्रय, m. a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयण
ऽआश्रयण -आश्रयण, i. e. आ-श्रि + अन, adj., f. णी.<BR> 1. Taking refuge.<BR> 2. Referring to, Vikr. d. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयाशवत्
आश्रयाशवत् आश्रयाशवत्, i. e. आश्रय-आश + वत्, adv. Like fire, Hit. ii. d. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयिन्
आश्रयिन् आश्रयिन्, i. e. आश्रय + इन्, adj., f. णी,<BR> 1. Seated, Ragh. 6, 4.<BR> 2. Lodging, Śāk. 78, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रव|आश्रवं|आश्रवः
आश्रव आश्रव, i. e. आ-श्रु + अ, adj., f. वा, Obedient.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाश्रव
अन्- + आश्रव अन्- + आश्रव, adj., f. वा, not obeying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रितत्व
आश्रितत्व आ-श्रित + त्व (vb. श्रि), n. Dependence, Bhāṣāp. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्लेष|आश्लेषः
आश्लेष आश्लेष, i. e. आ-श्लिष् + अ, m. An embrace, Megh. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वयुज|आश्वयुजः
आश्वयुज आश्वयुज, i. e. अश्व-युज् + अ, m. The month Āśvina (September--October), Man. 6, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वास|आश्वासः
आश्वास आश्वास, i. e. आ-श्वस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Recreation.<BR> 2. Rest, repose, Rājat. 5, 315.<BR> 3. Appeasing, Kathās. 9, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्वासन|आश्वासनं
आश्वासन आश्वासन, i. e. आ-श्वस् + अन, n. Recreation, Pañc. 70, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्विन|आश्विनः
आश्विन आश्विन, i. e. अश्विन् + अ, adj. Directed to the Aśvins, Chr. 296, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आषाढ|आषाढः
आषाढ आषाढ, i. e. अ-साढ, old ptcple. of the pf. pass. of सह्, + अ, m.<BR> 1. The name of a month (June--July), Rājat. 5, 126.<BR> 2. A staff carried by an ascetic in that month.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2699.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्
1. आस् आस्, an interj.<BR> 1. Of anger: Ah! Pañc. 36, 21.<BR> 2. Of fear, Prab. 31, 10.<BR> 3. Of recollection, Prab. 72, 11.<BR> 4. Of joy, Prab. 29, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्
2. आस् आस्, ii. 2, Ātm. (in epic poetry sometimes Par., MBh. 14, 2871).<BR> 1. To sit, Rām. 1, 50, 10; with the acc., Vikr. 27, 16.<BR> 2. To abide, MBh. 3, 12723.<BR> 3. To stay, Rām. 3, 9, 32.<BR> 4. To perform, Nal. 7, 3 (Böhtl.).<BR> 5. To spend time in doing something, to do something a long time; the action being expressed,<BR> a. By a participle, Pañc. 36, 20 (स्वाकारं निगूहन्न् आस्ते, He conceals the state of his mind).<BR> b. By an absolutive, Man. 7, 195; Rām. 4, 57, 23 (प्रायम् [hardly acc. of प्राय] आस्महे, we are starving).<BR> 6. To exist, Rājat. 5, 99; to be, Pañc. 89, 10; Rājat. 5, 3 (corr. आसाताम्). With an adv. तूष्णीम्, silent, Pañc. 21, 10; एवम्, thus, Rām. 5, 57, 15. With an [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-a " target="_blank">Page0092-a + 44</a>] instrumental, Pañc. i. d. 106, ‘with fearless mind.’ With a dative, Hit. i. d. 207, आस्ताम् तुष्टये, it may be gratifying.<BR> 7. To cease, Pañc. 106, 19; आस्ताम्, ‘enough,’ Hit. 122, 19.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pres. आसीन, Man. 1, 1. Of the pf. pass. आसित, passed, Rām. 1, 3, 4 (what came to pass with Rāma, etc.); n. Seat, Rām. 2, 58, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prepos. अधि अधि,<BR> 1. To sit down, Rām. 5, 57, 6.<BR> 2. To sit down on, with acc., Rām. 2, 81, 11.<BR> 3. To take for his seat, Rām. 2, 99, 11; to occupy, Rām. 6, 2, 34.<BR> 4. To inhabit, Rām. 3, 54, 5.<BR> 5. To enter, MBh. 3, 13330.<BR> 6. To live as wife of, MBh. 1, 7265. Part. of the pf. pass. अध्यासित, Being the subject, Lass. 92, 2.<BR> --With समधि सम्-अधि,<BR> 1. To occupy, Ragh. 13, 52.<BR> 2. To inhabit, Rām. 6, 4, 52.<BR> --With अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To sit down after, Ragh. 2, 24.<BR> 2. To attend, Śāk. 33, 3.<BR> 3. To perform, Rām. 2, 50, 34.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To be indifferent, Śiś. 2, 42.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pres. उदासीन, One who is indifferent, neither friend nor enemy, Man. 7, 155.<BR> --With उप उप,<BR> 1. To sit near, Man. 4, 154.<BR> 2. To attend, Bhag. 12, 2.<BR> 3. To honour, MBh. 3, 12611.<BR> 4. To partake, Man. 3, 104; MBh. 17, 2871.<BR> 5. To attain, Yājñ. 3, 192.<BR> 6. To sit, Man. 2, 103.<BR> 7. To occupy, Man. 5, 93.<BR> 8. To perform, Rām. 4, 24, 11; Daśak. in Chr. 184, 3.<BR> 9. To undergo, MBh. 3, 15634.<BR> 10. To stay, Rām. 1, 36, 1.<BR> 11. To spend time, doing something (cf. the simplex), the action being expressed,<BR> a. By a participle, Bhag. 12, 6;<BR> b. By an absolutive, Rām. 1, 44, 1.<BR> 12. To expect, MBh. 3, 1215.<BR> --With पर्युप परि-उप,<BR> 1. To surround, MBh. 2, 280; Nal. 1, 11.<BR> 2. To sit on, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b " target="_blank">Page0092-b + 44</a>] Man. 2, 75.<BR> 3. To dwell round (with the acc.), MBh. 3, 10412.<BR> 4. To partake, Arj. 8, 21.<BR> 5. To attend respectfully, Man. 7, 37.<BR> --With समुप सम्-उप,<BR> 1. To sit, Rām. 2, 105, 1.<BR> 2. To perform, Rām. 4, 10, 24.<BR> 3. To honour, Mṛcch. 37, 4.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To sit together, MBh. 2, 304.<BR> 2. To sit together with (with the acc.), MBh. 1, 2104; with the instr., Sāv. 6, 27.<BR> 3. To sit, Man. 2, 101.<BR> 4. To be a match, MBh. 3, 372.<BR> --With प्रतिसम् प्रति-सम्, To be able to resist (with the acc.), MBh. 3, 17314.<BR> --Cf. ἧμαι, ἧσται = आस्ते; concerning the spir. asper cf. ἡμεδ- in ἡμεδ-απός = अस्मद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरास्
दुस्- + आस् दुस्- + आस्, n. Unsuitable manner of sitting, MBh. 3, 14669.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0091-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसङ्ग|आसंग|आसङ्गं|आसङ्गः
आसङ्ग आसङ्ग, i. e. आ-सञ्ज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Being attached, Śāk. d. 132.<BR> 2. Attachment, Pañc. v. d. 93.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरासङ्ग|उत्तरासंग|उत्तरासङ्गः
उत्तर- + आसङ्ग उत्तर- + आसङ्ग, m. an upper and outer garment, Pañc. 236, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसत्ति|आसत्तिः
आसत्ति आसत्ति, i. e. आ-सद् + ति, f. Juxtaposition (of words), Bhāṣāp. 81; 82. Connection, Bhāṣāp. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसन|आसनं|आसनः
आसन आस् + अन, m. and n.<BR> 1. Sitting, Man. 6, 22; Daśak. in Chr. 180, 22 (विगृह्य-, Sitting separately, not together).<BR> 2. Sitting in some peculiar posture for pious purposes, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 14; 16.<BR> 3. Sitting encamped, Man. 7, 160.<BR> 4. Dwelling, Man. 2, 215.<BR> 5. A seat, Man. 3, 208; Bhag. 6, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धासन|अर्द्धासनं
अर्ध- + आसन अर्ध- + आसन, n. half a seat, Śāk. 97, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलासन|कमलासनः
कमल- + आसन कमल- + आसन and जलज-, m. a name of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मासन|धर्म्मासन|धर्म्मासनं
धर्म- + आसन धर्म- + आसन, n. the seat of a judge, Man. 8, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपासन|नृपासनं
नृप- + आसन नृप- + आसन, n. a throne.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मासन|पद्मासनं|पद्मासनः
पद्म- + आसन पद्म- + आसन,<BR> I. n. 1. a seat consisting of a lotusflower. 2. a kind of posture when absorbed in meditation.<BR> II. adj. dwelling in a lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भद्रासन|भद्रासनं
भद्र- + आसन भद्र- + आसन, n. 1. a throne. 2. a peculiar posture, in which abstract meditation is performed by a devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीरासन|वीरासनं
वीर- + आसन वीर- + आसन, n. 1. a field of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a " target="_blank">Page0093-a + 43</a>] battle. 2. a bivouac. 3. a kind of posture, Man. 11, 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रासन
शक्र- + आसन शक्र- + आसन, n. a throne, Pañc. iii. d. 270.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहासन
सह- + आसन सह- + आसन, n. sitting on the same seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंहासन|सिंहासनं|सिंहासनः
सिंह- + आसन सिंह- + आसन, n. a throne.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसव|आसवः
आसव आसव, i. e. आ-सु + अ, m. A distilled spirit, MBh. 16, 30.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्वासव|मध्वासवः
मधु- + आसव मधु- + आसव, m. a spirit distilled from the blossoms of the Bassia latifolia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरासव|सुरासवः
सुरा- + आसव सुरा- + आसव, n. an inebriating liquor, Man. 11, 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरासव|स्मरासवः
स्मर- + आसव स्मर- + आसव, m. saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसादन|आसादनं
आसादन आसादन, i. e. आ-सद् + अन, n. Attacking, MBh. 2, 808.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसार|आसारः
आसार आसार, i. e. आ-सृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. A hard shower, Pañc. 94, 3.<BR> 2. A king whose dominions are separated by other intervening states, Kāmand. Nītis. 8, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धारासार|धारासारः
धारा- + आसार धारा- + आसार, m. a hard shower, Vikr. d. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पासार|पुष्पासारः
पुष्प- + आसार पुष्प- + आसार, m. a shower of flowers, Megh. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सासार
स- + आसार स- + आसार, adj., f. रा, rainy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसिधार|आसिधारं
आसिधार आसिधार, i. e. असि-धारा + अ, adj. As difficult as standing on the edge of a sword (cf. व्रत), Ragh. 13, 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसिसादयिषु
आसिसादयिषु आसिसादयिषु, i. e. आ-सिसादयिष, desid. of सद्, + उ, adj. Desirous of attacking, Rām. 6, 76, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसुर|आसुरं|आसुरः
आसुर आसुर, i. e. असुर + अ, adj., f. री.<BR> 1. Belonging to the Asuras or demons, Arj. 10, 30.<BR> 2. Demon-like, Bhag. 9, 12; wicked, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 13: that form of marriage is so called in which the bridegroom gives to the bride, her father, and paternal kinsmen, as much as he can afford, Man. 3, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसेध|आसेधः
आसेध आसेध, i. e. आ-सिध् + अ, m. Arrest.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थानासेध|स्थानासेधः
स्थान- + आसेध स्थान- + आसेध, m. confine ment to a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसेवा
आसेवा आ-सेव् + आ, f. Intercourse.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरासेव
दुस्- + आसेव दुस्- + आसेव, adj., f. वा, hard to have intercourse with, Rām. 3, 23, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसेविन्
ऽआसेविन् -आ-सेव् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Addicted, Rājat. 5, 207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्कन्द|आस्कंदः|आस्कन्दः
आस्कन्द आ-स्कन्द् + अ, m. Mounting, Kathās. 26, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्कन्दिन्|आस्कंदिन्
आस्कन्दिन् आ-स्कन्द् + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Jumping on, Ragh. 17, 52.<BR> II. m. A donor, Kathās. 24, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तर|आस्तरः
आस्तर आस्तर, i. e. आ-स्तृ + अ, m. A layer, Kathās. 22, 196.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तरण|आस्तरणं
आस्तरण आस्तरण, i. e. आ-स्तृ + अन, n.<BR> 1. A layer, MBh. 3, 15142.<BR> 2. Lying, Pañc. i. d. 190.<BR> 3. A cover, Rām. 3, 49, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तरणवन्त्|आस्तरणवत्
आस्तरणवन्त् आस्तरण + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Covered with blankets, or carpets, Rām. 4, 44, 99; MBh. 1, 7943.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तरणिक
आस्तरणिक आस्तरणिक, i. e. आस्तरण + इक, adj. Spread sacrificial grass, Rām. 6, 96, 15 (Sch.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तिक|आस्तिकः
आस्तिक आस्तिक, i. e. अस्ति, third ps. of the pres. of 1. अस्, + इक, m. A believer, religious, pious, Rām. 2, 109, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्तिक्य|आस्तिक्यं
आस्तिक्य आस्तिक्य, i. e. आस्तिक + य, n. Devoutness, Bhag. 18, 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्था
आस्था आस्था f.<BR> 1. Stay, Bhartṛ. 1, 93.<BR> 2. Trust, Bhartṛ. 2, 96.<BR> 3. Regard, Bhartṛ. 3, 59.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनास्था
अन्- + आस्था अन्- + आस्था, f. disregard, Kumāras. 6, 63; no matter, 6, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जातास्थ
जात- + आस्थ जात- + आस्थ, adj., f. था, full of hope, Daśak. in Chr. 200, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्थान|आस्थानं
आस्थान आस्थान, i. e. आ-स्थ + अन, n. and f. नी, An assembly, Rājat. 5, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्पद|आस्पदं
आस्पद आस्पद, i. e. perhaps आत्-पद, n.<BR> 1. A place, Rājat. 5, 44.<BR> 2. palace, Rājat. 5, 235.<BR> 3. A position, Man. 7, 184.<BR> --Cf. perhaps Lat. oppidum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्पदता
ऽआस्पदता -आस्पद + ता, f. Condition of being the place of, Kathās. 7, 81 (confidence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्फालन|आस्फालनं
आस्फालन आस्फालन, i. e. आ-स्फल् Caus. + अन, n. Flapping, striking against, Pañc. iii. d. 237, Kumāras. 3, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0094-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्फोट|आस्फोटः
