आहुति|आहुतिः
आहुति आ-हु + ति, f. An oblation to the deities, Man. 2, 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहो
आहो आहो, part. Or, Śāk. d. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्निक|आह्निकं
आह्निक आह्निक, i. e. अहन् + इक,<BR> I. adj. Daily, MBh. 3, 10772.<BR> II. n. A religious ceremony which must be performed every day, Rām. 1, 25, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवाह्निक
