भूत- + ईश्वर भूत- + ईश्वर, m. Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महेश्वर|महेश्वरः
महा- + ईश्वर महा- + ईश्वर, m. Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेश्वर|योगेश्वरः
योग- + ईश्वर योग- + ईश्वर, m. 1. a teacher of sacred science, Pañc. 24, 23. 2. a magician. 3. a deity, the object of devout contemplation. 4. Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरेश्वर
शूर- + ईश्वर शूर- + ईश्वर, m. a sanctuary built by Śūra, Rājat. 5, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साम्बेश्वर
साम्बा- + ईश्वर साम्बा- + ईश्वर, m. a sanctuary built by Sāmbavatī, ib. 295.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेश्वर|सुरेश्वरः
सुर- + ईश्वर सुर- + ईश्वर,<BR> I. m. Śiva.<BR> II. f. री, a name of Durgā, Rājat. 5, 37; 40, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0106-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईश्वरता
ईश्वरता ईश्वर + ता, f. and ईश्वरत्व ईश्वर + त्व, n. Supremacy, Prab. 108, 15; MBh. 2, 1695.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईष्
ईष् ईष् (akin to 1. इष्), i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To go, to hasten, to fly.<BR> 2. † To kill.<BR> 3. † To see (or to give).<BR> --† i. 1, Par. To glean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईषत्
ईषत् ईषत् (probably ntr. of the ptcple. of the present of ईक्ष्, with ष् for क्ष्), adv.<BR> 1. A little, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 18.<BR> 2. When the former part of a comp., especially when followed by a word denoting the partic. of the fut. pass.: Easily, e. g. ईषत्-कार्य (vb. कृ), Easy to be made, Rām. 4, 54, 12 (विदारणे, easy to be cleft).<BR> ईषत्-कर (vb. कृ), Easy to be performed, Prab. 36, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईषा
ईषा ईषा, see ईशा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईह्
ईह् ईह्, i. 1, Ātm. (sometimes Par.)<BR> 1. To aim at, Man. 4, 15.<BR> 2. To desire, Bhartṛ. 2, 6.<BR> 3. To desire to perform, Man. 3, 205.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pres. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b " target="_blank">Page0107-b + 39</a>] अन्-ईहमान, Not desiring, Yājñ. 2, 116.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., ईहित, Desired, Prab. 104, 5. n.<BR> 1. Exertion, Man. 9, 208.<BR> 2. Desire, MBh. 1, 1370.<BR> --Comp.<BR> आयती-, adj. referring to future time, Rām. 3, 44, 11.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, To desire, Pañc. iii. d. 87; i. d. 105 (Par.).<BR> समीहित, n. Desire, Hit. 44, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईहा
ईहा ईह् + आ, f.<BR> 1. Exertion, Rām. 3, 43, 38.<BR> 2. Desire, MBh. 3, 95.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनीह|अनीहः
अन्-ईह अन्-ईह and निस्-, adj. devoid of energy, MBh. 3, 1240; 14, 1302.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीहा
निस्-ईहा निस्-ईहा, f. indifference, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईहातस्
ईहातस् ईहा-तस्, adv. By exertion, Man. 9, 205.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उ|उः
उ,<BR> I. interj. of anger, of command, Kumāras. 1, 26.<BR> II. a part. (cf. उद्),<BR> 1. Also.<BR> 2. Now, Chr. 289, 1 = Rigv. i. 50, 1. Lengthened ऊ, Chr. 296, 1 = Rigv. i. 112, 1.<BR> --Cf. अथो under अथ, किम्, and the ved. combination स उ, with οὑ in οὗ-τος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उ|उः
† उ उ, i. 1, Ātm. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्ति|उक्तिः
उक्ति उक्ति, i. e. वच् + इइ, f.<BR> 1. Speaking, Man. 8, 104.<BR> 2. Speech, Pañc. 44, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुक्ति|दुरुक्तिः
दुस्- + उक्ति दुस्- + उक्ति, f. offending speech, Bhāg. P. 3, 18, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रोक्ति|वक्रोक्तिः
वक्रोक्ति वक्रोक्ति, i. e. वक्र-, f. 1. equivoque, pun. 2. sarcasm. 3. hint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हितोक्ति|हितोक्तिः
हित- + उक्ति हित- + उक्ति, f. 1. good advice. 2. tenderness, compassion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्थ|उक्थं|उक्थः
उक्थ उक्थ, i. e. वच् + थ, n. Praise, Chr. 292, 4 = Rigv. i. 86, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्थ्य|उक्थ्यः
उक्थ्य उक्थ्य, i. e. उक्थ + य,<BR> I. adj. Praiseworthy, Chr. 288, 12 = Rigv. i. 48, 12.<BR> II. n. The name of the second day of the horse-sacrifice, Rām. 1, 13, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्ष्
उक्ष् उक्ष्. i. 1, Par. (ved. also [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a " target="_blank">Page0108-a + 42</a>] Ātm.),<BR> 1. To sprinkle, Chr. 293, 2 = Rigv. 1, 87, 2; Chr. 36, 15.<BR> 2. To wet, MBh. 13, 1791.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To sprinkle on, Śāk. 41, 4.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To hallow (by sprinkling) for a sacrifice, Man. 5, 27.<BR> 2. To sacrifice, Rām. 1, 13, 29; 31, Gorr.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To sprinkle on, Yājñ. 1, 24.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To wet, Rām. 3, 75, 8.<BR> 2. To endow. Rām. 2, 91, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0107-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षणज
उक्षणज उक्षणज, i. e. उक्ष् + अन-ज (vb. जन्), adj. Sprung up by consecration, Ragh. 5, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षन्
उक्षन् उक्ष् + अन्, m. An ox or bull, Kir. 5, 42.<BR> 2. A ved. epithet of the Maruts who, by bringing rain (i. e. by sprinkling), impregnate the earth like bulls, Chr. 290, 2 = Rigv. i. 64, 2.<BR> --Cf. Goth. auhsa, base auhsan; A.S. oxa; the ved. fem. is वशा, probably = Lat. vacca.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षित
उक्षित उक्षित, ptcple. of the pf. pass. of उक्ष्, and ved. also of वक्ष्, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उख्
† उख् उख्, and उङ्ख् उङ्ख्, i. 1 Par. To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उग्र|उग्रं|उग्रः
उग्र उग्र, probably वज् + र,<BR> I. adj. f. रा,<BR> 1. Very strong (ved.).<BR> 2. Terrible, Rām. 4, 22, 35; Bhag. 11, 31.<BR> 3. Cruel, Man. 4, 212.<BR> 4. Rigorous, Man. 6, 75.<BR> --Compar. उग्रतर, as rigorous as possible, Man. 6, 24.<BR> II. m. and f. रा, The offspring of a Kṣatriya father and a Śūdrā mother, Man. 10, 9; 19.<BR> III. m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2738.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्युग्र
अति- + उग्र अति- + उग्र, adj. excessively cruel, Pañc. iii. d. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्
उच् उच्, i. 4, Par. To like, to be accustomed to.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. उचित,<BR> 1. Used, Rām. 4, 8, 57.<BR> 2. Accustomed to (with the gen.), Nal. 23, 22.<BR> 3. Suitable, proper, Pañc. 176, 1; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b " target="_blank">Page0108-b + 43</a>] Rājat. 5, 184; Rām. 1, 44, 56.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, in the ptcple. of the pf. pass. समुचित, Used to, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतथोचित
अ-तथा- + उचित अ-तथा- + उचित, adj. not thus used to, Nal. 15, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुचित
अन्- + उचित अन्- + उचित, adj. 1. inappropriate, Pañc. 61, 3. 2. unused to, Rām. 2, 58, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचित|यथोचितं
यथा- + उचित यथा- + उचित, adj. used, Hit. 42, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथोचित
अ-यथा-उचित अ-यथा-उचित, adj. inappropriate, Pañc. i. d. 193 (former part of a comp. word, in the sense of the adv. ˚त + म्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उचितत्व
उचितत्व उचित + त्व (see the last), n. Convenience, MBh. 1, 7465.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्च|उच्चं|उच्चः
उच्च उच्च, i. e. उद्-अञ्च् + अ,<BR> I. adj. f. चा,<BR> 1. High, Kir. 5, 5.<BR> 2. Deep, Caurap. 44.<BR> 3. Loud, Bhartṛ. 3, 85.<BR> II. उच्चैस् (instr. pl.), adv.<BR> 1. High, Kumāras. 6, 72.<BR> 2. Loud, Nal. 11, 2.<BR> 3. Much, excessively, Amar. 94.<BR> 4. Powerfully, Pañc. iv. d. 22.<BR> III. m. Culmination, Rām. 1, 19, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुच्च
अन्- + उच्च अन्- + उच्च, adj. low, Rājat. 5, 478.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चकैस्
उच्चकैस् उच्चकैस्, i. e. उच्च + क, instr. pl., adv. Very loud, Pañc. ii. d. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चता
उच्चता उच्च + ता, f. Superiority, MBh. 3, 10635.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चय|उच्चयः
उच्चय उच्चय, i. e. उद्-चि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Gathering, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 20.<BR> 2. Collection, Śāk. d. 42.<BR> 3. Plenty, Rām. 5, 13, 61.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलोच्चय|शिलोच्चयः
शिला- + उच्चय शिला- + उच्चय, m. a mountain, Kir. 5, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सलिलोच्चय
सलिल- + उच्चय सलिल- + उच्चय, adj. having plenty of water, MBh. 3, 8334.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलोच्चय|स्थूलोच्चयः
स्थूल- + उच्चय स्थूल- + उच्चय, m. 1. a hollow at the root of an elephant's tusk. 2. the middle pace of an elephant. 3. pimples on the face. 4. a hill at the foot of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चाटन|उच्चाटनं|उच्चाटनः
उच्चाटन उच्चाटन, i. e. उद्-चट् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Ruin, Prab. 61, 16.<BR> 2. The name of one of the arrows of Kāma, Lass. 7, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चार|उच्चारः
उच्चार उच्चार, i. e. उद्-चर् + अ, m. Voiding excrements, Man. 4, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0108-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चारण|उच्चारणं
उच्चारण उच्चारण, i. e. उद्-चर् Caus., + अन, n. Pronunciation, Śiś. 4, 18; recitation, MBh. 3, 14037.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चारित्र
उच्चारित्र उच्चारित्र, i. e. उद्-चारित्र in मात्र-, n. Immoral conduct, Rājat. 6, 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चावच|उच्चावचः
उच्चावच उच्चावच, i. e. उच्च-अव-अञ्च् + अ, adj. High and low, various, Man. 12, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चैस्तर|उच्चैस्तरं
उच्चैस्तर उच्चैस् + तर (see उच्च), adj. Very tall, Pañc. 161, 14.<BR> प्तराम्, adj. Higher, Kumāras. 7, 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चैस्तरत्व
उच्चैस्तरत्व उच्चैस्तर + त्व, n. Being excessively high, Pañc. 33, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्|उछ्
उच्छ् उच्छ्, see 2. वस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छित्ति|उच्छित्तिः
उच्छित्ति उच्छित्ति, i. e. उद्-छिद् + ति, f. Extermination, Kathās. 15, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिलीन्ध्र|उच्छिलींध्र
उच्छिलीन्ध्र उच्छिलीन्ध्र, i. e. उद्-शिलीन्ध्र,<BR> I. n. A mushroom, Megh. 11.<BR> II. adj. Covered with mushrooms, ib. v. r. (read उच्छिल्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिष्टता
उच्छिष्टता उच्छिष्टता, i. e. उद्-शिष्ट + ता (vb. शिष्), f. Impurity, Pañc. 89, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छीर्षक|उच्छीर्षकं
उच्छीर्षक उच्छीर्षक, i. e. उद्-शीर्षन् + क,<BR> I. adj. Having the head erect.<BR> II. n. A pillow, Man. 3, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छुष्क
उच्छुष्क उच्छुष्क, i. e. उद्-शुष्क, adj., f. का, Dried up, Mṛcch. 2, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छृङ्खल|उच्छृंखल|उच्छृङ्खलं
उच्छृङ्खल उच्छृङ्खल, i. e. उद्-शृङ्खल, adj., f. ला,<BR> 1. Unrestrained, Hit. iii. d. 97.<BR> 2. Wicked, Kathās. 18, 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेत्तृ
उच्छेत्तृ उच्छेत्तृ, i. e. उद्-छिद् + तृ, m. A destroyer, Rām. 3, 36, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेद|उच्छेदः
उच्छेद उच्छेद, i. e. उद्-छिद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Chopping off, Kathās. 18, 29.<BR> 2. Destruction, Pañc. ii. d. 196.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुच्छेद
दुस्- + उच्छेद दुस्- + उच्छेद, adj. difficult to be destroyed, Prab. 76, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेदन|उच्छेदनं
उच्छेदन उच्छेदन, i. e. उद्-च्किद् + अन, n. Extermination, Pañc. 53, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेदिन्
उच्छेदिन् उच्छेदिन्, i. e. उद्-छिद् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Destroying, Hit. Pr. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेष|उच्छेषः
उच्छेष उच्छेष, i. e. उद्-शिष् + अ m. Residue, MBh. 13, 1621.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेषण|उच्छेषणं
उच्छेषण उच्छेषण, i. e. उद्-शिष् + अन, n. Residue, Man. 3, 246.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोषण
उच्छोषण उच्छोषण, i. e. उद्-शुष् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Drying up.<BR> II. n. Drying up, Rām. 5, 72, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रय|उच्छ्रयः
उच्छ्रय उच्छ्रय, i. e. उद्-श्रि + अ, m. Elevation, Rām. 1, 13, 24.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोच्छ्रय
महा- + उच्छ्रय महा- + उच्छ्रय, adj. lofty, Rām. 3, 74, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृतोच्छ्रय
सु-कृत- + उच्छ्रय सु-कृत- + उच्छ्रय, adj. very lofty, MBh. 1, 6963.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्राय|उच्छ्रायः
उच्छ्राय उच्छ्राय, i. e. उद्-श्रि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Rising, Kir. 5, 31; Kathās. 25, 45.<BR> 2. Elevation, Rājat. 5, 261.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गोच्छ्राय
शृङ्ग- + उच्छ्राय शृङ्ग- + उच्छ्राय, m. a lofty top, Megh. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रायवन्त्
ऽउच्छ्रायवन्त् -उच्छ्राय + वन्त्, in महा-, adj. Very tall, Pañc. 104, 6.<BR> पताका-, adj. Having tall flags, MBh. 1, 4995.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रिति|उच्छ्रितिः
उच्छ्रिति उच्छ्रिति, i. e. उद्-श्रि + ति, f. Exaltation, an exalted birth, Man. 5, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वास|उच्छ्वासः
उच्छ्वास उच्छ्वास, i. e. उद्-श्वस् + अ m.<BR> 1. Breathing, Rām. 1, 65, 7.<BR> 2. Growing a little more conspicuous (of a colour), Śāk. d. 142.<BR> 3. Breath, Vikr. d. 105.<BR> 4. Sighing, Megh. 100.<BR> 5. A division of a book, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 4.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुच्छ्वास|निरुच्छ्वासः
निस्- + उच्छ्वास निस्- + उच्छ्वास, adj., f. सा, without breathing, Rām. 5, 25, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वासिन्
उच्छ्वासिन् उच्छ्वासिन्, i. e. उद्-श्वस् + इन्, adj., f. नी,<BR> 1. Sighing, Megh. 100.<BR> 2. Rising, Vikr. d. 7.<BR> 3. Growing conspicuous (as colour), Kumāras. 7, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उछ्|उच्छ्
उछ् उछ्, see 2. वस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0109-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जयिनी
उज्जयिनी उज्जयिनी, i. e. उद्-जि + इन् + ई, 1. The city Oujein, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वल|उज्ज्वलं|उज्ज्वलः
उज्ज्वल उज्ज्वल, i. e. उद्-ज्वल् + अ, adj., f. ला,<BR> 1. Splendid, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 24.<BR> 2. Clear, Bhartṛ. 2, 16.<BR> 3. Beautiful, Śiś. 9, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वलन|उज्ज्वलनं
उज्ज्वलन उज्ज्वलन, i. e. उद्-ज्वल् + अन, n. Fire(?), Rām. 2, 40, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जृम्भ|उज्जृंभ|उज्जृम्भं|उज्जृम्भः
उज्जृम्भ उज्जृम्भ, i. e. उद्-जृम्भ् + अ, adj.<BR> 1. Yawning.<BR> 2. Open.<BR> 3. Expanded, blown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्झ्
उज्झ् उज्झ् (a dialect, form of उद्-का), i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To abandon, Rājat. 5, 349.<BR> 2. To let fall, Kir. 5, 6.<BR> 3. To throw, Rājat. 5, 108.<BR> उज्झित,<BR> 1. Devoid of, Rājat. 5, 4.<BR> 2. Risked, Rājat. 5, 131.<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To abandon, Pañc. v. d. 22.<BR> 2. To avoid, Hit. i. d. 17 n.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To abandon, Pañc. i. d. 343.<BR> समुज्झीत, Free from, Prab. 11, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उञ्छ्|उंछ्
उञ्छ् उञ्छ्, i. 1 and 6, Par. To collect the gleanings of the harvest, Man. 3, 100.<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र, To wipe out, Mṛcch. 140, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उञ्छ|उञ्छं|उंछः|उञ्छः
उञ्छ उञ्छ् + अ, m. Gleaning grains, Man. 10, 112.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलोञ्छ|शिलोञ्छः
शिल- + उञ्छ शिल- + उञ्छ, m. gleaning ears and grains, Man. 7, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उटज|उटजः
उटज उटज, i. e. perhaps वट-ज (vb. जन्), m. and n. A hut made of leaves, the residence of anchorites, Rām. 1, 48, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहोटज|सहोटजः
सह- + उटज सह- + उटज, m. A hut made of leaves, the residence of anchorites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उठ्
† उठ् उठ् or ऊठ् ऊठ्, i. 1, Par. To strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडु|उडुः
उडु उडु, f. and n. A star, Mālav. 64, d. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुप|उडुपः
उडुप उडुप, i. e.<BR> I. उडु (perhaps akin to उदन्, and a dialectical form of उद्र in समुद्र) -प (vb. 2. पा), m. and n. A raft, Mṛcch. 123, 20.<BR> II. उडु-प (vb. 2. पा), m. The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बर|उडुंबर|उडुम्बरं|उडुंबरः|उडुम्बरः
उडुम्बर उडुम्बर, see उदुम्बर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डयन|उड्डयनं
उड्डयन उड्डयन, i. e. उद्-डी + अन, n. Flying up, Pañc. 115, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत|उतं
उत उत, part.<BR> 1. And, Chr. 34, 7.<BR> 2. Also, Chr. 3, 8.<BR> 3. उत--उत, As well as, MBh. 3, 10684.<BR> 4. उत--वा--उत--उत, As well as, as also, and, MBh. 5, 916; 917.<BR> 5. उत वा, Or, Brāhmaṇav. 3, 5.<BR> 6. part. of interrogation, What, how. In a disjunctive interrogation: Or, Bhartṛ. 3, 77; also with following वा, Pañc. 68, 14; also with following आहो (उताहो), Nal. 12, 120; also with following आहो स्विद्, Nal. 19, 27-29; also with following स्विद् only, Pañc. 41, 1; seldom with preceding किम् (किम् उत), Mṛcch. 172, 3.<BR> 7. preceded by किम् (किम् उत), Much less, Rām. 4, 35, 8.<BR> 8. preceded by प्रति (प्रत्य् उत), Even, Pañc. iii. d. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्य|उतथ्यः
उतथ्य उतथ्य, m. The name of a Muni, Man. 3, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क|उत्कः
उत्क उत्क, i. e. उद्-क (vb. कम्), adj., f. का, Desirous, Megh. 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्क
स- + उत्क स- + उत्क, adj. desirous, Kathās. 26, 271.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कट|उत्कटं|उत्कटः
उत्कट उत्कट, i. e. उद्-कट (कट is probably a change of कष्ट), adj., f. टा.<BR> 1. Excessive, Rām. 5, 13, 37.<BR> 2. Abounding in, Rām. 2, 55, 30.<BR> 3. Drunk, MBh. 2, 2160.<BR> 4. Furious, Rām. 6, 73, 7.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्युत्कट
अति- + उत्कट अति- + उत्कट, adj. exceedingly great, Hit. i. d. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदोत्कट|मदोत्कटः
मद- + उत्कट मद- + उत्कट,<BR> I. adj. 1. arrogant. 2. furious.<BR> II. m. an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठ्
उत्कण्ठ् उत्कण्ठ् (properly a denomin. derived from उत्कण्ठा), Par.<BR> 1. To long for, Rām. 2, 53, 2.<BR> 2. To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a " target="_blank">Page0111-a + 41</a>] sorrow, Śāk. 60, 5.<BR> --Caus. उत्कण्ठय, To make desirous, Bhartṛ. 1, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0110-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठ|उत्कंठ|उत्कण्ठः
उत्कण्ठ उत्कण्ठ, i. e. उद्-कण्ठ,<BR> I. adj. Having the neck erect.<BR> II. f. ठा,<BR> 1. Longing for, Daśak. in Chr. 190, 18.<BR> 2. Regret, sorrow, Śāk. d. 81.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्कण्ठ|सोत्कंठ|सोत्कण्ठः
स- + उत्कण्ठ स- + उत्कण्ठ, adj., f. ठा, 1. ardently longing, Rājat. 5, 93. 2. regretting, grieving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्कण्ठम्
स- + उत्कण्ठ + -ठम् स- + उत्कण्ठ + -ठम्, adv. sorrowfully, Kir. 5, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्प|उत्कंप|उत्कम्पः
उत्कम्प उत्कम्प, i. e. उद्-कम्प् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Trembling.<BR> II. m. Trembling, Megh. 68.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गत्युत्कम्प
