सोत्कम्प
स- + उत्कम्प स- + उत्कम्प, adj., f. पा, Trembling, Vikr. 28, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्पिन्|उत्कंपिन्
