प्रकीर्णकुसुमोत्कर
प्रकीर्ण-कुसुम- + उत्कर प्रकीर्ण-कुसुम- + उत्कर, adj., f. रा, strewed with plenty of flowers, Rām. 1, 77, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्ष|उत्कर्षः
उत्कर्ष उत्कर्ष, i. e. उद्-कृष् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Boasting.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Excess, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 21.<BR> 2. Distinction, Śāk. d. 38.<BR> 3. Exaltation, Man. 10, 42; an exalted rank, Man. 4, 244.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्षण|उत्कर्षणं
