उत्कलिका
उत्कलिका उत्कलिका, i. e. उत्क + ल + इक, f. Longing for, Kathās. 22, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कषण|उत्कषणं
उत्कषण उत्कषण, i. e. उद्-कष् + अन, n. Tearing up, Megh. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्किर
ऽउत्किर -उत्किर, i. e. उद्-कॄ + अ, adj., f. रा, Heaping up, Kumāras. 5, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुट|उत्कुटं
उत्कुट उत्कुट, adj.<BR> 1. Stretched out.<BR> 2. Erect.<BR> 3. (Sitting) with the legs under one's body, Fausböll, Dhammap. 306.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूज|उत्कूजः
