उत्कोचक|उत्कोचकः
उत्कोचक उत्कोचक, i. e. उद्-कुच् + अक,<BR> I. adj., One who receives bribes, Man. 9, 258.<BR> II. (n.) The name of a holy place, MBh. 1, 6914.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क्रमण|उत्क्रमणं
उत्क्रमण उत्क्रमण, i. e. उद्-क्रम् + अन, n. Departure, Man. 6, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क्रोश|उत्क्रोशः
उत्क्रोश उत्क्रोश, i. e. उद्-क्रुश् + अ, m. An osprey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क्षेप|उत्क्षेपः
