उत्क्षेपक|उत्क्षेपकः
उत्क्षेपक उत्क्षेपक, i. e. उद्-क्षिप् + अक, m. A purloiner, Yājñ. 2, 274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

