पुरुषोत्तम|पुरुषोत्तमः
पुरुष- + उत्तम पुरुष- + उत्तम, m. 1. an excellent man, an excellent servant. 2. a name of Viṣṇu. 3. a proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलोत्तम
