मृगोत्तम|मृगोत्तमः
मृग- + उत्तम मृग- + उत्तम, m. a most excellent antelope, Rām. 3, 49, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघूत्तम
रघु- + उत्तम रघु- + उत्तम, m. chief of the race of Raghu, Rām. 3, 50, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथोत्तम
