शरोत्तम
शर- + उत्तम शर- + उत्तम, m. a very good arrow, Rām. 3, 50, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवकोत्तम
सेवक- + उत्तम सेवक- + उत्तम, m. an excellent servant, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1435.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0111-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमर्ण|उत्तमर्णः
उत्तमर्ण उत्तमर्ण, i. e. उत्तम + ऋण, m. A creditor, Man. 8, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमर्णिक
उत्तमर्णिक उत्तमर्णिक, i. e. उत्तमर्ण + इक, m. A creditor, Man. 8, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तर|उत्तरं|उत्तरः
उत्तर उत्तर, i. e. उद् + तर,<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Superior, Ragh. 1, 60; more powerful, Chr. 289, 10 = Rigv. i. 50, 10.<BR> 2. Northern, Pañc. 241, 7.<BR> उत्तरेण (instr. sing.), adv. and prep. (with the gen. abl. and acc.), To the north, Megh. 73.<BR> 3. Left (not right), MBh. 1, 7212.<BR> 4. Posterior, Man. 2, 136; subsequent, Hit. i. d. 143; becoming, fit, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 6.<BR> 5. Future, Rām. 2, 33, 22.<BR> 6. Answering, Rām. 3, 18, 48; Chr. 59, 24.<BR> II. m. The name of a mountain, Kathās. 25, 23.<BR> III. f. रा,<BR> 1. The north, Kathās. 18, 57.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 169.<BR> IV. n.<BR> 1. Superiority, MBh. 1, 4986; power, Rām. 5, 70, 18.<BR> 2. Answer, Rām. 3, 70, 7; defence, Lass. 90, 4.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ὕστερος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधरोत्तर
अधर- + उत्तर अधर- + उत्तर,<BR> I. adj. 1. lower and higher, Yājñ. 1, 96. 2. confused, Man. 8, 53.<BR> II. n. a state of confusion, topsy-turvy, Man. 7, 21; useless discussion, Śāk. 69, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरोत्तर
उत्तरोत्तर उत्तरोत्तर, i. e. उत्तर-,<BR> I. adj. 1. always the subsequent, Yājñ. 2, 136. 2. always increasing, Pañc. 84, 25.<BR> II. -रम्, adv. higher and higher, MBh. 14, 1016; more and more, Hit. 20, 20.<BR> III. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b " target="_blank">Page0112-b + 42</a>] n. useless discussion, Hit. 21, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्रोत्तरम्
अस्रोत्तरम् अस्रोत्तरम्, i. e. अस्र-उत्तर + म्, adv with tears in the eyes, Kumāras. 5, 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नपक्षोत्तर
क्लिन्न-पक्ष- + उत्तर क्लिन्न-पक्ष- + उत्तर, adj. of which the upper parts of the wings are wet, Daśak. 1, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणोत्तर
गुण- + उत्तर गुण- + उत्तर, m. superior virtue, Rām. 5, 2, 4; n. MBh. 3, 13922.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दक्षिणोत्तर
दक्षिण- + उत्तर दक्षिण- + उत्तर, turned to the south and to the north, Mārk. P. 16, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दध्युत्तर|दध्युत्तरं
दधि- + उत्तर दधि- + उत्तर, n. cream of curdled milk, Suśr. 1, 159, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखोत्तर
दुःख- + उत्तर दुःख- + उत्तर, adj., f. रा, accompanied by pain, Śāk. 61, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मोत्तर
धर्म- + उत्तर धर्म- + उत्तर, adj. attached to virtue, Ragh. 13, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्तर
निस्- + उत्तर निस्- + उत्तर, adj., f. रा, unable to answer, Pañc. 112, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागुत्तरेण
प्रागुत्तरेण प्रागुत्तरेण, i. e. प्राञ्च्-, adv. north-eastwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टरोत्तर
विष्टर- + उत्तर विष्टर- + उत्तर, adj. covered with Kuśa grass, MBh. 3, 1381.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तोत्तर
सप्तोत्तर सप्तोत्तर, i. e. सप्तन्-, adj., f. रा, having a surplus of seven (with शत, hundred and seven), Yājñ. 3, 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरण|उत्तरणं
उत्तरण उत्तरण, i. e. उद्-तॄ + अन, n. Crossing, passing over, Pañc. 33, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरतस्
उत्तरतस् उत्तर + तस्, adv. To the north, Rām. 4, 55, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरा
उत्तरा उत्तरा (an old instr. sing. of उत्तर), adv. To the north, e. g. in -मुख, adj. Looking to the north, MBh. 2, 1084.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरीय|उत्तरीयं
उत्तरीय उत्तरीय, i. e. उत्तर + ईय, and उत्तरीयक उत्तरीय + क, n. An upper and outer garment, Pañc. 236, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरेद्युस्
उत्तरेद्युस् उत्तरेद्युस्, i. e. उत्तर + इ-दिव् + अस्, adv. The following day, Daśak. in Chr. 183, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तान|उत्तानं
उत्तान उत्तान, i. e. उद्-तन् + अ, adj., f. ना, Lying supinely, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 20 (referring to the hand lying with the palm turned upwards).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तार|उत्तारः
उत्तार उत्तार, i. e. उद्-तॄ + अ, m. Crossing, passing over, Prab. 83, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तारण|उत्तारणः
उत्तारण उत्तारण, i. e. उद्-तॄ-अन, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a " target="_blank">Page0113-a + 40</a>]<BR> I. adj. Causing to cross, MBh. 14, 194.<BR> II. n. Deliverance, Rām. 4, 52, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0112-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्ताल|उत्तालः
उत्ताल उत्ताल, i. e. उद्-ताल, adj., f. ला, Formidable, Kathās. 25, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तितीर्षु
उत्तितीर्षु उत्तितीर्षु, i. e. उद्-तितीर्ष, desider. of तॄ, + उ, adj. Desirous to step out, MBh. 11, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुङ्ग|उत्तुंग|उत्तुङ्गः
उत्तुङ्ग उत्तुङ्ग, i. e. उद्-तुङ्ग, adj., f. गा.<BR> 1. Prominent, Bhartṛ. 1, 72.<BR> 2. High, Pañc. iii. d. 260.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तेजन|उत्तेजनं
उत्तेजन उत्तेजन, i. e. उद्-तिज् + अन, n. Instigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थ|उत्थः
उत्थ उत्थ, i. e. उद्-स्थ (vb. स्था), adj.<BR> 1. Rising, Caurap. 18.<BR> 2. Springing up, Pañc. 257, 4; proceeding, Pañc. i. d. 400; Bhāṣāp. 119; Rājat. 5, 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थान|उत्थानं
उत्थान उत्थान, i. e. उद्-स्था + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Rising, Bhartṛ. 3, 10; of the moon, Ragh. 6, 31.<BR> 2. Resurrection, MBh. 3, 10811.<BR> 3. Exertion, Man. 9, 215.<BR> II. m. A causer, MBh. 13, 1242.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्थान|अनुत्थानं
अन्- + उत्थान अन्- + उत्थान, n. want of exertion, Rājat. 5, 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्थान|सूत्थानः
सु- + उत्थान सु- + उत्थान, adj. clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थानवन्त्|उत्थानवत्
उत्थानवन्त् उत्थान + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Strenuous, MBh. 2, 1941.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थापन|उत्थापनं
उत्थापन उत्थापन, i. e. उद्-स्था, Caus., + अन, n.<BR> 1. Raising, MBh. 1, 1885.<BR> 2. Leading away. Lass. 24, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थायिन्
उत्थायिन् उत्थायिन्, i. e. उद्-स्था + इन्, adj., f. नी, Rising, MBh. 1, 3628.<BR> 2. Appearing, MBh. 1, 2332.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थितता
उत्थितता उत्थितता, i. e. उद्-स्थित + ता (vb. स्था), f. Veneration, MBh. 3, 14687.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पतन|उत्पतनं
उत्पतन उत्पतन, i. e. उद्-पत् + अन, n. Jumping, Pañc. 118, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पतिष्णु|उत्पतिष्णुः
उत्पतिष्णु उत्पतिष्णु, i. e. उद्-पत् + इष्णु, adj.<BR> 1. Rising, Ragh. 4, 47.<BR> 2. Being about to jump, Pañc. iii. d. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पत्ति|उत्पत्तिः
उत्पत्ति उत्पत्ति, i. e. उद्-पद् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Springing up, Śṛṅgārat. 20.<BR> 2. Birth, Man. 3, 16; second birth, 2, 68.<BR> 3. Produce, Rājat. 5, 69.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्पत्ति|अनुत्पत्तिः
अन्- + उत्पत्ति अन्- + उत्पत्ति, f. absence of production, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पत्तिमन्त्|उत्पत्तिमत्
उत्पत्तिमन्त् उत्पत्ति + मन्त्, adj. Produced, born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पथ|उत्पथः
उत्पथ उत्पथ, i. e. उद्-पथ, m. Wrong way, Chr. 22, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पल|उत्पलं|उत्पलः
उत्पल उत्पल, i. e. probably उद्-पट् + अ (with ल् for ट्),<BR> I. n. A blue lotus, Nymphæa cærulea, Bhartṛ. 2, 56.<BR> II. m. A proper name, Rājat. 5, 127.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलोत्पल|नीलोत्पलं
नील- + उत्पल नील- + उत्पल, m. a blue lotus, Nymphæa cyanea Roxb., Rām. 4, 44, 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पलिन्
उत्पलिन् उत्पलिन्, i. e. उत्पल + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Abounding with lotusflowers, Rām. 3, 78, 26.<BR> II. f. नी, An assemblage of lotus-flowers, MBh. 3, 8564.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पवन|उत्पवनं
उत्पवन उत्पवन, i. e. उद्-पू + अन, n. Purifying, Man. 5, 115 (Lois.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाटन|उत्पाटनं
उत्पाटन उत्पाटन, i. e. उद्-पत् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Eradication, Rām. 6, 83, 34.<BR> 2. Destruction, Rājat. 5, 292.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाटिन्
उत्पाटिन् उत्पाटिन्, i. e. उद्-पत् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Pulling out, Pañc. i. d. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पात|उत्पातः
उत्पात उत्पात, i. e. उद्-पत् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A jump, Rām. 5, 53, 25.<BR> 2. A portent, MBh. 1, 8287; an omen, Man. 6, 50.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोत्पात
महा- + उत्पात महा- + उत्पात, adj. terrible, Pañc. 114, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाद|उत्पादः
उत्पाद उत्पाद, i. e. उद्-पद् + अ, m. Producing, causing, Yājñ. 2, 225 (shedding).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादक|उत्पादकः
उत्पादक उत्पादक, i. e. उद्-पद् + अक,<BR> I. adj. A producer, a causer, Man. 4, 168 (a shedder).<BR> II. m. A father, Man. 2, 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादन|उत्पादनं
उत्पादन उत्पादन, i. e. उद्-पद् + अन, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a " target="_blank">Page0114-a + 40</a>]<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Producing, MBh. 1, 7834.<BR> II. n. Producing, Man. 9, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादिन्
उत्पादिन् उत्पादिन्, i. e.<BR> I. उत्पाद + इन्, adj., f. नी, Produced, Hit. i. d. 202.<BR> II. उद्-पद् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Producing, causing, Yājñ. 2, 224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पीड|उत्पीडः
उत्पीड उत्पीड, i. e. उद्-पीड् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Drawing out, MBh. 3, 825 (of an arrow).<BR> 2. Forcing, Megh. 88 (tears).<BR> 3. Pressing, Prab. 71, 10.<BR> 4. Foam, Rām. 5, 4, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्पीड
स- + उत्पीड स- + उत्पीड, adj. covered with foam, Rām. 4, 15, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पीडन|उत्पीडनं
उत्पीडन उत्पीडन, i. e. उद्-पीड् + अन, n. Pressing, Ṛt. 1, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्रास|उत्प्रासः
उत्प्रास उत्प्रास, i. e. उद्-प्र- 2. अस् + अ, m. Excess.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्प्रास|सोत्प्रासं|सोत्प्रासः
स- + उत्प्रास स- + उत्प्रास,<BR> I. adj. violent.<BR> II. m. a horse-laugh.<BR> III. m. and n. irony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्प्लवन|उत्प्लवनं
उत्प्लवन उत्प्लवन, i. e. उद्-प्लु + अन, n. Taking off (?) Man. 5, 115, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्फाल|उत्फालः
उत्फाल उत्फाल, i. e. उद्-फल् + अ, m. Jumping up, Kathās. 26, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्फुल्ल|उत्फुल्लः
उत्फुल्ल उत्फुल्ल, see फल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्स|उत्सः
उत्स उत्स (akin to उन्द्), m. A fountain, ved. a cloud, Chr. 290, 6 = Rigv. i. 64, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सङ्ग|उत्संग|उत्संगः|उत्सङ्गः
उत्सङ्ग उत्सङ्ग, i. e. उद्-सङ्ज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. The lap, Rām. 6, 71, 11; figuratively, Daśak. 199, 7; Rājat. 5, 6.<BR> 2. The slope of a mountain, Ragh. 6, 3.<BR> 3. A roof, Pañc. 128, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सङ्गिन्|उत्संगिन्
उत्सङ्गिन् उत्सङ्गिन्, i. e. उत्सङ्ग + इन्, adj., f. नी. Deep, Rām. 6, 23, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सधि|उत्सधिः
उत्सधि उत्सधि, i. e. उत्स-धा (cf. निधि), m. A reservoir of water, a cloud (ved.), Chr. 293, 4 = Rigv. i. 88, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सर्ग|उत्सर्गः
उत्सर्ग उत्सर्ग, i. e. उद्-सृज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Emission, Megh. 19.<BR> 2. Evacuation, Pañc. 34, 22; Man. 12, 21.<BR> 3. Abandoning, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b " target="_blank">Page0114-b + 44</a>] Nal. 10, 12; relinquishing, Man. 11, 193 (194); dismission, Chr. 9, 37.<BR> 4. Donation, Sāv. 1, 8.<BR> 5. The name of a ceremony, when suspending the reading of the Veda, Man. 4, 119.<BR> 6. Setting at liberty.<BR> 7. A general rule, Kumāras. 2, 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषोत्सर्ग|वृषोत्सर्गः
वृष- + उत्सर्ग वृष- + उत्सर्ग, m. setting a bull at liberty on occasion of a sacrifice or obsequial oblation, Pañc. 9, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सर्जन|उत्सर्जनं
उत्सर्जन उत्सर्जन, i. e. उद्-सृज् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Rejection, Chr. 9, 38.<BR> 2. The name of the ceremony, उत्सर्ग (q. cf.), Man. 4, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सर्पिन्|उत्सर्प्पिन्
उत्सर्पिन् उत्सर्पिन्, i. e. उद्-सृप् + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Soaring upwards, Śāk. 101, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सव|उत्सवः
उत्सव उत्सव, i. e. उद्-सु + अ, m. A festival, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 5; figuratively, Amar. 23.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बद्धोत्सव
बद्ध- + उत्सव बद्ध- + उत्सव (vb. बन्ध्), adj., f. वा, celebrating a festival, Kathās. 25, 269.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सादन|उत्सादनं
उत्सादन उत्सादन, i. e. उद्-सद् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Destruction, Rām. 1, 74, 21.<BR> 2. Cleaning with perfumes, Man. 2, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सारण|उत्सारणं
उत्सारण उत्सारण, i. e. उद्-सृ + अन, n. Removal, Rām. 6, 33, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्साह|उत्साहः
उत्साह उत्साह, i. e. उद्-सह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Effort, Draup. 8, 56.<BR> 2. Energy, Pañc. i. d. 44.<BR> 3. Ardour, Rām. 3, 33, 4.<BR> 4. Perseverance, Pañc. 79, 1; will, Śāk. 23, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतोत्साह
कृत- + उत्साह कृत- + उत्साह, adj., f. हा, having made an effort, Sāv. 4, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुत्साह
दुस्- + उत्साह दुस्- + उत्साह, adj. difficult to be resisted, MBh. 9, 1130.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्साह|निरुत्साहः
निस्- + उत्साह निस्- + उत्साह,<BR> I. m. want of energy, Hariv. 14493.<BR> II. adj., f. हा, 1. devoid of energy, Pañc. 123, 23. 2. desponding, Rām. 1, 21, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोत्साह|महोत्साहः
महा- + उत्साह महा- + उत्साह,<BR> I. adj. possessing great energy, persevering.<BR> II. m. 1. exertion. 2. a king possessing all the powers of monarchy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्साहम्
यथा-उत्साह + म् यथा-उत्साह + म्, adv. according to one's power or ability, Man. 5, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्साह
स- + उत्साह स- + उत्साह,<BR> I. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a " target="_blank">Page0115-a + 42</a>] adj. 1. energetic. 2. persevering.<BR> II. -हम्, adv. carefully, Pañc. i. d. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0114-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्साहवन्त्|उत्साहवत्
उत्साहवन्त् उत्साह + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्साहिन्
उत्साहिन् उत्साहिन्, i. e. उत्साह + इन्, adj., f. नी, Full of ardour, Pañc. ii. d. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सुक|उत्सुकः
उत्सुक उत्सुक, i. e. उद्-सु-क (vb. कम्), adj., f. का.<BR> 1. Longing for.<BR> 2. Languid.<BR> 3. Uneasy, Rām. 1, 17, 28.<BR> 4. Proud, Rām. 4, 9, 37.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्सुक
निस्- + उत्सुक निस्- + उत्सुक, adj. careless, Arj. 10, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युत्सुक|पर्य्युत्सुक
परि- + उत्सुक परि- + उत्सुक, adj. 1. longing for. 2. languid. 3. sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सुक
स- + उत्सुक स- + उत्सुक, adj. languid, Ṛt. 1, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सुकता
उत्सुकता उत्सुक + ता f.<BR> 1. Longing for, love, Śiś. 9, 2.<BR> 2. Care, zeal, Pañc. 40, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सुकता
अन्- + उत्सुकता अन्- + उत्सुकता, f. modesty, Vikr. 12, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सेक|उत्सेकः
उत्सेक उत्सेक, i. e. उद्-सिच् + अ, m. Pride, Rām. 4, 9, 88; 5, 3, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सेक|अनुत्सेकः
अन्- + उत्सेक अन्- + उत्सेक, m. meekness, Bhartṛ. 2, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्सेध|उत्सेधः
उत्सेध उत्सेध, i. e. उद्-सिध् + अ, m. Height, Rām. 6, 83, 23; figuratively, 6, 82, 44.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवोत्सेध
नवोत्सेध नवोत्सेध, i. e. नवन्-, adj., f. धा, having an elevation of nine (viz. fathoms), MBh. 3, 10207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्स्वप्नाय
उत्स्वप्नाय उत्स्वप्नाय, a denomin. derived from उद्-स्वप्न, Ātm. To speak sleeping, Mālav. 55, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्
उद् उद् (properly acc. sing. n. of उ, probably an obsolete pronominal base, akin to व in अव, एव, etc.), a prefix, उप्, ओउत्.<BR> I. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives, q. cf.<BR> II. Former part of comp. nouns, e. g. उद्-अयुध, adj. With raised weapon (literally, having a weapon upward), Chr. 4, 17.<BR> उत्पक्ष्मन्, i. e. उद्-, adj. The eye-lids of which are elevated, Śāk. d. 90.<BR> उद्-दाम, adj. Unfettered (literally, having the fetter out), Rām. 2, 23, 21.<BR> --Cf. ὕστερος, ὕστατος for [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b " target="_blank">Page0115-b + 44</a>] ὑδ + τερο, τατο; Goth. and A.S. ut; O.H.G. ûz.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद|उदं
उद उद, a substitute for उदक in comp. words, e. g. उद-कुम्भ, m. A water-pot, Man. 2, 182.<BR> क्षार-, m. The salt ocean, Bhāg. P. 5, 1, 34.<BR> क्षीर-, m. The sea of milk, Rām. 4, 37, 28.<BR> गन्ध-, Fragrant water, Bhāg. P. 9, 11, 26.<BR> घृत-, m. The sea of clarified butter, Rām. 4, 40, 49.<BR> लोहित-, adj., f. दा, With blood-red water, Rām. 4, 44, 65.<BR> शान्ति-, n. Lustral water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक|उदकं
उदक उदक, i. e. उदन् + क, n.<BR> 1. Water, Man. 2, 99.<BR> 2. The ceremony of pouring water at obsequies, Man. 5, 88.<BR> 3. Religious ablution, MBh. 1, 790.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामोदक|कामोदकं
काम- + उदक काम- + उदक, n. an optional oblation of water, Yājñ. 3, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालोदक
काल- + उदक काल- + उदक, the name of a sea, Rām. 4, 40, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशोदक
कुश- + उदक कुश- + उदक, n. water (boiled) with kuśagrass, Man. 11, 212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतोदक
कृत- + उदक कृत- + उदक, adj. 1. one who has performed the ceremony of pouring water at obsequies, Rām. 1, 25, 3. 2. one who has performed his religious ablution, MBh. 3, 8141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलोदक
तिल- + उदक तिल- + उदक, n. water with sesame, Man. 3, 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डोदक|मण्डोदकं
मण्ड- + उदक मण्ड- + उदक, n. 1. variegated colour. 2. painting figures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानोदक|समानोदकः
समान- + उदक समान- + उदक, m. a kinsman connected by oblations of water only to the manes of common ancestors, i. e. when the सपिण्डस् are excluded, a relation from the seventh to the fourteenth degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्या
उदक्या उदक्या, i. e. उदक + य, f. A woman in her courses, Man. 4, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्र|उदग्रं
उदग्र उद्-अग्र, adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Pointing upwards, lofty, Rām. 5, 54, 19; figuratively, Ragh. 2, 53.<BR> 2. Uppermost, Vikr. d. 156.<BR> 3. Excited, Rām. 6, 14, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदञ्च्|उदंच्
उदञ्च् उद्-अञ्च्, adj., f. उदीची.<BR> 1. Upper, upwards.<BR> 2. Northern, Megh. 58.<BR> उदक् (acc. sing. n.), adv. To the north, Man. 3, 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदञ्चन|उदंचन|उदंचनं|उदञ्चनं
उदञ्चन उद्-अञ्च् + अन, m. A pail, Daśak. 152, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदधि|उदधिः
उदधि उदधि, i. e. उद-धा (cf. निधि), m. The ocean, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 21.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षारोदधि|क्षारोदधिः
क्षार- + उदधि क्षार- + उदधि, m. the salt ocean, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोदधि
क्षीर- + उदधि क्षीर- + उदधि, m. the sea of milk, MBh. 12, 12778.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोदधि|महोदधिः
महा- + उदधि महा- + उदधि, m. the great ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्
उदन् उदन्, i. e. उन्द् + अन्, n. Water, Chr. 291, 5 = Rigv. i. 85, 5.<BR> --Cf. ὕδωρ with ρ for न्; cf. also Lat. udor; Goth. vato, base vatan, represents the organic form of the vb. उन्द्, viz. वद्; O.H.G. wazar has र् instead of न्, like the Greek.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्त|उदंत|उदन्तः
उदन्त उद्-अन्त, m. Tidings, Kathās. 10, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्वन्त्|उदन्वत्
उदन्वन्त् उदन् + वन्त्, m. The ocean, Ragh. 4, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदय|उदयः
उदय उदय, i. e. उद्-इ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Rising, Rām. 4, 34, 32 (of the ocean); Ragh. 12, 36 (of the moon); Man. 10, 33 (appearance of dawn); figuratively, Ragh. 9, 9; Rājat. 5, 311.<BR> 2. The eastern mountain behind which the sun is supposed to rise, Rām. 4, 58, 5.<BR> 3. Beginning, Bhāg. P. 1, 7, 12.<BR> 4. Appearance, Śāk. d. 67.<BR> 5. Prosperity, Rājat. 5, 336.<BR> 6. Consequence, Man. 4, 70.<BR> 7. Gain, Rām. 3, 2, 22; revenue, Man. 7, 55.<BR> 8. A gate(?), Rām. 2, 48, 29.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणोदय
करुणा- + उदय करुणा- + उदय, adj. causing compassion, MBh. 1, 436.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रोदय|चंद्रोदय|चन्द्रोदयः
चन्द्र- + उदय चन्द्र- + उदय, m. the rise of the moon, Suśr. 2, 485, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुदय
दुस्- + उदय दुस्- + उदय, adj. appearing with difficulty, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोदय|महोदयं|महोदयः
महा- + उदय महा- + उदय,<BR> I. m. 1. prosperity. 2. final beatitude. 3. sovereignty. 4. a lord. 5. the country of Kanoj. 6. a proper name, Rājat. 5, 28.<BR> II. n. Kanoj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोदयम्
यथा-उदय + म् यथा-उदय + म्, adv. in proportion to one's income, Yājñ. 2, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोदय|सोदयं
स- + उदय स- + उदय, adj. 1. with profit. 2. with interest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदयन|उदयनं|उदयनः
