उदर|उदरं|उदरः
उदर उदर, i. e. उद्-ऋ + अ, n.<BR> 1. The belly.<BR> 2. The interior part, Bhartṛ. 2, 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

