सोदर|सोदरः
स- + उदर स- + उदर, m. a brother, Rājat. 5, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0116-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

