उदार|उदारः
उदार उदार, i. e. उद्-ऋ + अ, adj., f. रा and री,<BR> 1. Distinguished, Nal. 1, 8.<BR> 2. Excellent, Rām. 1, 35, 8.<BR> 3. Great, MBh. 3, 13158.<BR> 4. Gentle, Rām. 1, 33, 3.<BR> 5. Munificent, Daśak. in Chr. 183, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0117-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदारक
