रघूद्वह|रघूद्वहः
रघु- + उद्वह रघु- + उद्वह, m. Rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतोद्वह|रतोद्वहः
रत- + उद्वह रत- + उद्वह, m. the Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वहन|उद्वहनं
उद्वहन उद्-वह् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Lifting up, Ragh. 13, 8.<BR> 2. Bearing, Pañc. 68, 23; having, Rājat. 5, 384.<BR> 3. Riding, Man. 8, 370.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वाष्पत्व
उद्वाष्पत्व उद्-वाष्प + त्व, n. Shedding tears, Vikr. d. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वास्य
उद्वास्य उद्वास्य (based on उद्- 1. वस्), adj. Referring to the slaughter of sacrifices, Rām. 1, 13, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वाह|उद्वाहः
उद्वाह उद्वाह, i. e. उद्-वह् + अ, m. Marriage, Kathās. 17, 68.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतोद्वाह
कृत- + उद्वाह कृत- + उद्वाह, adj., f. हा, married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वाहिक|उद्वाहिकः
उद्वाहिक उद्वाहिक, i. e. उद्वाक + इक, adj. Relating to nuptials, Man. 9, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0119-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वीक्षण|उद्वीक्षणं
उद्वीक्षण उद्वीक्षण, i. e. उद्-वि-ईक्ष् + अन, n. Looking at, sight, Ragh. 3, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वेग|उद्वेगं|उद्वेगः
उद्वेग उद्वेग, i. e. उद्-विज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Going upwards, MBh. 1, 1214 (fluctuation).<BR> 2. Violent motion, Daśak. 189, 6.<BR> 3. Uneasiness, distress, Rām. 6, 99, 28.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्वेग|अनुद्वेगः
अन्- + उद्वेग अन्- + उद्वेग, m. absence of uneasiness, Rām. 3, 14, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्वेग
निस्- + उद्वेग निस्- + उद्वेग, adj. fearless, MBh. 3, 7537.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोद्वेग
स- + उद्वेग स- + उद्वेग,<BR> I. adj. fearful, Pañc. 29, 15.<BR> II. -गम्, adv. eagerly, Pañc. 157, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वेगिन्
उद्वेगिन् उद्वेगिन्, i. e. उद्वेग + इन्, adj., m. A coward, Pañc. iii. d. 241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वेजन|उद्वेजनं
उद्वेजन उद्वेजन, i. e. उद्-विज् + अन, n. Terror, Man. 9, 248; aversion, 8, 352.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उध्रस्
† उध्रस् उध्रस् (a combination of उद्-ध्रस्, q. cf.), ii. 9; i. 10, Par. To glean.<BR> --i. 10, Par. To throw upward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्द्|उंद्
उन्द् उन्द् (cf. उदन्, and Lat. unda), ii. 7, Par. To wet, or moisten.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि, To moisten, Chr. 291, 5 = Rigv. i. 85, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्दरु|उंदरु|उंदरुः|उन्दरुः
उन्दरु उन्दरु, उन्दुर उन्दुर, and उन्दुरु उन्दुरु, m. A rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नतत्व|उन्नतत्वं
उन्नतत्व उन्नतत्व, i. e. उद्-नत + त्व (vb. नम्), n. Majesty, Ragh. 5, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नति|उन्नतिः
उन्नति उन्नति, i. e. उद्-नम् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Rising, Pañc. i. d. 166.<BR> 2. Increase, Pañc. iii. d. 58.<BR> 3. Loftiness, Bhartṛ. 2, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नतिमन्त्|उन्नतिमत्
उन्नतिमन्त् उन्नति + मन्त्, adj., f. मती,<BR> 1. Prominent, Śiś. 9, 72.<BR> 2. Lofty, Kathās. 24, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नयसाहसोन्नतिमन्त्|नयसाहसोन्नतिमत्
नय-साहस-उन्नति + मन्त् नय-साहस-उन्नति + मन्त्, endowed (i. e. performed) with wisdom, power, and majesty, Pañc. iii. d. 264.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नमन|उन्नमनं
उन्नमन उन्नमन, i. e. उद्-नम् + अन, n. Erecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नम्रता
उन्नम्रता उन्नम्रता, i. e. उद्-नम् + र + ता, f. Lifting up, Rājat. 5, 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नयन|उन्नयनं
उन्नयन उन्नयन, i. e. उद्-नी + अन, n.<BR> 1. Raising, lifting up.<BR> 2. Inference.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीमन्तोन्नयन|सीमंतोन्नयन|सीमन्तोन्नयनं
सीमन्त- + उन्नयन सीमन्त- + उन्नयन, n. (arranging of the hair) a purificatory and sacrificial ceremony observed by women in the sixth or eighth month of their first pregnancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्नाद|उन्नादः
उन्नाद उन्नाद, i. e. उद्-नद् + अ, m. Sound, MBh. 3, 11563.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मत्तक
उन्मत्तक उन्मत्तक, i. e. उद्-मत्त + क (vb. मद्) n. A madman, Yājñ. 2, 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मथन
उन्मथन उन्मथन, i. e. उद्-मथ् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Shaking, Suśr. 1, 25, 17.<BR> 2. Throwing down by shots, Rām. 6, 91, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मद|उन्मदः
उन्मद उन्मद, i. e. उद्-मद् + अ.<BR> I. m. Ecstasy, insanity.<BR> II. adj., f. दा.<BR> 1. Drunk, Prab. 3, 12.<BR> 2. Thoughtless, Pañc. 176, 1.<BR> 3. Furious, Dev. 4, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोन्मद|महोन्मदः
महा- + उन्मद महा- + उन्मद, m. 1. intoxication, literally and figuratively.<BR> 2. A sort of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मनस्
उन्मनस् उन्मनस्, i. e. उद्-मनस्, adj.<BR> 1. Desirous.<BR> 2. Agitated, Ragh. 11, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मनस्क
उन्मनस्क उन्मनस् + क, adj. Agitated, Mṛcch. 76, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मनाय
उन्मनाय उन्मनाय, a denomin. derived from उन्मनस् by य, Ātm. To be beside one's self, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 14 (उद्-अमनायत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्माथ|उन्माथः
उन्माथ उन्माथ, i. e. उद्-मथ् + अ, m. Shaking, Prab. 8, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्माथिन्
उन्माथिन् उन्माथिन्, i. e. उन्माथ + इन्, adj., f. नी, Shaking, Prab. 41, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्माद|उन्मादः
उन्माद उन्माद, i. e. उद्-मद् + अ, m. Madness, Rām. 5, 31, 40.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतोन्माद
कृत- + उन्माद कृत- + उन्माद, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a " target="_blank">Page0121-a + 41</a>] adj., f. दा (MBh. 14, 2009), feigning madness, Kathās. 18, 242.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोन्माद|सोन्मादः
स- + उन्माद स- + उन्माद, adj. mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0120-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मादन|उन्मादनः
उन्मादन उन्मादन, i. e. उद्-मद्, Caus., + अन, m. Causing madness, the name of one of the five arrows of Kāma, Lass. 7, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मार्ग|उन्मार्गः
उन्मार्ग उन्मार्ग, i. e. उद्-मार्ग, m.<BR> 1. A wrong road.<BR> 2. Improper conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मार्जन|उन्मार्जनं
उन्मार्जन उन्मार्जन, i. e. उद्-मृज्, Caus., + अन, n. Eclipsing, Prab. 81, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मिश्र
ऽउन्मिश्र -उन्मिश्र, i. e. उद्-मिश्र, adj., f. रा, Mixed, Rām. 3, 34, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मीलन|उन्मीलनं
उन्मीलन उन्मीलन, i. e. उद्-मील् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Opening of the eye, MBh. 1, 84.<BR> 2. Springing up, appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मुखता
उन्मुखता उन्मुखता, i. e. उद्-मुख + ता, f. Having the face uplifted, Kathās. 25, 248.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मूलन|उन्मूलनं
उन्मूलन उन्मूलन, i. e. उद्-मूल् + अन, n. Eradication, Ragh. 2, 34; figuratively, Prab. 67, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मेष|उन्मेषं|उन्मेषः
उन्मेष उन्मेष, i. e. उद्-मिष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Opening of the eye-lids, Rām. 6, 102, 25.<BR> 2. Flashing (of lightning), Megh. 79.<BR> 3. Opening (of buds), Kumāras. 2, 33.<BR> 4. Appearance, Prab. 118, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मेषण|उन्मेषणं
उन्मेषण उन्मेषण, i. e. उद्-मिष् + अन, n. Awaking, appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उप
उप उप, ind. Under, on, near.<BR> I. adv. Near, further (ved.).<BR> II. prep. Near to (with the acc.), MBh. 1, 4099.<BR> III. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives (q. cf.).<BR> IV. Former part of comp. nouns and adv. implying Inferiority, Nearness, e. g. उप-वन (lit., an inferior, a small, forest), n. A grove.<BR> उप-कीचक, m. A partisan of the Kīcakas (a people).<BR> उप-ग्रह, m. A minor planet or any secondary heavenly body, as a comet, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-b " target="_blank">Page0121-b + 42</a>] etc.<BR> उप-कन्या-पुर + म् adv. Near the gyneceum.<BR> --Cf. Goth. uf, e. g. in ufdaupjan (to submerge), ufsneithan (to cut up), and ufhaban (to lift); Lat. sub is compounded with स, corresponding to a Sskr. स-उप; likewise ὑπό.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकण्ठ|उपकंठ|उपकण्ठं|उपकण्ठः
उपकण्ठ उप-कण्ठ,<BR> I. adj., f. ठा, Near, Bhartṛ. 3, 24.<BR> II. m. n. Proximity, Pañc. 74, 21; 222, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकरण|उपकरणं
उपकरण उपकरण, i. e. उप-कृ + अन, n. Benefitting, Pañc. 86, 3.<BR> 2. Implements, Yājñ. 2, 276.<BR> 3. Complement, Man. 2, 105 (of the Veda, viz. the Vedāngas).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मोपकरण
कर्मोपकरण कर्मोपकरण, i. e. कर्मन्-, adj. assisting by labour, Man. 10, 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शस्त्रोपकरण
शस्त्र- + उपकरण शस्त्र- + उपकरण, n. military apparatus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0121-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकर्तृ|उपकर्त्तृ
