उपमर्दक|उपमर्दकः|उपमर्द्दक
उपमर्दक उपमर्दक, i. e. उप-मृद् + अक, adj. Destroying, Kathās. 7, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमा
उपमा उप-मा, f.<BR> 1. Comparison, Bhāṣāp. 79.<BR> 2. Likeness, MBh. 1, 6401; Bhag. 6, 19; आत्मानम् उपमां कृत्वा, comparing thyself (viz. with others), Rām. 5, 23, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --As latter part of a comp. adj. it denotes very often, Like; e. g. अमरोपम, i. e. अमर-, adj., f. मा, God-like, Nal. 5, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपम|अनुपमः
अन्-उपम अन्-उपम, adj., f. मा, incomparable, Rām. 4, 62, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलब्धोपम
अलब्धोपम अलब्धोपम, i. e. अ-लब्ध- (vb. लभ्), adj., f. मा, incomparable, MBh. 3, 16517.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपम|निरुपमः
नीस्- + उपम नीस्- + उपम, adj. not having his like, Bhartṛ. 2, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमृतोपम
अमृत- + उपम अमृत- + उपम, adj., f. मा, Amṛta-like, Nal. 12, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमान|उपमानं
उपमान उपमान, i. e. उप-मा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Comparison (the third प्रमाण), Bhāṣāp. 139.<BR> 2. Likeness, Kumāras. 4, 5.<BR> 3. An image, Vikr. d. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमिति|उपमितिः
उपमिति उपमिति, i. e. उप-मा + ति, f. Comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयन्तृ|उपयंतृ
उपयन्तृ उपयन्तृ, i. e. उप-यम् + तृ, m. A husband, Ragh. 7, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयम|उपयमः
उपयम उप-यम् + अ, m. Marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाचन|उपयाचनं
उपयाचन उप-याच् + अन, n. Solicitation.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्योपयाचन
सत्य- + उपयाचन सत्य- + उपयाचन, adj. fulfilling, or granting what is requested. Rām. 2, 68, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयान|उपयानं
उपयान उपयान, i. e. उप-या + अन, n. Approach, Rām. 3, 9, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयायिन्
उपयायिन् उपयायिन्, i. e. उप-या + इन्, adj., f. नी. Approaching, Rām. 2, 97, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोग|उपयोगः
उपयोग उपयोग, i. e. उप-युज् + अ, m. Employment, use, Kumāras. 1, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोगिन्
उपयोगिन् उपयोगिन्, adj., f. नी, i. e.<BR> 1. उप-युज् + इन्, Using, Daśak. 198, 16, Wils. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a " target="_blank">Page0126-a + 44</a>]<BR> 2. उपयोग + इन्, Serviceable, Kathās. 12, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0125-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरति|उपरतिः
उपरति उपरति, i. e. उप-रम् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Ceasing, Dev. 11, 3.<BR> 2. Resigning, indifference, Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 13, cf. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरम|उपरमः
उपरम उप-रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. End, Rām. 4, 19, 13.<BR> 2. Death, MBh. 1, 4897.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरमण|उपरमणं
उपरमण उपरमण, i. e. उप-रम् + अन, n. Ceasing, resigning, Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपराग|उपरागः
उपराग उपराग, i. e. उप-रञ्ज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Painting, Śāk. d. 80, v. r.<BR> 2. An eclipse, MBh. 3, 13476.<BR> 3. Calamity, Ragh. 16, 7.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विषयोपराग
निर्विषयोपराग निर्विषयोपराग, i. e. निस्-विषय-, adj., f. गा, unharmed by objects of the senses, Prab. 48, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरि
उपरि उपरि, indecl. Over, above, on.<BR> I. adv. Above, MBh. 1, 571; upwards, Pañc. ii. d. 74; moreover, MBh. 1, 294.<BR> II. prep.<BR> 1. Over, with the loc., Rām. 6, 85, 3; with the acc., 6, 3, 26; with the gen. MBh. 1, 507.<BR> 2. On, with the gen., Yājñ. 2, 253 (adding to).<BR> 3. Concerning, with the gen., Pañc. 94, 12; on account of, 214, 6.<BR> III. Former part of comp. nouns and former and latter part of comp. adv., e. g. उपरि-पुरुष, adj. Mounted by a man Daśak. in Chr. 188, 16.<BR> कर्परोपरि, i. e. कर्पर-, adv. Over earthen pots, Pañc. 218, 12.<BR> तरुवरोपरि, i. e. तरु-वर-, adv. On an excellent tree, Rām. 3, 35, 92.<BR> कथितवेलोपरि, i. e. कथित-वेला-, adv. After the appointed time, Lass. 44, 16.<BR> --Doubled उपर्युपरि, i. e. उपरि-उपरि.<BR> 1. adv. Always higher, Hit. ii. d. 2 (those who look always above themselves, i. e. to their superiors); one above another, Vedāntas. in Chr. 209, 2.<BR> 2. prep. Over, with acc., MBh. 1, 4648; with gen., Nal. 1, 2.<BR> --Cf. उप and ved. उपर, of which [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b " target="_blank">Page0126-b + 42</a>] it is probably the loc. sing. slightly changed; Goth. ufar-; concerning Lat. super and Gr. ὑπέρ (properly ὑπερι in aeol. ὑπέρρ, ep. ὑπείρ.) cf. उप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरिष्टात्
उपरिष्टात् उपरिष्टात्, i. e. उपर + भिस् (instr. pl.) + तात्.<BR> I. adv.<BR> 1. Above, Rām. 4, 28, 26.<BR> 2. Afterwards, Yājñ. 1, 106.<BR> II. prep.<BR> 1. Over, on, with the gen., MBh. 3, 13654.<BR> 2. Concerning, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोध|उपरोधः
उपरोध उपरोध, i. e. उप-रुध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Obstacle, MBh. 3, 13670.<BR> 2. Disturbance, Vikr. 44, 12; Śāk. 8, 9.<BR> 3. Injury, Man. 11, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधन|उपरोधनं
उपरोधन उपरोधन, i. e. उप + रुध् + अन, n. Obstacle, Rām. 5, 81, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधिन्
उपरोधिन् उपरोधिन्, adj., f. नी, i. e.<BR> I. उप-रुध् + इन्, Disturbing, Ragh. 18, 17.<BR> II. उपरोध + इन्, Interrupted, Śāk. d. 81, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपल|उपलः
उपल उपल, m.<BR> 1. A stone, Man. 11, 167.<BR> 2. A rock, Kir. 5, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तपनोपल|तपनोपलः
तपन- + उपल तपन- + उपल, m. A fabulous gem = सूर्य-कान्त, Rājat. 3, 296.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोपल|रसोपलं
रस- + उपल रस- + उपल, n. A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षण|उपलक्षणं
उपलक्षण उपलक्षण, i. e. उप-लक्ष् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Seeing after, Śāk. 46, 6.<BR> 2. A mark, Vikr. 69, 10.<BR> 3. Including.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्धि|उपलब्धिः
उपलब्धि उपलब्धि, i. e. उप-लभ् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Acquisition, Vikr. 65, 11.<BR> 2. Perception, MBh. 14, 683.<BR> 3. Knowledge, Vedāntas. in Chr. 206, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपलब्धि|अनुपलब्धिः
अन्- + उपलब्धि अन्- + उपलब्धि, f. Non-perception (the sixth प्रमाण of the Pūrva and Uttara mimāṃsā).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भ|उपलंभ|उपलंभः|उपलम्भः
उपलम्भ उपलम्भ, i. e. उप-लभ् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Acquisition, Rām. 5, 34, 23.<BR> 2. Observation, Śāk. 13, 23.<BR> 3. Perception, Chr. 59, 22 (तद्-उपलम्भ-संयुक्त, according with what he had heard): feeling, Ragh. 14, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भक|उपलंभक
उपलम्भक उपलम्भक, i. e. उप-लभ्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a " target="_blank">Page0127-a + 39</a>] Caus., + अक, adj. Causing perception, Bhāṣāp. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलिप्सु
उपलिप्सु उपलिप्सु, i. e. उप-लिप्स, desid. of लभ्, + उ, adj. Desirous to learn, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपन|उपलेपनं
उपलेपन उपलेपन, i. e. उप-लिप् + अन, n. Smearing, especially with cowdung, Pañc. 116, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवन|उपवनं
उपवन उप-वन, n. A grove, Rām. 3, 52, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्णन|उपवर्णनं
उपवर्णन उप-वर्ण् + अन, n. Description, Hit. 35, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवास|उपवासः
उपवास उपवास, i. e. उप-वस् + अ, m. and n. Fasting, Man. 2, 188.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोपवास|सोपवासः
स- + उपवास स- + उपवास, adj. keeping a fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासक
उपवासक उपवास + क, n. Fasting, MBh. 3, 13649.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासिन्
उपवासिन् उपवासिन्, i. e. उप-वस् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Fasting, Rājat. 5, 401.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासोपवासिन्
मास- + उपवासिन् मास- + उपवासिन्, f. ironically, a lascivious woman, Lass. 41, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाहिन्
उपवाहिन् उपवाहिन्, i. e. उप-वह् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Flowing to, MBh. 1, 2367.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीणय
उपवीणय उपवीणय, a denom. derived from उप-वीणा, Par. To entertain somebody (acc.) by playing on the वीणा or Indian lyre, Ragh. 8, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीतिन्
उपवीतिन् उपवीतिन्, i. e. उप-वीत (vb. व्ये) + इन्, adj. Wearing the sacrificial cord on the left shoulder, Man. 2, 63.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञोपवीतिन्
यज्ञ- + उपवीतिन् यज्ञ- + उपवीतिन्, i. e. यज्ञोपवीत + इन्, adj., invested with the sacred thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवृत्ति|उपवृत्तिः
उपवृत्ति उप-वृत् + ति, f. Collecting, holding, Prab. 40, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेद|उपवेदः
उपवेद उप-वेद, m. A subordinate Veda, a class of writings, MBh. 2, 450.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेश|उपवेशः
उपवेश उपवेश, i. e. उप-विश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Encampment, Rām. 5, 92, contents.<BR> 2. Undergoing, Rām. 5, 22, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेशन|उपवेशनं
उपवेशन उपवेशन, i. e. उप-विश् + अन, n. Undergoing, Pañc. 50, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेशिन्
उपवेशिन् उपवेशिन्, i. e. उप-विश् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Undergoing, Rājat. 5, 467.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशम|उपशमः
उपशम उप-शम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Ceasing, MBh. 1, 758.<BR> 2. Calmness, Bhartṛ. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशमन|उपशमनं
उपशमन उप-शम् + अन, n. Appeasing, Pañc. 118, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशल्य|उपशल्यं|उपशल्यः
उपशल्य उप-शल्य, m. A space near a village, Ragh. 15, 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशान्ति|उपशांति|उपशांतिः|उपशान्तिः
