उपशायिन्
उपशायिन् उपशायिन्, i. e. उप-शी + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Sleeping, Rām. 5, 14, 21.<BR> 2. Going to rest, MBh. 1, 3626.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशोभन|उपशोभनं
उपशोभन उपशोभन, i. e. उप-शुभ्, Caus., + अन, n. Trimming, Rām. 6, 112, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशोषण|उपशोषणं
उपशोषण उपशोषण, i. e. उप-शुष्, Caus., + अन, adj. Drying up, Prab. 29, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रुति|उपश्रुतिः
उपश्रुति उप-श्रु + ति, f. A voice heard in the night, considered as a deity, MBh. 5, 436 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लेष|उपश्लेषः
उपश्लेष उपश्लेष, i. e. उप-श्लिष् + अ, m. An embrace, Prab. 15, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहार|उपसंहारः
उपसंहार उपसंहार, i. e. उप-सम्-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Drawing back, Arj. 5, 6.<BR> 2. Comprehension, compendium, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 3; 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंक्षेप
उपसंक्षेप उपसंक्षेप, i. e. उप-सम्-क्षिप् + अ, m. Summary, Rām. 1, 3, contents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0127-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रह
उपसंग्रह उपसंग्रह, i. e. उप-सम्-ग्रह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Touching (one's feet), Pañc. 206, 21 (as a token of respect).<BR> 2. Collecting, Rām. 1, 3, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रहण
उपसंग्रहण उपसंग्रहण, i. e. उप-सम्-ग्रह् + अन, n. Respectful salutation (by touching one's feet, see the last), Man. 2, 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसदन|उपसदनं
उपसदन उप-सद् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Approaching for receiving instruction, MBh. 3, 17169.<BR> 2. Presence, Rām. 1, 50, 14 (यज्ञ-, i. e. at the sacrifice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंध्यम्|उपसन्ध्यम्
उपसंध्यम् उपसंध्यम्, adv. (from उप-संध्या), Near the twilight, Śiś. 9, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंन्यास
उपसंन्यास उपसंन्यास, i. e. उप-सम्-नि- 2. अस् + अ, m. Abandoning, resigning, MBh. 3, 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसर्ग|उपसर्गः
उपसर्ग उपसर्ग, i. e. उप-सृज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A portent, supposed to announce future evil, Dev. 12, 7.<BR> 2. A preposition.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोपसर्ग
स- + उपसर्ग स- + उपसर्ग, adj., f. गा, portentous, Rām. 3, 44, 11; possessed by an evil spirit, Rām. 5, 18, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसर्जन|उपसर्जनं|उपसर्ज्जन|उपसर्ज्जनं
उपसर्जन उपसर्जन, i. e. उप-सृज् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Obscuration, Man. 4, 105.<BR> 2. A representative, Man. 9, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसर्पण|उपसर्पणं
