उपसर्पिन्
उपसर्पिन् उपसर्पिन्, i. e. उप-सृप् + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Approaching, MBh. 1, 1200.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुपसर्पिन्
दुस्- + उपसर्पिन् दुस्- + उपसर्पिन्, adj. approaching carelessly, Man. 7, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसेवक
उपसेवक उप-सेव् + अक, adj. Courting as a gallant, Yājñ. 3, 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसेवन|उपसेवनं
उपसेवन उप-सेव् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Veneration, MBh. 3, 14677.<BR> 2. Service, devotion to, Man. 4, 134; MBh. 3, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसेवा
उपसेवा उप-सेव् + आ, f.<BR> 1. Attendance. Man. 3, 64.<BR> 2. Devotion to, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-b " target="_blank">Page0128-b + 42</a>] pursuing, MBh. 2, 2577.<BR> 3. Indulgence, Man. 12, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसेविन्
ऽउपसेविन् -उप-सेव् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Respecting, Man. 2, 121.<BR> 2. Serving, 11, 43.<BR> 3. Practising, Pañc. iii. d. 206 (ये हितं वाक्यम् उत्सृज्य विपरीतोपसेविनः, they who neglecting good advice, follow the contrary).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपस्कर|उपस्करः
उपस्कर उपस्कर, i. e. उप-कृ + अ, m. (and n. Chr. 36, 18).<BR> 1. Implements, MBh. 2, 2063; household implements, Man. 12, 66.<BR> 2. A broom (? vb. कॄ), Man. 3, 63.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपस्कर
सु- + उपस्कर सु- + उपस्कर, adj. well furnished with the necessary implements, Chr. 25, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0128-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंस्कृतोपस्कर
