उपाधि|उपाधिः
उपाधि उपाधि, i. e. उप-आ-धा (cf. निधि), m.<BR> 1. Deception, Rām. 2, 111, 29.<BR> 2. Modifying circumstance, Bhāṣāp. 46.<BR> 3. A condition supplied to limit a too general middle term, Bhāṣāp. 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपाधि
अन्- + उपाधि अन्- + उपाधि, m. natural disposition, Prab. 101, 11 (this country is beautiful naturally and not through any accidental circumstance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाधिता
ऽउपाधिता -उपाधि + ता, f. in the comp. words उत्कृष्ट-, Vedāntas. in Chr. 204, 17; निकृष्ट-, 205, 3; अस्पष्ट-, 205, 5. The affix ता does not belong to उपाधि alone, but to its combination with the preceding part, e. g. उत्कृष्टोपाधि, etc., and these compounds are of the Bahuvrīhi class.<BR> उत्कृष्टोपाधि (vb. कृष् with the prep. उद्) as Bhvr. and adj. would denote ‘Having an excellent disguise;’ with the aff. ता, Condition of having an excellent disguise.<BR> नि˚ (vb. कृष् with the prep. नि), Condition of having, vile disguise; अस्पष्ट- (अ-स्प्˚), Condition of having an indistinct disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाध्याय|उपाध्यायः
उपाध्याय उपाध्याय, i. e. उप-अधि-इ + अ, m. A spiritual preceptor who gives instruction in a part only of the Veda, Man. 2, 141; a spiritual preceptor in general, Śāk. 61, 11; Rām. 1, 11, 13 (19 Gorr.).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टोपाध्याय|पट्टोपाध्यायः
पट्ट- + उपाध्याय पट्ट- + उपाध्याय, m. a dispatcher of documents (master of the rolls?), Rājat. 5, 396.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोपाध्याय|महोपाध्यायः
महा- + उपाध्याय महा- + उपाध्याय, m. a reverend master, Chr. 175, 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामहोपाध्याय|महामहोपाध्यायः
महा-महा- + उपाध्याय महा-महा- + उपाध्याय, m. a very reverend master, Chr. 235, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाध्यायानी
उपाध्यायानी उपाध्यायानी, i. e. उपाध्याय + ई, f. The wife of a teacher, MBh. 1, 750.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपानह्
उपानह् उपानह्, i. e. उप-नह्, f. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a " target="_blank">Page0130-a + 39</a>] (nom. sing. उपानत्, inst. du. उपानद्भ्याम्, loc. pl. उपानत्सु). A shoe, Man. 2, 178.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0129-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपान्त|उपांत|उपान्तः
उपान्त उपान्त i. e. उप-अन्त, n. Proximity, Rājat. 5, 450.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपान्तिक|उपांतिक
उपान्तिक उपान्तिक, i. e. उपान्त + इक, n. Vicinity, Pañc. 167, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाय|उपायः
उपाय उपाय, i. e. उप-इ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Approach, Bhartṛ. 3, 10.<BR> 2. Means of success, Man. 7, 177.<BR> 3. An expedient in general, Man. 9, 110.<BR> 4. Craft, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 498.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपायन|उपायनं
उपायन उपायन, i. e. उप-इ + अन, n. A present, Rām. 2, 70, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपार्जन|उपार्जनं|उपार्ज्जन|उपार्ज्जनं
उपार्जन उपार्जन, i. e. उप-अर्ज् + अन, n. Acquisition, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपालम्भ|उपालंभ|उपालंभः|उपालम्भः
उपालम्भ उपालम्भ, i. e. उप-आ-लभ् + अ, m. Blame, Chr. 10, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोपालम्भ
स- + उपालम्भ स- + उपालम्भ, adj. censuring, Rām. 6, 99, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपालम्भन|उपालंभन|उपालंभनं
उपालम्भन उपालम्भन, i. e. उप-आ-लभ् + अन, n. Blame, Śāk. 59, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपावर्तन|उपावर्तनं|उपावर्त्तन
उपावर्तन उपावर्तन, i. e. उप-आ-वृत् + अन, n. Return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाश्रय|उपाश्रयः
उपाश्रय उपाश्रय, i. e. उप-आश्रय, m. A retreat, refuge, MBh. 15, 152; 3, 17262.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपासक|उपासकः
उपासक उपासक, i. e. उप-आस् + अक, m.<BR> 1. A servant, Kathās. 19, 78.<BR> 2. A worshipper, Mṛcch. 113, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपासङ्ग|उपासंग|उपासंगः|उपासङ्गः
उपासङ्ग उपासङ्ग, i. e. उप-आ-सञ्ज् + अ, m. A quiver, MBh. 2, 1916.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपासन|उपासनं
उपासन उपासन, i. e. उप-आस् + अन.<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Attendance, Man. 3, 107.<BR> 2. Practice, Mṛcch. 2, 11.<BR> 3. Religious contemplation, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 12, cf. 18, 3.<BR> 4. The sacred fire, Yājñ. 3, 45.<BR> II. f. ना, Service, Cāt. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपासितृ
उपासितृ उपासितृ, i. e. उप-आस् + तृ, m. A worshipper, Rām. 5, 32, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपास्ति|उपास्तिः
उपास्ति उपास्ति, i. e. उप-आस् + ति, f. Service, Lass. 56, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षक
उपेक्षक उपेक्षक, i. e. उप-ईक्ष् + अक, adj. Indifferent, Man. 6, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षण|उपेक्षणं
उपेक्षण उपेक्षण, i. e. उप-ईक्ष् + अन, n. Indulgence, tolerance, Hit. ii. d. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षा
उपेक्षा उपेक्षा, i. e. उप-ईक्ष् + अ, f.<BR> 1. Indifference, MBh. 14, 1049.<BR> 2. Neglect, Rām. 4, 12, 35.<BR> 3. Want of attention, Bhāṣāp. 159.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेतृ
उपेतृ उपेतृ, i. e. उप-इ + तृ, m. One who must use expedients, Man. 7, 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेन्द्र|उपेंद्र|उपेंद्रः|उपेन्द्रः
उपेन्द्र उपेन्द्र, i. e. उप-इन्द्र, m. A name of Viṣṇu, Rām. 1, 1, 6; Vedāntas. in Chr. 209, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोद्घात|उपोद्घातः
उपोद्घात उपोद्घात, i. e. उप-उद्-हन्, Caus., + अ, m. An introduction, Kathās. 3, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उप्ति|उप्तिः
उप्ति उप्ति, i. e. वप् + ति, f. Sowing, Man. 9, 330.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उब्ज्
उब्ज् उब्ज्, i. 6, Par. (originally a denom. derived from उब्ज, i. e. उभ् = ὑϕ in ὑϕός and ज from जन्). To incurvate, to restrain.<BR> --With the prep. निस् निस्, To let loose, to set free, Chr. 292, 9 = Rigv. i. 85, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभ्
उभ् उभ्, and उम्भ् उम्भ्, i. 6, Par. To fill (ved.), ii. 9, Par. To compress (properly ‘to incurvate’ = ὑϕ, see the last, an old form of *कुभ्, कुम्भ्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभ
उभ उभ (for original अम्भ = ἅμϕω; Lat. ambo; Goth. bai), numeral, m. f. n. dual. Both, Man. 2, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभय|उभयं|उभयः
उभय उभ + य, numeral, m. f. n. without dual. Both, Man. 2, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभयतस्
उभयतस् उभय + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. On [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a " target="_blank">Page0131-a + 39</a>] both sides, Man. 8, 315.<BR> 2. In the one and the other case, Man. 1, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0130-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभयत्र
उभयत्र उभय + त्र, adv. In both instances, Man. 3, 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभयथा
उभयथा उभय + था, adv. In both cases, Prab. 77, 3; Vikr. 43, 17 (on both reasons).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उमा
उमा उमा, f. Pārvatī, or Durgā, the wife of Śiva, Rām. 1, 36, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उम्भ्|उंभ्
उम्भ् उम्भ्, see उभ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरग|उरगः
उरग उरग, i. e. उरस्-ग (vb. गम्).<BR> I. m. A snake, Kir. 3, 33.<BR> II. f. गी, A female snake, Prab. 77, 7.<BR> III. f. गा, The name of a city.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृष्णोरग
कृष्ण- + उरग कृष्ण- + उरग, m. a black kind of snake, Draup. 5, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोरग|महोरगं|महोरगः
महा- + उरग महा- + उरग, m. a sort of demi-god of the serpent genus, inhabiting Pātāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हृतोरग
हृत- + उरग हृत- + उरग, adj. robbed of (its) snakes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरण|उरणः
उरण उरण, i. e. वृ + अन (cf. ऊर्ण), m. A lamb, MBh. 12, 6535.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरभ्र|उरभ्रः
उरभ्र उरभ्र, i. e. वृ + अ (akin to ऊर्णा) -भृ + अ, m. A ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरश्छद|उरश्छदः
उरश्छद उरश्छद, i. e. उरस्-छद् + अ, m. Mail.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काञ्चनोरश्छद
काञ्चन- + उरश्छद काञ्चन- + उरश्छद, adj. having a mail of gold, Rām. 3, 67, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरस्
उरस् उरस्, probably for वरस्, i. e. वृ + अस्, and akin to उरु, n. The breast, Daśak. in Chr. 184, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरस्क
ऽउरस्क -उरस् + क, a substitute for उरस्, when latter part of comp. adj., e. g. महा- and विपुल-, adj. Having a broad chest, Rām. 3, 36, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरसिज|उरसिजः
उरसिज उरस् + इ-ज (vb. जन्), m. The female breast, Rām. 1, 9, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरी
उरीऽ उरी-, see कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरु|उरुः
उरु उरु, i. e. वृ + उ, adj.,<BR> I. f. उर्वी, Large, MBh. 1, 1222. Comparat. वरीयंस्, superl. वरिष्ठ, MBh. 14, 879. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b " target="_blank">Page0131-b + 40</a>]<BR> II. f. उर्वी, the earth, Rām. 4, 44, 130.<BR> --Cf. εὐρύς, Ῥείη.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरोज|उरोजः
उरोज उरोज, i. e. उरस्-ज (see उरसिज), m. The female breast, Śiś. 9, 44; 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्द्
† उर्द् उर्द्, or ऊर्द् ऊर्द्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To measure.<BR> 2. To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्व्
† उर्व् उर्व्, i. 1, Par. To kill or hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वशी|उर्व्वशी
उर्वशी उर्वशी, f. The name of an Apsaras, Vikr. d. 110, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्विया
उर्विया उर्विया, adv. (probably for ऊर्व्या, instr. sing. fem. of उरु), Far and wide, Chr. 294, 9 = Rigv. i. 92, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वीभृत्
उर्वीभृत् उर्वी-भृ + त् (see उरु), m. A mountain, Amar. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलण्ड्
उलण्ड् उलण्ड्, see लण्ड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूक|उलूकं|उलूकः
उलूक उलूक, m.<BR> 1. An owl, Bhartṛ. 2, 89.<BR> 2. A name of Indra, Chr. 46, 26.<BR> 3. The name of a country, its people (plur.), and its king, MBh. 1, 335, etc.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. ulula; A.S. and O.H.G. ûla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भोलूक|कुम्भोलूकः
कुम्भ- + उलूक कुम्भ- + उलूक, m. A kind of owl, MBh. 13, 5499.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखल|उलूखलं|उलूखलः
उलूखल उलूखल (cf. उदूखल), n. A mortar, Pañc. 249, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलिक
ऽउलूखलिक -उलूखलिक, i. e. उलूखल + इक, adj. A substitute for the last, when latter part of comp. adj., e. g. दन्त-, adj. One who uses his teeth as a mortar or pestle, Man. 6, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलिन्
ऽउलूखलिन् -उलूखलिन्, i. e. उलूखल + इन्, in दन्त-, adj. Using his teeth as a mortar or pestle, Rām. 1, 52, 26 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्का
उल्का उल्का, i. e. probably ज्वल् + क, f.<BR> 1. A firebrand, Rām. 3, 75, 51.<BR> 2. Fire falling from heaven, a meteor, Man. 1, 38.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. Vulcanus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणोल्का
तृण- + उल्का तृण- + उल्का, f. a burning bunch of grass, Hit. i. d. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोल्का
महा- + उल्का महा- + उल्का, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a " target="_blank">Page0132-a + 40</a>] f. a great fireball, Man. 4, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0131-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्मुक|उल्मुकं|उल्मुकः
उल्मुक उल्मुक, i. e. perhaps ज्वल् + मन् + क, cf. उल्का,<BR> I. n. A firebrand, Pañc. 38, 20.<BR> II. m. A proper name, MBh. 2, 1275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लङ्घन|उल्लंघन|उल्लंघनं|उल्लङ्घनं
उल्लङ्घन उल्लङ्घन, i. e. उद्-लङ्घ् + अन, n. Transgress, Kathās. 22, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लाप|उल्लापः
उल्लाप उल्लाप, i. e. उद्-लप् + अ, m. Violent cry, Bhartṛ. 3, 6 (perhaps, with the former part खल-, a comp. of the Bahuvr. class, denoting a tyrant, cf. Galanos' translation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापिक|उल्लापिकः
उल्लापिक उल्लापिक, i. e. उल्लाप + इक (?), adj. Betraying(?), Chr. 57, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापिन्
उल्लापिन् उल्लापिन्, i. e. उद्-लप् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Calling out, Amar. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लास|उल्लासः
उल्लास उल्लास, i. e. उद्-लस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Skipping, Amar. 48.<BR> 2. Joy, Sāh. D. 73, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिदुल्लास|चिदुल्लासः
चिदुल्लास चिदुल्लास, i. e. चित्-, adj. rejoicing the mind, Bhāg. P. 9, 11, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासन
उल्लासन उल्लासन, i. e. उद्-लस् + अन, n. Delighting, making happy, Rājat. 5, 243 (हस्ताग्रवेष्टनोल्लासनस्पृशः खड्गस्य, Of the sword which seemed to rejoice at being grasped by his hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुञ्चन|उल्लुंचन|उल्लुंचनं
उल्लुञ्चन उल्लुञ्चन, i. e. उद्-लुञ्च् + अन, n. Pulling, Yājñ. 2, 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लेख|उल्लेखः
उल्लेख उल्लेख, i. e. उद्-लिख् + अ, m. Description, Kathās. 25, 225.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लेखन|उल्लेखनं
उल्लेखन उल्लेखन, i. e. उद्-लिख् + अन, n. Scraping, Man. 5, 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्व|उल्वं
उल्व उल्व, n.<BR> 1. Amnium, the caul, Ait. Br. 1, 3.<BR> 2. The womb, Bhag. 3, 38.<BR> --Cf. Lat. vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्वण|उल्वणं
उल्वण उल्वण (probably akin to उरु, of which the original form has been उर्वन्, cf. εὐρυν-ω for εὐρυνϳω), adj., f. णा.<BR> 1. Abundant, MBh. 3, 340.<BR> 2. Evident, Rājat. 5, 148 (incarnate). [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b " target="_blank">Page0132-b + 41</a>]<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्युल्वण
अति- + उल्वण अति- + उल्वण, adj. very violent, Rām. 3, 30, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशनस्
उशनस् उशनस्, m., nom. sing. उशना, The name of a Ṛṣi or saint, Rām. 6, 31, 14; identified with Śukra, regent of the planet Venus, MBh. 1, 3204.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीनर|उशीनरः
उशीनर उशीनर, m. The name of a country, its people (pl.), and its king, MBh. 1, 227.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीर|उशीरं|उशीरः
उशीर उशीर, m. and n. The root of a fragrant grass, Andropogon muricatum, Rām. 2, 55, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्
उष् उष्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To burn; to burn up, Man. 4, 189.<BR> 2. To chastise, Man. 9, 273.<BR> --Cf. αὕω, εὕω, εὔσανα, εὕστρα; Lat. uro prurire; O.H.G. usilvar, yellow, probably Lat. aurum.<BR> --Cf. 2. वस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषती
उषती उषती (ptcple. of an aor. of उष्?), f. Inauspicious, MBh. 1, 3558.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषर्बुध्
उषर्बुध् उषर्बुध्, i. e. उषस्-बुध्, adj. Early awake, Chr. 295, 18 = Rigv. i. 92, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषस्
उषस् उषस्, i. e. 2. वस् + अस्, f. The dawn, morning, Kir. 5, 40; ved. nom. pl. उषासस्, Chr. 294, 2 = Rigv. i. 92, 2. The deity of the dawn, Chr. 287, sqq.<BR> --Cf. aeol. αὔως (= the original nom. sing. वसास्), ἠώς; Lat. aurora.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्र|उष्ट्रः
उष्ट्र उष्ट्र,<BR> I. m. A camel, Man. 3, 162.<BR> II. f. उष्ट्री, A she-camel, Pañc. 87, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरोष्ट्र
खर- + उष्ट्र खर- + उष्ट्र, n. an ass and a camel, Yājñ. 2, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रिका
उष्ट्रिका उष्ट्रिका, i. e. उष्ट्री + क, f. A she-camel, Pañc. 228, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ण|उष्णः
उष्ण उष्ण, i. e. उष् + न,<BR> I. adj., f. णा, Hot, Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 17.<BR> II. m. and n. The hot season, Man. 11, 113.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्युष्ण
अति- + उष्ण अति- + उष्ण, adj. exceedingly hot, Man. 3, 236.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ण|अनुष्णं|अनुष्णः
अन्- + उष्ण अन्- + उष्ण, adj. not hot, Man. 2, 61; chilly, Śiś. 9, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णग|उष्णगः
उष्णग उष्ण-ग (vb. गम्), m. The hot season, Rām. 5, 31, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णता
उष्णता उष्ण + ता, f., and उष्णत्व उष्ण + त्व, n. Heat, MBh. 3, 15101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णालु
उष्णालु उष्णालु, i. e. उष्ण + आलु, adj. Hot, Vikr. d. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णिमन्
उष्णिमन् उष्णिमन्, i. e. उष्ण + इमन्, m. Heat, Śiś. 9, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णीष|उष्णीषं|उष्णीषः
उष्णीष उष्णीष, m. and n. A diadem, a turban, Chr. 25, 56; Rājat. 5, 206.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णीषिन्
उष्णीषिन् उष्णीषिन्, i. e. उष्णीष + इन्, m. A name of Śiva, MBh. 13, 1158.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कञ्चुकोष्णीषिन्
कञ्चुकोष्णीषिन् कञ्चुकोष्णीषिन्, i. e. कञ्चुक-उष्णीष + इन्, the affix belonging to both parts of the compound, wearing jackets and turbans, Rām. 6, 99, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्मन्
उष्मन् उष् + मन्, m.<BR> 1. Heat, MBh. 9, 13969.<BR> 2. Ardour, Pañc. ii. d. 67; Śiś. 9, 85.<BR> 3. Hot moisture, Man. 1, 45.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनोष्मन्
धन- + उष्मन् धन- + उष्मन्, m. ardent longing for wealth, Man. 9, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निधानोष्मन्
निधान- + उष्मन् निधान- + उष्मन्, m. ardour, courage, caused by the possession of a treasure, Pañc. 118, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुष्मन्
निस्- + उष्मन् निस्- + उष्मन्, adj. cold, MBh. 14, 476.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उसर्
उसर् उसर्, i. e. 2. वस् + अर् (र् for न्, and originally for वसन्त्, identic with उषस् for वसन्त्), f. Dawn, morning; acc. pl. उस्रस्, Lass. 100, 15 = Rigv. vii. 15, 8.<BR> --Cf. ἦρι = loc. वस्रि, ἄριστον, breakfast, αὔριον.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्र|उस्रः
उस्र उस्र, i. e. 2. वस् + र,<BR> I. m. A ray of light, Kir. 5, 31.<BR> II. f. रा, A cow, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 87, 1; Chr. 294, 4 = Rigv. i. 92, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रिया
उस्रिया उस्रिया, i. e. उस्र + इय, f. A cow, Chr. 297, 12 = Rigv. i. 112, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उह्
† उह् उह्, i. 1, Par. To hurt or to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊ
ऊ ऊ, see उ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊठ्
† ऊठ् ऊठ्, see उठ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढि|ऊढिः
ऊढि ऊढि, i. e. वह् + ति, f. Bringing, Rājat. 5, 173.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊति|ऊतिः
ऊति ऊति, f. i. e.<BR> I. अव् + ति,<BR> 1. Assistance, Chr. 288, 14 = Rigv. i. 48, 14; help, Lass. 98, 16 = Rigv. v. 9, 6; ऊती, ved. instr. sing, Chr. 291, 13 = Rigv. i. 64, 13.<BR> 2. Quickness, Bhāg. P. 8, 5, 44.<BR> II. वे + ति, Web, tissue, Bhāg. P. 2, 10, 1; 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधन्
ऊधन् ऊधन्, and, with र् for न्, ऊधर् ऊधर्, and ऊधस् ऊधस्, based on original *वद्-धन्त् (cf. उदन्, vb. धा, and पयोधस्), n. An udder.<BR> --Cf. οὖθαρ, uber; O.H.G. ûtar; A.S. uder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्य|ऊधस्यं
ऊधस्य ऊधस् + य, n. Milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्वन्त्
ऊधस्वन्त् ऊधस् + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Having exuberant udders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन्
ऊन् ऊन्, i. 10, Par. (properly a denom. of the following), To detract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन|ऊनं
ऊन ऊन (probably for वन् + न from वन् = Goth. van, vans: cf. O.H.G. wênag, few, perhaps εὖνις, etc.), adj., f. ना.<BR> 1. Lessened, Yājñ. 2, 295.<BR> 2. Inferior, Man. 9, 123.<BR> 3. Wanting, usually as former or latter part of a comp., e. g. अल्प-, adj. Wanting, a little, Man. 8, 217.<BR> किंचिद्-, adj. A little less, Sāv. 4, 26.<BR> त्रि-भाग-, adj. Reduced by a third, Rājat. 5, 170.<BR> दशोन, i. e. दशन्-, adj. Wanting ten, Rām. 1, 46, 12. If one only is wanting, एक may be added, e. g. एकोनचत्वारिंश, i. e. एक-ऊन-, ord. The thirty-ninth, MBh. 1, adhy. 39, but usually it is dropped, e. g. ऊन-विंश, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a " target="_blank">Page0134-a + 43</a>] ord. The nineteenth, MBh. 3, adhy. 19. As former part, e. g. ऊन-द्वि-वार्षिक (i. e. -द्वि-वर्ष + इक), adj. A child under two years, Man. 5, 68; ऊन-षोडशवर्ष (i. e. -षष्-दशन्-वर्ष), adj. Under sixteen years, Rām. 1, 22, 2.<BR> --Cf. probably Lat. un-, or unde-, e. g. in unde-viginti = ऊन-विंशति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0133-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊय्
† ऊय् ऊय्, i. 1, Ātm. (properly वे, i. 4, Ātm.). To sew, to weave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरी
ऊरी ऊरी, see कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरु|ऊरुः
ऊरु ऊरु, perhaps akin to उरु, m. The thigh, Rām. 3, 52, 32. When the latter part of a comp. adj., the fem. ends in रु, or रू, e. g. वामोरु, i. e. वाम-, f. रू, Having beautiful thighs, MBh. 1, 1903; but रु (against the grammatical rule), MBh. 1, 2988.<BR> करभोपमोरु, i. e. करभ-उपम-ऊरु, f. रू, and करभोरु, i. e. करभ- f. रू, Having thighs like the proboscis of an elephant, Ragh. 6, 83; Śāk. d. 69.<BR> रम्भ-, f. रू, Having bambu-like thighs, Mālav. d. 45.<BR> वर-, f. रु, Having beautiful thighs, Rām. 3, 52, 53.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूरु|अनूरुः
अन्- + ऊरु अन्- + ऊरु,<BR> I. adj. thighless.<BR> II. m. Aruṇa, the charioteer of the sun, Skandap., Kāśīkh. 2, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुज|ऊरुजः
ऊरुज ऊरु-ज, adj. Born from the thigh, MBh. 1, 6820.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज्
ऊर्ज् ऊर्ज्, i. 10, Par. (properly a denomin. derived from the next).<BR> 1. To nourish, to strengthen.<BR> 2. † To live.<BR> उर्जित,<BR> 1. Swollen, Rājat. 5, 214.<BR> 2. Strong, Hariv. 9920.<BR> 3. Distinguished, Ragh. 9, 38.<BR> 4. Violent, Rām. 2, 85, 2.<BR> --Cf. ὀργάω, ὀργάς, perhaps Lat. urgere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज्
ऊर्ज् ऊर्ज्, f. Strength, food, Chr. 295, 17 = Rigv. i. 92, 17; Bhāg. P. 4, 24, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज|ऊर्जः|ऊर्ज्ज|ऊर्ज्जं|ऊर्ज्जः
ऊर्ज ऊर्ज् + अ, m. Strength, Man. 2, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्कर
ऊर्जस्कर ऊर्जस्कर, i. e. ऊर्ज् + अस्-कृ + अ, adj. Causing strength, MBh. 3, 14181.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्वल|ऊर्ज्जस्वलः
ऊर्जस्वल ऊर्जस् + वल, adj., and ऊर्जस्विन् ऊर्जस् + विन्, adj., f. नी, Strong, Ragh. 2, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जावन्त्|ऊर्जावत्
ऊर्जावन्त् ऊर्ज् + आ + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Abundant with food, MBh. 13, 1842.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ण|ऊर्णं|ऊर्ण्ण
ऊर्ण ऊर्ण, i. e. वृ + न, n., and f. णा, Wool, MBh. 2, 1847.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Goth. vulla; A.S. wull; Lat. vellus; οὖλος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णोर्ण|कर्णोर्णः|कर्ण्णोर्ण्ण
कर्णोर्ण कर्णोर्ण, i. e. कर्ण-, adj. having wool near the ears, Bhāg. P. 4, 6, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्रोर्ण|पत्रोर्णं|पत्रोर्णः
पत्रोर्ण पत्रोर्ण, i. e. पत्र-, n. 1. Wove silk. 2. A garment of wove silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णमय
ऊर्णमय ऊर्ण + मय, adj., f. यी, Woollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णु|ऊर्ण्णु
ऊर्णु ऊर्णु, ii. 2, Par., Ātm. (properly vb. वृ, ii. 5). To cover; Ātm. To hide one's self, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 27.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप, To discover, Chr. 294, 4 = Rigv. i. 92, 4.<BR> --With वि वि, To discover, Chr. 295, 11 = Rigv. i. 92, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्द्
ऊर्द् ऊर्द्, see उर्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ध्व|ऊर्द्ध्वः
ऊर्ध्व ऊर्ध्व, i. e. ऋध् + व, adj., f. वा.<BR> 1. Erect, Hiḍ. 3, 2.<BR> 2. Raised (as dust), Man. 11, 110.<BR> 3. Upper, MBh. 1, 1034.<BR> 4. The name of a kind of flying, Pañc. ii. d. 57.<BR> वम्, adv.<BR> 1. Upwards, Rām. 4, 8, 5.<BR> 2. Above, Man. 1, 92.<BR> 3. After, Rām. 3, 53, 4; after death, Man. 9, 104.<BR> --Cf. ὀρθός; Lat. arduus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ध्वग|ऊर्ध्वगः
ऊर्ध्वग ऊर्ध्व-ग (vb. गम्), adj., f. गा.<BR> 1. Going upwards, MBh. 3, 850.<BR> 2. Being in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ध्वपुण्ड्रक|ऊर्ध्वपुण्ड्रकः
ऊर्ध्वपुण्ड्रक ऊर्ध्व-पुण्ड्र + क, m. A perpendicular line on the forehead [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a " target="_blank">Page0135-a + 38</a>] made with sandal, etc.; a sectarial mark, Lass. 70, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0134-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्मि|ऊर्मिः|ऊर्म्मि|ऊर्म्मिः
ऊर्मि ऊर्मि, probably क्वृ + मि, m. and f. A wave, Bhartṛ. 2, 4.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोर्मि|क्षीरोर्मिः
क्षीर- + ऊर्मि क्षीर- + ऊर्मि, a wave of the sea of milk, Ragh. 4, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्मिन्|ऊर्म्मिन्
ऊर्मिन् ऊर्मिन्, i. e. ऊर्मि + इन्, adj., f. णी, Wavy (ved.).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महोर्मिन्
महा- + ऊर्मिन् महा- + ऊर्मिन्, adj. having great waves, MBh. 3, 793.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्मिमन्त्|ऊर्मिमत्|ऊर्म्मिमत्
ऊर्मिमन्त् ऊर्मि + मन्त्, adj., f. मती, adj. Surgy, Rām. 4, 9, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्व|ऊर्वः
ऊर्व ऊर्व, m. The name of a saint from whose thighs (ऊरु) proceeded the submarine fire, Hariv. 2527 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्
† ऊष् ऊष्, ii. 1, Par. To be diseased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष|ऊषं|ऊषः
ऊष ऊष,<BR> I. m. Saline earth, Man. 5, 120.<BR> II. f. षी, Salt ground, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषण|ऊषणं|ऊषणः
ऊषण ऊषण, i. e. ऊष् (= उष्) + अन, n. Pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषर|ऊषरः
ऊषर ऊष + र, adj., f. रा, Impregnated with saline particles, MBh. 13, 3341.<BR> 2. Salt ground, barren land, Man. 2, 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मन्
ऊष्मन् ऊष्मन् (= उष्मन्).<BR> 1. Heat, MBh. 14, 468.<BR> 2. A name comprising the sibilants and ह्, Bhāg. P. 3, 12, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मप|ऊष्मपः
ऊष्मप ऊष्मप, i. e. ऊष्मन्-प (vb. 1. पा).<BR> I. adj. Drinking the steam of food only, MBh. 13, 646.<BR> II. m. pl. The name of a class of Pitṛs or Manes, MBh. 2, 341.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह्
1. ऊह् ऊह्, i. 1, Ātm., with prepositions also Par. To apprehend, MBh. 1, 5228.<BR> --Caus. To observe, MBh. 2, 1240.<BR> --With the prep. अपि अपि, To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-b " target="_blank">Page0135-b + 39</a>] understand, Hit. iii. d. 33.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To infer, Kathās. 7, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह्
2. ऊह् ऊह् (derived from वह्, and appearing only after prep.), i. 1, Par. and Ātm. ऊह्यमाना, Rājat. 5, 33, is to be corrected to उह्य्˚, pass. of वह्, Being carried.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप.<BR> 1. To remove, Man. 8, 414; 11, 102 (Ātm.); अपोहित, Prab. 116, 7.<BR> 2. To press, to follow immediately, Ragh. 19, 5.<BR> 3. To avoid, Man. 10, 86 (Ātm.).<BR> --With the prep. व्यप वि-अप.<BR> 1. To remove, Man. 2, 102.<BR> 2. To expiate, Man. 11, 81.<BR> 3. To keep off, Rām. 6, 75, 57 (Ātm.).<BR> --With उद् उद्. To raise, Bhāg. P. 4, 8, 15.<BR> --With उप उप, To bring near, Rām. 2, 52, 6.<BR> --Pass. To begin, MBh. 2, 2051.<BR> उपोढ, Produced, Śāk. d. 169.<BR> --With समुप सम्-उप in समुपोढ,<BR> 1. Near, Man. 6, 41.<BR> 2. Commenced, Rām. 2, 75, 29.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, प्रत्यूढ.<BR> 1. Denied, Rām. 5, 31, 14.<BR> 2. Exceeded, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 38.<BR> 3. Interrupted, Man. 5, 84.<BR> --With वि वि, To arrange an army, Man. 7, 191.<BR> व्यूढ, Large, Rām. 6, 36, 45.<BR> --With निर्वि निस्-वि, निर्व्यूढ<BR> 1. Brought out, MBh. 1, 6257.<BR> 2. Achieved, Kathās. 17, 159.<BR> --With प्रतिवि प्रति-वि, To arrange an army against, MBh. 3, 16370, प्रत्य्-अव्यूहत्, instead of प्रतिव्य्-औहत्; प्रतिव्यूढ, Large, Rām. 6, 35, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह|ऊहः
ऊह ऊह् + अ, m. Connected reasoning, MBh. 13, 6725.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूह
अन्-ऊह अन्-ऊह, adj. without (long) reflection, quick, Bhāg. P. 3, 5, 48; 18, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरूह|दुरूहः
दुरूह दुरूह, i. e. दुस्-, adj. difficult to be inferred, Man. 11, 238. v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0135-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋ
ऋ ऋ, i. 1, ऋच्छ (in epic poetry also अर्च्छ = ἔρχομαι), ii. 3; 5; 9 Par.<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To go to.<BR> 3. To undergo. With abstracts (cf. इ): Man. 1, 53, ग्लानिम् ऋच्छति, To become inert; MBh. 3, 2166, मृत्युम्, To die; अर्छ्, Nal. 7, 4; MBh. 3, 84; Nalod. 2, 10, युद्धरङ्गताम् आर, To become the field of battle.<BR> 4. To rise, ऋ-णु.<BR> 5. To meet, Man. 8, 351; to attain, Nalod. 1, 32; to fall on, Man. 8, 18, ऋच्छ.<BR> 6. To gain, to acquire.<BR> 7. To move, to raise, ved. ii. 3, इयर्मि.<BR> 8. To open, ii. 5.<BR> 9. To attack, MBh. 4, 1059, ऋच्छ.<BR> 10. To hurt; ऋत, and ऋते, see separately.<BR> --Caus. अर्पय,<BR> 1. To cast; अर्पित, thrown, Ragh. 8, 87; turned, Bhag. 8, 7.<BR> 2. To fasten, Śāk. d. 133.<BR> 3. To pierce.<BR> 4. To put, Ragh. 9, 74.<BR> 5. To deliver, Yājñ. 2, 65; Daśak. in Chr. 183, 24; 201, 11.<BR> 6. To restore, Man. 8, 191.<BR> --अर्पित.<BR> 1. Cut in, Śāk. d. 74.<BR> 2. Written, Ragh. 17, 79.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prepos. अभि अभि, To attack, MBh. 3, 11726, ऋच्छ, 11875 अर्च्छ.<BR> --With आ आ.<BR> 1. To meet, MBh. 3, 17226.<BR> 2. To adapt (ved.).<BR> --With प्र प्र, To rise, Chr. 288, 3 = Rigv. i. 49, 3.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, Caus.<BR> 1. To fasten, Ragh. 6, 28.<BR> 2. To deliver, Ragh. 15, 41.<BR> 3. To restore, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 15; 189, 15; 192, 16.<BR> --With वि वि, To open, Chr. 288, 15 = Rigv. i. 48, 15.<BR> --With सम् सम्, Caus.<BR> 1. To cast, MBh. 1, 6978.<BR> 2. To deliver, Pañc. 36, 13.<BR> 3. To restore, Hit. 72, 20.<BR> --समर्पित.<BR> 1. Fastened, Kumāras. 6, 63.<BR> 2. Put together, Daśak. in Chr. 200, 2.<BR> 3. Resting, Rām. 1, 77, 25.<BR> 4. Painted, Ragh. 3, 15.<BR> --Cf. ἔρχομαι, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b " target="_blank">Page0136-b + 41</a>] ὄρνυμι, ἄρνυμαι, ἄρος, μισθαρνέω, ἰάλλω, ὄλλυμι (Lat. abolere), ἄρω, ἀρτίζω; Lat. orior, adorior, adolesco, adultus; Goth. alds; A.S. ald; O.H.G. arnên.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रार्पित
चित्र- + अर्पित चित्र- + ऋ, adj. painted, Śāk. d. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्वन्
ऋक्वन् ऋक्वन्, i. e. ऋच् + वन्.<BR> I. adj. Praising.<BR> II. m. A praiser, Chr. 293, 5 = Rigv. i. 87, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ष्
† ऋक्ष् ऋक्ष् (?), ii. 5, Par. To kill or hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं|ऋक्षः
ऋक्ष ऋक्ष,<BR> I. m. A bear, Rām. 3, 52, 45.<BR> II. f. क्षी, A she-bear, Rām. 1, 16, 21.<BR> III. m. and n.<BR> 1. A star, Rām. 5, 73, 57; MBh. 13, 625.<BR> 2. Bears and stars, Śiś. 9, 31.<BR> IV. m. and f. क्षा, Proper names, MBh. 1, 3722; 3790.<BR> --Cf. ἄρκτος; Lat. ursus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षवन्त्|ऋक्षवत्
ऋक्षवन्त् ऋक्ष + वन्त्, m. The name of a mountain, Rām. 6, 3, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
ऋच् ऋच्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To shine, ved.<BR> 2. i. 1, and † i. 6, Par. To praise, ved.<BR> 3. To honour, Man. 3, 93; anomal. absol. अर्च्य, Man. 1, 4.<BR> --Caus. अर्चय, To honour, Man. 2, 181.<BR> अर्चित, Respectfully bestowed, Man. 4, 235.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To honour, Man. 8, 391.<BR> --With समभि सम्-अभि, To honour, Yājñ. i. 226; to adore, 2, 112.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति,<BR> 1. To salute in turn, Rām. 2, 71, 31.<BR> 2. To salute one by one, MBh. 1, 7211.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To adore, Rām. 2, 3, 48; to honour, MBh. 3, 11090 (properly 10190).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
ऋच् ऋच्, f.<BR> 1. A verse or text of the Vedas, Man. 11, 142.<BR> 2. The Ṛgveda, Man. 1, 23.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृच्
अन्- + ऋच् अन्- + ऋच्, adj. unlearned in holy texts, Man. 3, 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यृच्
त्र्य्-ऋच् त्र्य्-ऋच्, i. e. त्रि-, f. pl. three holy verses, Man. 2, 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच
ऽऋच -ऋच् + अ. A substitute for ऋच् when being the latter part of a comp., e. g. अन्-, adj. Unlearned in [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a " target="_blank">Page0137-a + 41</a>] holy texts, Man. 2, 158.<BR> त्र्यृच, i. e. त्रि-, n. A strophe consisting of three verses, Man. 11, 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीक|ऋचीकः
ऋचीक ऋचीक, m.<BR> 1. The name of a saint, Rām. 1, 35, 7.<BR> 2. The name of a country, Daśak. 193, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋछ्|ऋच्छ्
ऋछ् ऋछ् (properly the base of the pres. etc. of ऋ, q. cf.), i. 6, Par.; ep. also Ātm. (MBh. 4, 1056),<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To attack, MBh. 3, 16375, आनर्छ, pf.<BR> 3. † To fail in faculties.<BR> 4. † To become stiff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्
ऋज् ऋज् (for primitive रज्), i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. † To go.<BR> 2. † To stand or to be firm.<BR> 3. † To gain.<BR> 4. † To be strong.<BR> 5. To live.<BR> --Ved. i. 4, Par., and Ātm.<BR> 1. To stretch.<BR> 2. To desire, to strive for.<BR> --Cf. रज् under ऋजु, ὀρέγω, ὀρέγνυμι, ὀριγνάομαι; Lat. regere, rectus; Goth. rakjan; A.S. reccan; Goth. raihts, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीष|ऋजीषं
ऋजीष ऋजीष (vb. ऋञ्ज्), n. The name of a hell, Man. 4, 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीषिन्
ऋजीषिन् ऋजीषिन् (vb. ऋज्), adj. Quick, Chr. 291, 12 = Rigv. i. 64, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजु
ऋजु ऋज्-उ, adj.<BR> 1. Straight, Man. 2, 47.<BR> 2. Right, Rām. 4, 34, 31.<BR> --Comparat. ऋजीयंस्, and ved. also रजीयंस्; superl. ऋजिष्ठ, and ved. also रजिष्ठ.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ὄργυια, f. of ὀργυ, properly the measure of a tall upright man, i. e. six feet in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृजु|अनृजुः
अन्- + ऋजु अन्- + ऋजु, adj. crooked, Man. 4, 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुता
ऋजुता ऋजु + ता, f.<BR> 1. Straightness, Kumāras. 4, 23.<BR> 2. Plainness, Amar. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋञ्ज्|ऋंज्
† ऋञ्ज् ऋञ्ज्, i. 1, Ātm. To fry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋण्
† ऋण् ऋण्, ii. 8, Par., Ātm. (properly the base of the pres. etc. of ऋ, ii. 5), To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋण|ऋणं
ऋण ऋण, n. Obligation, Man. 6, 35; a debt, Man. 9, 218.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृण
अन्- + ऋण अन्- + ऋण, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b " target="_blank">Page0137-b + 41</a>] adj. free from obligation or debt, Man. 9, 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणयावन्
ऋणयावन् ऋण-या + वन्, m. A pursuer of debts, Chr. 293, 4 = Rigv. i. 87, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणवन्त्|ऋणवत्
ऋणवन्त् ऋण + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Indebted, Hit. Pr. d. 20, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणिन्
ऋणिन् ऋणिन्, i. e. ऋण + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Obligated, MBh. 1, 8341.<BR> 2. m. A debtor, Yājñ. 2, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत्
ऋत् ऋत्, the base of the pres., impf., imptve., and potent., and optionally of all the other forms, is ऋतीय ऋतीय, Ātm. (properly a denomin. derived from ऋति).<BR> 1. † To blame.<BR> 2. To pity, Mālav. 55, 23.<BR> 3. † To rival.<BR> 4. To domineer.<BR> 5. † To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत|ऋतं|ऋतः
ऋत ऋ + त,<BR> I. adj., f. ता, True, Man. 8, 82.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Truth, Rām. 5, 31, 19.<BR> 2. Gleaning, Man. 4, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. ratus, irritus; ἄρτιος, ἀνάρτιος, ἀνάρσιος, ἀλιτέω, ἀλιταίνω, ἀλιτεύω, ἀλιτήμων.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृत|अनृतं
अन्- + ऋत अन्- + ऋत,<BR> I. adj. untrue, Rām. 3, 53, 18; unjust, Man. 4, 170.<BR> II. n. 1. untruth, Rām. 3, 53, 16; a lie, Chr. 48, 12. 2. agriculture, Man. 4, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपानृत
अपानृत अपानृत, i. e. अप-अन्-ऋत, adj. true, Rām. 2, 34, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यानृत|सत्यानृतं
सत्य-अन् + ऋत सत्य-अन् + ऋत,<BR> I. adj. true and false at the same time, Pañc. 98, 17.<BR> II. n. commerce, traffic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतंभर|ऋतम्भर|ऋतंभरः
ऋतंभर ऋतंभर, i. e. ऋत + म्-भृ + अ,<BR> I. m. A name of Brahman, Bhāg. P. 6, 13, 17.<BR> II. f. रा, Understanding, Prab. 68, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतवन्त्|ऋतवत्
ऋतवन्त् ऋत + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Possessing truth, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतस्तुभ्
ऋतस्तुभ् ऋत-स्तुभ्, adj. Praising truth, Chr. 297, 20 = Rigv. i. 112, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋति|ऋतिः
ऋति ऋ + ति, f.<BR> 1. Way, Lass. 2, 8.<BR> 2. Attack (ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतीषह्
ऋतीषह् ऋतीषह्, i. e. ऋति-सह्, adj. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a " target="_blank">Page0138-a + 43</a>] Braving an attack, Chr. 291, 15 = Rigv. i. 64, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतु|ऋतुः
ऋतु ऋ + तु, m.<BR> 1. Order (ved.).<BR> 2. Right time, Chr. 288, 3 = Rigv. i. 49, 3.<BR> 3. A season (of the year), Man. 3, 217.<BR> 4. The menstrual discharge, MBh. 14, 2739.<BR> 5. The season approved for sexual intercourse, Man. 3, 46, sqq.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ἀρτύνω for ἀρτυν-ϳω, ἀρτύς, ἀρτύω.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृतु|अनृतुः
अन्- + ऋतु अन्- + ऋतु, m. wrong season, Man. 4, 104; for sexual intercourse, 5, 153. The aff. तु is a form of त्वन् and ऋ of अर्; the older form would be * अर्त्वन् = Lat. ordo, base ordon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुमती
ऋतुमती ऋतुमती, i. e. ऋतु + मन्त् + ई, f.<BR> 1. A woman in her courses, Suśr. 1, 317, 4.<BR> 2. A marriageable girl, Man. 9, 89.<BR> 3. A woman in the period approved for sexual intercourse, MBh. 1, 750.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋते
ऋते ऋते (loc. sing. ntr. of the ptcple. pf. pass. of ऋ, To go; properly, In deficiency), prep. with abl. and acc.<BR> 1. Wanting, Yājñ. 2, 117.<BR> 2. Except, MBh. 3, 16144; 3090.<BR> 3. Without, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 4; 191, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत्विज्
ऋत्विज् ऋत्विज्, i. e. ऋतु-यज्, m. A priest, who receives a stipend for preparing the holy fire and conducting sacrifices, Man. 2, 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्धि|ऋद्धिः
ऋद्धि ऋद्धि, i. e. ऋध् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Plenty, Indr. 5, 26.<BR> 2. Wealth, Kumāras. 2, 58.<BR> 3. Prosperity, Rām. 2, 105, 33.<BR> 4. Perfection, Bhāg. P. 9, 21, 12.<BR> 5. The deity of wealth, MBh. 13, 6750.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्धिमन्त्|ऋद्धिमत्
ऋद्धिमन्त् ऋद्धि + मन्त्, adj., f. मती.<BR> 1. Wealthy, Rām. 5, 9, 63.<BR> 2. Prosperous, MBh. 3, 244.<BR> 3. Resplendent, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 3; beautiful, MBh. 3, 11077 (p. 572).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋध्
ऋध् ऋध्, i. 4, Par., ii. 5, Par. and ved. also i. 6 and ii. 7.<BR> 1. To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b " target="_blank">Page0138-b + 43</a>] prosper, Man. 9, 322 (ii. 5); MBh. 2, 1693 (i. 4); pass. To prosper, MBh. 3, 8488.<BR> 2. To augment (ved.).<BR> 3. † To please; ऋउअन, Prosperous, Ragh. 2, 50.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To prosper, Man. 9, 315 (ii. 5), MBh. 2, 1960 (i. 4); सम्-ऋद्ध.<BR> 1. Completed, Rām. 1, 44, 60.<BR> 2. Abundant, Rām. 2, 104, 26.<BR> 3. Abounding in (with instr. or abl.), Daśak. in Chr. 184, 14; Man. 3, 6.<BR> 4. Wealthy, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 15.<BR> --Cf. ἄλθω; also ἀλδαίνω, etc., and ὀρόδαμνος; but ऋध् being compounded, viz. ऋ-धा, and the Vedas having a vb. ऋद्, which may be considered also as derived from ऋ, the base ἀλδ or ὀροδ may be another derivation from ऋ; cf. also Lat. ordior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋफ्
† ऋफ् ऋफ्, and ऋम्फ् ऋम्फ्, i. 6, Par. To injure, to kill.<BR> --Cf. ऋफ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋभु|ऋभुः
ऋभु ऋभु, i. e. रभ् + उ, m. The name of certain deities, MBh. 3, 15459.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋम्फ्
ऋम्फ् ऋम्फ्, see ऋफ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्
ऋष् ऋष्, i. 6, Par., ved. also i. 1; Par.<BR> 1. † To go.<BR> 2. To flow, to rain, to drip (ved. i. 1).<BR> 3. To pierce (ved. i. 6).<BR> --Cf. Lat. rigare, rivus; Goth. rign; A.S. regen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषभ|ऋषभः
ऋषभ ऋषभ, i. e. ऋष् + अन्-भ (vb. भा), m.<BR> 1. A bull, Bhāg. P. 1, 14, 19.<BR> 2. Chief, Bhāg. P. 2, 4, 22; especially as latter part of compound words, ‘best, excellent,’ e. g. पार्थिवर्षभ, i. e. पार्थिव-, m. An excellent king, Chr. 55, 4.<BR> पुरुष-, m. An excellent man, Rām. 3, 49, 11.<BR> भरत-, m. A noble descendant of Bharata, Chr. 24, 48.<BR> सिंह-, m. A fierce lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषि|ऋषिः
ऋषि ऋष् + इ (for original ऋषन्, cf. अक्षि for अक्षन्, अस्थि for अस्थन्, etc., = ἄρσην, ἄῤῥην), m.<BR> 1. A bard or author of sacred hymns, Chr. 287, 1. 3; Man. 11, 243.<BR> 2. An old saint, MBh. 12, 12724; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a " target="_blank">Page0139-a + 38</a>] Hariv. 417, seq.<BR> 3. A pious person, especially an anchorite, Man. 4, 94.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवर्षि|देवर्षिः
देवर्षि देवर्षि, i. e. देव-ऋषि, m. a sage of the class of demi-gods, as Nārada, VP. 284; Rām. 1, 1, 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मर्षि|ब्रह्मर्षिः
ब्रह्मर्षि ब्रह्मर्षि, i. e. ब्रह्मन्- and विप्रर्षि, i. e. विप्र-, m. a sage of the class of Brāhmaṇas, as Vaśiṣṭha, VP. 284; Chr. 22, 20; 14, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजर्षि|राजर्षिः
राजर्षि राजर्षि, i. e. राजन्-, m. a prince who has adopted a life of devotion, as Viśvāmitra, VP. 284; Chr. 11, 16; Pañc. 76, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तर्षि
सप्तर्षि सप्तर्षि, see separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषित्व
ऋषित्व ऋषि-त्व, n. State of a ऋषि, MBh. 13, 2896.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्टि|ऋष्टिः
ऋष्टि ऋष्टि, i. e. ऋष् + ति, f.<BR> 1. A spear, Chr. 290, 4 = Rigv. i. 64, 4.<BR> 2. A sword, Arj. 10, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्टिमन्त्|ऋष्टिमत्
ऋष्टिमन्त् ऋष्टि + मन्त्, adj., f. मती, Bearing spears, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 88, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्य|ऋष्यः
ऋष्य ऋष्य, m. The painted or white-footed antelope, Bhāg. P. 3, 31, 36; in ऋष्यरूपिन्, i. e. -रूप + इन्, adj. Having the shape of an antelope. In the Veda it is written ऋश्य; cf. O.H.G. elah; ἄλκη.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यक|ऋष्यकः
ऋष्यक ऋष्य + क, adj. Of the colour of the painted antelope, Rām. 5, 12, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यमूक|ऋष्यमूकः
ऋष्यमूक ऋष्य-मूक, m. The name of a mountain, Rām. 1, 3, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्व|ऋष्वः
ऋष्व ऋष्व, adj. Lofty, Chr. 290, 2 = Rigv. i. 64, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॠ
† ॠ ॠ, ii. 5, To go (cf. ऋ and ईर्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एक|एकं|एकः
एक ए-क (ए, old loc. sing. of the [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b " target="_blank">Page0139-b + 43</a>] pronom. base अ, cf. इदम् and एतत्; क cf. किम्), num., m., f. का, and n.<BR> I. sing.<BR> 1. One (cf. एनद्), Man. 2, 43; एकस्मात्, At once, Rājat. 5, 407.<BR> 2. Alone, Man. 1, 3; Only, Hit. i. d. 81; पुण्यैक-कर्मन्, i. e. पुण्य-एक-कर्मन्, adj. Practising only virtue.<BR> 3. Same, Man. 8, 204; Pañc. iv. d. 10.<BR> 4. Preeminent, chief, Megh. 31.<BR> 5. When immediately repeated, ‘one by one.’ Rām. 2, 91, 51.<BR> 6. A, an, Pañc. 242, 6, पुरुषम् एकम्, ‘a man.’<BR> 7. Somebody, Kathās. 18, 330.<BR> II. plur. Some, Man. 9, 61.<BR> III. Former and latter part of compounds, e. g. एक-छर, adj. living alone, Man. 5, 17.<BR> अन्-, adj. many, Man. 5, 159; several, Yājñ. 2, 120; manifold, Yājñ. 3, 144.<BR> करपादैकहीनक, i. e. कर-पाद-एक-हीन + क, adj. one who has had a hand and foot cut off, Yājñ. 2, 274.<BR> तद्-एक, one of these, Hit. 25, 10.<BR> --Cf. Lat. aequus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकक|एककः
एकक एक + क, adj.<BR> 1. Solitary, Pañc. iii. d. 51.<BR> 2. Same, Man. 9, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचित्तता
एकचित्तता एक-छित्त + ता, f.<BR> 1. Fixing one's mind only on one object, Pañc. 244, 23.<BR> 2. Unanimity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकज|एकजः
एकज एक-ज (vb. जन्), adj. Solitary, Hiḍ. 1, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत|एकतः
एकत एक + त, m. The name of a deity, MBh. 12, 12772.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतम|एकतमः
एकतम एक + तम adj., f. मा n. मद्,<BR> 1. One of many, Pañc. 169, 15.<BR> 2. One of two, Pañc. 92, 5.<BR> 3. A, an, Rām. 5, 14, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतर|एकतरः
एकतर एक + तर, adj., f. रा, n. रम्, One of two, Rām. 6, 6, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतस्
एकतस् एक + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. = abl. of एक, Rājat. 5, 90.<BR> 2. On one side, Kir. 5, 2; एकतस्-एकतस्, on one side, on the other, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 523.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0139-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकता
एकता एक + ता, f.<BR> 1. Unity, Prab. 18, 9.<BR> 2. Harmony, Rām. 4, 33, 26.<BR> 3. Conjunction, MBh. 3, 14272.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतीर्थिन्
एकतीर्थिन् एकतीर्थिन्, i. e. एक-तीर्थ + इन्, adj. Dwelling in the same religious retreat, Yājñ. 2, 137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्र
एकत्र एक + त्र, adv.<BR> 1. = loc. of एक, Man. 5, 136.<BR> 2. At the same place, MBh. 3, 1446.<BR> 3. Together, Pañc. 25, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्व|एकत्वं
एकत्व एक + त्व, n. Unity, MBh. 14, 952.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदा
एकदा एक + दा, adv.<BR> 1. Once, Rājat. 5, 249.<BR> 2. Sometimes, Pañc. iii. d. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधा
एकधा एक + धा, adv. Once, MBh. 14, 1166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्निता
एकपत्निता एकपत्निता, i. e. एक-पत्नी + ता, f. Having one wife in common, MBh. 1, 7274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्नीत्व
एकपत्नीत्व एक-पत्नी + त्व, n. Faithfulness to a husband, Rām. 5, 49, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदी
एकपदी एक-पद् + ई, f. A path, Rām. 4, 31, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमय
एकमय एक + मय, adj., f. यी, Only consisting of, in चारण- (of mimes), Kathās. 23, 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरात्रिक
एकरात्रिक एकरात्रिक, i. e. एक-रात्र + इक, adj. Sufficing for one night (or day), Man. 4, 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरूपता
एकरूपता एक-रूप + ता, f. Equality, Pañc. ii. d. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकल|एकलः
एकल एक + ल, adj., f. ला, Solitary, alone, Bhāg. P. 5, 7, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्णिक
एकवर्णिक एकवर्णिक, i. e. एक-वर्ण + इक, adj. Incumbent on one caste only, MBh. 3, 11298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवस्त्रता
एकवस्त्रता एक-वस्त्र + ता, f. Having one garment only, Nal. 10, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशस्
एकशस् एक + शस्, adv. One by one, Rām. 4, 8, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकश्रुतधरत्व
एकश्रुतधरत्व एकश्रुतधरत्व, i. e. एक-श्रु + त-धृ + अ + त्व, n. Retaining what one has heard once, Kathās. 2, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकस्थ
एकस्थ एक-स्थ (vb. स्था), adj. United, Rām. 3, 30, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकस्थता
एकस्थता एकस्थ + ता, f. Union, MBh. 1, 5328.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकांशता
एकांशता एकांशता, i. e. एक-अंश + ता, f. Being a part, Ragh. 3, 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाकिन्
एकाकिन् एकाकिन्, i. e. probably एक-एक + इन् (anom.), adj., f. नी, Solitary, alone, Man. 4, 258.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्रतस्
एकाग्रतस् एकाग्रतस्, i. e. एक-अग्र + तस्, adv. Attentively, Lass. 21, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकात्म्य
एकात्म्य एकात्म्य, i. e. एक-आत्मन् + य, adj.<BR> 1. Alone, Bhāg. P. 4, 21, 29.<BR> 2. Homogeneous, Bhāg. P. 4, 13, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादश
एकादश एकादश, i. e. एकादशन् + अ.<BR> I. ord. numb., f. शि.<BR> 1. The eleventh, Man. 3, 47.<BR> 2. Lasting eleven (months), MBh. 13, 4247.<BR> II. f. शी, The eleventh day of the half month, MBh. 13, 4234.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषभैकादश
वृषभैकादश वृषभैकादश, i. e. वृषभ-, adj., f. शा, having a bull as the eleventh, i. e. ten (cows) with a bull, Man. 11, 116 (117).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशक
एकादशक एकादशक, i. e. एकादशन् + क, adj. Consisting of eleven, MBh. 13, 4914.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशन्
एकादशन् एकादशन्, i. e. एक-दशन्, card. numb. pl. Eleven, Man. 2, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशम
एकादशम एकादशम, i. e. एकादशन् + म, ord. numb. Eleventh, Bhāg. P. 8, 13, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशिन्
एकादशिन् एकादशिन्, i. e. एकादशन् + इन्,<BR> I. adj. Consisting of eleven, MBh. 13, 10668. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a " target="_blank">Page0141-a + 42</a>]<BR> II. f. नी, Eleven (hymns), Yājñ. 3, 309.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्त|एकान्तं|एकान्तः
एकान्त एकान्त, i. e. एक-अन्त,<BR> I. adj., f. ता, Alone, Rām. 4, 28, 1; only, Bhartṛ. 2, 7; Pañc. 154, 20 (the only one, i. e. indispensable).<BR> II. m. and n.<BR> 1. A solitary place, Pañc. iii. d. 6.<BR> 2. An extreme, Rām. 4, 21, 36.<BR> 3. One only, MBh. 12, 13618.<BR> III. The acc. तम्, instr. तेन, and loc. ते, are used as adv.<BR> 1. Exclusively, Bhag. 6, 16; Pañc. 247, 8.<BR> 2. Privately, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 10.<BR> 3. Necessarily, MBh. 3, 1240.<BR> IV. As former part of comp. words,<BR> 1. Perfect, Rām. 6, 93, 24.<BR> 2. Altogether, Sund. 1, 15.<BR> 3. Necessary, Ragh. 2, 57.<BR> V. As latter part, Only, Pañc. 2, 21.<BR> अन्-, adj., f. ता, Relative, Bhartṛ. 2, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्ततस्
एकान्ततस् एकान्त + तस्, adv. Thoroughly, Bhartṛ. 3, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तर|एकान्तरः
एकान्तर एकान्तर, i. e. एक-अन्तर, adj., f. रा, Separated by one caste, Man. 10, 9 (the father belonging, e. g. to the Kṣatriyas, the mother to the Śūdras, the Vaiśyas being between them).<BR> द्व्य्-एकान्तर, i. e. द्वि-एक-, adj. Being separated by one or two castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तत्व
एकान्तत्व एकान्त + त्व, n. Exclusive adoration, Bhāg. P. 7, 9, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तित्व
एकान्तित्व एकान्तित्व, i. e. एकान्तिन् + त्व, n. Identity, Bhāg. P. 9, 2, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तिन्
एकान्तिन् एकान्तिन्, i. e. एकान्त + इन्, adj., f. नी, Adoring one being only, Bhāg. P. 6, 9, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायन|एकायनः
एकायन एकायन, i. e. एक-अयन,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Passable by one only, MBh. 3, 11136.<BR> 2. Adoring one only, MBh. 12, 7872.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A solitary place, MBh. 3, 11695.<BR> 2. Adoration of one only, MBh. 14, 532.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थ|एकार्थः
एकार्थ एकार्थ, i. e. एक-अर्थ, m. The same intention, Nal. 3, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थता
एकार्थता एकार्थ + ता, f. Having the same intention, MBh. 1, 3413.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीभाव|एकीभावः
एकीभाव एकीभाव, i. e. एक-भू + अ, m. Union. Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैक
एकैक एकैक, i. e. एक-एक,<BR> I. adj., f. का.<BR> 1. Every one, Draup. 8, 17.<BR> 2. One successively, Kathās. 18, 265.<BR> II. कम्, adv. One by one, Rām. 1, 13, 27.<BR> III. comparat. एकैकतर, adj. Always one of many, Bhāg. P. 2, 10, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकशस्
एकैकशस् एकैक + शस्, adv.<BR> 1. One by one, Nal. 1, 25.<BR> 2. One after another, Rām. 4, 45, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकश्य
एकैकश्य एकैकश्य, i. e. एकैकशस् + य, n. Singleness, MBh. 3, 14903 (fighting one by one).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदक|एकोदकः
एकोदक एकोदक, i. e. एक-उदक, m. A kinsman who is connected by oblations of water only to the manes of common ancestors, Man. 5, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एज्
एज् एज्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To stir, MBh. 1, 800.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pres. Living, Bhāg. P. 7, 3, 22.<BR> 2. To tremble, to quake, cf. एजत्क.<BR> 3. † i. 1, Ātm. To shine.<BR> --Caus. To move, to turn, Bhāg. P. 5, 2, 14.<BR> --Cf. ἐπ-είγω, αἴγειρος, αἰγίς; Lat. aeger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजत्क
एजत्क एजत्क, i. e. एजन्त् + क (vb. एज्), adj. Trembling, Bhāg. P. 9, 6, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एठ्
† एठ् एठ्, i. 1, Ātm. To annoy, to resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडक|एडकः
एडक एडक, m. A ram, MBh. 3, 10935.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडूक|एडूकं|एडूकः
एडूक एडूक, m. A building enclosing bones (a Buddhistic स्तूप), MBh. 3, 10374.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एण|एणः
एण एण, m., f. णी, A kind of antelope, Man. 3, 269.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्
एतद् ए-तद् (cf. एक and एनद्), [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a " target="_blank">Page0142-a + 42</a>] demonst. pron. This here, Nal. 20, 17; this, Man. 3, 147; with the first person, Hiḍ. 4, 15; with the second, Nal. 11, 9; with तद्, Kathās. 3, 48; with इदम्, Pañc. Pr. 3; with किम्, Śāk. 101, 19; with यद्, Man. 1, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतदात्म्य
एतदात्म्य एतदात्म्य, i. e. एतद्-आत्मन् + य, adj. Having the nature of this, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतर्हि
एतर्हि एतर्हि, i. e. एतद् + र्हि, adv. Now, Bhāg. P. 1, 17, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एतादृश् एतादृश्, i. e. एतद्-दृश्, adj. Such, Bhāg. P. 9, 11, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश
एतादृश एतादृश, i. e. एतद्-दृश् + अ, adj., f. शी, Such, MBh. 3, 579.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावत्त्व|एतावत्त्वं
एतावत्त्व एतावत्त्व, i. e. एतावन्त् + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Greatness, Bhāg. P. 2, 5, 10.<BR> 2. Sufficiency, Bhāg. P. 4, 30, 28 (एतावत्त्वम्--भाव्यम्, it must be sufficient).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावन्त्|एतावत्
एतावन्त् एतावन्त्, i. e. एतद् + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. So much, Man. 9, 45.<BR> 2. Such a one, Brāhmaṇ. 1, 8; such, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 4; एतावति, In this distance, Śāk. 8, 10.<BR> 3. With किम्, Of this kind, Kathās. 20, 58.<BR> II. वत् (acc. sing. n.), adv.<BR> 1. So far, Rām. 4, 40, 68.<BR> 2. Thus, Hit. 27, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध्
एध् एध् (a form of अर्ध्, the original form of ऋध्), i. 1, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 3, 15031).<BR> 1. To prosper, MBh. 2, 510.<BR> 2. To increase, Rām. 2, 52, 34; to grow up, Śāk. d. 51.<BR> --Caus. एधय.<BR> 1. To cause to prosper, Bhāg. P. 7, 1, 11.<BR> 2. To glorify, Kumāras. 6, 90.<BR> --With the prep. अधि अधि, To increase, Bhāg. P. 5, 11, 17.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To increase, Bhāg. P. 3, 21, 25.<BR> समेधित,<BR> 1. Strengthened, MBh. 3, 10443.<BR> 2. United, Rām. 2, 64, 35.<BR> --Caus. To cause to prosper, MBh. 13, 7510.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध|एधः
एध एध, i. e. इन्ध् (or rather इध्) + अ, m. Wood for fuel, Man. 4, 247.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधस्
एधस् एधस्,<BR> I. n. इन्ध् + अस् (see the last), Wood for fuel, Man. 11, 70.<BR> II. एध् + अस्, Prospering; in सुखम्-एधस्, adj. Well prospering, MBh. 13, 5191.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनद्
एनद् एनद्, i. e. ए-न (cf. एतद् and एव; न is an old pron. base), pron. which forms only the acc. sing., du. pl., instr. sing., and gen. loc. du., which are substituted for the corresponding cases of इदम् and एतत्, This, when used substantively, He, She, It, and without any stress, Man. 2, 50.<BR> --Cf. Goth. ainaha, ains; A.S. ân; Lat. oinos, unus; οἴνη.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्
एनस् एनस्, n.<BR> 1. Sin, Man. 5, 34.<BR> 2. Fault, Daśak. in Chr. 194, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेनस्
अन्- + एनस् अन्- + एनस्,<BR> I. adj. guiltless, Man. 8, 19.<BR> II. m. a proper name, Hariv. 669.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्विन्
एनस्विन् एनस् + विन्, adj., f. नी, m. A sinner, Man. 11, 189.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरक
एरक एरक,<BR> I. m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2154.<BR> II. f. का, The name of a grass, MBh. 1, 620; bent-grass, Bhāg. P. 1, 3, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्ड|एरंडः|एरण्डः
एरण्ड एरण्ड, m. The castor oil plant, Ricinus communis, Pañc. i. d. 108.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एर्वारु|एर्वारुः|एर्व्वारुः
एर्वारु एर्वारु, m. and f. A kind of cucumber, Cucumis utilissimus, Roxb., Yājñ. 3, 142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एला
एला एला, f. Small cardamoms, Ragh. 6, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एव|एवं|एवः
एव ए-व (cf. एनद्, व is an old pronominal base), a particle (properly an old instr. sing.).<BR> 1. Only, Man. 1, 91; 2, 87; 190; Śāk. 69, 15.<BR> 2. Still, Man. 2, 168.<BR> 3. Just, Man. 5, 61; Pañc. 223, 9.<BR> 4. Also, Man. 1, 48.<BR> 5. Very (especially after तद्), Man. 3, 23.<BR> --Cf. οἶος, οἰαδόν.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0142-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवम्
एवम् ए-व + म् (see the preceding), a particle (originally acc. sing. n.), Thus, Pañc. 24, 4. Very often former part of comp. words, e. g. एवंरूप, adj., f. पा, Having such a form, Rām. 3, 52, 36.<BR> एवंविध (cf. विधा), adj. Of such a kind, Śāk. d. 104.<BR> एवंगत (vb. गम्), adj. Being in this state, Rām. 2, 39, 31; loc. sing. ते, Under these circumstances, Chr. 23, 33.<BR> एवंगुण,<BR> I. m. Such a quality, Rām. 1, 1, 20.<BR> II. adj. Having such qualities, Nal. 6, 12.<BR> एवम्-आदि, adj. Beginning thus, i. e. This and the like, Man. 9, 260.<BR> एवम्-भू + त, adj. Being thus, such a one, Hit. 7, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एष्
एष् एष् (cf. 1, 2. इष्), i. 1, Ātm. (after अनु and परि in epic poetry also Par.).<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To strive to attain, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 44.<BR> 3. To search, Bhāg. P. 9, 4, 52.<BR> --With the prep अनु अनु, To search, MBh. 1, 5253; to investigate. Rām. 1, 3, 2.<BR> --With परि परि, To search, MBh. 13, 4033 (Par.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषण|एषणः
एषण एषण, i. e. इष् + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Wish, desire, Bhāg. P. 7, 9, 39.<BR> 2. Searching MBh. 1, 8399.<BR> II. f. णा, Desire, Rājat. 5, 281.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषिन्
एषिन् एषिन्, i. e. इष् + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Wishing, MBh. 3, 12513.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनैषिन्
धन- + एषिन् धन- + एषिन्, adj. one who asks payment of a debt, Man. 8, 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0143-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वभूतहितैषिन्
