ऐश्वर
ऐश्वर ऐश्वर, i. e. ईश्वर + अ, adj., f. री.<BR> 1. Befitting a lord, majestic, MBh. 1, 3315; 14, 411; powerful, Rām. 3, 10, 21.<BR> 2. Belonging to Śiva, Ragh. 11, 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0144-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

