ऐश्वर्यवन्त्|ऐश्वर्यवत्
ऐश्वर्यवन्त् ऐश्वर्य + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Endowed with superhuman power, MBh. 15, 389.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0144-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐषीक
ऐषीक ऐषीक, i. e. इषीका + अ, adj. Made of reeds, Rām. 1, 29, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐष्टिकपौर्तिक|ऐष्टिकपौर्त्तिक
