ओक|ओकं|ओकः
ओक ओक, i. e. उच् + अ, m. A house; in अन्-ओक-शायिन्, adj. Not sleeping in a house, MBh. 1, 3631.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओकस्
ओकस् ओकस्, i. e. उच् + अस्, n. A dwelling-place, Bhāg. P. 3, 3, 15; a house, MBh. 2, 805.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

