जलौकस्
जल- + ओकस् जल- + ओकस्,<BR> I. adj. living in water, MBh. 13, 2650.<BR> II. f. a leech, Suśr. 1, 28, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0145-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिदिवौकस्
