और्ध्वदेहिक|और्द्ध्वदेहिकं
और्ध्वदेहिक और्ध्वदेहिक, i. e. ऊर्ध्व-देह + इक,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Serving for the acquisition of merit, Man. 11, 10.<BR> 2. Belonging to the obsequies of a deceased person, Pañc. 9, 3.<BR> II. n. Obsequies, Rām. 4, 24, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

