औशीर|औशीरं|औशीरः
औशीर औशीर, i. e. उशीर + अ, n.<BR> 1. The handle of a fan, MBh. 12, 2299.<BR> 2. A bed, Daśak. in Chr. 200, 8.<BR> 3. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-b " target="_blank">Page0148-b + 37</a>] An ointment made of Uśīra, Śāk. d. 57, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

