क|कं|कः
क क,<BR> I. see किम्.<BR> II. m. (properly nom. sing. of किम्), A name of the highest deities, viz. Prajāpati, Bhāg. P. 6, 6, 2; Brahman, MBh. 1, 32; Viṣṇu, 13, 7027.<BR> III. n. Water, Yājñ. 2, 108.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंस्
† कंस् कंस् (or कश् कश्, or कस् कस्), ii. 2, Ātm.<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To command (v. r. to destroy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंस|कंसं|कंसः
कंस कंस,<BR> I. m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 357.<BR> II. f. सा, A proper name, Hariv. 2029.<BR> III. m. n. Bell metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंसवती
