ककुद्
ककुद् ककुद् (a reduplicated form of a lost base, कुद्, probably akin to κῡδος, etc., cf. ककुद्मन्त्), f.<BR> 1. A summit, Bhāg. P. 5, 25, 7.<BR> 2. The hump of the Indian bull, Bhāg. P. 9, 6, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिककुद्
