ककुद|ककुदं|ककुदः
ककुद ककुद् + अ, m. and n.<BR> 1. Chief, Rām. 6, 37, 12.<BR> 2. The hump of the Indian bull, MBh. 13, 835.<BR> 3. An ensign or symbol of royalty, Ragh. 3, 70.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिककुद
