ककुद्रुम
ककुद्रुम ककुद्रुम, i. e. ककुद्-द्रुम, n. A proper name, Pañc. i. d. 290.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ककुद्वन्त्|ककुद्वत्
ककुद्वन्त् ककुद् + वन्त्, m. A bull having a hump, Rām. 5, 7, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ककुन्दर|ककुंदर|ककुंदरं|ककुन्दरं
ककुन्दर ककुन्दर, and कुकुन्दर कुकुन्दर, n. The cavities of the loins, Yājñ. 3, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ककुभ्
ककुभ् ककुभ् (a reduplicated form of a lost base, कुभ्; cf. κῡϕός; Lat. cubare, and कुम्भ्), f.<BR> 1. A summit (ved.)<BR> 2. A quarter or point of the compass, Kathās. 21, 13.<BR> 3. A proper name, Bhāg. P. 6, 6, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ककुभ|ककुभः
ककुभ ककुभ् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A tree, Terminalia Arjuna, Rām. 1, 26, 15.<BR> 2. A certain musical mode, Vikr. 61, 1.<BR> 3. The name of a mountain, Bhāg. P. 5, 19, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कक्क्
† कक्क् कक्क्, see कख्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कक्कोल|कक्कोलः
कक्कोल कक्कोल, m. (?) A plant bearing a berry, the inner part of which is an aromatic substance, Rām. 3, 39, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कक्ख्
† कक्ख् कक्ख्, see कख्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कक्ष|कक्षः
कक्ष कक्ष,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A spreading creeper, MBh. 3, 12548; weed, Man. 7, 110.<BR> 2. A dry wood, Rām. 5, 5, 24.<BR> 3. A forest, MBh. 15, 1082.<BR> 4. The side or flank, Rām. 6, 36, 108 (of an army).<BR> 5. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 6, 356.<BR> II. m. and f. क्षा.<BR> 1. The armpit, Rām. 4, 10, 19; Mṛcch. 34, 11.<BR> 2. The end of the lower garment tucked into the waistband, MBh. 2, 902; Pañc. 32, 25 (used for keeping money).<BR> III. f. क्षा.<BR> 1. A girdle, MBh. 4, 1749.<BR> 2. A wall, Rām. 2, 32, 32.<BR> 3. An enclosure, a part of an edifice, Man. 7, 224.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0149-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यकक्ष
