कन्यका
कन्यका कन्यका, i. e. कन्या + क, f. A girl, Pañc. 44, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यकुब्ज
कन्यकुब्ज कन्यकुब्ज, i. e. कन्या-कुब्ज (with shortened आ), f. The name of a town, Rām. 1, 34, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यस|कन्यसः
कन्यस कन्यस, i. e. कन्यंस् (for कनीयंस्) + अ, adj., f. सी, Younger, Rām. 5, 33, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्या
कन्या कन्या (akin to कनीयंस्), f.<BR> 1. A girl, Nal. 1, 8.<BR> 2. A virgin, Man. 8, 367.<BR> 3. A daughter, Man. 9, 71.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काशिकन्या
काशि- + कन्या काशि- + कन्या, f. a daughter of the king of the Kāśis, Chr. 20, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जह्नुकन्या
जह्नु- + कन्या जह्नु- + कन्या, f. a name of the Gangā, Bhartṛ. 3, 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकन्या
सम- + कन्या सम- + कन्या, f. a girl fit to be married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यात्व
कन्यात्व कन्या + त्व, n. Virginity, MBh. 1, 2406.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यामय
कन्यामय कन्या + मय, adj., f. यि, Consisting of a girl, Ragh. 16, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप्
कप् कप्, see क्रप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप
कप कप, m. The name of a kind of demons, MBh. 13, 7329 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपट|कपटं|कपटः
कपट कपट, m. and n. Fraud, Pañc. 217, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्द|कपर्दः|कपर्द्द|कपर्द्दः
कपर्द कपर्द, m.<BR> 1. A small shell used as a coin, a cowrie.<BR> 2. The braided hair of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दक|कपर्दकः|कपर्द्दक|कपर्द्दकः
कपर्दक कपर्द + क, m. and कपर्दिका कपर्दिका, f. A small shell used as a coin, Hit. 115, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दिन्|कपर्द्दिन्
कपर्दिन् कपर्दिन्, i. e. कपर्द + इन्, m. A name of Śiva, MBh. 3, 1624.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाट|कपाटं|कपाटः
कपाट कपाट, m., f. टी, and n.<BR> 1. A half of a folding-door, Rām. 5, 15, 10.<BR> 2. A door, Mṛcch. 16, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटक
ऽकपाटक -कपाट + क, a substitute for the last when latter part of a comp. adj. स्फाटिक-उरु-, adj. Having large folding-doors of crystal, MBh. 2, 1673. f. टिका, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाल|कपालं|कपालः
कपाल कपाल (probably for *कर्पाल; cf. कर्पर),<BR> I. m., f. ली, An earthen water-pot, especially of the religious mendicants, Man. 6, 44; Bhartṛ. 3, 24; of beggars in general, Daśak. in Chr. 194, 1.<BR> II. m. and n.<BR> 1. Either half of a water-jar, Bhāṣāp. 10.<BR> 2. The skull, MBh. 14, 273.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. A potsherd.<BR> 2. Either half of an egg, Kathās. 2, 15.<BR> 3. The glene, Suśr. 1, 265, 8.<BR> 4. A kind of leprosy, Suśr. 1, 268, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिक|कपालिकः
कपालिक कपालिक,<BR> I. = कापालिक<BR> II. (q. cf.), Pañc. i. d. 239 (with shortened अ on account of the metre?).<BR> II. f. का, i. e. कपाल + क, f. A potsherd, Man. 4, 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिन्
कपालिन् कपालिन्, i. e. कपाल + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Wearing skulls (as a necklace), Kumāras. 5, 78; covered with skulls, Bhāg. P. 4, 4, 16.<BR> II. m. and f. A follower of a certain sect, Prab. 56, 13.<BR> III. m. A name of Śiva, MBh. 2, 1641; of one of the Rudras, 1, 2567.<BR> IV. f. नी, A name of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपि|कपिः
कपि कपि, i. e. कम्प् + इ, m.<BR> 1. A monkey, Man. 11, 154. A name of Viṣṇu, MBh. 13, 7045.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिञ्जल|कपिंजल|कपिंजलः|कपिञ्जलः
कपिञ्जल कपिञ्जल, m.<BR> 1. A bird, the francoline partridge, Bhāg. P. 6, 9, 5.<BR> 2. A proper name, Pañc. 163, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्थ|कपित्थः
कपित्थ कपित्थ (probably कपि-स्थ, vb. स्था),<BR> I. m. A tree, Feronia elephantum, Corr., MBh. 1, 2830.<BR> II. n. Its fruit, Suśr. 1, 148, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्थक
कपित्थक कपित्थ + क, m. A tree, Feronia elephantum, Corr., Rām. 5, 16, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्व
कपित्व कपि + त्व, n. Condition of a monkey, Rām. 5, 2, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिल|कपिलः
कपिल कपि + ल,<BR> I. adj., f. ला, Reddish, Man. 3, 8 (with reddish hair), Rām. 6, 3, 2.<BR> II. m. The name of a sage, MBh. 3, 1896; of a mountain, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 27.<BR> III. f. ला.<BR> 1. A reddish or brown cow, MBh. 3, 8067.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2520.<BR> 3. The name of a river, MBh. 3, 14233.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिश|कपिशः
कपिश कपि + श, adj. Reddish, Śāk. d. 75; brown, Vikr. d. 26; Megh. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीन्द्र|कपींद्र|कपीन्द्रः
कपीन्द्र कपीन्द्र, i. e. कपि-इन्द्र, m. A name of Viṣṇu, MBh. 13, 7002.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीवन्त्|कपीवत्
कपीवन्त् कपीवन्त्, i. e. कपि + वन्त्,<BR> I. m. The name of a sage, Hariv. 426.<BR> II. f. वती, The name of a river, Rām. 2, 71, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोत|कपोतः
कपोत क-पोत (see किम्),<BR> I. m. A dove or pigeon, Pañc. iii. d. 139.<BR> II. f. ती, A she-pigeon, Pañc. iii. d. 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोतक|कपोतकं|कपोतकः
कपोतक कपोत + क, m., f. तिका, A little pigeon, Pañc. ii. 9; iii. 144.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोल|कपोलः
कपोल कपोल, m. A cheek, Pañc. d. 225.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकपोल
सु- + कपोल सु- + कपोल, adj., f. ला, having beautiful cheeks, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपोलकाष|कपोलकाषः
कपोलकाष कपोलकाष, i. e. कपोल-कष् + अ, m. That which rubs the cheeks (viz. of the elephants), as a branch, etc., Kir. 5, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कफ|कफः
कफ कफ, m. Phlegm, one of the three humours of the body, Suśr. 1, 4, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कफल
कफल कफ + ल, adj. Phlegmatic, causing or exciting phlegm, Suśr. 1, 224, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कब्
† कब् कब्, or कव् कव्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To colour.<BR> 2. To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कबन्ध|कबंध|कबंधं|कबन्धं|कबंधः|कबन्धः
कबन्ध कबन्ध, and कवन्ध क-वन्ध, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a " target="_blank">Page0158-a + 44</a>] m. and n.<BR> 1. A headless trunk, especially one retaining the power of action, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 166.<BR> 2. A belly, MBh. 3, 806.<BR> 3. A cloud, or vapour, MBh. 3, 13087.<BR> 4. The name of a demon, Rām. 3, 75, 24, sqq.<BR> --Cf. Κάανθος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्
कम् क + म् (old acc. s. n. of किम्), a particle, Indeed, Chr. 293, 2 = Rigv. i. 88. 2.<BR> --Cf. κέν.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्
कम् कम्, i. 10, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., Hiḍ. 4, 4; Rām. 3, 51, 28), in the pres., impf., imptive., and potent., and optionally in all the other forms, कामय.<BR> 1. To love, MBh. 1, 2400; Rām. 1, 34, 16.<BR> 2. To desire, Sāv. 5, 52; to wish, with infin., MBh. 1, 6582; to intend, with infin., MBh. 3, 2249.<BR> --Anom. ptcple. of the pres. कामयान, e. g. MBh. 13, 1891; काममन (probably to be corrected to कामयान), Rām. 5, 24, 37; 38.<BR> --Pf. pass. कान्त.<BR> 1. Loved, Hiḍ. 4, 35.<BR> 2. Amiable, graceful.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Compar. कान्त + तर, Most beautiful, Rām. 3, 17, 6.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. कमनीय.<BR> 1. To be loved, Kumāras. 1, 37.<BR> 2. Beautiful, Bhartṛ. 1, 45.<BR> काम्य, see separately.<BR> --Caus. To cause to desire, Rām. 3, 38, 20 (Par.); Ṛt. 6, 30 (Ātm.).<BR> --With the prep. अति अति, in अति-कान्त, adj. Excessively loved, Bhartṛ. 2, 30.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To desire, MBh. 1, 3347.<BR> --With नि नि, To desire, Bhāg. P. 5, 18, 21.<BR> --Cf. Lat. carus = कम्-र, Beautiful, charming (Grammarians), amo (cf. कतर), amœnus, etc.; κῆδος (aff. δος = त्वस्) κεδνός, etc.; probably O.H.G. gaman; A.S. gamene.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रकान्त|चंद्रकांत|चन्द्रकान्तं|चन्द्रकान्तः
चन्द्र- + कान्त चन्द्र- + कान्त, m. the moon-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमाकान्त|रमाकान्तः
रमा- + कान्त रमा- + कान्त, m. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविकान्त|रविकांत|रविकान्तः
रवि- + कान्त रवि- + कान्त, m. the sun-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राधाकान्त|राधाकान्तः
राधा- + कान्त राधा- + कान्त, m. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यकान्त|सूर्यकांत|सूर्यकान्तः|सूर्य्यकान्त|सूर्य्यकान्तः
सूर्य- + कान्त सूर्य- + कान्त, m. 1. the sunstone, Śāk. d. 40; a gem. 2. Hibiscus phœniceus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामित
कामित कामित, n. Wish, MBh. 1, 2187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमठ|कमठं|कमठः
कमठ कमठ, m.<BR> 1. A tortoise, Pañc. ii. d. 199.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 2, 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमण्डलु|कमंडलु|कमंडलुः|कमण्डलुः
कमण्डलु कमण्डलु, m. (and n.) A water-pot used by ascetics and religious students, Man. 2, 64; Rām. 3, 52, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमन|कमनं|कमनः
कमन कम् + अन, adj. Desirable, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमल|कमलं|कमलः
कमल कम् + अल,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. A lotus, Nelumbium, Megh. 32.<BR> 2. Water, Kir. 5, 25.<BR> II. f. ला.<BR> 1. A name of Lakṣmī, Bhāg. P. i. p. xcv.<BR> 2. A proper name, Rājat. 4, 424.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकमल
कर-कमल कर-कमल, n. a lotus-like hand, Ṛt. 3, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकसितवदनकमल
विकसित-वदन-कमल विकसित-वदन-कमल, adj., f. ला, opening her lotus-like mouth, Pañc. 129, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकसितनयनवदनकमल
विकसित-नयन-वदन-कमल विकसित-नयन-वदन-कमल, opening his lotus-like eyes and mouth, 192, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकमल
स- + कमल स- + कमल, adj. abounding in lotus-flowers, Kir. 5, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलाहास्
कमलाहास् कमलाहास्, a denomin. derived from कमल-आ-हास, Par. To smile like a lotus, Lass. 67, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलिनी
कमलिनी कमलिनी, i. e. कमल + इन् + ई, f. A group of lotus flowers, Megh. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प्|कंप्
कम्प् कम्प्, i. 1, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 4, 1290).<BR> 1. To move to and fro, Rām. 1, 14, 18.<BR> 2. To tremble, Rām. 3, 53, 61.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pf. pass. आ-कम्पित, n. Trembling a little, Ragh. 2, 13.<BR> --Caus. To cause to tremble, Rām. 1, 74, 13; 3, 33, 38 (Ātm.).<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pf. pass. अ-कम्पित, Without being stirred, by themselves, MBh. 4, 1290.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. अ-कम्प्य, immoveable, Rām. 3, 53, 43.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, To pity, with loc. and acc., MBh. 14, 29; Rām. 3, 37, 15.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. अनु-कम्पित, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a " target="_blank">Page0159-a + 41</a>] n. Compassion, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 22.<BR> --Caus. To pity, Kumāras. 4, 39.<BR> --With समनु सम्-अनु, To pity, Ragh. 9, 14.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To tremble, MBh. 3, 15721 (? v. r.).<BR> --With आ आ, Caus. To cause to tremble, MBh. 1, 1165.<BR> आकम्पित, Excited, Ṛt. 6, 32.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To tremble, Kathās. 15, 2.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To tremble, Rām. 1, 65, 13.<BR> --Caus. To cause to tremble, Rām. 3, 25, 26.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. दुष्प्रकम्प्य, i. e. दुस्-.<BR> 1. Difficult to be made to tremble, Hariv. 12824.<BR> 2. Difficult to be made to reel, MBh. 5, 718.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, Caus. To cause to tremble, Rām. 5, 6, 16.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, Caus.<BR> 1. To cause to tremble, MBh. 4, 298.<BR> --With वि वि.<BR> 1. To tremble, Bhag. 2, 31.<BR> 2. To retreat (with abl., from), MBh. 4, 109.<BR> 3. To change, Rām. 2, 60, 17.<BR> विकम्पित, Trembling, Ṛt. 1, 3.<BR> --Caus. To cause to tremble, Ragh. 11, 19.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To tremble, MBh. 4, 574.<BR> --Caus. To cause to tremble, MBh. 1, 1167.<BR> --Cf. perhaps κάμπτω καμπύλος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0158-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प|कंप|कंपः|कम्पः
कम्प कम्प् + अ, m. Trembling, Bhartṛ. 1, 50.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कम्प|निष्कंप
निष्कम्प निष्कम्प, i. e. निस्-, adj., f. पा, unmoved, unmovable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिकम्प|क्षितिकंप|क्षितिकम्पः
क्षिति-, भू- + कम्प क्षिति-, भू- + कम्प and भूमि-, m. an earthquake, MBh. 7, 7867; Rām. 1, 41, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूकम्प|भूकंप|भूकम्पः
क्षिति-, भू- + कम्प क्षिति-, भू- + कम्प and भूमि-, m. an earthquake, MBh. 7, 7867; Rām. 1, 41, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पन|कंपन|कम्पनं|कम्पनः
कम्पन कम्प् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. ना.<BR> 1. Causing to tremble, MBh. 13, 662.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A certain weapon, Rām. 6, 7, 24.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 2, 117.<BR> 3. The name of a country, Rājat. 5, 446.<BR> III. f. ना, The name of a river, MBh. 3, 8094.<BR> IV. n. Trembling, MBh. 3, 13539.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकम्पन|सकंपन
स- + कम्पन स- + कम्पन, adj., f. ना, accompanied by earthquakes, Chr. 36, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वकम्पन|स्वकंपन|स्वकम्पनः
स्व- + कम्पन स्व- + कम्पन, m. wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हृदयकम्पन
हृदय- + कम्पन हृदय- + कम्पन, adj. agitating [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b " target="_blank">Page0159-b + 44</a>] the heart, causing it to throb (with indignation), Draup. 4, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्ब्|कंब्
† कम्ब् कम्ब्, see कर्ब्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बल|कंबल|कम्बलं|कंबलः|कम्बलः
कम्बल कम्बल,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. A woollen blanket, MBh. 3, 181.<BR> 2. A woollen garment, Rājat. 5, 460.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga, MBh. 1, 1555.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाण्डुकम्बल|पांडुकंबल|पाण्डुकम्बलः
पाण्डु- + कम्बल पाण्डु- + कम्बल, m. 1. a white woollen blanket. 2. a kind of stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बु|कंबु|कम्बुः
कम्बु कम्बु, m. and n.<BR> 1. A shell, Bhāg. P. 4, 7, 20.<BR> 2. A bracelet (made of shells, MBh. 2, 2067), MBh. 4, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बोज|कंबोज|कंबोजः|कम्बोजः
कम्बोज कम्बोज, m. pl. The name of a country and its inhabitants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर|करः
कर कर, i. e. A कृ + अ,<BR> I. latter part of comp. adj. and subst., f. री, Making, causing, producing; e. g. वैर-, Causing enmity, Man. 9, 227.<BR> अ-यशस्-, Causing disgrace, Hiḍ. 3, 18.<BR> देह-, m. A father, MBh. 5, 3657.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. The hand, Man. 5, 136.<BR> 2. An elephant's trunk, Nal. 13, 12.<BR> B. कॄ + अ, m.<BR> 1. A ray of light, Rām. 6, 11, 44.<BR> 2. Hail.<BR> 3. Royal revenue, Man. 7, 128; toll, Man. 7, 127.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रकर|अग्रकरः
अग्र- + कर अग्र- + कर, m. 1. the tip of the extended hand. 2. the extremity of the hand and of a ray, Śiś. 9, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतुषारकर|अतुषारकरः
अ-तुषार-कर अ-तुषार-कर, m. the sun, Śiś. 9, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकर|कुलकरः
कुल-कर कुल-कर, m. ancestor, MBh. 1, 6562.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रकर|चित्रकरः
चित्र- + कर चित्र- + कर, m. a painter, Kathās. 5, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनकर|दिनकरः
दिन-, दिवस- + कर दिन-, दिवस- + कर, and दिवा-, m. the sun, Bhartṛ. 2, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिवसकर|दिवसकरः
दिन-, दिवस- + कर दिन-, दिवस- + कर, and दिवा-, m. the sun, Bhartṛ. 2, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्कर|दुष्करं
दुष्कर दुष्कर, i. e. दुस्-, adj., f. री, difficult Man. 7, 55; दुष्करं यदि, scarcely, Rām. 2, 73, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकर|पद्मकरः
पद्म- + कर पद्म- + कर,<BR> I. m. a lotuslike hand, Bhāg. P. 7, 9, 26.<BR> II. adj., f. रा, holding a lotus, Prab. 86, 3.<BR> III. f. रा, a name of Śrī, Bhāg. P. 4, 20, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भोगकर
भोग- + कर भोग- + कर, adj., f. री, procuring food, Bhartṛ. 2, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूलोद्यतकर
शूलोद्यतकर शूलोद्यतकर, i. e. शूल-उद्यत- (vb. यम्), adj. with a spear in his uplifted hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकर
स- + कर स- + कर, adj. 1. bearing toll. 2. with rays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकर|सुकरः
सु- + कर सु- + कर,<BR> I. adj., f. री. 1. easy, Man. 7, 55. 2. doing well [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a " target="_blank">Page0160-a + 41</a>]<BR> II. f. रा, a tractable cow.<BR> III. n. charity, benevolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असुकर
अ-सु- + कर अ-सु- + कर, adj. to be shunned, Bhartṛ. 2, 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0159-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करक|करकं|करकः
करक करक, m., i. e.<BR> A. कृ + अक, The waterpot of the student or ascetic, Man. 4, 66.<BR> B. कॄ + अक, Hail, Megh. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकासार्
करकासार् करकासार्, a denominative derived from करक-आसार, Par. To rain like a shower of hail, Lass. 67, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करङ्क|करंक|करंकः|करङ्कः
करङ्क करङ्क, m. The skull, Mālat. 79, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करज|करजं|करजः
करज कर-ज (vb. जन्), m. A finger nail, Man. 4, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करञ्ज|करंज|करंजः|करञ्जः
करञ्ज करञ्ज, m. The name of a plant, Pongamia glabra, Vent., MBh. 3, 14488 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करञ्जक|करञ्जकः
करञ्जक करञ्ज + क, m. = the last, Rām. 3, 79, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करट|करटः
करट करट, m.<BR> 1. An elephant's temples, MBh. 3, 16039; Bhartṛ. 3, 73.<BR> करटा-मुख, with lengthened अ, MBh. 3, 441, etc., perhaps on account of the metre.<BR> 2. A crow, Bhāg. P. 5, 14, 29.<BR> 3. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 6, 370.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रभिन्नकरट
प्र-भिन्न- + करट प्र-भिन्न- + करट, m. an elephant in rut, or from whose temples the juice is exuding, Sund, 2, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटक|करटकः
करटक करट + क, m.<BR> 1. A crow, Mṛcch. 104, 13 (Prākṛ.).<BR> 2. A proper name, Pañc. 9, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण|करणं|करणः
करण करण, i. e. कृ + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. णी, Making, causing, e. g. वैधव्य-, Causing widowhood, Rām. 6, 95, 27.<BR> संजीव-, Causing health, Rām. 6, 26, 5.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Making, MBh. 3, 15297; performing, Pañc. 40, 15.<BR> 2. Action, Rām. 1, 11, 17.<BR> 3. Instrument, Bhāṣāp. 57.<BR> 4. An organ of sense, Ragh. 8, 38.<BR> 5. The body, Kumāras. 4, 5.<BR> 6. A document, Man. 8, 51. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-b " target="_blank">Page0160-b + 41</a>]<BR> 7. Musical time, Kumāras. 6, 40.<BR> III. m. The son of a Vrātya Kṣatriya, Man. 10, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकरण|अकरणं
अ- + करण अ- + करण, n. non-doing, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकरण
अन्त- + करण अन्त- + करण, adj. causing destruction, Man. 9, 221.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकरण|अन्तःकरणं
अन्तःकरण अन्तःकरण, i. e. अन्तर्-, n. the internal sense, Vedāntas. in Chr. 206, 24; the heart, Śāk. d. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहितकरण
अ-हित- + करण अ-हित- + करण, n. a wicked action, Bhartṛ. 1, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिवृत्करण|त्रिवृत्करणं
त्रिवृत्- + करण त्रिवृत्- + करण, n. triplication, Vedāntas. in Chr. 208, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहारकरण
