करुण|करुणः
करुण करुण,<BR> I. adj., f. णा,<BR> 1. Doleful, Vikr. 4, 1; Rām. 2, 63, 32.<BR> 2. Lamentable, Rām. 3, 51, 25.<BR> II. णम् (acc. sing. n.), adverbially, Miserably, Rām. 1, 2, 14; Śiś. 9, 67.<BR> III. m. Moving compassion, one of the रसस्, or sentiments of a poetical production, Rām. 1, 4, 7.<BR> IV. f. णा, Compassion, Bhāg. P. 1, 2, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0161-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकरुण|अकरुणः
