करूषक
करूषक करूष + क,<BR> I. m. A proper name.<BR> II. n. A certain fruit, MBh. 3, 10039.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणु|करेणुः
