कर्कट|कर्कटः
कर्कट कर्कट, a form of *कर्कर्त, i. e. an old reduplicated form of कृत् + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A crab, Pañc. iv. d. 10.<BR> 2. The sign of the zodiac, Cancer, Rām. 1, 19, 2.<BR> 3. The name of a plant, Suśr. 2, 253, 12.<BR> II. f. टी, A female crab, MBh. 4, 272.<BR> III. m., f. टी, The curved end of the beam of a balance, Pañc. ii. d. 74.<BR> --Cf. Lat. cancer; καρκίνος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कटक|कर्कटकः
