कर्कन्धु|कर्कंधु|कर्कंधुः|कर्कन्धुः
कर्कन्धु कर्कन्धु,<BR> I. m., and f. धू, The jujube, Zizyphus jujuba.<BR> II. n. Its fruit, Yājñ. 1, 240; also the fem. धू, Bhāg. P. 3, 31, 32.<BR> III. m. A proper name, Chr. 296, 6 = Rigv. i. 112, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कर|कर्करं|कर्करः
कर्कर कर्कर,<BR> I. adj., f. रा, Hard, Mālat. 79, 18.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga, MBh. 1, 1561.<BR> III. f. री, A small water-jar, Bhartṛ. 1, 47.<BR> --Cf. perhaps Lat. calculus, calx; κρόκη, κροκάλη, κάχληξ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कश|कर्कशः
कर्कश कर्कश, adj., f. शा.<BR> 1. Hard, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 740.<BR> 2. Firm, Bhartṛ. 2, 56.<BR> 3. Cruel, Rām. 3, 36, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कशत्व
कर्कशत्व कर्कश + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Hardness, Kumāras. 1, 36.<BR> 2. Harshness, MBh. 13, 542.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कोटक|कर्कोटकः
कर्कोटक कर्कोटक,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The name of a Nāga or snake, Nal. 14, 4.<BR> 2. A plant, Momordica mixta, Suśr. 1, 137, 15.<BR> II. n. Its fruit, 2, 343, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ज्
† कर्ज् कर्ज्, i. 1, Par. To pain or make uneasy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ण्
† कर्ण् कर्ण्, i. 10, Par. To pierce or bore.<BR> --Cf. आकर्णय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ण|कर्णः|कर्ण्ण
कर्ण कर्ण, m.<BR> 1. The ear, Man. 8, 125; with दा, To listen, Śāk. 8, 21.<BR> 2. A rudder, Rām. 6, 23, 30.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2427.<BR> --Comp.<BR> When the latter part of a comp. adj. the f. ends in णा and णी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकर्ण|अश्वकर्णः|अश्वकर्ण्ण
अश्व- + कर्ण अश्व- + कर्ण, m. a timber tree, Vatica robusta, Rām. 1, 26, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्ण|उत्कर्णः|उत्कर्ण्ण
उत्कर्ण उत्कर्ण, i. e. उद्-, adj. with the ears erect, Ragh. (Calc. ed.) 15, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकर्ण|कुम्भकर्णः
कुम्भ- + कर्ण कुम्भ- + कर्ण, m. 1. a name of Śiva, MBh. 12, 10350. 2. the name of a Rākṣasa, Rām. 1, 3, 34. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a " target="_blank">Page0163-a + 42</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोकर्ण|गोकर्णः
गो- + कर्ण गो- + कर्ण, m. 1. a kind of deer, Antelope picta, Rām. 2, 103, 41. 2. a kind of arrow, MBh. 8, 4668. 3. a span from the tip of the thumb to that of the little finger, MBh. 2, 2324. 4. the name of a holy place, Rām. 1, 42, 13. 5. a name of Śiva, Kathās. 22, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्कर्ण
चतुष्कर्ण चतुष्कर्ण, i. e. चतुर्-, adj. heard only by four ears, Pañc. i. d. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिकर्ण
त्रि- + कर्ण त्रि- + कर्ण, adj., f. णी, having three ears, Rām. 5, 18, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दधिकर्ण
दधि- + कर्ण दधि- + कर्ण, m. a proper name, Pañc. 165, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बकर्ण|लंबकर्ण|लम्बकर्णः
लम्ब- + कर्ण लम्ब- + कर्ण, m. 1. a goat. 2. an elephant. 3. a Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्ण|विकर्णः
वि- + कर्ण वि- + कर्ण, adj. earless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुकर्ण|शंकुकर्ण|शङ्कुकर्णः
शङ्कु- + कर्ण शङ्कु- + कर्ण,<BR> I. adj., f. णा, having ears like a javelin, MBh. 1, 6662; णी, Rām. 5, 18, 24.<BR> II. m. 1. an ass. 2. a proper name, Pañc. 87, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्कर्ण|षट्कर्णः
षट्कर्ण षट्कर्ण, i. e. षष्-, adj. heard by six ears, Lass. 3, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तब्धकर्ण
स्तब्ध- + कर्ण स्तब्ध- + कर्ण (vb. स्तम्भ्), adj. having the ears erect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिकर्ण|हस्तिकर्णः
हस्तिकर्ण हस्तिकर्ण, i. e. हस्तिन्-, m. 1. the castor oil tree. 2. the Butea frondosa. 3. a demigod. 4. the name of a district, Rājat. 5, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकुब्ज
कर्णकुब्ज कर्ण-कुब्ज, n. The name of a city, Lass. 8, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णग्राहवन्त्|कर्णग्राहवत्
कर्णग्राहवन्त् कर्णग्राहवन्त्, i. e. कर्ण-ग्रह् + अ + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Having a helmsman, Rām. 2, 52, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णधार|कर्णधारः|कर्ण्णधार
कर्णधार कर्णधार, i. e. कर्ण-धृ + अ, m. A helmsman, Rām. 2, 52, 75.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकर्णधार
अ- + कर्णधार अ- + कर्णधार, adj., f. रा, without a pilot, Hit. iii. d. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णवन्त्|कर्णवत्
कर्णवन्त् कर्ण + वन्त्, adj. f. वती, Having ears, Rām. 2, 45, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णश्रव|कर्ण्णश्रव
कर्णश्रव कर्णश्रव, i. e. कर्ण-श्रु + अ, adj. Heard by the ear, Man. 4, 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णाकर्णि
कर्णाकर्णि कर्णाकर्णि, i. e. कर्ण-कर्ण + इ, adv. From ear to ear, Rām. 6, 21, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णाट|कर्णाटः
कर्णाट कर्णाट,<BR> I. m. pl. The name [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b " target="_blank">Page0163-b + 40</a>] of a country and its inhabitants, MBh. 3, 16352.<BR> II. f. टी, A proper name, Rājat. 4, 152.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णाटक|कर्णाटकः
कर्णाटक कर्णाट + क = कर्णाट, m. Bhāg. P. 5, 6, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिका|कर्ण्णिका
कर्णिका कर्णिका, i. e. कर्ण + क or इक, f.<BR> 1. An ornament of the ear, Daśak. in Chr. 199, 1.<BR> 2. The pericarp of the lotus, Rām. 3, 22, 25.<BR> 3. The name of an Apsaras, MBh. 1, 428.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकर्णिक
पद्म-कर्णिक पद्म-कर्णिक (perhaps to be corrected to ˚णिका), the pericarp of a lotus, i. e. a manner of arraying an army, MBh. 7, 2674.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिकार|कर्णिकारः|कर्ण्णिकार
कर्णिकार कर्णिकार,<BR> I. m. The name of a plant, Pterospermum acerifolium, Rām. 3, 21, 15.<BR> II. n. Its flower, Ṛt. 6, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णिन्
कर्णिन् कर्णिन्, i. e. कर्ण + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Mischievously barbed, Man. 7, 90.<BR> 2. In -अर्धकुण्डलकर्णिन्, MBh. 13, 886, where the aff. इन् belongs to -अर्ध-कुण्डल-कर्ण, not to कर्ण alone: Wearing in his ear half an ear-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णीरथ|कर्णीरथः|कर्ण्णीरथ
कर्णीरथ कर्णीरथ (cf. रथ), m. A litter, Rājat. 5, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णीसुत|कर्णीसुतः|कर्ण्णीसुत
कर्णीसुत कर्णीसुत (cf. सु), m. A proper name, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णोपकर्णिका|कर्ण्णोपकर्ण्णिका
कर्णोपकर्णिका कर्णोपकर्णिका, i. e. कर्ण-उप-कर्ण + क, f. Gossip, Pañc. 36, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्|कर्त्त्
† कर्त् कर्त्, see कर्त्र्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तन|कर्त्तन|कर्त्तनं
कर्तन कर्तन, i. e. कृत् + अन, n. Cutting, Yājñ. 2, 229.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तव्यता|कर्त्तव्यता
कर्तव्यता कर्तव्य + ता (vb. कृ), f. Business, Man. 7, 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तुकाम|कर्त्तुकाम
कर्तुकाम कर्तुकाम, i. e. कर्तुम्-काम (vb. कृ), adj. Desiring to do, Rām. 3, 49, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तुमनस्
कर्तुमनस् कर्तुमनस्, i. e. कर्तुम्-मनस् [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a " target="_blank">Page0164-a + 42</a>] (vb. कृ), adj. Intending to do, Pañc. 12, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0163-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तृ|कर्त्तृ
कर्तृ कर्तृ, i. e. कृ + तृ, m., f. त्री, and n.<BR> 1. An agent, a maker, Rām. 4, 24, 5; Man. 4, 172; 3, 160; 5, 105 (n.); Kathās. 25, 153 (f.).<BR> 2. A founder, MBh. 13, 1662.<BR> 3. Creator, Rām. 3, 69, 7.<BR> 4. An author, Pañc. ii. d. 34.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आदिकर्तृ|आदिकर्त्तृ
आदि- + कर्तृ आदि- + कर्तृ, m. the first creator, Rām. 6, 102, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनकर्तृ
दिन- + कर्तृ दिन- + कर्तृ, m. the sun, Hariv. 9367.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिष्टकर्तृ|मिष्टकर्त्तृ
मिष्ट- + कर्तृ मिष्ट- + कर्तृ, m. a confectioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राज्यकर्तृ
राज्य- + कर्तृ राज्य- + कर्तृ, m. an officer of the government, Rām. 2, 67, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरकर्तृ
शरीर- + कर्तृ शरीर- + कर्तृ, m. a father, Chr. 15, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकर्तृ|सुवर्णकर्त्तृ
सु-वर्ण- + कर्तृ सु-वर्ण- + कर्तृ, m. a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमकर्तृ
हेम- + कर्तृ हेम- + कर्तृ, m. a kind of bird (?), Man. 12, 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तृक|कर्त्तृक
ऽकर्तृक -कर्तृ + क, a substitute for कर्तृ, when the latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. स-, adj., f. का, Accompanied by an agent, Bhāṣāp. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तृत्व|कर्तृत्वं|कर्त्तृत्व
कर्तृत्व कर्तृ + त्व, n. Being agent, MBh. 3, 1232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्तरि|कर्तरि
कर्त्तरि and री कर्त्तरी̆ (for कर्त्त्री, i. e. कृत् + तृ + ई), f. Scissors, Suśr. 2, 13, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्र्
† कर्त्र् कर्त्र्, or कर्त् कर्त्, or कत्र् कत्र्, i. 10, Par. To loosen (akin to कृत्, a denominative).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्त्रिका
कर्त्त्रिका कर्त्त्रिका, i. e. 1. कृत् + तृ + ई + क, f. A hunter's knife, Hit. 43, 19 v. r.<BR> --With कर्त्तृ, cf. Lat. culter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्द्
† कर्द् कर्द्, i. 1, Par. To grumble, as the bowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्दम|कर्दमः|कर्द्दम|कर्द्दमं|कर्द्दमः
कर्दम कर्दम,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Mud, Yājñ. 1, 197; Rām. 3, 78, 31 (रुधिरकर्दम, Gore, Pañc. iii. d. 107).<BR> 2. Dregs, MBh. 14, 2683.<BR> 3. A certain plant, Suśr. 2, 100, 20.<BR> 4. The name of a Nāga, MBh. 1, 1561; of a Prajāpati, 12, 2211.<BR> II. adj. Soiled, Suśr. 2, 309, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षारकर्दम|क्षारकर्दमः
क्षार- + कर्दम क्षार- + कर्दम, m. the name of a hell, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यक्षकर्दम|यक्षकर्दमः|यक्षकर्द्दम|यक्षकर्द्दमः
यक्ष- + कर्दम यक्ष- + कर्दम, m. a sort of perfumed paste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पट|कर्पटं|कर्पटः
कर्पट कर्पट (this and some of the following words seem to be derived from a base कर्प् = Lat. carpo), m. and n. Rags, Pañc. 236, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पण|कर्पणः
कर्पण कर्पण (see the last), A spear, Daśak. 56, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पर|कर्परः
कर्पर कर्पर (see कर्पट), n.<BR> 1. A pot, Pañc. 218, 11.<BR> 2. A potsherd, Pañc. 217, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटकर्पर|घटकर्परः
घट- + कर्पर घट- + कर्पर, m. a broken jar, Ghaṭak. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पास|कर्पासं|कर्पासः
कर्पास कर्पास (see कर्पट), m. and n. Cotton, Suśr. 2, 481, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पूर्
कर्पूर् कर्पूर्, a denominative derived from the next, Par. To smell like camphor, Lass. 67, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पूर|कर्पूरं|कर्पूरः
कर्पूर कर्पूर, m. and n. Camphor, Pañc. 47, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ब्
† कर्ब् कर्ब्, and कम्ब् कम्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बु
कर्बु कर्बु, adj. Of a spotted or variegated colour, Yājñ. 3, 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बुर|कर्बुरः|कर्ब्बुरं|कर्ब्बुरः
कर्बुर कर्बु + र, or कर्वुर कर्वर (with ब् for व्), adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Of a variegated colour, Suśr. 1, 40, 12.<BR> 2. Grey, Kumāras. 4, 27.<BR> --Cf. probably Κέρβερος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मक
ऽकर्मक -कर्मक, i. e. कर्मन् + क, A substitute for कर्मन् when the latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. अद्भुत-, adj. One who has done surprising works, MBh. 3, 8102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकर|कर्मकरः|कर्म्मकर|कर्म्मकरः
कर्मकर कर्मकर, i. e. कर्मन्-कृ + अ, adj., f. री, A hired labourer, a servant, Pañc. 10, 4; Kathās. 13, 94.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकर्मकर
गृह- + कर्मकर गृह- + कर्मकर, m. a domestic servant, Pañc. 30, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकार|कर्मकारः|कर्म्मकार|कर्म्मकारः
कर्मकार कर्मकार, i. e. कर्मन्-कृ + अ, adj. A hired labourer, Pañc. 116, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0164-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकृत्|कर्म्मकृत्
कर्मकृत् कर्मकृत्, i. e. कर्मन्-कृ + त्, m. A workman, Rājat. 5, 90.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्मकृत्
