स्वकर्मकृत्|स्वकर्म्मकृत्
स्व- + कर्मकृत् स्व- + कर्मकृत्, m. an independent workman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मज|कर्मजः|कर्म्मज|कर्म्मजः
कर्मज कर्मज, i. e. कर्मन्-ज (vb. जन्), adj. Proceeding from actions, Man. 12, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मठ|कर्मठः|कर्म्मठ|कर्म्मठः
कर्मठ कर्मठ (base कर्मन्, probably a dialect. form of कर्मस्थ), adj. Eager, Rājat. 5, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मतस्
कर्मतस् कर्मतस्, i. e. कर्मन् + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. Out of one's works (or with, etc. ?), Man. 12, 98.<BR> 2. Concerning one's business, Daśak. in Chr. 186, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मन्|कर्म्मन्
कर्मन् कर्मन्, i. e. कृ + मण्, n.<BR> 1. Action, Bhāṣāp. 5; Sāv. 2, 28.<BR> 2. Work, Śāk. 22, 17.<BR> 3. Business, Bhag. 18, 42 sqq.; Pañc. 7, 9.<BR> 4. Religious action as sacrifice, etc., Chr. 296, 2 = Rigv. i. 112, 2.<BR> 5. The actions of a former life as the cause of men's subsequent births and fate, Pañc. v. d. 77; cf. कर्मतस्, and Pañc. 134, 9.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुतकर्मन्|अद्भुतकर्म्मन्
