केशकर्मन्|केशकर्म्मन्
केश- + कर्मन् केश- + कर्मन्, n. dressing of the hair, MBh. 4, 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्मन्|क्रूरकर्म्मन्
क्रूर- + कर्मन् क्रूर- + कर्मन्,<BR> I. n. 1. a cruel deed, Suśr. 1, 106, 1. 2. a hard work, Śāk. d. 37 v. r.<BR> II. adj. 1. practising cruel deeds, Pañc. i. d. 74. 2. f. अणी, cruel, Rām. 2, 75, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकर्मन्
गृह- + कर्मन् गृह- + कर्मन्, n. domestic business, Pañc. 121, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राम्यकर्मन्|ग्राम्यकर्म्मन्
ग्राम्य- + कर्मन् ग्राम्य- + कर्मन्, n. sensual pleasure, Bhāg. P. 5, 14, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

