कल्कक
ऽकल्कक -कल्क + क, a substitute for the last, when the latter part of comp. adj., अ- adj. Candid, MBh. 3, 4053.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्कन|कल्कनं
