कल्कि|कल्किः
कल्कि कल्कि (MBh. 3, 13111), and कल्किन् कल्किन् (MBh. 3, 13101), m. A name of Viṣṇu in his tenth or future avatāra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्प|कल्पः
कल्प कल्प, i. e. कॢप् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. पा.<BR> 1. Able, Bhāg. P. 1, 6, 7; with infin., 4, 13, 42.<BR> 2. Being a match for, able to protect (with gen.), Bhāg. P. 8, 23, 22.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A sacred precept, Man. 5, 74.<BR> 2. A rule, Man. 3, 147.<BR> 3. Performance, MBh. 13, 4728; usage, Daśak. in Chr. 189, 17; an act, Śāk. 99, 15.<BR> 4. Manner, Man. 1, 112.<BR> 5. The rules concerning rites, one of the six Vedāngas, Man. 2, 140.<BR> 6. A designation of Viṣṇu as containing all the [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-b " target="_blank">Page0169-b + 44</a>] sacred precepts, MBh. 13, 953; of Śiva, 12, 10368.<BR> 7. A day of Brahman, a period of 1000 yugas, the duration of the world, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 23.<BR> 8. Toxicology, Suśr. 1, 8, 5.<BR> --<BR> III. Comp.<BR> when the latter part of a comp. adj., f. पा, almost like, Rām. 1, 5, 21; 3, 52, 46.<BR> अ-, adj. unable, with loc., Bhāg. P. 7, 12, 23; with infin., 4, 3, 21.<BR> पुरा-, m. 1. a former creation, Man. 9, 227. 2. a tale of past ages.<BR> पूर्व-, m. time of old, MBh. 9, 2732.<BR> प्रथम-, m. a principal rule, Man. 11, 30.<BR> प्रसन्न- (vb. सद्), adj. almost quiet, Daśak. in Chr. 200, 6.<BR> यथा-कल्प + म्, adv. according to rule, Rām. 1, 11, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पक|कल्पकः
कल्पक कल्प + क, m. Rite, MBh. 14, 1571.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पन|कल्पनं
कल्पन कल्पन, i. e. कॢप् + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Determination, Prab. 111, 8.<BR> 2. Caparisoning or decorating an elephant, Daśak. 53, 13.<BR> 3. Ornament, MBh. 13, 2784.<BR> II. f. ना.<BR> 1. A rule, Man. 9, 116.<BR> 2. Performance, Mṛcch. 47, 17.<BR> 3. Making, Bhāg. P. 2, 5, 42; 4, 18, 32.<BR> 4. Imagination.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

