कल्माष|कल्माषः
कल्माष कल्माष (cf. the last),<BR> I. adj., f. षी, Of a mixed or variegated [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0170-a " target="_blank">Page0170-a + 40</a>] colour, spotted, MBh. 2, 1043; Rām. 1, 52, 20.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga, MBh. 1, 1552.<BR> III. f. षी,<BR> 1. A cow of variegated colour, Rām. 5, 13, 16.<BR> 2. The name of a river, MBh. 2, 2575.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0169-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषपाद|कल्माषपादः
