कामचार|कामचारः
कामचार कामचार, i. e. काम-चर् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Going as one lists, MBh. 13, 4175.<BR> II. m. Free will, intention, Yājñ. 2, 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामचारतस्
कामचारतस् कामचार + तस्, adv. Through sensual indulgence, Man. 2, 220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामज|कामजः
कामज काम-ज (vb. जन्), adj. Produced from love of pleasure, Man. 7, 46; 9, 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामठ
कामठ कामठ, i. e. कमठ + अ, adj. Belonging or proper to the tortoise, Rām. 1, 45, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामतस्
कामतस् काम + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. By inclination, Man. 3, 12.<BR> 2. At one's pleasure, 5, 90.<BR> 3. Intentionally, 4, 207.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकामतस्
अ- + कामतस् अ- + कामतस्, adv. 1. unwillingly, Man. 2, 181. 2. unintentionally, 9, 242.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामत्व
कामत्व काम-त्व, n. Love of pleasure, Lass. 40, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामदुघ
