कामन्दकि|कामन्दकिः
कामन्दकि कामन्दकि, patron. (कमन्दक + इ). A proper name, Pañc. 122, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काममय
काममय काम + मय, adj., f. यी, Meeting all wishes, Rām. 4, 33, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामया
