कामरसिक
कामरसिक कामरसिक, i. e. काम-रस + इक, adj. Libidinous, Bhartṛ. 3, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामरूपधर
कामरूपधर कामरूपधर, i. e. काम-रूप-धृ + अ, adj., f. रा, Changing one's shape as one lists, Rām. 1, 9, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामरूपिन्
कामरूपिन् कामरूपिन्, i. e. कामरूप + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Changing one's shape as one lists, MBh. 3, 367.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामल|कामलः
कामल कामल,<BR> I. (m. and) f. ला, A disease of the bile, Suśr. 1, 193, 15.<BR> II. f. ली, A proper name, Hariv. 1453.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामलिन्
