कामात्मन्
कामात्मन् कामात्मन्, i. e. काम-आत्मन्, adj. Voluptuous, Man. 7, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिक|कामिकः
कामिक कामिक, i. e. काम + इक,<BR> I. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a " target="_blank">Page0177-a + 43</a>] adj., f. की.<BR> 1. Wished, wish, MBh. 13, 6025.<BR> 2. Wishing, 1969.<BR> 3. In सर्वकामिक the aff. इक belongs to the comp. सर्व-काम, Attaining all one's desires, MBh. 3, 13860.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0176-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिता
कामिता कामिता, i. e. कामिन् + ता, f. Love, Hit. i. d. 104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिन्
कामिन् कामिन्, i. e. कम + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Desiring, MBh. 13, 7060.<BR> 2. Having sexual intercourse, MBh. 1, 4185.<BR> II. m. A lover, MBh. 4, 978.<BR> III. f. नी, A beloved one, Man. 8, 112.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकामिन्
अ- + कामिन् अ- + कामिन्, m. one who is not in love, Pañc. i. d. 180.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामकामिन्
काम- + कामिन् काम- + कामिन्, adj. fostering wishes, Bhag. 2, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वकामिन्
सर्व- + कामिन् सर्व- + कामिन्, i. e. सर्वकाम + इन्, adj. abounding in all pleasures, Sund. 1, 31 (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामुक|कामुकः
कामुक कामुक, i. e. कम् + उक,<BR> I. adj., f. का and की, Desirous, Rām. 2, 74, 7.<BR> II. m. A lover, Rām. 5, 16, 42.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चितानेककामुक
वञ्चितानेक- + कामुक वञ्चितानेक- + कामुक, i. e. वञ्चित-अन्-एक-, adj., f. का, one who has deceived many lovers, Kathās. 12, 190.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामुकत्व
कामुकत्व कामुक + त्व, n. Lasciviousness, Megh. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्पिल्य|काम्पिल्यः
काम्पिल्य काम्पिल्य, i. e. काम्पिल (the name of a country) + य,<BR> I. adj., f. या, Belonging to Kāmpila, Kathās. 25, 53; with पुर or पुरी, or without a subst., ntr. Its capital, MBh. 1, 5512; Rām. 1, 34, 46; Chr. 52, 14.<BR> II. m. A proper name, Bhāg. P. 9, 21, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्बोज|कांबोज|कांबोजः|काम्बोजः
काम्बोज काम्बोज, i. e. कम्बोज + अ,<BR> I. adj. Originating from Kamboja, Rām. 5, 12, 36.<BR> II. m. The king of Kamboja, MBh. 1, 6995.<BR> III. m. pl. The name of the people and of the country of Kamboja, MBh. 1, 2668.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्य|काम्यं
काम्य काम्य, i. e.<BR> I. the ptcple. of the fut. pass. of कम्.<BR> 1. Amiable, Ragh. 6, 30.<BR> 2. Agreeable, Rām. 5, 43, 13.<BR> 3. Precious, Rām. 2, 25, 9.<BR> II. काम + य, adj. Connected with a wish, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b " target="_blank">Page0177-b + 43</a>] interested, Man. 12, 89.<BR> III. f. या, The name of an Apsaras, MBh. 1, 4820.<BR> IV. f. या, Desire, Man. 5, 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतरकाम्या
इतरेतरकाम्या इतरेतरकाम्या, i. e. इतर-इतर-, f.; instr. sing. according to their several fancies, Man. 3, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वद्धितकाम्या
त्वद्धितकाम्या त्वद्धितकाम्या, i. e. त्वद्-हित-, f. desire of benefitting thee, Chr. 15, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बधकाम्या
बध-काम्या बध-काम्या, f. intention to hurt, Man. 4, 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वकाम्य
सर्व-काम्य सर्व-काम्य, adj. deserving to be wished for by every one, Sund. 4, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हितकाम्या
हित- + काम्या हित- + काम्या, f. या, concern for another's welfare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्यक|काम्यकः
काम्यक काम्य + क, n. The name of a forest, MBh. 3, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्यता
काम्यता काम्य + ता f. Beauty, MBh. 13, 1032.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काय|कायं|कायः
काय काय,<BR> I. (base क, a name of the god Prajāpati).<BR> 1. m. A nuptial form called Prājāpatya, Man. 3, 38.<BR> 2. n. The root of the little finger, Man. 2, 59.<BR> II. i. e. चि + अ, m. The body, Bhag. 5, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकाय|अतिकायः
अति- + काय अति- + काय,<BR> I. adj. gigantic, Rām. 5, 56, 124.<BR> II. m. the name of a Rākṣasa, Rām. 6, 51, 3 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकाय|पूर्वकायः
पूर्व- + काय पूर्व- + काय, m. the fore-part of the body, Śāk. d. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्काय
यशः-काय यशः-काय, m. a body consisting of glory, i. e. glory, Bhartṛ. 2, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वर्णकाय|स्वर्णकायः|स्वर्ण्णकाय
स्वर्ण- + काय स्वर्ण- + काय, m. Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कायस्थ|कायस्थः
कायस्थ काय-स्थ (vb. स्था), m. A mixed tribe or caste, the writer caste; a writer, Rājat. 5, 174; 264; 438.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कायिक|कायिकः
कायिक कायिक, i. e. काय + इक, adj., f. का (Man. 8, 153) and की.<BR> 1. Corporeal, bodily Man. 12, 8; Suśr. 1, 12, 2.<BR> 2. (viz. वृद्धि, Immoderate profits) from a pledge to be used by way of interest, Man. 8, 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार|कारः
1. कार कार, i. e. कृ + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. री. Latter part of a comp. adj. Making, a maker of, e. g. अन्ध-कार, माल-कार, रथ-कार.<BR> दन्त-, m. An artist in ivory, Rām. 2, 83, 14.<BR> द्यूत- (vb. दिव्) m. A gamester, Pañc. i. d. 431. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a " target="_blank">Page0178-a + 45</a>]<BR> पर्व(न्)-, adj. Working at festivals.<BR> भस्म(न्)-, m. A washerman.<BR> सु-वर्ण-, स्वर्ण-, and हेम-, m. A goldsmith.<BR> II. m. Latter part of comp. substantives, Making action. Cf. e. g. काम-कार, पुरुष-कार; especially used after letters to form their name, e. g. अ-कार, the letter अ; उ-कार, the letter उ; म-कार, the letter म(म्), Man. 2, 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0177-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार|कारः
2. कार कार, i. e. कर + अ, adj. Produced by hail, Suśr. 1, 170, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारक|कारकं|कारकः
कारक कारक, i. e. कृ + अक,<BR> I. adj., f. रिका, Making. Latter part of nominal comps., e. g. क्षेम-, adj. Causing security, Pañc. v. d. 89.<BR> गृक-, m. A carpenter, Yājñ. 3, 146.<BR> प्रिय-, adj. Causing love, Man. 7, 204; गुरु-वचन-, adj. Performing the order of one's teacher; मङ्गल-, adj. Giving joy, MBh. 2, 1925; शिल्प-, adj. Versed in an art, Mālav. 65, 15.<BR> II. m. An agent; doing, Yājñ. 2, 233; causing, 3, 150; an author, MBh. 13, 247.<BR> सिंह-, m. A maker of lions, Pañc. v. d. 31.<BR> III. f. रिका, A metrical explanation, a memorial verse, MBh. 2, 453.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारण|कारणं
कारण कारण, i. e. कृ, Caus., + अन.<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Motive, Pañc. iii. d. 99.<BR> 2. Cause, Suśr. 1, 310, 4; Kathās. 3, 31 (with the loc.).<BR> 3. Primary cause, Man. 5, 152; Bhartṛ. 2, 82.<BR> 4. An element, Yājñ. 3, 148.<BR> 5. Basis, Man. 11, 84.<BR> 6. Argument, Nal. 16, 27; proof, Man. 8, 200.<BR> 7. An instrument, a means, Rām. 1, 65, 10 (cf. Gorr. 1, 67, 4, who reads उपायैः).<BR> 8. An organ of sense, Ragh. 16, 22.<BR> 9. Abl. कारणात्, and loc. णे, On account of, Rām. 5, 56, 136; 5, 28, 9. Instr. णेन, By some reason, Cāṇ. 23.<BR> येन कारणेन, Because, Pañc. 175, 10.<BR> किं पुनः कारणम्, From what motive, MBh. 1, 3600.<BR> II. f. णा, Torture, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 16.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकारण|अकारणं
अ- + कारण अ- + कारण, adj. 1. unreasonable, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b " target="_blank">Page0178-b + 41</a>] Pañc. 246, 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकारणम्
अ-कारणम् अ-कारणम् and अ-कारणेन, without cause, Vikr. d. 54; Yājñ. 2, 234.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्नकारणम्
अन्न-कारणम् अन्न-कारणम्, on account of (supplying) food, Man. 5, 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्यकारण|कार्य्यकारण
कार्य- + कारण कार्य- + कारण, n. aim and motive, Pañc. i. d. 462.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कारण|निष्कारणं
निष्कारण निष्कारण, i. e. निस्-, adj. 1. not proceeding from any cause, Bhāg. P. 8, 3, 15. 2. disinterested, Pañc. ed. orn. 41, 19. 3. Acc. णम्, and abl. णात्, adv. without a special motive, MBh. 12, 4993; Rām. 6, 10, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्कारणम्
यत्कारणम् यत्कारणम्, and णात्, i. e. यद्-, adv. because, Pañc. 30, 21; 135, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारणतस्
कारणतस् कारण + तस्, adv. By some reason, Ragh. 10, 19.<BR> कार्य-, adv. From the relation of cause and effect, Hit. i. d. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारणता
कारणता कारण + ता, f., and कारणत्व कारण + त्व, n. Causality, Kumāras. 2, 6; Bhāṣāp. 14. Being the cause, Bhāg. P. 3, 26, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारणिक|कारणिकः
कारणिक कारणिक, i. e. करण + इक, m. A judge, Pañc. 237, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारण्डव|कारंडव|कारंडवः|कारण्डवः
कारण्डव कारण्डव, m. A sort of duck, Rām. 2, 27, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारंधम
कारंधम कारंधम, i. e. करंधम + अ, patron.<BR> I. m. MBh. 14, 63.<BR> II. n. The name of a holy place, MBh. 1, 7843.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारयितृ
कारयितृ कारयितृ, i. e. कृ, Caus., + तृ, m. Giving the power of acting, MBh. 3, 7000; Man. 12, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारा
कारा कारा, f. A gaol, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारावर|कारावरः
कारावर कारावर, m. The name of a mixed caste, viz. of the offspring of a Niṣāda by a Vaidehī woman, Man. 10, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारिन्
कारिन् कारिन्, i. e. क्रि + इन्, adj., f. इणी, An agent, Rām. 2, 78, 8; MBh. 13, 4804; acting, Man. 7, 26.<BR> --It is generally [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0179-a " target="_blank">Page0179-a + 41</a>] the latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. अ-कार्य-, adj.<BR> 1. One who does a wrong action, Man. 11, 239.<BR> 2. One who does not what ought to be done, i. e. who neglects his duty, Man. 5, 107.<BR> अ-क्लिष्ट-, adj. Indefatigable, Rām. 3, 31, 1.<BR> आप्त-, adj. Acting properly, Man. 9, 12 (in a trustworthy manner).<BR> केश-, m. f. इणी, A hair-dresser, MBh. 4, 412.<BR> क्षिप्र-, adj. Clever, Rām. 3, 36, 10.<BR> गृह-, m. A kind of wasp. Man. 12, 66.<BR> तत्कर्मकारिन्, i. e. तद्-कर्मन्-, adj. Doing the same, Man. 9, 261.<BR> दृढ-, adj. Persevering in good actions, Man. 4, 246.<BR> विघ्न-, adj.<BR> 1. Obstructing.<BR> 2. Fearful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0178-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारीष|कारीषं
कारीष कारीष, i. e. करीष + अ,<BR> I. adj. Sprung up from dung, Suśr. 1, 224, 11.<BR> II. n. A great quantity of dung, Hariv. 4355.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारु|कारुः
कारु कारु, i. e. कृ + उ, adj. and s., f. रू, Working, an artisan, Man. 8, 360.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0179-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारुक|कारुकः
