कार्य|कार्य्य|कार्य्यं
कार्य कार्य,<BR> I. ptcple. of the fut. pass. of 1. कृ, cf. कृ.<BR> 1. What ought to be made, to be done, etc., Man. 3, 248; superl. कार्यतम, That which must be done first, Rām. 5, 77, 16.<BR> 2. With an instr. To be used; use, Pañc. i. d. 81 (तृणेन कार्यं भवतीश्वराणाम्, kings use a blade of grass); with न, No use, Rām. 1, 30, 5 (we do not care for possessing the earth); 2, 21, 60 (I am indifferent to life and joy).<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Intention, Rām. 1, 18, 15.<BR> 2. Duty, Man. 3, 80.<BR> 3. Service, Man. 10, 47.<BR> 4. Business, Man. 9, 299; affairs, 7, 59.<BR> 5. A law-suit, 8, 43.<BR> 6. Effect, Vedāntas. in Chr. 207, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0180-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

