काल|कालं|कालः
2. काल काल (cf. कलङ्क),<BR> I. adj., f. ली, Dark blue, black, Rām. 6, 67, 2; MBh. 16, 57.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A black and poisonous snake, Coluber naga, Lass. 16, 13.<BR> 2. The black in the eye, Suśr. 2, 336, 20.<BR> 3. A name of Rudra, Bhāg. P. 3, 12, 12.<BR> 4. A proper name, Hariv. 189.<BR> 5. The name of a mountain, Rām. 4, 44, 21.<BR> III. f. ला.<BR> 1. The name of several plants, Suśr. 1, 131, 19, etc.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2520.<BR> 3. The name of a female demon, Hariv. 11552.<BR> IV. f. ली.<BR> 1. A name of Durgā, MBh. 4, 195.<BR> 2. A surname of Satyāvatī, Chr. 6, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. κελαινός, etc., under कलङ्क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

