काष्ठमय
काष्ठमय काष्ठ + मय, adj., f. यी. Made of wood, Man. 2, 157.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काष्ठलोष्टमय
काष्ठलोष्टमय काष्ठ-लोष्ट-मय, adj., f. यी, Made of wood or clay, Man. 8, 289.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काष्ठा
काष्ठा काष्ठा, f.<BR> 1. Aim, MBh. 3, 10424; limit, boundary, Kumāras. 5, 28.<BR> 2. Place, Bhāg. P. 3, 18, 12.<BR> 3. A quarter or point of the compass, Bhāg. P. 4, 24, 1.<BR> 4. A lunar station, Bhāg. P. 1, 12, 31.<BR> 5. A measure of time, MBh. 1, 1292.<BR> 6. A proper name, Bhāg. P. 6, 6, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काष्ठिक|काष्ठिकः
काष्ठिक काष्ठिक, i. e. काष्ठ + इक,<BR> I. m. One who carries wood, Kathās. 6, 43.<BR> II. f. का, A small piece of wood, Pañc. 194, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कास्
कास् कास्, i. 1, Ātm. To cough, Suśr. 1, 38, 10.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. huosta; A.S. hvosta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कास|कासः
