कासवन्त्|कासवत्
कासवन्त् कास + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Subject to cough, Suśr. 2, 506, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासार|कासारं|कासारः
कासार कासार, m. A pond, Bhartṛ. 1, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कासिन्
