कासीस|कासीसं
कासीस कासीस, n. Green vitriol, Suśr. 1, 132, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काहल|काहलं|काहलः
काहल काहल, m. A large drum, Pañc. 20, 8. f. A musical instrument, probably a large drum, Rājat. 5, 464.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काहलि|काहलिः
काहलि काहलि, i. e. काहल + इ, m. A name of Śiva, MBh. 13, 1179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कि
