किञ्जल्क|किंजल्क|किञ्जल्कं|किंजल्कः|किञ्जल्कः
किञ्जल्क किञ्जल्क, m. A filament, especially of the lotus, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 43; 2, 2, 9; MBh. 3, 12880.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्जल्किन्
किञ्जल्किन् किञ्जल्किन्, i. e. किञ्जल्क + इन्, adj., f. नी, Consisting of filaments, Dev. 5, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट्
