किट्ट|किट्टं
किट्ट किट्ट, n. Excretion, dirt, Suśr. 1, 328, 14; with लौहम्, Rust of iron, Suśr. 2, 469, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किण|किणः
किण किण, m. A sear or callosity, Śāk. d. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किणवन्त्|किणवत्
