किल्
† किल् किल्, i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To be white.<BR> 2. To play.<BR> --i. 10, Par. केलय, To throw (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0187-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

