कु|कुः
1. कुऽ कु-, a contraction of क + व, from किम्. Former part of compound words, implying,<BR> I. Inferiority, wickedness, e. g. कु-कर्मन्,<BR> 1. n. A wicked action, Pañc. v. d. 64.<BR> 2. adj. Doing wicked actions, Bhāg. P. 1, 16, 22.<BR> कु-कृत्य, n. A shameful action, Pañc. 237, 21.<BR> कु-गो, m. An infirm bull, Rām. 6, 112, 6.<BR> कु-जननी, f. A bad mother, Rām. 6, 82, 118.<BR> कु-जन्मन्, adj. Having a bad origin, Bhāg. P. 4, 4, 22.<BR> कु-तनय, m. A son who has not turned out well, Pañc. i. d. 85.<BR> कु-तपस्विन्, m. A bad ascetic, Pañc. 126, 1.<BR> कु-तर्क, m. A false doctrine, Rājat. 5, 378.<BR> कु-दृष्ट, adj. Imperfectly seen, Pañc. v. d. 1.<BR> कु-दृष्टि, f. A false system, Man. 12, 95.<BR> कु-धी, adj. sbst. A fool, Pañc. i. d. 38.<BR> कु-नदिका, f. An insignificant rivulet, Pañc. i. d. 31.<BR> कु-पथ, m.<BR> 1. An erroneous way, Bhāg. P. 6, 7, 14. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0189-b " target="_blank">Page0189-b + 43</a>]<BR> 2. A proper name, Hariv. 203.<BR> कु-परीक्षक, m. A bad estimator, Bhartṛ. 2, 12.<BR> कु-परीक्षित, adj. Imperfectly examined, Pañc. v. d. 1.<BR> कु-पुत्र, m. A contemptible son, Man. 9, 161.<BR> कु-पुरुष, m.<BR> 1. A contemptible man, MBh. 13, 108.<BR> 2. A coward, 5, 5493.<BR> कु-प्लव, m. A frail boat, Man. 9, 161.<BR> कु-बुद्धि, adj.<BR> 1. Foolish, Bhāg. P. 5, 5, 17.<BR> 2. Mischievous, Pañc. i. d. 444.<BR> कु-भृत्य, m. A bad servant, Pañc. 83, 43.<BR> कु-मति,<BR> A. f.<BR> 1. Perversity, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 7.<BR> 2. Error, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 36.<BR> B. adj. Foolish, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 17.<BR> कु-मन्त्र, m. An evil advice, Bhāg. P. 3, 3, 13.<BR> कु-मन्त्रिन्, m. A bad counsellor, Rājat. 5, 455.<BR> कु-मार्ग, m. An erroneous way, Pañc. 122, 24.<BR> कु-मित्र, n. A false friend, Pañc. iii. d. 61.<BR> कु-मेधस्, adj. Mischievous, Bhāg. P. 3, 20, 33.<BR> कु-राजन्, m. A contemptible king, Pañc. v. d. 64.<BR> कु-रूप, adj. Ugly, Pañc. v. d. 17.<BR> कु-वर्ष, m. A heavy shower, Rām. 6, 89, 15.<BR> कु-वाक्य, n. Injurious speech, Pañc. v. d. 64.<BR> कु-विवाह, m. A culpable marriage, Man. 3, 63.<BR> कु-सचिव, m. A bad counsellor, Rājat. 5, 439.<BR> कु-सृति, adj. Walking in error; a sinner, Bhāg. P. 8, 23, 7.<BR> II. Surprise: How, cf. e. g. कुमार; how muc? cf. e. g. कुमुद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0189-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
2. कु कु, see कू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0189-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

