वनकुक्कुट|वनकुक्कुटः
वन- + कुक्कुट वन- + कुक्कुट, m. wild fowl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटक|कुक्कुटकः
कुक्कुटक कुक्कुट + क, m. A man of a mixed caste, one sprung from a Śūdra by a Niṣādī woman, Man. 10, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाण्डक
कुक्कुटाण्डक कुक्कुटाण्डक, i. e. कुक्कुट-अण्ड + क, A kind of rice, Suśr. 1, 196, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुभ|कुक्कुभः
कुक्कुभ कुक्कुभ, i. e. कुक्कु (onomatop.) -भ (vb. भा), m. A wild cock, Phasianus gallus, MBh. 13, 2835.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुर|कुक्कुरं|कुक्कुरः
कुक्कुर कुक्कुर.<BR> 1. see कुर्कुर.<BR> 2. m. The name of a muni, or sage, MBh. 2, 113.<BR> 3. m. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 1872.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्षि|कुक्षिः
कुक्षि कुक्षि (vb. कुच्), m.<BR> 1. The belly, Rām. 1, 70, 34.<BR> 2. Cavity, Pañc. i. d. 281.<BR> 3. A cavern, Ragh. 2, 38.<BR> 4. A bay, MBh. 3, 793.<BR> 5. A proper name, Rām. 1, 70, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्कुम|कुंकुम|कुंकुमं|कुङ्कुमं
कुङ्कुम कुङ्कुम, n. Saffron, Crocus sativus, Bhartṛ. 1, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुच्
कुच् कुच्, see कुञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुच|कुचः
कुच कुच, i. e. कुच् + अ, m. The female breast, Rām. 2, 29, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुज्
† कुज् कुज्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To steal or rob.<BR> 2. To be crooked (cf. कुञ्च्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुज|कुजः
कुज कुज, i. e. 3. कु-ज (vb. जन्), m. The planet Mars, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्च्|कुंच्
 I. कुञ्च् कुञ्च्, i. 1, and कुच् कुच्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b " target="_blank">Page0190-b + 41</a>] i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To straiten, to make narrow, Ṛt. 4, 16.<BR> 2. To bend, Rām. 5, 55, 27; Pañc. 50, 10.<BR> 3. To crisp, MBh. 1, 2170.<BR> II. † कुच् कुच्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To sound high.<BR> 2. To go.<BR> 3. To polish.<BR> 4. To be crooked.<BR> 5. To draw furrows.<BR> 6. To resist.<BR> --With the prepos. आ आ, आकुञ्चित,<BR> 1. Compressed, Rām. 3, 31, 21.<BR> 2. Contracted, Bhartṛ. 1, 3.<BR> 3. Crisped, MBh. 13, 882.<BR> --With वि वि, विकुञ्चित,<BR> 1. Frowning, MBh. 1, 4112.<BR> 2. Crisped, Ṛt. 3, 19.<BR> --Caus. कुञ्चय, To turn backwards (?), Rām. 5, 5, 18.<BR> --With सम् सम्, कुच्.<BR> 1. To contract one's self, Pañc. 3, 40.<BR> 2. To close, Daśak. in Chr. 184, 3.<BR> संकुचित,<BR> 1. Contracted, Bhartṛ. 3, 74.<BR> 2. Shut, Rām. 4, 30, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Caus. कोचय,<BR> 1. To contract, MBh. 1, 2843.<BR> 2. To diminish, Bhartṛ. 2, 37.<BR> --Cf. Lat. quic in conquinisco, conquexi, cûlus for cuc + lus; κύκλος; Goth. hauh; N.H.G. hucke in huckeback, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असंकुचित
अ-संकुचित अ-संकुचित, adj. not wrinkled, Suśr. 1, 66, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्चन|कुंचन|कुंचनं|कुञ्चनं
कुञ्चन कुञ्च् + अन, n. Shrinking, Suśr. 1, 251, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्चिका|कुंचिका
कुञ्चिका कुञ्चिका, i. e. कुञ्च् + अक, f. A key, Bhartṛ. 1, 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्ज्|कुंज्
† कुञ्ज् कुञ्ज्, i. 1, Par. To make any inarticulate sound.<BR> --Cf. कूज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्ज|कुंज|कुंजं|कुंजः|कुञ्जः
कुञ्ज कुञ्ज, m.<BR> 1. A place overgrown with creeping plants, a bower, Megh. 19.<BR> 2. A cavern, Rām. 4, 26, 6; Ragh. 9, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुञ्जर|कुंजर|कुंजरः|कुञ्जरः
कुञ्जर कुञ्जर (probably akin to the preceding), m.<BR> 1. An elephant, Pañc. i. d. 177.<BR> 2. Preeminent, Rām. 5, 2, 13; in this meaning it is generally the latter part of a compound, e. g. कपि-, m. A most excellent monkey [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a " target="_blank">Page0191-a + 41</a>] (literally, an elephant among monkeys), Rām. 5, 3, 17.<BR> 3. The name of a Nāga, or serpent, MBh. 1, 1560.<BR> 4. The name of a prince, 3, 15597.<BR> 5. The name of a mountain, Rām. 4, 41, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0190-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्
1. कुट् कुट्, i. 6, Par. To bend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्
2. कुट् कुट् (akin to कृत्, based on कर्त्), i. 4, Par. To burst, Lass. 95, 15.<BR> --† i. 10, कोटय, To cut.<BR> --With the prepos. अव अव, To diminish, Suśr. 2, 175, 20.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To divide, MBh. 1, 2842.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटज|कुटजः
कुटज कुट-ज (vb. जन्), m. A medicinal plant, Wrightia antidysenterica, Megh. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिक
कुटिक कुट् + इक,<BR> I. adj. Crooked, MBh. 3, 13454.<BR> II. f. का, The name of a river, Rām. 2, 71, 15 (Gorr. 2, 73, 13, reads कुटिला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिकोष्टिका
कुटिकोष्टिका कुटिकोष्टिका, f. The name of a river Rām. 2, 71, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिल|कुटिलं
कुटिल कुट् + इल,<BR> I. adj., f. ला,<BR> 1. Crooked, Rām. 1, 44, 25.<BR> 2. Crisped, Bhāg. P. 3, 33, 14.<BR> 3. Frowning, Rām. 5, 89, 2.<BR> 4. Deceitful, Pañc. i. d. 73; cf. अ-कुटिल, adj. Candid, Pañc. i. d. 142.<BR> II. f. ला, The name of a river, Rām. 2, 73, 13, Gorr. (cf. कुटिक); 4, 40, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिलक
कुटिलक कुटिल + क,<BR> I. adj. Crisped, Pañc. i. d. 225.<BR> II. f. कुटिलिका, A kind of motion on the stage, Vikr. 62, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटी
कुटी कुट् + ई, f.<BR> 1. A hut, Man. 11, 72.<BR> 2. A vessel serving for fumigation, Suśr. 2, 33, 18.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकुटी
अश्व- + कुटी अश्व- + कुटी, f. a stable, Pañc. 254, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकुटी
पर्ण- + कुटी पर्ण- + कुटी, f. a hut made of leaves, Rām. 2, 92, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रमत्कुटी
भ्रमत्कुटी भ्रमत्कुटी, i. e. भ्रमन्त्-, f. a sort of umbrella.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीचक|कुटीचकः
कुटीचक कुटी-चक् + अ, m. A class of religious mendicants, Bhāg. P. 3, 12, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीर|कुटीरं|कुटीरः
कुटीर कुटी + र, n.<BR> 1. A hut, Gīt. 1, 27.<BR> 2. Sexual intercourse, Bhartṛ. 3, 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीरक|कुटीरकः
कुटीरक कुटीर + क, n. A hut, Amar. 48.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणकुटीरक
तृण- + कुटीरक तृण- + कुटीरक, a hut made of grass, Pañc. 34, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्ब्
† कुटुम्ब् कुटुम्ब्, i. 10 (rather a denom. derived from the next), Ātm. To support a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुंबं|कुटुम्बः
कुटुम्ब कुटुम्ब, n.<BR> 1. Household, Śāk. d. 95.<BR> 2. Family, Man. 11, 22.<BR> 3. Family goods, Man. 9, 199.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजयरथकुटुम्ब
विजय-रथ-कुटुम्ब विजय-रथ-कुटुम्ब, adj. taking care of Vijaya's chariot as a father would a household, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बक|कुटुंबक|कुटुंबकं
कुटुम्बक कुटुम्ब + क, n. Family, Hit. i. d. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिक|कुटुंबिक|कुटुंबिकः|कुटुम्बिकः
कुटुम्बिक कुटुम्बिक, i. e. कुटुम्ब + इक, adj. Taking care of one's family, MBh. 13, 4401.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिन्|कुटुंबिन्
कुटुम्बिन् कुटुम्बिन्, i. e. कुटुम्ब + इन्, m.<BR> 1. A householder, Man. 3, 80; f. इनी, The wife of a householder, MBh. 3, 13660.<BR> 2. A kinsman, Pañc. 96, 4.<BR> 3. A cultivator of the soil, Rājat. 5, 468.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथकुटुम्बिन्|रथकुटुंबिन्
रथ- + कुटुम्बिन् रथ- + कुटुम्बिन्, m. a charioteer, Rām. 6, 89, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट्
कुट्ट् कुट्ट् (a form of कृत्, based on कर्त्),<BR> I. i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. † To cut.<BR> 2. To cut in a defective manner, Suśr. 1, 361, 19.<BR> 3. † To censure.<BR> 4. To multiply.<BR> II. † i. 10, Ātm., v. r. of कूट्.<BR> --With the prepos. वि वि, Par. To cut off, MBh. 13, 3305.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट|कुट्टः
कुट्ट कुट्ट् + अ, adj., f. टी,<BR> 1. Latter part of compound words, e. g. अश्मकुट्ट, i. e. अश्मन्-, adj. Breaking with a stone, Man. 6, 17.<BR> 2. A multiplier.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काष्ठकुट्ट|काष्ठकुट्टः
काष्ठ- + कुट्ट काष्ठ- + कुट्ट, m. the woodpecker, Picus Bengalensis, Pañc. 157, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रकुट्ट|ताम्रकुट्टः
ताम्र- + कुट्ट ताम्र- + कुट्ट, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a " target="_blank">Page0192-a + 40</a>] m. a coppersmith, Rām. 2, 90, 25 Gorr. (thus to be read instead of -कुट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टक|कुट्टकः
कुट्टक कुट्ट + क,<BR> 1. adj. = कुट्ट 1. Yājñ. 3, 49.<BR> 2. = कुट्ट 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टनी
कुट्टनी कुट्टनी, and कुट्टिनी कुट्टिनी, f. A procuress or bawd, Hit. i. d. 9; Prab. 14, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिम|कुट्टिमः
कुट्टिम कुट्टिम (cf. कुट्ट्),<BR> I. adj., f. मा, Plastered with small stones, Rām. 2, 80, 13.<BR> II. m. and n. A floor or ground smoothed and plastered, MBh. 14, 2522; 1, 6964; Mālav. 21, d. 27.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रकुट्टिम|वस्त्रकुट्टिमं
वस्त्र- + कुट्टिम वस्त्र- + कुट्टिम, n. 1. an umbrella. 2. a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्मल
कुट्मल कुट् + मल, m. and n.<BR> 1. An opening bud, Mṛcch. 10, 10.<BR> 2. Opening, Rām. 4, 38, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठार|कुठारः
कुठार कुठार, m. (and f. री),<BR> I. An axe, Rām. 2, 35, 41.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga or serpent, MBh. 1, 2156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारिक|कुठारिकः
कुठारिक कुठारिक, i. e. कुठार + इक,<BR> I. m. A wood-cutter, Rājat. 5, 310.<BR> II. f. का, A small axe, Bhartṛ. 3, 23. A lancet, Suśr. 1, 26, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्
† कुड् कुड्, i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To act as a child.<BR> 2. To eat.<BR> 3. To heap.<BR> 4. To dive(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडव|कुडवः
कुडव कुडव, m. A measure of grain, etc., described as a vessel four fingers wide and as many deep, containing twelve handfuls; the fourth part of a Prastha, MBh. 14, 2722.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मल|कुड्मलः
कुड्मल कुड्मल (cf. कुट्मल),<BR> I. m. An opening bud, Ṛt. 2, 25.<BR> II. adj. Opening, MBh. 4, 393.<BR> III. n. A kind of hell, Man. 4, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मलित
