कुड्य|कुड्यं
कुड्य कुड्य, n. A wall, Yājñ. 2, 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्
† कुण् कुण्, i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To sound.<BR> 2. To cherish; to support (or to pain).<BR> --i. 10, Par. कुणय,<BR> 1. To address.<BR> 2. To converse with.<BR> 3. To invite.<BR> --Cf. क्वण्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणप|कुणपः
