कुणि|कुणिः
कुणि कुणि (probably a form of कुष् + नि, cf. कूण्), m.<BR> 1. A cripple with a crooked or withered arm, MBh. 3, 1270.<BR> 2. The name of a prince, Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ट्
† कुण्ट् कुण्ट्, i. 1, Par. To maim (? v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठ्|कुंठ्
कुण्ठ् कुण्ठ्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. † To be maimed.<BR> 2. † To be lazy.<BR> --† i. 10, Par. To cover (? v. r.).<BR> कुण्ठित,<BR> 1. Blunt, Kumāras. 2, 20.<BR> 2. Powerless, Rājat. 5, 138.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि, विकुण्ठित, Blunted, Ragh. 5, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

