होमकुण्ड|होमकुंड|होमकुण्डं
होम- + कुण्ड होम- + कुण्ड, n. a hole in the ground for receiving the fire for an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डक|कुण्डकः
