कुण्डल|कुंडल|कुंडलं|कुण्डलं|कुंडलः|कुण्डलः
कुण्डल कुण्डल.<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. A ring, Bhāg. P. 5, 23, 3.<BR> 2. An ear-ring, Bhartṛ. 2, 63.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga, MBh. 1, 2154.<BR> III. f. ला, A proper name, Mārk. P. 21, 34.<BR> --When the latter part of a comp. adj., the f. is ला, e. g. शैल-, adj., f. ला, Surrounded by mountains, MBh. 3, 10943.<BR> स-, adj. With earrings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलिन्|कुंडलिन्
कुण्डलिन् कुण्डलिन्, i. e. कुण्डल + इन्, adj., f. नी, Having earrings, MBh. 1, 7005.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डाशिन्|कुंडाशिन्
