कुतप|कुतपः
कुतप कु-तप् + अ, m. and n.<BR> 1. A blanket made of the hair of the mountain goat, Man. 3, 234.<BR> 2. The eighth portion of the day, about noon, MBh. 13, 6040.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतस्
कुतस् कुतस्, i. e. क + व + तस् (cf. किम् and कु), adv.<BR> 1. = Abl. of किम्, Lass. 13, 14.<BR> 2. From what place, Hiḍ. 2, 24.<BR> 3. Whence, Rām. 1, 14, 36.<BR> 4. Whither, Bhāg. P. 8, 19, 34.<BR> 5. Why, Rām. 3, 1, 12.<BR> 6. How, Brāhmaṇ. 1, 28.<BR> 7. How much less? Indr. 1, 17.<BR> 8. With following अपि, From some, Pañc. 229, 1; from somewhere.<BR> 9. With न and following चन, From no quarter whatever, Man. 6, 40.<BR> 10. With following चिद्, From any, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 7; from anywhere, Pañc. 239, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुतस्
अ- + कुतस् अ- + कुतस्, adv. from no quarter, Pañc. 68, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुक|कुतुकं
कुतुक कुतुक, n. Desire, Gīt. i. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूहल|कुतूहलं|कुतूहलः
