कुतूहलवन्त्|कुतूहलवत्
कुतूहलवन्त् कुतूहल + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Anxious, eager, Mālav. 51, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूहलिन्
कुतूहलिन् कुतूहलिन्, i. e. कुतूहल + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Eager, Ragh. 15, 65.<BR> 2. Inquisitive, Man. 4, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्र
कुत्र कुत्र, i. e. क + व + त्र (cf. किम् and कु), adv.<BR> 1. Where, Rām. 5, 34, 21.<BR> 2. Whither, Lass. 25, 5.<BR> 3. कुत्र--क्व are used to denote a great difference, Bhāg. P. 7, 9, 25.<BR> 4. With following अपि, Somewhere, Mārk. P. 8, 120.<BR> 5. With following चिद्,<BR> a. In some, Pañc. 256, 6.<BR> b. Somewhere, Rām. 5, 1, 5. With preceding न, Nowhere, MBh. 3, 10359; Pañc. 36, 22.<BR> c. कुत्र चिद्--कुत्र चिद्, In some cases--in others, Man. 9, 34.<BR> 6. With preceding यत्र and following च, In whomsoever even, Bhāg. P. 8, 8, 22.<BR> --Cf. Goth. hvathro and hvar; Engl. whither; Lat. cur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्रत्य
कुत्रत्य कुत्र + त्य, adj. Where dwelling, Bhāg. P. 5, 10, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्स्
कुत्स् कुत्स्, i. 10 (rather a denom. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a " target="_blank">Page0194-a + 40</a>] derived from कुतस्), in epic poetry also i. 1, MBh. 2, 2298, Par.<BR> 1. To blame, MBh. 2, 2121.<BR> 2. To contemn, Man. 2, 54.<BR> कुत्सित, Contemptible, MBh. 13, 2222.<BR> कुत्स्य, Blameable, Bhartṛ. 2, 12 (thus to be read).<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To blame. Rām. 2, 75, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0193-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्स
कुत्स कुत्स, m. The name of a Ṛṣi, Chr. 296, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सन|कुत्सनं
कुत्सन कुत्स् + अन, n. Contempt, Man. 4, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सा
कुत्सा कुत्स् + आ, f. Blaming, MBh. 13, 6589; Blame, 2, 2235.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथ्
कुथ् कुथ्, i. 4, Par. To stink.<BR> कुथित, Fetid, Suśr. 2, 115, 3.<BR> --Causal, कोथय, To cause to putrefy, Suśr. 1, 344, 4.<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र, To begin stinking, to turn putrid, प्रकुथित, Suśr. 1, 344, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथ|कुथं|कुथः
कुथ कुथ,<BR> I. m., and f. था, and n. A painted woollen blanket, MBh. 2, 1894.<BR> II. m. A kind of grass, Poa cynosuroides, Rām. 2, 30, 14 (but 2, 30, 16 Gorr. reads कुश, ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्
† कुद् कुद्, i. 10, Par. To speak falsely, to lie (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दाल|कुद्दालः
कुद्दाल कुद्दाल, m. and n. A kind of spade or hoe, MBh. 3, 8871.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनख|कुनखः
