कुनखिन्
कुनखिन् कुनखिन्, i. e. कुनख + इन्, adj., f. नी, One who has whitlows on his nails, Man. 3, 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्त|कुंत|कुंतः|कुन्तः
कुन्त कुन्त, m. A lance, Rām. 3, 28, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्तल|कुंतल|कुंतलः|कुन्तलः
कुन्तल कुन्तल, m.<BR> 1. Hair, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 30.<BR> 2. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 6, 347.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्ति|कुंति|कुंतिः|कुन्तिः
