कुरर|कुररः
कुरर कुरर (onomatop.),<BR> I. m. An osprey, Rām. 3, 15, 6.<BR> II. f. री, A female osprey, MBh. 1, 908.<BR> III. m. The name of a mountain, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0196-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरव|कुरवः
