कुश कुश,<BR> I. m. and n. The sacrificial grass, Poa cynosuroides, Man. 2, 43.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A proper name, Rām. 1, 34, 1.<BR> 2. One of the great dvīpas or divisions of the universe, Bhāg. P. 5, 1, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशल|कुशलं|कुशलः
कुशल कुशल (perhaps for कु-शर, and akin to शरण),<BR> I. adj., f. ला.<BR> 1. Happy, Bhag. 18, 10.<BR> 2. Healthy, Rām. 2, 70, 12.<BR> 3. Expert, Pañc. v. d. 33; skilful, Nal. 19, 19; 20; with loc., Man. 7, 190; gen., Yājñ. 2, 181; infin., MBh. 1, 53.<BR> II. लम्, adv. Well, Bhāg. P. 1, 14, 29; mildly, Man. 6, 48.<BR> III. m. The name of a people, MBh. 6, 359.<BR> IV. n.<BR> 1. Well-being, Rām. 1, 52, 5.<BR> 2. Happiness, Pañc. 192, 23; prosperity (of devotion), Man. 2, 127.<BR> 3. Salutation, Rām. 1, 73, 8.<BR> --Instr. लेन, adverbially, Cheerfully, Rām. 2, 34, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुशल
अ- + कुशल अ- + कुशल, adj. unlucky, Bhag. 18, 21; Rām. 2, 64, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतानकुशल
वैतान- + कुशल वैतान- + कुशल, adj. Knowing the sacred ordinances, Man. 11, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शस्त्रकुशल
शस्त्र- + कुशल शस्त्र- + कुशल, adj. expert in arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्रयानकुशल
समुद्र-यान- + कुशल समुद्र-यान- + कुशल, adj. well acquainted with sea-voyages and journeys by land, Man. 8, 157.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वार्थकुशल
सर्वार्थ- + कुशल सर्वार्थ- + कुशल, i. e. सर्व-अर्थ-, adj. expert in all affairs, Nal. 8, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वाधीनकुशल
स्वाधीन- + कुशल स्वाधीन- + कुशल, i. e. स्व-अधीन-, adj. having prosperity in one's own power, Śāk. 64, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलता
कुशलता कुशल + ता, f. Cleverness, Man. 12, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलिन्
कुशलिन् कुशलिन्, i. e. कुशल + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Prosperous, Nal. 2, 16.<BR> 2. Safe and sound, Rām. 3, 69, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशवन्त्|कुशवत्
कुशवन्त् कुश + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj., f. वती, Abounding in Kuśa grass, MBh. 3, 10533.<BR> II. f. वती, The name of a city, MBh. 3, 11792.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाम्ब
कुशाम्ब कुशाम्ब, m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2363.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिक|कुशिकः
कुशिक कुशिक, m. A proper name, Rām. 1, 23, 11. pl. His descendants, MBh. 1, 3723.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिन्
कुशिन् कुशिन्, i. e. कुश + इन्, adj., f. नी, Holding Kuśa grass, MBh. 13, 973.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीद|कुशीदं
कुशीद कुशीद; see कुसीद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीलव|कुशीलवः
कुशीलव कु-शील + व (व is mutilated वन्त्),<BR> 1. m. An actor, Man. 3, 155.<BR> 2. du. कुश and लव, the sons of Rāma, Rām. 1, 4, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूल|कुशूलः
कुशूल कुशूल, m. A granary, Hit. 66, 19; Man. 4, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशेशय|कुशेशयं|कुशेशयः
कुशेशय कुशेशय, i. e. कुश + इ-शी + अ,<BR> I. adj. Dwelling in Kuśa grass (viz. fire), MBh. 13, 1698.<BR> II. n. A water lily, Ragh. 18, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्
कुष् कुष् (akin to कृष्, and based on कर्ष्), ii. 9, कुष्णा, णी, Par. (also i. 6, Bhāg. P. 3, 16, 10),<BR> 1. To tear, Bhāg. P. 3, 16, 10.<BR> 2. † To draw out.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To pull, Suśr. 2, 145, 2.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To tear out (i. 6), Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 19; निष्कुषित, Torn out, Ragh. 7, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठ|कुष्ठं|कुष्ठः
कुष्ठ कुष्ठ, m. and n.<BR> 1. A plant, Costus speciosus, Rām. 2, 94, 23.<BR> 2. i. e. कुष् + थ, Leprosy, Bhartṛ. 1, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठित
कुष्ठित कुष्ठित, i. e. कुष्ठ + इत, adj., f. ता, and कुष्ठिन् कुष्थिन्, i. e. कुष्ठ + इन्, adj., f. नी, Subject to leprosy, Suśr. 1, 270, 21; Man. 3, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुस्
† कुस् कुस्, also कुश् कुश्, i. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a " target="_blank">Page0200-a + 41</a>] 4, Par. To embrace.<BR> --Cf. κυνέω for κυσ-νέω, ep. fut. κύσ-σω, etc. O.H.G. chus, kussian; A.S. coss, cyssan, belong rather to जुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0199-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीद|कुसीदं|कुसीदः
कुसीद कुसीद, probably कु-सद् + अ (from the base of the pres. सीद), n. Usury, Pañc. i. d. 12; with श् for स्: कुशीद, Man. 8, 410.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुम|कुसुमं|कुसुमः
कुसुम कु-सुम, probably, कु-स्मि + अ, n. A flower, Man. 11, 70.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुसुम
अ- + कुसुम अ- + कुसुम, adj. flowerless, Kir. 5, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुममय
कुसुममय कुसुम + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of flowers, Prab. 7, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमशरत्व
कुसुमशरत्व कुसुम-शर + त्व, n. Having flowers instead of arrows, Śāk. d. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमित
कुसुमित कुसुमित, i. e. कुसुम + इत, adj., f. ता, Blossoming, Rām. 2, 96, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुम्भ|कुसुंभ|कुसुंभं|कुसुम्भं|कुसुंभः|कुसुम्भः
कुसुम्भ कुसुम्भ, probably स् for श् and कु-शुम्भ् + अ,<BR> I. m. and n. Safflower, Carthamus tinctorius, Śiś. 9, 14.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A student's water-pot.<BR> 2. The name of a mountain, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुम्भवन्त्|कुसुम्भवत्
कुसुम्भवन्त् कुसुम्भ + वन्त्, adj. Bearing a water-pot, Man. 6, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुस्म्
† कुस्म् कुस्म्, i. 10 (rather a denomin. derived from कु-स्मय), Ātm.<BR> 1. To smile.<BR> 2. To see mentally, to imagine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुह्
कुह् कुह्, i. 10, Ātm. To surprise, to deceive (cf. the next).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहक|कुहकं|कुहकः
कुहक कुह् + अक (कुह् probably = κεύθω),<BR> I. adj., f. का, and sbst. Deceiving, a cheat, MBh. 3, 14718; a juggler, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 21.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A kind of frog, Suśr. 2, 290, 6.<BR> 2. The name of a king of the Nāgas or serpents, Bhāg. P. 5, 24, 29.<BR> III. n. and f. का, Juggling, Hit. iv. d. 101; MBh. 5, 5461. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b " target="_blank">Page0200-b + 41</a>]<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकुहक
अ- + कुहक अ- + कुहक, m. one who is no deceiver. Suśr. 2, 290, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहर|कुहरं|कुहरः
कुहर कुह् + अर (cf. the last).<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. A cavern, Bhartṛ. 3, 29.<BR> 2. A cavity, Prab. 3, 15.<BR> 3. The interior, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 33.<BR> 4. Coition, Daśak. in Chr. 196, 22.<BR> II. m. The name of a serpent, MBh. 1, 2701.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहु|कुहुः
कुहु कुहु, The cry of the cuckoo, MBh. 15, 724.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुकुहाय
कुहुकुहाय कुहुकुहाय (onomatop. ?), Ātm. To show surprise, MBh. 3, 14129.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहू
कुहू कुहू,<BR> 1. कुह् + ऊ (cf. कुहक), f. The new moon; probably that part of the day of the new moon when the moon is completely waned, MBh. 3, 14129.<BR> 2. The name of a river, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 10.<BR> 3. The cry of the cuckoo, Gīt. 1, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कू
कू कू, and कु कु, ii. 2, Par., i. 1 and 6, Ātm., and as v. r. of क्नू, ii. 9, Par. Ātm. To cry. Frequent. कोकूय, cf. κωκύω; cf. आकूत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज्
कूज् कूज् (onomatop., from the cry of the cuckoo, cf. κόκκυξ, κόκκυγος; O.H.G. gauch; A.S. gaec), i. 1, Par. (Ātm. see नि), To make any inarticulate sound:<BR> 1. To cry, as a bird, MBh. 3, 9926. To coo, Rām. 2, 52, 2.<BR> 2. To buzz, Ṛt. 6, 34, v. r.<BR> 3. To rustle, Ragh. 2, 12.<BR> 4. To moan, Rām. 3, 32, 33.<BR> 5. To fill with one of these sounds, Rām. 3, 78, 27.<BR> कूजित, n.<BR> 1. Inarticulate sound, Ragh. 9, 26.<BR> 2. Chirping, Bhāg. P. 4, 6, 12.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, To rival in chirping, Rām. 3, 79, 24; in singing, 2, 96, 13; in moaning, MBh. 3, 14144.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To buzz, Rām. 3, 79, 6.<BR> --With आ आ, To sing, as a bird, Suśr. 2, 503, 13. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a " target="_blank">Page0201-a + 41</a>]<BR> --With उद् उद्, To utter a monotonous sound, Kathās. 10, 130.<BR> --With उप उप, To fill with a sound, MBh. 3, 5212.<BR> --With नि नि,<BR> 1. To chirp, Rām. 3, 7, 4.<BR> 2. To fill with chirping, Bhāg. P. 3, 23, 20.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To utter inarticulate sounds, Rām. 2, 95, 11.<BR> --With परि परि, To buzz round about, Sāh. D. 55, 20.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To answer by an inarticulate sound, Rām. 2, 56, 9.<BR> --With वि वि, To cry, Rām. 3, 76, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0200-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज|कूजः
कूज कूज् + अ, m. Croaking of the bowels, Suśr. 2, 514, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकूज
अ- + कूज अ- + कूज, adj. not murmuring, MBh. 1, 4116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कूज
निष्कूज निष्कूज, i. e. निस्-, adj. silent, Rām. 2, 59, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजन|कूजनं
कूजन कूज् + अन, n. Croaking of the bowels, Suśr. 2, 402, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजिन्
कूजिन् कूजिन्, i. e. कूज + इन्, adj., f. नी, Subject to croaking of the bowels, Suśr. 2, 428, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट्
† कूट् कूट्, i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To burn.<BR> 2. To sorrow.<BR> 3. To advise.<BR> --i. 10, Ātm.<BR> 1. To be foul.<BR> 2. To avoid giving.<BR> 3. To despond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट कूट,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. The head, MBh. 16, 110.<BR> 2. Top, Rām. 6, 95, 24.<BR> 3. The peak or summit of a mountain, MBh. 1, 1172.<BR> 4. Chief, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 19.<BR> 5. A multitude, a heap, Rām. 1, 13, 15<BR> 6. A hammer, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 6.<BR> 7. A trap, Rām. 4, 17, 6.<BR> 8. An enigma; वाचः कूट, enigmatic speech, Bhāg. P. 6, 5, 29.<BR> II. adj.<BR> 1. Untrue, false, Yājñ. 1, 80; 2, 241 (viz. coin).<BR> 2. Insidious, Man. 7, 90 (concealed in wood, Kull.; cf. कूट-खड्ग).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकूट
अ- + कूट अ- + कूट, adj. 1. open, honest, Yājñ. 1, 323. 2. genuine (viz. coin), 2, 241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षकूट|अक्षकूटः
अक्ष- + कूट अक्ष- + कूट, n. a trap by means of dice, MBh. 3, 1266.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0201-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षिकूट|अक्षिकूटः
