कृच्छ्र|कृच्छ्रं|कृच्छ्रः|कृछ्र
कृच्छ्र कृच्छ्र (probably from an old pres. base कृच्छ of the vb. कृष्; cf. e. g. इष्, pr. base इच्छ),<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Painful, Rām. 3, 74, 29.<BR> 2. Difficult, Rām. 3, 46, 16.<BR> 3. Dangerous, Suśr. 1, 131, 4.<BR> 4. Wicked, Man. 6, 78.<BR> 5. Miserable, MBh. 3, 15388.<BR> II. n. and m.<BR> 1. Pain, Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 35.<BR> 2. Difficulty, Rām. 3, 68, 53.<BR> 3. Distress, Bhartṛ. 2, 23.<BR> 4. Penance, Man. 4, 222.<BR> III. acc. रम्, adverbially, Miserably, Rām. 4, 22, 7. Instr. रेण, adv. With difficulty, Pañc. 137, 25; with much ado, Pañc. 40, 10. Abl. रात्, adv. With difficulty, Rām. 3, 73, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिकृच्छ्र|अतिकृच्छ्रः
अति- + कृच्छ्र अति- + कृच्छ्र, m. 1. a very severe penance, described Man. 11, 213. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नातिकृच्छ्रात्
न अतिकृच्छ्रात् न अतिकृच्छ्रात्, easily, MBh. 1, 1442.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृच्छ्रातिकृच्छ्र|कृच्छ्रातिकृच्छ्रः
कृच्छ्रातिकृच्छ्र कृच्छ्रातिकृच्छ्र, i. e. कृच्छ्र-अति-, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-b " target="_blank">Page0210-b + 41</a>] m. 1. du. a common and a very severe penance, Man. 11, 208. 2. a particular penance, Yājñ. 3, 321.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थकृच्छ्र
अर्थ-कृच्छ्र अर्थ-कृच्छ्र, n. a difficult question, Nal. 15, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तप्तकृच्छ्र|तप्तकृच्छ्रः
तप्त- + कृच्छ्र तप्त- + कृच्छ्र, m. and n. a kind of penance, Man. 11, 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मकृच्छ्र
धर्म- + कृच्छ्र धर्म- + कृच्छ्र, a moral difficulty, a situation in which it is difficult to act rightly, Nal. 24, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकृच्छ्र|पर्णकृच्छ्रः
पर्ण- + कृच्छ्र पर्ण- + कृच्छ्र, m. a kind of penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणकृच्छ्र
