पुत्रकृतक|पुत्रकृतकः
पुत्र- + कृतक पुत्र- + कृतक, adj. an adopted child, Śāk. d. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

