कृतघ्नता
कृतघ्नता कृतघ्न + ता, f., and कृतघ्नत्व कृतघ्न + त्व, n. Returning [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b " target="_blank">Page0211-b + 40</a>] evil for good, ingratitude, Pañc. 214, 5; Mārk. P. 15, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतज्ञ|कृतज्ञः
कृतज्ञ कृत-ज्ञ, adj., f. ञा, Grateful, Man. 7, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतज्ञता
कृतज्ञता कृतज्ञ + ता, f. Gratitude, Rām. 5, 35, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

