कृति|कृतिः
कृति कृ + ति,<BR> I. f.<BR> 1. Making, Pañc. 91, 3.<BR> 2. Action, Bhāṣāp. 145.<BR> 3. A literary work, Mālav. 3, 13.<BR> 4. Hurt, Dev. 5, 11 (?).<BR> II. m. and f. Proper names, MBh. 2, 320; Bhāg. P. 6, 18, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलकृति
चल- + कृति चल- + कृति, adj. fickle, Pañc. 109, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

