कृतिन्
कृतिन् कृतिन्, i. e. कृत + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Wise, Bhartṛ. 2, 16.<BR> 2. Clever, MBh. 3, 8278.<BR> 3. Satisfied, Ragh. 3, 51.<BR> II. m. A proper name, Bhāg. P. 9, 22, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0211-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

