कृत्नु|कृत्नुः
कृत्नु कृ-त्नु, adj. Clever, Chr. 295, 10 = Rigv. i. 92, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत्य|कृत्यं|कृत्यः
कृत्य कृ + त्य,<BR> I. ptcple. of the fut. pass. of कृ.<BR> 1. To be done or performed, Rām. 3, 60, 27.<BR> 2. Seducible, bribable, Rājat. 5, 247.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Right, Pañc. i. d. 309.<BR> 2. Need, with instr., e. g. न मे जीवितेन कृत्यम्, I do not want (or wish) to live, Mṛcch. 154, 3.<BR> 3. Duty, Man. 2, 237.<BR> 4. Service, Śāk. d. 193.<BR> गुण-कृत्ये नियोजिता, is used to serve as a string, Kumāras. 4, 15.<BR> 5. Business, Rām. 3, 47, 15.<BR> 6. motive, Rām. 6, 33, 18.<BR> III. f. या.<BR> 1. Causing, Man. 11, 67.<BR> 2. Act, Man. 11, 125.<BR> 3. Charm, witchery, Man. 9, 290.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0212-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकृत्य
