केतन|केतनं
केतन केतन, i. e. कित् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Invitation, Man. 4, 110.<BR> 2. An abode, MBh. 3, 13396.<BR> 3. A place, Kathās. 26, 44.<BR> 4. A sign, MBh. 14, 2430.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिकेतन
