केतु|केतुः
केतु केतु, i. e. कित् + उ, m.<BR> 1. A sign by which an object may be recognised, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a " target="_blank">Page0218-a + 42</a>] Chr. 289, 3 = Rigv. i. 50, 3; Chr. 294, 1 = Rigv. i. 92, 1; Rām. 2, 54, 5.<BR> 2. A banner, MBh. 4, 2068.<BR> 3. Chief, Rām. 4, 28, 18.<BR> 4. A meteor, Man. 1, 38.<BR> 5. The mythological name of the descending node, represented as a headless demon, Rām. 3, 35, 52.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Goth. haidus; A.S. had.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निकेतु|अग्निकेतुः
अग्नि- + केतु अग्नि- + केतु, m. the name of a Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकेतु|तालकेतुः
ताल- + केतु ताल- + केतु, m. (having as banner the palmyra tree), epithet of Bhīṣma, MBh. 5, 5081.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धूमकेतु|धूमकेतुः
धूम- + केतु धूम- + केतु, m. 1. fire, MBh. 1, 4162. 2. a meteor, MBh. 6, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धृष्टकेतु|धृष्टकेतुः
धृष्ट- + केतु धृष्ट- + केतु, m. a proper name, MBh. 1, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरकेतु|मकरकेतुः
मकर- + केतु मकर- + केतु, m. the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0217-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुमन्त्|केतुमत्
केतुमन्त् केतु + मन्त्, m.<BR> 1. The name of a Dānava, or demon, MBh. 1, 2532.<BR> 2. The name of a palace, Hariv. 8989.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदार|केदारः
केदार केदार, m. A cultivated field, Man. 9, 44; particularly a watered one, Rām. 3, 22, 18; Rājat. 5, 112.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककेदार
एक- + केदार एक- + केदार, adj. having the same fields, Man. 9, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केप्
† केप् केप्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To tremble.<BR> 2. To go.<BR> --Cf. कम्प् and गेप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूर|केयूरं|केयूरः
केयूर केयूर, m. and n. A bracelet worn on the upper arm, Bhartṛ. 2, 16; Rājat. 5, 358.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूरिन्
केयूरिन् केयूरिन्, i. e. केयूर + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Wearing a bracelet, Mārk. P. 23, 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केरल|केरलः
केरल केरल, m.<BR> 1. pl. The name of a people, Rām. 2, 82, 7.<BR> 2. Their king, MBh. 3, 15250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केल्
† केल् केल्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To shake.<BR> 2. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलि|केलिः
केलि केलि, m. and f.<BR> 1. Amorous sport, Man. 8, 357.<BR> 2. Sport, Gīt. 7, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातकेलि|वातकेलिः
वात- + केलि वात- + केलि, m. 1. Whisper. 2. the marks of finger nails on the lover's person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमकेलि|हेमकेलिः
हेमकेलि हेमक्˚, i. e. हेमन्-, m. fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केव्
† केव् केव्, i. 1, Ātm. To serve.<BR> --Cf. खेव्, सेव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवल|केवलं|केवलः
केवल केवल, i. e. एके (old loc. sing. of एक) + वल,<BR> I. adj., f. ला (ved. ली).<BR> 1. Exclusively proper; वीक्षस्व यद्रूपं मम केवलम्, Look what shape is proper only to me, Rām. 5, 35, 52; Bhāg. P. 6, 4, 26.<BR> 2. Mere, Man. 2, 199; nothing but, 3, 118.<BR> 3. Alone, only, Pañc. v. d. 12.<BR> 4. United, i. e. entire, MBh. 13, 2686; whole, 4, 1485; all, Man. 2, 95.<BR> II. लम्, adv.<BR> 1. Only, Pañc. 31, 7.<BR> 2. Entirely (?), Rām. 2, 87, 23; न केवलम्--अपि, Not only, but also, Rājat. 5, 443.<BR> III. n. The knowledge of the unity of all the universe.<BR> IV. m. The name of a prince. Bhāg. P. 9, 2, 30.<BR> V. f. ली, The name of a locality, MBh. 3, 15245.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलिन्
केवलिन् केवलिन्, i. e. केवल + इन्, m. One who possesses the knowledge of the universal unity, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केश|केशः
केश केश, m.<BR> 1. Hair, Hit. i. d. 102.<BR> 2. A lion's mane, Sch. ad Śāk. 6, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR> adj. end in the fem. in शा or शी. अञ्जन-, adj., f. शी, having manes as smooth as ointment, MBh. 1, 8008.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूतकेश|भूतकेशः
भूत- + केश भूत- + केश, m., and f. शी, root of sweet flag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिश्रकेशी
मिश्र-केशी मिश्र-केशी, f. an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तकेश
मुक्त- + केश मुक्त- + केश (vb. मुच्), adj., f. शी, one whose hair is loose, Man. 7, 91; MBh. 1, 782.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जकेश|मुंजकेश|मुञ्जकेशः
मुञ्ज- + केश मुञ्ज- + केश, m. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकेश
वि- + केश वि- + केश,<BR> I. adj., f. शी, bald.<BR> II. f. शी, a small braid or dress of hair, tied up severally and then collected into the larger braid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमकेश|व्योमकेशः
व्योमकेश व्योमक्˚, i. e. व्योमन्-, m. Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकीर्णकेश
वि-कीर्ण- + केश वि-कीर्ण- + केश (vb. कॄ), and वि-गलित-, adj., fem. शा, with dishevelled hair, Kumāras. 5, 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुक्लकेश
शुक्ल- + केश शुक्ल- + केश, adj. hoary-haired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकेश
सु- + केश सु- + केश, adj., f. शी, having beautiful hair, Rām. 3, 52, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशर|केशरं|केशरः
केशर केश + र, also केसर केसर,<BR> I. n. A lion's or horse's mane, Pañc. i. d. 207.<BR> II. m. and n. The filament of a lotus, or of any vegetable, Śiś. 9, 47. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a " target="_blank">Page0219-a + 41</a>] (with स्).<BR> III. m. The name of several plants, Mesua ferrea, Mimusops elengi, Bottleria tinctoria; their flower, n., Rām. 2, 96, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालकेशर
कराल- + केशर कराल- + केशर, m. a proper name, Pañc. 214, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागकेशर|नागकेशरः
नाग- + केशर नाग- + केशर, m. a tree, Mesua Roxburghii, Wight. Rām. 6, 96, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0218-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशरि
केशरि केशरि (i. e. mutilated केशरिन्, q. cf.), m. A proper name, Rām. 4, 33, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशरिन्
केशरिन् केशरिन्, i. e. केशर + इन्, also केसरिन् केसरिन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इणि, Having a mane, MBh. 1, 8286.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A lion, Bhartṛ. 2, 22.<BR> 2. A proper name, Rām. 4, 39, 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुषकेशरिन्
पुरुष- + केशरिन् पुरुष- + केशरिन्, m. a name of Viṣṇu in his fourth incarnation (half man, half lion).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशव|केशवः
केशव केश + व (व for वन्त्), m.<BR> 1. A name of Viṣṇu, Rām. 1, 45, 31.<BR> 2. A proper name, Pañc. iii. d. 270.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालकेशव
गो-पाल- + केशव गो-पाल- + केशव, m. the name of an idol of Kṛṣṇa set up by Gopālavarman, Rājat. 5, 243.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवत्व
केशवत्व केशव + त्व, n. State of Viṣṇu, MBh. 13, 1361.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवन्त्|केशवत्
केशवन्त् केश + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Long-haired, Mārk. P. 8, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशाकेशि
केशाकेशि केशाकेशि, i. e. केश-केश + इ, adv. In mutual grasping of hair, Yājñ. 2, 283; in closest proximity, MBh. 4, 1056.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशान्तिक
केशान्तिक केशान्तिक, i. e. केश-अन्त + इक, adj. Reaching to one's hair, Man. 2, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिन्
केशिन् केशिन्, i. e. केश + इन्,<BR> I. m. The name of an Asura or demon, etc., MBh. 1, 2531; Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 47.<BR> II. f. इनी, The name of an Apsaras, etc., MBh. 1, 2558; Rām. 1, 39, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धामकेशिन्
धामकेशिन् धामकेशिन्, i. e. धामन्-केश + इन्, adj. having rays instead of hair, MBh. 3, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जकेशिन्|मुंजकेशिन्
मुञ्ज- + केशिन् मुञ्ज- + केशिन्, m. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसर|केसरं|केसरः
केसर केसर, and केसरिन् केसरिन्; see केशर केशर, केशरिन् केशरिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कै
कै कै, i. 1, Par. To sound (ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैकय|कैकयः
कैकय कैकय = केकय, and कैकेय, q. cf., MBh. 1, 2647; 3, 2009; f. यी = कैकेयी, Rām. i. 1, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैकेय|कैकेयः
कैकेय कैकेय, a syncope of कैकयेय, i. e. केकय + एय, patron.<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A descendant of Kekaya, a king of the Kekayas, MBh. 3, 462.<BR> 2. pl. The people of the Kekayas, Rām. 4, 43, 11.<BR> II. f. यी, One of the wives of Daśaratha, Rām. 1, 1, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैंकर्य
कैंकर्य कैंकर्य, i. e. किंकर + य, n. Service, Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैटभ|कैटभः
कैटभ कैटभ, m. The name of an Asura or demon, MBh. 3, 498.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैतक|कैतकं
कैतक कैतक, i. e. केतक + अ, adj. Produced from the tree Pandanus odoratissimus, Ragh. 4, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैतव|कैतवं|कैतवः
कैतव कैतव, i. e. कितव + अ,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. A stake, MBh. 2, 2163.<BR> 2. Gambling, Nal. 26, 10.<BR> 3. Deceit, Bhartṛ. 2, 44.<BR> II. m. Patron. designation of Ulūka, MBh. 1, 7002.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैतवक|कैतवकं
कैतवक कैतव + क, n. Game of hazard, MBh. 2, 2060.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैरव|कैरवं|कैरवः
कैरव कैरव, n. The white esculent water-lily, Bhartṛ. 2, 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैरात|कैरातं|कैरातः
कैरात कैरात, i. e. किरात + अ,<BR> I. adj. Referring to the Kirātas, MBh. 1, 320.<BR> II. m. A prince of the Kirātas, MBh. 2, 1869.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैरातक
कैरातक कैरात + क, adj., f. की, Belonging to the Kirātas, MBh. 2, 1867.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैलास|कैलासः
कैलास कैलास, also कैलाश कैलाश (probably akin to कील), m. The name of a mountain, the residence of Kuvera, MBh. 3, 503; Rām. 3, 54, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0219-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवर्त|कैवर्तः|कैवर्त्त|कैवर्त्तः
कैवर्त कैवर्त, m.<BR> 1. A fisherman, Man. 8, 260.<BR> 2. A mixed tribe; the son of a Niṣāda by an Āyogavī woman, Man. 10, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवर्तक|कैवर्तकः|कैवर्त्तक
कैवर्तक कैवर्त + क, m. A fisherman, Rām. 2, 83, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैवल्य|कैवल्यं
कैवल्य कैवल्य, i. e. केवल + य, n.<BR> 1. Complete absorption in the thought of the universal unity, absolute happiness, Vedāntas. in Chr. 219, 13; MBh. 13, 1073.<BR> 2. Totality, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैशव
कैशव कैशव, i. e. केशव + अ, adj. Belonging to Keśava, Ragh. 17, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैशिक|कैशिकं|कैशिकः
कैशिक कैशिक, m. The name of a tribe, MBh. 2, 585.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैशोर|कैशोरं
कैशोर कैशोर, i. e. किशोर + अ, n. Youth, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोक|कोकः
कोक कोक, m.<BR> 1. A wolf, Rām. 5, 26, 9.<BR> 2. The cuckoo (ved.).<BR> 3. The ruddy goose, Gīt. 5, 17.<BR> --Cf. Lat. cuculus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकनद|कोकनदं
कोकनद कोकनदअ,<BR> I. n. The red lotus, Gīt. 10, 5.<BR> II. m. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 1026.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोकिल|कोकिलः
कोकिल कोकिल, i. e. कोक + इल, m.<BR> 1. The Indian cuckoo, Rām. 2, 52, 2. f. ला, The female cuckoo, Bhartṛ. 1, 34.<BR> 2. A kind of mouse, Suśr. 2, 274, 4.<BR> 3. A poisonous insect. Suśr. 2, 288, 7.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंस्कोकिल|पुंस्कोकिलः
पुंस्- + कोकिल पुंस्- + कोकिल, m. the male cuckoo, Ṛt. 6, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोङ्क|कोंक|कोंकः|कोङ्कः
कोङ्क कोङ्क, m. The name of a people, Bhāg. P. 5, 6, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोङ्कण|कोंकण|कोङ्कणं|कोंकणः|कोङ्कणः
कोङ्कण कोङ्कण, m. The name of a people, Daśak. 193, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोंकार
कोंकार कों-कार, m. The sound कोम्, Pañc. 158, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोच|कोचः
कोच कोच, i. e. कुच् + अ, m. Shrinking, Suśr. 1, 269, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटर|कोटरं|कोटरः
कोटर कोटर (cf. vb. कुट्), m. and n.<BR> 1. The hollow of a tree, Pañc. 104, 7.<BR> 2. A cavity, Rājat. 5, 439.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटरस्थ
कोटरस्थ कोटर-स्थ (vb. स्था) adj. Being in the interior, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 547.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटि|कोटिः
कोटि and टी कोटी̆, i. e. कुट् + इ, f.<BR> 1. A point, Pañc. 120, 23.<BR> 2. Eminence, MBh. 3, 542 (प्रमाण-कोटी, extraordinary tallness).<BR> 3. Ten millions, Man. 6, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिक|कोटिकः
कोटिक कोटिक, m.<BR> 1. A worm, Jaṭādh. in ŚKD.; f. का, मानुष-कोटिका, A worm-like woman, Pañc. 44, 25.<BR> 2. A kind of frog, Suśr. 2, 290, 7.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 3, 15586.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिकाश्य
कोटिकाश्य कोटिकाश्य, and कोटिकास्य कोटिकास्य (better), i. e. कोटिक-आस्य, m. The name of a prince, Draup. 1, 12; MBh. 3, 15593.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिपाल|कोटिपालः
कोटिपाल कोटिपाल, Lass. 13, 11; read कोट्टपाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिमन्त्|कोटिमत्
कोटिमन्त् कोटि + मन्त्, adj., f. मती, Pointed, Śāk. d. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटिशस्
कोटिशस् कोटि + शस्, adv. By ten millions, Sund. 3, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्ट|कोट्टं|कोट्टः
कोट्ट कोट्ट (a dialect. form of कोष्ठ), n. A strong-hold, Pañc. 237, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टवी
कोट्टवी कोट्टवी, f. A naked woman, Rājat. 5, 439.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोठ|कोठः
कोठ कोठ (a dialect form of कुष्ठ), m. A species of leprosy, Suśr. 1, 156, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोण|कोणः
कोण कोण (perhaps a dialect. form of कर्ण), m.<BR> 1. A corner, Pañc. 258, 8.<BR> 2. An angle, MBh. 14, 2035.<BR> 3. An instrument for sounding a lute, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a " target="_blank">Page0221-a + 42</a>] Rām. 2, 71, 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रकोण|सूत्रकोणः
सूत्र- + कोण सूत्र- + कोण, m. A kind of drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0220-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोथ|कोथः
कोथ कोथ, i. e. कुथ् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Putrefaction, Suśr. 1, 41, 19.<BR> 2. Gangrene, Suśr. 1, 92, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोदण्ड|कोदंड|कोदंडं|कोदण्डं|कोदंडः|कोदण्डः
कोदण्ड को-दण्ड (को = कस्, nom. sing. of किम्; cf. कु-), n. (and m.), A bow, Bhartṛ. 1, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोद्रव|कोद्रवः
कोद्रव को-द्रव (cf. the last), m. A species of grain eaten by the poorer people, Paspalum scrobiculatum, Lin., Bhartṛ. 2, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोप|कोपः
कोप कोप, i. e. कुप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Morbose excitement, Suśr. 1, 5, 8.<BR> 2. Wrath, Pañc. i. d. 139.<BR> कोपं कृ, To be angry, Pañc. 162, 25.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकोप|अन्तःकोपः
अन्तःकोप अन्तःकोप, i. e. अन्तर्-, m. inward anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकोप|क्रीडाकोपः
क्रीडा- + कोप क्रीडा- + कोप, m. feigned anger, Amar. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिथ्याकोप|मिथ्याकोपः
मिथ्या- + कोप मिथ्या- + कोप, m. feigned anger, Lass. 9, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगकोप
मृग- + कोप मृग- + कोप, m. rage at animals, Pañc. 56, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकोप
स-कोप स-कोप, adj., f. पा, enraged, Pañc. iii. d. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकोपम्
स-कोप + म् स-कोप + म्, adv. angrily, Pañc. 38, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपन|कोपनः
कोपन कोपन, i. e. कुप् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. ना.<BR> 1. Passionate, wrathful, Rām. 1, 34, 22.<BR> 2. Irritating, Suśr. 1, 177, 15.<BR> II. m. The name of an Asura or demon, Hariv. 2284.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. Excitement, MBh. 14, 466.<BR> 2. Provocation, MBh. 13, 2426.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकोपन
अ- + कोपन अ- + कोपन, adj. not inclined to wrath, Lass. 40, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपयिष्णु
कोपयिष्णु कोपयिष्णु, i. e. कुप्, Caus., + इष्णु, adj. Provoking, MBh. 1, 6836.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपिन्
कोपिन् कोपिन्, i. e. कोप + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Wrathful, Rām. 3, 16, 29.<BR> 2. When latter part of a comp. word, Irritating, Suśr. 1, 199, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोमल|कोमलं|कोमलः
कोमल को-मल (cf. कोद्रव, कुमार, and vb. म्लै), adj., f. ला, oft, bland, Bhartṛ. 2, 56; 1, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोयष्टि|कोयष्टिः
कोयष्टि को-यष्टि (see the last), and<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोयष्टिक|कोयष्टिकः
कोयष्टिक कोयष्टि + क, m. A kind of bird Man. 5, 13; MBh. 13, 2835.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोर|कोरः
कोर कोर, m.<BR> 1. A flexible joint (as of the fingers).<BR> 2. A bud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरक|कोरकं|कोरकः
कोरक कोर + क, m. and n. A bud, Rām. 2, 59, 8; Bhāṣāp. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरदूष|कोरदूषः
कोरदूष कोर-दूष, and कोरदूषक कोरदूष + क, m. = कोद्रव, Suśr. 2, 64, 1, MBh. 3, 13027.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोल|कोलं|कोलः
कोल कोल,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A hog, Yājñ. 3, 273.<BR> 2. A kind of weapon, Dev. 1, 4; 5(?).<BR> II. n. The fruit of the jujube, Zizyphus jujuba, Suśr. 1, 25, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोलाहल|कोलाहलं|कोलाहलः
कोलाहल कोलाहल,<BR> I. m. n.<BR> 1. A great and confused noise, Rām. 6, 8, 45.<BR> 2. Screaming, Daśak. in Chr. 183, 13.<BR> 3. A shout, Rājat. 5, 361.<BR> II. m. The name of a mountain, MBh. 1, 2367 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोविद|कोविदः
कोविद को-विद् + अ, cf. कोयष्टि, adj., f. दा, Knowing, Man. 7, 26; MBh. 3, 1287 (with gen.); skilful, Rām. 2, 80, 5 (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोविदार|कोविदारं|कोविदारः
कोविदार कोविदार, i. e. को-विदॄ + अ (cf. the last), m. A species of ebony, Bauhinia variegata, Lin., Rām. 2, 84, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोश|कोशं|कोशः
कोश कोश, also कोष कोष, m. and n.<BR> 1. A coop, denoting a cloud (ved.), Chr. 293, 2 = Rigv. i. 87, 2; Chr. 297, 11 = i. 112, 11.<BR> 2. A sheath, Rām. 3, 18, 39 (with ष्).<BR> 3. A bud, Ragh. 13, 29.<BR> 4. A shell, Mārk. P. 11, 6.<BR> 5. The womb, Suśr. 1, 120, 12.<BR> 6. A testicle, Suśr. 1, 290, 4.<BR> 7. An egg. Bhāg. P. 2, 8, 16.<BR> 8. An abode, Vedāntas. in Chr. 204, 22; Bhāg. P. 2, 1, 34.<BR> 9. A store-room, Rām. 2, 63, 7; a treasury, Man. 8, 38; 1, 99.<BR> 10. Treasure, Nal. 26, 19.<BR> 11. A cocoon, Yājñ. 3, 147.<BR> 12. As latter part of comp. words, A ball, e. g. नेत्र-, The eyeball, Rām. 3, 79, 28.<BR> 13. A [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0222-a " target="_blank">Page0222-a + 41</a>] sacred draught, employed in a judicial trial by ordeal, Yājñ. 2, 95.<BR> 14. Oath, Rājat. 5, 325.<BR> 15. A kind of bandage, Suśr. 1, 65, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0221-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकोष
