कौशिक|कौशिकः
1. कौशिक कौशिक, i. e. कुशिक + अ,<BR> I. adj. and patronym. Descending from Kuśika, MBh. 13, 2719; Rām. 1, 35, 20.<BR> II. m. An owl, Pañc. 157, 21.<BR> III. f. की,<BR> 1. The name of a river, Rām. 4, 40, 19.<BR> 2. A proper name, Mālav. 12, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0224-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौशिक|कौशिकः
