क्नस्
† क्नस् क्नस्, i. 4, Par.<BR> 1. To be crooked.<BR> 2. To shine.<BR> --Cf. perhaps κνημός, κνήμη.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0224-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्नू
