क्रतु|क्रतुः
क्रतु क्रतु, i. e. क्रम् + तु, m.<BR> 1. Power (ved.), Chr. 291, 13 = Rigv. i. 64, 13.<BR> 2. Sacrifice, Man. 7, 79.<BR> 3. The name of one of the seven Ṛṣis, Man. 1, 35.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. κρατύς, κράτος, κάρτος, κραταῖος, etc.; Gradivus; Goth. hardu [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0225-a " target="_blank">Page0225-a + 38</a>] (द्, not थ्, on account of the aff. तु being based on त्व).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0224-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरक्रतु|वरक्रतुः
