शतक्रतु|शतक्रतुः
शत- + क्रतु शत- + क्रतु,<BR> I. adj. honoured by a hundred sacrifices (ἑκατομβαῖος), Chr. 298, 23 = Rigv. i. 112, 23.<BR> II. m. a name of Indra, Pañc. i. d. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0224-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रथ्
