क्रथ
क्रथ क्रथ, m.<BR> 1. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 585.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2697.<BR> 3. The name of an Asura or demon, MBh. 1, 2665.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0225-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रथन|क्रथनं
क्रथन क्रथन,<BR> I. n. Slaughter, Prab. 5, 10.<BR> II. m. The name of an Asura or demon, MBh. 1, 1488; a monkey, Rām. 4, 63, 4, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0225-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रथनक|क्रथनकं
