क्रम|क्रमः
क्रम क्रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A step, MBh. 3, 11178.<BR> 2. A foot, MBh. 3, 14316.<BR> 3. A posture for assailing, Pañc. 197, 24; a bound, 229, 20.<BR> 4. Strength, see comp.<BR> 5. Regular order, Man. 8, 24; succession, Pañc. i. d. 83.<BR> 6. Course, Pañc. iii. d. 240<BR> 7. Method, Hit. 68, 21.<BR> 8. Way, Rām. 2, 26, 20.<BR> 9. A sacred precept, Mārk. P. 23, 112.<BR> 10. Intention, Kathās. 18, 380; Hit. 39, 5.<BR> 11. instr. क्रमेण,<BR> a. By degrees, Pañc. 209, 24;<BR> b. In order, Man. 2, 173;<BR> c. Afterwards, Pañc. 221, 9.<BR> 12. abl. क्रमात्, In order, Man. 10, 28.<BR> 13. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-a " target="_blank">Page0228-a + 40</a>] The name of a country = Kramavattu, Rājat. 5, 87.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0227-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

