उदक- + क्रिया उदक- + क्रिया, f. pouring water in honour of a deceased one, Man. 5, 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतक्रिय|कृतक्रियः
कृत-क्रिय कृत-क्रिय, adj. one who has performed a religious ceremony, e. g. the funeral rites, Man. 5, 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौतुकक्रिया
कौतुक-क्रिया कौतुक-क्रिया, f. the nuptial ceremonies, Ragh. 11, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रक्रिया
चित्र- + क्रिया चित्र- + क्रिया, f. painting, MBh. 4, 1360.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलक्रिया
जल- + क्रिया जल- + क्रिया = उदक-, Rām. 1, 42, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दारक्रिया
दार- + क्रिया दार- + क्रिया, f. marriage, Chr. 3, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मक्रिया|धर्म्मक्रिया
धर्म- + क्रिया धर्म- + क्रिया, f. observance of duties, Man. 12, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रिय|निष्क्रियं
निष्क्रिय निष्क्रिय, i. e. निस्-, adj. 1. inactive, Bhāṣāp. 85. 2. one who does not perform his religious duties, Man. 11, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरहंक्रिया
निरहंक्रिया निरहंक्रिया, i. e. निस्-अहम्-,<BR> I. f. want [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-a " target="_blank">Page0229-a + 42</a>] of selfishness, Bhāg. P. 3, 29, 18.<BR> II. -क्रिय, adj. impersonal, 3, 27, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुक्रिया
लघु- + क्रिया लघु- + क्रिया, f. a trifle, बह्वारम्भे लघुक्रिया, Much ado about nothing, Cāṇ. 91, in Monatsber. Berl. Ak. Hist. Phil. 1864, 413.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वशक्रिया
वश- + क्रिया वश- + क्रिया, f. 1. subduing by drugs, charms, etc. 2. The drugs, etc., so used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्मक्रिया|विकर्म्मक्रिया
विकर्मक्रिया विकर्मक्रिया, i. e. विकर्मन्-, f. 1. vicious conduct, Man. 9, 226. 2. illegal act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्रिय
स-क्रिय स-क्रिय, adj. one who observes his religious duties, Lass. 42, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हीनक्रिय
हीन- + क्रिय हीन- + क्रिय (vb. हा), adj. one who neglects his religious duties, Man. 3, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0228-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावन्त्|क्रियावत्
क्रियावन्त् क्रिया + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. One who performs actions, Hit. i. d. 162.<BR> 2. One who performs his religious duties, Rām. 2, 106, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरगक्रियावन्त्|तुरगक्रियावत्
तुरग-क्रिया + वन्त् तुरग-क्रिया + वन्त्, adj. skilful in managing horses, Lass. 70, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्री
क्री क्री, ii. 9, Par., Ātm.; क्रीणा, णी, base of the pres. etc. To buy, Man. 9, 74.<BR> क्रेतव्य and क्रेय, Purchasable, MBh. 13, 2450; Rājat. 5, 270.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, To buy, Daśak. 80, 4.<BR> --With उप उप, To buy, Hit. 115, 3.<BR> --With परि परि, To hire, MBh. 1, 4672.<BR> --With वि वि, To sell, Man. 10, 90.<BR> विक्रीत, n. Sale, Man. 8, 165.<BR> --Desider. वि-चिक्रीष, Ātm. To desire to sell, Daśak. in Chr. 191, 6.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To buy, MBh. 1, 6219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड्
क्रीड् क्रीड्, i. 1, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm.), To play, Rām. 4, 24, 39; with acc. द्यूतं क्रीड्, To play (with dice), Mṛcch. 30, 18; with instr. Man. 4, 74; Pañc. i. d. 201; Ātm. Rām. 3, 67, 6.<BR> क्रीडित, n. Play, Rām. 5, 13, 23.<BR> क्रीदनीय, n. A plaything, MBh. 13, 4206.<BR> --Caus. क्रीडय, To cause to play, MBh. 1, 6440.<BR> --With the prepositions समा सम्-आ, To play, MBh. 13, 659.<BR> --With उप उप, To surround [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b " target="_blank">Page0229-b + 39</a>] playing (with acc.), MBh. 13, 3832.<BR> --With प्र प्र, Ātm. To play, MBh. 3, 14882.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To play, MBh. 3, 11099.<BR> 2. To act as if jesting, MBh. 3, 569.<BR> 3. To treat like a plaything, Bhāg. P. 6, 2, 37.<BR> --With सम् सम्, Ātm. To play. Rām. 1, 9, 14; Par., MBh. 1, 7651.<BR> --With परिसम् परि-सम्, To jest, to indulge in amusements, Rām. 4, 30, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडन|क्रीडनं
क्रीडन क्रीड् + अन, n. Play, Rām. 1, 9, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकक्रीडन
उदक- + क्रीडन उदक- + क्रीडन, n. playing in the water, MBh. 1, 4996.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनक|क्रीडनकं|क्रीडनकः
क्रीडनक क्रीडन + क, m. (and n.) A plaything, Śāk. 105, 10; Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनकता
क्रीडनकता क्रीडनक + ता, f. The character of a plaything, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 32 (तया, instr. Like a plaything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनीयक|क्रीडनीयकं
क्रीडनीयक क्रीडनीय + क, n. A doll, Kathās. 12, 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडा
क्रीडा क्रीड् + आ, f.<BR> 1. Play, Rām. 3, 39, 17; jest, Gīt. 9, 10.<BR> 2. Amusement, Rājat. 5, 338.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलक्रीडा
जल- + क्रीडा जल- + क्रीडा, f. playing in the water, Pañc. 53, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोयक्रीडा
तोय- + क्रीडा तोय- + क्रीडा, f. playing in the water, Megh. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वप्र|वप्रं|वप्रः
वप्र वप्र f. butting at a bank or hillock as or an elephant or bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडामय
क्रीडामय क्रीडा + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of dalliance, MBh. 14, 1486.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडितृ
क्रीडितृ क्रीडितृ, i. e. क्रीड् + तृ, m. A gambler, Bhāg. P. 1, 13, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतक|क्रीतकः
क्रीतक क्रीत + क (vb. क्री), adj. Acquired by purchase, Man. 9, 174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीळि
क्रीळि क्रीऌ, i. e. क्रीड् + इ (ved.), adj. Playing, Chr. 293, 3 = Rigv. i. 87, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुञ्च्|क्रुंच्
† क्रुञ्च् क्रुञ्च्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To be crooked<BR> 2. To curve.<BR> 3. To move crookedly.<BR> 4. To become small. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a " target="_blank">Page0230-a + 39</a>]<BR> 5. To make small.<BR> --Cf. perhaps O.H.G. kriuchan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुड्
† क्रुड् क्रुड्, i. 6, Par. To sink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् क्रुध्, i. 4, Par. To be wrathful, Man. 6, 48.<BR> क्रुद्ध, Enraged, Pañc. iii. d. 75.<BR> अति-क्रुद्ध, adj. Much enraged, Rām. 3, 53, 55.<BR> परम-, adj. Very much enraged, Rām. 1, 51, 19.<BR> सु-, adj. Much enraged, Rām. 3, 51, 19.<BR> क्रोधनीय, What may provoke to anger, Rām. 2, 41, 3.<BR> --Caus., क्रोधय, To make angry, Rām. 2, 9, 21.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To be enraged at (with acc.), Vikr. 36, 2.<BR> --With समभि सम्-अभि, To be angry, MBh. 3, 8738.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To be angry in turn against (with acc.), Man. 6, 48.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To be angry, MBh. 3, 14828.<BR> संक्रुद्ध, Wrathful, Rām. 1, 55, 6.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To be enraged at (with acc.), MBh. 4, 1572.<BR> --With प्रतिसम् प्रति-सम्, To be enraged against, MBh. 1, 5983.<BR> --Cf. Lat. crudus, crudelis; see also क्रूर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् क्रुध्, f. Wrath, Kathās. 18, 282.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुन्थ्|क्रुंथ्
† क्रुन्थ् क्रुन्थ्, v. r. of कुन्थ्, ii. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश्
क्रुश् क्रुश्, i. 1. Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., Rām. 1, 60, 19), To cry, Rām. 1, 54, 7; 2, 56, 9.<BR> क्रुष्ट, One who reviles(?), MBh. 13, 2135.<BR> --With अनु अनु, Caus. क्रोशय, To pity, MBh. 13, 285.<BR> --With अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To cry at, MBh. 4, 359.<BR> 2. To bewail, Rām. 4, 24, 22.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To cry, Bhartṛ. 3, 87.<BR> 2. To revile, Man. 6, 48.<BR> आक्रुष्ट, n. Scream, Suśr. 1, 108, 17.<BR> --With प्रत्या प्रति-आ, To revile [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b " target="_blank">Page0230-b + 41</a>] in turn, MBh. 3, 1091.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ, To lament, Rām. 3, 68, 22.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To cry out, Rām. 6, 36, 60.<BR> 2. To cry to (with acc.), MBh. 1, 7748.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, To cry out, Rām. 6, 111, 29.<BR> --With परि परि, To lament, Rām. 2, 65, 22.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To cry out, MBh. 2, 2695.<BR> 2. To call, MBh. 3, 2363.<BR> --With वि वि, To call aloud, MBh. 1, 7633.<BR> 2. To call, MBh. 2, 2229.<BR> 3. To resound, Rām. 6, 92, 69.<BR> विक्रुष्ट, Offensive, Man. 4, 176; n.<BR> 1. Scream, Rām. 3, 30, 29.<BR> 2. A cry for help, Yājñ. 2, 234.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To cry all together, MBh. 2, 1553.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To call to, Rām. 2, 100, 36.<BR> --Akin to क्रुश्, but not its true reflex, are κραυγή, κρωγμὸς, etc.; Goth. hrukjan; Lat. lugeo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूर|क्रूरः
क्रूर क्रूर, adj.<BR> 1. Sore (ved.).<BR> 2. Cruel, Hiḍ. 4, 31.<BR> 3. Harsh, Rām. 3, 64, 2.<BR> 4. Formidable, Pañc. iii. d. 75.<BR> 5. Hard, Śāk. d. 37.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. probably Lat. crusta; κρύος, etc., κρυσταίνω; see क्रुध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्रूर|अक्रूरः
अ- + क्रूर अ- + क्रूर, adj. soft, Man. 2, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्तक्रूरम्
दन्त-क्रूर + म् दन्त-क्रूर + म्, adv. (he seized) in a terrible way with the teeth, MBh. 7, 2431.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्मकृत्
क्रूरकर्मकृत् क्रूरकर्मकृत्, i. e. क्रूर-कर्मन्-कृ + त्, adj. m. A cruel beast, Man. 12, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरता
क्रूरता क्रूर + ता, f. Cruelty, Man. 10, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेतृ
क्रेतृ क्रेतृ, i. e. क्री + तृ, m. A purchaser, Yājñ. 2, 253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोड|क्रोडं|क्रोडः
क्रोड क्रोड,<BR> I. m. and f. डा.<BR> 1. The breast, Rām. 6, 82, 10; Mṛcch. 34, 14 (the bosom used to keep money in).<BR> 2. The interior, Hit. 80, 14.<BR> II. m. A hog, Pañc. 120, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0230-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोध|क्रोधः
क्रोध क्रोध, i. e. क्रुध् + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Anger, Man. 1, 25.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2543.<BR> II. f. धा, A proper name, MBh. 1, 2520.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्रोध|अक्रोधः
अ- + क्रोध अ- + क्रोध, m. freedom from wrath, Man. 3, 235.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्रोध
स- + क्रोध स- + क्रोध, adj., f. धा, wrathful, Chr. 57, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधन|क्रोधनः
क्रोधन क्रोधन, i. e. क्रुध् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. ना, Passionate, Rām. 2, 70, 10; Yājñ. 1, 333.<BR> II. n. Anger.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्रोधन|अक्रोधनः
अ- + क्रोधन अ- + क्रोधन, adj. free from wrath, Man. 3, 192.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्रोधन
स- + क्रोधन स- + क्रोधन, adj. enraged, Rām. 5, 85, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधालु
क्रोधालु क्रोधालु, i. e. क्रोध + आलु, adj. Passionate, Suśr. 2, 533, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोश|क्रोशः
क्रोश क्रोश, i. e. क्रुश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Cry (ved.).<BR> 2. A measure of distance, containing 4,000 cubits, Rām. 2, 90, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टु
क्रोष्टु क्रोष्टु, i. e. क्रुश् + तु, the base of most cases is क्रोष्टृ क्रोष्टृ, i. e. क्रुश् + तृ, m., f. त्री, A jackal, Draup. 1, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुक
क्रोष्टुक क्रोष्टु + क, m., f. की, A jackal, MBh. 13, 6342; Rām. 3, 20, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्च|क्रौंच|क्रौंचः|क्रौञ्चः
क्रौञ्च क्रौञ्च,<BR> I. m., f. ची, A kind of heron, or curlew, Man. 11, 134; Rām. 2, 76, 21.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. The name of a mountain, Rām. 4, 44, 32.<BR> 2. One of the Dvīpas, or principal divisions of the world, Bhāg. P. 5, 1, 32.<BR> 3. The name of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौर्य|क्रौर्यं|क्रौर्य्य
क्रौर्य क्रौर्य, i. e. क्रूर + य, n. Cruelty, Man. 12, 33 (Jones: Detraction).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लथ्
क्लथ् क्लथ्, i. 1, Par. To kill or hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लद्
† क्लद् क्लद्, see क्लन्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लन्द्|क्लंद्
† क्लन्द् क्लन्द्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To call.<BR> 2. To weep.<BR> --i. 1, Ātm. (v. r. क्लद्),<BR> 1. To be confused.<BR> 2. To confound.<BR> --Cf. क्रन्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लप्
† क्लप् क्लप्, i. 10, Par. To speak (? v. r.).<BR> --Cf. perhaps Lat. crepare; O.H.G. hrôfan; A.S. hreopan; Goth. hrôpjan (= क्लापय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लम्
क्लम् क्लम्, i. 1 and 4, क्लाम and क्लाम्य, Par. To be fatigued, exhausted.<BR> क्लान्त,<BR> 1. Fatigued. Rām. 2, 42, 19.<BR> 2. Exhausted, Ragh. 2, 13.<BR> 3. Withered, Śāk. d. 66.<BR> 4. Thin, Śāk. d. 58.<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, परि-क्लान्त, Much exhausted, MBh. 1, 5893.<BR> --With वि, Ātm. To despond, Śiś. 15, 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लम|क्लमः
क्लम क्लम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Fatigue, Arj. 4, 47.<BR> 2. Languor, Rām. 5, 49, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गतक्लम
गत- + क्लम गत- + क्लम, adj. f. मा, recreated, Nal. 11, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लव्
क्लव् क्लव्, i. 1, Ātm. To fear.<BR> --With prep. वि वि, To fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्ति|क्लांति|क्लांतिः|क्लान्तिः
क्लान्ति क्लान्ति, i. e. क्लम् + ति, f. Languor, Bhartṛ. 1, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिद्
क्लिद् क्लिद्, i. 4, क्लिद्य, Par. To become wet, Suśr. 2, 23, 12.<BR> क्लिन्न,<BR> 1. Wet, Rām. 1, 42, 20.<BR> 2. Filled with tears.<BR> 3. Compassionate, Bhāg. P. 4, 3, 10.<BR> --Caus. क्लेदय, To make wet, Bhag. 2, 23.<BR> --With the prep. समा सम्-आ, समाक्लिन्न, Wet with tears, MBh. 3, 13472.<BR> --With परि परि, परिक्लिन्न, Completely wet, Rām. 4, 6, 16.<BR> --With प्र प्र, Ātm. To become wet, Suśr. 1, 297, 17.<BR> प्रक्लिन्न, Wet, Rām. 3, 22, 21.<BR> --Caus. To moisten, Suśr. 1, 68, 4.<BR> --With वि वि, विक्लिन्न, Thoroughly wet, MBh. 1, 5412.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संक्लिन्न, Wet, Mṛcch. 92, 7.<BR> --Cf. perhaps κλύδιος, κλύζω; Goth. hlûtrs, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्द्|क्लिंद्
† क्लिन्द् क्लिन्द्, i. 1, Par., Ātm. To bewail.<BR> --Cf. क्रन्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0231-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिश्
क्लिश् क्लिश्, ii. 9, क्लिश्ना, क्लिश्नी, Par., and i. 4, क्लिश्य, Ātm. (also Par. Man. 8, 169),<BR> 1. To torment. MBh. 2, 2351; Ragh. 13, 73.<BR> 2. i. 4. To suffer distress, MBh. 2, 2255, Man. 8, 169.<BR> क्लिष्ट,<BR> 1. Afflicted, Śāk. d. 58, Rām. 3, 58, 15.<BR> 2. Hurt, Rām. 3, 58, 12.<BR> 3. Wasted, Suśr. 2, 157, 8.<BR> 4. Painful, Pañc. i. d. 12.<BR> टम्, adv. Miserably, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Caus. क्लेशय, To torment, Rām. 5, 27, 33.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To become uneasy, Suśr. 1, 331, 21.<BR> --Caus. To stir, Suśr. 2, 184, 18.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, To become uneasy, Suśr. 2, 348, 18.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To torment, Rām. 5, 58, 21.<BR> 2. i. 4, To suffer distress, Rām. 5, 25, 32; Par. MBh. 3, 578.<BR> परिक्लिष्ट, Much pained, Rām. 3, 52, 41.<BR> टम्, adv. With pain, Bhag. 17, 21.<BR> अ-, adv. With cheerfulness, MBh. 3, 108.<BR> --With वि वि, विक्लिष्ट, Violated, Rām. 4, 17, 15.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To torment, Rām. 2, 22, 14.<BR> संक्लिष्ट, Bruised, Suśr. 2, 16, 17.<BR> --Cf. कृश् and लिश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्लिश्ट
अ- + क्लिश्ट अ- + क्लिश्ट, adj.<BR> 1. without pain, MBh. 3, 1706. 2. unhurt, Rām. 6, 103, 4. 3. firm, Rām. 1, 34, 1. 4. reliable, Rām. 1, 38, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीब्
† क्लीब् क्लीब् and क्लीव् क्लीव्, i. 1. Ātm.<BR> 1. To behave like an eunuch; to be timorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीब|क्लीबः
क्लीब क्लीब, or क्लीव क्लीव, adj.<BR> 1. Deprived of virility; m. An eunuch, Man. 3, 150.<BR> 2. Timorous; m. A coward, MBh. 1, 5142.<BR> 3. Neuter.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्लीब
अ- + क्लीब अ- + क्लीब, adj. manly, Rām. 1, 28, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीबता
क्लीबता क्लीब + ता, f. and क्लीबत्व क्लीब-त्व, n.<BR> 1. Want of virility, Suśr. 1, 366, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्लीबता
अ- + क्लीबता अ- + क्लीबता, f. manly behaviour, Ragh. 8, 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लु
† क्लु क्लु, i. 1, Ātm. To move(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेद|क्लेदः
क्लेद क्लेद, i. e. क्लिद् + अ, m. Humidity, Rām. 5, 12, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदन|क्लेदनः
क्लेदन क्लेदन, i. e. क्लिद् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Moistening, Suśr. 1, 76, 19.<BR> II. n. Moistening, Bhāg. P. 3, 26, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेश्
† क्लेश् क्लेश्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To speak.<BR> 2. To impede.<BR> 3. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेश|क्लेशः
क्लेश क्लेश, i. e. क्लिश् + अ, m. Pain, Man. 2, 227.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्लेश|अक्लेशं|अक्लेशः
अ- + क्लेश अ- + क्लेश, m. want of bodily pain, Man. 4, 3; abl. शात्, without any effort, Pañc. ii. d. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भक्लेश|गर्भक्लेशः
गर्भ- + क्लेश गर्भ- + क्लेश, m. pains in labour, Mārk. P. 22, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशिन्
ऽक्लेशिन् -क्लेशिन्, i. e. क्लिश् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Hurting, Megh. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेष्टृ
क्लेष्टृ क्लेष्टृ, i. e. क्लिश् + तृ, m. Causing pain, MBh. 3, 1076.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लैब्य|क्लैब्यं
क्लैब्य क्लैब्य, or क्लैव्य क्लैव्य, i. e. क्लीब, or क्लीव, + य, n.<BR> 1. Want of virility, Hit. i. d. 129.<BR> 2. Timidity, Rām. 3, 19, 5.<BR> 3. Weakness, Ragh. 12, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लोमन्
क्लोमन् क्लोमन्, m. and n. The right lobe of the lungs, Suśr. 2, 446, 19. If identical with πλεύμων; Lat. pulmon, Sanskrit क् stands for प्; cf. क्षिव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्व
क्व क्व, i. e. क + व (cf. इ + व), from किम्, adv.<BR> 1. = loc. sing. of किम्. In whom, Man. 10, 66.<BR> 2. Where, Rām. 5, 34, 21.<BR> 3. Whither, Pañc. 36, 21.<BR> 4. क्व--क्व denotes the greatest difference: क्व वयं क्व परोक्षमन्मथो मृगशावैः समम् एधितो जनः, What communion could there be between me and a girl grown up among young fawns and disinclined to love? Śāk. d. 51.<BR> 5. How much less, Rām. 1, 67, 10.<BR> 6. With following अपि, Somewhere, Hit. pr. d. 17; Pañc. 96, 5; with न, Nowhere, Nal. 16, 6.<BR> 7. With न--च, Not anywhere, Bhāg. P. 4, 29, 64.<BR> 8. With न--च न, Nowhere, MBh. 14, 650.<BR> 9. With following चिद्,<BR> a. In some, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a " target="_blank">Page0233-a + 42</a>] Pañc. 118, 14.<BR> b. Somewhere, Lass. 6, 17; Kathās. 4, 131;<BR> c. With न, or another negative particle, Nowhere, Man. 2, 56; Rām. 3, 60, 5.<BR> d. क्व चिद्--क्व चिद्, Here and there, Rām. 2, 100, 6; क्व चिद्--क्व चिद्, Here--there, Kathās. 6, 26; 27; now--now, Rām. 3, 50, 7; with न, Never, Man. 2, 180.<BR> e. Some time, Nal. 14, 6.<BR> 10. With preceding यत्र,<BR> a. and following अपि, or च, or वा, Wherever, Bhartṛ. 3, 91; Bhāg. P. 8, 12, 34; 1, 17, 36;<BR> b. and following च न, Wherever, Brāhmaṇ. 3, 12; whenever, Bhāg. P. 5, 21, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वण्
क्वण् क्वण्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To sound, Ṛt. 3, 26.<BR> 2. To buzz, Vikr. d. 103.<BR> क्वणित, n. Sound, Ragh. 7, 83.<BR> --Caus. To cause to sound, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वथ्
क्वथ् क्वथ्, i. 1, Par. To boil, Man. 6, 20.<BR> --Caus. क्वाथय, The same, Mārk. P. 12, 26.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To boil out, Suśr. 2, 418, 10.<BR> --Caus. The same, 2, 432, 15.<BR> --With निस् निस्, Caus. To boil down, Suśr. 2, 80, 16.<BR> --Cf. perhaps κότος, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वथन|क्वथनं
क्वथन क्वथ् + अन, n. Boiling, Suśr. 1, 171, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वाथ|क्वाथः
क्वाथ क्वाथ, i. e. क्वथ् + अ, m. A decoction, Suśr. 2, 85, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वेल्
† क्वेल् क्वेल्, i. 1, Par. To shake (? v. r.; see क्ष्वेल्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षज्
† क्षज् क्षज्, or क्षञ्ज् क्षञ्ज्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To give.<BR> --i. 10, Par. To live in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षण्
क्षण् क्षण्, ii. 8, क्षणु (probably for original क्षे-णु, cf. क्षि); Par., Ātm. To wound, Kumāras. 5, 24.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. क्षत,<BR> 1. Wounded, Ragh. 3, 53.<BR> 2. Destroyed, Ṛt. 1, 2.<BR> 3. Violated, Yājñ. 1, 67. n. A wound, Suśr. 2, 19, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, परिक्षत,<BR> 1. Wounded, Man. 4, 122.<BR> 2. Hurt, Śāk. d. 72.<BR> --With वि वि, विक्षत, Hurt, MBh. 2, 1816.<BR> --With अभिवि अभि-वि, अभिविक्षत, Hurt, Rām. 5, 16, 21.<BR> --With परिवि परि-वि, परिविक्षत, Wounded, MBh. 1, 6906.<BR> --Cf. κταν in ἔκτανον, κτόνος, κτείνω, etc.; κτείς, κτενός, etc.; κτηδών, i. e. κταν + त्वन्, ἀσκεθής, καίνω, κατακονά, ξαίνω, ξάντης, etc.; ϕθόνος etc; perhaps Goth. skath, skathjan, skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षत|अक्षतं|अक्षतः
अ- + क्षत अ- + क्षत, f. A virgin, Yājñ. 2, 130. m. pl. or n. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b " target="_blank">Page0233-b + 42</a>] sing. Fried grain, Pañc. 158, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपरिक्षत
अति-परि-क्षत अति-परि-क्षत, Grievously wounded, Man. 7, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षत|विक्षतः
विक्षत विक्षत in अप-विक्षत, adj. Unhurt, Śāk. 63, 3 C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षण|क्षणं|क्षणः
क्षण क्षण (probably for ईक्षण, i. e. ईक्ष् + अन), m. and n.<BR> 1. A moment, Nal. 5, 1<BR> 2. A measure of time = 4 minutes, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 7.<BR> 3. Leisure, Mālav. 8, 9.<BR> 4. Opportunity, MBh. 4, 666.<BR> 5. A festival, Bhāg. P. 3, 3, 21.<BR> 6. Loc. णे and abl. णात्,<BR> a. In an instant, Rām. 2, 42, 44; Man. 11, 246;<BR> b. After a moment, Nal. 2, 3; Rām. 3, 50, 5.<BR> 7. क्षणेक्षणे, Every moment, Rājat. 5, 165.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किङ्क्षण|किंक्षण
किम्- + क्षण किम्- + क्षण, adj. one who disregards a moment, Hit. ii. d. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतक्षण
कृत- + क्षण कृत- + क्षण, adj., f. णा, expecting impatiently, MBh. 1, 778.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्षणम्
तत्क्षणम् तत्क्षणम्, i. e. तद्-क्षण + म्, and ˚णात्, adv. instantly, Pañc. 69, 20; Rām. 1, 55, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुक्षणात्
वस्तु-क्षणात् वस्तु-क्षणात् (abl.), when there is given an opportunity, Rājat. 5, 378.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्षण
स- + क्षण स- + क्षण, adj. being at leisure, Bhāg. P. 1, 1, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वयंवरकृतक्षण
स्वयंवर-कृत- + क्षण स्वयंवर-कृत- + क्षण, adj. having fixed the moment for the choosing a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणदा
क्षणदा क्षणदा, i. e. क्षण-द (vb. दा), f. Night, Rām. 2, 50, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणदाकर
क्षणदाकर क्षणदा-कर, m. The moon, Śiś. 9, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणदाचर
क्षणदाचर क्षणदा-चर, m. A Rākṣasa, or demon, Rām. 3, 35, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणन|क्षणनं
क्षणन क्षण् + अन, n. Hurting, Suśr. 1, 31, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणिक|क्षणिकः
क्षणिक क्षणिक, i. e. क्षण + इक, adj. Momentary, Hit. i. d. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणिन्
क्षणिन् क्षणिन्, i. e. क्षण + इन्, adj. Being at leisure, MBh. 2, 558.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षतज|क्षतजं
क्षतज क्षत-ज (vb. क्षण् and जन्),<BR> I. adj. Caused by wounding, Suśr. 2, 503, 5.<BR> II. n. Blood, Rām. 2, 94, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षति|क्षतिः
क्षति क्षति, i. e. क्षण् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Hurting, MBh. 3, 12180.<BR> 2. Destroying, Śāk. d. 39.<BR> 3. Harm, MBh. 4, 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्तृ
क्षत्तृ क्षत्तृ, m.<BR> 1. i. e. क्षद् + तृ, A carver (ved.).<BR> 2. A door-keeper, MBh. 4, 2215.<BR> 3. A charioteer.<BR> 4. The son of a Śūdra man and a Kṣatriyā woman, Man. 10, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्र|क्षत्त्रं|क्षत्त्रः|क्षत्रं|क्षत्रः
क्षत्र क्षत्र, i. e. क्षि + अत्र,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Dominion (ved.).<BR> 2. The second, or military caste, Man. 9, 322; its dignity, Bhāg. P. 3, 6, 31.<BR> II. m. A man of the military caste, Man. 3, 23.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षत्र
अ- + क्षत्र अ- + क्षत्र and निस्-, adj. without the military caste, Man. 9, 322; Bhāg. P. 1, 3, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रबन्धुवत्
क्षत्रबन्धुवत् क्षत्र-बन्धु + वत्, adv. Like a man of the military caste, Chr. 23, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रिय|क्षत्त्रियः|क्षत्रियः
क्षत्रिय क्षत्रिय, i. e. क्षत्र + इय,<BR> I. m. A man of the military caste, Man. 10, 4.<BR> II. f. या, A woman of the military caste, Man. 3, 44.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःक्षत्रिय
निःक्षत्रिय निःक्षत्रिय, i. e. निस्-, adj., f. या, devoid of Kṣatriyas, MBh. 1, 2459.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रियत्व
क्षत्रियत्व क्षत्रिय + त्व, n. The dignity of a Kṣatriya, MBh. 3, 13975.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रियब्रुव
क्षत्रियब्रुव क्षत्रियब्रुव, i. क्षत्रिय-ब्रा + अ, m. A wicked Kṣatriya, MBh. 13, 3565.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षद्
क्षद् क्षद्, i. 1, Ātm. To carve, to slaughter.<BR> --Cf. σϕάζω, etc., σχάζω, स्खद्, and खड्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षन्तृ|क्षंतृ
क्षन्तृ क्षन्तृ, i. e. क्षम् + तृ, m. One who endures, patient, MBh. 13, 4873.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षप्
1. क्षप् क्षप् (originally Caus. of 3. क्षि), i. 1, Par., Ātm. To fast, MBh. 3, 13405.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, The same, MBh. 13, 5149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षप्
2. क्षप् क्षप्, i. 10, Par. To throw, Pañc. 56, 2.<BR> --Cf. क्षिप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षप्
3. क्षप् see क्षपा, f. Night, Chr. 290, 8 = Rigv. i. 64, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षपण|क्षपणः
क्षपण क्षपण, i. e. क्षप् and 3. क्षि, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Fasting, Man. 4, 222.<BR> 2. Destroying, MBh. 2, 523.<BR> II. A Buddhistic mendicant; see भू.<BR> III. adj. Destroying, Bhāg. P. 4, 7, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षपणक|क्षपणकः
क्षपणक क्षपण + क, m. A religious, especially a Buddhistic, mendicant, MBh. 1, 789; Daśak. in Chr. 184, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षपा
क्षपा क्षपा, i. e. 3. क्षि, Caus., + अ, f. Night, Rām. 2, 25, 9.<BR> --Cf. probably Lat. crepusculum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षपाचर|क्षपाचरः
क्षपाचर क्षपा-चर, m. A Rākṣasa, or demon, Chr. 62, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षम्
क्षम् क्षम्, i. 1, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par.) and i. 4, † क्षाम्य, Par. (क्षम्य, Ātm., Bhāg. P. 6, 3, 30),<BR> 1. To endure, Rām. 4, 21, 23.<BR> 2. To have patience, Rām. 4, 26, 25.<BR> 3. To pardon, Rām. 2, 23, 11.<BR> 4. To permit, Rām. 2, 64, 37.<BR> 5. To be able, Śiś. 9, 65.<BR> क्षान्त, Patient, Man. 5, 158; n. Patience, Rām. 1, 34, 32.<BR> --Caus. क्षमय,<BR> 1. To beg one's pardon for something (with two acc., literally, To cause somebody to endure something), MBh. 3, 3017.<BR> 2. To endure patiently, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a " target="_blank">Page0235-a + 42</a>] Rām. 5, 49, 11.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, To indulge MBh. 2, 1389.<BR> --Cf. κομίζω, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षम|क्षमं|क्षमः
क्षम क्षम् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. मा.<BR> 1. Enduring, Draup. 6, 4.<BR> 2. Endurable, Śāk. d. 123.<BR> 3. Able, Pañc. v. d. 30.<BR> 4. Favourable, Rām. 2, 35, 31.<BR> 5. Useful, Man. 7, 208.<BR> 6. Suitable, MBh. 14, 703.<BR> II. f. मा,<BR> 1. Patience, forbearance, Rām. 1, 1, 19.<BR> 2. The earth, Rājat. 5, 334.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. χαμά + θεν χθαμαλός, etc., and ved. क्षम् = χθών.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतिक्षम
आयति- + क्षम आयति- + क्षम, adj. useful in future time, Man. 7, 208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोगक्षम
उपभोग- + क्षम उपभोग- + क्षम, adj. abounding in enjoyment, Śāk. 4, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालान्तरक्षम|कालांतरक्षम
कालान्तर- + क्षम कालान्तर- + क्षम, i. e. काल-अन्तर-, adj. suffering delay, Mālav. 28, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिक्षम
दृष्टि- + क्षम दृष्टि- + क्षम, adj. worth to be looked on, Vikr. d. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देशकालक्षम
देश-काल- + क्षम देश-काल- + क्षम, adj. in accordance with place and time, Rām. 5, 49, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनवासक्षम
वन-वास- + क्षम वन-वास- + क्षम, adj. suitable to a sojourn in a forest, Rām. 2, 30, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षमवन्त्|क्षमवत्
क्षमवन्त् क्षम + वन्त्, adj. Knowing what is suitable (?), Rām. 5, 89, 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षमापय
क्षमापय क्षमापय, a denomin. derived from क्षमा, Par., Ātm. To beg one's pardon, Bhāg. P. 9, 4, 71.<BR> --Cf. क्षम्, Causal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षमावन्त्|क्षमावत्
क्षमावन्त् क्षमा + वन्त्, adj. Patient, forbearing, Rām. 1, 34, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षमिन्
क्षमिन् क्षमिन्, i. e. क्षम + इन्, adj. Patient, forbearing, Yājñ. 2, 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षम्प्
† क्षम्प् क्षम्प्, i. 1, and 10, Par. To endure.<BR> --Cf. क्षम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षय|क्षयः
क्षय क्षय, i. e. 1. and 3. क्षि + अ, m.<BR> 1. An abode, MBh. 1, 2510.<BR> 2. Decrease, Man. 3, 122.<BR> 3. Diminution of price, Yājñ. 2, 258.<BR> 4. Loss, Brāhmaṇ. 2, 20.<BR> 5. End, Rām. 6, 105, 14.<BR> 6. Destruction, Hiḍ. 4, 84.<BR> 7. Consumption, phthisis, Suśr. 2, 445, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिनक्षय|दिनक्षयः
दिन- + क्षय दिन- + क्षय, m. evening, Kām. Nītis. 7, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनक्षय|धनक्षयः
धन- + क्षय धन- + क्षय, m. loss of wealth, Pañc. 234, 7. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b " target="_blank">Page0235-b + 40</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वदुःखक्षय|सर्वदुःखक्षयः|सर्व्वदुःखक्षय|सर्व्वदुःखक्षयः
सर्व-दुःख- + क्षय सर्व-दुःख- + क्षय, m. final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वकुलक्षय|स्वकुलक्षयः
स्व-कुल- + क्षय स्व-कुल- + क्षय, m. a fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षयंकर
क्षयंकर क्षयंकर, i. e. क्षय + म्-कर, adj., f. री, Causing destruction, MBh. 4, 180.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षयरोगित्व
क्षयरोगित्व क्षयरोगित्व, i. e. क्षयरोगिन् + त्व, n. Consumption, phthisis, Man. 11, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षयरोगिन्
क्षयरोगिन् क्षयरोगिन्, i. e. क्षय-रोग + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Phthisical Yājñ. 3, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षयिन्
क्षयिन् क्षयिन्, i. e. 3. क्षि and क्षय + इन्, adj., f. इणी.<BR> 1. Decreasing, Bhartṛ. 2, 50.<BR> 2. Phthisical, Man. 3, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षयिष्णु
क्षयिष्णु क्षयिष्णु, i. e. 3. क्षि + इष्णु, adj.<BR> 1. Destroying, Bhāg. P. 6, 16, 41.<BR> 2. Perishable, 7, 7, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षय्य|क्षय्यं
क्षय्य क्षय्य, i. e. क्षय + य, adj.<BR> 1. Subject to phthisis, Man. 3, 7.<BR> 2. Perishable.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षय्य
अ- + क्षय्य अ- + क्षय्य, adj. imperishable, Man. 4, 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षर्
क्षर् क्षर्, i. 1, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm.).<BR> 1. To stream, Rām. 5, 42, 8.<BR> 2. To pass away, Man. 2, 84.<BR> 3. To lose (with abl.), MBh. 13, 4716.<BR> 4. To let escape, to yield, Chr. 297, 11 = Rigv. i. 112, 11; MBh. 13, 3720.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि, To dissolve, MBh. 14, 2184.<BR> --Cf. Lat. scortum (cf. मिह्); Goth. hôrs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षर|क्षरं|क्षरः
क्षर क्षर् + अ, adj., f. रा, Perishable, MBh. 2, 433; see अक्षर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षरक
क्षरक क्षर् + अक, adj., f. रिका, Effusing, Dev. 11, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षल्
† 1. क्षल् क्षल्, i. 1, Par. To shake; to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षल्
2. क्षल् क्षल्, i. 10, क्षालय, Par. (properly Causal of क्षर्),<BR> 1. To make clean, Kathās. 25, 52; to purify, Prab. 94, 7.<BR> 2. To remove, Rājat. 5, 59. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a " target="_blank">Page0236-a + 38</a>]<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To wash, Pañc. 245, 7.<BR> 2. To remove, MBh. 1, 7510.<BR> --With अभिप्र अभि-प्र, To cleanse, Vikr. 78, 6.<BR> --With वि वि, To wash away, Ragh. 5, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0235-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षवथु|क्षवथुः
क्षवथु क्षवथु, i. e. क्षु + अथु, m. Sneezing, catarrh, Suśr. 1, 39, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षात्र
क्षात्र क्षात्र, i. e. क्षत्र + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. र्त्, Peculiar to the military caste, Rām. 1, 54, 14.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. The military caste, MBh. 3, 5097.<BR> 2. Royal dignity, Rām. 5, 84, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षान्ति|क्षांति|क्षांतिः|क्षान्तिः
क्षान्ति क्षान्ति, i. e. क्षम् + ति, f. Patience, forbearance, Man. 5, 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षान्तिमन्त्|क्षान्तिमत्
क्षान्तिमन्त् क्षान्ति + मन्त्, adj., f. मती, Forbearing, Rājat. 5, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षाम|क्षामः
क्षाम क्षाम, see क्षै.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षार|क्षारं|क्षारः
क्षार क्षार, i. e. क्षर् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. रा, Salty, Pañc. 61, 11.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A burning corrosive substance, either soda or potash, Rām. 2, 73, 3.<BR> 2. Treacle, Bhāg. P. 7, 4, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवक्षार|यवक्षारः
यव- + क्षार यव- + क्षार, m. saltpetre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षारय
क्षारय क्षारय, a denomin. derived from the last, Par.<BR> 1. To torment by corrosive substances, Mārk. P. 8, 142.<BR> 2. To defame, MBh. 2, 238.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, To defame, Man. 8, 275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षालन|क्षालनं
क्षालन क्षालन, i. e. क्षल् + अन, n. Washing, Pañc. ii. d. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षि|क्षिः
1. क्षि क्षि, i. 6, क्षिय (ved. ii. 2), Par.<BR> 1. To dwell (ved.). 2. † To go.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, ii. 2, To acquire, Chr. 291, 13 = Rigv. i. 64, 13.<BR> --Cf. κτι in ἐΰκτιτος, ἐϋκτίμενος, κτίζω; perhaps Lat. civis, etc., so-cius, cf. सखि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षि|क्षिः
2. क्षि क्षि, i. 1, क्षय, Par. To possess; to rule (with gen.), Chr. 296, 3 = Rigv. i. 112, 3.<BR> --Cf. κτάομαι, κτέανον, κτέαρ, κτῆνος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षि|क्षिः
3. क्षि क्षि, ii. 9, क्षिणा, क्षिणी, ii. 5, क्षिणु, i. 1, क्षय, Par.<BR> 1. To destroy, Ragh. 2, 40.<BR> 2. To hurt, MBh. 3, 1355.<BR> 3. To oppress, Man. 9, 315.<BR> --Pass. क्षीय,<BR> 1. To decrease Bhāg. P. 5, 22, 9.<BR> 2. To become exhausted, Pañc. i. d. 181.<BR> 3. To disappear, Bhartṛ. 2, 16.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass.,<BR> I. क्षीण,<BR> 1. Decreased, Śāk. d. 133; Bhartṛ. 2, 88.<BR> 2. Thin, Śāk. d. 58, v. r.<BR> 3. Exhausted, Hit. 1, 66; Pañc. i. d. 244; iv. d. 16 (of hunger). Feeble, Cāṇ. 99, in Monatsb. d. Berl. Ak. Hist. Phil. 1864, 413.<BR> 4. Finished, Kathās. 5, 128.<BR> 5. Perished, MBh. 2, 972.<BR> II. क्षित.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Causal,<BR> I. क्षपय,<BR> 1. To destroy, MBh. 3, 15163.<BR> 2. To emaciate, Man. 5, 157.<BR> 3. To pass away, MBh. 14, 2720.<BR> II. क्षयय in क्षयित,<BR> 1. Destroyed, Megh. 54.<BR> 2. Atoned, Bhag. 4, 30 (v. r. क्षपित).<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass., क्षययितव्य. To be destroyed, Rām. 6, 17, 4.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, pass., To disappear by degrees, Bhāg. P. 5, 14, 21.<BR> --With अप अप in अपक्षित, Exhausted, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 32.<BR> --With उप उप in उपक्षीण, Disappeared, Sāh. D. 17, 2.<BR> --With परि परि, To destroy, Bhāg. P. 3, 8, 20. Pass., To become poor, Hit. ii. d. 91, v. r. परिक्षीण,<BR> 1. Diminished, Kathās. 25, 140.<BR> 2. Weakened, Man. 7, 172.<BR> 3. Indigent, Man. 8, 170.<BR> --With प्र प्र, pass., To perish, MBh. 2, 1468.<BR> प्रक्षीण,<BR> 1. Destroyed, Bhāg. P. 6, 7, 23.<BR> 2. Atoned, Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 21. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a " target="_blank">Page0237-a + 41</a>]<BR> --With वि वि, in विक्षित, Miserable, Rām. 3, 79, 46.<BR> --With सम् सम्, pass., To become exhausted, Bhartṛ. 3, 44.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. क्षपय, To cause to fall off, Suśr. 2, 134, 3.<BR> 2. Ptcple. pf. pass., क्षयित, Vanished, Rām. 2, 48, 29.<BR> --Cf. κτίννυμι (probably for κτειννυμι and original κτεισνυμι, cf. क्षेष्णु, Vop. 26, 44), ψίω; Lat. sitis, properly, exhaustion by thirst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षित
अ-क्षित अ-क्षित, adj., not decayed, inexhaustible, Chr. 290, 6 = Rigv. i. 64, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0236-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिण्
† क्षिण् क्षिण्, ii. 8, क्षिणु (cf. 3. क्षि), Par., Ātm., To hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षित्
ऽक्षित् 2. क्षि + त्, Ruling, e. g. पृथिवी-, m. A king, Nal. 5, 4.<BR> मही-, m. The same, Chr. 5, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिति|क्षितिः
क्षिति 1. क्षि + ति, f.<BR> 1. An abode, Bhāg. P. 4, 9, 5.<BR> 2. The earth, Bhartṛ. 3, 5.<BR> 3. Land, Rājat. 5, 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिज|क्षितिजं|क्षितिजः
क्षितिज क्षिति-ज (vb. जन्)<BR> I. adj. Sprung from the earth, Suśr. 1, 224, 9.<BR> II. m. A tree, Rām. 6, 76, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिधर|क्षितिधरः
क्षितिधर क्षिति-धर, m. A mountain, Bhartṛ. 2, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिभृत्
क्षितिभृत् क्षिति-भृ + त्, m.<BR> 1. A mountain, Ṛt. 6, 25.<BR> 2. A king, Bhartṛ. 3, 59, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिरुह्
क्षितिरुह् क्षिति-रुह्, m. A tree, Bhartṛ. 3, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिवृत्तिमन्त्|क्षितिवृत्तिमत्
क्षितिवृत्तिमन्त् क्षिति-वृत्ति + मन्त्, adj. Patient, like the earth, Bhāg. P. 4, 16, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्
क्षिप् क्षिप्, i. 6, Par., Ātm. (i. 4, Ātm. only in a grammatical poem).<BR> 1. To throw, Pañc. 210, 17; MBh. 1, 1126 (क्षिप्यतस्, pass., instead of क्षिप्यमाणस्य); (of arrows), MBh. 3, 1018.<BR> 2. To move quickly, Mṛcch. 9, 19.<BR> 3. To impel, Rām. 3, 58, 21.<BR> 4. To pour, Yājñ. 1, 230.<BR> 5. To disdain, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 17.<BR> 6. To slander, Man. 8, 312.<BR> 7. To destroy, Bhāg. P. 6, 1, 14. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-b " target="_blank">Page0237-b + 42</a>]<BR> --Comp. partcple. of the pf. pass., तिर्यक्क्षिप्त, i. e. तिर्यञ्च्-, adj. (One part of the bones of a joint) being turned outward, Suśr. 1, 300, 8.<BR> --Caus. To cause to be thrown, Kathās. 13, 160.<BR> --With the prep. अति अति, अति-क्षिप्त, Dislocated, Suśr. 1, 300, 8.<BR> --With अधि अधि,<BR> 1. To offend, Man. 4, 185.<BR> 2. To humble, to surpass, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 30.<BR> 3. To prevent (a disease), Suśr. 2, 337, 8.<BR> --With अप अप, To remove, Rām. 3, 1, 24.<BR> --With अव अव,<BR> 1. To cast down, MBh. 1, 1126.<BR> 2. To cast off, Rām. 2, 37, 7.<BR> 3. To slander, MBh. 2, 1337.<BR> 4. To tender, to grant, MBh. 13, 3030.<BR> --With समव सम्-अव, To repel, MBh. 3, 15662.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To cast on, Pañc. 263, 20.<BR> 2. To hit, Rām. 6, 78, 5.<BR> 3. To pull, MBh. 4, 750.<BR> 4. To rob, Vikr. d. 143.<BR> 5. To throw down, Bhāg. P. 6, 12, 28.<BR> 6. To expel, MBh. 3, 539.<BR> 7. To set up, Kathās. 18, 121.<BR> 8. To put in, MBh. 3, 3094.<BR> 9. To neglect, MBh. 3, 16117.<BR> 10. To insult, Man. 4, 141.<BR> --Caus. To cause to be overthrown, MBh. 3, 15733.<BR> --With पर्या परि-आ, To twine, Kumāras. 7, 14.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ,<BR> 1. To put on, MBh. 3, 566.<BR> 2. To discharge, to shoot off.<BR> 3. To hit, MBh. 1, 1402.<BR> व्याक्षिप्त, Agitated, Rām. 6, 91, 3.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ,<BR> 1. To accumulate, MBh. 1, 156.<BR> 2. To repel, MBh. 3, 15662.<BR> 3. To move violently, MBh. 3, 117.<BR> 4. To expel, MBh. 2, 1019.<BR> 5. To pull down, Rām. 3, 56, 50.<BR> 6. To destroy, MBh. 1, 1253.<BR> 7. To insult, MBh. 1, 1677.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To throw up, Man. 3, 90.<BR> 2. To raise, MBh. 3, 11187; Pañc. 187, 21.<BR> 3. To cast off, Bhāg. P. 4, 23, 17.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्,<BR> 1. To throw up, MBh. 3, 436. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-a " target="_blank">Page0238-a + 41</a>]<BR> 2. To lift up, MBh. 3, 11519.<BR> 3. To expel, MBh. 3, 13972.<BR> 4. To loosen, Rām. 5, 56, 140.<BR> 5. To destroy, Rām. 5, 3, 69.<BR> --With उप उप,<BR> 1. To cast on, Sāh. D. 66, 5.<BR> 2. To set, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 34.<BR> 3. To insult, Rām. 5, 11, 11.<BR> 4. To hint, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 6.<BR> --With नि नि,<BR> 1. To throw down, Rām. 3, 33, 20.<BR> 2. To put down, Yājñ. 1, 103.<BR> 3. To encamp, Rām. 2, 91, 5.<BR> 4. To put, Yājñ. 1, 327.<BR> 5. To pour, Pañc. 174, 14.<BR> 6. To dispense, Man. 7, 101.<BR> 7. To intrust, Man. 7, 59.<BR> 8. To establish, Rām. 2, 51, 17.<BR> 9. To cast off, MBh. 3, 14115.<BR> 10. To repel, Hit. 91, 11.<BR> --Caus. To cause to be drawn up, Ragh. 7, 62.<BR> --With उपनि उप-नि, To put down, Man. 3, 224.<BR> --With प्रतिनि प्रति-नि, To put down again, MBh. 3, 15184.<BR> --With विनि वि-नि,<BR> 1. To throw down, Rām. 5, 11, 12.<BR> 2. To put down, Yājñ. 1, 231.<BR> 3. To intrust, MBh. 1, 3545.<BR> 4. To appoint, MBh. 3, 10403.<BR> --With निस् निस्,<BR> 1. To put down, Rām. 1, 38, 21.<BR> 2. To put in, MBh. 3, 14314.<BR> --With विनिस् वि-निस्,<BR> 1. To inlay with, MBh. 13, 1444.<BR> 2. To direct, MBh. 3, 14293.<BR> --With परा परा, पराक्षिप्त,<BR> 1. Robbed, Bhāg. P. 5, 24, 18.<BR> 2. Enraptured, Bhāg. 5, 2, 18.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To overlay, Rām. 2, 32, 35.<BR> 2. To surround, Rām. 3, 61, 31.<BR> 3. To embrace, Rām. 2, 30, 2.<BR> 4. To fetter, Rām. 2, 72, 38.<BR> 5. To put in, MBh. 1, 4205.<BR> सूर्यातप-परिक्षिप्त, Darted upon by the rays of the sun.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To cast, MBh. 3, 707.<BR> 2. To put, Mṛcch. 50, 1.<BR> --Caus. To order to be put, MBh. 1, 5008.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b " target="_blank">Page0238-b + 39</a>] To cast, MBh. 13, 4609.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति,<BR> 1. To cast in, MBh. 1, 7068.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To cast in different directions, Chr. 34, 10.<BR> 2. To disperse, MBh. 1, 7022.<BR> 3. To extend, MBh. 14, 1161.<BR> 4. To let go (the string of a bow, MBh. 3, 15690; or the bow, Rām. 3, 70, 2, i. e. to shoot).<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To heap, Ragh. 1, 52.<BR> 2. To destroy, Rām. 3, 43, 42.<BR> 3. To constrain, Rām. 2, 40, 39.<BR> 4. To diminish, Man. 7, 34.<BR> 5. To abridge, MBh. 1, 51.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To contract, MBh. 5, 283; अभिसंक्षिप्त, Thrown at, MBh. 1, 5368.<BR> --With परिसम्, To surround, Rām. 5, 29, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0237-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तचित्तता
क्षिप्तचित्तता क्षिप्त-चित्त + ता, f. Absence of mind, MBh. 2, 241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्र|क्षिप्रं
क्षिप्र क्षिप् + र,<BR> I. adj., f. रा, Quick, Man. 7, 179. Comparat. क्षेपीयंस्, superl. क्षेपिष्ठ.<BR> II. रम्, adv. Quickly, Rām. 1, 52, 21.<BR> III. रात्, adv. Directly, Kathās. 18, 280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिल्लिका
क्षिल्लिका क्षिल्लिका, f. A proper name, Rājat. 5, 289.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिव्
† क्षिव् क्षिव्, i. 1 and 4, क्षीव्य, Par. To spit.<BR> --If identical with Goth. speiwan; A.S. spiwan; Lat. spuo; κτύω; Sskr. क् stands for प्, see क्लोमन्.<BR> --Cf. ष्ठिव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षी
† क्षी क्षी = 3. क्षि, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीज्
क्षीज् क्षीज्, i. 1, Par. To sound inarticulately, to groan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीण|क्षीणः
क्षीण क्षीण, see 3. क्षि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणता
क्षीणता क्षीण + ता, f. Being damaged, Mṛcch. 47, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीब्
क्षीब् क्षीब्, and क्षीब क्षीब, = क्षीव्, क्षीव, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0238-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीर|क्षीरः
क्षीर क्षीर, Milk, Man. 5, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरप|क्षीरपः
क्षीरप क्षीर-प (vb. 1. पा), m.<BR> 1. Drinking milk, MBh. 13, 646.<BR> 2. A nurse-child, Suśr. 1, 129, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरमय
क्षीरमय क्षीर + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of milk, represented by milk, Bhāg. P. 4, 18, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरय
क्षीरय क्षीरय, a denomin. derived from क्षीर, Par. To become like milk, Lass. 12, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरिन्
क्षीरिन् क्षीरिन्, i. e. क्षीर + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इणी, Abounding in milk, Yājñ. 1, 204; Man. 8, 246.<BR> II. m. A certain tree, Suśr. 1, 133, 16.<BR> III. f. इणी, A name of several plants, Suśr. 2, 67, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीव्
क्षीव् क्षीव्, i. 1, Par. To spit; cf. क्षिव् and ष्ठिव्.<BR> --With प्र प्र, प्रक्षीवित, Intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीव|क्षीवः
क्षीव क्षीव् + अ, adj., f. वा, Intoxicated, Rām. 5, 60, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीवता
क्षीवता क्षीव + ता, f. Intoxication, Kathās. 13, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षु|क्षुः
क्षु क्षु, ii. 2, Par. To sneeze, Man. 5, 145; Śiś. 9, 83.<BR> क्षुत,<BR> 1. One who has sneezed, MBh. 13, 7584.<BR> 2. On which a person has sneezed, MBh. 13, 1577. n. Sneezing, Yājñ. 1, 196.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, अवक्षुत, On which a person has sneezed, Man. 4, 213.<BR> --Akin to क्षिव्, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुण्ण|क्षुण्णं
क्षुण्ण क्षुण्ण, see क्षुद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुत्पिपासित
क्षुत्पिपासित क्षुत्पिपासित, i. e. क्षुध्-पिपासा + इत, adj. Tormented with hunger and thirst, Man. 8, 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुद्
क्षुद् क्षुद्, ii. 7, क्षुणद्, क्षुन्द्, Par., Ātm. To pound.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., क्षुण्ण,<BR> 1. Pounded, Pañc. 160, 3.<BR> 2. Scattered, MBh. 3, 678.<BR> 3. Exercised, Suśr. 2, 139, 12.<BR> --Comp.[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b " target="_blank">Page0239-b + 40</a>]<BR> --Caus. To grind, Suśr. 2, 66, 13.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To grind, Suśr. 1, 163, 13.<BR> --With प्र प्र, प्रक्षुण्ण, metaph., urged on, Pañc. ii. d. 150.<BR> --With वि वि, विक्षुण्ण, Pounded, Dev. 3, 25.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To stamp, Rām. 2, 80, 10.<BR> --Cf. खुद्, probably Lat. cudere, incus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षुण्ण|अक्षुण्णः
अ-क्षुण्ण अ-क्षुण्ण, adj. unbroken, Rām. 1, 8, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुद्र|क्षुद्रः
क्षुद्र क्षुद् + र, adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Small, Rām. 3, 33, 21.<BR> 2. Mean, Pañc. iii. d. 89.<BR> --Comparat. क्षोदीयंस्, superl. क्षोदिष्ठ.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षुद्र|अक्षुद्रः
अ- + क्षुद्र अ- + क्षुद्र, adj. Lofty, Pañc. iii. d. 69; MBh. 2, 152.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुद्रक|क्षुद्रकः
क्षुद्रक क्षुद्र + क,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Very little (young), Man. 8, 297.<BR> 2. Short (of breath), Suśr. 2, 497, 7.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 1871.<BR> 2. The name of a prince, Bhāg. P. 9, 12, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुद्रंचर
क्षुद्रंचर क्षुद्रंचर, i. e. क्षुद्र + म्-चर, adj. Pursuing small things, Bhāg. P. 4, 29, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुध्
क्षुध् क्षुध्, i. 4, क्षुध्य, Par. To be hungry; क्षुधित, Hungry, Rām. 3, 16, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुध्
क्षुध् क्षुध्, f. Hunger, Man. 7, 134.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुधा
क्षुधा क्षुध् + आ, f. Hunger, Pañc. 88, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुधालु
क्षुधालु क्षुधा + लु, adj. Hungry, Pañc. 88, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुप|क्षुपः
क्षुप क्षुप, m.<BR> 1. A shrub, Yājñ. 2, 229.<BR> 2. The name of a king, MBh. 14, 66.<BR> 3. The name of a mountain, Hariv. 8950.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. scubo, scubil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुब्धता
क्षुब्धता क्षुब्ध + ता (vb. क्षुभ्), f. Commotion, Bhartṛ. 3, 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुभ्
क्षुभ् क्षुभ्, i. 1, Ātm.; i. 4, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a " target="_blank">Page0240-a + 41</a>] क्षुभ्य, Par. (also Ātm.); ii. 9, क्षुभ्ना, क्षुभ्नी, Par. To become agitated, Rām. 2, 34, 45.<BR> क्षुब्ध and क्षुभित,<BR> 1. Agitated, Suśr. 2, 147, 19; Rām. 1, 65, 12.<BR> 2. Shaken, Vikr. d. 115.<BR> 3. Trembling, Rām. 5, 36, 77.<BR> अ-क्षोभ्य, comp. participle of the fut. pass.<BR> 1. Unshakeable, Rām. 2, 18, 6.<BR> 2. Undisturbable, Rām. 2, 12, 86.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To agitate, Rām. 1, 1, 77.<BR> 2. To shake, Rām. 5, 54, 12.<BR> 3. To impel, MBh. 13, 7256.<BR> 4. To throw in confusion, Man. 8, 418.<BR> 5. To trouble, Mārk. P. 1, 40 (Ātm.).<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र, To become agitated, Rām. 6, 87, 15; confused, Man. 9, 254.<BR> --Caus. To excite, Suśr. 2, 247, 10.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To become confused, Rām. 6, 78, 24.<BR> --With वि वि, To become agitated, Bhāg. P. 7, 8, 32.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To agitate, MBh. 1, 1216; 7283 (Ātm.).<BR> 2. To put in disorder, MBh. 1, 5484.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To become agitated, Pañc. 163, 1.<BR> --Cf. A.S. be-scufan, contrudere; O.H.G. sciuban; A.S. sceofan; but their labial is not the regular substitute for Sskr. भ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुमा
क्षुमा क्षुमा, f. A sort of flax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुर्
† क्षुर् क्षुर्, i. e. Par.<BR> 1. To cut.<BR> 2. To scratch.<BR> 3. To make furrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुर|क्षुरः
क्षुर क्षुर् + अ, m. A razor, Man. 9, 292.<BR> --Cf. ξυρόν, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरप्र|क्षुरप्रः
क्षुरप्र क्षुर-प्र (cf. खुर), m. A kind of arrow, one with a horse-shoe head, MBh. 4, 1732; Pañc. 38, 2 (a knife?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिका
क्षुरिका क्षुरिका, i. e. क्षुर + क, f. A dagger, Rājat. 5, 437.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्ल|क्षुल्लः
क्षुल्ल क्षुल्ल (a form of क्षुद्र, with ल् for र् and assimilation), adj. Small, Bhāg. P. 3, 5, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लक|क्षुल्लकः
क्षुल्लक क्षुल्ल + क, adj., f. का, Small, Bhāg. P. 4, 30, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्र|क्षेत्रं
क्षेत्र क्षेत्र, i. e. 1. 2. क्षि + त्र, n.<BR> 1. Landed property, Bhāg. P. 9, 6, 37.<BR> 2. A field, Man. 10, 114.<BR> 3. Place, Lass. 17, 2.<BR> 4. Extent, Yājñ. 2, 156.<BR> 5. A wife, Man. 9, 33; MBh. 1, 4661.<BR> 6. The body, Bhag. 13, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षेत्र
अ- + क्षेत्र अ- + क्षेत्र, n. a barren field, Man. 10, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मक्षेत्र|कर्म्मक्षेत्र
कर्मक्षेत्र कर्मक्षेत्र, i. e. कर्मन्-, n. the seat of sacred works, Bhāg. P. 5, 17, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरुक्षेत्र|कुरुक्षेत्रं
कुरु- + क्षेत्र कुरु- + क्षेत्र,<BR> I. n. the name of a country, Man. 2, 19;<BR> II. m. pl. the name of its inhabitants, Man. 7, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मक्षेत्र|धर्मक्षेत्रः|धर्म्मक्षेत्र|धर्म्मक्षेत्रं
धर्म- + क्षेत्र धर्म- + क्षेत्र, n. a plain in the north-west of India, Bhag. 1, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणक्षेत्र
रण- + क्षेत्र रण- + क्षेत्र, n. a field of battle, Chr. 25, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेश्वरीक्षेत्र
सुर-ईश्वरी- + क्षेत्र सुर-ईश्वरी- + क्षेत्र, n. the name of a district, Rājat. 5, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज|क्षेत्रजः
क्षेत्रज क्षेत्र-ज (vb. जन्), and क्षेत्रजात क्षेत्र-जात, m. A wife's son by a kinsman or a person duly appointed to beget issue to the husband, Man. 9, 159; Yājñ. 2, 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञ|क्षेत्रज्ञः
क्षेत्रज्ञ क्षेत्र-ज्ञ (vb. ज्ञा),<BR> I. adj. f. ज्ञा, Conversant with (with gen.), MBh. 1, 3653.<BR> II. m. The soul, Man. 8, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रता
क्षेत्रता क्षेत्र + ता, f. Residence, Kathās. 3, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रवित्तपता
क्षेत्रवित्तपता क्षेत्रवित्तपता, i. e. क्षेत्र-विद्-तप + ता, f. Illuminating the soul, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिक|क्षेत्रिकः
क्षेत्रिक क्षेत्रिक, i. e. क्षेत्र + इक,<BR> 1. m. The owner of a field, Man. 8, 241.<BR> 2. A husband, Man. 9, 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिन्
क्षेत्रिन् क्षेत्रिन्, i. e. क्षेत्र + इन्, m.<BR> 1. The owner of a field, Man. 9, 51.<BR> 2. A husband, Man. 9, 132.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अक्षेत्रिन्
अ- + क्षेत्रिन् अ- + क्षेत्रिन्, 1. one who has no property in a field, Man. 9, 41. 2. one who has no marital property in a woman, Man. 9, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0240-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप|क्षेपः
क्षेप क्षेप, i. e. क्षिप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Throwing, moving, Rām. 4, 62, 12.<BR> 2. Abuse, Yājñ. 2, 204.<BR> 3. A nosegay, Megh. 48.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालक्षेप|कालक्षेपः
काल- + क्षेप काल- + क्षेप, m. delay, Pañc. 43, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकालक्षेपम्
अ-कालक्षेप + म् अ-कालक्षेप + म्, adv. directly, Śāk. C. 91, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटाक्षेप
पटाक्षेप पटाक्षेप, i. e. पट-अ-क्षेप, m. not drawing away the curtain(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटीक्षेप|अपटीक्षेपः
अपटी-क्षेप अपटी-क्षेप, m. tossing up the curtain; the instr. एण denotes (in theatrical language) abrupt entrance on the stage, Mṛcch. 29, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूक्षेप|भ्रूक्षेपः
भ्रू- + क्षेप भ्रू- + क्षेप, m. 1. a graceful motion of the eyebrows, Indr. 5, 7; 2. a frown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदृष्टिक्षेपम्
स-दृष्टि-क्षेप + म् स-दृष्टि-क्षेप + म्, adv. glancing to somebody, Śāk. 12, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपण|क्षेपणं
क्षेपण क्षेपण, i. e. क्षिप् + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Striking (?), MBh. 4, 352.<BR> 2. Letting go (the string of a bow).<BR> 3. Expelling, MBh. 3, 13272.<BR> 4. Suspension, MBh. 4, 419.<BR> 5. A sling, Bhāg. P. 3, 19, 18.<BR> II. fem. णी, A sling, of other missile weapon, Rām. 6, 7, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपिष्ठ|क्षेपिष्ठः
क्षेपिष्ठ क्षेपिष्ठ, and क्षेपीयंस् क्षेपीयंस्, see क्षिप्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप्तृ
क्षेप्तृ क्षेप्तृ, i. e. क्षिप् + तृ, m. A linger, Rām. 4, 9, 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम|क्षेमं|क्षेमः
क्षेम क्षेम, i. e. 1. or 2. क्षि + म, 1. adj., f. मा,<BR> 1. Safe, dangerless, MBh. 3, 488.<BR> 2. Prosperous, MBh. 3, 15976.<BR> II. m. and n.<BR> 1. Safety, Man. 2, 127.<BR> 2. Well-being, Rām. 3, 44, 15.<BR> 3. Happiness, Bhāg. P. 2, 6, 18.<BR> 4. Fortune, wealth, MBh. 13, 3081.<BR> 5. instr. मेण, adverbially, Peacefully, Mṛcch. 110, 8; happily, Pañc. i. d. 162; also क्षेमैस्, MBh. 13, 1519.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. क्षेम, safety, happiness, personified, Bhāg. P. 4, 1, 51.<BR> 2. The name of a prince, MBh. 1, 2701.<BR> IV. f. मा, The name of an Apsaras, MBh. 1, 4818.<BR> V. n. The name of one of the divisions of the continent, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Goth. haims; A.S. ham.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेम|योगक्षेमं|योगक्षेमः
योग- + क्षेम योग- + क्षेम, n.<BR> 1. Security, Man. 8, 230.<BR> 2. Expenses for securing goods (properly, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b " target="_blank">Page0241-b + 39</a>] for securing a business), Man. 7, 127.<BR> 3. What serves for giving security of business (family priests and spiritual counsellors), Man. 9, 219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमंकर|क्षेमङ्कर|क्षेमङ्करः
क्षेमंकर क्षेमंकर, i. e. क्षेम + म्-कर, m. The name of a king, Draup. 2, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमिन्
क्षेमिन् क्षेमिन्, i. e. क्षेम + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Safe, Nal. 12, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम्य|क्षेम्यं|क्षेम्यः
क्षेम्य क्षेम्य, i. e. क्षेम + य,<BR> I. adj., f. या.<BR> 1. Salubrious, Man. 7, 212.<BR> 2. Secure, MBh. 14, 1691.<BR> II. m. The name of several princes, Hariv. 1592, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेव्
† क्षेव् क्षेव्, i. 1, Par. = क्षिव्, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षै
क्षै क्षै, i. 1, क्षाय, Par. = 3. क्षि; ptcple. of the pf. pass. क्षाम,<BR> 1. Dried up, Pañc. 20, 25.<BR> 2. Emaciated, Ṛt. 6, 28.<BR> 3. Slender, Megh. 80.<BR> 4. Weak, Rājat. 5, 219.<BR> 5. Little, Megh. 78, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षैण्य|क्षैण्यं
क्षैण्य क्षैण्य, i. e. क्षीण + य, n. Ruin, Rājat. 5, 262.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षैत्रपत्य
क्षैत्रपत्य क्षैत्रपत्य, i. e. क्षेत्र-पति + य, n. Estate, Chr. 297, 13 = Rigv. i. 112, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोट्
† क्षोट् क्षोट्, i. 10, Par. To cast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोणि|क्षोणिः
क्षोणि and क्षोणी क्षोणी̆, f. The earth, Bhāg. P. 4, 21, 35; Rām. 1, 42, 23 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोणीमय
क्षोणीमय क्षोणी + मय, adj. Containing the earth, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोद|क्षोदः
क्षोद क्षोद, i. e. क्षुद् + अ, m. Pulverised substance, flour, Rām. 2, 104, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोदस्
क्षोदस् क्षोदस्, i. e. क्षुद् + अस्, n. Stream, Chr. 259, 12 = Rigv. i. 92, 12; Chr. 297, 12 = Rigv. i. 112, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोदिष्ठ|क्षोदिष्ठः
क्षोदिष्ठ क्षोदिष्ठ, and क्षोदीयंस् क्षोदीयंस्, see क्षुद्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोभ|क्षोभः
क्षोभ क्षोभ, i. e. क्षुभ् + अ, m. Agitation, MBh. 1, 1214; Śāk. d. 158.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोभण|क्षोभणं|क्षोभणः
क्षोभण क्षोभण, i. e. क्षुभ् + अन, adj. Shaking, Rām. 3, 36, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षौणी
क्षौणी क्षौणी = क्षोणि, Bhāg. P. 3, 14, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षौद्र|क्षौद्रं|क्षौद्रः
क्षौद्र क्षौद्र, i. e. क्षुद्र + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The name of a tree, Michelia campaka, MBh. 3, 11569.<BR> 2. The name of a mixed caste, the offspring of a Vaideha man and a Māgadhī woman, MBh. 13, 2584.<BR> II. n. Honey, Man. 10, 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षौम|क्षौमं|क्षौमः
क्षौम क्षौम, i. e. क्षुमा + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. मी.<BR> 1. Made of flax, Man. 2, 41.<BR> 2. Made of linseed-oil, Suśr. 1, 182, 20.<BR> II. (m. and n.) A linen garment, Rām. 5, 45, 4.<BR> III. n. Linseed, Suśr. 2, 364, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षौर|क्षौरं
क्षौर क्षौर, i. e. क्षुर + अ, n. Shaving, Hit. 101, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षौरपव्य|क्षौरपव्यं
क्षौरपव्य क्षौरपव्य, i. e. क्षुर-पवि + य, adj. made of razors and thunderbolts, Bhāg. P. 6, 5, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्णु
क्ष्णु क्ष्णु (a syncope of 3. क्षि + णु) ii. 2, Par. To sharpen.<BR> --Cf. Goth. hnuto.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्मा
क्ष्मा क्ष्मा, a syncope of क्षम् + आ, f. The earth, Bhartṛ. 2, 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्माप|क्ष्मापः
क्ष्माप क्ष्मा-प (vb. 2. पा), m. A king, Rājat. 5, 314.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्माभुज्
क्ष्माभुज् क्ष्मा-भुज्, m. A king, Rājat. 5, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्माभृत्
क्ष्माभृत् क्ष्मा-भृ + त्, m. A mountain, Pañc. i. d. 171.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्माय्
क्ष्माय् क्ष्माय्, i. 1, Ātm. To tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्मील्
† क्ष्मील् क्ष्मील् (cf. श्मील्, स्मील्, मील् and मिस्ह्), i. 1, Par. To twinkle, to close the eyelids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्रौम्
क्ष्रौम् क्ष्रौम्, A mystical exclamation, Bhāg. P. 5, 18, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्विड्
1. क्ष्विड् क्ष्विड्, i. 1, Par. To sound inarticulately:<BR> 1. To hum (?), Rām. 4, 45, 8.<BR> 2. To gnash the teeth, Man. 4, 64.<BR> --Caus. क्ष्वेडय, to make a noise, MBh. 3, 12379.<BR> क्ष्वेडित, n. Noise, MBh. 1, 2820.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, आक्ष्वेदित, Groaning(?), Rām. 6, 35, 2.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To whiz, MBh. 4, 1686.<BR> 2. To groan, Rām. 6, 17, 32.<BR> --Cf. क्ष्वेल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्विड्
† 2. क्ष्विड् क्ष्विड् (cf. क्ष्विद्), i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To be unctuous.<BR> 2. To exude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्विद्
क्ष्विद् क्ष्विद्, i. 1, Par. = 1. क्ष्विड्. † i. 1, Ātm., and i. 4, Par. = 2. क्ष्विड्.<BR> --Cf. स्विद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेड|क्ष्वेडं|क्ष्वेडः
क्ष्वेड क्ष्वेड,<BR> I. m. Poison, Sāyaṇa and Rigv. i. 117, 16.<BR> II. f. डा, A bamboo rod.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलक्ष्वेड|स्थूलक्ष्वेडः
स्थूल-क्ष्वेड स्थूल-क्ष्वेड, m. an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेडन|क्ष्वेडनं
क्ष्वेडन क्ष्वेडन, i. e. 1. क्ष्विड् + अन, n. An inarticulate sound (of sighing), MBh. 3, 12388.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेल्
क्ष्वेल् क्ष्वेल् (originally = 1. क्ष्विड्), i. 1, Par. (To be noisy), To jump, to play, Rām. 5, 10, 13.<BR> क्ष्वेलित, m. and n., and क्ष्वेल्य, n. Play, Bhāg. P. 8, 9, 11; 5, 1, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेलिका
क्ष्वेलिका क्ष्वेलिका, i. e. क्ष्वेल् + अक, f. Play, Bhāg. P. 5, 8, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख|खं|खः
ख ख (vb. खन्), n.<BR> 1. A cavity of the human body, as mouth, nose, etc., Man. 12, 120.<BR> 2. A wound, Man. 9, 45.<BR> 3. The subtile æther, Man. 12, 120.<BR> 4. Sky, Rām. 1, 19, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खक्ख्
† खक्ख् खक्ख्, see कख्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खग|खगः
खग ख-ग,<BR> I. adj. Moving, existing, in the sky, MBh. 3, 12257.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A bird, Rām. 3, 20, 36.<BR> 2. Wind, MBh. 3, 14616.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खच्
खच् खच् (probably for क्षच्; cf. खञ्ज् and Lat. scatere), i. 1 (and † ii. 9), Par.<BR> 1. To spring up, Kathās. 23, 88.<BR> 2. To appear, Lass. 73, 13.<BR> 3. † To bind.<BR> खचित,<BR> 1. Crowded, Śāk. d. 170, v. r.<BR> 2. Inlaid, Megh. 36.<BR> --With the prep. उद् उद्, उत्खचित, Mixed, Ragh. 13, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचर|खचरः
खचर ख-चर,<BR> I. adj. Moving, existing, in the sky, MBh. 3, 12205.<BR> II. m. A bird, Rām. 4, 68, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खज्
† खज् खज्, i. 1, Par. To churn (properly, to move to and fro; cf. खञ्ज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खज|खजः
खज खज् + अ, m. and. f. जा, A churning stick, Suśr. 2, 88, 3; MBh. 4, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खञ्ज्|खंज्
खञ्ज् खञ्ज् (probably for क्षञ्ज्; cf. खच्, σκάζω and A.S. scanca), i. 1, Par. To limp, Suśr. 1, 256, 14.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. hinkan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खञ्ज|खंज|खञ्जः
खञ्ज खञ्ज् + अ, adj., f. जा, Lame, Man. 3, 242.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खञ्जन|खंजन|खञ्जनं|खंजनः|खञ्जनः
खञ्जन खञ्ज् + अन, m. A wag-tail, Śṛṅgārat. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खञ्जरीट|खंजरीट|खंजरीटः|खञ्जरीटः
खञ्जरीट खञ्जरीट, and खञ्जरीटक खञ्जरीट + क, m. A wag-tail, Yājñ. 1, 174; Man. 5, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्
† खट् खट्, i. 1, Par. To desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट|खटः
खट खट, Lass. 58, 9, read षट्क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खटकामुख|खटकामुखं|खटकामुखः
खटकामुख खटकामुख, A certain posture of the hand, Amar. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खटखटाय
खटखटाय खटखटाय, a denominative derived from खटखटा (a reduplicated imitative sound) by य, Ātm. To hiss, Mṛcch. 2, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खटिका
खटिका खटिका, f. Chalk, Prab. 63, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्ट्
† खट्ट् खट्ट्, i. 10, Par. To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वा
खट्वा खट्वा, f. A bedstead, Pañc. 187, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वाङ्गिन्|खट्वांगिन्
खट्वाङ्गिन् खट्वाङ्गिन्, i. e. खट्वा-अङ्ग + इन्, adj., Bearing a part of a bed, or a so-called weapon of Śiva (?), Man. 11, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्
† खड् खड्, i. 10, Par. To divide, to break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्ग|खड्गं|खड्गः
खड्ग खड्ग (probably from क्षद्, q. v.; cf. खञ्ज् and ϕάσγανον) m.<BR> 1. A sword, Rām. 1, 1, 41.<BR> 2. A rhinoceros, Man. 3, 272.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटखड्ग|कूटखड्गः
कूट- + खड्ग कूट- + खड्ग, m. a sword-cane, Rām. 6, 80, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सखड्ग
स- + खड्ग स- + खड्ग, adj., f. गा, with a sword, Rājat. 5, 385.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गवन्त्|खड्गवत्
खड्गवन्त् खड्ग + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Armed with a sword, MBh. 3, 10963.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गिन्
खड्गिन् खड्गिन्, i. e. खड्ग + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इनी, Armed with a sword, Rām. 5, 10, 22.<BR> II. m. A rhinoceros, Rām. 1, 26, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खणखणाय
खणखणाय खणखणाय, a denomin. derived from खणखणा (a reduplicated imitative sound) by य, Ātm. To rustle, Bhāg. P. 5, 2, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड्|खंड्
खण्ड् खण्ड्,<BR> I. † i. 1, Ātm.<BR> II. i. 10, Par. (rather a denomin. derived from the next),<BR> 1. To cut to pieces, Pañc. 47, 5.<BR> 2. To break, Vikr. d. 19.<BR> 3. To bite, Pañc. 46, 1.<BR> 4. To destroy, Hit. ii. d. 107.<BR> 5. To cause to cease, to satisfy, Rājat. 5, 281.<BR> 6. To trouble, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a " target="_blank">Page0244-a + 41</a>] Rām. 3, 14, 14.<BR> खण्डित, Afflicted, Megh. 40.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि,<BR> 1. To dismember, Pañc. iv. d. 60.<BR> 2. To trouble, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड|खंड|खण्डं|खण्डः
खण्ड खण्ड, m. and n.<BR> 1. Breaking up, Rām. 2, 105, 3. (The sense is: You alone are able to avert this breaking up of the kingdom, [which is] like a bridge broken by a great torrent of water, etc.).<BR> 2. A piece.<BR> 3. A part.<BR> 4. The section of a work.<BR> 5. A group, Sāv. 5, 108.<BR> 6. A multitude.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अखण्ड|अखंड|अखण्डः
अ- + खण्ड अ- + खण्ड, adj., f. डा, entire, Śāk. d. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्पूरखण्ड|कर्पूरखंड|कर्पूरखण्डः
कर्पूर- + खण्ड कर्पूर- + खण्ड, m. a group of camphor trees, Bhartṛ. 2, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मिनीखण्ड
पद्मिनी- + खण्ड पद्मिनी- + खण्ड, n. a multitude of lotusses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतखण्ड|शतखंड|शतखण्डं
शत- + खण्ड शत- + खण्ड, n. gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रीखण्ड|श्रीखंड|श्रीखण्डः
श्री- + खण्ड श्री- + खण्ड, m. and n. sandal wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डक|खंडक|खण्डकः
खण्डक खण्ड + क, A piece, Kathās. 24, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डन|खंडन|खण्डनं
खण्डन खण्ड् + अन,<BR> I. adj., Destroying, Gīt. 10, 8.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Hurting, Pañc. 45, 11.<BR> 2. Violation, Pañc. 46, 3.<BR> 3. Deceiving, baffling, Hit. ii. d. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डशस्|खंडशस्
खण्डशस् खण्ड + शस्, adv. In pieces, Rām. 3, 31, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खद्
खद् खद्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To be firm.<BR> 2. † To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खदिर|खदिरः
खदिर खद् + इर, m. A tree, Acacia catechu, the resin of which is used in medicine, Rām. 3, 21, 22; Suśr. 2, 76, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खदिरमय
खदिरमय खदिर-मय, adj., f. यी, Made of Khadira-wood, Pañc. 237, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खद्योत|खद्योतः
खद्योत ख-द्योत,<BR> I. m. A fire-fly, Rām. 6, 19, 28.<BR> II. f. ता, The same, denoting an eye, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खन्
खन् खन्, i. 1, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To dig, Man. 2, 218.<BR> 2. To dig up, MBh. 14, 1716.<BR> 3. To pierce, Bhartṛ. 2, 76; Pañc. ii. d. 96.<BR> 4. To inter, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b " target="_blank">Page0244-b + 39</a>] MBh. 13, 3089.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., खात, n.<BR> 1. A ditch, Hit. iii. d. 57;<BR> 2. A pit, Pañc. v. d. 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Caus. खानय, To cause to be dug, Rām. 2, 110, 25.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To dig up, Rām. 1, 41, 24.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To dig out, Kathās. 20, 143.<BR> 2. To dig up, Megh. 53.<BR> 3. To pull out, Rājat. 5, 221.<BR> 4. To eradicate, Pañc. 187, 18; to destroy, Rājat. 5, 149.<BR> उत्खात, n. A pit, Śāk. d. 192, v. r.<BR> --With प्रोद् प्र-उद्,<BR> 1. To dig up, Rām. 1, 40, 14.<BR> 2. To eradicate, Mṛcch. 178, 1.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, To eradicate, Prab. 5, 12.<BR> --With नि नि,<BR> 1. To bury, MBh. 1, 3616.<BR> 2. To dig in, Ragh. 6, 38.<BR> 3. To infix, Rām. 3, 8, 7.<BR> 4. To dig up, Bhāg. P. 5, 19, 29.<BR> --Caus. निखानित, Infixed, Suśr. 2, 456, 19.<BR> --With परि परि, परिखात, m. Track, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 2.<BR> --Cf. Lat. canalis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवखात|देवखातं
देव- + खात देव- + खात, n. a natural pond (not artificial) Man. 4, 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनक|खनकः
खनक खन् + अक, m. A digger, Rām. 2, 80, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनन|खननं
खनन खन् + अन, n. Digging, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनि|खनिः
खनि खन् + इ, f. A mine, Ragh. 17, 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनितृ
खनितृ खन् + इतृ, m. A digger, Hit. ii. d. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनित्र|खनित्रं
खनित्र खन् + इत्र, n. A spade, Man. 2, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनित्रक|खनित्रकं
खनित्रक खनित्र + क, n. A small spade, Pañc. 122, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खमूर्तिमन्त्|खमूर्तिमत्|खमूर्त्तिमत्
खमूर्तिमन्त् ख-मूर्ति + मन्त्, adj., f. मती, Having an ætherial form, Man. 2, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खम्ब्
† खम्ब् खम्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go (? v. r.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0244-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर|खरं|खरः
खर खर,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Solid, Suśr. 2, 176, 12.<BR> 2. Pointed (?), Rām. 6, 87, 3.<BR> 3. Sharp, Suśr. 1, 76, 14.<BR> 4. Hoarse, Rām. 3, 28, 42.<BR> 5. Hot, Cāt. 7.<BR> II. रम्, adv. Hoarsely, Rām. 3, 29, 9.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. An ass, Man. 2, 201.<BR> 2. A proper name, Rām. 1, 1, 45.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. the reduplicated κάρχαρος καρχαλέος, καρχαρίας.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिखर
अति- + खर अति- + खर, adj., very loud, Rām. 3, 30, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्खोदवेदिन्
खर्खोदवेदिन् खर्खोदवेदिन्, i. e. खर्खोद-वेद + इन्, adj. Versed in the art of Kharkhoda, i. e. in sorcery, Rājat. 5, 238.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्ज्
खर्ज् खर्ज्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To creak (ved.).<BR> 2. † To worship.<BR> 3. † To pain.<BR> 4. † To cleanse.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. krachjan, krachôn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जूर|खर्जूरः|खर्ज्जूर|खर्ज्जूरं|खर्ज्जूरः
खर्जूर खर्जूर, m. and f. री, A tree, Phœnix sylvestris.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डखर्जूर|पिण्डखर्ज्जूर|पिण्डखर्ज्जूरः
पिण्ड- + खर्जूर पिण्ड- + खर्जूर, m. and f. री, A sort of date tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्द्
† खर्द् खर्द्, i. 1, Par. To bite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्ब्
† खर्ब् खर्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्ब|खर्ब्ब|खर्ब्बः
खर्ब खर्ब, see खर्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्व्
† खर्व् खर्व्, i. 1, Par. To be haughty.<BR> --Cf. गर्व्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्व|खर्वः|खर्व्व|खर्व्वः
खर्व खर्व and खर्ब खर्ब, n. A very great number, 10,000,000,000, or 1 with 37 zeros, a quadrillion, Rām. 6, 4, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्वट|खर्वटं|खर्वटः|खर्व्वट|खर्व्वटः
खर्वट खर्वट, m. and n. A market or country town, Bhāg. P. 1, 6, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्
† खल् खल्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To totter.<BR> 2. To gather.<BR> --Cf. स्खल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल|खलं|खलः
खल खल,<BR> I. m. and n. A threshing-floor, Man. 11, 17.<BR> II. m. An oilcake, Pañc. ii. d. 53.<BR> III. m. and f. ला,<BR> 1. Mischievous, Pañc. i. d. 443.<BR> 2. Vile, Hit. ii. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलखलाय
खलखलाय खलखलाय, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b " target="_blank">Page0245-b + 40</a>] Ātm. To fluctuate(?), Cāṇ. 72 in Monatsb. Berl. Ak. Hist. Phil. 1864, 411.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलति|खलतिः
खलति खलति, adj. Baldheaded, Suśr. 1, 316, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलि|खलिः
खलि खलि, m. An oil-cake; in तिल-खलि, Bhartṛ. 2, 98 (cf. Chr. p. 309), The deposit of oil prepared from sesamum.<BR> --Cf. खल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलिन|खलिनं|खलिनः
खलिन खलिन, i. e. खल + इन, adj. Covered with oil-cakes(?), MBh. 13, 7288.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलीकार|खलीकारः
खलीकार खलीकार, i. e. खल, or खलि-कृ + अ, m., and खलीकृति खलीकृति, i. e. खल or खलि-कृ + ति. f. Abuse, Kathās. 12, 175; 13, 157.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलीन|खलीनं|खलीनः
खलीन खलीन, m. and n. The bit of a bridle, MBh. 1, 7343; (borrowed from the Greek χαλῑνός).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलु
खलु खलु, a particle.<BR> 1. Indeed, Rām. 3, 35, 32; Yājñ. 2, 64.<BR> 2. Only, Rām. 2, 63, 37.<BR> 3. With preceding न, Not at all, Rām. 1, 74, 21.<BR> 4. It lays a stress on an interrogation, Śāk. 32, 11.<BR> 5. खलु कृत्वा, Enough of this, do it no more, Pāṇ. 3, 4, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्ल्
खल्ल् खल्ल्, i. 1, Ātm. To totter, to be loose, Suśr. 1, 301, 8.<BR> --Cf. स्खल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्ल|खल्लः
खल्ल खल्ल, m. A bag, Suśr. 2, 364, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्वाट
खल्वाट खल्वाट, adj. Baldheaded, Bhartṛ. 2, 86.<BR> --Cf. खलति, and Lat. calvus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खव्
† खव् खव्, ii. 9, खौना (others, खुना), Par., v. r. of खच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खश|खशः
खश खश,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. pl. The name of a people, Man. 10, 47.<BR> 2. The son of an outcast Kṣatriya, Man. 10, 22 (written with स् instead of श्).<BR> II. f. शा (and सा), A proper name, Hariv. 169; 11521.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खशरीरिन्
खशरीरिन् खशरीरिन्, i. e. ख-शरीर + इन्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a " target="_blank">Page0246-a + 39</a>] adj., f. इणी, Having an ætherial form, Man. 4, 243.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0245-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खष्
† खष् खष्, i. 1, Par. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खस|खसः
खस खस, खसा खसा, see खश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाण्डव|खांडव|खाण्डवं|खांडवः|खाण्डवः
खाण्डव खाण्डव, i. e. खण्ड् + उ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Sweetmeats, Rām. 1, 53, 4.<BR> 2. The name of a forest, MBh. 1, 316.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाण्डवायन
खाण्डवायन खाण्डवायन, i. e. खण्डु, or खाण्डव + आयन, m. pl. A tribe of Brāhmaṇas, MBh. 3, 10208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाण्डविक|खांडविक|खांडविकः|खाण्डविकः
खाण्डविक खाण्डविक, i. e. खाण्डव + इक, m. A confectioner, MBh. 15, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खातक|खातकं|खातकः
खातक खात + क (vb. खन्), n. A pit, Bhāg. P. 6, 12, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद्
खाद् खाद्, i. 1, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., MBh. 1, 5580),<BR> 1. To eat, Man. 5, 53; पृष्ठ-मांसम्, To be a backbiter, Hit. i. d. 76.<BR> 2. To gnaw, Suśr. 1, 63, 16.<BR> खाद्य, Eatable, Pañc. 61, 13.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To let devour, Man. 8, 371.<BR> 2. To devour, MBh. 3, 2435.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, To devour, Mṛcch. 176, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादक|खादकः
खादक खाद् + अक, m. One who eats, Man. 5, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादन|खादनं|खादनः
