खादि|खादिः
खादि खादि, m. A ring (ved.).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखादि
सु- + खादि सु- + खादि, adj. beautifully adorned, Chr. 293, 6 = Rigv. i. 87, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादिन्
ऽखादिन् -खाद् + इन्, adj. Biting, Man. 4, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादिर|खादिरः
खादिर खादिर, i. e. खदिर + अ, adj., f. री, Made of Khadira-wood, Man. 2, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाधूया
खाधूया खाधूया, f. The name of an Agrahāra, Rājat. 5, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खारी
खारी खारी, f. A measure of grain, containing 16 droṇas, or about three bushels, Pañc. iv. d. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खार्कार|खार्कारः
खार्कार खार्-कार (an imitative sound) -कार, m. Bray, Bhāg. P. 3, 17, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खालित्य
खालित्य खालित्य (probably for खालत्य, ved., i. e. खलति + य), n. Baldness, Suśr. 1, 129, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिट्
† खिट् खिट्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To be terrified.<BR> 2. To terrify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिद्
खिद् खिद्, i. 6, खिन्द, Par.; i. 4, and ii. 7, खिनद्, खिन्द्, Ātm. (i. 4, also Par. Bhāg. P. 3, 4, 16).<BR> 1. To be afflicted, Rām. 2, 39, 7.<BR> 2. To be subdued, Hit. ii. d. 134.<BR> 3. To despair, Rām. 3, 49, 57.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. खिन्न,<BR> 1. Tired, Man. 7, 141.<BR> 2. Exhausted, Bhartṛ. 1, 47.<BR> 3. Desponding, Rām. 3, 69, 5.<BR> --Caus. To distress, Mṛcch. 143, 14.<BR> खेदित, Relaxed, Rām. 5, 13, 47.<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, To be afflicted, Bhāg. P. 3, 9, 28 (i. 4, Par.).<BR> परिखिन्न, Tired, Rām. 4, 51, 3.<BR> --Caus. To afflict, Bhāg. P. 1, 17, 7.<BR> --Cf. probably κίνδυνος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिल|खिलं|खिलः
खिल खिल (perhaps for 3. क्षि + ल; cf. खड्ग), m. and n.<BR> 1. Waste or unploughed land (ved.).<BR> 2. A powerless subject, Bhāg. P. 6, 4, 49.<BR> 3. Remainder, Bhāg. P. 6, 4, 15.<BR> 4. A supplement, MBh. 1, 357.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अखिल|अखिलं
अ- + खिल अ- + खिल, adj., f. ला. 1. entire, Man. 1, 59. 2. all, Man. 1, 144.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अखिलेन
अखिलेन ˚लेन, instr. entirely, Man. 1, 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खु
† खु खु, i. 1, Ātm. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुज्
† खुज् खुज्, i. 1, Par. To steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुड्
† खुड् खुड्, i. 10, Par. To break in pieces (v. r. of खुण्ड्, and of थुड्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुण्ड्|खुंड्
† खुण्ड् खुण्ड्, i. 1, Ātm. and i. 10, Par. To break in pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0246-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुद्
खुद् खुद्, i. 6, Par. To push, ved. (probably for क्षुद्, q. v.; cf. खिल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुर्
† खुर् खुर् (= क्षुर्, cf. खुद्), i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To cut.<BR> 2. To break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुर|खुरः
खुर खुर (for क्षुर, cf. क्षुरप्र), m. A hoof, Śāk. d. 31.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वखुर|अश्वखुरः
अश्व- + खुर अश्व- + खुर, a horse's hoof, Pañc. 252, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरक|खुरकः
खुरक खुर + क, m. A kind of dancing, Vikr. 59, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुर्द्
† खुर्द् खुर्द्, i. 1, खूर्द, Ātm. To play.<BR> --Cf. कुर्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेचर|खेचरः
खेचर खेचर, i. e. ख + इ-चर,<BR> I. adj., f. री, Moving in the sky, Rām. 6, 107, 25.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A bird, Nal. 20, 1.<BR> 2. A Gandharva, MBh. 3, 14887.<BR> III. f. री A name of Durgā, MBh. 4, 186.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेचरत्व
खेचरत्व खेचर + त्व, n. The faculty of flying, Kathās. 3, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट्
† खेट् खेट्, i. 10, Ātm. To eat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट|खेटं|खेटः
खेट खेट, m. A village, MBh. 3, 13220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटक|खेटकः
खेटक खेटक, m. A shield, MBh. 4, 181.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेड्
† खेड् खेड्, i. 10, Ātm. To eat (v. r. of खेट्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेद|खेदः
खेद खेद, i. e. खिद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Fatigue, Rām. 4, 49, 14.<BR> 2. Faintness, Megh. 90.<BR> 3. Affliction, Pañc. i. d. 225.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेल्
खेल् खेल्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To move to and fro, Rām. 5, 55, 26 (to dance?).<BR> --Caus. To put in motion, to turn, Pañc. 221, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेल
खेल खेल् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Moving from one side to the other, swinging, moving gently, MBh. 1, 7043; Vikr. d. 95.<BR> II. ˚लम्, adv. Moving gently, Rām. 2, 60, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सखेलम्
स-खेल + म् स-खेल + म्, adv. moving gently, MBh. 2, 2536.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेलन|खेलनं
खेलन खेल् + अन, n. Moving to and fro, Gīt. 1, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेलि|खेलिः
खेलि खेल् + इ, f. Play, Gīt. 11, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेव्
† खेव् खेव्, i. 1, Ātm. To serve.<BR> --Cf. केव्, सेव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खै
खै खै, i. 1, खय, Par.<BR> 1. † To be firm.<BR> 2. † To hurt.<BR> 3. To dig.<BR> --Cf. खन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोट्
† खोट् खोट्, i. 1, Par. To be lame; cf. खोड्, खोर्, खोल्. i. 10, Par. v. r. of क्षोट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोड्
† खोड् खोड्, i. 1, Par. To be lame.<BR> --i. 10, Par. v. r. of क्षोट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोर्
† खोर् खोर्, i. 1, Par. To be lame.<BR> --Cf. खोट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्
† खोल् खोल्, i. 1, Par. To be lame.<BR> --Perhaps cf. χωλός, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्या
ख्या ख्या, ii. 2, Par. Pass. To be known, MBh. 3, 8384.<BR> ख्यात, Knowṇ, Rām. 3, 22, 32.<BR> --Caus. ख्यापय,<BR> 1. To proclaim, MBh. 5, 7403.<BR> 2. To report, MBh. 3, 15697.<BR> 3. To praise, Rām. 3, 27, 19.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, अभिख्यात, Known, MBh. 13, 4644.<BR> --Caus. To proclaim, Man. 9, 262.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To report, MBh. 1, 26.<BR> 2. To announce, Rām. 2, 34, 1.<BR> 3. To name, Man. 4, 6.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass., अन्-आ-ख्येय,<BR> 1. Not to be reported, Pañc. 19, 16.<BR> 2. unutterable, Bhartṛ. 1, 51.<BR> --Caus. To proclaim, MBh. 1, 7485.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ, To report, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 45.<BR> --With प्रत्या प्रति-आ,<BR> 1. To repudiate, Rām. 3, 54, 21.<BR> 2. To recant, Daśak. in Chr. 192, 13.<BR> 3. To surpass, Mālav. d. 40.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ, To explain, MBh. 1, 53.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ,<BR> 1. To reckon up, Arj. 5, 11.<BR> 2. To add, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-a " target="_blank">Page0248-a + 40</a>] Man. 7, 156.<BR> 3. To report, MBh. 3, 11915.<BR> --With परि परि, परिख्यात,<BR> 1. Known, MBh. 1, 874.<BR> 2. Famed, Rām. 3, 62, 2.<BR> 3. Named, Rām. 5, 2, 4.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To report, Bhāg. P. 1, 5, 40. Pass. To shine, Rām. 5, 18, 4.<BR> प्रख्यात,<BR> 1. Acknowledged, Man. 8, 399.<BR> 2. Renowned, Rām. 3, 23, 39.<BR> --Caus. To make generally known, Kathās. 1, 61.<BR> --With वि वि, विख्यात,<BR> 1. Generally known, Yājñ. 3, 301.<BR> 2. Renowned, Rām. 3, 55, 16.<BR> 3. Named, Rām. 1, 57, 10.<BR> --Caus. To proclaim, Man. 11, 83.<BR> --With अभिवि अभि-वि, अभिविख्यात,<BR> 1. Renowned, Rām. 4, 1, 22.<BR> 2. Named, MBh. 1, 2644.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, प्रविख्यात,<BR> 1. Renowned, MBh. 1, 2543.<BR> 2. Named, Mārk. P. 1, 26.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To sum up, MBh. 3, 2822.<BR> 2. To calculate, Rām. 2, 40, 15.<BR> संख्यात, n. Number, Bhāg. P. 6, 14, 3.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass., अ-संख्येय, adj. uncountable, Rām. 1, 1, 91.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To reckon up, Rām. 4, 47, 4; 6, 1, 5.<BR> --With परिसम् परि-सम्, To add together, Man. 1, 71.<BR> --With प्रसम् प्र-सम्,<BR> 1. To number, MBh. 1, 2547.<BR> --Cf. Goth. gôds (= ख्यात; the original signification of the vb. is probably ‘to shine’); A.S. gôd; ἀ-γαθός where ἀ = Sskt. स.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0247-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्याति|ख्यातिः
ख्याति ख्या + ति, f.<BR> 1. Fame, celebrity, Man. 12, 36; personified, Bhāg. P. 3, 24, 22.<BR> 2. Name, MBh. 1, 3180.<BR> 3. Knowledge, Yogas. 2, 26.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुख्याति
सु- + ख्याति सु- + ख्याति, f. fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिमन्त्|ख्यातिमत्
ख्यातिमन्त् ख्याति + मन्त्, adj. f. मती, Renowned, Kathās. 17, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापक
ऽख्यापक -ख्यापक, i. e. ख्या, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b " target="_blank">Page0248-b + 38</a>] Caus., + अक, adj. Foreboding, Suśr. 1, 127, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापन|ख्यापनं
ख्यापन ख्यापन, i. e. ख्या, Caus., + अन, n.<BR> 1. Report, Chr. 55, 2.<BR> 2. Confession, Man. 11, 227.<BR> 3. Making renowned, Rājat. 5, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग|गं|गः
1. ऽग -ग (vb. गम्), latter part of comp. words.<BR> 1. Moving, going, e. g. शीघ्र-, adj. Going quickly, Rām. 3, 31, 3.<BR> 2. Being, e. g. कूप-ग, adj. Being in a pit, Kathās. 4, 128.<BR> 3. Referring to, e. g. राघवानुज-, adj. Referring to the younger brother of Rāma, Rām. 6, 70, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग|गं|गः
2. ऽग -ग (vb. गै), latter part of comp. words. Singing.<BR> --Cf. छन्दोग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगण|गगणं
गगण गगण, and गगन गगन, n. The sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणेचर
गगणेचर गगणेचर, and गगनेचर गगनेचर, i. e. गगण or गगन + इ-चर,<BR> I. adj. Moving in the sky, Bhāg. P. 6, 17, 1; Rām. 3, 39, 6.<BR> II. m. A bird, MBh. 1, 1317 (with n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनचर|गगनचरः
गगनचर गगन-चर, m. A bird, MBh. 1, 1339.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गग्घ्
† गग्घ् गग्घ्, i. 1, Par. = कख्, q. cf. (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गदत्त
गङ्गदत्त गङ्गदत्त, i. e. गङ्गा-दत्त (the आ of the first part is shortened; cf. the vb. दा), m. A proper name, Pañc. iv. d. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गा|गंगा
गङ्गा गङ्गा (from *गङ्गम् for जङ्गम्, frequentat. of गम्), f. The river Ganges, supposed to exist also in the sky and in the lower regions, Rām. 1, 44, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमगङ्गा|व्योमगंगा
व्योमगङ्गा व्योमगङ्गा, i. e. व्योमन्-, f. the supposed Ganges of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0249-a " target="_blank">Page0249-a + 40</a>] the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पातालगङ्गा|पातालगंगा
पाताल- + गङ्गा पाताल- + गङ्गा, f. that of the lower regions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0248-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गज्
