गण्
गण् गण्, i. 10 (rather a denomin. derived from the next), गणय, Par. (also Ātm., Bhāg. P. 4, 7, 29).<BR> 1. To number, MBh. 3, 2618.<BR> 2. To value, MBh. 2, 1552.<BR> 3. To impute, Bhartṛ. 2, 44.<BR> 4. To regard, Pañc. 258, 21.<BR> गणित, Reckoned, MBh. 13, 4439; calculated, Lass. 37, 8. n. Arithmetic, MBh. 1, 293.<BR> --With the prep. अधि अधि, To praise, Bhāg. P. 1, 5, 21.<BR> --With अव अव, To disregard, to neglect, Pañc. 239, 2.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To count over, Suśr. 1, 334, 8 (परिगण्य, instead of the regular परिगणय्य).<BR> 2. To consider, Megh. 5.<BR> अ-परिगणित, adj. Innumerable, Bhāg. P. 6, 9, 35.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To calculate, MBh. 1, 6808.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To number, Rām. 3, 53, 11.<BR> 2. To consider, Rām. 3, 44, 31.<BR> 3. To disregard, Pañc. iii. d. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0249-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण|गणः
गण गण, m.<BR> 1. A multitude, Rām. 5, 91, 1.<BR> 2. A class, Man. 1, 22.<BR> 3. Troops of inferior deities, considered as Śiva's attendants, and under the especial superintendence of Gaṇeśa, Rām. 5, 89, 7.<BR> 4. A community, Yājñ. 2, 187.<BR> 5. A contemptible association, Man. 4, 209.<BR> 6. A body of troops consisting of 3 gulmas: i. e. 27 chariots, 27 elephants, 81 horses, and 135 foot, MBh. 1, 291.<BR> 7. A foot of a verse, Śrut. 5, Br.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0249-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारागण
तारा- + गण तारा- + गण, m. a multitude of stars, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2743.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0249-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

