गगण- + गति गगण- + गति, adj. moving in the sky, Megh. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0250-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

