गद्
† 2. गद् गद्, i. 10, Par. To thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0251-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

