गम|गमः
गम गम् + अ,<BR> I. latter part of comp. words, f. मा, Going, e. g. ख-,<BR> 1. adj. Moving in the sky, MBh. 3, 820.<BR> 2. m. A bird, Nal. 1, 24.<BR> 3. m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 995.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Way, Caurap. 44.<BR> 2. Carnal approaching, Man. 11, 54.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

