दुर्गम|दुर्गमः
दुर्गम दुर्गम, i. e. दुस्-, adj., f. मा, 1. difficult to be passed (as a way), Rām. 5, 74, 31. 2. difficult to be crossed, MBh. 1, 2924.<BR> 3. difficult to be attained, Rām. 6, 67, 10. 4. difficult in general, MBh. 13, 7535.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षगम
पक्ष- + गम पक्ष- + गम, adj. flying, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b " target="_blank">Page0256-b + 41</a>] Rām. 3, 56, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगम|सुगमः
सु- + गम सु- + गम, adj. 1. accessible. 2. easy, MBh. 13, 7535. 3. plain, intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गमन|गमनं
गमन गम् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Gait, Śṛṅgārat. 7.<BR> 2. Going, Rām. 1, 9, 40.<BR> 3. Going to, Rām. 1, 3, 16.<BR> 4. Coming, Hiḍ. 4, 27 (? read आगमनम्).<BR> 5. Carnal approach, Rām. 3, 13, 6.<BR> 6. Undergoing, e. g. पञ्चत्व-, Death, Rām. 5, 15, 78.<BR> 7. Way, Rām. 3, 68, 50.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधोगमन
अधोगमन अधोगमन, i. e. अधस्-, n. descending, Rājat. 5, 310.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तगमन
अन्त- + गमन अन्त- + गमन, n. 1. accomplishing, Pañc. iii. d. 130. 2. dying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरागमन
अन्तरा- + गमन अन्तरा- + गमन, n. passing between, Man. 4, 126.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्तगमन
अस्त- + गमन अस्त- + गमन, n. setting (of the sun), MBh. 1, 6058.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहगमन
सह- + गमन सह- + गमन, n. 1. accompanying. 2. a woman's burning herself with her deceased husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गमनीय
ऽगमनीय गमनीय, i. e. गमन + त्य, adj. Relating to carnal approach, Man. 11, 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गम्ब्
† गम्ब् गम्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गम्भीर|गंभीर|गम्भीरं|गम्भीरः
गम्भीर गम्भीर, see गभीर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गय|गयः
गय गय,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The name of a Ṛṣi, Rām. 2, 107, 11.<BR> 2. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 1827.<BR> 3. The name of a mountain, MBh. 3, 8304.<BR> II. f. या.<BR> 1. The name of a river, MBh. 3, 8075.<BR> 2. The name of a river, MBh. 1, 7818.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर|गरं|गरः
गर गर, i. e. 2. गॄ + अ, m.<BR> 1. A fluid (ved.).<BR> 2. m. and n. Poison, Rām. 2, 110, 24.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूगर|भूगरं
भू- + गर भू- + गर, n. Poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरद|गरदं|गरदः
गरद गर + द (vb. दा), m. A giver of poison, Man. 3, 158.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरल|गरलं|गरलः
गरल गरल (cf. गर), m. Poison, Pañc. 63, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरिमन्
गरिमन् गरिमन्, i. e. गुरु + इमन् (cf. गुरु), m. Heaviness, Śiś. 9, 49.<BR> 2. The magical faculty of making one's self as heavy as one lists, Lass. 3, 18. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a " target="_blank">Page0257-a + 38</a>]<BR> 3. Dignity, Pañc. i. d. 36.<BR> 4. A most venerable person, Bhāg. P. 4, 5, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरिष्ठ|गरिष्ठः
गरिष्ठ गरिष्ठ, superl., and गरीयंस् गरीयंस्, comparat. of गुरु, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरीयस्त्व
गरीयस्त्व गरीयस्त्व, i. e. गरीयंस् + त्व, n. Great importance, MBh. 1, 5080.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुड|गरुडः
गरुड गरुड, for *गरुत्र, i. e. probably, गल् + तृ + अ = Lat. volucer, m.<BR> 1. The sovereign of the feathered race and vehicle of Viṣṇu, MBh. 1, 1092.<BR> 2. The name of a battle-array, Man. 7, 187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुत्
गरुत् गरुत् (vb. गल्), m. A wing.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतगरुत्
श्वेत- + गरुत् श्वेत- + गरुत्, m. A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुत्मन्त्|गरुत्मत्
गरुत्मन्त् गरुत् + मन्त्, m. A name of Garuḍa, MBh. 1, 1510.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ग|गर्गः
गर्ग गर्ग,<BR> I. m. The name of an old Ṛṣi, MBh. 9, 2132, and other persons.<BR> II. f. गा, A proper name, Rājat. 5, 250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्गर|गर्गरः
गर्गर गर्-गर् + अ (vb. 2. गॄ, reduplicated, + अ), m.<BR> 1. A whirlpool (ved.).<BR> 2. A churn, MBh. 12, 2783.<BR> --Cf. Lat. gurges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ज्
गर्ज् गर्ज्, i. 1, Par. To roar, Pañc. 9, 8.<BR> गर्जित, n.<BR> 1. Roaring, MBh. 3, 12137.<BR> 2. Thunder, Megh. 35.<BR> --With अनु अनु, To roar after, MBh. 7, 1714.<BR> अनुगर्जित, n. The echo of a roar, Kumāras. 6, 40.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To roar at, MBh. 7, 5484.<BR> अभिगर्जित, n. A wild challenging roar, Rām. 4, 14, 1.<BR> --With समभि सम्-अभि, To roar at, MBh. 5, 5635.<BR> --With परि परि, To roar, Rām. 1, 28, 17 (गर्जतीम्, anom. instead of गर्जन्तीम्, on account of the metre).<BR> --With प्र प्र, To begin to roar, MBh. 1, 1419.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To roar at, MBh. 5, 2048.<BR> --With वि वि, To roar, MBh. 6, 610.<BR> --With सम् [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b " target="_blank">Page0257-b + 42</a>] सम्, To roar at, MBh. 7, 5908.<BR> --Cf. probably γοργός, Γοργώ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जन|गर्जनं|गर्ज्जन|गर्ज्जनं
गर्जन गर्ज् + अन, n. Roaring, Hit. 34, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्त|गर्तं|गर्तः|गर्त्त|गर्त्तः
गर्त गर्त (probably 2. गॄ), m., f. ता, and n.<BR> 1. A hole, MBh. 1, 1034; Pañc. 81, 22; MBh. 7, 4953.<BR> 2. A ditch, Man. 4, 47; 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्द्
† गर्द् गर्द्, i. 1, and 10, Par. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभ|गर्दभः|गर्द्दभ|गर्द्दभं|गर्द्दभः
गर्दभ गर्दभ<BR> I. m. An ass, Man. 8, 298.<BR> II. f. भी.<BR> 1. A she ass, MBh. 13, 1827.<BR> 2. An insect, a kind of beetle living in cow-dung. Suśr. 2, 288, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ध्
गर्ध् गर्ध्, i. 10, Par. To desire.<BR> --Cf. गृध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धिन्
ऽगर्धिन् -गर्धिन्, i. e. गृध् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Latter part of comp. words, Desiring, greedy, Man. 4, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ब्|गर्ब्ब्
† गर्ब् गर्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR> --Cf. गर्व्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भ|गर्भः
गर्भ गर्भ, i. e. ग्रभ् (ved. = ग्रह्) + अ, m.<BR> 1. The womb, Pañc. Pr. 8.<BR> 2. The interior, MBh. 9, 2741.<BR> 3. A fœtus or embryo, Bhag. 3, 38.<BR> 4. A sprout, Rām. 5, 28, 6.<BR> 5. Conception, Man. 2, 36.<BR> 5. As former part of comp. words it has often the second signification; cf. गर्भ-गृह. As latter part of comp. adj. Holding in one's interior, containing; e. g. शुक-, adj. Containing parrots, Śāk. d. 14.<BR> स्नेह-, adj. Containing oil, MBh. 12, 13414.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. δελϕύς, ἀδελϕειός, ἀδελϕεός, ἀδελϕός; βρέϕος; Goth. kalbo; A.S. calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहीतगर्भ
गृहीत- + गर्भ गृहीत- + गर्भ (vb. ग्रह्), adj., f. भा, pregnant, Suśr. 1, 321, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जारगर्भ
जार- + गर्भ जार- + गर्भ, adj., f. भा, Pregnant by an adulterer, not. ad Hit. Pr. d. 38; 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवगर्भ|देवगर्भः
देव- + गर्भ देव- + गर्भ, m. The child of a god, MBh. 3, 17161.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिगर्भ
मति- + गर्भ मति- + गर्भ, adj. full of understanding, Śiś. 9, 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नगर्भ|रत्नगर्भः
रत्न- + गर्भ रत्न- + गर्भ,<BR> I. m. Kuvera.<BR> II. f. भा, the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शमीगर्भ|शमीगर्भः
शमी- + गर्भ शमी- + गर्भ, m. 1. a Brāhmaṇa. 2. fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगर्भ|सगर्भः
स- + गर्भ स- + गर्भ, m. a brother by the same [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a " target="_blank">Page0258-a + 41</a>] father and mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरगर्भ
सुर- + गर्भ सुर- + गर्भ, m. the child of a god, Hiḍ. 4, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमगर्भ|सोमगर्भः
सोम- + गर्भ सोम- + गर्भ, m. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्रवद्गर्भा
स्रवद्गर्भा स्रवद्गर्भा, i. e. स्रवन्त्-गर्भ (vb. स्रु), f. a woman or cow miscarrying by accident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वगर्भ
स्व- + गर्भ स्व- + गर्भ, m. one's own fœtus, Rām. 3, 49, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमगर्भ
हिम- + गर्भ हिम- + गर्भ, adj. laden with cold, Śāk. d. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यगर्भ|हिरण्यगर्भः
हिरण्य- + गर्भ हिरण्य- + गर्भ, m. Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भवती
गर्भवती गर्भवती, i. e. गर्भ + वन्त् + ई, f. A pregnant female, MBh. 3, 10667.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भस्थ
गर्भस्थ गर्भ-स्थ (vb. स्था), adj.<BR> 1. Being in the womb, Pañc. ii. d. 82.<BR> 2. Being in the interior, MBh. 7, 3110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भास्राव|गर्भास्रावः
गर्भास्राव गर्भास्राव, i. e. गर्भ-आ-स्रु + अ, m. Abortion, Suśr. 1, 175, 7.<BR> --Cf. गर्भ-स्राव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भिन्
गर्भिन् गर्भिन्, i. e. गर्भ + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Pregnant, Man. 9, 173.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भेश्वरता
गर्भेश्वरता गर्भेश्वरता, i. e. गर्भ-ईश्वर + ता, f. Hereditary dominion, Rājat. 5, 198.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्व्
† गर्व् गर्व्, or गर्ब् गर्ब्, i. 1, Par. and i. 10, Ātm. To be proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्व|गर्वः|गर्व्व|गर्व्वः
गर्व गर् + व (cf. गुरु), m. Pride, Pañc. 26, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनगर्व
धन- + गर्व धन- + गर्व, m. a proper name, Daśak. in Chr. 191, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगर्व|सगर्व्व
स- + गर्व स- + गर्व, adj. proud; ˚वम्, adv. haughtily, Rām. 3, 32, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्वाय
गर्वाय गर्वाय, a denomin. derived from गर्व by य, Ātm. To behave haughtily, Prab. 24, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्वित|गर्व्वित|गर्व्वितः
गर्वित गर्वित, i. e. गर्व + इत, adj., f. ता, Proud, Rām. 1, 7, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगर्वित
परि- + गर्वित परि- + गर्वित, adj. very proud, Cāṇ. 94 in Berl. Monatsb. 1864, 413.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ह्
गर्ह् गर्ह् (probably akin to ग्रह्), i. 1, Ātm. and Par.; i. 10, Par. Ātm.<BR> 1. To blame, Rām. 2, 75, 19; MBh. 5, 648; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-b " target="_blank">Page0258-b + 40</a>] 1, 5731; 3, 526.<BR> 2. To loathe, Man. 11, 229. गर्हित,<BR> 1. Contemned, Man. 10, 39.<BR> 2. Blameable, Rām. 3, 51, 23.<BR> 3. Prejudicial, Lass. 16, 15.<BR> 4. with abl., Worse, MBh. 3, 1040.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --गर्ह्य, contemptible, Man. 5, 149.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, अवगर्हित, Contemned, Rām. 2, 21, 19.<BR> --With नि नि, To despise, MBh. 13, 5892.<BR> --With परि परि, To blame much, Rām. 2, 106, 10.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, प्रतिगर्हित, Blamed, Rām. 6, 103, 15 (perhaps प्रति must be separated, and signifies Concerning).<BR> --With वि वि, To blame, Rām. 6, 8, 3. विगर्हित,<BR> 1. Blemished, Man. 9, 72.<BR> 2. Contemptible, Man. 3, 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगर्हित|अगर्हितः
अ- + गर्हित अ- + गर्हित, adj. f. ता, 1. unblamed, respected, Man. 9, 109. 2. unblameable, Man. 4, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्हण|गर्हणं
गर्हण गर्हण, i. e. गर्ह् + अन, n. and f. णा, Blame, MBh. 12, 9153; Man. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्हा
गर्हा गर्ह् + आ, f. Blame, Pañc. i. d. 192.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्हिन्
ऽगर्हिन् -गर्ह् + इन्, adj. Blaming, Bhāg. P. 4, 4, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्
1. गल् गल्, (akin to गुर्, cf. उद्-गुर्), i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To drop, to distil, Kathās. 11, 57.<BR> 2. To fall, Śiś. 9, 75.<BR> 3. To disappear, Bhartṛ. 1, 69.<BR> --Caus. गालय,<BR> 1. To percolate, Daśak. 156, 2.<BR> 2. To sift, Suśr. 1, 165, 18.<BR> 3. To dilute, Suśr. 1, 166, 6.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To fall off, Śiś. 8, 34.<BR> --With आ आ, To fall, Rām. 5, 13, 34.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To tumble down, MBh. 1, 1409.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To burst forth, Bhāg. P. 1, 10, 14.<BR> --With निस् निस्, निर्गलित, Distilling, Ragh. 5, 17.<BR> --With परि परि, परिगलित,<BR> 1. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a " target="_blank">Page0259-a + 40</a>] Tumbled down, MBh. 1, 1183.<BR> 2. Sunk in, Pañc. 8, 17.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To distil, Prab. 79, 16.<BR> 2. To fall off, Amar. 36.<BR> 3. To disappear, Kathās. 7, 75. विगलित,<BR> 1. Drained by distilling, MBh. 1, 1182.<BR> 2. Liquefied, dissolved, Kathās 18, 78; Gīt. 1, 31.<BR> 3. Tumbled down, MBh. 4, 826.<BR> 4. Unwieldy, Bhartṛ. 3, 74.<BR> --Cf. गरुड, and Lat. volare (concerning the signification, cf. पत्), βάλλω (Causal).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0258-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्
† 2. गल् गल्, i. 10, Ātm. To distil; see 1. गल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्
† 3. गल् गल्, i. 1, Par. To eat.<BR> --Cf. 2. गॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल|गलः
गल गल, i. e. 2. गॄ + अ, m. The throat, Pañc. 249, 1.<BR> --Cf. Lat. gula; O.H.G. kela; A.S. ceolr, etc..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गलितक|गलितकः
गलितक गलित + क (vb. 1. गल्), m. A kind of dance, Vikr. 68, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्भ्
गल्भ् गल्भ् (akin to ग्रभ्, see ग्रह्), i. 1, Ātm. To be bold.<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र, To behave resolutely, Śiś. 10, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्ल|गल्लः
गल्ल गल्ल (probably a dialectical form of गण्ड), m. The cheek, Pañc. 125, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्वर्क|गल्वर्कः
गल्वर्क गल्वर्क m. Crystal(?), Rām. 3, 48, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गल्ह्
† गल्ह् गल्ह्, i. 1, Ātm. = गर्ह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गव
गव गव, i. e. गो + अ, a substitute for गो in comp. words, e. g. गवार्ह, i. e. गव-अर्ह, adj. Worth a bull, MBh. 2, 828. गवार्थे, i. e. गव-अर्थे, adv. For preserving a cow, Man. 10, 69. अष्टगव, i. e. अष्टन्-, adj. Drawn by eight oxen, MBh. 8, 799. स्त्री-गवी, f. a milch cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवय|गवयः
गवय गवय (akin to गो), m.<BR> 1. A species of ox, Bos gavæus, Pañc. 53, 10. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b " target="_blank">Page0259-b + 40</a>]<BR> 2. The name of a monkey, Rām. 4, 25, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवाक्ष|गवाक्षः
गवाक्ष गवाक्ष, i. e. गव-अक्ष, m.<BR> 1. An air-hole, a round window, a bull's eye, Rām. 3, 61, 13.<BR> 2. (m. ?) The name of a sea, Rājat. 5, 423.<BR> 3. The name of a monkey, Rām. 4, 25, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवाक्षक|गवाक्षकः
गवाक्षक गवाक्ष + क, m. = गवाक्ष<BR> 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गविष्ठ|गविष्ठः
गविष्ठ गविष्ठ, m.<BR> 1. The sun, Bhāg. P. 1, 10, 36.<BR> 2. The name of a Dānava, MBh. 1, 2538.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेष्
गवेष् गवेष्, i. e. गव-इष्, i. 1, Ātm.; i. 10, Par. To search, Ṛt. 1, 21; Kathās. 24, 230.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषण|गवेषणं
गवेषण गवेषण, i. e. गवेष् + अन, n. Search, Kathās. 21, 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषिन्
गवेषिन् गवेष् + इन्, adj. Searching, MBh. 3, 10890.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गव्य|गव्यं
गव्य गव्य, i. e. गो + य,<BR> I. adj., f. या,<BR> 1. Produced by a cow.<BR> 2. Consisting of milk.<BR> II. n. Milk.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चगव्य|पंचगव्य|पञ्चगव्यं
पञ्चगव्य पञ्चगव्य, i. e. पञ्चन्-, n. the five pure things produced by the cow, Man. 11, 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गव्यूति|गव्यूतिः
गव्यूति गव्यूति, i. e. गो-यु + ति, f.<BR> 1. Pasture-ground (ved.).<BR> 2. A measure = 4000 daṇḍa = 2 krośas, Rām. 6, 33, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्
† गह् गह्, i. 10, गहय, Par. To strive, to penetrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गहन|गहनं|गहनः
गहन गहन, i. e. गभ् (cf. गभी-र, and गाह्) + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. ना.<BR> 1. Deep, Bhartṛ. 3, 11.<BR> 2. Impervious, Rām. 2, 85, 4.<BR> 3. Impenetrable, Pañc. i. d. 317.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A thicket, Rām. 4, 48, 2.<BR> 2. Impenetrability, obscurity, MBh. 11, 125.<BR> 3. Multitude, Rām. 1, 35, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0259-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गहनत्व
गहनत्व गहन + त्व, n. Impenetrability, MBh. 2, 2355.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गहनवन्त्|गहनवत्
गहनवन्त् गहन + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Full of thickets, Rām. 4, 48, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्वर|गह्वरं|गह्वरः
गह्वर गह् + वर (cf. गहन),<BR> I. adj., f. रा and री, Impenetrable, Bhāg. P. 5, 14, 4.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A thicket, MBh. 4, 727.<BR> 2. An enigma, MBh. 13, 1388.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्वरित
गह्वरित गह्वरित, i. e. गह्वर + इत, adj. Lying in one's hiding-place, MBh. 2, 2294.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गा
गा गा, † i. 1. Ātm.; ved. ii. 2 and 3, जिगा (in classic writings only the Aor. Par. Ātm.).<BR> 1. To go, Bhāg. P. 1, 13, 1.<BR> 2. To come, Bhāg. P. 3, 18, 27.<BR> 3. To undergo (cf. गम्); हर्षम्, To become glad, Rām. 5, 91, 25. Desider. जिगीष, To desire to go, Bhāg. P. 2, 10, 25.<BR> --With the prep. अति अति,<BR> 1. To cross, Rām. 2, 52, 75.<BR> 2. To pass, Arj. 4, 62.<BR> 3. To die, Rām. 2, 72, 29.<BR> 4. To escape, Bhāg. P. 4, 21, 56.<BR> 5. To subdue, Bhāg. P. 9, 20, 27.<BR> 6. To neglect, MBh. 5, 4212.<BR> --With व्यति वि-अति, To pass, Ragh. 6, 52.<BR> --With अधि अधि,<BR> 1. To undergo; श्रमम्, To become tired, Bhāg. P. 4, 26, 10.<BR> 2. To think of, Nal. 10, 16.<BR> 3. usually Ātm., To study, to learn, to read, MBh. 1, 5106; 13, 121; Man. 1, 59; Bhāg. P. 9, 22, 23.<BR> --With अनु अनु, To follow, MBh. 3, 2303.<BR> --With समनु सम्-अनु, To follow, MBh. 5, 432.<BR> --With अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To go to, Rām. 1, 63, 3.<BR> 2. To approach, Rām. 1, 20, 2.<BR> 3. To undergo, to attain, MBh. 3, 16625.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To approach, MBh. 1, 3573.<BR> 2. To befall, MBh. 3, 1355.<BR> --With अभ्या अभि-आ<BR> 1. To approach, Bhāg. P. 9, 21, 10. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b " target="_blank">Page0260-b + 37</a>]<BR> 2. To befall, MBh. 3, 1120.<BR> 3. To resolve (with infin.), Man. 10, 108.<BR> --With समभ्या सम्-अभि-आ, To approach, MBh. 1, 5328.<BR> 2. To befall, MBh. 2, 2597.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ, To approach, Kathās. 5, 68.<BR> --With पर्या, To expire, MBh. 12, 8157.<BR> --With नि नि, To nestle, MBh. 6, 1886.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To go out, Kathās. 18, 83.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To move round, Rām. 2, 96, 45.<BR> 2. To befall, MBh. 1, 3647.<BR> 3. To mistake, to know not, Bhāg. P. 2, 6, 35.<BR> --With अनुपरि अनु-परि, To walk over, MBh. 12, 8081.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To proceed, MBh. 6, 2212.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To return, Bhāg. P. 4, 20, 37.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To go to, Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 66.<BR> --Cf. βιβα, βιβάς, βιβάω, ἔβην (= अगाम्), perhaps Lat. navi-gare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाङ्ग|गांग|गाङ्गं|गाङ्गः
गाङ्ग गाङ्ग, i. e. गङ्गा + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. गी.<BR> 1. Belonging to the Gaṅga, MBh. 7, 2215.<BR> II. n. The name of a kind of rain-water (ascribed to the celestial Gaṅgā), Suśr. 1, 170, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाङ्गेय|गांगेय|गाङ्गेयं|गाङ्गेयः
गाङ्गेय गाङ्गेय, i. e. गङ्गा + एय,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Belonging to the Gaṅgā, MBh. 3, 165.<BR> 2. Being near the Gaṅgā, Rām. 6, 4, 2.<BR> II. m. metronym. A son of the Gaṅgā, MBh. 1, 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाढ|गाढं
गाढ गाढ, see गाह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाढत्व
गाढत्व गाढ + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Depth.<BR> 2. Intensity, Daśak. 102, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाणपत्य|गाणपत्यः
गाणपत्य गाणपत्य, i. e. गण-पति + य, n. Dominion over the inferior deities, or the condition of Gaṇeśa, MBh. 3, 4093.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाण्डिव|गांडिव|गांडिवं|गांडिवः|गाण्डिवः
गाण्डिव गाण्डिव, or गाण्डीव गाण्ड्-ईव [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0261-a " target="_blank">Page0261-a + 38</a>] (cf. the next), m. and n. The bow of Arjuna, MBh. 3, 228; 1, 8177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाण्डीमय
गाण्डीमय गाण्डी + मय, adj. Made of gāṇḍī (a plant?), MBh. 5, 3540.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0261-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

