गार्हस्थ्य गार्हस्थ्य, i. e. गृह-स्थ + य,<BR> I. adj. Befitting the householder, MBh. 9, 2854.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Condition of a householder, Rām. 2, 106, 21.<BR> 2. Household, MBh. 14, 162.<BR> 3. Abode, Bhāg. P. 3, 33, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

