गालव गालव, m. The name of a saint, MBh. 1, 331.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गालवि
गालवि गालवि, i. e. गालव + इ, patronym., m. A son of Gālava, MBh. 9, 2995.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गालि|गालिः
गालि गालि, i. e. गल् + इ, 1. An execration, Bhartṛ. 3, 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0263-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गालिमन्त्|गालिमत्
