गिर्
गिर् गिर् (vb. 1. गॄ), f.<BR> 1. Voice, Yājñ. 1, 71.<BR> 2. Speech, Nal. 1, 26 (25).<BR> 3. A word, Nal. 11, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0263-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

