गिरि|गिरिः
गिरि गिरि (for original गर; cf. Slav. gora; ὄρος, probably from गुर् for गर्), m.<BR> 1. A mountain, Rām. 1, 2, 29.<BR> 2. A name of the numeral eight, Śrutab. 38.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

