द्वि- + गुणित द्वि- + गुणित, adj. double, Kir. 5, 46.<BR> 2. † To invite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण|गुणः
गुण गुण (for गुष् + न, from गुष् in ved. गुष्-प्; cf. पुष् and पुष्-प्), m.<BR> 1. A string, Ragh. 2, 83.<BR> 2. A bow-string, Rām. 3, 33, 16.<BR> 3. A lutestring, Śiś. 4, 57.<BR> 4. Time; दशगुणास्, Ten times, Man. 2, 85; in this signification it is almost always the latter part of a comp. adj. and preceded by numerals, e. g. अष्टगुण, i. e. अष्टन्-, Eight-fold, Man. 8, 400. द्वि-,<BR> a. Twofold, double, Cāṇ. 78.<BR> b. Twice as many, MBh. 3, 14316.<BR> c. Folded, Yājñ. 1, 232. With an abl., As many times more as are denoted by the numeral, e. g. मूल्यात् पञ्चगुण, i. e. पञ्चन्-, Five times the value, Man. 8, 289; त्वत्तः शतगुणो बले, A hundred times stronger than thou, Rām. 6, 95, 11; also comparat., e. g. द्विगुणतर, Doubled, Pañc. 57, 15.<BR> 5. Species, MBh. 12, 6847.<BR> 6. A subordinate element.<BR> 7. An accompanying dish, Man. 3, 226.<BR> 8. Quality of a subject, Man. 3, 36; 1, 76-78.<BR> 9. The three fundamental qualities: सत्त्व, रजस्, and तमस्, Man. 12, 24.<BR> 10. A good quality, virtue, Man. 9, 141; excellence, Ragh. 3, 30; gain, Pañc. ii. d. 21.<BR> 11. Excess, MBh. 3, 14746.<BR> 12. One of the six expedients in government, Man. 7, 160.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगुण|अगुणः
अ- + गुण अ- + गुण, m. a bad property, Man. 3, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिगुण|अतिगुणः
अति- + गुण अति- + गुण, adj. extraordinary, Rām. 4, 41, 79.; धनुस्-, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b " target="_blank">Page0265-b + 43</a>] a bow-string, Ṛt. 6, 1 (read -मालम् and -गुणम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागुण
तथा- + गुण तथा- + गुण, adj. having such qualities, Rām. 2, 22, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिगुण|त्रिगुणं
त्रि- + गुण त्रि- + गुण,<BR> I. m. pl. the three principal qualities, Bhāg. P. 4, 24, 28.<BR> II. adj. 1. consisting of three strings, Kumāras. 5, 10. 2. three times as many, Man. 5, 137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गुण|निर्गुणः
निस्- + गुण निस्- + गुण, adj., f. णा, 1. without a string, Mṛcch. 131 17. 2. without qualities, MBh. 1, 2432. 3. devoid of virtue, Rām. 2, 33, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तागुण|मुक्तागुणः
मुक्ता- + गुण मुक्ता- + गुण, m. a string of pearls, Megh. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगुण|विगुणः
वि- + गुण वि- + गुण, adj. 1. void of all qualities. 2. void of distinguishing qualities, Śiś. 9, 12. 3. worthless, bad. 4. imperfect, Man. 10, 97 (imperfectly performed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवेकविगुण
विवेक-वि- + गुण विवेक-वि- + गुण, adj. contrary to reason, unreasonable, Rājat. 5, 352.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशेषगुण|विशेषगुणः
विशेष- + गुण विशेष- + गुण, m. a special quality, Bhāṣāp. 26, 89; 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिविषयगुण
श्रुति-विषय- + गुण श्रुति-विषय- + गुण, adj. having as its special property that which is the object of hearing, i. e. sound, epithet of the ether, Śāk. d. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगुण
स- + गुण स- + गुण, adj. endowed with qualities, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणज्ञ|गुणज्ञः
गुणज्ञ गुण-ज्ञ (vb. ज्ञा), m. A friend of virtue, Bhartṛ. 2, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणतस्
गुणतस् गुण-तस्, adv.<BR> 1. Concerning good qualities, Man. 11, 185.<BR> 2. Conformably to the three fundamental qualities (see गुण<BR> 9), Bhag. 18, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणता
गुणता गुण + ता, f.<BR> 1. Being subordinate, Bhāg. P. 3, 26, 39 (see गुण<BR> 6).<BR> 2. Excellence, MBh. 3, 11236.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणत्व|गुणत्वं
गुणत्व गुण + त्व, n.<BR> 1. The state of being a string, Hit. i. d. 30.<BR> 2. Excellence, Suśr. 1, 184, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणन|गुणनं
गुणन गुण् + अन, n. Exalting, Gīt. 7, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणमय
गुणमय गुण + मय, adj., f. यी.<BR> 1. Consisting of virtues, MBh. 1, 6546.<BR> 2. Referable to the three fundamental qualities, MBh. 14, 1327.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवत्ता
गुणवत्ता गुणवत्ता, i. e. गुणवन्त् + ता, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a " target="_blank">Page0266-a + 39</a>] f. Possession of virtues, MBh. 14, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवन्त्|गुणवत्
गुणवन्त् गुण + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Possessing good qualities, Rām. 3, 11, 16.<BR> 2. Excellent, Nal. 1, 30.<BR> --Compar. वत्तर, More excellent, Man. 5, 113.<BR> --Superl. Most distinguished, Yājñ. 2, 78.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगुणवन्त्|अगुणवत्
अ- + गुणवन्त् अ- + गुणवन्त्, adj. bad, Bhartṛ. 2, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिता
गुणिता गुणिता, i. e. गुणिन् + ता, f. Possession of virtues, Hit. Pr. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिन्
गुणिन् गुणिन्, i. e. गुण + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Possessing qualities or attributes, i. e. being a subject, Bhāg. P. 2, 8, 14.<BR> 2. Possessing good qualities, virtuous, Man. 8, 73.<BR> 3. Knowing the qualities, Mārk. P. 27, 9.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगुणिन्
सु- + गुणिन् सु- + गुणिन्, adj. virtuous, Bhartṛ. 2, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ठ्|गुंठ्
गुण्ठ् गुण्ठ्, i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To cover, MBh. 7, 2734.<BR> 2. To ensnare, 6, 819.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To cover, Man. 4, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ठन|गुंठन|गुंठनं
गुण्ठन गुण्ठ् + अन, n. Covering, Prab. 30, 17 (v. r.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ड्|गुंड्
† गुण्ड् गुण्ड्, i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To cover.<BR> 2. To pound.<BR> 3. To preserve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डन|गुंडनं
गुण्डन गुण्ड् + अन, n. = गुण्ठन, Prab. 30, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुद्
† गुद् गुद्, i. 1. Ātm. To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुद|गुदं
गुद गुद, m. and n. The anus, Man. 8, 283.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुध्
† गुध् गुध्, i. 4, Par. To cover. ii. 9, Par. To be angry.<BR> --i. 1, Ātm. To play (v. r.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुन्द्र्|गुंद्र्
† गुन्द्र् गुन्द्र्, i. 10, Par. To lie, to speak falsely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
1. गुप् गुप्, Par. Base of the present, etc., गोपाय (गोप, Gīt. 6, 12), Par.; and गोपय, Par. Ātm. (old Causals [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-b " target="_blank">Page0266-b + 44</a>] of गुह्; cf. रुह्).<BR> 1. To guard, to protect, गोपायति, MBh. 6, 472; गोपयस्व, 5, 350; जुगोप, 6, 3897.<BR> 2. To keep in memory, Gīt. 6, 12 (गोपतस्, ptcple. of the pres.).<BR> 3. To conceal, Rājat. 5, 222; Pañc. ii. d. 106.<BR> 4. † गोपय, To speak.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., गोपित and गुप्त, Guarded, MBh. 1, 5090; Man. 7, 76. गुप्त + म् adv. Privately, Kathās. 5, 40.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass.<BR> 1. गोप्तव्य and गोप्य, To be guarded, MBh. 12, 3449; 12, 1481.<BR> 2. गोप्य, To be concealed, Pañc. i. d. 113.<BR> 3. गोपनीय, To be prevented, MBh. 12, 5399.<BR> --Caus. गोपायय, To guard, MBh. 3, 10835.<BR> --Desider. जुगुप्स, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par. Rām. 2, 69, 20).<BR> 1. To disdain, Man. 6, 58.<BR> 2. To be offended, MBh. 1, 6375.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., जुगुप्सित,<BR> 1. Abominated, MBh. 3, 1288.<BR> 2. Contemned, Man. 4, 209. n. 1. An abominable act, Bhāg. P. 1, 5, 15. 2. Abominableness, 1, 7, 42.<BR> --Comp.<BR> अ-जुगुप्सित, being reverenced, Man. 3, 209.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, अनुगुप्त, Guarded, MBh. 3, 8436. तम्, adv. Privately, MBh. 3, 251.<BR> --With अभि अभि, अभिगुप्त, Protected. MBh. 1, 7989.<BR> --With उप उप, उपगुप्त, Concealed, Bhāg. P. 4, 16, 10.<BR> --With परि परि, गोपाय To guard. Bhāg. P. 5, 2, 1.<BR> --Desider. To be on one's guard (with abl.), MBh. 12, 3136.<BR> --With प्र प्र, गोपय. To guard Pañc. i. d. 348.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संगुप्त,<BR> 1. Protected, MBh. 13, 248. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a " target="_blank">Page0267-a + 41</a>]<BR> 2. Concealed, MBh. 13, 514.<BR> --Comp.<BR> सु-, adj. well guarded, MBh. 5, 900.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, अभिसंगुप्त, Guarded, MBh. 3, 274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवगुप्त
देव- + गुप्त देव- + गुप्त, m. a proper name, Rājat. 5, 436.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाभिगुप्त
नाभि- + गुप्त नाभि- + गुप्त, the name of a division of the world, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वगुप्त
पर्व(न्)- and विष्णु- + गुप्त पर्व(न्)- and विष्णु- + गुप्त, m. proper names.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुगुप्त|विष्णुगुप्तः
पर्व(न्)- and विष्णु- + गुप्त पर्व(न्)- and विष्णु- + गुप्त, m. proper names.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगुप्त
सु-गुप्त सु-गुप्त, adj. well concealed, Lass. 15, 3. ˚तम्, adv. privily, Pañc. 231, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0266-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
2. गुप् गुप्, i. 4, Par. To be confused or disturbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
ऽगुप् -गुप्, adj. Guarding, MBh. 13, 7000.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्ति|गुप्तिः
गुप्ति गुप् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Guarding, protecting, Rām. 2, 51, 3.<BR> 2. Defences, Rām. 6, 12, 16.<BR> 3. Concealing.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथगुप्ति|रथगुप्तिः
रथ- + गुप्ति रथ- + गुप्ति, f. an apparatus encompassing a war-chariot, to secure it from being injured by weapons or collision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगुप्ति
सु- + गुप्ति सु- + गुप्ति, f. secrecy, Hit. iv. d. 51 (closeness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुफ्
गुफ् गुफ् and गुम्फ् गुम्फ् (from ved. गुष्प्; cf. गुण), i. 6, Par. To string together. गुफित, Tied, clinging, Lass. 66, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्
गुर् गुर्, i. 6, Ātm. (also Par. Man. 4, 169), and i. 10, गोरय, Ātm.; also गूर् गूर्, i. 10, Ātm. To make an effort.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To assault, Man. 4, 169.<BR> --With उद् उद्, ptcple. of the pf. pass., उद्गूर्ण, Raised, Yājñ. 2, 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरु|गुरुः
गुरु गुर् + उ (for original, गर्-उ; cf. compar. गर् + ईयंस्, βαρύ),<BR> I. adj., f. गुर्वि,<BR> 1. Heavy, MBh. 3, 885.<BR> 2. Great, Bhartṛ. 2, 50; large, Pañc. 51, 8.<BR> 3. Violent, Vikr. d. 6.<BR> 4. Weighty, Brāhmaṇ. 2, 6; important, Man. 9, 52.<BR> 5. Dear, MBh. i, 2749.<BR> 6. Venerable, Man. 2, 133.<BR> II. m. and f. A father or mother, a husband, or any venerable male or female relation, Rām. 1, 22, 20; Sāv. 4, 22; Sund. 4, 15.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. A spiritual teacher, Man. 2, 142.<BR> 2. An object of veneration Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 868. Compar.<BR> 1. गुरुतर. Heavier, MBh. 3, 13292; fem. तरा, MBh. 1, 3267 (तरी, Indr. 5, 41, is to be changed to [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b " target="_blank">Page0267-b + 41</a>] तरा, according to the Calc. ed. 3, 1857).<BR> 2. गरीयंस्, Very heavy, Rām. 6, 82, 43.<BR> 3. Preferable, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 910. Superl. गुरुतम, गरिष्ठ.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. βαρύς, etc., ἐπι-ζαρέω; Lat. gravis; Goth. kaurs, kauritha; A.S. caru; Engl. care.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिगुरु|अतिगुरुः
अति- + गुरु अति- + गुरु, adj. exceedingly heavy, Ṛt. 6, 31. Compar. अतिगरीयंस्, too dear, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रगुरु|इन्द्रगुरुः
इन्द्र- + गुरु इन्द्र- + गुरु, m. Indra's teacher, Śāk. 101, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौरीगुरु|गौरीगुरुः
गौरी- + गुरु गौरी- + गुरु, m. a name of the Himālaya, Śāk. d. 144.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगद्गुरु|जगद्गुरुः
जगत्- + गुरु जगत्- + गुरु, m. a name of Brahman, Viṣṇu, Śiva, Rāma, Rām. 3, 6, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरगुरु|सुरगुरुः
सुर- + गुरु सुर- + गुरु, m. Bṛhaspati, the teacher of the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुक
गुरुक गुरु + क, adj. A little heavy, MBh. 3, 11477.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुतल्पग|गुरुतल्पगः
गुरुतल्पग गुरु-तल्प-ग, m. A violator of the bed of his guru, i. e. his father or teacher, Man. 9, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुतल्पिन्
गुरुतल्पिन् गुरुतल्पिन्, i. e. गुरु-तल्प + इन्, m. A violator of the bed of his guru, i. e. his father or teacher, Man. 11, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुता
गुरुता गुरु + ता, f.<BR> 1. Heaviness, Śāk. d. 35.<BR> 2. Molestation, Rām. 2, 27, 22.<BR> 3. Importance, Śiś. 9, 22.<BR> 4. The condition of a teacher, Kathās. 19, 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुत्व|गुरुत्वं
गुरुत्व गुरु + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Heaviness, Pañc. 247, 13.<BR> 2. Dignity, Ragh. 10, 65.<BR> 3. The condition of a teacher, Chr. 22, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुत्वक
गुरुत्वक गुरुत्व + क, n. Heaviness, Bhāṣāp. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुलघुता
गुरुलघुता गुरु-लघु + ता, f. The condition of being wealthy or poor, Bhartṛ. 2, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुवत्
गुरुवत् गुरु + वत्, adv. Like a preceptor, Man. 2, 208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्जर|गुर्जरः|गुर्ज्जर|गुर्ज्जरः
गुर्जर गुर्जर, m. The name of a country, Guzarat, Pañc. 229, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्द्
† गुर्द् गुर्द्, or गूर्द् गूर्द्, i. 1, गूर्द, Ātm. To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0267-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्व्
† गुर्व् गुर्व्, i. 1, गूर्व, Par. To endeavour.<BR> --Cf. गुर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्विणी|गुर्व्विणी
गुर्विणी गुर्विणी (a dialect. fem. of गुरु), f. A pregnant woman. MBh. 14, 1843.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्फ|गुल्फः
गुल्फ गुल्फ, m. The ancle, Rām. 6, 23, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्चगुल्फ
उच्च- + गुल्फ उच्च- + गुल्फ, adj., f. फा, having high ancles, MBh. 4, 253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्म|गुल्मं|गुल्मः
गुल्म गुल्म, m. and n.<BR> 1. A shrub, MBh. 13, 2992.<BR> 2. A body of troops, consisting of 9 elephants, 9 chariots, 27 horses, and 45 foot, Man. 9, 266.<BR> 3. A morbose swelling in the belly, Kathās. 15, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गुल्म
निस्- + गुल्म निस्- + गुल्म, adj., f. मा, free from bushes, MBh. 1, 5320.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातगुल्म|वातगुल्मः
वात- + गुल्म वात- + गुल्म, m. 1. a gale. 2. acute gout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायुगुल्म|वायुगुल्मः
वायु- + गुल्म वायु- + गुल्म, m. a whirlpool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्
गुह् गुह्, i. 1, गूह, Par. and Ātm.<BR> 1. To conceal, Man. 7, 105; ptcple. of the pf. pass., गूढ,<BR> 1. Secret, Man. 7, 186.<BR> 2. Disguised, Man. 9, 261. ढम्, adv. Privately, Daśak. in Chr. 191, 13. ढे, loc. adv. Secretly, Man. 9, 170.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass., गुह्य,<BR> 1. To be concealed, Man. 11, 265.<BR> 2. Hidden, MBh. 3, 173.<BR> 3. Mysterious, Bhag. 18, 63. यम्, adv. Solitarily, MBh. 12, 902. n.<BR> 1. A secret, MBh. 13, 5876; a mystery, Man. 12, 117.<BR> 2. Pudendum, Suśr. 1, 116, 7.<BR> --Comp.<BR> देव-गुह्य, n. a mystery known only to the gods, Rām. 5, 27, 33.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप,<BR> 1. To cover, MBh. 5, 7246.<BR> 2. To embrace, Pañc. iii. d. 191.<BR> --With उप उप, To embrace; उपगाढ, n. An embrace, Megh. 95.<BR> --With समुप सम्-उप, To embrace, Caurap. 6.<BR> --With नि नि,<BR> 1. To cover, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 24.<BR> 2. To conceal, Pañc. 36, 20. निगूढ + तर, Well-concealed, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b " target="_blank">Page0268-b + 36</a>] Pañc. 46, 7. निगूढ + म्, adv. Privately, Kathās. 5, 65.<BR> --With विनि वि-नि, To conceal, Rām. 5, 20, 6.<BR> --With वि वि, विगूढ,<BR> 1. Concealed, Man. 9, 260.<BR> 2. Scarcely perceivable, Bhāg. P. 5, 5, 31.<BR> 3. Blamed.<BR> --Cf. कुहक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्त्रगुह्य
मन्त्र- + गुह्य मन्त्र- + गुह्य, m. a spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगूढम्
स-गूढ + म् स-गूढ + म्, adv. secretly, privily, Daśak. in Chr. 201, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह|गुहः
गुह गुह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A name of Skanda, the god of war, MBh. 13, 4093.<BR> 2. A name of Śiva, MBh. 13, 1263.<BR> 3. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 12, 7559.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुहा
गुहा गुह् + आ, f.<BR> 1. A cave, Rām. 1, 6, 20.<BR> 2. The heart, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 24; cf. Śvet. Up. 3, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यक|गुह्यकः
गुह्यक गुह्य + क (vb. गुह्), m. A class of demigods attendant upon Kuvera, Man. 12, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यमय|गुह्यमयः
गुह्यमय गुह्य + मय, adj. in सर्व-, Comprehending all mysteries, MBh. 1, 5431.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गू
गू गू, see 2. गु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढत्व
गूढत्व गूढ + त्व (vb. गुह्), n. Secretness, MBh. 1, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्
† गूर् गूर्, i. 4, Ātm. To injure.<BR> --Cf. गुर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्द्
गूर्द् गूर्द्, see गुर्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूहन|गूहनं
गूहन गूहन, i. e. गुह् + अन, n. Concealment, MBh. 11, 820.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृ
गृ गृ, i. 1, Par. To sprinkle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृज्
† गृज् गृज्, and गृञ्ज् गृञ्ज् i. 1, Par. To roar.<BR> --Cf. गर्ज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृञ्जन|गृंजन|गृञ्जनं|गृंजनः|गृञ्जनः
गृञ्जन गृञ्ज् + अन, and गृञ्जनक गृञ्जन + क, m. Garlic, Man. 5, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृत्समद|गृत्समदः
गृत्समद गृत्स-मद (the first part is a vedic word), m. The name of a Ṛṣi, MBh. 13, 1314.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0268-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृद्धिन्
गृद्धिन् गृद्धिन्, i. e. गृद्ध + इन् (vb. गृध्), adj.<BR> 1. Greedy, MBh. 1, 2948.<BR> 2. Loving, MBh. 13, 1876.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्
गृध् गृध्, i. 4, गृध्य, Par. To be greedy, Bhāg. P. 3, 3, 4; with loc., MBh. 3, 225; with acc., MBh. 4, 276. गृद्ध, Greedy, MBh. 5, 811.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, To be greedy for (with loc.), MBh. 12, 372.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To be greedy for, (with acc.), MBh. 14, 847.<BR> --Cf. ἀγρήθετο; probably Goth. gredon, to hunger; gredus, gredags; λιμός; see गृध्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्न
गृध्न गृध् + न, MBh. 13, 5640, Greedy, is probably to be changed to गृध्नु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्निनी
