अगृध्नु
अ- + गृध्नु अ- + गृध्नु, adj. liberal, Ragh. 1, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्या
गृध्या गृध् + या, f. Greediness, MBh. 13, 5590.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्र|गृध्रः
गृध्र गृध् + र,<BR> I. adj. Greedy, Pañc. i. d. 203.<BR> II. m. A vulture, Rām. 3, 20, 19.<BR> III. f. री, A female vulture, Yājñ. 3, 256.<BR> --Cf. Lat. vultur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्रवाजित
गृध्रवाजित गृध्रवाजित, i. e. गृध्रवाज + इत, m. An arrow, MBh. 14, 2454.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृध्राण
गृध्राण गृध्राण (akin to गृध्र), adj. Full of desires, Bhāg. P. 5, 17, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृष्टि|गृष्टिः
गृष्टि गृष्टि, f. A cow that has had one calf, MBh. 13, 4919.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृष्ट्या
गृष्ट्या गृष्ट्या (cf. the last), adj. f. (A cow) that has had but one calf, MBh. 13, 4427.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0269-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्
