गो
गो गो,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A bull; f. A cow, Man. 3, 141; pl. Bulls and cows, cattle, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0272-a " target="_blank">Page0272-a + 44</a>] Man. 4, 72.<BR> 2. m. pl. Rays of light, Rājat. 5, 1.<BR> II. f. The earth, Rām. 1, 41, 18.<BR> III. m. and f. Water, Bhāg. P. 1, 10, 36.<BR> IV. f. Speech, Ragh. 5, 12.<BR> V. The deity of speech, MBh. 5, 4149.<BR> VI. m. The name of a Ṛṣi, MBh. 2, 381.<BR> VII. f. A proper name, Bhāg. P. 9, 21, 25.<BR> --Cf. βοῦς, γαῖος, Γη-ρύων; Lat. bos, ceva; O.H.G. kô; A.S. cû; probably also γαῖα, γῆ, δῆ, Δημήτηρ; Goth. gavi, gauja.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0271-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोअग्र
गोअग्र गो-अग्र, adj. Preceded by cows, Chr. 294, 7 = Rigv. i. 92, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0272-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोअर्णस्
