गोप|गोपः
गोप गो-प (vb. 2. पा),<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A cowherd, Man. 8, 231.<BR> 2. A preserver, MBh. 13, 1375.<BR> 3. A name of Kṛṣṇa, MBh. 12, 1438.<BR> II. f. पी, A cowherd's wife, Hit. 64, 7; a milk-maid, Gīt. 2, 21.<BR> --Comp.<BR> When latter part of a comp. adj. the fem. ends in पा, e. g. अ-गोप, adj., f. पा, without a cowherd, MBh. 1, 3213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0273-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

