गोलोमतस् गोलोमतस्, i. e. गो-लोमन् + तस्, adv. From cow's hair, Pañc. i. d. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0273-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोविन्द|गोविंद|गोविन्दः
गोविन्द गोविन्द, i. e. गो-विद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A name of Kṛṣṇa, MBh. 5, 2572.<BR> 2. The name of a mountain, MBh. 6, 460.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0273-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गीतगोविन्द
गीत- + गोविन्द गीत- + गोविन्द, m. title of an idyllic drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0273-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोविषाणिक|गोविषाणिकः
गोविषाणिक गोविषाणिक, i. e. गो-विषाण + इक, m. A kind of trumpet, MBh. 9, 2676.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0273-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोषुयुध्
