ग्रहण|ग्रहणं
ग्रहण ग्रहण, i. e. ग्रह् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Seizing, Hariv. 2734.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Taking, seizure, Mṛcch. 147, 1.<BR> 2. Captivity, Rām. 1, 1, 73.<BR> 3. An eclipse (cf. ग्रह,<BR> II. 1), Śṛṅgārat. 6.<BR> 4. Receiving, Rām. 1, 24, 18.<BR> 5. Buying, Pañc. 229, 2.<BR> 6. Putting on, MBh. 2, 840.<BR> 7. Undergoing, Pañc. 34, 9.<BR> 8. Protection, Bhāg. P. 3, 1, 44.<BR> 9. Pronouncing, Man. 6, 67.<BR> 10. Perception, MBh. 14, 1197.<BR> 11. Study, Man. 2, 173.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

