ग्रहिल
ग्रहिल ग्रहिल, i. e. ग्रह + इल, adj.<BR> 1. Assuming, Sāh. D. 24, 13.<BR> 2. Frantic, Śukas. 15 (14).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहीतृ
ग्रहीतृ ग्रहीतृ, i. e. ग्रह् + तृ,<BR> I. m. f. त्री, and n. Apprehending, Man. 1, 15.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A purchaser, Pañc. i. d. 15.<BR> 2. A debtor, Man. 8, 166.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिग्रहीतृ
पाणि- + ग्रहीतृ पाणि- + ग्रहीतृ, m, a husband, MBh. 13, 2423.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राम्
† ग्राम् ग्राम्, i. 10 (rather a denomin. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a " target="_blank">Page0279-a + 41</a>] derived from the next), Par. To invite, see श्राम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राम|ग्रामः
ग्राम ग्राम, i. e. ग्रह् + म, m.<BR> 1. A village, Man. 4, 107 (n. Rām. 2, 57, 4).<BR> 2. A villager, Man. 8, 258 (? perhaps is to be read ग्रामसाम्˚).<BR> 3. As latter part of a comp. word. A multitude, Nal. 4, 10.<BR> 4. A scale in music, Mārk. P. 23, 52.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रियग्राम|इन्द्रियग्रामः
इन्द्रिय- + ग्राम इन्द्रिय- + ग्राम, m. all the senses, Man. 2, 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्राम|गुणग्रामः
गुण- + ग्राम गुण- + ग्राम, m. a multitude of good qualities, Bhartṛ. 3, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिग्रामी
त्रि-ग्रामी त्रि-ग्रामी, f. the name of a locality, Rājat. 5, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामी
दशग्रामी दशग्रामी, i. e. दशन्-, f. a district of ten villages, MBh. 12, 3263.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सालग्राम
साल- + ग्राम साल- + ग्राम, m. a stone, a species of ammonite worshipped by the Vaiṣṇavas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामक|ग्रामकः
ग्रामक ग्राम + क, m.<BR> 1. A village, MBh. 5, 1466.<BR> 2. A fictitious name, Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामणी
ग्रामणी ग्रामणी, i. e. ग्राम-नी, m.<BR> 1. The chief of a community, MBh. 1, 4798 (ग्रामणि, on account of the metre, MBh. 7, 1123; 4099).<BR> 2. A chief, MBh. 12, 4798.<BR> 3. A proper name, Rām. 4, 41, 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामणीत्व
ग्रामणीत्व ग्रामणी + त्व, n. The dignity of a chief, MBh. 12, 4861.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामवन्त्|ग्रामवत्
ग्रामवन्त् ग्राम + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Crowded with villages, MBh. 8, 4570.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामान्तीय
ग्रामान्तीय ग्रामान्तीय, i. e. ग्राम-अन्त + ईय, adj. Near a village, Man. 8, 240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामिक|ग्रामिकः
ग्रामिक ग्रामिक, i. e. ग्राम + इक, m. The chief of a village, Man. 7, 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामिन्
ग्रामिन् ग्रामिन्, i. e. ग्राम + इन्, m. A peasant, Bhāg. P. 4, 29, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामी
