ग्रामीण|ग्रामीणः
ग्रामीण ग्रामीण, i. e. ग्राम + ईन, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b " target="_blank">Page0279-b + 44</a>] adj., f. णा, Inhabiting a village, a peasant, Bhartṛ. 1, 89.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकग्रामीण
एक- + ग्रामीण एक- + ग्रामीण, i. e. एकग्राम + ईन, adj. living in the same village, Man. 3, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामीयक|ग्रामीयकः
ग्रामीयक ग्रामीयक, i. e. ग्राम + ईय + क, adj. Belonging to a community, Man. 8, 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामेय
ग्रामेय ग्रामेय, i. e. ग्राम + एय, m. A villager, MBh. 12, 3264.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राम्य|ग्राम्यः
ग्राम्य ग्राम्य, i. e. ग्राम + य,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Referring to villages, Man. 7, 120.<BR> 2. Prepared in villages, MBh. 1, 3637.<BR> 3. Inhabiting a village, Yājñ. 2, 166.<BR> 4. Coarse, sensual, Rām. 3, 37, 3.<BR> 5. Living in towns, Man. 11, 199; tame, Pañc. 68, 14.<BR> 6. Cultivated, MBh. 1, 6658.<BR> II. n. Sensuality, MBh. 2, 2270.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्राम्य
अ- + ग्राम्य अ- + ग्राम्य, adj. town-made.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रावन्
ग्रावन् ग्रावन्, m. A stone, a rock, Bhartṛ. 3, 29.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. probably λᾶας, λεύς; Lat. lapis (cf. ovis, opilio).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकषग्रावन्
निकष- + ग्रावन् निकष- + ग्रावन्, m. a touchstone, Hit. i. d. 204.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रास|ग्रासः
ग्रास ग्रास, i. e. ग्रस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A mouthful, Man. 3, 133; a morsel, Pañc. 221, 21.<BR> 2. Food, Man. 8, 339.<BR> 3. Swallowing, Bhartṛ. 2, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राह|ग्राहं|ग्राहः
ग्राह ग्राह, i. e. ग्रह् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. ही,<BR> 1. Taking, Yājñ. 2, 51.<BR> 2. Robbing, Rām. 4, 41, 38.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A shark, Pañc. i. d. 420. f. ही, A female shark, Rām. 6, 82, 73.<BR> 2. Seizing, seizure; e. g. पाणि-, Taking the hand at marriage.<BR> 3. A fit, a disease, MBh. 6, 5680 (read ऊरु-).<BR> 4. Enterprise, Bhag. 17, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवग्राहम्
जीव-ग्राह + म् जीव-ग्राह + म् (absol. of ग्रह्), combined with ग्रह्, to take somebody prisoner alive, MBh. 3, 14918.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुर्ग्राह
धनुस्- + ग्राह धनुस्- + ग्राह, m. an archer, MBh. 3, 1430.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिग्राह|पाणिग्राहः
पाणि- + ग्राह पाणि- + ग्राह, m. a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पार्ष्णिग्राह|पार्ष्णिग्राहः
पार्ष्णि- + ग्राह पार्ष्णि- + ग्राह, m. a supporting prince (perhaps, rather, a dangerous prince), Man. 7, 207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वन्दिग्राह|वन्दिग्राहः
वन्दि- + ग्राह वन्दि- + ग्राह, m. a housebreaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रग्राह
सूत्र- + ग्राह सूत्र- + ग्राह, adj. taking a thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0279-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहक|ग्राहकः
ग्राहक ग्राहक, i. e. ग्रह् + अक,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Apprehending, MBh. 3, 13932.<BR> 2. Convincing, Rām. 4, 38, 18. m.<BR> 1. A purchaser, Pañc. 7, 16.<BR> 2. A policeman, Yājñ. 2, 266.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहवन्त्|ग्राहवत्
ग्राहवन्त् ग्राह + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Containing sharks, Rām. 5, 72, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमग्राहवन्त्|भीमग्राहवत्
भीम- + ग्राहवन्त् भीम- + ग्राहवन्त्, i. e. भीमग्राह + वन्त्, adj. containing fearful sharks, Chr. 47, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रागग्राहवन्त्
राग-ग्राह + वन्त् राग-ग्राह + वन्त्, containing love instead of sharks, Bhartṛ. 3, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहिन्
ग्राहिन् ग्राहिन्, i. e. ग्रह् + इन्, adj., f. इणी,<BR> 1. Seizing, robbing, Rām. 5, 8, 6.<BR> 2. Gaining, Rām. 3, 72, 1.<BR> 3. Catching, Kathās. 25, 49.<BR> 4. Gathering, Sāh. D. 11, 12.<BR> 5. Choosing, Mārk. P. 27, 28.<BR> 6. Spying, Śāk. 24, 7.<BR> 7. Holding, Bhartṛ. 3, 67.<BR> 8. Containing, Daśak. in Chr. 189, 11.<BR> 9. Charming, Rām. 5, 44, 8.<BR> 10. Obstructing, Suśr. 1, 178, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्राहिन्
गुण- + ग्राहिन् गुण- + ग्राहिन्, m. acknowledging another's virtues, Lass. 34, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवग्राहिन्
पल्लव- + ग्राहिन् पल्लव- + ग्राहिन्, adj. shooting forth too luxuriantly (or twigpicking, superficial), Hit. i. d. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनग्राहिन्
वचन- + ग्राहिन् वचन- + ग्राहिन्, adj. compliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनयग्राहिन्
विनय- + ग्राहिन् विनय- + ग्राहिन्, adj. compliant, governable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीवा
ग्रीवा ग्रीवा, f. The neck, Man. 8, 283.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वग्रीव|अश्वग्रीवः
अश्व-ग्रीव अश्व-ग्रीव, m. the name of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्ग्रीव
उद्-ग्रीव उद्-ग्रीव, adj., f. वा, with raised neck, Rājat. 5, 359.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुग्रीवा|कंबुग्रीवा
कम्बु- + ग्रीवा कम्बु- + ग्रीवा,<BR> I. adj., f. वा, having a neck marked with three lines like a shell, and considered to be indicative of exalted fortune, Rām. 1, 1, 11.<BR> II. m. a proper name, Pañc. 76, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रग्रीव
चित्र-ग्रीव चित्र-ग्रीव, m. a proper name, Pañc. 105, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रीव|दशग्रीवः
दशग्रीव दशग्रीव, i. e. दशन्-, adj. 1. an epithet of Rāvaṇa, Rām. 1, 16, 18. 2. the name of a demon, MBh. 2, 367.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्कग्रीव
निष्क-ग्रीव निष्क-ग्रीव, adj. wearing a golden ornament on the neck, Bhāg. P. 3, 23, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलग्रीव|नीलग्रीवः
नील-ग्रीव नील-ग्रीव, adj. with a blue neck (epithet of Śiva), MBh. 3, 1625.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाग्रीव|महाग्रीवः
महा-ग्रीव महा-ग्रीव, m. a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रग्रीव|वक्रग्रीवः
वक्र- + ग्रीव वक्र- + ग्रीव, m. a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग्रीव
सु- + ग्रीव सु- + ग्रीव,<BR> I. adj. handsome-necked.<BR> II. m. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b " target="_blank">Page0280-b + 38</a>] 1. a goose. 2. a hero. 3. a sort of weapon. 4. one of Kṛṣṇa's horses. 5. a proper name. 6. Indra. 7. Śiva. 8. a serpent of the lower regions. 9. the name of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हयग्रीवा
हय- + ग्रीवा हय- + ग्रीवा, m. a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रीष्म|ग्रीष्मः
ग्रीष्म ग्रीष्म, m. The hot season, comprehending about June and July, Man. 3, 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रुच्
† ग्रुच् ग्रुच्, i. 1, Par. To steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैव|ग्रैवं
ग्रैव ग्रैव, i. e. ग्रीवा + अ, n. A neckornament, Ragh. 4, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैवेय|ग्रैवेयं
ग्रैवेय ग्रैवेय, i. e. ग्रीवा + एय, n. A chain for the neck, Rām. 1, 53, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैवेयक|ग्रैवेयकं
ग्रैवेयक ग्रैवेय + क, m. and n. A chain for the neck, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 16; a neck-ornament, Dev. 2, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रैष्म
ग्रैष्म ग्रैष्म, i. e. ग्रीष्म + अ, adj., f. मी, Referring to the hot season, Bhāg. P. 5, 9, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लपन|ग्लपनं
ग्लपन ग्लपन, i. e. ग्लै, Caus., + अन, n. Relaxation, Suśr. 1, 151, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लस्
† ग्लस् ग्लस् = ग्रस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लह्
ग्लह् ग्लह्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To play with dice, MBh. 8, 4404.<BR> 2. To win, 7, 6538.<BR> 3. † = ग्रह् (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लह|ग्लहः
ग्लह ग्लह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A gambler, MBh. 2, 2037.<BR> 2. A stake, MBh. 2, 2499; Daśak. in Chr. 188, 22.<BR> 3. A die, MBh. 8, 3756.<BR> 4. A dice-box, MBh. 2, 1986.<BR> 5. Playing with dice, MBh. 5, 1898.<BR> 6. Aim, MBh. 8, 4402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लानि|ग्लानिः
ग्लानि ग्लानि, i. e. ग्लै + नि, f.<BR> 1. Lassitude, MBh. 1, 8142.<BR> 2. Inertness, Man. 1, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लुच्
ग्लुच् ग्लुच्, i. 1, Par. To steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लुञ्च्|ग्लुंच्
† ग्लुञ्च् ग्लुञ्च्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेप्
† ग्लेप् ग्लेप् (akin to ग्लै), i. 1, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a " target="_blank">Page0281-a + 38</a>] Ātm.<BR> 1. To be poor.<BR> 2. To tremble.<BR> 3. To move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0280-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेव्
† ग्लेव् ग्लेव्, i. 1, Ātm. To serve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लेष्
† ग्लेष् ग्लेष् (? v. r.), i. 1, Ātm. To search.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लै
ग्लै ग्लै (akin to गल्), i. 1, ग्लाय (in epic poetry ग्लाति instead of ग्लायति, e. g. MBh. 3, 13730; cf. गै), Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., MBh. 3, 16713).<BR> 1. To become exhausted, MBh. 5, 7178.<BR> 2. To decrease, MBh. 12, 7513.<BR> 3. To repine, Man. 3, 98.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. ग्लान,<BR> 1. Sad, MBh. 15, 132.<BR> 2. Wearied, MBh. 3, 14109, n. Exhaustion, MBh. 13, 3519.<BR> --Caus. ग्लापय and ग्लपय,<BR> 1. To macerate, Vikr. d. 54.<BR> 2. To injure, Rājat. 1, 334.<BR> 3. To pain, distress, MBh. 5, 1100 (ग्लपेत्, instead of ग्लपयेत्, cf. गुप्); 13, 4694 (Ātm.)<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, परिग्लान, Exhausted, MBh. 7, 8898.<BR> --With अभिपरि अभि-परि, अभिपरिग्लान, The same, MBh. 1, 4489.<BR> --With वि वि, Caus. ग्लापय, To afflict, Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 22.<BR> --Cf. probably O.H.G. kleini, akin to ग्लान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ|घः
घ घ, usually घा (old instr. of a pronomin. base = Lat. ho, in ho-c, etc.), part., ved. Indeed, Chr. 287, 5 = Rigv. i. 48, 5; Chr. 297, 19 = Rigv. i. 112, 19.<BR> --Cf. γέ, ह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घंष्
† घंष् घंष्, and घंस् घंस्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To render handsome.<BR> 2. To sprinkle, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घग्घ्
† घग्घ् घग्घ्, and घघ् घघ्, i. 1, Par. To laugh.<BR> --Cf. गघ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्
घट् घट् (akin partly to हन्, partly to घट्ट्).<BR> --i. 1, Ātm. (also Par., MBh. 3, 14703),<BR> 1. To endeavour, MBh. 3, 1581.<BR> 2. To work, MBh. 5, 256.<BR> 3. To take place, Śiś. 9, 44.<BR> 4. To be possible, Bhāg. P. 7, 10, 3.<BR> 5. To fall into, Lass. 18, 8 (one's hand).<BR> 6. To be joined, Mālat. p. 38, 9.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pf. pass. अ-घटित, adj. impossible, Bhāg. P. 6, 16, 44.<BR> --Caus.<BR> I. घटय,<BR> 1. To join, Pañc. 40, 12.<BR> 2. To put on, Gīt. 12, 26.<BR> 3. To fetch, Bhartṛ. 3, 18.<BR> 4. To make, Pañc. 44, 16; to perform, Rājat. 4, 364.<BR> 5. To endeavour, MBh. 3, 14702.<BR> 6. To touch, MBh. 4, 637.<BR> II., also i. 10, Par. घाटय,<BR> 1. (cf. उद्, परि), To injure.<BR> 2. † To shine or speak.<BR> --With the prep. व्या वि-आ, व्याघटित, Returned (?), Lass. 22, 9.<BR> --With उद् उद्, Caus. घाटय,<BR> 1. To open, Mṛcch. 80, 7.<BR> 2. To discover (as a secret), Pañc. 184, 16.<BR> 3. To begin, Hit. iv. d. 2.<BR> 4. To tickle, Suśr. 2, 370, 2.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass.<BR> 1. उद्घाटित, Rājat. 2, 100.<BR> 2. उद्घटित, Kūmar. 7, 53.<BR> --With परि परि, Caus. घाटय, To strike, to sound, Mṛcch. 11, 4 (v. r.).<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To burst, to crumble down, Prab. 8, 11.<BR> 2. To become interrupted, Hit. iv. d. 2.<BR> --Caus. घटय,<BR> 1. To tear, Prab. 116, 3.<BR> 2. To ruin, Hit. ii. d. 157.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To assemble, Rājat. 6, 242.<BR> --Caus. घटय,<BR> 1. To strike, to sound, Rām. 2, 71, 26.<BR> 2. To collect, Rājat. 5, 326.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुघटित
सु- + घटित सु- + घटित, adj.<BR> 1. well joined.<BR> 2. well-contrived or managed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट|घटः
घट घट् + अ, m.<BR> I. adj. Active, Pañc. ii. d. 74.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A jar, Man. 11, 183 (184).<BR> 2. The Aquarius of the zodiac, Mārk. P. 12, 22 (change घटी to घटः).<BR> III. f. टा,<BR> 1. A multitude, Bhāg. P. 3, 17, 6.<BR> 2. A troop of elephants assembled for martial purposes, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a " target="_blank">Page0282-a + 42</a>] Rājat. 1, 369.<BR> IV. f. टी, A jar, Prab. 22, 18.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्घट
दुस्- + घट दुस्- + घट, adj. difficult, Rājat. 4, 364.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0281-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटक|घटकः
घटक घट् + अक, adj. Striving, Bhartṛ. 2, 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटन|घटनं
घटन घट् + अन, n. and f. ना,<BR> 1. Striving, Pañc. i. d. 175.<BR> 2. Exertion, Śāntiś. 2, 20.<BR> 3. Junction, Vikr. d. 34, v. r.; Kathās. 24, 231.<BR> 4. Composition, Lass. 68, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिका
घटिका घटिका, i. e. घटी + क, f.<BR> 1. A jar, Pañc. i. d. 206; a bucket, Mṛcch. 178, 7.<BR> 2. A मुहूर्त, or thirtieth part of a day and night, Bhāg. P. 5, 21, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्ट्
घट्ट् घट्ट् (probably a denominative derived from a dialectical form of घृष्ट, vb. घृष्, based on the original घर्ष्ट), i. 1, Ātm. and i. 10 Par., घट्टय,<BR> 1. To slip over, to touch, Suśr. 2, 28, 4.<BR> 2. To stir, MBh. 7, 7742.<BR> 3. To shake, MBh. 7, 9401.<BR> 4. To churn, Suśr. 2, 88, 19.<BR> --With अव अव, घट्टय,<BR> 1. To push away, Rām. 5, 15, 10.<BR> 2. To touch, MBh. 11, 462.<BR> 3. To besmear, Suśr. 1, 42, 17.<BR> 4. To churn, Suśr. 1, 33, 4. अवघट्टित, n. Butting at each other, Hariv. 4720.<BR> --With परि परि, घट्टय, To rub, Śiś. 9, 64.<BR> --With वि वि, घट्टय, To open, MBh. 2, 1674. विघट्टित,<BR> 1. Dispersed, Bhartṛ. 3, 36.<BR> 2. Churned, Suśr. 1, 32, 19.<BR> 3. Shaken, Kumāras. 1, 9.<BR> 4. Hurt, Suśr. 1, 71, 18.<BR> 5. Severed, Ṛt. 3, 8.<BR> 6. Disclosed, MBh. 4, 1494.<BR> --With सम् सम्, घट्ट्, To grind, Rām. 6, 68, 30. घट्टय,<BR> 1. To rub, Ragh. 6, 73.<BR> 2. To stir, MBh. 7, 8584.<BR> 3. To collect, MBh. 7, 3512.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्टन|घट्टनं
घट्टन घट्ट् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Scratching, Rām. 6, 98, 25.<BR> 2. Touching, Hariv. 14581.<BR> 3. Churning, Mārk. P. 12, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्टितृ
घट्टितृ घट्ट्-इतृ, m. One who strives, MBh. 3, 5890.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्
† घण् घण्, ii. 8, Par., Ātm. To shine (v. r.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्ट्|घंट्
† घण्ट् घण्ट्, i. 1, and 10, Par. To shine, or speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्ट|घंट|घण्टः
घण्ट घण्ट (akin to हन्),<BR> I. adj., f. टी, Sounding (?), MBh. 12, 10377; 4, 188.<BR> II. f. टा, A bell, Man. 10, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्टावन्त्|घण्टावत्
घण्टावन्त् घण्टा + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Having a bell or bells, Bhāg. P. 8, 11, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्टिन्|घंटिन्
घण्टिन् घण्टिन्, i. e. घण्टा + इन्, adj. Having bells (?), MBh. 12, 10377.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घन|घनं|घनः
घन घन, i. e. हन् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. ना,<BR> 1. Firm, hard, Bhartṛ. 1, 17.<BR> 2. Without interstices, Suśr. 1, 29, 8.<BR> 3. Uninterrupted, Pañc. iii. d. 237.<BR> 4. Dense, Pañc. iii. d. 188; 129, 8.<BR> 5. As latter part of a compound adj., sometimes Full, Ragh. 8, 90.<BR> 6. Dusk, Bhāg. P. 4, 5, 3.<BR> 7. Deep (as a sound), MBh. 1, 6680; Rājat. 5, 377.<BR> 8. Whole, Upak. 24.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A solid mass, substance, Vedāntas. in Chr. 211, 9.<BR> 2. A heap, Rām. 5, 16, 55.<BR> 3. A cloud, Megh. 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सघन
स- + घन स- + घन, adj. dense, Pañc. 141, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तम्बघन|स्तंबघन|स्तम्बघनः
स्तम्ब- + घन स्तम्ब- + घन, m. 1. a small hoe for weeding. 2. A sickle. 3. A basket for the heads of wild rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घनता
घनता घन + ता, f. Solidity, Śiś. 9, 64 (˚तां नयति श्रवणम्, She makes her ear solid, i. e. she fills up its opening so that no empty space remains).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घनाघन|घनाघनः
घनाघन घनाघन (from घनाघन्, an old frequent. of हन्, by the aff. अ),<BR> I. adj., f. ना, Warlike, MBh. 8, 697.<BR> II. m. A rainy cloud, Bhāg. P. 5, 24, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घम्ब्|घंब्
† घम्ब् घम्ब् i. 1, Ātm. To move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0282-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घर|घर्घरः
घर्घर घर्घर (based on an imitative sound), m. An inarticulate sound, rattling, Rājat. 2, 99; gurgling, Kathās. 25, 66 (perhaps adj.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरित|घर्घरितं
घर्घरित घर्घरित, i. e. घर्घर + इत, n. Grunting, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्ब्
† घर्ब् घर्ब्, i. 1, Par. To move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्म|घर्मः|घर्म्म|घर्म्मः
घर्म घर्म, i. e. घृ + म, m.<BR> 1. Heat, Pañc. 80, 7.<BR> 2. The hot season, Rām. 1, 63, 24.<BR> --Cf. θερμός; Lat. formus (Fest.). feumentum; O.H.G. waram; A.S. wearm; and घ्रि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्ष|घर्षः
घर्ष घर्ष, i. e. घृष् + अ, m. Dashing together, Rām. 2, 54, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्षण|घर्षणं
घर्षण घर्षण, i. e. घृष् + अन, n. Grinding, rubbing into, Suśr. 2, 329, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्
घस् घस्, ii. 2, Par. and † i. 1, Par. To devour.<BR> --Desider. जिघत्स, To desire to devour, MBh. 2, 1485.<BR> --Cf. Lat. gânea, ganeo; perhaps Goth. gasts; A.S. gest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस|घसः
घस घस् + अ, m. The name of a Rākṣasa, Rām. 5, 12, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्मर|घस्मरः
घस्मर घस्मर, i. e. घस् + मन् + अ, adj. Voracious, MBh. 8, 1856.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटिका
घाटिका घाटिका, Pañc. 209, 24; 211, 24; 212, 4 = घटिका, which is probably to be read.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाण्टिक|घांटिक|घांटिकः|घाण्टिकः
घाण्टिक घाण्टिक, i. e. घण्टा + इक, m. A bard who sings in honour of the gods, and rings a bell before their images, MBh. 13, 6028.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घात|घातः
घात घात् + अ, i. e. हन्, Caus., + अ,<BR> I. Latter part of comp. adj., Killing.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A stroke, Rām. 6, 98, 23.<BR> 2. A shot, Chr. 35, 4.<BR> 3. Killing, Pañc. i. d. 321.<BR> 4. Sacking, Man. 9, 274.<BR> 5. Spoiling, Yājñ. 2, 159.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्तघात|दन्तघातः
दन्त- + घात दन्त- + घात, m. 1. bite, Sāh. D. 25, 12. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b " target="_blank">Page0283-b + 40</a>] 2. a proper name, Lass. 8, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वासघात|विश्वासघातः
विश्वास- + घात विश्वास- + घात, m. perfidy, treachery, Pañc. 101, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूलघात
स-मूल- + घात स-मूल- + घात, m. utter destruction or eradication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातक|घातकः
घातक घातक, i. e. हन्, Caus., + अक, adj. and s., f. की.<BR> 1. A murderer, Man. 5, 51; Lass. 12, 12.<BR> 2. Destroying, MBh. 3, 1277.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वासघातक|विश्वासघातकः
विश्वास- + घातक विश्वास- + घातक, m. a traitor, Pañc. 52, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातन|घातनं|घातनः
घातन घातन, i. e. हन्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. n. Killing, MBh. 2, 1558.<BR> II. f. नी, A club, Rām. 6, 37, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिन्
घातिन् घातिन्, i. e. हन्, Caus., + इन्, adj. and s., f. नी.<BR> 1. Killing, MBh. 3, 17198; a murderer, Man. 8, 89.<BR> 2. Destroying, MBh. 3, 63.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मघातिन्
आत्मघातिन् आत्मघातिन्, i. e. आत्मन्-, m. a felo-de-se, Yājñ. 3, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालघातिन्
काल- + घातिन् काल- + घातिन्, adj. killing slowly, Suśr. 2, 252, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामघातिन्
ग्राम- + घातिन् ग्राम- + घातिन्, adj. sacking a village, MBh. 12, 1213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृघातिन्
पितृ- + घातिन् पितृ- + घातिन्, m. a parricide, Rājat. 5, 448.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वासघातिन्
विश्वास- + घातिन् विश्वास- + घातिन्, adj. perfidious, MBh. 3, 625.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घार्तिक|घार्तिकः|घार्त्तिक|घार्त्तिकः
घार्तिक घार्तिक, i. e. घृत + इक, m. A cake fried with clarified butter, Pañc. 194, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घास|घासः
घास घास, i. e. घस् + अ, m. Food, Pañc. 215, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वघास|अश्वघासः
अश्व- + घास अश्व- + घास, m. 1. food for horses, Rājat. 3, 489. 2. Pastureground for horses, Kathās. 15, 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घिण्ण्
† घिण्ण् घिण्ण् (a dialectical form of गृह्ण् from गृह्णा, vb. ग्रह्; cf. घृण्ण्), i. 1, Ātm. To take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घु|घुः
† घु घु, i. 1, Ātm. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुंष्
† घुंष् घुंष्, i. 1, Ātm. To render beautiful.<BR> --Cf. घंष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुट्
घुट् घुट्, i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To resist.<BR> 2. To protect (v. r.).<BR> --i. 1, Ātm. To return.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, अवघोटित, Covered, MBh. 3, 13155.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ, To turn, Pañc. 36, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0283-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुड्
† घुड् घुड्, i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To hinder.<BR> 2. To protect, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्
† घुण् घुण् (a dialectical form of घूर्ण्), i. 1, Ātm., i. 6, Par. To whirl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण|घुणः
घुण घुण, m. A wood-worm, Suśr. 1, 29, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्ण्
† घुण्ण् घुण्ण् (like घिण्ण्, a dialectical form of गृह्ण्, vb. ग्रह्), i. 1, Ātm. To take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्
† घुर् घुर्. i. 6, Par.<BR> 1. To be frightful.<BR> 2. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुरघुराय
घुरघुराय घुरघुराय (a denomin. based on an imitative sound), Ātm. To rattle in the throat, Bhāg. P. 3, 30, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्घुराय
घुर्घुराय घुर्घुराय (a denomin. based on an imitative sound), Ātm. To whistle, Suśr. 1, 104, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष्
घुष् घुष्, i. 1, Par. (Ātm. Rām. 5, 56, 139), To proclaim, Rām. 1, 1, 4. 10, 12.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass., घुष्ट,<BR> 1. Loud, MBh. 13, 4557.<BR> 2. Resounding, Hariv. 1125.<BR> 3. Offered, Man. 4, 209.<BR> --Caus. घोषय, To proclaim, Rām. 5, 49, 13.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To proclaim, Hariv. 3522. अवघुष्ट,<BR> 1. Summoned, Rām. 3, 47, 9.<BR> 2. Resounding, MBh. 13, 522.<BR> 3. Offered, MBh. 13, 1576.<BR> --With आ आ, To proclaim, MBh. 3, 647.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ, व्याघुष्ट, Loud sounding, MBh. 12, 3637.<BR> --Caus. To proclaim loud, Hariv. 10542.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To cry, MBh. 12, 5349. उद्घुष्ट, Resounding, Rām. 3, 79, 45.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To cause to be sounded loud, Rājat. 3, 5.<BR> 2. To proclaim, Mṛcch. 169, 8.<BR> --With प्रोद् प्र-उद्, प्रोद्घुष्ट, Resounding, MBh. 3, 2512.<BR> --Caus. To proclaim, Rājat. 1, 285. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b " target="_blank">Page0284-b + 40</a>]<BR> --With उप उप, उपघुष्ट, Resounding, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 28.<BR> --With प्र प्र, Caus. To proclaim, MBh. 12, 2645.<BR> --With वि वि, To proclaim, Man. 8, 233. विघुष्ट, Resounding, Rām. 3, 12, 14.<BR> --With उद्वि उद्-वि, Caus. To proclaim, Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 66.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संघुष्ट,<BR> 1. Sounding, Hariv. 3715.<BR> 2. Resounding, Rām. 2, 31, 4.<BR> 3. Offered, Yājñ. 1, 168.<BR> --With परिसम् परि-सम्, परिसंघुष्ट, Resounding, MBh. 3, 2406.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्
† घूर् घूर्, i. 4, Ātm.<BR> 1. To kill.<BR> 2. To become old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्ण्
घूर्ण् घूर्ण्, (a dialectical form of ह्वृण् in ह्वृणा, ii. 9, of ह्वृ, based on the original ह्वर्णा), i. 6, Par.; i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To reel, MBh. 10, 802.<BR> 2. To move to and fro, MBh. 1, 2133.<BR> 3. To roll (as the eye), Prab. 6, 5.<BR> 4. To be uncertain, MBh. 1, 2061.<BR> --Caus. घूर्णय,<BR> 1. To roll, Bhartṛ. 1, 88.<BR> --With अव अव, To roll, Daśak. in Chr. 194, 12. अवघूर्णित, Cast down, MBh. 9, 3239.<BR> --With आ आ, To wave, Mṛcch. 85, 16. आघूर्णित,<BR> 1. Shaken, Dev. 12, 26.<BR> 2. Rolling, Bhāg. P. 6, 1, 59.<BR> --With व्या वि-आ, To flutter, MBh. 7, 7301. व्याघूर्णित,<BR> 1. Shaken, MBh. 5, 7191.<BR> 2. Tottering, MBh. 2, 1673.<BR> --With परि परि, To be agitated, MBh. 1, 2089.<BR> --With वि वि, To stagger, MBh. 11, 522; to shake, 3, 11141. विघूर्णित, Revolved, Bhāg. P. 3, 19, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्ण|घूर्णः|घूर्ण्ण
घूर्ण घूर्ण् + अ, adj., f. णा, Vacillating, Bhāg. P. 7, 2, 2.<BR> 2. Shaken, Bhāg. P. 9, 10, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरघूर्ण
तिमिर- + घूर्ण तिमिर- + घूर्ण (corr. perhaps तिमिरे-), adj. staggering in dimness, Cāṇ. 70, Berl. Monatsb. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a " target="_blank">Page0285-a + 39</a>] 1864, 411.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाघूर्णा
महा- + घूर्णा महा- + घूर्ण, f. णा, Spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0284-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णन|घूर्णनं|घूर्ण्णन
घूर्णन घूर्ण् + अन, n. and f. णा, Trembling oscillation, Gīt. 9, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृ
1. घृ घृ, i. 1, ii. 3, जिघृ, and i. 10, Par. To sprinkle.<BR> --Cf. घृत separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृ
† 2. घृ घृ, ii. 3, जिघृ, Par. To shine.<BR> --Cf. χλιαίνω, etc.; θέρος, θέρω, θάλπω; Lat. fervor, fornax, and घर्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृ
† 3. घृ घृ, i. 10, Par. To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृण्
† घृण् घृण्, ii. 8, घृनु, and घर्णु, Par. To shine.<BR> --Cf. 2. घृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणा
घृणा घृणा, i. e. probably 2. घृ + ण, f.<BR> 1. Compassion, Rām. 1, 27, 16.<BR> 2. Contempt, Naiṣ. 1, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घृण
निर्घृण निर्घृण, i. e. निस्-, adj., f. णा, cruel, Rām. 1, 32, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सनिर्घृण
स-निस्- + घृण स-निस्- + घृण, adj. The same, 1, 61, 20, Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणालु
घृणालु घृणा + लु, adj. Compassionate, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणि|घृणिः
घृणि घृणि (akin to घृणा), adj. Disagreeable, Hariv. 3588.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणित्व
घृणित्व घृणित्व, i. e. घृणिन् + त्व, n. Compassion, MBh. 3, 1119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणिन्
घृणिन् घृणिन्, i. e. घृणा + इन्, adj., f. नी, Compassionate, Pañc. i. d. 472.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघृणिन्
अ- + घृणिन् अ- + घृणिन्, adj. Not despising, MBh. 1, 6374.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृण्ण्
† घृण्ण् घृण्ण् (a dialectical form of गृह्ण्, vb. ग्रह्, cf. घिण्ण्), i. 1, Ātm. To take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृत|घृतः
घृत घृ + त (properly ptcple. of the pf. pass. of 1. घृ), n.<BR> 1. Clarified butter, or butter which has been boiled gently and allowed to cool, Man. 11, 134.<BR> 2. (ved.) Rain, Chr. 291, 3 = Rigv. i. 85, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतवन्त्|घृतवत्
घृतवन्त् घृत + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b " target="_blank">Page0285-b + 38</a>] Abundant in butter, Chr. 290, 6 = Rigv. i. 64, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृताची
घृताची घृताची, i. e. घृत-अञ्च् + इ, f. The name of an Apsaras, MBh. 1, 4821.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतिन्
घृतिन् घृतिन्, i. e. घृत + इन्, adj., f. नी, Containing ghṛta, MBh. 13, 1840.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृष्
घृष् घृष्, i. 1, Par. To grind, Pañc. i. d. 160. घृष्ट,<BR> 1. Pounded, Pañc. iii. d. 240.<BR> 2. Scratched, Hariv. 12175.<BR> 3. Rubbed into, Suśr. 2, 278, 7.<BR> --Caus. घर्षित, Crumbled, Rām. 3, 79, 31.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव, To rub off, Pañc. i. d. 337.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. The same, Suśr. 1, 344, 6.<BR> 2. To rub into, 1, 46, 12.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To rub out, Ragh. 17, 28.<BR> 2. To strike, Rājat. 2, 99.<BR> --With नि नि, To grind, MBh. 8, 1797. निघृष्ट, Subdued, MBh. 12, 7318.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To rub, Rām. 2, 96, 18.<BR> --With परि परि, To grind, Hariv. 5362.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To rub into, Suśr. 2, 193, 3.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, The same, Suśr. 2, 67, 2.<BR> --With वि वि, विघृष्ट,<BR> 1. Ground.<BR> 2. Sore, 2, 129, 6.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To rub, Bhāg. P. 4, 6, 30; MBh. 1, 1133 (घृष्य, pass. with the terminations of the Par.).<BR> 2. To rival, Ragh. 19, 36.<BR> --Cf. χρίω, χρῖσμα, etc., χρίμπτω; Lat. frio, frico; O.H.G. and A.S., hrinan, to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृषु
घृषु घृषु, i. e. ved. घृष् = कृष् + उ, adj. Brisk, Chr. 291, 12 = Rigv. i. 64, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृष्वि|घृष्विः
घृष्वि घृष्वि, i. e. ved. घृष् = हृष् + वि, adj. Brisk, Chr. 291, 1 = Rigv i. 85, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0285-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोटक|घोटकः
घोटक घोटक, m. A horse, Pañc. 254, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोणा
घोणा घोणा (a dialectical form of घ्राणा), f.<BR> 1. The nose. Mṛcch. 35, 10.<BR> 2. The nostrils of a horse, MBh. 6, 3390.<BR> 3. A beak, MBh. 10, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोण्टा|घोंटा
घोण्टा घोण्टा, f. The betel-nut tree, Suśr. 2, 103, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोर|घोरं|घोरः
घोर घोर,<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Horrible, dreadful, Rām. 3, 8, 12.<BR> 2. Violent, Suśr. 1, 35, 7.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A name of Śiva, MBh. 12, 10375.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 13, 4148.<BR> III. n. A horrible act, Rām. 1, 58, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. probably Goth. gaurs, sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुघोर
सु- + घोर सु- + घोर, adj. terrific, hideous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोरत्व
घोरत्व घोर + त्व, n. Horribleness, MBh. 3, 13781.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोष|घोषं|घोषः
घोष घोष, i. e. घुष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Sound, Man. 7, 225; roar, Rām. 2, 66, 10; language, Rām. 3, 52, 20.<BR> 2. A station of herdsmen, MBh. 2, 215.<BR> 3. A name of Śiva, MBh. 12, 10386.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दमघोष|दमघोषः
दम- + घोष दम- + घोष, m. a proper name, MBh. 1, 7029.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नन्दिघोष|नंदिघोष|नन्दिघोषः
नन्दि- + घोष नन्दि- + घोष, m. shout, MBh. 13, 5288.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाघोष|महाघोषं|महाघोषः
महा- + घोष महा- + घोष, n. a market.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंहघोष
सिंह- + घोष सिंह- + घोष, m. a proper name, Daśak. in Chr. 199, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखपुण्याहघोष
सुखपुण्याह- + घोष सुखपुण्याह- + घोष, i. e. सुख-पुण्य-अह-, m. the proclamation of a happy holiday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्त्रीघोष|स्त्रीघोषः
स्त्री- + घोष स्त्री- + घोष, m. day-break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषक|घोषकः
घोषक घोषक, i. e. घुष् + अक, m. A bell-man, Kathās. 24, 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषण|घोषणं
घोषण घोषण, i. e. घुष् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Causing to sound, Bhāg. P. 4, 5, 6.<BR> II. n., and f. णा, Proclaiming, Rām. 5, 58, 18; Daśak. in Chr. 183, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषवन्त्|घोषवत्
घोषवन्त् घोष + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj. वती, Sounding, MBh. 2, 65; roaring, MBh. 6, 578.<BR> II. f. वती, A kind of lute (?), Kathās. 12, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषिन्
घोषिन् घोषिन्, i. e. घोष + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Sounding, MBh. 5, 3348.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्न
ऽघ्न -घ्न, i. e. हन् + अ, Latter part of comp. adj. and 8., f. नी (ना, MBh. 13, 2397),<BR> 1. Striking, Man. 8, 386.<BR> 2. Killing, a murderer, Man. 9, 232.<BR> 3. Destroying, Man. 8, 127; Rām. 2, 35, 6.<BR> 4. Removing, Man. 7, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्रा
घ्रा घ्रा, i. 1, जिघ्र (ep. ii. 2, घ्राति, MBh. 14, 668), Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., MBh. 1, 7982).<BR> 1. To smell, Man. 2, 98.<BR> 2. To sniff at, Rām. 2, 26, 35.<BR> 3. To perceive, Bhāg. P. 1, 3, 36.<BR> 4. To kiss (or, rather, To smell as a token of affection; see Wilson, Hindu Dr. vol. i. p. 45 n.), MBh. 9, 2940. Anomalous ptcple. of the pres. जिघ्राण, MBh. 1, 5781.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. घ्रात, also in the sense of an act, Having scented.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass.<BR> 1. घ्रातव्य, n. Smell, Bhartṛ. 1, 7.<BR> 2. घ्रेय, n. Smell, MBh. 2, 200.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. अव अव,<BR> 1. To smell, Man. 3, 218.<BR> 2. To kiss, Rām. 2, 20, 21.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To smell, Man. 11, 149.<BR> 2. To kiss, Rām. 2, 70, 16.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. आघ्रात, in active sense, Hariv. 4478.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ,<BR> 1. To smell, MBh. 3, 14504.<BR> 2. To kiss, Rām. 1, 4, 9.<BR> --With समुपा सम्-उप-आ, To kiss, Rām. 2, 72, 4.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ,<BR> 1. To smell, Rām. 5, 23, 32.<BR> 2. To kiss, Rām. 2, 72, 4.<BR> --With उप उप,<BR> 1. To smell, MBh. 5, 4059; to smell at, Man. 4, 209.<BR> 2. To kiss, Rām. 2, 72, 30.<BR> --With समुप सम्-उप, To kiss, Rām. 4, 22, 1.<BR> --With परि परि, To kiss all over, MBh. 11, 616.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To trace, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 28.<BR> 2. To smell, Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 18.<BR> --Cf. βρῶμος and घ्राण; perhaps also Lat. frâgro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघ्रा
अ- + घ्रा अ- + घ्रा, adj. unfit to be smelt, Man. 11, 67. Anomalous absolut. जिघृत्वा, Hariv. 7059.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0286-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्राण|घ्राणं|घ्राणः
घ्राण घ्राण, i. e. घ्रा + न,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Smelling, Bhāg. P. 2, 1, 29.<BR> II. n. and f. णा, The nose, MBh. 1, 6074.<BR> --Cf. ῥῑ́ν, ῥῑ́ς.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्राणज
घ्राणज घ्राण-ज, adj. Produced by the nose, Bhāṣāp. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्राति|घ्रातिः
घ्राति घ्रा + ति, f. Smelling, Man. 11, 67 (68).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्रातृ
घ्रातृ घ्रा-तृ, m. One who smells, MBh. 14, 619.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ङु
† ङु ङु, i. 1, Ātm. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च|चः
च च,<BR> I. A copulative particle, And. Where two things are to be joined, it is,<BR> 1. Repeated, च--च (like τε--τε; Lat. que--que), As well--As, and, संजीवयति चाजस्रं प्रमापयति चाव्ययः, That immutable power revivifies as well as destroys in eternal succession, Man. 1, 57; दश चाष्टौ च, Ten and eight, Man. 1, 64.<BR> 2. Dropped in the first place; this is the general use, Hit. i. d. 33.<BR> 3. Dropped, but not often, in the second place, e. g. प्रेत्य चेह, In the next world and in this, Man. 3, 20. Where more than two things are to be joined, some have the conjunction, while others are without it, e. g. कर्णौ चर्म च बालांश् च वस्तिं स्नायुं च रोचनाम्, (let him carry) their ears, their hides, their tails, the skin below their navels, their tendons, and the liquor exuding from their foreheads, Man. 8, 234.<BR> II. When followed by वा, Either, Man. 12, 89; when preceded by वा, Or, Nal. 14, 8.<BR> III. Even, Śāk. 6, 5; and even, Hiḍ. i. 26. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b " target="_blank">Page0287-b + 43</a>]<BR> IV. Just, Ragh. 12, 45.<BR> V. But, Hit. Pr. d. 12.<BR> VI. If, Bhartṛ. 2, 45.<BR> --Cf. τε; Lat. que; Goth. -h, e. g. in sa-h, ‘and he.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्
चक् चक्, i. 1, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. † To be satisfied.<BR> 2. † To resist.<BR> 3. To shine. चकित,<BR> 1. Frightened, Bhartṛ. 3, 10.<BR> 2. Timid, Bhāg. P. 5, 8, 18. n. Being frightened, Mṛcch. 86, 20.<BR> --With the prep. उद् उद्, To see, Bhāg. P. 6, 16, 48.<BR> --With प्र प्र, प्रचकित, Frightened, Pañc. i. d. 420.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चकास्
चकास् चकास् (cf. काश्), ii. 2, Par. To shine, Bhāg. P. 5, 24, 9 (with श् instead of स्, Bhāg. P. 3, 19, 14).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चकोर|चकोरः
चकोर चकोर, m. The Greek partridge. Perdix rufa, MBh. 3, 936.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्क्
† चक्क् चक्क्, i. 10, Par. To give pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्नस|चक्नसः
चक्नस चक्नस, Lass. 4, 17, is to be changed to चक्र-सं (कुलम्)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्र|चक्रं|चक्रः
चक्र चक्र,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. A wheel, Man. 8, 291.<BR> 2. A potter's wheel, Yājñ. 3, 146.<BR> 3. A discus, or sharp circular missile weapon, especially of Viṣṇu, Rām. 1, 29, 6.<BR> 4. An oil-press, Man. 4, 84.<BR> 5. A circle, Rājat. 5, 230.<BR> 6. A form of military array, a circular position.<BR> 7. An astrological or mystical figure, Rājat. 5, 55 (मातृ-).<BR> 8. A multitude, Rām. 6, 75, 39.<BR> 9. An army, MBh. 5, 1939.<BR> 10. Dominion, Bhāg. P. 9, 20, 32.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. The ruddy goose, Anas casarca, MBh. 9, 443.<BR> 2. The name of a people, MBh. 6, 352.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2147.<BR> 4. The name of a mountain, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचक्र|एकचक्रं|एकचक्रः
एक- + चक्र एक- + चक्र,<BR> I. adj., f. रा, protected by one sovereign, Bhāg. P. 3, 1, 20.<BR> II. m. a proper name, MBh. 1, 2533.<BR> III. f. का, the name of a town, MBh. 1, 382.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालचक्र|कालचक्रं|कालचक्रः
काल- + चक्र काल- + चक्र,<BR> I. n. the wheel of ever-revolving time, MBh. 4, 1607. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a " target="_blank">Page0288-a + 43</a>]<BR> II. m. the sun, MBh. 3, 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्चक्र
दिक्चक्र दिक्चक्र, i. e. दिश्-, n. the real horizon, Lass. 74, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मचक्र|धर्मचक्रः|धर्म्मचक्र|धर्म्मचक्रः
धर्म- + चक्र धर्म- + चक्र, n. the law, MBh. 2, 456.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परचक्र
पर- + चक्र पर- + चक्र, n. the host of the enemy, MBh. 1, 6209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृचक्र
मातृ- + चक्र मातृ- + चक्र (see<BR> 7.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशिचक्र|राशिचक्रं
राशि- + चक्र राशि- + चक्र, n. the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यचक्र
हिरण्य- + चक्र हिरण्य- + चक्र, adj. having golden wheels, Chr. 294, 5 = Rigv. i. 88, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0287-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रक|चक्रकः
चक्रक चक्र + क, m.<BR> 1. A kind of snake, Suśr. 2, 265, 17.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 13, 253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रधर|चक्रधरः
चक्रधर चक्र-धर,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Bearing a wheel, Pañc. 242, 15.<BR> 2. Bearing a discus.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A name of Viṣṇu (wielding the discus) Mṛcch. 76, 13.<BR> 2. A sovereign, MBh. 3, 8221.<BR> 3. A snake, Rājat. 1, 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रबाल|चक्रबालः
चक्रबाल चक्र-बाल, and चक्रवाल चक्र-वाल (cf. वालक, A finger ring).<BR> I. (m. or n.) A ring, MBh. 1, 7021.<BR> II. m. A range of mountains supposed to encircle the earth, and to be the limit of light and darkness.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. A circle, Bhāg. P. 5, 18, 14.<BR> 2. A group, Bhartṛ. 2, 65.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डचक्रबाल
दण्ड- + चक्रबाल दण्ड- + चक्रबाल, m. 1. the name of a fabulous weapon, Rām. 1, 29, 5. 2. A division of an army, Mālav. 9, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्चक्रबाल
दिश्- + चक्रबाल दिश्- + चक्रबाल, n. the horizon, Lass. 74, 1. 2. A compass card, Varāh. Bṛh. S. 86, 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समातृचक्रबाल
स-मातृ- + चक्रबाल स-मातृ- + चक्रबाल, adj. surrounded by the divine mothers, Rājat. 5, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवर्तिता
चक्रवर्तिता चक्रवर्तिता, and चक्रवर्तित्व चक्रवर्तित्व, i. e. चक्र-रर्तिन् + ता, f., or + त्व, n. Sovereign dominion, Daśak. 185, ult.; Hariv. 8815.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवाक|चक्रवाकः
चक्रवाक चक्रवाक, i. e. चक्र (based on an imitative sound) -वच् + अ,<BR> I. m. The ruddy goose, Anas casarca Gm., Rām. 3, 20, 20.<BR> II. f. की, Its female, Megh. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवाकिन्
चक्रवाकिन् चक्रवाकिन्, i. e. चक्रवाक + इन्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b " target="_blank">Page0288-b + 40</a>] adj., f. नी, Crowded with ruddy geese, Ragh. 15, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवाल|चक्रवालं|चक्रवालः
चक्रवाल चक्रवाल, see चक्रबाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्राङ्किता
चक्राङ्किता चक्राङ्किता, i. e. चक्र-अङ्किता (vb. अङ्क्), f. The name of a plant (?), Pañc. 157, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्राङ्ग|चक्रांग|चक्राङ्गः
चक्राङ्ग चक्राङ्ग, i. e. चक्र-अङ्ग, m. A goose, MBh. 8, 1895; Man. 5, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिका
चक्रिका चक्रिका, i. e. चक्र + क, f.<BR> 1. A troop, Rājat. 4, 376.<BR> 2. Artifice, Rājat. 5, 279.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिन्
चक्रिन् चक्रिन्, i. e. चक्र + इन्,<BR> I. adj. Driving in a carriage, Man. 2, 138.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A name of Viṣṇu, Bhag. 11, 17.<BR> 2. A name of Śiva, MBh. 13, 745.<BR> 3. An oil-grinder, Yājñ. 1, 141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्ष्
चक्ष् चक्ष् (akin to अक्षि), ii. 2, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 3, 601),<BR> 1. To see, Bhāg. P. 5, 7, 13.<BR> 2. To perceive, Bhāg. P. 1, 18, 25.<BR> 3. To say, MBh. 8, 3384 (Par.).<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To look at, Chr. 294, 9 = Rigv. i. 92, 9 (अभिचक्ष्या, absol. with lengthened final); Bhāg. P. 4, 8, 18.<BR> 2. To address, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 5.<BR> 3. To name, Bhāg. P. 3, 12, 51.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. To declare, Man. 4, 81.<BR> 2. To address, Daśak. in Chr. 189, 2.<BR> 3. To name, Bhāg. P. 5, 22, 6.<BR> --With अभ्या अभि-आ,<BR> 1. To look at, Bhāg. P. 1, 9, 11.<BR> 2. To speak, Bhāg. P. 8, 5, 14.<BR> --With प्रत्या प्रति-आ,<BR> 1. To decline, MBh. 12, 6676.<BR> 2. To repulse, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 6.<BR> 3. To answer (with acc. of the person), Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 11.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To report, Bhāg. P. 1, 4, 13.<BR> --With परि परि, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a " target="_blank">Page0289-a + 41</a>]<BR> 1. To overlook, Bhāg. P. 4, 14, 33.<BR> 2. To report, MBh. 1, 1025.<BR> 3. To mention, admit, MBh. 12, 294.<BR> 4. To call, Man. 2, 171.<BR> 5. To answer (with acc.), Bhāg. P. 1, 17, 21.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To report, MBh. 1, 8331.<BR> 2. To declare, Man. 4, 102.<BR> 3. To call, Man. 2, 59.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To explain, Suśr. 1, 37, 13.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति,<BR> 1. To perceive, Bhāg. P. 3, 9, 32.<BR> 2. To expect, Bhāg. P. 9, 4, 41.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To see clearly, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 17.<BR> 2. To explain, MBh. 1, 2199.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, To call, MBh. 12, 11466.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To look at, Bhāg. P. 3, 19, 8.<BR> 2. To consider, Rām. 2, 1, 27.<BR> 3. To report, MBh. 6, 253.<BR> --Cf. παπταίνω (properly a denominative of a lost noun, *παπταν = ved. चक्षन्), also ὀπιπτεύω, ὀπίπης; probably Goth. saihvan; A.S. sean; Goth. siuns (for organ. sihvni + s); O.H.G. sagên; A.S. saegan, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0288-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षस्
चक्षस् चक्ष् + अस्, n. The eye, Chr. 295, 11 = Rigv. i. 92, 11.<BR> 2. Guidance, Chr. 293, 5 = Rigv. i. 87, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वचक्षस्
विश्व- + चक्षस् विश्व- + चक्षस्, adj. all-seeing, Chr. 289, 2 = Rigv. i. 50, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष
ऽचक्षुष -चक्षुष, i. e. चक्षुस् + अ, A substitute for चक्षुस्, when latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. स-, adj. Seeing, MBh. 1, 6818.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्मत्ता
चक्षुष्मत्ता चक्षुष्मत्ता, i. e. चक्षुष्मन्त् + ता, f. The faculty of seeing, Ragh. 4, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्मन्त्|चक्षुष्मत्
चक्षुष्मन्त् चक्षुष्मन्त्, i. e. चक्षुस् + मन्त्, adj., f. मती.<BR> 1. Seeing, MBh. 1, 737.<BR> 2. Having eyes, Bhāg. P. 3, 23, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्य|चक्षुष्यं|चक्षुष्यः
चक्षुष्य चक्षुष्य, i. e. चक्षुस् + य, adj., f. या.<BR> 1. Fit for the eyes, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b " target="_blank">Page0289-b + 42</a>] MBh. 13, 3423.<BR> 2. Agreeable to the eyes, Rājat. 3, 493.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुस्
चक्षुस् चक्ष् + उस्, n. The eye, Indr. 4, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचक्षुस्
अ- + चक्षुस् अ- + चक्षुस्, adj. blind, Pañc. i. d. 393.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ्राणचक्षुस्
घ्राण- + चक्षुस् घ्राण- + चक्षुस्, adj. using his nose instead of his eye, blind, MBh. 8, 3443.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारचक्षुस्
चार- + चक्षुस् चार- + चक्षुस्, adj. seeing by means of spies, Man. 9, 256.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जनचक्षुस्
जन- + चक्षुस् जन- + चक्षुस्, n. the eye of all creatures, i. e. the sun, Hariv. 8050.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानचक्षुस्
ज्ञान- + चक्षुस् ज्ञान- + चक्षुस्, n. intellect, Man. 2, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिव्यचक्षुस्
दिव्य- + चक्षुस् दिव्य- + चक्षुस्,<BR> I. n. a divine, i. e. a prophetic eye, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 7.<BR> II. adj. having a divine eye, Ragh. 3, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मचक्षुस्
धर्म- + चक्षुस् धर्म- + चक्षुस्, adj. loving justice, Rām. 2, 111, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नयचक्षुस्
नय- + चक्षुस् नय- + चक्षुस्, n. the eye of prudence, Rām. 1, 7, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निश्चक्षुस्
निस्- + चक्षुस् निस्- + चक्षुस्, adj. blind, MBh. 12, 10523.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तचक्षुस्
मुक्त- + चक्षुस् मुक्त- + चक्षुस् (vb. मुच्),<BR> I. adj. with one's eyes opened.<BR> II. m. a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचक्षुस्
स- + चक्षुस् स- + चक्षुस्, adj. seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चघ्
† चघ् चघ्, ii. 5, Par. To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चङ्क्रमण|चंक्रमण|चंक्रमणं|चङ्क्रमणं
चङ्क्रमण चङ्क्रमण, i. e. चङ्क्रम् (frequent. of क्रम्) + अन, n. Going, walking, Pañc. 209, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्च्|चंच्
चञ्च् चञ्च् (akin to चल्, cf. चञ्चल), i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To hop, to dance, Gīt. 4, 8.<BR> 2. To move, Bhartṛ. 3, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चल|चंचल|चञ्चलं|चञ्चलः
चञ्चल चञ्चल् + अ (frequent. of चल्), adj., f. ला.<BR> 1. Moving to and fro, unsteady, MBh. 8, 3920.; Pañc. 204, 1.<BR> 2. Fickle, Kathās. 7, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चलत्व
चञ्चलत्व चञ्चल + त्व, n. Unsteadiness, Bhag. 6, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चु|चंचु|चञ्चुः
चञ्चु चञ्चु, f. The beak, Pañc. i. d. 28.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादचञ्चु|वादचंचु
वाद- + चञ्चु वाद- + चञ्चु, m. a jester, Bhartṛ. 3, 57 (read राद- instead of वादि, and probably चुञ्चवः instead of चञ्चवः, cf. Pāṇ. 5, 2, 26; cf. Schol.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चुता
चञ्चुता चञ्चु + ता, f. Cleverness, Rājat. 5, 304.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चुरी
चञ्चुरी चञ्चुर् + ई (frequent. of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a " target="_blank">Page0290-a + 41</a>] चर्), adj. Continually doing, MBh. 13, 1220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0289-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चट्
चट् चट् (a dialectical form of चर्त्. vb. चृत्), i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. † To rain.<BR> 2. To cover.<BR> 3. To separate, Pañc. 121, 1.<BR> --i. 10 (rather Causal), चाटय,<BR> 1. To separate.<BR> 2. † To kill.<BR> --With the prep. उद् उद्, To disappear, Bhāg. P. 5, 9, 18.<BR> --Caus. To drive out, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चटक|चटकः
चटक चटक, m. A sparrow, Pañc. 80, 5. f. का, A hen-sparrow, Pañc. 80, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगेन्द्रचटक|मृगेंद्रचटक|मृगेन्द्रचटकः
मृग-इन्द्र- + चटक मृग-इन्द्र- + चटक, m. A hawk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चटचटा
चटचटाऽ चटचटा-, (an imitative sound), Clashing, MBh. 1, 7110; roaring, 3, 10980.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चटचटाय
चटचटाय चटचटाय (a denomin. derived from the preceding by य), Ātm. To crackle, Suśr. 2, 245, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चटुल|चटुलः
चटुल चटुल, adj.<BR> 1. Unsteady, Ragh. 9, 58.<BR> 2. Inconstant, Amar. 71.<BR> 3. Beautiful, Gīt. 10, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्
† चण् चण्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To give (or to go, to kill).<BR> 2. To sound, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण|चणः
चण चण, and चणक चण + क, m. Chick-pea, MBh. 13, 5468; Pañc. i. d. 148.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्ड्
† चण्ड् चण्ड्, i. 1 and 10 (rather a denomin. derived from the next), Ātm. To be angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्ड|चंड|चण्डं|चण्डः
चण्ड चण्ड (a dialectical form of चन्द् + र),<BR> I. adj., f. डी.<BR> 1. Flaming, Bhāg. P. 7, 8, 20; hot, e. g. in चण्डांशु, i. e. चण्ड-अंशु, m. The sun (properly, Having hot rays), Rājat. 4, 401.<BR> 2. Violent, MBh. 1, 1493; Bhartṛ. 2, 47.<BR> 3. Passionate, Ragh. 2, 49.<BR> 4. Wrathful, Rām. 2, 70, 10 (डी).<BR> 5. Cruel, MBh. 1, 6752.<BR> II. ˚डम्, adv. Passionately, Mālav. d. 56.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. A name of Śiva, MBh. 12, 10358.<BR> 2. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b " target="_blank">Page0290-b + 40</a>] A name of Skanda, MBh. 3, 14631.<BR> 3. A proper name, Hariv. 12937.<BR> IV. f. डा.<BR> 1. A name of Durgā, MBh. 6, 797.<BR> 2. A name of several plants, Suśr. 1, 139, 9.<BR> V. f. डी, A name of Durgā, MBh. 6, 797.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिचण्ड
अति- + चण्ड अति- + चण्ड, adj. very passionate, Rājat. 5, 380.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डत्व
चण्डत्व चण्ड + त्व, n. Passionateness, Sāh. D. 176.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डाल|चंडाल|चण्डालः
चण्डाल चण्डाल (akin to चण्ड), m. A man of the lowest of the mixed tribes, Man. 5, 131; 10, 12; f. ला, A woman of that tribe, Man. 11, 175.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डालता
चण्डालता चण्डाल + ता, f., and चण्डालत्व चण्डाल + त्व, n. The condition of a Caṇḍāla, Rām. 1, 58, 9; 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डिका|चंडिका
चण्डिका चण्डिका, i. e. चण्डी + क, f. A name of Durgā, Kathās. 25, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डिमन्|चंडिमन्
चण्डिमन् चण्डिमन्, i. e. चण्ड + इमन्, m. Cruelty and heat, Rājat. 6, 298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्
चत् चत्, i. 1, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To abscond (ved.).<BR> 2. † To ask.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतसृ
चतसृ चतसृ, see चतुर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुःसन|चतुःसनः
चतुःसन चतुःसन, i. e. चतुर्-सन, adj. Containing the four sons of Brahman, of whom the names begin with सन, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 5, viz. सनक, सनन्द, सनातन, सनत्कुमार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्
चतुर् चतुर् (for चत्वर्), f. चतसृ, numeral, Four, Chr. 28, 21; msc. instead of the fem. Rām. 4, 39, 33.<BR> --Cf. πέτταρες for τέτϝαρες; Lat. quatuor; Goth. fidvôr; A.S. feower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर|चतुरः
चतुर चतुर,<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Dexterous, Pañc. 161, 2.<BR> 2. Ingenious, Pañc. 158, 9.<BR> 3. Charming, Ragh. 8, 94.<BR> 4. Quick, Rājat. 3, 176; ˚रम्, adv. 188.<BR> II. n. Cleverness, Amar. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरक
चतुरक चतुर + क, m.<BR> 1. A proper [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a " target="_blank">Page0291-a + 39</a>] name, Pañc. 87, 4.<BR> 2. f. रिका, A proper name, Kathās. 6, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरता
चतुरता चतुर + ता, f. Shrewdness, Bhartṛ. 1, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरन्त|चतुरंत
चतुरन्त चतुर्-अन्त,<BR> I. adj. Epithet of the earth, denoting: Whole (verbally, with its four ends, i. e. north, east, etc.), MBh. 1, 2801.<BR> II. f. ता, The earth, Ragh. 10, 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरस्रक
चतुरस्रक चतुर्-अस्र + क, m. and comp. अर्ध-, द्वि-, m. The names of different postures, Vikr. d. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थ|चतुर्थः
चतुर्थ चतुर् + थ,<BR> I. ordin. number, f. थी, Fourth, Chr. 12, 16.<BR> II. n. A fourth part, MBh. 1, 1822.<BR> --Cf. τέταρτος; Lat. quartus; O.H.G. fiordo; A.S. feordh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थक|चतुर्थकः
चतुर्थक चतुर्थ + क, adj. Returning every fourth day (as fever), Hariv. 10555.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्दश|चतुर्द्दश
चतुर्दश चतुर्दश, i. e. चतुर्दशन् + अ,<BR> I. ord. number, f. शी, Fourteenth, Rām. 2, 112, 25.<BR> II. f. शी, The fourteenth day of the half of a lunar month, Man. 4, 113.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्दशधा
चतुर्दशधा चतुर्दशधा, i. e. चतुर्दशन् + धा, adv. Fourteen-fold, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्दशन्|चतुर्द्दशन्
चतुर्दशन् चतुर्-दशन्, numeral, Fourteen, Rājat. 5, 442.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्दशम
चतुर्दशम चतुर्दशम, i. e. चतुर्दशन् + म, ordin. numb., f. मी, Fourteenth, Bhāg. P. 8, 13, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्दिशम्
चतुर्दिशम् चतुर्-दिश् + अ + म्, adv. To the four quarters or points of the compass, Bhāg. P. 5, 17, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्धा
चतुर्धा चतुर् + धा, adv.<BR> 1. In four parts, Vedāntas. in Chr. 208, 19.<BR> 2. Four-fold, MBh. 9, 2487.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्युज्
चतुर्युज् चतुर्-युज्, adj. Drawn by four horses, Rām. 1, 53, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्वर्णमय
चतुर्वर्णमय चतुर्-वर्ण + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of the four castes, Ragh. 10, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्विंशतिक
चतुर्विंशतिक चतुर्-विंशति + क, adj. Consisting of twenty-four, Bhāg. P. 3, 26, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्क|चतुष्कं
चतुष्क चतुष्क, i. e. चतुर् + क,<BR> I. adj. with शतम्, Four in the hundred, Man. 8, 142.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A collection of four things, Man. 7, 50.<BR> 2. A hall supported by four columns, Kumāras. 5, 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्कर्णता
चतुष्कर्णता चतुष्कर्णता, i. e. चतुर्-कर्ण + ता, f. Confidence, Pañc. 66, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्किका
चतुष्किका चतुष्किका, i. e. चतुष्क + क, f. A collection of four things, Rājat. 5, 369.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्किन्
ऽचतुष्किन् -चतुष्किन्, i. e. चतुष्क + इन्, adj. Having four, MBh. 12, 13340.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्टय|चतुष्टयं
चतुष्टय चतुष्टय, i. e. चतुर् + तय,<BR> I. adj., f. यी.<BR> 1. Of four different sorts, MBh. 12, 11965.<BR> 2. Being four, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 28.<BR> II. n. A collection of four things, Man. 8, 180.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्टोम
चतुष्टोम चतुष्टोम, i. e. चतुर्-स्तोम, n. A stoma, or sacrifice, consisting of four parts, Rām. 1, 13, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पथ|चतुष्पथं|चतुष्पथः
चतुष्पथ चतुष्पथ, i. e. चतुर्-पथ, m. and n. A place where four roads meet, Man. 4, 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पद्
चतुष्पद् चतुष्पद्, see चतुष्पाद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पद|चतुष्पदः
चतुष्पद चतुष्पद, i. e. चतुर्-पद,<BR> I. adj., f. दा.<BR> 1. Having four legs, MBh. 3, 10661.<BR> 2. Consisting of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a " target="_blank">Page0292-a + 43</a>] four pādas, or verses, Mālav. 19, 11.<BR> II. m. A quadruped, Bhāg. P. 6, 4, 9.<BR> III. n. A stanza of four pādas (see<BR> I. 2), Mālav. 16, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0291-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पाद्
चतुष्पाद् चतुष्पाद्, i. e. चतुर्-पाद्. The base of the weakest cases is -पद्,<BR> I. adj., f. -पदी, but n. -पाद् and पद्,<BR> 1. Having four legs, Chr. 288, 3 = Rigv. i. 49, 3; Man. 1, 81.<BR> 2. Having four steps, MBh. 12, 8838.<BR> 3. Consisting of four parts, MBh. 5, 5352.<BR> II. m. A quadruped, MBh. 12, 5697.<BR> --Cf. τετράπους; Lat. quadrupes; A.S. feower-fed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पाद
चतुष्पाद चतुष्पाद, i. e. चतुर्-पाद,<BR> I. adj., f. दी<BR> 1. Having four legs, Rām. 5, 17, 30.<BR> 2. Having four parts, MBh. 3, 1459.<BR> II. m. A quadruped, Yājñ. 2, 298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुस्
चतुस् चतुस्, i. e. चतुर् + स्, adv. Four times, Cāṇ. 71.<BR> --Cf. Lat. quater.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वर|चत्वरं
चत्वर चत्वर् + अ (cf. चतुर्), n. and m.<BR> 1. A place where many (literally, four) roads meet; in the name of one of the mothers, चत्वर-वासिनी, MBh. 9, 2630 (dwelling on cross-roads, cf. चतुष्पथ-निकेता, MBh. 9, 2643; चतुष्पथ-रता, 2645, names of other mothers bearing the same signification; cf. Hecate trivia); a square, MBh. 3, 655.<BR> 2. A courtyard, Bhāg. P. 4, 9, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वारिंश
चत्वारिंश चत्वारिंश, ordin. numb. (from चत्वारिंशत्), f. शी, Fortieth, e. g. एक-, Forty-first, MBh. adhy. अष्टचत्वारिंश, i. e. अष्टन्-, Forty-eighth, Rām. 3, 48. त्रि-, Forty-third, MBh. 4, chap. 43. चतुश्चत्वारिंश, i. e. चतुर्-, Forty-fourth, MBh. adhy. द्वा-, and द्वि-, Forty-second, ib. 1, adhy. 42; 2, adhy. 42. नवन्-, Fortyninth, Rām. 6, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वारिंशत्
चत्वारिंशत् चत्वारिंशत्, i. e. चत्वारि-दशन्ति (originally pl. n., cf. τεσσαράκοντα; Lat. quadraginta, but in [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b " target="_blank">Page0292-b + 43</a>] Sanskrit it has become fem.), f. Forty, Rām. 5, 6, 19.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाचत्वारिंशत्
द्वा- + चत्वारिंशत् द्वा- + चत्वारिंशत्, fortytwo, MBh. 12, adhy. 142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वारिंशति
चत्वारिंशति चत्वारिंशति (cf. the last), f. Forty, Rājat. 3, 475.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चद्
† चद् चद्, i. 1, Par., Ātm. To beg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन
चन च-न, A particle used after derivatives of the interrogative pronoun किम्, in order to make them indefinite; see कथम्, कदा, किम्, कुतस्, क्व.<BR> --Cf. Goth. -hun, e. g. hvar-hun, whenever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्|चंद्
चन्द् चन्द् (for original श्चन्द्; cf. the ved. frequent. चनिश्चन्द्, ved. श्चन्द्र, Rigv. 3, 31, 15; and some comp. words, e. g. पुरु-श्चन्द्र), i. 1, Par. To shine.<BR> --Cf. ξανθός, ξουθός, σπινθήρ; Lat. candere, accendo, scintilla, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दन|चंदन|चंदनं|चन्दनं|चंदनः|चन्दनः
चन्दन चन्द् + अन,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. Sandal, the tree, Rām. 3, 76, 3; the wood, Pañc. i. d. 47; the unctuous preparations of the wood, Pañc. v. d. 18.<BR> II. m. A proper name, Rām. 4, 41, 3.<BR> III. f. नी, The name of a river, Rām. 4, 40, 20.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचन्दन
कु- + चन्दन कु- + चन्दन, n. redsanders, Pterocarpus santalinus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हरिचन्दन|हरिचंदन|हरिचन्दनं|हरिचन्दनः
हरि- + चन्दन हरि- + चन्दन,<BR> I. m. and n. 1. A yellow and fragrant sort of sandal-wood. 2. a tree of paradise.<BR> II. n. 1. saffron. 2. moonlight. 3. the farina of the lotus. 4. the person of a beloved one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनिन्|चंदनिन्
चन्दनिन् चन्दनिन्, i. e. चन्दन + इन्, adj. Smeared over with the unctuous preparation of sandal, MBh. 13, 1249.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्र|चंद्र|चन्द्रं|चन्द्रः
चन्द्र चन्द् + र, m.<BR> 1. The moon, MBh. 11, 220.<BR> 2. A moon-like spot, Bhāg. P. 4, 15, 7.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2667.<BR> 4. The name of a mountain, Rām. 6, 26, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्र|अर्द्धचन्द्रः|अर्धचन्द्रः
अर्ध- + चन्द्र अर्ध- + चन्द्र, see separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णचन्द्र
पूर्ण- + चन्द्र पूर्ण- + चन्द्र, m. the full of the moon, Rām. 3, 53, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रामचन्द्र|रामचंद्र|रामचन्द्रः
राम- + चन्द्र राम- + चन्द्र, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a " target="_blank">Page0293-a + 40</a>] m. the second of the three renowned Rāmas, the son of Daśaratha, and hero of the Rāmāyaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरच्चन्द्र|शरच्चंद्र|शरच्चन्द्रः
शरच्चन्द्र शरच्चन्द्र, i. e. शरद्-, m. the autumnal moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0292-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रक|चंद्रक|चन्द्रकं|चंद्रकः|चन्द्रकः
चन्द्रक चन्द्र + क, f. रिका.<BR> I. A substitute for चन्द्र when latter part of comp. adj. Mālav. d. 82; Rām. 5, 42, 3.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. The eye in a peacock's tail, Rājat. 1, 260.<BR> 2. A proper name, Rājat. 2, 16.<BR> III. f. रिका.<BR> 1. Moonlight, Śiś. 9, 28.<BR> 2. A proper name, Mālav. 50, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रकान्त|चंद्रकांत|चन्द्रकान्तं|चन्द्रकान्तः
चन्द्रकान्त चन्द्र + कान्त, (vb. कम्),<BR> I. adj. Graceful, like the moon, Śrut. 23.<BR> II. m. A fabulous gem, supposed to be formed of the congealed rays of the moon, Pañc. i. d. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रमस्|चंद्रमस्
चन्द्रमस् चन्द्रमस्, i. e. चन्द्र-मास, m. The moon, Nal. 17, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रवन्त्|चन्द्रवत्
चन्द्रवन्त् चन्द्र + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj., f. वती, Moonlit, Ghaṭ. 2.<BR> II. f. वती, A proper name, Pañc. 127, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रिका|चंद्रिका
चन्द्रिका चन्द्रिका, see चन्द्रक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चप्
† चप् चप्, i. 1. Par. To soothe.<BR> --i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To grind.<BR> 2. To deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपल|चपलं|चपलः
चपल चपल (i. e. कम्प् + अल) adj., f. ला.<BR> 1. Trembling, unsteady, Ragh. 11, 8; Hit. i. d. 46.<BR> 2. Giddy, inconsiderate, Matsyop. 72; MBh. 3, 13848.<BR> 3. Swift, Hariv. 4104; ˚लम्, adv. Quickly, Daśak. in Chr. 260, 2.<BR> 4. Wanton, Rām. 3, 51, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपलक
चपलक चपल + क, adj. Inconsiderate, Hariv. 4546.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपलता
चपलता चपल + ता, f. Fickleness, Hit. 49, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्
चम् चम्, i. 1; ii. 5, Par. To sip.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, base of the pres. etc., चाम,<BR> 1. To sip water, Rām. 2, 52, 73.<BR> 2. To rinse one's [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b " target="_blank">Page0293-b + 41</a>] mouth, i. e. to make one's ablution, Man. 2, 61.<BR> 3. To swallow figuratively, MBh. 5, 2978 (the horses swallowed the way, i. e. finished it very quickly).<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. आ-चान्त, in active sense, One who has rinsed his mouth, Man. 3, 251.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass., आ-चमनीय, n. Water for rinsing the mouth with, MBh. 3, 13662.<BR> --Causal, चामय, To cause to sip, Man. 5, 241.<BR> --With पर्या परि-आ, पर्याचान्त (viz. अन्न, food), One who has rinsed his mouth too early (without waiting the end of a meal), Man. 4, 212.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To make one's ablution, MBh. 13, 5063.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमत्कार|चमत्कारः
चमत्कार चमत्-कार (the latter part is कार, the former questionable), n. Surprise, Prab. 76, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमर|चमरं|चमरः
चमर चमर,<BR> I. m. Bos grunniens, Rām. 3, 49, 24.<BR> II. m. and n. The tail of the Bos grunniens, used to whisk off insects, flies, etc.; one of the insignia of royalty, MBh. 2, 1861; Vikr. d. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमस|चमसं|चमसः
चमस चम् + अस, m. and n. A drinking vessel, Man. 5, 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमू
चमू चमू, f. An army, Rām. 1, 74, 16, consisting of 729 elephants, 729 chariots, 2187 horses, and 3645 foot, MBh. 1, 292.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्प्|चंप्
† चम्प् चम्प्, i. 10, Par. To go, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पक|चंपक|चम्पकं|चंपकः|चम्पकः
चम्पक चम्पक,<BR> I. m. A tree, Micelia champaca, Lin., Rām. 1, 17, 35.<BR> II. f. का. The name of a town, Hit. 27, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शितचम्पक
शित- + चम्पक शित- + चम्पक, m.<BR> 1. a lamp. 2. a mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकवती
चम्पकवती चम्पकवती, i. e. चम्पक + वन्त् + ई, f.<BR> 1. The name of a forest, Hit. 17, 13.<BR> 2. The name of a town, 27, 10, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0293-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पा|चंपा
चम्पा चम्पा, f. The name of a town, Rām. 1, 17, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्ब्|चंब्
† चम्ब् चम्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चय्
† चय् चय्, i. 1, Ātm. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चय|चयः
चय चय, i. e. चि + अ, m.<BR> 1. A heap, Mārk. P. 21, 86.<BR> 2. A mass, MBh. 3, 16426.<BR> 3. A multitude, Caurap. 34.<BR> 4. Arranged fuel, Hariv. 2161.<BR> 5. A mound of earth, a rampart, Rām. 5, 9, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचय|अग्निचयः
अग्नि- + चय अग्नि- + चय, m. a funeral pile, Rām. 3, 9, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चयन|चयनं
चयन चयन, i. e. चि + अन, n. Arranged fuel, Draup. 2, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्
चर् चर् (for original श्चर्, cf. आश्चर्य), i. 1, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., MBh. 3, 12655),<BR> 1. To move, Rām. 4, 51, 8.<BR> 2. To go, MBh. 1, 3071.<BR> 3. To graze, Man. 2, 23; with acc., Hit. 81, 15.<BR> 4. To go through, over, along (with acc.), Man. 2, 185; 9, 238; Hariv. 3632.<BR> 5. To behave, to live, Man. 5, 90.<BR> 6. To act, MBh. 14, 534; विषमम्, To deal unjustly, Man. 9, 287.<BR> 7. To make, to perform, Man. 3, 30; 11, 53; विवादम्, To contest, Man. 8, 8; इन्द्रव्रतम्, To act like Indra, Man. 9, 304; तेजोव्रित्तम्, To emulate the power and acts, Man. 9, 303.<BR> 8. To treat, तपसा...इन्द्रियग्रामम्, To mortify one's flesh, MBh. 14, 544.<BR> 9. To spy, Rām. 6, 6, 16.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass.<BR> I. चरित, n.<BR> 1. Going, Suśr. 1, 21, 17.<BR> 2. Doing, acting, Hit. i. d. 76; adventures in दशकुमार-, i. e. दशन्-, The adventures of the ten princes, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass.<BR> I. चरितव्य;<BR> II. चर्तव्य, MBh. 13, 5134.<BR> III. चर्य, see [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-b " target="_blank">Page0294-b + 42</a>] separately.<BR> --Absol.,<BR> I. चरित्वा;<BR> II. चर्त्वा, MBh. 5, 3790;<BR> III. चीर्त्वा, MBh. 13, 495.<BR> --Infin.<BR> I. चरितुम्;<BR> II. चर्तुम्, Rām. 3, 14, 15.<BR> --Caus. चारय,<BR> 1. To cause to graze, Hariv. 3548.<BR> 2. To cause to wander, MBh. 3, 1498.<BR> 3. To send out, MBh. 12, 2705.<BR> 4. To expel, MBh. 12, 12944.<BR> 5. To cause to perform, Man. 11, 176.<BR> 6. To permit to hold a culpable intercourse, Man. 8, 362.<BR> 7. To cause to be spied, MBh. 3, 10030.<BR> --Frequent. चञ्चूर्य,<BR> 1. To rove, MBh. 1, 7910.<BR> 2. To wander over (with acc.), Hariv. 3726. Anomalous ptcple. of the pres. चञ्चूर्यन्त्, Hariv. 3602.<BR> --With अति अति,<BR> 1. To over-step, Hariv. 12790.<BR> 2. To trespass, Bhāg. P. 5, 10, 8.<BR> 3. To offend (one's husband by committing adultery, one's parents by disobedience), MBh. 12, 8387.<BR> --With व्यति वि-अति, To offend somebody, Rām. 6, 101, 11.<BR> --With अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To ramble through, Rām. 1, 59, 19.<BR> 2. To follow, MBh. 4, 652.<BR> 3. To act, MBh. 3, 1303. अनुचरित, n. Doing, history, Bhāg. P. 5, 6, 10.<BR> --Caus. To cause to be marched through, Man. 9, 266.<BR> --With अन्तर् अन्तर्, To move in the midst, MBh. 3, 2989.<BR> --With अप अप,<BR> 1. To trespass, MBh. 12, 9566.<BR> 2. To offend, Mārk. P. 13, 13. अपचरित, n. Sin, Śāk. d. 106.<BR> --With अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To offend, Man. 9, 102.<BR> 2. To use witchcraft, Bhāg. P. 3, 19, 13.<BR> 3. To occupy, to possess, Rām. 1, 34, 10.<BR> --With व्यभि वि-अभि,<BR> 1. To offend, MBh. 1, 3234.<BR> 2. To fail, Bhāg. P. 4, 18, 5.<BR> 3. To surpass, Kir. 5, 34.<BR> --With अव अव, Caus. To apply, Suśr. 2, 8, 12.<BR> --With अभ्यव अभि-अव, Caus. To send out, MBh. 12, 3779.<BR> --With [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0295-a " target="_blank">Page0295-a + 41</a>] आ आ,<BR> 1. To frequent, Rām. 3, 57, 11.<BR> 2. To live, Man. 11, 180.<BR> 3. To act, Man. 2, 110.<BR> 4. To treat, Man. 8, 102.<BR> 5. To perform, Man. 5, 156; to make, MBh. 4, 117.<BR> 6. To act according to custom, Śāk. 108, 22. आचरित, n.<BR> 1. Behaviour, Bhāg. P. 3, 14, 26.<BR> 2. Acting desperately, in order to excite compassion (as killing wife and cattle, and sitting before some-one's door till he complies with what is wished for), Man. 8, 49. आचीर्ण, Eaten.<BR> --With अध्या अधि-आ, To occupy, Man. 2, 119 (शय्यासने ऽध्याचरिते श्रेयसा, A couch or chair being occupied by a superior).<BR> --With अन्वा अनु-आ, To imitate, Bhāg. P. 5, 4, 6.<BR> --With अभ्या अभि-आ, To practise, MBh. 12, 9719.<BR> --With समुदा सम्-उद्-आ,<BR> 1. To treat, MBh. 12, 1203 (read समुद्˚ instead of सदुद्˚).<BR> 2. To perform, MBh. 13, 3968.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ,<BR> 1. To serve, MBh. 2, 408.<BR> 2. To treat, MBh. 18, 95.<BR> --With समुपा सम्-उप-आ,<BR> 1. To treat, Suśr. 1, 47, 4.<BR> 2. To practise, MBh. 3, 10572.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ,<BR> 1. To walk, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 9.<BR> 2. To act, Pañc. i. d. 78.<BR> 3. To perform, Man. 11, 231.<BR> 4. With दूराद्, To remove far from, Man. 4, 151. समाचीर्ण, Committed, MBh. 8, 1281.<BR> --With अनुसमा अनु-सम्-आ, To perform, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 53.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To rise, MBh. 3, 10088.<BR> 2. To fly back (as a bow), Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 25.<BR> 3. To void one's excrements, Man. 4, 49.<BR> 4. To utter, to pronounce, MBh. 5, 917.<BR> 5. To leave, Naiṣ. 5, 48 (Ātm.).<BR> 6. To offend, MBh. 16, 43. उच्चरित, n. Excrements, Bhāg. P. 5, 5, 32.<BR> --Caus. To utter, to pronounce, MBh. 1, 966.<BR> --With प्रोद् प्र उद्, To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0295-b " target="_blank">Page0295-b + 42</a>] pronounce, Hariv. 14694.<BR> --Caus. To cause to sound, Pañc. 21, 3.<BR> --With प्रत्युद् प्रति-उद्, Caus. To excite, MBh. 8, 3553.<BR> --With व्युद् वि-उद्,<BR> 1. To offend (Ātm.).<BR> 2. To have culpable intercourse (with instr.), MBh. 3, 12868.<BR> --With उप उप,<BR> 1. To approach, Rām. 5, 64, 5.<BR> 2. To serve, Man. 4, 254; to attend, Daśak. in Chr. 199, 21; to honour, Man. 3, 193.<BR> 3. To treat, Pañc. 43, 10.<BR> 4. pass. To be used metaphorically (with loc.), Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 37. उपचीर्ण, Attended, Bhāg. P. 3, 23, 38.<BR> --With दुस् दुस्, To treat ill, to deceive, Rām. 3, 2, 25.<BR> --With निस् निस्,<BR> 1. To come out, MBh. 1, 8235.<BR> 2. To appear, MBh. 6, 4543.<BR> 3. To proceed, MBh. 5, 4929.<BR> --With विनिस् वि-निस्, To proceed, MBh. 4, 1322.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To go round, Rām. 5, 52, 5.<BR> 2. To serve, Man. 2, 243; to attend, Rām. 1, 46, 11.<BR> 3. To honour.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To proceed, to appear, MBh. 6, 2189; Rām. 1, 35, 18.<BR> 2. To succeed, Bhāg. P. 5, 3, 2.<BR> 3. To visit, Rām. 2, 55, 5.<BR> 4. To walk, Prab. 33, 10.<BR> 5. To circulate, Rām. 1, 2, 40.<BR> 6. To act, Man. 9, 284.<BR> 7. To perform, Man. 10, 100.<BR> --Caus. To cause to graze, Hariv. 785.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To advance, Rām. 6, 16, 105.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, Caus. To diffuse, MBh. 12, 12742.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To go in different directions, Hiḍ. 2, 31; to rove, MBh. 3, 2486.<BR> 2. To wander through, MBh. 1, 3931 (Ātm.).<BR> 3. To live lasciviously, Man. 9, 20.<BR> 4. To fail, Bhāg. P. 9, 1, 15.<BR> 5. To act, Pañc. 26, 3.<BR> 6. To live, Man. 4, 18; 9, 302 (to live virtuously); with instr., To converse with, Bhāg. P. 4, 28, 52.<BR> 7. To make, to perform, Hariv. 10148. विचरित, n. Roving, Nal. 24, 49. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0296-a " target="_blank">Page0296-a + 44</a>]<BR> विचीर्ण,<BR> 1. Wandered through, Rām. 3, 73, 25.<BR> 2. Performed, Pañc. i. d. 307.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To cause to run, Arj. 6, 17.<BR> 2. To cause to go round, Rām. 4, 13, 44; बुद्धिम्, To reflect, Rām. 1, 41, 9.<BR> 3. To seduce, Rām. 1, 49, 6.<BR> 4. To consider, Man. 7, 178.<BR> 5. To doubt, Rām. 1, 23, 19.<BR> 6. To hesitate, Rām. 5, 35, 25; to decide, MBh. 4, 235.<BR> विचारित, n.<BR> 1. Consideration, Sāv. 3, 13.<BR> 2. Scruple, Mṛcch. 9, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR> अ-, adj. Requiring no hesitation, Man. 8, 295.<BR> --Comp.<BR> absol. अ-विचार्य, without having considered, Rām. 3, 51, 21.<BR> --With अनुवि अनु-वि, To walk through, Daśak. in Chr. 201, 13.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि,<BR> 1. To advance, MBh. 7, 1451.<BR> 2. To wander through, MBh. 10, 732.<BR> --Caus. To consider duly, Pañc. iii. d. 116.<BR> --With अनुसंवि अनु-सम्-वि, To wander through one by one, MBh. 3, 10288.<BR> --With सम् सम् (Ātm. when joined with an instrumental),<BR> 1. To come together, to join, Gīt. 2, 2; to collect, Hariv. 10758; to converse with, Pañc. i. d. 335.<BR> 2. To wander, MBh. 12, 6669.<BR> 2. To descend, Kumāras. 1, 6.<BR> 3. To wander through, Rām. 6, 83, 20.<BR> 4. To move, to live, Bhartṛ. 1, 89.<BR> 5. To pass over to somebody, Pañc. 186, 24.<BR> 6. To practise, Bhāg. P. 1, 16, 33.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To put in motion, Hit. 65, 13.<BR> 2. To let go, Rājat. 5, 195.<BR> 3. To cause to wander over, Bhāg. P. 8, 14, 5.<BR> 4. To lead, Śāk. d. 102.<BR> 5. To transfer, MBh. 1, 3169.<BR> --With अनुसम् अनु-सम्,<BR> 1. To wander through, MBh. 3, 1366.<BR> 2. To rove, MBh. 1, 3606.<BR> 3. To visit one by one, MBh. 12, 7002.<BR> --Caus. To cause to change to, MBh. 12, 11208 (अनुसंचार्य तान्, Having been changed to those).<BR> --With प्रतिसम् प्रति-सम्, To meet, MBh. 12, 11022. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0296-b " target="_blank">Page0296-b + 45</a>]<BR> --Cf. चल्, κολ in βου-κόλος, δύσ-κολος (= दुश्चर, i. e. दुस्-चर), κόρος, κορέννυμι (based on κορενϳυμι); Lat. colere, in-quilinus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

