सुचरित
सु- + चरित सु- + चरित, 1. adj. 1. well-conducted. 2. well-managed. 11. n. 1. good action, Bhartṛ. 2, 58. 2. good-conduct.<BR> II. चीर्ण, Performed, MBh. 15, 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0294-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर|चरः
चर चर् + अ,<BR> 1. adj., f. री.<BR> 1. Moveable, Man. 7, 15.<BR> 2. Latter part of comp. adj.<BR> a. Moving, Rām. 3, 9, 10.<BR> b. Practising, Man. 4, 196.<BR> II. m. A spy, Man. 7, 122.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0296-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

