चरितार्थय चरितार्थय (a denomin. derived from चरितार्थ by अय), Par. To let somebody attain his object, Naiṣ. 9, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्र|चरित्रं
चरित्र चर् + इत्र, n.<BR> 1. Ancient usages, Man. 9, 7.<BR> 2. Conduct, Rām. 5, 51, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रचरित्र
वि-चित्र- + चरित्र वि-चित्र- + चरित्र, adj., f. त्रा, behaving in a surprising way, Pañc. iv. d. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरिष्णु|चरिष्णुः
चरिष्णु चर्-इष्णु, adj. Moveable, belonging to the animal world, Man. 1, 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरु|चरुः
चरु चरु, m.<BR> 1. A caldron, Man. 5, 117.<BR> 2. An oblation to the gods, chiefly of milk and butter, Man. 6, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्च्
चर्च् चर्च्, i. 1 and 6, Par.<BR> 1. † To abuse.<BR> 2. † To menace.<BR> 3. † To injure.<BR> --i. 10, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To repeat.<BR> 2. † To study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरिका
चर्चरिका चर्चरिका, i. e. चर्-चरी + क, f. A kind of gesture, Vikr. 55, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरी|चर्च्चरी
चर्चरी चर्चरी (चर्चर् is probably an old frequent. of चर्), f. A kind of song, Vikr. 55, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चा|चर्च्चा
चर्चा चर्चा, f.<BR> 1. Cleaning the person with fragrant unguents, Gīt. 9, 10.<BR> 2. Smearing, anointing.<BR> 3. Applying, practice, Rājat. 5, 303.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चित|चर्च्चितं
चर्चित चर्चित, i. e. चर्चा + इत, adj.<BR> 1. Anointed, MBh. 2, 2371.<BR> 2. Smeared, Pañc. 123, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्चित
वि- + चर्चित वि- + चर्चित, adj., anointed, smeared, Ṛt. 6, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्ब्
† चर्ब् चर्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मकार|चर्मकारः|चर्म्मकार|चर्म्मकारः
चर्मकार चर्मकार, i. e. चर्मन्-कार, m. A shoemaker, Man. 2, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मन्|चर्म्मन्
चर्मन् चर्मन्, n.<BR> 1. Skin, Bhāg. P. 3, 6, 16.<BR> 2. Hide, Man. 2, 41.<BR> 3. A shield, Rām. 5, 73, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. perhaps πάλμη.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गलचर्मन्
गल- + चर्मन् गल- + चर्मन्, n. the throat, Suśr. 2, 215, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचर्मन्|गोचर्म्मन्
गो- + चर्मन् गो- + चर्मन्, n. the hide of a cow, MBh. 13, 1228.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुश्चर्मन्
दुस्- + चर्मन् दुस्- + चर्मन्, adj. suffering from a cutaneous disease, Yājñ. 3, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्ममय|चर्म्ममय
चर्ममय चर्ममय, i. e. चर्मन् + मय, adj., f. यी, Made of leather, Man. 2, 157.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रचर्ममय
व्याघ्रचर्म-मय व्याघ्रचर्म-मय, i. e. व्याघ्र-चर्मन् + मय, covered by a sheath made of the hide of a tiger, MBh. 6, 1787.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मवन्त्|चर्मवत्|चर्म्मवत्
चर्मवन्त् चर्मवन्त्, i. e. चर्मन् + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Covered by a hide, MBh. 3, 643.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मावकर्तिन्|चर्मावकर्त्तिन्|चर्म्मावकर्त्तिन्
चर्मावकर्तिन् चर्मावकर्तिन्, i. e. चर्मन्-अव-कृत् + इन्, m. A leathercutter, Man. 4, 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मावकर्त्तृ|चर्मावकर्तृ
चर्मावकर्त्तृ चर्मावकर्त्तृ, i. e. चर्मन्-अव-कृत् + तृ, m. A leathercutter, MBh. 12, 1321.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0297-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मिन्|चर्म्मिन्
चर्मिन् चर्मिन्, i. e. चर्मन् + इन्, m. A shield-bearer, MBh. 3, 756.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्य|चर्य्य
चर्य चर्य,<BR> I. ptcple. of the fut. pass. of चर्, To be practised, Man. 3, 1.<BR> II. f. या.<BR> 1. Roaming, MBh. 8, 2099.<BR> 2. Visiting, Bhāg. P. 9, 16, 1.<BR> 3. Going, Rām. 1, 19, 19.<BR> 4. Observance, Man. 1, 111.<BR> 5. Practising, occupation, Rām. 1, 40, 6.<BR> 6. Conduct, Man. 6, 32.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. Going, MBh. 8, 4215.<BR> 2. Practising.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचर्या|कुचर्य्या
कु-चर्या कु-चर्या, f. bad conduct, Man. 9, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तपश्चर्या
तपश्चर्या तपश्चर्या, i. e. तपस्-, f. mortification, MBh. 7, 1280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवचर्या|देवचर्य्या
देव-चर्या देव-चर्या, f. worship of the gods, MBh. 3, 11045.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मचर्या
धर्म- + चर्या धर्म- + चर्या, f. observance of the law, Kumāras. 7, 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुचर्या|पशुचर्य्या
पशु- + चर्या पशु- + चर्या, f. acting like beasts, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचर्य|ब्रह्मचर्यं|ब्रह्मचर्यः|ब्रह्मचर्य्य|ब्रह्मचर्य्यं
ब्रह्म-चर्य ब्रह्म-चर्य, i. e. ब्रह्मन्-,<BR> I. n. 1. studentship, the order of a religious student. 2. pious austerity, Man. 5, 160. 3. chastity, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 15.<BR> II. ब्रह्मचर्य, m. a religious student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सब्रह्मचर्य|सब्रह्मचर्यं|सब्रह्मचर्य्य
स-ब्रह्मचर्य स-ब्रह्मचर्य, n. studying together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथचर्या
रथ-चर्या रथ-चर्या, f. a chariot-exercise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रतचर्य|व्रतचर्यः
व्रत- + चर्य व्रत- + चर्य,<BR> I. f. observance of religious vows, Chr. 42, 11.<BR> II. व्रत-चर्य, m. a student in theology, Man. 1, 111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्व्
चर्व् चर्व् (akin to चर्), i. 1, and 10, Par.<BR> 1. To chew, to bite, Pañc. 259, 8.<BR> 2. To bite to pieces, Dev. 7, 10.<BR> 3. To taste, Sāh. D. 27, 11.<BR> --Cf. चूर्ण्, चूर्ण, τείρω, τρύω; Lat. terere, triticum, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वण|चर्वणं|चर्व्वण|चर्व्वणं
चर्वण चर्वण, i. e. चर्व् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Chewing.<BR> 2. Tasting, Sāh. D. 30, 17; also fem. णा, 30, 2.<BR> 3. Food, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 35.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुनःपुनश्चर्वितचर्वण
पुनःपुनश्चर्वित- + चर्वण पुनःपुनश्चर्वित- + चर्वण, i. e. पुनर्-पुनर्-चर्वित-, adj. chewing repeatedly what has been chewed already, Bhāg. P. 7, 5, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्षणि|चर्षणिः
चर्षणि चर्षणि (vb. चर्), pl. Men. Chr. 292, 5. = Rigv. i. 86. 5. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-b " target="_blank">Page0298-b + 44</a>]<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वचर्षणि
विश्व- + चर्षणि विश्व- + चर्षणि, adj. active, strenuous in everything, Chr. 291, 14 = Rigv. i. 64, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल्
1. चल् चल् (akin to चर्), i. 1, Par. (sometimes also Ātm.),<BR> 1. To tremble, MBh. 2, 1589.<BR> 2. To move, Hariv. 5591; to go, Bhāg. P. 3, 30, 23.<BR> 3. To go away, MBh. 1, 6546.<BR> 4. To become troubled, Pañc. i. d. 448.<BR> 5. To swerve (with the abl.), Man. 7, 15 (स्वधर्मान् न चलन्ति, They do not swerve from their duty). चलित,<BR> 1. Shaking, Rām. 3, 57, 23; trembling, MBh. 3, 10065.<BR> 2. Gone away, Arj. 4, 39.<BR> 3. Troubled, Rām. 5, 30, 13.<BR> 4. Damaged, Pañc. iv. d. 30.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. चलितव्य, Rām. 3, 49, 14, न चलितव्यं ते, You must not leave this place.<BR> --Caus.<BR> I. चलय,<BR> 1. To put in motion, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 37; to stir, Śāk. d. 158.<BR> 2. To trouble, to excite, Ṛt. 3, 10.<BR> 3. To turn off, Mṛcch. 147, 9.<BR> II. चालय,<BR> 1. To shake, Rām. 3, 7, 10; to move, MBh. 3, 11185.<BR> 2. To cause to waver, Rām. 6, 73, 20.<BR> 3. To drive onwards, MBh. 1, 5743.<BR> 4. To drive away, Hariv. 2697.<BR> 5. To put to flight, MBh. 7, 222.<BR> 6. To trouble, Vedāntas. in Chr. 218, 7. Anomalous ptcple. of the pres. Ātm. चालयान, MBh. 3, 11095.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. Not to be turned off, Bhāg. P. 2, 17, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, Caus. चालय,<BR> 1. To cause to tremble, Hariv. 3036.<BR> 2. To push away, MBh. 12, 5814.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To depart, Śāk. d. 28.<BR> 2. To rise, Bhāg. P. 6, 7, 8.<BR> 3. To unbind, Hariv. 2886.<BR> 4. To set out, Daśak. in Chr. 184, 6.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, To set out together, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 15.<BR> --With परि परि, To move, Sāh. D. 67, 12.<BR> --Caus. चालय, To turn round, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a " target="_blank">Page0299-a + 43</a>] MBh. 12, 6870.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To tremble, Rām. 3, 29, 13.<BR> 2. To advance, Bhāg. P. 7, 2, 23.<BR> 3. To move, Pañc. 87, 17.<BR> 4. To set out, Pañc. 104, 14.<BR> 5. To become troubled, MBh. 12, 2736.<BR> 6. To swerve, MBh. 3, 11249.<BR> --Caus. चलय, To move, Amar. 58. चालय,<BR> 1. To cause to tremble, Rām. 5, 38, 34.<BR> 2. To stir up, Pañc. 262, 20.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To waver, Rām. 3, 57, 23.<BR> 2. To depart, Hariv. 4113.<BR> 3. To move, MBh. 3, 2614.<BR> 4. To fall down, Gīt. 5, 10.<BR> 5. To become troubled, Hariv. 9948.<BR> 6. To swerve, Man. 7, 28.<BR> --Caus. चालय,<BR> 1. To cause to tremble, Rām. 1, 16, 23.<BR> 2. To make unsteady, Man. 7, 13; to rescind, 8, 167.<BR> 3. To trouble, Rām. 5, 32, 37.<BR> 4. To turn off, Bhāg. P. 9, 8, 15.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि,<BR> 1. To tremble, MBh. 1, 1184.<BR> 2. To become unsteady, Hariv. 11126.<BR> 3. To deviate, Bhartṛ. 2, 81.<BR> --Caus. चालय, To cause to tremble, Hariv. 6226.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To tremble, Rām. 6, 75, 34.<BR> 2. To move, Rām. 2, 90, 4 (आसनात्, To start up from one's seat).<BR> --Caus. चालय,<BR> 1. To cause to tremble, Hariv. 13211.<BR> 2. To put in motion, Śāk. d. 69.<BR> 3. To drive away, MBh. 10, 627.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचल|अचलः
अ- + चल अ- + चल, adj., immoveable, MBh. 13, 2161.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0298-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल्
† 2. चल् चल्, i. 6, Par. To sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल्
† 3. चल् चल्, i. 10, Par. To foster, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल|चलं|चलः
चल चल् + अ, adj., f. ला.<BR> 1. Trembling, Ragh. 3, 68.<BR> 2. Loose, Suśr. 1, 303, 18.<BR> 3. Troubled, Suśr. 1, 146, 16.<BR> 4. Fickle, Nal. 19, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR> see अचल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निश्चल
निस्- + चल निस्- + चल, adj. 1. immoveable, Bhartṛ. 2, 69. 2. steady, Bhag. 2, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिश्चल
वि-निस्- + चल वि-निस्- + चल, adj. immoveable, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचल|विचलः
वि- + चल वि- + चल, adj. 1. moving to and fro, unsteady. 2. conceited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविचल
