चलचित्तता
चलचित्तता चल-चित्त + ता, f. Fickleness, Hit. i. d. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलत्व
चलत्व चल + त्व, n. Trembling, Megh. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलन|चलनं|चलनः
चलन चल् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Trembling, Pañc. ii. d. 174.<BR> 2. Moving, MBh. 12, 3708.<BR> 3. Swerving, MBh. 3, 1319.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूमिचलन
भूमि- + चलन भूमि- + चलन, n. an earthquake, Man. 4, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलाचल|चलाचलः
चलाचल चलाचल् + अ (derived from an old frequent. of चल्), adj.<BR> 1. Moving to and fro, Rām. 5, 42, 11.<BR> 2. Unsteady, MBh. 5, 2758.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चष्
† चष् चष्, i. 1, Par. To kill.<BR> --i. 1, Par., Ātm. To eat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषक|चषकं|चषकः
चषक चषक, m. and n. A drink. ing vessel, Ragh. 7, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषाल|चषालः
चषाल चषाल, m. and n. A ring on the top of a sacrificial post, MBh. 7, 2266.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चह्
† चह् चह्, i. 1 and 10 (v. r.), Par. To deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्र
चाक्र चाक्र, i. e. चक्र + अ, adj. Performed with a discus, Hariv. 5648.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रिक|चाक्रिकः
चाक्रिक चाक्रिक, i. e. चक्र + इक, m.<BR> 1. An oil grinder, Rājat. 6, 272 (at the same time, A partisan).<BR> 2. A bellman, Hariv. 9047.<BR> 3. A partisan, Rājat. 5, 267.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुष|चाक्षुषं|चाक्षुषः
चाक्षुष चाक्षुष, i. e. चक्षुस् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. षी.<BR> 1. Peculiar to the eye, e. g. षी विद्या, The magic faculty of seeing every object, MBh. 1, 6478.<BR> 2. Perceptible by the eye, Suśr. 1, 153, 5.<BR> 3. Referring to Manu Cākṣuṣa, Bhāg. P. 4, 30, 49.<BR> II. m. The name of the sixth Manu, Man. 1, 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाट|चाटः
चाट चाट, m. A rogue, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 907.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0299-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटु|चाटुः
चाटु चाटु, m. and n. Pleasing, flattering discourse, Ṛt. 6, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुकार
चाटुकार चाटु-कार, m. A flatterer, Rājat. 5, 351.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणक्य|चाणक्यः
चाणक्य चाणक्य,<BR> I. m. A proper name, Pañc. 253, 12.<BR> II. adj. Composed by Cāṇakya, Cāṇ. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डाल|चांडाल|चांडालः|चाण्डालः
