ब्राह्मण- + चाण्डाल ब्राह्मण- + चाण्डाल, m. The son of a Śūdra man and Brāhmaṇī woman, Man. 9, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातक|चातकः
