चातुर्मास्य चातुर्मास्य, i. e. चतुर्-मास + य, n. The name of sacrifices which ought to be offered every four months, Man. 6, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्य|चातुर्यं|चातुर्य्य
