चान्द्रायण|चांद्रायण|चांद्रायणं|चान्द्रायणं
चान्द्रायण चान्द्रायण, i. e. चन्द्र-अयन + अ, n. A religious or expiatory observance regulated by the moon's age; diminishing the daily consumption of food by one mouthful every day for the dark half of the month, and increasing it in like manner during the light half, Man. 11, 216; Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

