कुसुम-, पुष्प- + चाप कुसुम-, पुष्प- + चाप, m. a name of the god of love, Ragh. 9, 33; Kathās. 14, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

