ससुरचापम्
स-सुर-चाप + म् स-सुर-चाप + म्, adv. with Indra's bow, Kir. 5, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

