अतिचापल्य
अति- + चापल्य अति- + चापल्य, n. great quickness, Pañc. 62, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिचापल्य
पाणि- + चापल्य पाणि- + चापल्य, n. fidgeting with the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चापिन्
चापिन् चापिन्, i. e. चाप + इन्, m. An archer, MBh. 12, 10406.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामर|चामरं|चामरः
चामर चामर, i. e. चमर + अ, n. The tail of the Bos grunniens, used to whisk off flies, and one of the insignia of royalty, Rājat. 5, 449: Megh. 36. Used also as an ornament on the heads of horses, Śāk. d. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामीकर|चामीकरं
