चाय्
चाय् चाय्, i. 1, Par., Ātm. To worship.<BR> --With the prep. नि नि, To worship, Daśak. 174, 5.<BR> --Cf. चि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार|चारं|चारः
