सहचार|सहचारः
सह- + चार सह- + चार, m. the concomitance of the major and middle term, Bhāṣāp. 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारक|चारकः
चारक चारक, i. e. चर् + अक,<BR> I. adj. Acting, Rām. 3, 66, 18.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A spy, MBh. 2, 172.<BR> 2. A prison, Daśak. in Chr. 195, 11.<BR> III. f. रिका, A servant-girl, Kathās. 14, 65. प्रच्छन्न- (vb. चद्), adj. Acting fraudulently, Rām. 3, 66, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारण|चारणः
