चारिन्
चारिन् चारिन्, i. e. चर् + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इणी.<BR> 1. Moveable, MBh. 7, 372.<BR> 2. As latter part of comp. words:<BR> a. Going, Bhāg. P. 6, 4, 9.<BR> b. Moving, Hiḍ. 4, 4.<BR> c. Roaming, Pañc. 69, 1.<BR> d. Living, Rām. 3, 15, 6.<BR> e. Acting, प्रच्छन्न- (vb. चद्), Acting fraudulently, Rām. 3, 51, 26.<BR> f. Observing, Rām. 3, 53, 21.<BR> g. Feeding on, Suśr. 1, 208, 12.<BR> II. m. A foot-soldier, MBh. 6, 3545.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0301-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

