चारु|चारुः
चारु चारु (akin to चर् in चर्व्, cf. चूर्ण, properly: Delicate, cf. τέρην, τείρω), adj., f. र्वी.<BR> 1. Agreeable, Pañc. 256, 14.<BR> 2. Beautiful, Rām. 1, 63, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. καλός.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

