चार्वाक|चार्वाकः|चार्व्वाक|चार्व्वाकः
चार्वाक चार्वाक i. e. चारु-वच् + अ, m. The name of a philosopher holding materialistic and heterodox principles, Vedāntas. in Chr. 210, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0302-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालन|चालनं
