† चिक्क् चिक्क्, i. 10, Par. To give pain, v. r.<BR> --Cf. चक्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिक्कण|चिक्कणं|चिक्कणः
चिक्कण चिक्कण, adj. Smooth, slippery, MBh. 12, 6854; 14, 1416 (thus to be read instead of चिक्वण); Suśr. 2, 176, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिक्रीडिषा
चिक्रीडिषा चिक्रीडिषा, i. e. चिक्रीडिष, desiderat. of क्रीड्, + अ, f. The desire to play, Bhāg. P. 3, 7, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिखादिषु
चिखादिषु चिखादिषु, i. e. चिखादिष, desider. of खाद्, + उ, adj. Desiring to devour, MBh. 10, 483.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिच्छित्सु
चिच्छित्सु चिच्छित्सु, i. e. चिच्छित्स, desider. of चिद्, + उ, adj. Desiring to cop off, MBh. 7, 6001.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिट्
† चिट् चिट्, i. 1, Par. To send off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्
1. चित् चित् (akin to 2. चि), i. 1. Par. To perceive. Chr. 295, 12 = Rigv. i. 92, 12.<BR> --Caus. and i. 10, Ātm. चेतय,<BR> 1. To perceive, MBh. 12, 9890 (Ātm.).<BR> 2. To get consciousness, MBh. 1, 3616 [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a " target="_blank">Page0304-a + 42</a>] (Ātm.).<BR> 3. To think, MBh. 18, 74 (Par.); Bhāg. P. 1, 8, 9 (Ātm.).<BR> 4. To cause to think, Bhāg. P. 8, 1, 9 (Ātm.).<BR> 5. To know, MBh. 3, 14877 (Par.). Anomalous ptcple. of the pres. Ātm. चेतयान, Sensible, Rām. 2, 109, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0303-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्
2. चित् चित्, f. Soul (as distinguished from चित्त), Vedāntas. in Chr. 215, 6; Sāṅkhya Aph. 1, 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्
3. चित् चित्, see चिद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिता
चिता चिता, i. e. चित, ptcple. of the pf. pass. of 1. चि, f. A funeral pile, Rājat. 5, 226.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिति|चितिः
चिति चि + ति, f.<BR> 1. A heap, Bhāg. P. 4, 28, 50.<BR> 2. Wood raised for burning, Man. 4, 46.<BR> 3. An altar, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 36.<BR> 4. Intellect, Dev. 5, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चितिका
चितिका चितिका, i. e. चिता + क, f. A funeral pile, Pañc. iii. d. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्कार
चित्कार चित्-कार (the first part is an imitative sound), m. Scream; braying of an ass, Hit. ii. d. 30, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्कारवन्त्|चित्कारवत्
चित्कारवन्त् चित्कार + वन्त्, adj., f. वति, Accompanied by shouts, Mālat. 1, 5, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्त|चित्तं
चित्त 1. चित् + त, n.<BR> 1. Thought, Bhag. 16, 16.<BR> 2. Intellect, Vedānt. in Chr. 207, 2.<BR> 3. Will, Śāk. C. 32, 3.<BR> 4. The mind, Rām. 3, 55, 19.<BR> 5. The heart, Pañc. 140, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यचित्त
अन्य- + चित्त अन्य- + चित्त, adj. thinking of some one or something else, Pañc. 225, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचित्त
एक- + चित्त एक- + चित्त,<BR> I. n. 1. thought directed to one object only, Prab. 8, 5. 2. unanimity, Rām. 2, 40, 35.<BR> II. adj. 1. thinking only of one object; in तद्-, thinking of him only, Hit. 39, 2. 2. unanimous, Hit. 14, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलचित्त
चल- + चित्त चल- + चित्त,<BR> I. n. fickleness, Man. 9, 15.<BR> II. adj. unsteady, Rām. 3, 1, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोहचित्त
प्रमोह- + चित्त प्रमोह- + चित्त, adj., f. ता, bewildered in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्ति|चित्तिः
चित्ति 1. चित् + ति, f. Thought, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b " target="_blank">Page0304-b + 44</a>] Bhāg. P. 5, 18, 18.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वचित्ति
पूर्व- + चित्ति पूर्व- + चित्ति, f. 1. first thought. 2. the name of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्य|चित्यं|चित्यः
चित्य 1. चि + त्या,<BR> I. n. A tomb, Rām. 1, 58, 10.<BR> II. f. A layer.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुश्चित्य|चतुश्चित्यः
चतुश्चित्य चतुश्चित्य, i. e. चतुर्-, adj. supported on four layers, MBh. 14, 2643.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्र्
चित्र् चित्र्, i. 10 (rather a denomin. derived from the next), Par.<BR> 1. To colour with various colours, Hit. i. d. 171.<BR> 2. To adorn, MBh. 12, 988.<BR> 3. † To see a wonderful sight.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि, विचित्रित (rather वि-चित्र + इत),<BR> 1. Spotted, Rām. 3, 49, 35.<BR> 2. Coloured with various colours, Chr. 34, 10.<BR> 3. Wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्र|चित्रं|चित्रः
चित्र 1. चित् + र,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Visible (ved.).<BR> 2. Clear, shining, Chr. 293, 2 = Rigv. i. 88, 2.<BR> 3. Variegated, Chr. 2, 21.<BR> 4. Spotted, Rām. 3, 48, 12.<BR> 5. Various, Man. 9, 248.<BR> 6. Fluctuating, Rām. 3, 52, 15.<BR> 7. Wonderful, Rām. 3, 35, 4.<BR> 8. Surprised, Rājat. 5, 2.<BR> 9. Uncommon, rigorous, Daśak. in Chr. 193, 4; adv. in a rigorous manner, ib. 198, 3.<BR> II. f. त्रा, The name of a lunar mansion, Spica virginis, Rām. 3, 23, 11.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. A surprising appearance, Śāk. 110, 17; wonder, Rām. 3, 51, 26.<BR> 2. A spot, MBh. 13, 2605.<BR> 3. A picture, MBh. 13, 7692.<BR> 4. Painting, Rām. 2, 90, 23 Gorr.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्र|विचित्रं|विचित्रः
वि- + चित्र वि- + चित्र,<BR> I. adj. 1. variegated, spotted. 2. painted. 3. handsome. 4. surprising.<BR> II. n. 1. variegated (the colour). 2. surprise. 3. speech implying apparently the reverse of the intended object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचित्र
स- + चित्र स- + चित्र, adj. 1. painted, Hariv. 4532. 2. containing pictures, Megh. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रक|चित्रकं|चित्रकः
चित्रक चित्र + क,<BR> I. m. The Cheeta, or small hunting leopard, Pañc. 72, 11.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A sectarial mark, made on the forehead, Hariv. 7074.<BR> 2. A mode of fighting, Hariv. 15979.<BR> 3. The name of a forest, Hariv. 8952.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0304-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रकार|चित्रकारः
चित्रकार चित्र-कार, m. A painter, MBh. 5, 5025.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रग
चित्रग चित्र-ग, and चित्रगत चित्र-गत (vb. गम्), adj., f. गा, ता, Painted, Kathās. 5, 31; MBh. 6, 1662.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रगुप्त|चित्रगुप्तः
चित्रगुप्त चित्र-गुप्त, m. Yama's registrar, who records the vices and virtues of mankind, MBh. 13, 5924.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रधा
चित्रधा चित्र-धा, adv. Manifold, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रबर्हिन्
चित्रबर्हिन् चित्रबर्हिन्, i. e. चित्र-बर्ह + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Having a variegated tail, MBh. 13, 4206.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रवन्त्|चित्रवत्
चित्रवन्त् चित्र + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Adorned with pictures, Ragh. 14, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रस्थ
चित्रस्थ चित्र-स्थ, adj. Painted, Kathās. 6, 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रामघ
चित्रामघ चित्रामघ, i. e. चित्र-मघ, with lengthened final of the former part, adj., f. घा, Having splendid treasures, Chr. 288, 10 = Rigv. i. 48, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रीय
चित्रीय चित्रीय, a denomin. derived from चित्र by य, Ātm.<BR> 1. To be surprised, Kathās. 6, 50.<BR> 2. To cause surprise, Daśak. 177, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिद्
चिद् चिद् (properly acc. n. of a lost indefinite pronoun चि = τι; Lat. qui + s), a particle giving to the preceding word an indefinite signification: Any, Chr. 292, 5 = Rigv. i. 86, 5; Chr. 290, 3 = Rigv. i. 64, 3. All, Chr. 288, 3 = Rigv. i. 49, 3. In classic language it is only used after derivatives of the interrogative pronouns किम्, and जतु, and gives them an indefinite signification; cf. कथम्, कदा, किम्, कुतस्, क्व, and जातु.<BR> --Cf. Lat. -que (= Oscan -pid) in quando-que = कदा चिद्, (qui)-cumque = कम् चिद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिदात्मन्
चिदात्मन् चिदात्मन्, i. e. चित्-आत्मन्, m. He whose essence is intelligence; the pure soul, Prab. 114, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त्|चिंत्
चिन्त् चिन्त् (akin to चित् and चि), i. 10 and † i. 1, Par. (also Ātm., Rām. 5, 67, 10),<BR> 1. To think, Lass. 36, 8. To think of, with the acc., Pañc. i. d. 100; with the dat., Hariv. 5976; with the loc., Bhāg. P. 5, 19, 14; with प्रति and acc., MBh. 3, 1714.<BR> 2. To reflect, Rām. 1, 8, 2.<BR> 3. To mind, MBh. 3, 2399.<BR> 4. To regard, Rām. 5, 77, 11.<BR> 5. To devise, Hit. 13, 19. Anomalous ptcple. of the pres., छिन्तयान, Pañc. 209, 6. चिन्तित, n.<BR> 1. Thought, Matsyop. 37.<BR> 2. Design, Rām. 1, 70, 7.<BR> 3. Care, Lass. 74, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass.<BR> 1. Comp. अ-चिन्तनीय, Not to be thought of, Pañc. iii. d. 221.<BR> 2. चिन्त्य, n. Necessity of minding something, Bhāg. P. 7, 5, 49.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To think, to think of, Hariv. 9216.<BR> 2. To reflect, Rām. 1, 15, 23.<BR> 3. To remember, MBh. 3, 2642.<BR> 4. To consider, Rām. 6, 21, 35.<BR> --With समनु सम्-अनु,<BR> 1. To remember, MBh. 3, 9952.<BR> 2. To consider, MBh. 12, 12393.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To ponder, MBh. 13, 4341.<BR> --With निस् निस्, अ-निश्चिन्त्य, adj. Unfathomable, Rām. 5, 81, 6.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To reflect, MBh. 4, 1534.<BR> 2. To remember, Rām. 5, 34, 23.<BR> 3. To consider, MBh. 14, 568.<BR> 4. To devise, Rām. 1, 9, 2.<BR> --With संपरि सम्-परि, To devise, Rām. 6, 22, 10.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To reflect, Rām. 4, 8, 8.<BR> 2. To consider, MBh. 3, 12231.<BR> 3. To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a " target="_blank">Page0306-a + 42</a>] devise, MBh. 3, 8820.<BR> --With विप्र वि-प्र, To remember, MBh. 8, 4230.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति,<BR> 1. To remember, Rām. 5, 28, 11.<BR> 2. To consider again, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2977.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To reflect, Pañc. 23, 10.<BR> 2. To consider, MBh. 1, 5190.<BR> 3. To care, Bhāg. P. 7, 2, 38.<BR> 4. To devise, Pañc. 92, 6.<BR> 5. To find out, MBh. 3, 1445.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. दुर्विचिन्त्य, i. e. दुस्-, adj. Difficult to be penetrated, MBh. 12, 4628.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, To think of (with acc.), Rām. 5, 66, 33.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To reflect, Rām. 5, 1, 86.<BR> 2. To consider, Pañc. 255, 3.<BR> 3. To design, Bhāg. P. 5, 7, 1.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. दुस्-संचिन्त्य, adj. Hardly to be imagined, Rājat. 6, 61.<BR> --With अनुसन् अनु-सम्, To reflect, MBh. 14, 59.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To remember, MBh. 7, 5551.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्तित|अचिंतित
अ- + चिन्तित अ- + चिन्तित, adj. unexpected, Pañc. ii. d. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्त्य|अचिंत्य|अचिन्त्यः
अ- + चिन्त्य अ- + चिन्त्य, adj. incomprehensible, Man. 1, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुश्चिन्त्य
दुस्- + चिन्त्य दुस्- + चिन्त्य, adj. difficult to be penetrated, MBh. 7, 433.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0305-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तक|चिंतक
ऽचिन्तक -चिन्त् + अक, latter part of comp. words, Thinking of, caring, e. g. MBh. 1, 7777.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्यचिन्तक|कार्यचिंतक|कार्यचिन्तकः|कार्य्यचिन्तक
कार्य- + चिन्तक कार्य- + चिन्तक, m. a superintendent of all affairs. Yājñ. 2, 191.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दैवचिन्तक|दैवचिंतक|दैवचिन्तकः
दैव- + चिन्तक दैव- + चिन्तक, m. an astrologer, MBh. 12, 4454.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वार्थचिन्तक|सर्वार्थचिन्तकः
सर्वार्थ- + चिन्तक सर्वार्थ- + चिन्तक, i. e. सर्व-अर्थ-, m. a superintendent of all affairs, Man. 7, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थानचिन्तक|स्थानचिंतक|स्थानचिन्तकः
स्थान- + चिन्तक स्थान- + चिन्तक, m. a quartermaster, Pañc. 156, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तन|चिंतन|चिंतनं
चिन्तन चिन्त् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Thinking, Man. 12, 5.<BR> 2. Way of thinking, Rājat. 5, 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्ता|चिंता
चिन्ता चिन्त् + आ, f.<BR> 1. Thinking, Bhāṣāp. 65.<BR> 2. Thought, Rājat. 5, 11.<BR> 3. Care, Pañc. i. d. 226.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यचिन्त
अन्-अन्य-चिन्त अन्-अन्य-चिन्त, adj. having one's thoughts fixed on one only object, Rām. 5, 57, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निश्चिन्त|निश्चिंत|निश्चिन्तः
निश्चिन्त निश्चिन्त, i. e. निस्-, adj. 1. free from thought, MBh. 14, 1307. 2. Careless, Hariv. 10302.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तामय
चिन्तामय चिन्ता + मय, adj., f. यी.<BR> 1. Appearing as thought, Bhāg. P. 2, 2, 12.<BR> 2. Produced by thinking, Rām. 2, 85, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्मात्र|चिन्मात्रं
चिन्मात्र चिन्मात्र, i. e. चित्-मात्र, n. Pure-intelligence, Bhāg. P. 4, 7, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर|चिरं
चिर चिर (i. e. probably चर् + अ, cf. चरम),<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Long, Hariv. 9942.<BR> 2. Olden, Bhāg. P. 3, 2, 21.<BR> II. n. Delay, Rām. 4, 5, 27.<BR> III. The acc. रम्, instr. रेण, dat. राय, abl. रात्, gen. रस्य, and loc. रे, are used adverbially: रम्, A long time. Man. 4, 60. रेण, After a long time, Sāv. 5, 84; from a long time back, Prab. 29, 14. राय, A long time, Ragh. 14, 59; after a long time, at last, Pañc. 231, 21; too late, MBh. 5, 780; for a long time, MBh. 13, 392. रात्, After a long time, Pañc. ii. d. 63; at last, Rām. 4, 27, 17; from a long time back, Hit. 17, 14. रस्य, After a long time, at last, Rām. 2, 54, 20.<BR> --When former part of a comp. word these adverbs drop their terminations, and appear in the form of the base चिर, e. g. Rām. 1, 42, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिर
अ- + चिर अ- + चिर, adj. short, Rām. 5, 37, 21; the acc. रम्, instr. रेण, and abl. रात्, are used adverbially: In a short time, Draup. 5, 20; Man. 7, 134; Rām. 1, 70, 34. As former part of comp. words it signifies often, Just, Man. 3, 280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नचिर
न- + चिर न- + चिर, adj. not long, MBh. 1, 3860; ˚रम्, adv. a short time, Rām. 2, 94, 14 Gorr. ˚रेण, राय, and रात्, adv. soon, MBh. 1, 7487; 833; Rām. 5, 89, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माचिर|माचिरं
माचिर माचिर, see separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचिरम्
सु-चिर + म् सु-चिर + म्, adv. a very long time, Rājat. 5, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकार
चिरकार चिर-कार, चिरकारि चिरकारि, i. e. चिर-कृ + इ, चिरकारिक चिरकारिक, i. e. चिरकार + इक, and चिरकारिन् चिर-कारिन्, adj. Slow, tardy, MBh. 12, 9482; 9539; 9483; 9485.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकारिता
चिरकारिता चिरकारिता, and चिरकारित्व चिरकारित्व, i. e. चिर-कारिन् + ता, f., or त्व, n. Slowness, MBh. 12, 9524; 9489.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरकालत्व
चिरकालत्व चिर-काल + त्व, n. A long interval, Pañc. 115, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरंतन|चिरन्तन|चिरन्तनः
चिरंतन चिरंतन, i. e. चिर + म् + तन, adj.<BR> 1. Old, Pañc. 228, 11.<BR> 2. Hereditary, Pañc. 16, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरय
चिरय चिरय (a denominative derived from चिर by अय), Par. To tarry, Pañc. 52, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिराय
चिराय चिराय (a denomin. derived from चिर by य), Par., Ātm. To tarry, Pañc. 257, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरि|चिरिः
† चिरि चिरि, ii. 5, चिरिणु, Par. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर्भटिका
चिर्भटिका चिर्भटिका, i. e. चिर्भटी + क, and चिर्भटी चिर्भटी, f. A kind of cucumber, Cucumis utilissimus utilissimus, Pañc. 30, 7; 248, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्
† चिल् चिल्, i. 6, Par. To put on clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्ल्
† चिल्ल् चिल्ल्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To be loose.<BR> 2. To indicate one's meaning(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लक
चिल्लक चिल्लक, m. or f. का, A certain animal, MBh. 7, 1320.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लिका
चिल्लिका चिल्लिका, i. e. चिल्ली + क, m. and चिल्ली चिल्ली, f. A kind of vegetable, Daśak. 169, 19; Suśr. 1, 220, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिवुक|चिवुकं|चिवुकः
चिवुक चिवुक, n. The chin, Yājñ. 3, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्न|चिह्नं
चिह्न चिह्न (probably for चिख्न, from a reduplicated form of खन् by the aff. अ), n.<BR> 1. A mark of any kind, Rām. 4, 12, 44.<BR> 2. Insignia, Ragh. 2, 7.<BR> 3. An attribute, Bhāg. P. 4, 15, 9. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b " target="_blank">Page0307-b + 38</a>]<BR> 4. A sign, Pañc. i. d. 193.<BR> 5. Caracter, Bhāg. P. 3, 32, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्नय
चिह्नय चिह्नय (a denomin. derived from the last by अय), Par. To mark, Man. 8, 352.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To mark, Rām. 4, 42, 12.<BR> --With उपरि उपरि, उपरिचिह्नित, Signed above, Yājñ. 1, 318.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To mark, MBh. 3, 12445.<BR> 2. To sign, Yājñ. 2, 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीक्
† चीक् चीक्, i. 1 and 10, Par. To suffer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीचीकुची
चीचीकुची and चीचीकूची चीचीकूची, a word imitative of the chirping of birds, Rām. 6, 11, 42; MBh. 16, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीत्कार|चीत्कारः
चीत्कार चीत्-कार, m. Noise, MBh. 7, 6666.<BR> --Cf. चित्कार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीत्कारवन्त्|चीत्कारवत्
चीत्कारवन्त् चीत्कारवन्त्, adj., f. वती, Accompanied by noise, Mālat. 1, 8.<BR> --Cf. चित्कारवन्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीन|चीनं|चीनः
चीन चीन, m.<BR> 1. pl. The name of a people, Man. 10, 44.<BR> 2. A sort of cloth, Suśr. 1, 65, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरचीन
अपर- + चीन अपर- + चीन, m. pl. the western Cīnas, Rām. 4, 44, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीनक|चीनकः
चीनक चीन + क, m. The name of a people = Cīna, MBh. 8, 236.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीब्
† चीब् चीब्, see चीव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीभ्
† चीभ् चीभ्, v. r. of बीभ्, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीय्
† चीय् चीय्, v. r. of चीव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर|चीरं
चीर चीर (perhaps a syncope of चीवर), n.<BR> 1. Bark, Rām. 5, 31, 22; a vesture of bark, Man. 6, 6.<BR> 2. A rag, Kathās. 4, 48; also fem. रा, Rājat. 4, 573.<BR> 3. A cloth, Rām. 2, 37, 10 (कुश-, A cloth of Kuśa grass).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरिन्
चीरिन् चीरिन्, i. e. चीर + इन्, adj. Covered with bark or rags, MBh. 3, 1002.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरी
चीरी चीरी (based on an imitative sound; cf. the next), f. A cricket, Yājñ. 3, 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरीवाक|चीरीवाकः
चीरीवाक चीरीवाक, i. e. चीरी-वच् + अ, m. A cricket, Man. 12, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर्ण|चीर्णं|चीर्ण्ण
चीर्ण चीर्ण, ptcple. of the pf. pass. of चर्, q. cf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीव्
† चीव् चीव्, or चीब्, or चीय्, i. 1, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To take.<BR> 2. To cover. चीव्, i. 10, Par. To shine (or speak).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीवर|चीवरं
चीवर चीवर (perhaps from 1. चि by the affixes वन् + अ), n. The tattered dress of a Buddhist mendicant, MBh. 1, 3638; or of any mendicant, Daśak. in Chr. 191, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुकोपयिषु
चुकोपयिषु चुकोपयिषु, i. e. चुकोपयिष, desiderative of the Causal of कुप्, + उ, adj. Desiring to make wrathful, MBh. 8, 1793.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्क्
