चुक्र|चुक्रं|चुक्रः
चुक्र चुक्र, m. A kind of vinegar, made of fruits, Suśr. 2, 365, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्षोभयिषु
चुक्षोभयिषु चुक्षोभयिषु, i. e. चुक्षोभयिष, desider. of the Causal of क्षुभ्, + उ, adj. Desiring to cause to waver, Man. 7, 1142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुच्चू
चुच्चू चुच्चू, f. A sort of vegetable, Suśr. 1, 219, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0308-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुच्य्
