मृगजीवन|मृगजीवनः
मृग- + जीवन मृग- + जीवन, m. a hunter, Nal. 11, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवनता
जीवनता जीवन + ता, f. Conduct, Lass. 88, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवन्ती
जीवन्ती जीवन्ती, i. e. जीवन्त्, ptcple. pres. of जीव्, + अ + ई, f. A vegetable and medicinal plant, MBh. 2, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवमय
जीवमय जीव + मय, adj., f. यी, Living, Bhāg. P. 9, 9, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवल
जीवल जीवल, m. A proper name, Nal. 15, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीववन्त्|जीववत्
जीववन्त् जीव + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Living, MBh. 8, 4930.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवातु|जीवातुः
जीवातु जीव् + आतु (m. and n.?), Life, Mṛcch. 172, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीविन्
जीविन् जीव् + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Living, Man. 9, 246.<BR> 2. Subsisting on, Rām. 1, 9, 61; especially latter part of comp. words, e. g. कृषि-, adj. Supporting one's self by tillage, Man. 3, 165.<BR> II. m. A living being, Pañc. 68, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीर्घजीविन्
दीर्घ- + जीविन् दीर्घ- + जीविन्, adj. long-lived, Man. 9, 246.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बुद्धिजीविन्
बुद्धि- + जीविन् बुद्धि- + जीविन्, adj. intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलजीविन्
जल- + जीविन् जल- + जीविन्, and मत्स्य-, m. a fisher, MBh. 12, 7427; 1, 1339.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्येनजीविन्
श्येन- + जीविन् श्येन- + जीविन्, m. one who lives by training hawks, a falconer, Man. 3, 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघजीविन्|सङ्घजीविन्
संघ- + जीविन् संघ- + जीविन्, m. a hired labourer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारजीविन्|सञ्चारजीविन्
संचार- + जीविन् संचार- + जीविन्, adj. living in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजीविन्
सुरा- + जीविन् सुरा- + जीविन्, m. a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जु
जु जु, see जू and छ्यु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुगुपिषु
जुगुपिषु जुगुपिषु, i. e. जुगुपिष, desider. of गुप्, + उ, adj. Desiring to protect, MBh. 8, 1737.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुगुप्सा
जुगुप्सा जुगुप्सा, i. e. जुगुप्स, desider. of गुप् (q. cf.), + आ, f. Aversion, MBh. 14, 1733.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजुगुप्स
अ-जुगुप्स अ-जुगुप्स, adj. having no aversion, MBh. 13, 3077.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुङ्ग्|जुंग्
† जुङ्ग् जुङ्ग्, i. 1, Par. To abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुञ्च्
† जुञ्च् जुञ्च्, i. 1 and 10, Par. To speak(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुट्
†<BR> I. जुट् जुट्, or जुड् जुड्, i. 6. Par. To bind.<BR> II. जुड् जुड्, or जुन् जुन्, i. 6, Par. To go.<BR> III. जुड् जुड्, i. 10, Par. To send.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुत्
† जुत् जुत् (= ज्युत्, q. cf.), i. 1, Ātm. To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुन्
† जुन् जुन्, see जुड्<BR> II.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुर्व्
जुर्व् जुर्व्, i. 1, जुर्व, Par.<BR> 1. To hurt.<BR> 2. ved. To burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुल्
† जुल् जुल् (akin to जॄ), i. 10, Par. To grind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुष्
1. जुष् जुष्, i. 6, Ātm. (also Par., Hariv. 7430).<BR> 1. To be pleased, Mārk. P. 31, 49.<BR> 2. To enjoy, MBh. 2, 1718.<BR> 3. To like, MBh. 3, 12732.<BR> 4. To undergo, Bhāg. P. 8, 7, 20.<BR> 5. To frequent, MBh. 3, 2464.<BR> 6. To befall, MBh. 3, 11061. जुष्ट,<BR> 1. Loved, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 87, 1.<BR> 2. Endowed, Bhāg. P. 1, 19, 20.<BR> --Caus. जोषय, To agree, MBh. 14, 1289.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To frequent, MBh. 5, 1040.<BR> --With अव अव, To visit, MBh. 13, 645.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To resolve upon, Hariv. 7431 (precat. Par., or ii. 2, potent.).<BR> --With निस् निस्, निर्जुष्ट, Frequented, Bhāg. P. 4, 6, 21.<BR> --With प्र प्र, प्र-जष्ट, Strongly attached to, Man. 2, 96.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संजुष्ट, Frequented, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b " target="_blank">Page0336-b + 39</a>] MBh. 13, 646.<BR> --Cf. Lat. gustus, gustare; γεύω; Goth. kiusan; A.S. ceosan, also cyssan; Goth. kukjan, cf. with ved. जुज्; cf. कुस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुष्
2. जुष् जुष्, adj.<BR> 1. Loving, attached to, Bhāg. P. 7, 6, 25; especially as latter part of comp. words, e. g. Bhāg. P. 4, 9, 36.<BR> 2. Visiting, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुष्
3. जुष् जुष्, i. 1 and 10, Par.<BR> 1. † To reason or to hurt.<BR> 2. To satisfy.<BR> --Cf. 1. जुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुहोति|जुहोतिः
जुहोति जुहोति, i. e. 3. sing. of the pres. of हु, A technical expression for those sacrifices which are denoted by the term जुहोति, Man. 2, 84, जुहोति-यजति-क्रिया, sacrifices denoted by the terms जुहोति and यजति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जू
जू जू, ii. 9, जुना, नी, Par. (in the native collection of roots, जु, i. 1, Ātm.),<BR> 1. To push on (ved.).<BR> 2. To impel.<BR> --With the prep. प्र प्र, To push on, to impel.<BR> --Ptcple. pf. pass. प्रजवित, Rām. 3, 33, 27; Hariv. 10848.<BR> --Cf. probably Lat. gavi in gaudeo, gavisus sum; γηθέω, ἀγαυός.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जूट|जूटः
जूट जूट, m. The matted hair of Śiva (cf. जटा), Mālat. 1, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाजूट|जटाजूटः
जटा-जूट जटा-जूट, the same, Kathās. 25, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जूर्
जूर् जूर् (akin to जॄ), i. 4, Ātm.<BR> 1. To grow old (appearing in the Veda in the form जुर्, i. 6, and i. 4, जूर्य, Par.).<BR> 2. † To hurt.<BR> 3. To be angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जूष्
† जूष् जूष्, i. 1, Par. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृ
† जृ जृ, i. 1, Par. To subdue(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृभ्
† जृभ् जृभ्, i. 1, Ātm. = जृम्भ्(?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृम्भ्|जृंभ्
जृम्भ् जृम्भ्, i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To yawn, Man. 4, 43.<BR> 2. To open, Kathās. 25, 238.<BR> 3. To snap backwards (of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-a " target="_blank">Page0337-a + 42</a>] a bow), MBh. 5, 1909.<BR> 4. To cause to snap backwards, Rām. 3, 30, 28.<BR> 5. To spread, Hariv. 2556.<BR> 6. To increase, Bhartṛ. 3, 4.<BR> 7. To arise, Rājat. 5, 363.<BR> 8. To revive, to take courage, Rājat. 6, 283; to feel at ease, Hariv. 12073.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. जृम्भित, n.<BR> 1. Yawning, Suśr. 1, 363, 15.<BR> 2. Appearance, Kathās. 26, 89.<BR> --Causal, जृम्भय, To cause to gape, Hariv. 10632.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To gape at, Rām. 6, 2, 18.<BR> --With उद् उद्,<BR> 1. To open wide, Bhāg. P. 1, 6, 16.<BR> 2. To arise, Prab. 10, 2.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्,<BR> 1. To spread, Mṛcch. 84, 24.<BR> 2. To endeavour, Bhartṛ. 2, 6.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To begin to yawn, MBh. 3, 11138.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To gape, Rām. 5, 3, 4.<BR> 2. To open, Bhāg. P. 3, 9, 25.<BR> 3. To spread, Sāh. D. 71, 10; to increase, Vikr. 41, 15.<BR> 4. To snap backwards, MBh. 8, 3984.<BR> 5. To rise, Rām. 5, 2, 34.<BR> 6. To appear, Bhāg. P. 3, 33, 15. विजृम्भित,<BR> 1. Yawning, Hariv. 10635.<BR> 2. Expanded, blossomed.<BR> 3. Sported, wantoned. n.<BR> 1. Wish.<BR> 2. Pastime, sport.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To appear, Rājat. 6, 229.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृम्भ|जृंभ|जृंभं|जृंभः|जृम्भः
जृम्भ जृम्भ् + अ,<BR> I. m. and f. भा, and n.<BR> 1. Yawning, Suśr. 1, 98, 11.<BR> 2. Opening, as a flower, Mālat. 148, 8.<BR> II. m. A kind of animal, Rām. 2, 35, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृम्भक|जृंभकः|जृम्भकः
जृम्भक जृम्भ् + अक,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The name of certain demons, MBh. 3, 14548.<BR> 2. The name of a spell, producing drowsiness, Rām. 1, 30, 7.<BR> II. f. भिका, Yawning, MBh. 5, 282.<BR> III. n. Swelling, Lass. 17, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृम्भण|जृंभण|जृम्भणं
जृम्भण जृम्भण, i. e. जृम्भ् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Causing to gape, Rām. 1, 56, 7. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b " target="_blank">Page0337-b + 42</a>]<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Yawning, Vedāntas. in Chr. 207, 16.<BR> 2. Opening, as a flower, Bhartṛ. 1, 24.<BR> 3. Stretching, Ṛt. 6, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जॄ
जॄ जॄ, i. 1, Par., i. 4, Par. (also Ātm., MBh. 13, 367).<BR> --† ii. 9, जृणा, णी, Par.<BR> 1. To grow old, MBh. 3, 13860.<BR> 2. To be digested, Suśr. 1, 70, 18.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pres. जरन्त्, f. रती, Old, Rājat. 6, 172.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. जीर्ण,<BR> 1. Old, decayed, Bhāg. P. 1, 13, 22; Rām. 3, 11, 9.<BR> 2. Tumbled down, Man. 4, 46.<BR> 3. Rotten, MBh. 3, 678.<BR> 4. Faded, Śāk. d. 170.<BR> 5. Destroyed, MBh. 3, 1939. n. Old age, Rājat. 3, 316.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Caus. and i. 10,<BR> I. जरय, To cause to wax old, Chr. 287, 5 = Rigv. i. 48, 5; Chr. 295, 10 = Rigv. 1, 92, 10; MBh. 7, 5967 (Ātm.).<BR> 2. To consume, Bhāg. P. 3, 25, 33.<BR> 3. To overpower, MBh. 3, 1939.<BR> 4. To digest, Rām. 5, 84, 12.<BR> II. † जारय.<BR> --With the prep. निस् निस्, To grind, Bhāg. P. 6, 12, 29.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To wear out, MBh. 4, 332.<BR> 2. To fade, Suśr. 1, 224, 20.<BR> 3. To wax old, MBh. 1, 5139.<BR> 4. To be digested, Suśr. 2, 178, 14.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To be digested, Suśr. 1, 239, 1.<BR> --Cf. γέρων (= जरन्त्), γεραιός, γραῦς, γραΐς, γῆρας, γῦρις, γίγαρτον, γαργαλίζω, γαγγαλίζω; Lat. granum; Goth. kaurn, ga-krôtôn; O.H.G. korn, kern; Goth. qvairnu; A.S. cweorn, cwyrn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजीर्ण|अजीर्णं
अ- + जीर्ण अ- + जीर्ण, n. indigestion, Man. 4, 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जेतुकाम
जेतुकाम जेतुकाम, i. e. जेतुम्, infin. of जि, -काम, adj. Desiring victory, Rām. 1, 63, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जेतृ
जेतृ जेतृ, i. e. जि + तृ, m., f. त्री, and n.<BR> 1. Conquering, a conqueror, Rām. 3, 38, 13.<BR> 2. A winner in a game, Yājñ. 2, 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जेष्
† जेष् जेष्, i. 1, Ātm. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जेह्
† जेह् जेह् (an old frequentat. of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a " target="_blank">Page0338-a + 40</a>] का), i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To gape (ved.).<BR> 2. † To endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0337-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जै
† जै जै (akin to ज्या), i. 1, Par. To wane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैत्र|जैत्रं|जैत्रः
जैत्र जैत्र, i. e. जेतृ + अ, adj., f. री, Victorious, MBh. 2, 490.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैमिनि|जैमिनिः
जैमिनि जैमिनि, m. The name of a philosopher, the founder of the Pūrva Mīmānsā school, Pañc. ii. d. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैमूत
जैमूत जैमूत, i. e. जीमूत, a proper name, + अ, adj. Relating to Jīmūta, MBh. 5, 3845.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैवातृक|जैवातृकः
जैवातृक जैवातृक, i. e. जीव् + आ + तृ + क, adj. Long-lived, one who may live long, Daśak. 95, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैह्म्य|जैह्म्यं
जैह्म्य जैह्म्य, i. e. जिह्म + य, n. Cheating, Man. 11, 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैह्व्य|जैह्व्यं
जैह्व्य जैह्व्य, i. e. जिह्व + य, n. Delight of the tongue, Bhāg. P. 7, 6, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोष|जोषं|जोषः
जोष जोष, i. e. जुष् + अ, m. Satisfaction (ved.). ˚अम्, adv. Silently, MBh. 2, 2431.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोषण|जोषणं
जोषण जोषण, i. e. जुष् + अन, n. Pleasure, Bhāg. P. 3, 25, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञ|ज्ञः
ज्ञ ज्ञ (vb. ज्ञा), adj., f. ञा.<BR> 1. Knowing, MBh. 12, 12028; particularly as latter part of comp. words, e. g. Man. 4, 102.<BR> 2. Intelligent, Bhāg. P. 7, 8, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. beni-gnus, mali-gnus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञ|अज्ञः
अ- + ज्ञ अ- + ज्ञ, adj. 1. ignorant, Bhartṛ. 2, 3. 2. unreasonable, Pañc. ii. d. 3. 3. foolish, Mṛcch. 24, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मनोज्ञ|मनोज्ञं|मनोज्ञः
मनोज्ञ मनोज्ञ, i. e. मनस्-, adj. beautiful, Lass. 53, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वज्ञ|सर्व्वज्ञ|सर्व्वज्ञः
सर्व- + ज्ञ सर्व- + ज्ञ, adj. omniscient, Bhartṛ. 2, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञता
ज्ञता ज्ञ + ता, f.<BR> 1. Knowledge, Yājñ. 3, 142. When latter part of comp. words, ता is the aff. of the comp., e. g. हय-ज्ञ + ता, Knowledge of horses and their management, Nal. 19, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञप्ति|ज्ञप्तिः
ज्ञप्ति ज्ञप्ति, i. e. ज्ञा, Caus., + ति, f. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-b " target="_blank">Page0338-b + 45</a>] Comprehension, knowing, Kathās. 25, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञंमन्य
ज्ञंमन्य ज्ञंमन्य, i. e. ज्ञ + म्, -मन् + य, adj. Thinking one's self intelligent, Rājat. 3, 491.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञा ज्ञा, ii. 9, जाना, नी, Par. Ātm.<BR> 1. To know, Man. 2, 123; MBh. 3, 2154 (with the gen.).<BR> 2. To be intelligent, Man. 2, 110.<BR> 3. To recognise, Megh. 64; Bhag. 5, 29.<BR> 4. To search, Rām. 3, 51, 1; to investigate, MBh. 4, 962; to learn, Pañc. 4, 17.<BR> 5. To consider, Man. 8, 71; 2, 23.<BR> 6. To perceive, Rām. 1, 42, 1. Anomalous 3 sing. pres. जानते, MBh. 13, 5204; 1 pl. जानीम, 3, 15591; 2 pl. जानथ, 2, 842; 2 pl. imptve. जानत, 2, 2397; 2 sing. impf. Ātm. जानिथास्, 14, 1641; ptcple. of the pres. Ātm. जानमान, 3, 1413.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. ज्ञात,<BR> 1. Known, Mṛcch. 2, 8.<BR> 2. Thought, Pañc. i. d. 123.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass.<BR> 1. ज्ञातव्य, Perceptible, Hariv. 11143.<BR> 2. दुस्-ज्ञेय, adj. Hard to be discerned, Man. 6, 73.<BR> --Caus. ज्ञापय and ज्ञपय,<BR> 1. To declare, MBh. 2, 558.<BR> 2. To teach, MBh. 14, 415.<BR> 3. To report, MBh. 1, 5864.<BR> 4. To address, MBh. 3, 8762. Ptcple of the pf. pass. ज्ञापित and ज्ञप्त. Desider. जिज्ञास,<BR> 1. To desire to know, Rām. 2, 35, 19.<BR> 2. To search, to inquire, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 35.<BR> 3. To get certainty, Kathās. 22, 84.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To grant, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 14.<BR> 2. To promise, Daśak. in Chr. 186, 19.<BR> 3. To permit, give leave, Mālav. 16, 11; Rām. 2, 52, 44.<BR> 4. To pardon, MBh. 1, 7772.<BR> 5. To repent, Rām. 2, 42, 8.<BR> 6. To dismiss, Man. 3, 251.<BR> 7. To take leave, Rām. 2, 37, 4 (with the acc.).<BR> 8. To beg, Rām. 2, 21, 25.<BR> 9. To favour, MBh. 3, 11631.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To ask permission, Man. 4, 122.<BR> 2. To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0339-a " target="_blank">Page0339-a + 41</a>] take leave (with the acc.), Rām. 2, 71, 13.<BR> --With अभ्यनु अभि-अनु,<BR> 1. To approve, Man. 2, 1.<BR> 2. To permit, Man. 3, 243.<BR> 3. To dismiss, Rām. 1, 2, 3.<BR> 4. To take leave, Rām. 3, 12, 7.<BR> 5. To favour, Rām. 3, 36, 19.<BR> --Caus. To take leave, MBh. 1, 6619.<BR> --With प्रत्यभ्यनु प्रति-अभि-अनु, To dismiss, MBh. 12, 13928.<BR> --With प्रत्यनु प्रति-अनु, To spurn, Rām. 2, 87, 16.<BR> --With समनु सम्-अनु,<BR> 1. To approve, MBh. 3, 14824.<BR> 2. To pardon, Rām. 2, 39, 38.<BR> 3. To empower, MBh. 3, 14815; to allow, MBh. 3, 1850.<BR> 4. To dismiss, MBh. 5, 5974.<BR> 5. To favour, MBh. 13, 3603.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To beg, MBh. 1, 6340.<BR> 2. To beg permission, Rām. 2, 40, 2.<BR> 3. To take leave (with the acc.), Rām. 1, 74, 6.<BR> 4. To salute, MBh. 1, 6423.<BR> --With अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To recognise, MBh. 3, 2201.<BR> 2. To perceive, Bhāg. P. 4, 19, 26.<BR> 3. To know, Rām. 6, 94, 15; MBh. 3, 13339.<BR> 4. To think, MBh. 1, 3337.<BR> 5. To approve, MBh. 13, 5871.<BR> 6. To acknowledge, MBh. 1, 3060.<BR> --With प्रत्यभि प्रति-अभि,<BR> 1. To recognise, Prab. 24, 16.<BR> 2. To recover, Kathās. 18, 175.<BR> --With समभि सम्-अभि, To recognise, MBh. 3, 2945.<BR> --With अव अव, To despise, Bhag. 9, 11. अवज्ञात, Accompanied with contempt, Bhag. 17, 22.<BR> --With आ आ, To perceive, MBh. 3, 448; to learn, Rām. 1, 9, 61.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To command, MBh. 2, 2567 (Ātm.); with that which is commanded in the dat., e. g. स्वगृहाय, To command to go home, Pañc. 242, 24.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ,<BR> 1. To recognise, MBh. 4, 1736.<BR> 2. To learn, Lass. 18, 13.<BR> 3. To know, MBh. 3, 680.<BR> --Caus. To command, Mṛcch. 66, 23. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0339-b " target="_blank">Page0339-b + 43</a>]<BR> --With उप उप, desider. To spy, MBh. 13, 3016.<BR> --With समुप सम्-उप, To perceive, to learn, MBh. 12, 5241.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To recognise, Rām. 6, 8, 3.<BR> 2. To learn, MBh. 7, 467. To know, Pañc. 99, 8.<BR> 4. To know exactly, Vikr. 5, 14.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pf. pass. कु-परि-ज्ञात, adj. Imperfectly known, Pañc. v. d. 1.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. अ-परि-ज्ञेय, adj. Incomprehensible, Bhāg. P. 8, 12, 36.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To discern, Bhag. 18, 31.<BR> 2. To know, Bhag. 11, 31. प्रज्ञात, Renowned, Man. 4, 39. अ-प्रज्ञात, adj. Imperceptible, Man. 1, 5.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र,<BR> 1. To discern, MBh. 12, 1872.<BR> 2. To know exactly, MBh. 12, 2319.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति (according to the Grammar. Ātm., except in the seventh signification),<BR> 1. To admit, Man. 8, 139.<BR> 2. To promise (with the acc. and dat. of the promised object), Rām. 2, 109, 24; MBh. 1, 7234; with the gen. of the person to which something is promised, Man. 9, 99; with the dat., MBh. 3, 2135; with the loc., Rām. 1, 75, 7.<BR> 3. To confirm, Sāv. 1, 16.<BR> 4. To affirm, MBh. 2, 842.<BR> 5. To recognise, MBh. 1, 2089.<BR> 6. To perceive, Hariv. 1036.<BR> 7. To remember sorrowfully, MBh. 12, 8438 (Ātm. against the rule).<BR> --With संप्रति सम्-प्रति, To promise, MBh. 7, 2652.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To distinguish, Man. 2, 212.<BR> 2. To know exactly, Man. 5, 121; to know, MBh. 9, 2666.<BR> 3. To inquire, Pañc. 45, 24.<BR> 4. To learn, Pañc. i. d. 430.<BR> 5. To perceive, Rām. 3, 51, 1.<BR> 6. To consider, Man. 9, 32.<BR> 7. To explain, Bhāg. P. 3, 25, 30.<BR> 8. To become learned, Man. 4, 20.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the pres. adj. अ-विजानन्त्, Inconsiderate, Chr. 15, 5.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a " target="_blank">Page0340-a + 43</a>] of the pf. pass. अ-विज्ञात, adj.<BR> 1. Unknown, Man. 4, 129.<BR> 2. Unperceived, Bhāg. P. 1, 13, 16.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. दुस्-विज्ञेय, adj. Difficult to be conceived, MBh. 13, 724.<BR> --Comp. absol. अ-विज्ञाय, Without knowing exactly, Pañc. 57, 3.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To declare, Pañc. 152, 5.<BR> 2. To speak, Rām. 5, 90, 17.<BR> 3. To address, Pañc. 69, 12.<BR> 4. To impart (with acc. of the person and of the object), Rājat. 3, 241.<BR> --Desid. To with to learn, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 2.<BR> --With अभिवि अभि-वि,<BR> 1. To learn, MBh. 1, 1565.<BR> 2. To perceive, Rām. 2, 101, 1.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, To know exactly, Suśr. 1, 342, 3.<BR> --With संवि सम्-वि, To advise, MBh. 12, 2451.<BR> --Caus. To recite, Rājat. 3, 180.<BR> --With सम् सम्, Ātm.<BR> 1. To allot, Bhāg. P. 9, 16, 34.<BR> 2. To understand, Rām. 2, 35, 17.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To satisfy, MBh. 12, 12567.<BR> 2. To quiet an animal destinated to be sacrificed, MBh. 14, 2645.<BR> 3. To speak in signs, Mṛcch. 30, 15.<BR> 4. To command, Hariv. 7056 (संज्ञपन् instead of -ज्ञपयन्).<BR> --Cf. γιγνώσκω, γνῶσις, ἄγνοια, νοῦς, etc.; Lat. nosco, cf. co-gnosco, gnarus, narro; Goth. kunnan, kunths, kunthi; O.H.G. knajan; A.S. cnáwan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञा
अ- + ज्ञा अ- + ज्ञा, without knowing, unknowingly, Man. 4, 140; 11, 155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0338-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञा ज्ञा, for आज्ना after ए and ओ, MBh. 1, 3168; 3, 16308.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञाति|ज्ञातिः
ज्ञाति ज्ञाति, i. e. जन् + आ + ती, m. A paternal relation, Man. 2, 132.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Goth. knôds; Lat. co-gnatus, natio; γνήσιος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञाति|अज्ञातिः
अ- + ज्ञाति अ- + ज्ञाति, m. one who is not a paternal kinsman, Man. 5, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ज्ञाति
निस्- + ज्ञाति निस्- + ज्ञाति, adj. being without kinsmen, MBh. 8, 280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वज्ञाति|स्वज्ञातिः
स्व- + ज्ञाति स्व- + ज्ञाति,<BR> I. f. kindred.<BR> II. m. a kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातित्व
ज्ञातित्व ज्ञाति + त्व, n. Consanguinity, Man. 11, 172.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातृ
ज्ञातृ ज्ञा + तृ, m., f. त्री, n.<BR> 1. One [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b " target="_blank">Page0340-b + 41</a>] who knows, MBh. 13, 7173.<BR> 2. A witness, Man. 8, 57, v. r.<BR> --Cf. Lat. co-gnitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञान|ज्ञानं
ज्ञान ज्ञान, i. e. ज्ञा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Knowledge, Man. 2, 13.<BR> 2. Superior knowledge, Bhag. 3, 3.<BR> 3. Consciousness, MBh. 1, 5827.<BR> 4. Intention, Man. 11, 145.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञान|अज्ञानं
अ- + ज्ञान अ- + ज्ञान,<BR> I. n. 1. ignorance, Pañc. ii. d. 34. 2. inadvertence, Man. 11, 145. Abl. ˚नात्, without one's knowledge, Man. 8, 243.<BR> II. adj., f. ना, ignorant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मज्ञान
आत्मज्ञान आत्मज्ञान, i. e. आत्मन्-, n. the knowledge of the universal soul, Man. 12, 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्ज्ञान
दुस्- + ज्ञान दुस्- + ज्ञान, adj. difficult to be known, MBh. 12, 4026.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानद|ज्ञानदः
ज्ञानद ज्ञान-द, m. One who can impart knowledge, Man. 2, 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानमय|ज्ञानमयः
ज्ञानमय ज्ञान + मय, adj., f. यी, Containing knowledge, Man. 2, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानवन्त्|ज्ञानवत्
ज्ञानवन्त् ज्ञान + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Knowing, Vedāntas. in Chr. 218, 20.<BR> 2. Endowed with superior knowledge, Rām. 6, 102, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानिक
ऽज्ञानिक -ज्ञानिक, i. e. ज्ञान + इक, = ज्ञान, as latter part of a comp. adj. in प्र-नष्ट- (vb. नश्), adj. Without knowledge, Suśr. 1, 8, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानित्व|ज्ञानित्वं
ज्ञानित्व ज्ञानित्व, i. e. ज्ञानिन् + त्व, n. Fortune-telling, Kathās. 19, 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानिन्
ज्ञानिन् ज्ञानिन्, i. e. ज्ञान + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, One who understands fully, Man. 12, 103; learned, Rām. 1, 8, 13.<BR> II. m. An astrologer, a fortune-teller, Rām. 6, 23, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञापक|ज्ञापकः
ज्ञापक ज्ञापक, i. e. ज्ना, Caus., + अक,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A teacher, Bhāg. P. 9, 6, 10.<BR> 2. A master of requests, Pañc. 156, 18 (thus to be read instead of नायक).<BR> II. n. A precept, Rājat. 1, 5; a rule, MBh. 1, 5846.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञापन|ज्ञापनं
ज्ञापन ज्ञापन, i. e. ज्ना, Caus., + अन, n. Notifying, Rājat. 4, 180.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञु
ऽज्ञु -ज्ञु, a substitute for जानु in some comp. words, (cf. ved. ज्ञु-बाध्, ऊर्ध्व-ज्ञु), प्र-ज्ञु, adj. Having the knees far apart.<BR> --Cf. πρόχνυ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञेयत्व
ज्ञेयत्व ज्ञेय + त्व (vb. ज्ञा), n. Capability of being known, Bhāṣāp. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्या
ज्या ज्या, ii. 9, जिना, नी, Par. i. 4, जीय, Ātm. ved.<BR> 1. To overpower (ved.).<BR> 2. To be overpowered (जीय, ved.).<BR> 3. † To decay, to become old. जीन, see separately.<BR> --Cf. βία (= ved. ज्या), βιάω, etc., probably also βῑνέω.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्या
ज्या ज्या, f. A bow-string, MBh. 1, 8193.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. βιός.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्य
स-ज्य स-ज्य, adj. strung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्याय
ज्याय ज्याय, a denominat. derived from the last Ātm. To represent a bow-string, Daśak. 2, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यायंस्
ज्यायंस् ज्या + यंस्, comparat. of प्रशस्य and वृद्ध, f. ज्यायसी,<BR> 1. More powerful (ved.).<BR> 2. Stronger, MBh. 9, 3247.<BR> 3. Superior, Man. 3, 137.<BR> 4. m. A master, Man. 8, 167.<BR> 5. Elder, Man. 2, 139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यायिष्ठ
ज्यायिष्ठ ज्यायिष्ठ, anomal. superl. of प्रशस्य (cf. ज्येष्ठ), Best, MBh. 7, 3701.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यु
† ज्यु ज्यु, i. 1, Ātm. To go, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्युत्
ज्युत् ज्युत् (= द्युत्, q. cf.), i. 1, Ātm. v. r., and † i. 1, Par. v. r., To shine, Indr. 1, 32, v. r.<BR> --Caus. ज्योतय, To illuminate, Indr. 1, 30, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्युतिमन्त्|ज्युतिमत्
ज्युतिमन्त् ज्युति + मन्त् (= द्युति, i. e. दिव् + ति), adj., f. मती, Shining, Indr. 1, 33, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्येष्ठ|ज्येष्ठः
ज्येष्ठ ज्येष्ठ, i. e. ज्या + इष्ठ,<BR> I. superl. of प्रशस्य and वृद्ध (cf. ज्यायंस्), f. ठा,<BR> 1. Most excellent, Man. 9, 123.<BR> 2. Eldest, Man. 9, 126; Daśak. in Chr. 184, 12.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. An elder brother, Man. 4, 184.<BR> 2. = ज्यैष्ठ, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b " target="_blank">Page0341-b + 40</a>] The name of a month, Rājat. 1, 220.<BR> III. f. ठा.<BR> 1. The name of a lunar station, Rām. 6, 86, 43.<BR> 2. Misfortune, Bhāg. P. 1, 17, 32.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्येष्ठ
अ- + ज्येष्ठ अ- + ज्येष्ठ, adj. forfeiting one's primogeniture, Man. 9, 213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्येष्ठम्
यथा-ज्येष्ठ + म् यथा-ज्येष्ठ + म्, adv. according to (their) rank, Pañc. 198, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्येष्ठतर
ज्येष्ठतर ज्येष्ठ + तर, comparat. One of the elder ones, Pañc. 243, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्येष्ठता
ज्येष्ठता ज्येष्ठ + ता. f.<BR> 1. Superiority, Hariv. 7164.<BR> 2. Primogeniture, Man. 9, 134.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्येष्ठत्व
ज्येष्ठत्व ज्येष्ठ + त्व, n. Primogeniture, MBh. 1, 8372.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यैष्ठ|ज्यैष्ठः
ज्यैष्ठ ज्यैष्ठ, i. e. ज्येष्ठा + अ, m. The name of a month, May--June, Man. 8, 245.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यैष्ठिनेय
ज्यैष्ठिनेय ज्यैष्ठिनेय, i. e. ज्येष्ठ + इन् + ई + एय, adj. Borne by the eldest wife of a father, MBh. 2, 1934.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यैष्ठ्य|ज्यैष्ठ्यं
ज्यैष्ठ्य ज्यैष्ठ्य, i. e. ज्येष्ठ + य, n.<BR> 1. Precedence, Man. 9, 85.<BR> 2. Primogeniture, Man. 1, 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यो
† ज्यो ज्यो, i. 1. Ātm.<BR> 1. To restrain.<BR> 2. To vow.<BR> 3. To instruct(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिरीश
ज्योतिरीश ज्योतिरीश, or ज्योतिरीश्वर ज्योतिरीश्वर, i. e. ज्योतिस्-ईश, or -ईश्वर, m. The name of the author of the Dhūrtasamāgama, Lass. 68, 15; 67, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिर्मय
ज्योतिर्मय ज्योतिर्मय, i. e. ज्योतिस् + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of light, Ragh. 15, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिष|ज्योतिषं|ज्योतिषः
ज्योतिष ज्योतिष, i. e. ज्योतिस् + अ,<BR> I. m. A kind of spell, Rām. 1, 30, 6.<BR> II. n. Astronomical science, MBh. 12, 13136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिष्क|ज्योतिष्कः
ज्योतिष्क ज्योतिष्क, i. e. ज्योतिस् + क, n.<BR> 1. The name of a shining weapon of Arjuna's MBh. 7, 1325.<BR> 2. The name of the summit of Meru. MBh. 12, 16212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिष्टोम|ज्योतिष्टोमः
ज्योतिष्टोम ज्योतिष्टोम, i. e. ज्योतिस्-स्तोम, m. One of the great sacrifices in which especially the juice of the Soma is offered, Rām. 1, 13, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिस्
ज्योतिस् ज्योतिस्, i. e. ज्युत् + इस्, n. Light, Chr. 289, 10 = Rigv. i. 50, 10; Man. 1, 77.<BR> 2. pl. The stars. Man. 1, 38.<BR> 3. Intelligence, Bhag. 13, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्ज्योतिस्
अन्तर्- + ज्योतिस् अन्तर्- + ज्योतिस्, adj. one whose light (i. e. thought) is fixed on his soul (not on external pleasures), Bhag. 5, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योतिस्
स- + ज्योतिस् स- + ज्योतिस्, adj., n. the time during which the sun or the stars give light, Man. 5, 82 (viz., when a king dies at day-time the impurity lasts till sunset, when he dies at night till the disappearance of the stars).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतीरथ|ज्योतीरथः
ज्योतीरथ ज्योतीरथ, i. e. ज्योतिस्-रथ,<BR> I. m. A kind of snake, Suśr. 2, 265, 20.<BR> II. f. था, The name of a river, MBh. 6, 334.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतीरस
ज्योतीरस ज्योतीरस, i. e. ज्योतिस्-रस, m. A kind of jewel, Rām. 2, 94, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योत्स्ना
ज्योत्स्ना ज्योत्स्ना, i. e. ज्युत् + स्न, f.<BR> 1. Moonlight, Bhāg. P. 4, 28, 34.<BR> 2. Light, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 21 (pl.)<BR> 3. The name of a body of Brahman, Bhāg. P. 3, 20, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योत्स्नावन्त्|ज्योत्स्नावत्
ज्योत्स्नावन्त् ज्योत्स्ना + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Moonlight (night), Ragh. 6, 34.<BR> 2. Shining, Bhāg. P. 4, 21, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्रि
1. ज्रि ज्रि, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. † To conquer.<BR> 2. To go (ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्रि
† 2. ज्रि ज्रि, and ज्री ज्री, i. 1, ii. 9, ज्रिणा, णी, and i. 10, ज्रायय, Par. To grow old, v. r.<BR> --Cf. जॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वर्
ज्वर् ज्वर् (cf. ज्वल्), i. 1, Par. To be feverish, Suśr. 2, 84, 13 (pass.).<BR> --Caus. ज्वरय, To cause to be feverish.<BR> --With the prep. सम् सम्, To be afflicted, MBh. 3, 13743.<BR> --With अनुसम् [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b " target="_blank">Page0342-b + 43</a>] अनु-सम्,<BR> 1. To afflict, MBh. 5, 1607.<BR> 2. To envy, MBh. 5, 1605.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To envy, MBh. 5, 1615.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वर|ज्वरः
ज्वर ज्वर् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Excited, MBh. 13, 3464.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Fever, MBh. 12, 10255.<BR> 2. Sorrow, Rām. 1, 18, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गतज्वर
गत- + ज्वर गत- + ज्वर, adj., f. रा, without sorrow, Rām. 6, 98, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीर्णज्वर|जीर्णज्वरः
जीर्ण- + ज्वर जीर्ण- + ज्वर (vb. जॄ), m. a lingering fever, Suśr. 1, 175, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीर्णामयज्वर
जीर्णामय- + ज्वर जीर्णामय- + ज्वर, i. e. जीर्ण-आमय-, m. the same, Kathās. 17, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाहज्वर|दाहज्वरः
दाह- + ज्वर दाह- + ज्वर, m. a burning fever, Kathās. 5, 122; Daśak. in Chr. 192, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनज्वर|मैथुनज्वरः
मैथुन- + ज्वर मैथुन- + ज्वर, m. wantonness, MBh. 13, 1516.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथज्वर|रथज्वरः
रथ- + ज्वर रथ- + ज्वर, m. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरित|ज्वरितः
ज्वरित ज्वरित, i. e. ज्वर + इत, adj., f. ता, Feverish, Suśr. 2, 409, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरिन्
ज्वरिन् ज्वरिन्, i. e. ज्वर + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Feverish, Suśr. 1, 34, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वल्
ज्वल् ज्वल् (= ज्वर्), i. 1, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., Hariv. 7914),<BR> 1. To blaze, MBh. 1, 3687 (Ātm.).<BR> 2. To shine, Suśr. 1, 113, 16.<BR> 3. To burn, Pañc. 98, 1.<BR> 4. To be consumed by fire, Bhāg. P. 9, 6, 23.<BR> 5. To be red hot, Man. 8, 271.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. ज्वलित,<BR> 1. Flaming, Pañc. i. d. 37; Indr. 1, 6.<BR> 2. Shining, Rām. 3, 50, 18.<BR> 3. Burnt. Chr. 24, 40 (ट्रिणेषु ज्वलितं त्वया, You have burnt up only grass, i. e. You have fought only with insignificant men).<BR> --Caus. ज्वालय and ज्वलय, after prep. only the latter (also ज्वालय, e. g. MBh. 3, 17078),<BR> 1. To kindle, Rām. 2, 52, 99.<BR> 2. To illuminate, Kir. 5, 14. अग्नि-ज्वलित, Blazing with fire, Man. 7, 90. Frequent. जाज्वल् and जाज्वल्य,<BR> 1. To burn violently, MBh. 12, 11597.<BR> 2. To flame violently, Rām. 4, 38, 15.<BR> 3. To be very brilliant, Rām. 6, 19, 49.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि, To shine, MBh. 3, 10335.<BR> --Frequent. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a " target="_blank">Page0343-a + 39</a>] To blaze powerfully, Kām. Nītis. 15, 8.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To flash up, Rām. 5, 93, 15.<BR> --Caus. To kindle, Rājat. 3, 176.<BR> --With प्रोद् प्र-उद्, To shine brightly, Hariv. 15696.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, The same, MBh. 8, 1715.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To being to blaze, Rām. 3, 18, 32.<BR> 2. To begin to burn, MBh. 1, 1770.<BR> 3. To become wrathful, Rām. 2, 21, 53.<BR> 4. To blaze brightly, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 15. प्रज्वलित,<BR> 1. Burning, Chr. 33, 5.<BR> 2. Shining, Hariv. 9746.<BR> 3. Flaming, Pañc. 55, 10. n. Blazing, Hariv. 3293.<BR> --Caus. To kindle, Rām. 2, 47, 8.<BR> --With अभिप्र अभि-प्र, To become inflamed, MBh. 6, 4188.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, The same, Rām. 6, 96, 17; Hariv. 6475.<BR> --Caus. To kindle, MBh. 13, 7776.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To shine, MBh. 7, 7437.<BR> --With अभिवि अभि-वि, To shine towards, Bhag. 11, 28.<BR> --With मस् सम्, To blaze, MBh. 9, 222.<BR> --Caus. To kindle, MBh. 3, 16882.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. quelan; A.S. cwellan; Goth. vulan; A.S. wellian; Lat. bullire; O.H.G. quellan, cf. A.S. weall (a well); ζῆλος (cf. अनु-सम्-ज्वर्, and अभि-सम्-ज्वर्), probably also ζάλη, ζαλαίνω.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0342-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वल|ज्वलः
ज्वल ज्वल् + अ, adj. f. ला, Flaming, Hiḍ. 2, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलन|ज्वलनः
ज्वलन ज्वल् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Shining, MBh. 3, 12239.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Fire, Man. 10, 103.<BR> 2. Caustic potash, Suśr. 2, 125, 17.<BR> III. n. Shining (and fire), Śiś. 9, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वाल|ज्वालः
ज्वाल ज्वाल, i. e. ज्वल् + अ, m. and f. ला, Flame, MBh. 3, 14132; Ragh. 15, 16.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तज्वाल|सप्तज्वालः
सप्तज्वाल सप्तज्˚, i. e. सप्तन्-, m. Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमज्वाल|हेमज्वालः
हेमज्वाल हेमज्˚, i. e. हेमन्-, m. fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालिन्
ज्वालिन् ज्वालिन्, i. e. ज्वाल + इन्, adj. Flaming, MBh. 13, 1171.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झंकार|झङ्कार|झंकारः|झङ्कारः
झंकार झंकार, i. e. झम्, an imitative sound, -कार, m. Humming, Bhāg. P. 8, 8, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झंकारित
झंकारित झंकारित, i. e. झम्-कारित (ptcple. pf. pass. of the Caus. of कृ; cf. the last), n. Humming, Bhartṛ. 1, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झञ्झा|झंझा
झञ्झा झञ्झा, i. e. probably a reduplicated form of झम् (cf. झंकार), f. A sharp clanging sound, Amar, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झट्
झट् झट्, i. 1, Par. To be entangled; cf. जट्.<BR> --With the prep. उद् उद्, उज्झटित, Confused, Rājat. 1, 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झटिति
झटिति झटिति, i. e. झटत् (?), probably based on an imitative sound, -इति, adv. Instantly, in a moment, Bhartṛ. i. 69; on a sudden, Daśak. in Chr. 186, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झणझण|झणझणं
झणझण झणझण, a reduplicated form of the imitative sound झणत् (cf. इहणत्कार), Tinkling, Kathās. 25, 222.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झणत्कार|झणत्कारः
झणत्कार झणत्-कार (see the last), m. Tinkling, Prab. 40, 6, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झनज्झना
झनज्झना झनज्झना, a reduplicated form of an imitative sound झनत् (cf. झणत्कार ?). The sound caused by the flapping of an elephant's ear, Kām. Nītis. 1, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झम्
† झम् झम्, i. 1, Par. To eat.<BR> --Cf. जम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झम्प|झंप|झंपः|झम्पः
झम्प झम्प, m. Jumping, Hit. 63, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झरी
झरी झरी (probably a form of a [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a " target="_blank">Page0344-a + 36</a>] derivative from क्षर्), f. A waterfall, Prab. 73, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0343-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्च्
† झर्च् झर्च्, झर्छ् झर्छ्, झर्झ् झर्झ्, i. 1, and 6, Par.<BR> 1. To explain.<BR> 2. To menace.<BR> 3. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्झर|झर्झरः
झर्झर झर्झर, i. e. झर्झर्, a reduplicated form of an imitative sound, + अ, m. and f. री, A kind of drum, MBh. 6, 4463; Rām. 6, 99, 23 (but Sch., A flute); Hariv. 13212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झर्झरिन्
झर्झरिन् झर्झरिन्, i. e. झर्झर + इन्, adj. Provided with a drum, MBh. 12, 10406.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झलज्झला
झलज्झला झलज्झला, i. e. a reduplicated form of झलत्, an imitative sound, and aff. अ, f. The sounding of falling drops, Amar. 9, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झल्ल|झल्लः
झल्ल झल्ल, m. A prize-fighter, considered as the son of an outcaste Kṣatriya, MBh. 2, 102; Man. 10, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झष्
† झष् झष्, i. 1, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To take.<BR> 2. To cover.<BR> --i. 1, Par. To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झष|झषं|झषः
झष झष, m.<BR> 1. A fish, MBh. 1, 8316.<BR> 2. The sign Pisces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्लि|झिल्लिः
झिल्लि झिल्लि, झिल्लिका झिल्लि + का, and झिल्ली झिल्ली, f. A cricket, Hariv. 3497; Rām. 1, 26, 13; Bhāg. P. 5, 13, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्लीक|झिल्लीकः
झिल्लीक झिल्ली + क, m. A cricket, MBh. 1, 2849.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झूष्
† झूष् झूष्, v. r. for जूष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झॄ
† झॄ झॄ, i. 4, झीर्य; ii. 9, झृणा, णी, m. To grow old, v. r.<BR> --Cf. जॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झोड|झोडः
झोड झोड, m. The betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झौलिक
झौलिक झौलिक, i. e. झोड + इक, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b " target="_blank">Page0344-b + 35</a>] A little pouch containing betel, Dhūrtas. 95, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झ्यु
† झ्यु झ्यु, i. 1, Par. To go, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्कदेश|टक्कदेशः
टक्कदेश टक्क-देश, m. The land of the Ṭakkas, Rājat. 5, 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्कर|टक्करः
टक्कर टक्कर, A kind of musical sound(?), or a drum, Rājat. 5, 417.<BR> --Cf. करोटिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्क्|टंक्
टङ्क् टङ्क्, i. 1(?), and 10, Par.<BR> 1. † To bind.<BR> 2. To cover (ved.).<BR> --With the prep. वि वि, वितङ्कित,<BR> 1. Marked, Bhāg. P. 1, 16, 36.<BR> 2. Loaded, Bhāg. P. 4, 4, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्क|टंक|टंकं|टंकः|टङ्कः
टङ्क टङ्क,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. A hatchet, Hariv. 5009.<BR> 2. Slope, Bhaṭṭ. 1, 8 (Sch.).<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A weight equal to 4 māṣas, Lass. 29, 4.<BR> 2. (and n?) A coin, Hit. 98, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कवन्त्|टङ्कवत्
टङ्कवन्त् टङ्क + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Sloping, Rām. 3, 55, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टंकार|टङ्कार|टंकारः|टङ्कारः
टंकार टंकार, i. e. तम्, an imitative sound, -कार, m. Howling, Bhāg. P. 3, 17, 9; sound, Rājat. 5, 417(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टंकारित
टंकारित टंकारित, i. e. टम्-कारित (ptcple. pf. pass. of the Caus. of कृ; cf. the last), m. Humming, Bhartṛ. 1, 97, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टल्
† टल् टल्, i. 1, Par. To be confused, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टांकार
टांकार टांकार, v. l. for तंकार, Rājat. 5, 417.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टांकृत
टांकृत टांकृत, i. e. टाम्-कृत (vb. कृ), Sound, Rājat. 2, 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिक्
† टिक् टिक्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0344-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिट्टिभ|टिट्टिभः
टिट्टिभ टिट्टिभ,<BR> 1. m. A bird, Parra jacuna, or goensis, Pañc. 74, 17.<BR> 2. f. भी, Its female, Rām. 2, 8, 43 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप्
† टिप् टिप्, i. 10, Par. To cast, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टीक्
टीक् टीक्, i. 1, Ātm. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टीका
टीका टीका, f. A commentary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टौक्
टौक् टौक् (a form of त्रौक्), i. 1, Ātm. To go, to approach, v. r.<BR> --Cf. ढौक्, with उप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ट्वल्
† ट्वल् ट्वल्, i. 1, Par. To be confused, v. r.<BR> --Cf. द्वल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठक्कुर|ठक्कुरः
ठक्कुर ठक्कुर, m. A deity, a honorary title, Rājat. 7, 536.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डप्
† डप् डप्, i. 10, डापय, Ātm. To collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्
डम् डम्, i. 1 or 6. Par. To sound, Prab. 55, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरिन्
डमरिन् डमरिन् and डमरु डमरु, m. A kind of drum, Bhāg. P. 8, 10, 7; Prab. 55, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्प्|डंप्
† डम्प् डम्प्, v. r. for डप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्ब्|डंब्
डम्ब् डम्ब्, i. 10, Par. To cast.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि,<BR> 1. To imitate, Ragh. 4, 17.<BR> 2. To simulate, Hariv. 8406.<BR> 3. To deride, to sneer, Hariv. 1.<BR> 4. To deceive, Bhartṛ. 1, 21. विडम्बित, Low, poor, distressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्बर|डंबर|डम्बरः
डम्बर डम्बर,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Renowned, Mālat. 3, 8, Lass. वाच्- [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b " target="_blank">Page0345-b + 37</a>] m. Graceful and eloquent language.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A proper name, MBh. 9, 2541.<BR> 2. A mass, assemblage (as of blossoms), Mālat. 48, last l.. 148, 8; (of clouds), Mahāvīr. 99, 17; Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्भ्|डंभ्
डम्भ् डम्भ्, v. r. of डप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकिनी
डाकिनी डाकिनी (probably a form of शाकिनी), f. A kind of female demon, Kathās. 18, 147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकिनीत्व
डाकिनीत्व डाकिनी + त्व, n. The character of a Ḍākinī, Daśak. 164, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डांकृति
डांकृति डांकृति, i. e. डाम्, an imitative sound, -कृति, f. Sound, Prab. 55, 6.<BR> --Cf. तांकृत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामर|डामरः
डामर डामर,<BR> 1. m. An object causing surprise, Gīt. 12, 23.<BR> 2. The name of a people, Rājat. 5, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डिम|डिंडिम|डिंडिमः|डिण्डिमः
डिण्डिम डिण्डिम, m. A kind of drum, Rām. 5, 13, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिप्
† डिप् डिप्, डिम्प् डिम्प्, i. 10, Ātm. To collect. डिप् डिप्, i. 4; 6 and 10, Par., and डिम्ब् डिम्ब्, i. 10, Ātm. To cast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्ब|डिंब|डिम्बं|डिंबः|डिम्बः
डिम्ब डिम्ब, m.<BR> 1. An affray, conflict, MBh. 1, 1219; a battle without king, i. e. after the king has been slain (?), Man. 5, 95.<BR> 2. An egg or ball, Mālat. 148, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भ्
† डिम्भ् डिम्भ्, i. 10, Ātm. To collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भ|डिंभ|डिंभः|डिम्भः
डिम्भ डिम्भ, m. and f. भा, A child, Śāk. p. 103, 11 (Prākṛ.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डी
डी डी (akin to 1. दी, q. cf.), i. 1 and 4, Ātm. To fly.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. डिन, n. Flying, the flight of a bird, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> --With the prep. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a " target="_blank">Page0346-a + 36</a>] अति अति, अतिडीन, n. Flying over, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR> --With अभि अभि, अभिडीन, n. Flying towards, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR> --With अव अव, अवडीन, n. Flying down, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> --With उद् उद्, To fly up, Pañc. 106, 1. उड्डीन, Flown up, MBh. 7, 776. n.<BR> 1. Flying up, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> 2. The flight of a bird, Pañc. 114, 25.<BR> --With प्रोद् प्र-उद्, To fly up and away, Mṛcch. 84, 22. प्रोड्डीन, Flown up and away, Rām. 4, 63, 24.<BR> --With नि नि, निडीन, n. Flying down, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> --With परा परा, परा-डीन, n. Flying away, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR> --With परि परि, परिडीन, n. Flying round, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR> --With प्र प्र, प्रडीन, Flown forth, Rām. 6, 83, 26; n. Flying forward, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> --With वि वि, विडीन, n. Flying apart, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संडीन, n. Flying together, MBh. 8, 1899.<BR> --With अवसम् अव-सम्, अवसंदीन, n. Flying down together, MBh. 8, 1901.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0345-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डीनक
डीनक डीन + क (vb. डी) in डीन-डीनक, A kind of flying, MBh. 8, 1900.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुण्डुभ|डुंडुभ|डुंडुभः|डुण्डुभः
डुण्डुभ डुण्डुभ, m. A kind of lizard, Amphisbæna, MBh. 1, 984.<BR> --Cf. दुण्डुभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डोम्ब
डोम्ब डोम्ब, m. A man of a low caste, who gains his livelihood by singing and dancing, Rājat. 5, 353.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डौण्डुभ
डौण्डुभ डौण्डुभ, i. e. डुण्डुभ + अ, n. The body of a ḍuṇḍubha, MBh. 1, 1006.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ड्वल्
ड्वल् ड्वल्, Caus. ड्वालय, with the prep. आ आ, To mix (ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्क|ढक्कः
ढक्क ढक्क,<BR> 1. m. A kind of sacred edifice(?), Rājat. 5, 305.<BR> 2. f. का, A large drum Rājat. 6, 133.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौक्
ढौक् ढौक् (a form of त्रौक्), i. 1, Ātm. To approach, Śāk. 63, 14 C.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To offer, Rājat. 3, 445.<BR> 2. To procure, Kathās. 26, 7.<BR> --With the prep. उप उप, Caus.<BR> 1. To offer, Hit. 67, 20, v. r. उप टौकयामः.<BR> 2. To perform, Pañc. 158, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौकन|ढौकनं
ढौकन ढौक् + अन, n. Bestowing, Rājat. 6, 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंस्
तंस् तंस्, i. 1 and 10, Par. 1. To shake (ved.).<BR> 2. † To adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्
तक् तक्,<BR> 1. ii. 2, Par. Ātm. ved. To start.<BR> 2. † i. 1, Par. To laugh, or to endure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्र|तक्रं
तक्र तक्र, i. e. तञ्च् + र n. Buttermilk mixed with water, Man. 8, 326.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्ष्
तक्ष् तक्ष्, i. 1, Par. (also Ātm.), and ii. 5, तक्ष्णु, Par.<BR> 1. To slice (wood), MBh. 5, 4161.<BR> 2. To cut to pieces, to wound, MBh. 3, 1585.<BR> 3. To prepare, to form (ved.).<BR> 4. † To cover with a hide.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, To sharpen, Chr. 292, 3 = Rigv. i. 86, 3.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To cut to pieces, to wound, MBh. 6, 3725.<BR> --Cf. Lat. tignum; O.H.G. dehsa (an axe), dîhsila; A.S. thixl, thisl; Lat. temo, and probably O.H.G. dahs (a badger); τάσσω; see तक्षन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षक|तक्षकः
तक्षक तक्ष् + अक m. A cutter, a wood-cutter, Rām. 2, 80, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षण|तक्षणं
तक्षण तक्षण, i. e. तक्ष् + अन, n. Planing, Man. 5, 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0346-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षन्
तक्षन् तक्ष् + अन्, m. A carpenter, Man. 4, 210 (read तक्ष्णो वा).<BR> --Cf. τέκτων.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षशिला
तक्षशिला तक्षशिला, f. The name of a town, Τάξιλα, Rām. 4, 43, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगर|तगरं|तगरः
तगर तगर, n. An ornamental plant, Tabernæmontana coronaria, and an aromatic powder made of it, MBh. 13, 5042.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्क्|तंक्
† तङ्क् तङ्क्, i. 1, Par. To live in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्ग्|तंग्
† तङ्ग् तङ्ग्, i. 1, Par.<BR> 1. To go.<BR> 2. To stumble.<BR> 3. To shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तज्ज्ञ|तज्ज्ञः
तज्ज्ञ तज्ज्ञ, i. e. तद्-ज्ञ, m.<BR> 1. Knowing that, a connoisseur, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 20.<BR> 2. Versed in, Hariv. 8427.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्च्|तंच्
तञ्च् तञ्च्,<BR> 1. ii. 7, तनच्, तञ्च्, Par. To contract.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ and अभ्या अभि-आ, To curdle (ved.).<BR> 2. † i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्ज्|तंज्
तञ्ज् तञ्ज्, v. r. of 1. तञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट्
तट् तट्, i. 1 or 6, Par. To groan (ved.).<BR> --† i. 1. To rise; i. 10, ताटय, Par. v. r. of 1. तड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट तट,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Slope, MBh. 1, 1567.<BR> 2. Horizon, Kathās. 26, 26.<BR> II. m. and f. टी, and n.<BR> 1. A bank, MBh. 13, 1334.<BR> 2. Often without a special signification as latter part of a comp. whose former part denotes a portion of the human body, e. g. अधर-, The lips, Gīt. 4, 23; कटि-, The hip, Indr. 2, 32; कण्ठ-, The throat, Rājat. 5, 1; जघन-, The buttocks, Bhartṛ. 1, 49; ललाट-, The forehead, Śiś. 9, 28; श्रवण-, The ear, Ṛt. 5, 13; स्तन-, The bosom, Amar. 21.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतट|अतटः
अ- + तट अ- + तट, adj. steep, Śāk. d. 137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्तट
दिश्- + तट दिश्- + तट, m. the end of the horizon, Rājat. 3, 253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुमतट
विद्रुम- + तट विद्रुम- + तट, adj. f. ता, having banks of coral, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थ|तटस्थं|तटस्थः
तटस्थ तट-स्थ, adj. Indifferent, Mālat. 7, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाक|तटाकं|तटाकः
तटाक तटा + क, cf. तट, m. and n. A pond, Rām. 2, 68, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनी
तटिनी तटिनी, i. e. तट + इन् + ई, f. A river, Rājat. 3, 339.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमरतटिनी
अ-मर- + तटिनी अ-मर- + तटिनी, f. a name of the Gaṅgā, Bhartṛ. 3, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट्य|तट्यः
तट्य तट्य, i. e. तट + य, adj. Dwelling on slopes, MBh. 12, 10381.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
1. तड् तड् (a form of तृद्, based on the original form तर्द्), i. 10, ताडय (anom. pf. तताड, Bhāg. P. 6, 12, 1), Par.<BR> 1. To strike, Man. 4, 169.<BR> 2. To chastise, Man. 4, 164.<BR> 3. To wound, MBh. 1, 5302.<BR> 4. Pass. To beat, Suśr. 1, 265, 15.<BR> 5. To play a musical instrument, Varāh. Bṛh. S. 45, 61.<BR> --With the prep. अभि अभि,<BR> 1. To strike, MBh. 7, 531.<BR> 2. To wound, Rām. 2, 36, 13.<BR> --With आ आ, To strike. Pañc. 235, 23.<BR> --With परि परि, To touch, Kathās. 6, 114.<BR> --With प्र प्र, To strike, MBh. 8, 4693.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To strike in one's turn, MBh. 13, 4562.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To cast, Pañc. 263, 8.<BR> 2. To wound, MBh. 8, 1067.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To strike, MBh. 7, 3401.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
† 2. तड् तड्, i. 10, ताडय, Par. To shine, or speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाक|तडाकः
तडाक तडाक, m. and n. A pond.<BR> --Cf. तटाक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाकिन्
तडाकिन् तडाकिन्, i. e. तडाक + इन्, adj., f. नी, Provided with ponds, MBh. 3, 16088.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाग|तडागं|तडागः
तडाग तडाग, m. and n. A pond, Man. 4, 203.<BR> --Cf. तडाक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडागवन्त्|तडागवत्
तडागवन्त् तडाग + वन्त्, adj., f. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a " target="_blank">Page0348-a + 41</a>] वती, Provided with ponds, MBh. 13, 2973.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0347-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्
तडित् तड् + इत्, f. Lightning, Kir. 5, 46.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेन्द्रायुधतडित्
सेन्द्रायुध- + तडित् सेन्द्रायुध- + तडित्, i. e. स-इन्द्र-आयुध, adj. with a rainbow and lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्वन्त्|तडित्वत्
तडित्वन्त् तडित् + वन्त्, adj.<BR> 1. Containing lightnings, Kir. 5, 4.<BR> 2. Flashing, Vikr. d. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिन्मय
तडिन्मय तडिन्मय, i. e. तडित् + मय, adj. Resembling lightning, Kumāras. 5, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्ड्|तंड्
† तण्ड् तण्ड् (akin to तड्), i. 1, Ātm. To strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुल|तंडुल|तंडुलः|तण्डुलः
तण्डुल तण्ड् + उल, m. Grain after threshing and winnowing, especially rice Pañc. 104, 20; Rām. 3, 76, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
तत तत, m. The father, Bhāg. P. 4, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्
ततस् त + तस् (cf. तद्), adv.<BR> 1. = the abl. of तद्, Man. 4, 82; with preceding यतस्, Indiscriminately (literally, From whomsoever), Man. 4, 15.<BR> 2. From that place, Sāv. 5, 78. यतस्-यतस्--ततस्-ततस्, Wherever--from that place, Bhāg. P. 7, 15, 13.<BR> 3. Thither, Rām. 1, 44, 34. यतस्-यतस्--ततस्-ततस्, Wherever--thither, Śāk. d. 23.<BR> 4. ततस्-ततस्, Everywhere, Rām. 1, 35, 18.<BR> 5. इतस्-ततस्, From here and there, Rām. 6, 96, 2; here and there, 3, 61, 16.<BR> 6. यतस्-ततस्, From wherever, Pañc. i. d. 6.<BR> 7. Afterwards, then, Man. 2, 60.<BR> 8. Therefore, MBh. 12, 13626.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततामह|ततामहः
ततामह ततामह, i. e. तत-महन्त्, m. A grandfather, Bhāg. P. 6, 9, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
तति तति, i. e. तन् + ति, f. A troop, Śāk. d. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्व|तत्त्वं
तत्त्व तत्त्व (often तत्व), i. e. तद् + त्व,<BR> 1. The very essence, Man. 4, 92; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b " target="_blank">Page0348-b + 43</a>] Bhag. 18, 1.<BR> 2. Truth, Śāk. d. 22.<BR> 3. A principle (especially the 25 of the Sānkhya philosophy), Rām. 3, 53, 42. Instr. त्वेन,<BR> 1. Truly, Rām. 1, 48, 13.<BR> 2. Thoroughly, Man. 7, 68.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निस्तत्त्व
निस्- + तत्त्व निस्- + तत्त्व, adj. not contained in the principles, MBh. 12, 11480.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातत्त्वम्
यथा-तत्त्व + म् यथा-तत्त्व + म् adv. truly, Chr. 17, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सतत्त्व|सतत्त्वं
स- + तत्त्व स- + तत्त्व,<BR> I. adj. knowing the real essence, Vedāntas. in Chr. 219, 3.<BR> II. n. natural property, nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वतस्
तत्त्वतस् तत्त्व + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. According to the principles, Man. 8, 229.<BR> 2. Truly, Man. 8, 32.<BR> 3. From the bottom, Man. 7, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्ववन्त्|तत्त्ववत्
तत्त्ववन्त् तत्त्व + वन्त्, adj. Possessing the principles or reality, MBh. 12, 11480.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्र
तत्र त + त्र (cf. तद्), adv.<BR> I. = the loc. of तद्,<BR> 1. In that, Man. 3, 60.<BR> 2. ऽअत्र-तत्र, On that continually, Nal. 5, 9.<BR> 3. On account of that, Nal. 18, 10.<BR> 4. यत्र-तत्र, For every trifle, MBh. 13, 514.<BR> II. There, Man. 7, 146.<BR> III. Thither, Nal. 7, 1.<BR> IV. तत्र-तत्र, Here and there, Man. 7, 81.<BR> V. यत्र-तत्र, Indiscriminately (literally, Wherever), MBh. 13, 3686.<BR> VI. Thereby, Man. 8, 34.<BR> VII. Then Man. 8, 238.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रत्य|तत्रत्यः
तत्रत्य तत्र + त्य, adj. Being there, Bhāg. P. 3, 31, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्व|तत्वं
तत्व तत्व, see तत्त्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथा
तथा त + था (see तद्), adv.<BR> 1. So, correl. to यथा, As, Man. 3, 258; correl. to इव, Man. 3, 181.<BR> 2. Thus, in that manner, Man. 1, 4.<BR> 3. यथा-तथा, By all means, Man. 4, 17.<BR> 4. यथा-यथा--तथा-तथा, As far--so far, Man. 4, 20; in proportion, 8, 285; the more--the more, Nal. 8, 14.<BR> 5. Yes, Rām. 1, 2, 22.<BR> 6. So, in an oath, correl. to यथा, e. g. यथा नान्यं वरं ध्यायामि कं चन त्वाम् ऋते--तथा मूर्धानम् आ लभे, I touch my head, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a " target="_blank">Page0349-a + 44</a>] in token that I have not thought of any bridegroom beside thee, Chr. 7, 16.<BR> 7. Also, and, Man. 1, 24.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथम्
यथा-तथ + म् यथा-तथ + म्, adv. Properly, suitably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथम्
अ-यथा-तथ + म् अ-यथा-तथ + म्, adv. without fruit, Man. 3, 240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितथ|वितथं
वि-तथ वि-तथ, adj. false, Man. 8, 118; with कृ, To annul, 9, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितथम्
वितथम् ˚थम्, adv. Falsely, 8, 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवितथ|अवितथं
अ-वितथ अ-वितथ,<BR> I. adj. true.<BR> II. n. truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाविधेय
तथाविधेय तथाविधेय, i. e. तथा-विध + एय (see विधा), adj. Being thus, MBh. 4, 246.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्य|तथ्यं
तथ्य तथ्य, i. e. तथा + य,<BR> I. adj. True, MBh. 7, 2136.<BR> II. n. Truth, Rām. 2, 34, 23.<BR> III. instr. येन, Truly, MBh. 8, 274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्यतस्
तथ्यतस् तथ्य + तस्, adv. Truly, Rājat. 1, 325.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् तद्, except the nom. sing. m. and f., the base of the m. and n. and most derivatives is त, of the f. ता; the nom. sing. m. is सस्, f. सा.<BR> I. third personal pronoun,<BR> 1. He, she, it, that, Man. 2, 234; 8, 11.<BR> 2. Combined with the pronouns of the first, second, and third persons, Here, MBh. 1, 6415; 5, 5957; Hiḍ. 1, 38.<BR> 3. Combined with the relative pronoun,<BR> a. Without a special signification, MBh. 7, 427.<BR> b. Every one, MBh. 13, 1674; whoever, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2429.<BR> c. with वा, This or that, Man. 12, 68.<BR> 4. Repeated, This and that, Man. 12, 74; with following एव, The same, Rām. 3, 50, 28.<BR> 5. यद्-यद्--तद्-तद्, Whatever, that, Man. 4, 159.<BR> II. n. The universe, Rām. 6, 102, 25.<BR> III. acc. sing. n. तद्, adverbially,<BR> 1. Then, Pañc. 48, 3.<BR> 2. Therefore, Man. 9, 41.<BR> IV. instr. तेन,<BR> 1. Thus, Man. 4, 178.<BR> 2. Therefore, Man. 7, 36.<BR> V. abl. तस्मात्, Therefore, Man. 1, 108.<BR> --Cf. ὁ, ἡ, τό; Lat. te, ta, tud in iste, etc.; Goth. sa, so, thata; A.S. se, seo, thaet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदा
तदा त + दा, see तद्, adv.<BR> 1. Then, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b " target="_blank">Page0349-b + 40</a>] Nal. 1, 25; at that time, Man. 1, 52.<BR> 2. From that time, MBh. 13, 2231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदात्व|तदात्वं
तदात्व तदा + त्व, n. Present time, Man. 7, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदानीम्
तदानीम् तदानीम्, i. e. तद + न + ई + म्, adv. Then, at that time, Draup. 6, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदीय
तदीय तद् + ईय, adj.<BR> 1. Belonging, or referring, or proper, to him, her, it, that, Rām. 4, 21, 35; Pañc. i. d. 224. Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 8.<BR> 2. Such, Kathās. 3, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्|तद्वन्त्
तद्वत् तद् + वत्, adv.<BR> 1. Thus, Pañc. ii. d. 62.<BR> 2. Thus also, Pañc. i. d 254.<BR> 3. And, Kathās. 6, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्ता
तद्वत्ता तद्वत् + ता, f. Harmony, Vedāntas. in Chr. 202, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वन्त्|तद्वत्
तद्वन्त् तद् + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Possessed of that (i. e. the previously mentioned उद्भूत-रूप), Bhāṣāp. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
1. तन् तन्, ii. 8, तनु, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To draw (a bow), MBh. 4, 141.<BR> 2. To spread, Bhag. 2, 17.<BR> 3. To cover, Śiś. 9, 23.<BR> 4. To propagate, Hariv. 2386.<BR> 5. To augment, Śāk. d. 19.<BR> 6. To direct, Nalod. 1, 20.<BR> 7. To arrange, Man. 4, 205.<BR> 8. To cause (pleasure or pain), Ragh. 3, 25; Bhāg. P. 1, 18, 37.<BR> 9. To speak, Daśak. 7 ult. Pass. तन्य, and ताय; ptcple. तत.<BR> --With the prep. अति अति, अतितत, Very haughty, Śiś. 19, 3.<BR> --With अधि अधि, To cover, Rām. 5, 12, 33.<BR> --With अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To augment, MBh. 12, 4816.<BR> 2. To maintain, MBh. 3, 12681.<BR> --With अव अव,<BR> 1. To descend, अवतत, Descending, Hariv. 3621.<BR> 2. To cover, MBh. 6, 2666.<BR> --With आ आ,<BR> 1. with पदम्, To get a footing, Bhartṛ. 1, 32.<BR> 2. To stretch, MBh. 5, 4164; to draw, Ragh. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-a " target="_blank">Page0350-a + 41</a>] 1, 19.<BR> 3. To effuse, Śāk. d. 193.<BR> 4. To grant, Bhāg. P. 5, 24, 22.<BR> 5. To cause, Bhartṛ. 1, 50.<BR> 6. To arrange, Bhartṛ. 1, 36.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To procure, Rājat. 4, 247. समातत, Violent, MBh. 8, 4205.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To spread, Suśr. 1, 354, 5.<BR> 2. To show, Śiś. 2, 30.<BR> 3. To cover, Rām. 3, 76, 25.<BR> 4. To begin (a sacrifice), MBh. 12, 9613.<BR> 5. To cause, Rājat. 2, 78.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To spread out, MBh. 1, 1335.<BR> 2. To stretch out, Mṛcch. 143, 21.<BR> 3. To draw, MBh. 1, 5290.<BR> 4. To cover, Rām. 3, 63, 13.<BR> 5. To arrange (a sacrifice), Man. 3, 28.<BR> 6. To show, Rām. 4, 9, 89. वितत,<BR> 1. Large, Bhāg. P. 5, 16, 7.<BR> 2. Powerful, Rājat. 5, 22.<BR> --With आवि आ-वि, To illuminate, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 37.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, प्रवितत,<BR> 1. Large, Megh. 104.<BR> 2. Begun, MBh. 5, 5317.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To cover, Rām. 6, 21, 1.<BR> 2. To fill up, Bhāg. P. 8, 23, 14.<BR> 3. To expand, Bhāg. P. 1, 3, 37. संतत,<BR> 1. Uninterrupted, Lass. 96, 9.<BR> 2. Eternal.<BR> 3. Extended.<BR> 4. Much. ˚तम्, adv. Eternally.<BR> --Caus. तानय, To cause to be performed, Bhāg. P. 4, 7, 16.<BR> --With अनुसम् अनु-सम्,<BR> 1. To spread, Bhag. 15, 2.<BR> 2. To cover, Rām. 5, 16, 8.<BR> --With अभि-सम् अभि-सम्, To cover, Hariv. 4986.<BR> --Cf. τάνυμαι, ἔκ-τατος (= तत), τιταίνω (for τιτανϳω), τείνω (for τενϳω), ἐπιτηδές (for ταν + tvas); Lat. tenere, tendere, ostendere (for obs-), tenus, etc.; O.H.G. danjan; A.S. thenian; see also तनु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0349-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
2. तन् तन् (akin to स्तन्), i. 4, Par. To sound (ved.).<BR> --Cf. τόνος; Lat. tonare; O.H.G. donar; A.S. thunor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
† 3. तन् तन् (or वन् वन्), i. 1 and 10, तानय, Par.<BR> 1. To believe. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b " target="_blank">Page0350-b + 43</a>]<BR> 2. To assist (or to afflict, or to be afflicted).<BR> 3. To sound (cf. 2. तन्).<BR> 4. With prepositions, To stretch (cf. 1. तन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनय|तनयः
तनय तनय (vb. 1. तन्, anomal. Caus. + अ),<BR> I. adj. Continuing a family, Chr. 291, 14 = Rigv. i. 64, 14.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A son.<BR> 2. du. A son and a daughter.<BR> III. f. या, A daughter.<BR> --Comp.<BR> See कु-.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनतनय|पवनतनयः
पवन- + तनय पवन- + तनय, m. Hanumant, the son of the wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राधातनय|राधातनयः
राधा- + तनय राधा- + तनय, m. Karṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यतनय|सूर्यतनयः|सूर्य्यतनय|सूर्य्यतनयः
सूर्य- + तनय सूर्य- + तनय,<BR> I. m. 1. Karṇa. 2. Sugrīva.<BR> II. f. या, the Yamunā river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनु|तनुः
तनु तन् + उ,<BR> I. adj., f. नु and न्वी,<BR> 1. Thin, Rām. 2, 8, 42 Gorr.<BR> 2. Delicate, Nal. 12, 106.<BR> 3. Moderate (in quantity and size), Man. 3, 10.<BR> 4. Small, MBh. 3, 1747. Comparat. तनीयंस्, Rājat. 3, 223, and तनुतर, Amar. 3. Superl. तनिष्ठ and तनुतम.<BR> II. f. नु and नू,<BR> 1. The body, Man. 2, 28; Rām. 1, 16, 5.<BR> 2. A person, Man. 4, 184.<BR> 3. One's own self, Hariv. 2386.<BR> III. f. न्वी, A slender woman, Bhartṛ. 1, 71.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. tenuis; O.H.G. dunni; A.S. thyn; τανεῖα (= तन्वी), ταναός for ταναϝός (cf. ταναύπους), i. e. τανυ + ο.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतनु
अ- + तनु अ- + तनु, adj. large, MBh. 3, 6028.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धतनु|अर्धतनुः
अर्ध- + तनु अर्ध- + तनु, f. half a body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वामनतनु
वामन- + तनु वामन- + तनु, adj. dwarfbodied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतनु|सुतनुः
सु- + तनु सु- + तनु,<BR> I. adj. very delicate.<BR> II. f. a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुक
तनुक तनु + क, adj. Small, Suśr. 1, 296, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुज|तनुजः
तनुज तनु-ज, m. A son, Pañc. v. d. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुता
तनुता तनु + ता, f.<BR> 1. Smallness, meagerness, Rām. 5, 19, 22; Megh. 83.<BR> 2. in कलभ-, Condition of having the body of a young elephant, Megh. 79.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतनुता
सु- + तनुता सु- + तनुता, f. Great meagerness, Lass. 72, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्र|तनुत्रं
तनुत्र तनु-त्र (vb. त्रा), n. A coat of mail, MBh. 4, 1009.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0350-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्रवन्त्|तनुत्रवत्
तनुत्रवन्त् तनुत्र + वन्त्, adj. Covered with a coat of mail, Rām. 6, 76, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्व
तनुत्व तनु + त्व, n. Smallness, delicateness, MBh. 13, 541.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुस्
तनुस् तन् + उस्, n. The body, Rām. 5, 93, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनूज|तनूजः
