तन्तु तन् + तु, m.<BR> 1. A thread, MBh. 1, 806; epithet of the supreme deity, Being the thread, Bhāg. P. 8, 16, 31.<BR> 2. A cobweb, Vedāntas. in Chr. 206, 13.<BR> 3. A filament, Bhartṛ. 2, 6.<BR> 4. Series, Bhāg. P. 8, 13, 36.<BR> 5. Propagation of a family, race, MBh. 8, 3393; 3, 15363 (on whom depends the propagation).<BR> 6. Issue, Man. 9, 203.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

