प्रजातन्तु|प्रजातंतु|प्रजातन्तुः
प्रजा- + तन्तु प्रजा- + तन्तु, m. race, Bhāg. P. 1, 12, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0351-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

