तूल्
† तूल् तूल्, i. 1 and 10, To weigh (cf. तुल्).<BR> --i. 10, Ātm. = तूण्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूल|तूलं|तूलः
तूल तूल, m. and n. Cotton, MBh. 1, 6740.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंसतूल|हंसतूलः
हंस- + तूल हंस- + तूल, down, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलक|तूलकं
तूलक तूल + क, n. Cotton, Bhāṣāp. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलिका
तूलिका तूलिका, i. e. तूल + क, f.<BR> 1. A pencil, Kumāras. 1, 22.<BR> 2. A mattress filled with cotton, Kathās. 26, 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूवरक
तूवरक तूवर + क (तूवर = ved. तूपर, Without horns, beardless, an eunuch), adj. Unmanly, MBh. 5, 5470.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्
† तूष् तूष्, i. 1, Par. To be satisfied; see तुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्णीक|तूष्णीकः
तूष्णीक तूष्णीक, i. e. तूष्णीम् + क, adj. Taciturn, Rām. 2, 117, 3 Gorr. ˚कम्, adv. Silently, Rām. 5, 1, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्णीम्
