तृच|तृचः
तृच तृच, i. e. त्रि-ऋच् + अ, m. and n. Three verses, Chr. 294, 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण्
तृण् तृण्, or तृन् तृन्, ii. 8, Par. To eat, Skandap., Kāśīkh. 3, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण|तृणं
तृण तृण, i. e. तॄ + ण (cf. तरु), n. (and m.).<BR> 1. Grass, any gramineous plant, Man. 1, 48; Hit. i. d. 144; Rām. 2, 21, 26; Man. 4, 166.<BR> 2. A grass blade, Pañc. i. d. 190.<BR> --Cf. perhaps O.H.G. dorn; A.S. thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणक|तृणकं
तृणक तृण + क, n. A worthless grass-blade, MBh. 1, 3666.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणपीड
