त्यक्तुकाम त्यक्तुकाम, i. e. त्यक्तुम्-काम (vb. त्यज्), adj. Wishing to leave, Nal. 9, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तृ
त्यक्तृ त्यक्तृ, i. e. त्यज् + तृ, m, f. त्री, n. One who resigns, or sacrifices, MBh. 7, 378.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यज्
त्यज् त्यज्, i. 1, Par. (also Ātm., [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-b " target="_blank">Page0375-b + 43</a>] Rām. 5, 80, 30).<BR> 1. To leave, to abandon, MBh. 5, 5994; Nal. 24, 35. To throw away, Cāṇ. 108, in Berl. Monatsb.<BR> 2. To disown, Śāk. d. 122.<BR> 3. To expose, Bhāg. P. 9, 24, 35.<BR> 4. To give, MBh. 5, 2348.<BR> 5. To resign, Man. 2, 95; with प्राणान्, श्वासम्, जीवितम्, To sacrifice one's life, Rām. 3, 55, 24; to risk one's life, MBh. 5, 7204.<BR> 6. To neglect, Hit. ii. d. 39.<BR> --Caus. त्याजय,<BR> 1. To cause to abandon, to rob, Megh. 94.<BR> 2. To expel, Kathās. 20, 126.<BR> 3. To cause to be disregarded, Ragh. 6, 56.<BR> --With the prep. समभि सम्-अभि,<BR> 1. To resign, MBh. 12, 269.<BR> 2. To risk, MBh. 6, 158.<BR> --With निस् निस्, To expel, Rām. 4, 46, 8.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To abandon, Hit. 25, 19.<BR> 2. To disown, Man. 9, 175.<BR> 3. To resign, Man. 4, 176; With देहम्, To die, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 49.<BR> 4. To disregard, to leave out, Vedāntas. in Chr. 208, 19.<BR> 5. pass. with instr. To lose, Hit. i. d. 128.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. परित्यक्त,<BR> 1. Deserted, Man. 12, 21.<BR> 2. Robbed, Hit. i. d. 31.<BR> 3. Left, wanting, Cāṇ. 101, in Berl. Monatsb.<BR> --Caus. To rob (with two accus.), Rām. 4, 19, 35.<BR> --With संपरि सम्-परि,<BR> 1. To abandon, Rām. 3, 54, 5.<BR> 2. To risk, Rām. 6, 29, 15.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To abandon, Pañc. i. d. 168.<BR> 2. To shun, Man. 4, 181; Bhartṛ. 1, 80.<BR> 3. To resign, Bhāg. P. 6, 10, 7.<BR> 4. To except, Rājat. 3, 343. संत्यक्त, Robbed, Varāh. Bṛh. S. 67, 70.<BR> --Caus. To rob (with two accus.), MBh. 7, 8991.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, To leave, MBh. 6, 2232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यज्
ऽत्यज् -त्यज्, latter part of comp. adj. Abandoning, resigning, giving away, Bhāg. P. 8, 20, 9.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्यज्
तनु- + त्यज् तनु- + त्यज्, adj. 1. dying, Ragh. 1, 8. 2. risking one's life, MBh. 4, 2354.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0375-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यद्
त्यद् त्यद्, i. e. त-यद्, see तद्; except the nom. sing. m. and f., the base of the m. and n. is त्य, of the fem. त्या; the nom. sing. msc. is स्यस्, f. स्या; pronoun of the third person, That, Chr. 289, 1 = Rigv. i. 50, 1.<BR> --Cf. Goth. si; O.H.G. siu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याग|त्यागः
त्याग त्याग, i. e. त्यज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Abandoning, Man. 10, 111; Pañc. 261, 6; forsaking, Man. 8, 389; resigning, Rām. 4, 7, 9.<BR> 2. Giving away, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 499; liberality, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 16; prodigality, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1260.<BR> 3. Secretion, MBh. 14, 630.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मत्याग|आत्मत्यागः
आत्मत्याग आत्मत्याग, i. e. आत्मन्-, m. 1. loss of conscience, Suśr. 1, 192, 6. 2. suicide, Daśak. in Chr. 189, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्याग
तनु- + त्याग तनु- + त्याग, m. risking one's life, Rām. 2, 40, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देहत्याग|देहत्यागः
देह- + त्याग देह- + त्याग, m. dying, death, Man. 10, 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थानत्याग
स्थान- + त्याग स्थान- + त्याग, m. leaving one's place, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3348.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागमय
त्यागमय त्याग + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting in donation, Kathās. 23, 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागिता
त्यागिता त्यागिता, i. e. त्यागिन् + ता, f. Liberality, Hit. i. d. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागिन्
त्यागिन् त्यागिन्, i. e. त्यज् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Deserting, Man. 3, 245; disowning, Śāk. d. 125; resigning, Bhag. 18, 11; with आत्मनस्, killing one's self, Man. 5, 89.<BR> 2. Liberal, Pañc. iii. d. 259.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मत्यागिन्
आत्मत्यागिन् आत्मत्यागिन्, i. e. आत्मन्-, m. a suicide, Yājñ. 3, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याजक
त्याजक त्याजक, i. e. त्यज् + अक, adj. Abandoning, Yājñ. 2, 198.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र
ऽत्र -त्र (vb. त्रा), latter part of comp. words, Protecting, cf. e. g. तनुत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रंस्
† त्रंस् त्रंस्, i. 1 and 10, Par. To speak or shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रख्
† त्रख् त्रख्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रङ्क्|त्रंक्
† त्रङ्क् त्रङ्क्, i. 1, Ātm. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रङ्ख्
† त्रङ्ख् त्रङ्ख्, and त्रङ्ग् त्रङ्ग् (v. r.), i. 1. Par., To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रन्द्|त्रंद्
† त्रन्द् त्रन्द्, i. 1, Par. To be active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रप्
त्रप् त्रप्, i. 1, Ātm. (also Par. Rām. 2, 57, 28), To be embarrassed, to be ashamed, Rājat. 3, 94.<BR> --Caus. त्रा̆पय, To make ashamed, Śāntiś. 14, 15.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप,<BR> 1. To turn away on account of shame, MBh. 12, 3491.<BR> 2. To be ashamed, MBh. 3, 110.<BR> --With व्यप वि-अप,<BR> 1. To turn away on account of shame, MBh. 2, 433.<BR> 2. To be ashamed, Rām. 3, 59, 3.<BR> --Cf. τρέπω; Lat. turpis, probably also trepidus (cf. ved. तृप्र, hastening), and perhaps Goth. dreiban; A.S. drifan (Caus.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रप
त्रप त्रप् + अ, m., and f. पा, Shame, Pañc. 84, 8; MBh. 2, 2239.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्रप
अ-त्रप अ-त्रप and निस्-, adj., f. पा, Shameless, Pañc. i. d. 472; MBh. 5, 1458.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपु|त्रपुः
त्रपु त्रप् + उ, n. Tin, Man. 5, 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपुस|त्रपुसं
त्रपुस त्रपुस, n. Cucumber, the fruit of the त्रपुसी, Suśr. 1, 29, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपुसी
त्रपुसी त्रपुसी, f. A sort of cucumber, Suśr. 2, 481, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रय|त्रयं|त्रयः
त्रय त्रय, i. e. त्रि + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. यी, Threefold, Man. 1, 23.<BR> II. f. यी,<BR> 1. The three Vedas, Man. 4, 125.<BR> 2. Triad, Rājat. 5, 143 (शत-, Three hundreds).<BR> III. n. Triad, Daśak. in Chr. 197, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नित्रय
अग्नि- + त्रय अग्नि- + त्रय, n. The three holy fires, Rām. 3, 12, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयस्
त्रयस्ऽ त्रयस्-, nom. pl. m. of त्रि, Former part of compounded numerals, Three, e. g. त्रयस्त्रिंशत्, Thirtythree; त्रयश्चत्वारिंशत्, Fortythree; त्रयःपञ्चाशत्, Fifty-three.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयीमय
त्रयीमय त्रयी + मय (see त्रय), [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a " target="_blank">Page0377-a + 41</a>] adj., f. यी, Consisting of the three Vedas, Bhāg. P. 3, 13, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0376-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदश|त्रयोदशः
त्रयोदश त्रयोदश, i. e. त्रयोदशन् + अ,<BR> 1. ordinal number, f. शी, Thirteenth, Rām. 2, 77, 22.<BR> 2. f. शी, The thirteenth day of the lunar fortnight, Man. 3, 273.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशधा
त्रयोदशधा त्रयोदशधा, i. e. त्रयो-दशन् + धा, adv. Thirteen-fold, Rājat. 5, 173.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशन्
त्रयोदशन् त्रयोदशन्, i. e. त्रयस्-दशन्, numeral, Thirteen, Man. 9, 129.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. τρις-καί-δεκα, for τρεῖς-; Lat. tredecim for tres-decem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धत्रयोदशन्
अर्ध- + त्रयोदशन् अर्ध- + त्रयोदशन्, Thirteen and a half, Yājñ. 2, 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशिक
त्रयोदशिक त्रयोदशिक, i. e. त्रयो-दशी (see त्रयोदश) + इक, adj. Performed on the thirteenth day of the lunar fortnight, Rām. 2, 86, 1 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोविंशतिक
त्रयोविंशतिक त्रयोविंशतिक, i. e. त्रयस्-विंशति + क, adj. Consisting of twenty-three, Bhāg. P. 3, 6, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्
1. त्रस् त्रस्, i. 1 and 4, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., Bhāg. P. 1, 17, 20), To tremble, to be afraid, MBh. 7, 1402; 6, 20. त्रस्त, Trembling, MBh. 3, 1431; fearful, Rām. 1, 49, 1; MBh. 4, 841.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Caus. त्रासय, To frighten, Rām. 2, 43, 3; anomalous ptcple. of the pres. Ātm. त्रासयान, MBh. 6, 2141.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. त्रासनीय, Terrible, Hariv. 2430.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप, To retire in fear, MBh. 12, 2526.<BR> --With अव अव, अवत्रस्त, Frightened, Hariv. 2520.<BR> --With उद् उद्, उत्त्रस्त, Frightened, Rājat. 5, 148.<BR> --Caus. To frighten, Hariv. 3377.<BR> --With परि परि, परि-त्रस्त, Trembling, Hariv. 10127; frightened, Rām. 3, 54, 7.<BR> --With वि वि, To tremble, to be afraid, MBh. 3, 8663. वि-त्रस्त, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b " target="_blank">Page0377-b + 42</a>] Frightened, MBh. 1, 5964.<BR> --Comp.<BR> अ-वित्रस्त, adj. intrepid, MBh. 1, 5496.<BR> --Caus. To frighten, to alarm, MBh. 3, 698; Man. 7, 196.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To be afraid, MBh. 7, 103. संत्रस्त, Frightened, MBh. 6, 2640.<BR> --Comp.<BR> सु-संत्रस्त, adj. very frightened, Rām. 3, 55, 29.<BR> --Caus. To frighten, Pañc. i. d. 212.<BR> --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, अभिसंत्रस्त, Frightened, Rām. 2, 9, 6 Gorr.<BR> --Cf. त्रा̆स, τρέω (for τρεσϳω), τρέστης, ταρταρίζω, τρήρων (for τρεσρων); Goth. thlahsjan; Lat. terrere (for tersere, tresere); cf. तरल, तॄ, तुर्, त्रप्; τρέμω; Lat. tremo, probably tristis; τάρβος, ταράσσω and many other words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्रस्त
अ-त्रस्त अ-त्रस्त, adj. intrepid, Ragh. 1, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्
† 2. त्रस् त्रस्, i. 10, Par. To hold, or to take, or to prevent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस|त्रसं|त्रसः
त्रस त्रस् + अ, n. (moving) Living creatures, Matsyop. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रसदस्यु|त्रसदस्युः
त्रसदस्यु त्रसदस्यु (cf. त्रस् and दस्यु), m. A proper name, Chr. 297, 14 = Rigv. i. 112, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रसरेणु|त्रसरेणुः
त्रसरेणु त्रस-रेणु, m.<BR> 1. A small mote visible in a sunbeam, Man. 8, 132.<BR> 2. A compound atom in the Vaiśeṣika philosophy (said by some to be composed of three परमाणुस्, by others of three द्व्यणुकस्), Brahmavaiv. P. 4, 96, 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्नु|त्रस्नुः
त्रस्नु त्रस् + नु, adj. Timid, Rājat. 5, 415.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्रस्नु
अ- + त्रस्नु अ- + त्रस्नु, adj. intrepid, Ragh. 14, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनतित्रस्नु
अन्-अति- + त्रस्नु अन्-अति- + त्रस्नु, adj. confident, Daśak. in Chr. 196, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रा
त्रा त्रा, ii. 2, Par. Ātm., and त्रै त्रै, i. 1, त्राय (i. e. properly त्रा, i. 4), Ātm. To protect, to preserve (with the abl.), MBh. 2, 2606.<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, To protect, MBh. 13, 3600; परित्रात, Rām. 6, 6, 10.<BR> --With सम् सम्, To protect, MBh. 1, 6819.<BR> --Akin to तॄ, and for original तर् + आ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0377-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्राण|त्राणं
त्राण त्राण, i. e. त्रा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Shelter, Man. 11, 113.<BR> 2. Protection, MBh. 3, 13284.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अङ्गुलित्राण|अंगुलित्राण
अङ्गुलि- + त्राण अङ्गुलि- + त्राण = अङ्गुलित्र, q. cf. तनु-, n. a coat of mail, Rām. 2, 31, 25 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलत्राण
तल- + त्राण तल- + त्राण, n. a leathern fence worn by archers on the left arm, MBh. 3, 1501.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पादत्राण|पादत्राणं
पाद- + त्राण पाद- + त्राण, n. a shoe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रातृ
त्रातृ त्रातृ, i. e. त्रा + तृ, m. A preserver, a protector, MBh. 1, 8421.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मखत्रातृ
मख- + त्रातृ मख- + त्रातृ, m. Rāma, the son of Daśaratha, and second incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रामन्
त्रामन् त्रामन्, i. e. त्रा + मन्, n. Protection.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुत्रामन्
सु- + त्रामन् सु- + त्रामन्, m. Indra (cf. सूत्रामन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रास|त्रासः
त्रास त्रास, i. e. त्रस् + अ,<BR> I. adj. Moveable, MBh. 7, 9476.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Fear, terror, Rām. 3, 50, 17.<BR> 2. Frightening, Hit. 27, 15.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलत्रास|जलत्रासः
जल- + त्रास जल- + त्रास, m. hydrophobia, Suśr. 2, 282, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रासन
त्रासन त्रासन, i. e. त्रस्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Frightening, Rām. 3, 7, 8.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Frightening, MBh. 4, 1706.<BR> 2. Fright, Bhāg. P. 4, 10, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रासिन्
त्रासिन् त्रासिन्, i. e. त्रास + इन्, adj., f. नी, Afraid, MBh. 12, 5904.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलत्रासिन्
जल- + त्रासिन् जल- + त्रासिन्, adj. suffering from hydrophobia, Suśr. 2, 282, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रि|त्रिः
त्रि त्रि, numeral, f. तिसृ, Three, Man. 2, 229.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिंश|त्रिंशः
त्रिंश त्रिंश, i. e. curtailed त्रिंशत्, ordin. number, f. शी, Thirtieth.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुस्त्रिंश
चतुस्त्रिंश चतुस्त्रिंश, i. e. चतुर्-, Thirtyfourth, Rām. 1, 30, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वात्रिंश
द्वा- + त्रिंश द्वा- + त्रिंश, thirtysecond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चत्रिंश|पंचत्रिंश
पञ्चत्रिंश पञ्चत्रिंश, i. e. पञ्चन्-, thirty-fifth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिंशत्
त्रिंशत् त्रिंशत्, i. e. त्रि-दचन्त्, numeral, f. adj. and sbst., Thirty, MBh. 6, 5409; Rājat. 1, 286.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वात्रिंशत्
द्वा- + त्रिंशत् द्वा- + त्रिंशत्, thirty-two, Rām. 1, 43, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्त्रिंशत्
षट्-त्रिंशत् षट्-त्रिंशत्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b " target="_blank">Page0378-b + 39</a>] i. e. षष्-, thirty-six, Rājat. 5, 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिंशत्क|त्रिंशत्कं
त्रिंशत्क त्रिंशत् + क, n. An assemblage of thirty, Kām. Nītis. 8, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिंशत्तम
त्रिंशत्तम त्रिंशत् + तम, ordin. number, f. मी, Thirtieth, MBh. 12, chapter 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिक|त्रिकं
त्रिक त्रि + क,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Forming a triad, Suśr. 1, 158, 2.<BR> 2. (suppl. शत), Three per cent. Man. 8, 142.<BR> 3. (A place) where three roads meet, Hariv. 6501.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A triad, MBh. 12, 7954.<BR> 2. The chine-bone, Ragh. 6, 16.<BR> 3. The hip, Pañc. i. d. 205.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिगर्त|त्रिगर्त्त|त्रिगर्त्तः
त्रिगर्त त्रिगर्त, m. pl. The name of a people, MBh. 2, 1026.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिङ्ख्
† त्रिङ्ख् त्रिङ्ख्, i. 1, Par. To go; see त्रख्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिचतुर
त्रिचतुर त्रि-चतुर् + अ, pl. Three or four, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिणाचिकेत|त्रिणाचिकेतः
त्रिणाचिकेत त्रिणाचिकेत, i. e. त्रि-नाचिकेत, m. One who practises a certain vow prescribed in a part of the Yājurveda, Man. 3, 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रित
त्रित त्रित, m. The name of a deity, MBh. 1, 2112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितय|त्रितयं
त्रितय त्रि + तय, n. A triad, MBh. 13, 5415.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रित्व
त्रित्व त्रि + त्व, n. A triad, MBh. 14, 2617.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिदश|त्रिदशः
त्रिदश त्रिदश (i. e. त्रि-दशन्),<BR> I. adj. pl. Thirty, MBh. 1, 4445.<BR> II. m. A name of the thirty-three gods, a deity, MBh. 3, 8162.<BR> III. n. Heaven, MBh. 13, 3327.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिदशत्व
त्रिदशत्व त्रिदश + त्व, n. Divine nature, Ragh. 18, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिधा
त्रिधा त्रि + धा, adv. Threefold, MBh. 13, 6467; in three places, 1, 8013; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a " target="_blank">Page0379-a + 40</a>] in three parts, MBh. 5, 7206.<BR> --Cf. τρίχα, τρίχθα.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0378-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिपुरेशाद्रि
त्रिपुरेशाद्रि त्रिपुरेशाद्रि, i. e. त्रि-पुर-ईश-अद्रि, m. The name of a locality, Rājat. 5, 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिरसक
त्रिरसक त्रि-रस + क, n. A spirituous liquor, Śiś. 9, 10; in Sāh. D. 66, 1, v. r. of त्रि-सरक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिवर्षीय
त्रिवर्षीय त्रिवर्षीय, i. e. त्रि-वर्ष +ईय adj. Designed for three years, MBh. 13, 4467.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिवृत्
त्रिवृत् त्रि-वृत्,<BR> I. adj. Triple, Man. 11, 263.<BR> 2. A peculiar mode of reciting the eleventh hymn of the ninth maṇḍala of the Rigv., Man. 11, 74.<BR> II. m. A triple string, Man. 2, 43.<BR> III. f. Ipomœa turpethum R. Br., Suśr. 2, 35, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिवृता
त्रिवृता त्रिवृता, i. e. त्रि-वृत् + अ, f. = त्रिवृत्<BR> III. Suśr. 1, 132, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिशङ्कु|त्रिशंकु|त्रिशङ्कुः
त्रिशङ्कु त्रि-शङ्कु, m. The name of a king, Hariv. 730.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिषवण
त्रिषवण त्रिषवण, i. e. त्रि-सवन, n. The three daily ablutions, Man. 6, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिष्टुभ्
त्रिष्टुभ् त्रिष्टुभ्, i. e. त्रि-स्तुभ्, f. A kind of metre, Bhāg. P. 3, 12, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिस्
त्रिस् त्रि + स्, adv.<BR> 1. Thrice, Man. 2, 60.<BR> 2. At three places, MBh. 1, 5885.<BR> --Cf. τρίς; Lat. ter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसुपर्ण|त्रिसुपर्णः
त्रिसुपर्ण त्रि-सु-पर्ण, and त्रिसुपर्णक त्रिसुपर्ण + क, adj. One conversant with a part of the Vedas called त्रिसु-पर्ण, Man. 3, 185; Yājñ. 1, 219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसुवर्चक
त्रिसुवर्चक त्रि-सु-वर्च + क (cf. वर्चस्), adj. Having a threefold splendour(?), MBh. 3, 14156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसौपर्ण
त्रिसौपर्ण त्रिसौपर्ण, i. e. त्रि-सु-पर्ण + अ, adj. Epithet of a certain religious study, MBh. 12, 13567.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रुट्
त्रुट् त्रुट्, i. 4 and 6, Par. To [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b " target="_blank">Page0379-b + 40</a>] burst asunder, Bhartṛ. 1, 95; Hit. 15, 20. त्रुटित, Burst, Pañc. 121, 2.<BR> --Caus. To tear asunder, to break, Pañc. 146, 24.<BR> --† i. 10, Ātm. To cut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रुटि|त्रुटिः
त्रुटि त्रुट् + इ, f.<BR> 1. A moment as measure of time, MBh. 1, 1292.<BR> 2. Small cardamoms, Suśr. 2, 505, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रुटिशस्
त्रुटिशस् त्रुटि + शस्, adv. By moments called त्रुटि, MBh. 5, 3782.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रुप्
† त्रुप् त्रुप्. त्रुफ् त्रुफ्, त्रुम्प् त्रुम्प्, and त्रुम्फ त्रुम्फ्, i. 1, Par. To hurt.<BR> --Cf. perhaps θρύπτω, τρύϕος, etc., and τρυπάω.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रेता
त्रेता त्रेता (i. e. probably त्रय + ता), f.<BR> 1. A triad, MBh. 14, 2759.<BR> 2. The three sacred fires, MBh. 5, 1559.<BR> 3. A die, or the side of a die, which has three points, Mṛcch. 33, 9.<BR> 4. The name of the second युग, or age, Man. 9, 201.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नित्रेता
अग्नि- + त्रेता अग्नि- + त्रेता, f. the three sacred fires, Man. 2, 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रै
त्रै त्रै, see त्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0379-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रैकालिक
