त्वच्
† 1. त्वच् त्वच्, i. 6, Par. To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0381-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वच्
2. त्वच् त्वच्, f.<BR> 1. Skin, Man. 2, 90.<BR> 2. Hide, Rām. 3, 49, 9.<BR> 3. Bark, Ragh. 2, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0381-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वच|त्वचं
त्वच त्वच् + अ,<BR> I. a substitute for त्वच्, when latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. मृदु-, Having a tender skin, Hariv. 10425.<BR> II. n. Cinnamon, Rām. 3, 39, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0381-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

