त्वद्
त्वद् त्वद्, substitute for the sing. of the pronoun of the second person when former part of a comp. word, and in many derivatives (cf. युष्मद्), e. g. त्वद्-विध (see विधा), adj. Resembling thee, Rām. 2, 23, 7. त्वद्-कृत, Made by thee, Rām. 1, 2, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0381-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वदीय|त्वदीयं
