दान्
† दान् दान्, i. 1, Par., Ātm. i. 10, Par. To cut. Desider. दीदांस, Par., Ātm.<BR> 1. To be straight.<BR> 2. To make straight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान|दानं|दानः
दान दान, i. e. 1. दा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Giving, Man. 1, 90.<BR> 2. Gift, Man. 4, 233; 11, 2.<BR> 3. Liberality, Man. 1, 86.<BR> 4. Oblation, Man. 3, 211.<BR> 5. Giving in marriage, Man. 3, 27.<BR> 6. The fluid that flows from the temples of an elephant in rut, Pañc. i. d. 419.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. donum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदान
अ- + दान अ- + दान,<BR> I. n. 1. non-payment, Man. 8, 5. 2. illiberality, Pañc. ii. d. 74.<BR> II. adj. illiberal; and, without the fluid which flows from the temples of an elephant in rut, Pañc. ii. d. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदान|अतिदानं
अति- + दान अति- + दान, n. excessive liberality, Cāṇ. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मदान
आत्मन्- + दान आत्मन्- + दान, n. sacrificing one's self, Kathās. 22, 219. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-a " target="_blank">Page0395-a + 41</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकदान
उदक- + दान उदक- + दान, n. Pouring water in honour of a deceased one, Prab. 98, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगदान|योगदानं
योग- + दान योग- + दान, n. a fraudulent gift, Man. 8, 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृथादान|वृथादानं
वृथा- + दान वृथा- + दान, unprofitable donation, gift to musicians, actresses, etc., Man. 8, 159.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदान
स- + दान स- + दान, adj. pouring out the fluid which flows from the temples of an elephant in rut, Kir. 5, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदादान|सदादानः
सदा- + दान सदा- + दान,<BR> I. n. liberality.<BR> II. m. 1. Indra's elephant. 2. an elephant in rut. 3. Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0394-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानतस्
दानतस् दान + तस्, adv. By liberality, Sāv. 2, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानव|दानवः
दानव दानव, i. e. दानु, ved. (a demon; cf. also दनु, दनुज), + अ,<BR> 1. m. A demon, Man. 3, 201.<BR> 2. adj., f. वी, Peculiar to the Dānavas, Arj. 10, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवन्त्|दानवत्
