दामन्
दामन् 3. दा + मन्, n. A rope, MBh. 1, 6678.<BR> 2. A string, Rām. 2, 78, 7. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b " target="_blank">Page0395-b + 41</a>]<BR> 3. A garland, Megh. 89.<BR> 4. A large bandage to support parts, Suśr. 1, 65, 17.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. δέμα, κρήδεμνον.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पदामन्
