दामनी
दामनी दामन् + ई, f. A rope for tying cattle, Hariv. 3536.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

