दाय|दायः
दाय दाय, i. e. 1. दा + अ, m.<BR> 1. A gift, MBh. 1, 6938.<BR> 2. Separate property of a wife, Man. 9, 77.<BR> 3. Delivering, Man. 8, 180.<BR> 4. Inheritance, Man. 9, 217.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदाय|सुदायः
सु- + दाय सु- + दाय, m. A special gift, as a nuptial present, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायक|दायकः
दायक दायक, i. e. 1. दा + अक, adj. Giving, Man. 9, 271; a giver, MBh. 3, 13245.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदायक
अग्नि- + दायक अग्नि- + दायक, m. An incendiary, Rām. 2, 79, 19 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्बूलदायक
ताम्बूल- + दायक ताम्बूल- + दायक, m. The betel-bearer of a prince, Kām. Nītis. 12, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषदायक
विष- + दायक विष- + दायक, m. a poisoner, Rām. 2, 75, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायकता
ऽदायकता -दायक + ता, f. Giving, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायाद|दायादः
दायाद दायाद, i. e. दाय-आ-द, m.<BR> 1. A heir, Man. 8, 160.<BR> 2. A son, a kinsman, Rām. 2, 110, 35; 1, 60, 2. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-a " target="_blank">Page0396-a + 42</a>]<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0395-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदायाद
