दायाद्य
दायाद्य दायाद्य, i. e. दायाद + य, n. Inheritance, Man. 11, 184.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

