दायिन्
ऽदायिन् -दायिन्, i. e. 1. दा + इन्, adj., f. नी,<BR> 1. Giving, Man. 3, 104.<BR> 2. Causing, Hariv. 15379.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकदायिन्
