दारक|दारकः
2. दारक दारक, m.<BR> 1. A son, Pañc. 100, 24.<BR> 2. A young animal, Bhāg. P. 5, 8, 17.<BR> 3. du. A boy and a girl, Brāhmaṇ. 2, 35.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

