दारिन्
दारिन् दारिन्, i. e. दॄ + इन्, adj., f. इणी. Splitting, MBh. 7, 3993.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दारी
