दारु|दारुः
दारु दारु, i. e. दॄ + वन्त् = वन् = उ, n.<BR> 1. Wood, Pañc. i. d. 100.<BR> 2. A species of pine, Pinus deodora Roxb., Suśr. 1, 161, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. δόρυ, δούρατα for δορϝατα, δορήϊος, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवदारु|देवदारुः
