दारुण|दारुणः
दारुण दारुण, i. e. दारु + न (or rather दर्वन् + अ),<BR> I. adj., f. णा.<BR> 1. Hard, Suśr. 1, 295, 10.<BR> 2. Sharp, 1, 130, 14.<BR> 3. Harsh, severe, Pañc. 58, 11.<BR> 4. Violent, MBh. 14, 442.<BR> 5. Painful, Man. 12, 78.<BR> 6. Terrible, Rām. 1, 56, 8.<BR> II. n. Severity, MBh. 13, 2144.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0396-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

