शिवदास
शिव- + दास शिव- + दास, m. a proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0397-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दासत्व
दासत्व दास + त्व, n. Condition of a slave, Rām. 4, 3, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दासप्रवर्ग
दासप्रवर्ग दास-प्र-वर्ग, adj. Comprising a crowd of slaves, Chr. 294, 8 = Rigv. i. 92, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दासीत्व
दासीत्व दासी + त्व (see दास), n. The condition of a female slave, MBh. 1, 1088.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दासेरक|दासेरकः
दासेरक दासेरक (स् probably erroaeously for श्, cf. दशेरक), i. e. दशेरक + अ, m.<BR> 1. A camel, Pañc. 87, 8.<BR> 2. pl. The name of a people, Varāh. Bṛh. S. 14, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दास्य|दास्यं
दास्य दास्य, i. e. दास + य, n.<BR> 1. Servitude, Daśak. in Chr. 183, 11.<BR> 2. Service, Man. 8, 410.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दास्वन्त्|दास्वत्
दास्वन्त् दास्वन्त् (vb. 1. दा, cf. भा and भास्), adj., f. वती, Liberal, Chr. 287, 1 = Rigv. i. 48, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाह|दाहः
दाह दाह, i. e. दह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Burning, Man. 4, 115.<BR> 2. Conflagration, Rām. 1, 3, 31.<BR> 3. Cauterising, Suśr. 1, 47, 8.<BR> 4. Feverish heat, Suśr. 1, 34, 16.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्दाह|अन्तर्दाहः
अन्तर्- + दाह अन्तर्- + दाह, m. inward heat, Rām. 2, 85, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाहक|दाहकः
दाहक दाहक, i. e. दह् + अक, adj., f. हिका, Setting on fire, an incendiary, Yājñ. 2, 282.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाहन|दाहनं
दाहन दाहन, i. e. दह्, Caus. + अन, n. Causing to be consumed by fire, MBh. 1, 403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाहिन्
दाहिन् दाहिन्, i. e. दह् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Setting on fire, Man. 3, 158.<BR> 2. Burning, Suśr. 2, 213, 16.<BR> 3. Paining, Bhartṛ. 2, 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिगम्बर|दिगंबर|दिगम्बरः
दिगम्बर दिगम्बर, i. e. दिश्-अम्बर, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b " target="_blank">Page0398-b + 40</a>]<BR> I. adj., f. रा, Naked, Pañc. v. d. 14.<BR> II. m. An ascetic, Prab. 46, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिगम्बरत्व
दिगम्बरत्व दिगम्बर + त्व, n. Nakedness, Kumāras. 5, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिति|दितिः
दिति दिति, f. One of the wives of Kaśyapa and mother of the Daityas, MBh. 1, 2520.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दितिज|दितिजः
दितिज दिति-ज, and दितिनन्दन दिति-नन्दन, m. A Daitya or demon, MBh. 13, 971; Bhāg. P. 8, 10, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दित्सा
दित्सा दित्सा, i. e. दित्स, desider. of 1. दा, + अ, f. Wish to give, Rājat. 3, 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दित्सु
दित्सु दित्सु, i. e. दित्स, desider. of 1. दा, + उ, (and दिदित्सु दिदित्सु, MBh. 5, 187), adj. Willing, ready to give, MBh. 1, 1733.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदित्सु
अ- + दित्सु अ- + दित्सु, adj. one who will not give, Man. 9, 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिदृक्षा
दिदृक्षा दिदृक्षा, i. e. दिदृक्ष, desider. of दृश्, + अ, f. Wish to see, Kir. 5, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जातगीतदिदृक्ष
जात-गीत-दिदृक्ष जात-गीत-दिदृक्ष, adj., f. षा, desirous to see the singer, Rājat. 5, 357.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिदृक्षु
दिदृक्षु दिदृक्षु, i. e. दिदृक्ष, desider. of दृश्, + उ, adj.<BR> 1. Desirous to see, Chr. 35, 11.<BR> 2. Desirous of inspecting, Man. 8, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधक्षा
दिधक्षा दिधक्षा, i. e. दिधक्ष, desider. of दह्, + अ, f. The desire to consume by fire, MBh. 1, 8363.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधक्षु
दिधक्षु दिधक्षु, i. e. दिधक्ष, desider. of दह्, + उ, adj. Desirous to consume by fire, MBh. 1, 8090; to destroy, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधिषु|दिधिषुः
दिधिषु दिधिषु, i. e. दिधिष, old desider. of धा, + उ,<BR> I. m. A husband, Bhāg. P. 9, 9, 34.<BR> II. f. षू, A widow married to the brother of her deceased husband, Man. 3, 173.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रेदिधिषू
अग्रे-दिधिषू अग्रे-दिधिषू, f. a younger sister married before her elder one, Man. 3, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0398-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिन|दिनं|दिनः
दिन दिन, i. e. दिव् + अन् + अ, m. and n. Day, Man. 11, 144.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0399-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यदिन
अद्य- + दिन अद्य- + दिन, the present day, Pañc. 186, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0399-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्दिन|दुर्द्दिनं
दुस्- + दिन दुस्- + दिन,<BR> I. n. 1. a cloudy day. Hariv. 7856. 2. rain, rainy weather, Rām. 3, 73, 13.<BR> II. adj. clouded, Rām. 6, 90, 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0399-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाष्पदुर्दिन
वाष्प-दुस्-दिन वाष्प-दुस्-दिन, adj. clouded by tears, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0399-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमदुर्दिन|हिमदुर्दिनं|हिमदुर्द्दिन
हिम-दुस्- + दिन हिम-दुस्- + दिन, n. wintry weather, winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0399-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदिन|सुदिनं
