दुर्विवक्तृ
दुर्विवक्तृ दुर्विवक्तृ, i. e. दुस्-वि-वच् + तृ, m. One who answers a question wrongly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0407-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विश
दुर्विश दुर्विश, i. e. दुस्-विश् + अ, adj., f. शा, Difficult to be trod upon, Rām. 6, 19, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विषह|दुर्विषहः|दुर्व्विषह
