देवक|देवकः
देवक देव + क,<BR> I. A substitute for देव when latter part of a comp. adj., e. g. स-, adj. With the gods, MBh. 2, 1396.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2704.<BR> 2. pl. The inhabitants of one of the varṣas, or divisions of the world, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 22.<BR> III. f. विका,<BR> 1. The name of a river, MBh. 3, 5044.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 3828.<BR> IV. f. वकी, A proper name, MBh. 1, 2428.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0415-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

