दौहित्र|दौहित्रः
दौहित्र दौहित्र, i. e. दुहितृ + अ,<BR> I. m. A daughter's son, Man. 3, 148.<BR> II. f. त्री, A daughter's daughter, Rām. 6, 95, 36.<BR> III. m. A rhinoceros, Mārk. P. 32, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0420-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

