अ-मित- + द्युति अ-मित- + द्युति (vb. मा), adj. of boundless splendour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

