महाद्युति
महा- + द्युति महा- + द्युति, adj. supremely glorious, Man. 1, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमद्युति|हिमद्युतिः
हिम- + द्युति हिम- + द्युति, m. the moon, Śiś. 9, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युतिमन्त्|द्युतिमत्
द्युतिमन्त् द्युति + मन्त्,<BR> I. adj., f. मती.<BR> 1. Brilliant, Kir. 5, 8.<BR> 2. Dignified, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-b " target="_blank">Page0421-b + 38</a>] Rām. 1, 1, 10.<BR> II. m. A proper name, MBh. 1, 3832.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युमन्त्|द्युमत्
