द्युम्न|द्युम्नं
द्युम्न द्युम्न, i. e. 2. द्यु + मन् (for मन्त्) + अ, n.<BR> 1. Splendour, Chr. 287, 1 = Rigv. i. 48, 1.<BR> 2. Strength, Chr. 288, 16 = Rigv. i. 48, 16.<BR> 3. Wealth, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

