द्योतन|द्योतनं|द्योतनः
द्योतन द्योतन, i. e. द्युत् + अन, n. Illuminating, Bhāg. P. 3, 26, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतिन्
द्योतिन् द्योतिन्, i. e. द्युत् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Shining, Megh. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0421-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतिस्
