द्विज|द्विजः
द्विज द्वि-ज,<BR> I. adj. Twice born.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A man of either of the three first classes, as their initiation passes for a second birth, especially a Brāhamaṇa, Yājñ. 1, 39; Nal. 16, 1.<BR> 2. A bird, Man. 5, 17.<BR> 3. A tooth, Bhartṛ. 1, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

