2. द्विष् द्विष्,<BR> I. latter part of comp. adj. Hating, Man. 3, 41.<BR> II. m. A foe, MBh. 4, 509.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0428-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

