नाशक
नाशक नाशक, i. e. 2. नश्, Caus., + अक, adj. Destroying, MBh. 13, 1634.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0468-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतनाशक
