नासिका
नासिका नासिका, i. e. नासा + क, f.<BR> 1. A nostril, Bhāg. P. 5, 23, 6.<BR> 2. du. The nose, 2, 10, 20.<BR> 3. sing. The nose, Man. 2, 90.<BR> 4. The trunk of an elephant, MBh. 13, 4900.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रनासिका
अग्र- + नासिका अग्र- + नासिका, f. the tip of the nose, Rām. 1, 28, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूतिनासिक
