नास्तिक्य|नास्तिक्यं
नास्तिक्य नास्तिक्य, i. e. नास्तिक + य,<BR> 1. Disbelief, Man. 3, 65.<BR> 2. Infidelity, 4, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्य|नास्यं
नास्य नास्य, i. e. नासा + य, n.<BR> 1. A nose-cord, Man. 8, 291.<BR> 2. A multitude of noses (?), Hariv. 15996.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाह|नाहः
