निःशेषय
निःशेषय निःशेषय, a denomin. derived from निस्-शेष with अय, Par.<BR> 1. To destroy completely, Prab. 6, 11; Pañc. 201, 23 (see Benfey's translation, n. 1210).<BR> 2. To consume completely, Rām. 1, 65, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्रेणि|निःश्रेणिः
