निकर|निकरः
निकर निकर, i. e. नि-कॄ + अ, m. A flock or multitude, Gīt. 11, 4; MBh. 15, 722.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकर्तन|निकर्तनं
