निकषण|निकषणः
निकषण निकषण, i. e. नि-कष् (for कर्ष्, vb. कृष्) + अन, n. A touchstone, Bhāg. P. 5, 19, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकषा
निकषा निकषा, an old instr. of नि-कष् (for कर्ष्, vb. कृष्), + अ, prepos. with acc. Near, Hariv. 16038.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकषाय
निकषाय निकषाय, i. e. a denomin. derived from निकष with य, Ātm. To serve as touchstone, Daśak. 1, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

