निकाय|निकायः
निकाय निकाय, i. e. नि-चि + अ, m.<BR> 1. An assemblage, a class, Man. 1, 36. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0470-a " target="_blank">Page0470-a + 40</a>]<BR> 2. A multitude, Bhāg. P. 4, 24, 25.<BR> 3. A house, a dwelling-place, Rām. 4, 44, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0469-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकार|निकारः
निकार निकार, i. e. नि-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Humiliation, MBh. 1, 7081.<BR> 2. Abuse, 14, 1788.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0470-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाश|निकाशः
