निदिध्यासन|निदिध्यासनं
निदिध्यासन निदिध्यासन, i. e. नि-दिध्यास, desider. of ध्यै, + अन, n. Profound meditation, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिध्यासु
निदिध्यासु निदिध्यासु, i. e. नि-दिध्यास, desider. of ध्यै, + उ, adj. Desiring to meditate on, Bhāg. P. 2, 10, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदेश|निदेशः
निदेश निदेश, m., i. e.<BR> 1. नि-दिश् + अ, Order, MBh. 12, 8929.<BR> 2. नि-देश, Neighbourhood, Man. 2, 197.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निद्रा
निद्रा नि-२. द्रा, f.<BR> 1. Sleep, Rām. 4, 26, 9.<BR> 2. Sleepiness, Hiḍ. 1, 4.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिद्रा
अ- + निद्रा अ- + निद्रा,<BR> I. f. sleeplessness.<BR> II. adj. (अ-निद्र), sleepless, Rām. 2, 2, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिद्र
अति-निद्र अति-निद्र, adj. one who sleeps excessively, 6, 37, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनिद्र
अप- + निद्र अप- + निद्र, adj. 1. sleepless, Kir. 5, 26. 2. opened, Śiś. 9, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्निद्र|उन्निद्रः
