निधान|निधानं
निधान निधान, i. e. नि-धा + अन, n. (m., Rām. 5, 11, 4),<BR> 1. Putting aside, MBh. 4, 158.<BR> 2. A receptacle, a place or vessel in or on which anything is collected or deposited, Hariv. 2477.<BR> 3. A treasure, Man. 8, 36.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

