निनादिन्
निनादिन् निनादिन्, i. e. निनाद + इन्, and नि-नद् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Sounding, Rām. 1, 20, 7.<BR> 2. Playing, Hariv. 2458.<BR> 3. Accompanied by the sound of, MBh. 5, 3139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निनीषा
निनीषा निनीषा, i. e. निनीष, desider. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a " target="_blank">Page0474-a + 40</a>] of नी, + अ, f. Desire to carry, MBh. 8, 3445.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0473-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निनीषु
निनीषु निनीषु, i. e. निनीष, desider. of नी, + उ, adj. Wishing to bring, Man. 4, 244.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्द
निन्द निन्द्, see 1. निद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्दक|निंदक|निन्दकः
निन्दक निन्द् + अक, adj. subst. Blaming, defaming, Man. 2, 201; a scorner, 2, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्दन|निंदन|निंदनं|निन्दनं
निन्दन निन्द् + अन, n. Blame, Bhāg. P. 7, 1, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्दा|निंदा
निन्दा निन्दा, i. e. निन्द् + अ, f.<BR> 1. Blame, Man. 8, 19.<BR> 2. Defamation, Man. 2, 200.<BR> 3. Scorn, Bhāg. P. 4, 21, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्द्यता
निन्द्यता निन्द्य + ता (vb. निन्द्), f. Infamy, Man. 5, 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्व्
† निन्व् निन्व्, or सिन्व् सिन्व्, i. 1, Par. To wet, or to wait on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपतन|निपतनं
निपतन नि-पत् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Falling, MBh. 8, 1788.<BR> 2. Flying, 1895.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपात|निपातः
निपात निपात, i. e. नि-पत् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Falling, Man. 11, 104.<BR> 2. Casting, 3, 241.<BR> 3. Death, 8, 185.<BR> 4. The opposite extremity, Bhāg. P. 5, 21, 9.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धारानिपात|धारानिपातः
धारा- + निपात धारा- + निपात, m. A sudden shower of rain, Pañc. 93, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातक|निपातकः
निपातक निपातक, नि-पत्, Caus., + अक (m. or n.), Sin, MBh. 5, 4053.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातन|निपातनं
निपातन निपातन, i. e. नि-पत्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj. Destroying, MBh. 3, 1624.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Dropping, Rām. 6, 74, 24.<BR> 2. Putting on, Suśr. 1, 95, 17.<BR> 3. Touching, 290, 17.<BR> 4. Beating, Man. 11, 208.<BR> 5. Killing, 8, 298.<BR> 6. Flying down, hurrying down, Pañc. ii. d. 57.<BR> 7. Falling down, Yājñ. 1, 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातिन्
निपातिन् निपातिन्, i. e. नि-पत् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Falling down, Vikr. d. 153.<BR> 2. Flying on, Ragh. 9, 40.<BR> 3. Destroying, MBh. 7, 9462.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपान|निपानं
निपान निपान, i. e. नि-१. पा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Drinking, MBh. 13, 3439.<BR> 2. A pool, Man. 4, 201.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिपान
अ- + निपान अ- + निपान, n. thirst, Bhāg. P. 5, 26, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपानवन्त्|निपानवत्
निपानवन्त् निपान + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Abounding in pools, Ragh. 9, 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपुण|निपुणः
निपुण निपुण, i. e. probably नि-पुष् + न, adj., f. णा.<BR> 1. Perfect, Man. 5, 61.<BR> 2. Clever, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 490.<BR> 3. Conversant, 57. ˚णम्, adv.<BR> 1. Completely, Rām. 2, 96, 1 Gorr.<BR> 2. Carefully, 4, 44, 82.<BR> 3. In a delicate manner, Śāk. 59, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपुणतस्
निपुणतस् निपुण + तस्, adv. Completely, MBh. 12, 10217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपुणता
निपुणता निपुण + ता, f.<BR> 1. Cleverness, Bhartṛ. Suppl. 10.<BR> 2. Carefulness, Pañc. 181, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबन्ध|निबंध|निबन्धं|निबंधः|निबन्धः
निबन्ध नि-बन्ध् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Fastening, binding, Rām. 5, 42, 4.<BR> 2. Fetter, Bhāg. P. 6, 2, 46.<BR> 3. Root, MBh. 2, 2532.<BR> 4. Fixed property, Yājñ. 2, 121.<BR> 5. A literary work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबन्धन|निबंधन|निबंधनं|निबन्धनं
निबन्धन नि-बन्ध् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Binding, Bhāg. P. 3, 21, 54.<BR> II. f. नी, Fetter, MBh. 5, 771.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. Binding, ligation, Man. 2, 27; making (a bridge), MBh. 3, 10725.<BR> 2. Bond, fetter, 12, 9680.<BR> 3. A receptacle, Rām. 2, 31, 28 Gorr.<BR> 4. Cause, motive, MBh. 1, 5141; Man. 9, 27.<BR> 5. Syntax, Kumāras. 7, 90.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थनिबन्धन
अर्थ- + निबन्धन अर्थ- + निबन्धन, adj. having (its) cause in wealth, MBh. 1, 5141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्त्रीनिबन्धन|स्त्रीनिबंधन
स्त्री- + निबन्धन स्त्री- + निबन्धन, n. domestic duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबन्धिन्|निबंधिन्
निबन्धिन् निबन्धिन्, i. e. नि-बन्ध् + इन्, and निबन्ध + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Binding, MBh. 12, 6548.<BR> 2. Joined, 11, 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबर्हण|निबर्हणं
निबर्हण निबर्हण, and निवर्हण निवर्हण, i. e. नि-बर्ह्, or वर्ह् + अन,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Destroying, Rām. 1, 1, 11. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a " target="_blank">Page0475-a + 42</a>]<BR> 2. Removing, Suśr. 1, 166, 11.<BR> II. n. Destruction, Rām. 1, 3, 30 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0474-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निभ|निभः
ऽनिभ -नि-भ (vb. भा), latter part of comp. adj., f. भा.<BR> 1. Like, resembling, Rām. 3, 49, 34.<BR> 2. Pleonastically in चारु-निभ-आनन, adj. Handsome-faced, Hariv. 11789.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निभीम
निभीम नि-भी + म, adj. Terrible, Hariv. 13599.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमज्जन|निमज्जनं
निमज्जन नि-मज्ज् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Absorbing, MBh. 7, 897.<BR> II. n. Diving, immersion, Rājat. 1, 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमन्त्रक
निमन्त्रक नि-मन्त्र् + अक, m. An inviter, MBh. 13, 2350.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमन्त्रण|निमंत्रण|निमंत्रणं|निमन्त्रणं
निमन्त्रण निमन्त्रण, i. e. नि-मन्त्र् + अन, n. Invitation, Yājñ. 2, 263.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमय|निमयः
निमय निमय, i. e. नि-मे + अ, m. Barter, exchange, MBh. 12, 2923.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमि|निमिः
निमि निमि, m. A proper name, Man. 7, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्त|निमित्तं
निमित्त नि-मित्त (vb. मा), n.<BR> 1. Aim, mark, MBh. 5, 3480.<BR> 2. Sign, omen, Man. 6, 50; Śāk. 8, 17.<BR> 3. Cause, motive, Bhāg. P. 8, 20, 6.<BR> 4. Instrumental cause, MBh. 3, 10743 (the cause on which the life of a prince was dependent, cf. 10744 and 10739).<BR> 5. ˚तम् acc., ˚तेन instr., ˚ताय dat., adverbially, On account of, Rām. 2, 48, 28; 90, 12; 30, 1.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमित्त
अ- + निमित्त अ- + निमित्त, adj. having no motive, Śāk. d. 176. acc. ˚तम्, adv. without a cause, Śāk. d. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतोनिमित्तम्
अतोनिमित्त + म् अतोनिमित्त + म्, i. e. अतस्-, adv. therefore, Nal. 9, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्निमित्त|किंनिमित्त
किम्- + निमित्त किम्- + निमित्त, adj. by what occasioned or caused, Bhāg. P. 9, 9, 19. acc. ˚तम्, adv. why, Chr. 80, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतोनिमित्त
कुतोनिमित्त कुतोनिमित्त, i. e. कुतस्-, adj. by what caused, Rām. 2, 74, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्निमित्त
दुस्- + निमित्त दुस्- + निमित्त, n. a bad omen, MBh. 2, 818.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्ततस्
निमित्ततस् निमित्त + तस्, adv. By a special cause, Suśr. 1, 91, 14.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमित्ततस्
अ- + निमित्ततस् अ- + निमित्ततस्, adv. without cause, Man. 4, 144.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिष्
निमिष् नि-मिष्, f. Twinkling of the eye.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिष्
अ- + निमिष् अ- + निमिष्, adj. sbst. a god (free from twinkling of the eyes), Bhāg. P. 5, 23, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिष|निमिषः
निमिष नि-मिष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Twinkling of the eye, Rām. 6, 102, 25.<BR> 2. A moment, 5, 56, 59.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 5, 3595.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिष|अनिमिषं|अनिमिषः
अ- + निमिष अ- + निमिष,<BR> I. adj. not twinkling, having the eyes fixed, Indr. 5, 28; Rām. 3, 6, 14.<BR> II. m. a god (see the preceding).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलन|निमीलनं
निमीलन नि-मील् + अन, n. Shutting the eye-lids, Amar. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलिका
निमीलिका निमीलिका, i. e. नि-मील् + अक, f. Twinkling of the eye; in गज-, Connivance, Rājat. 6, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलिन्
निमीलिन् निमीलिन्, i. e. नि-मील् + आ + इन्, Having the eye-lids shut, Naiṣ. 5, 71 (cf. Sch.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेष|निमेषः
निमेष निमेष, i. e. नि-मिष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Twinkling of the eye, Nal. 5, 26.<BR> 2. A moment, Rām. 3, 36, 19.<BR> 3. A proper name, MBh. 1, 1489.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमेष|अनिमेषं|अनिमेषः
अ- + निमेष अ- + निमेष,<BR> I. m. absence of twinkling, Ragh. 3, 43.<BR> II. adj. open, Rām. 3, 63, 22.<BR> III. m. a god, Bhāg. P. 6, 10, 1 (see निमिष्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्न|निम्नं
निम्न नि + म्न (i. e. नि + मन् + अ),<BR> I. adj., f. ना.<BR> 1. Deep, Ṛt. 5, 12; with न, high, grand, Bhartṛ. 2, 36.<BR> II. n. Low ground, MBh. 2, 784.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नगा
निम्नगा निम्नगा, i. e. निम्न-ग (vb. गम्), f. A river, Man. 9, 22.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गिरिनिम्नगा
गिरि- + निम्नगा गिरि- + निम्नगा, f. A mountain-stream, Rām. 2, 97, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0475-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

