निर्हार|निर्हारः
निर्हार निर्हार, i. e. निस्-हृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Carrying a corpse to the funeral pyre, Bhāg. P. 7, 2, 35.<BR> 2. A hoard, Man. 9, 199.<BR> 3. Rooting up, destruction, Bhāg. P. 3, 29, 10.<BR> 4. Evacuation of excrements, MBh. 13, 1796.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्हारक
