निर्हारिन्
निर्हारिन् निर्हारिन्, i. e. निस्-हृ + इन्, adj. Diffusively fragrant, MBh. 12, 6848.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्हृति|निर्हृतिः
निर्हृति निर्हृति, i. e. निस्-हृ + ति, f. Removal, Kām. Nītis. 13, 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

