निलय|निलयः
निलय निलय, i. e. नि-ली + अ, m. A dwelling-place, a nest, a house, Rām. 2, 46, 3; 25, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निलयन|निलयनं
