निवर्तक
निवर्तक निवर्तक, i. e. नि-वृत्, Caus., + अक, adj., f. तिका.<BR> 1. Turning back, flying, Hariv. 5048.<BR> 2. Causing to cease, removing, Bhāṣāp. 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवर्तन|निवर्त्तन
निवर्तन निवर्तन, i. e. नि-वृत् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Disappearing, MBh. 6, 2427.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Return, Rām. 6, 92, 4.<BR> 2. Ceasing, MBh. 1, 8388.<BR> 3. Abstaining from (abl.), 1, 373.<BR> 4. Inactivity, Kām. Nītis. 1, 28.<BR> 5. Bringing back, Amar. 84.<BR> 6. Turning off from (abl.), Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवर्तिन्
