निवह|निवहः
निवह नि-वह् + अ, m. A multitude, Pañc. v. d. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवात|निवातः
निवात नि-वात,<BR> I. adj., f. ता, Protected against the wind, not windy, Hariv. 3947.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. A place inaccessible to the wind, MBh. 2, 1218.<BR> 2. Calm, Kumāras. 3, 48.<BR> III. m. An impenetrable coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवाप|निवापः
निवाप निवाप, i. e. नि-वप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Seed, corn, MBh. 13, 4350.<BR> 2. Offering to the Manes, 12, 6996.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवापक|निवापकः
निवापक निवापक, i. e. नि-वप् + अक् m. A sower, Rām. 2, 90, 20 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0482-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवारक|निवारकः
निवारक निवारक, i. e. नि-वृ + अक, adj. Able to keep off, MBh. 8, 1276.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवारण|निवारणं
निवारण निवारण, i. e. नि-वृ + अन,<BR> I. adj. Keeping off, MBh. 3, 12454.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Keeping off, Rām. 2, 23, 40.<BR> 2. Preventing, MBh. 2, 2002.<BR> 3. Prohibition, Bhāg. P. 1, 5, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवास्
निवास् निवास्, i. 10 (rather a denomin. derived from निवास), Par. To put on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवास|निवासः
निवास निवास, i. e. नि-वस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Dwelling, Rām. 3, 5, 22.<BR> 2. Passing the night, Hariv. 9700.<BR> 3. An abode, a house, Bhāg. P. 1, 11, 27.<BR> 4. Nightquarters, Rām. 2, 55, 33.<BR> 5. Cloth, Hariv. 10679.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वनिवास
