निविड|निविडं
निविड निविड, probably नि-विल,<BR> I. adj., f. डा.<BR> 1. Without interstices, Mālav. d. 24.<BR> 2. Dense, Bhāg. P. 5, 2, 4.<BR> 3. Firm, Kathās. 5, 140.<BR> II. m. The name of a mountain, MBh. 6, 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवीतिन्
निवीतिन् निवीतिन्, i. e. नि-वीत + इन् (vb. व्ये), adj. Wearing the sacred cord fastened on one's neck, Man. 2, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवृत्ति|निवृत्तिः
निवृत्ति नि-वृत् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Return, MBh. 5, 7469.<BR> 2. Disappearance, 6, 5775.<BR> 3. Cessation, Śāk. 112, 16.<BR> 4. Abstinence, Man. 5, 56.<BR> 5. Abstaining from acting, inactivity, Bhag. 16, 7; Bhāṣāp. 148.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवेदन|निवेदनं|निवेदनः
निवेदन निवेदन, i. e. नि-विद्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj. Announcing, Hariv. 9289. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b " target="_blank">Page0483-b + 41</a>]<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Making known, Sāv. 3, 5.<BR> 2. Announcement, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 417.<BR> 3. Offering, MBh. 2, 1361.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवेदयिषु
निवेदयिषु निवेदयिषु, i. e. नि-वेदयिष (desider. of the Caus. of विद्, without reduplication), + उ, adj. Wishing to report (acc.), MBh. 3, 1543.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवेदिन्
