निवेश|निवेशः
निवेश निवेश, i. e. नि-विश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Settling, Hariv. 3520.<BR> 2. Encamping, 4999.<BR> 3. A residence, MBh. 1, 7781.<BR> 4. A camp, 5, 173.<BR> 5. Marriage, 1, 1051.<BR> 6. Foundation, Rām. 1, 34, 5.<BR> 7. Impression, mark, Śāk. d. 142, v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवेशन|निवेशनं
निवेशन निवेशन, i. e. नि-विश् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Entering, Hariv. 15005.<BR> II. m. A proper name, 9195.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. Sitting down, Rām. 6, 85.<BR> 2. Encamping, MBh. 14, 1901.<BR> 3. Marriage, Bhāg. P. 3, 7, 31.<BR> 4. A dwelling-place, a residence, Indr. 3, 2.<BR> 5. A camp, MBh. 5, 680.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्निवेशन
