निश्
† निश् निश्, i. 1, Par. To meditate profoundly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निश्
निश् निश्, probably curtailed निशा, f. Night, Man. 9, 60.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युनिश्
द्यु- + निश् द्यु- + निश्, f. day and night, Man. 4, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0483-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिश्
