निस्
निस् निस्, adv. (ved.), and preposition, Outward, out, forth.<BR> I. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives.<BR> II. Compounded with nouns, and implying:<BR> 1. Out of, e. g. निर्वन, Being out of a forest, MBh. 5, 863.<BR> 2. Negation, No, without, e. g. निरनुक्रोश,<BR> 1. m. No compassion = mercilessness, Rām. 4, 19, 21.<BR> 2. adj. Without mercy = merciless, 2, 34, 11 Gorr. निर्जीव,<BR> 1. m. Death, Kathās. 17, 15.<BR> 2. adj. Without life, MBh. 7, 1954.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0486-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

