नीच|नीचः
नीच नीच, i. e. नि-अञ्च् + अ, adj., f. चा.<BR> 1. Low, Man. 2, 198.<BR> 2. Short, Yājñ. 1, 131.<BR> 3. Deep, Pañc. i. d. 225.<BR> 4. Base, mean, Rām. 3, 35, 35.<BR> 5. ˚चैस्, instr. pl., adv.<BR> 1. Below, Megh. 43.<BR> 2. Low-bowing, MBh. 1, 3287.<BR> 3. Little, Ragh. 3, 43.<BR> 4. Humbly, Kām. Nītis. 7, 42.<BR> 5. Softly, Amar. 67.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0489-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

