नील नील, i. e. निश् + ल,<BR> I. adj., f. ला and ली, Black or dark-blue, Man. 11, 136.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A proper name, MBh. 1, 2697.<BR> 2. The name of a mountain, 6, 198.<BR> III. f. ली,<BR> 1. The indigo plant, Man. 10, 89.<BR> 2. A proper name, MBh. 1, 3722.<BR> IV. n. Indigo, the dye, Yājñ. 3, 38.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. niger for nigro = निश् + र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

