आ- + नील आ- + नील, adj. blackish, Kir. 5, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रनील|इन्द्रनीलः
इन्द्र- + नील इन्द्र- + नील, m. a sapphire, Megh. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कांस्यनील|कांस्यनीलः
कांस्य- + नील कांस्य- + नील, m. the name of a monkey, Rām. 4, 39, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानील|महानीलः
महा- + नील महा- + नील, m. 1. the sapphire. 2. one of the Nāgas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राजनील|राजनीलं
राज(न्)- + नील राज(न्)- + नील, n. the emerald.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0490-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलजा
नीलजा नीलजा, i. e. नील-ज, f. The river Vitastā, Rājat. 5, 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलता
नीलता नील + ता, f. Dark-blue colour, Kām. Nītis. 7, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलिमन्
नीलिमन् नीलिमन्, i. e. नील + इमन्, m. Blackness, Gīt. 8, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीव्
† नीव् नीव्, i. 1, Par. To become corpulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवार|नीवारः
नीवार नीवार,<BR> I. m. Rice growing wild, Rām. 2, 28, 21 Gorr.<BR> II. f. रा, The name of a river, MBh. 6, 328.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवि|नीविः
नीवि and नीवी नीवी̆, f. A cloth worn round a woman's waist, Yājñ. 2, 284.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोयनीवी
तोय-नीवी तोय-नीवी, adj. surrounded by the ocean, Bhāg. P. 1, 15, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीहार|नीहारः
नीहार नीहार, m. Fog, Hiḍ. 4, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीहारकर|नीहारकरः
नीहारकर नीहार-कर, m. The moon, Daśak. 7, 3, below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
1. नु नु, and नू नू, ved. (perhaps akin to नव, cf. नूतन), a particle,<BR> 1. Now (ved.).<BR> 2. A particle of interrogation in two or more interrogative sentences succeeding each other, Śāk. d. 137.<BR> 3. Preceded by interrogatives, MBh. 5, 6003.<BR> 4. नु--नु, Either... or, Rām. 2, 72, 27; नु--नु--नु ... or...or, Kir. 5, 1.<BR> 5. A part. of affirmation, Indeed, Chr. 291, 13 = Rigv. i. 64, 13.<BR> --Cf. νύ; Goth. nu; A.S. nu; νῦν; Lat. nunc (i. e. num-ce = νῦν κεν); Goth. nuh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
2. नु नु, ii. 2, and नु, or नू नू, i. 6, नुव, Par., and ved. i. 1, Ātm.<BR> 1. To shout (ved.).<BR> 2. To praise, Bhāg. P. 3, 23, 39.<BR> --With the prep. परि परि, णु णु, To praise, 1, 8, 44.<BR> --With प्र प्र, णु णु, To praise, 3, 21, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुड्
† नुड् नुड्, i. 6, Par. To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुति|नुतिः
नुति नु + ति, f. Praise, Bhartṛ. 2, 59 v. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
नुद् नुद्, i. 6, Par., Ātm. (ii. 2, Hariv. 7442).<BR> 1. To push on, Megh. 9.<BR> 2. To push away, to remove, MBh. 3, 12707; 4, 1819.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. नुत्त, नुन्न, नूत, and in epic poetry also नुदित, MBh. 1, 6670.<BR> --Caus. नोदय,<BR> 1. To push on, MBh. 9, 1005.<BR> 2. To incite, Rām. 5, 46, 12.<BR> --With the prep. अप अप,<BR> 1. To drive away, Bhāg. P. 1, 16, 35.<BR> 2. To remove, MBh. 14, 1853.<BR> --With व्यप वि-अप, To remove, 11, 24.<BR> --With अभि अभि, To strike, 14, 1718.<BR> --Caus. To order, 1478.<BR> --With अव अव, Caus.<BR> 1. To induce to drive away (two acc.), 7, 3069.<BR> --With अपा अप-आ, (probably अप with lengthened final),<BR> 1. To drive away, 7, 8691.<BR> 2. To remove, 3, 16973.<BR> 3. To expiate, Man. 6, 95.<BR> --With व्यपा वि-अप-आ (see अपा), To remove, MBh. 4, 1319.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ (?),<BR> 1. To drive away, 7, 1771.<BR> 2. To remove, 268.<BR> 3. To bruise, 6, 5619.<BR> --With उप उप, To drive near, Śiś. 4, 68.<BR> --With निस् निस्, निर्णुद् निर् णुद्,<BR> 1. To reject, Man. 4, 250.<BR> 2. To remove, MBh. 12, 7126.<BR> --With अभिनिस् To remove, 12, 10728.<BR> --With परा परा, णुद् णुद्, To remove, Bhāg. P. 3, 7, 7.<BR> --With प्र प्र, णुद् णुद्,<BR> 1. To drive away, MBh. 4, 1660.<BR> 2. To remove, Rām. 3, 78, 8.<BR> 3. To push on, MBh. 3, 12096.<BR> 4. To stir, Rām. 5, 3, 38.<BR> --Caus. प्र-णोदित, Agitated, Pañc. 165, 10.<BR> --With अतिप्र अति-प्र, To press hard, Daśak. in Chr. 193, 14.<BR> --With अनुप्र अनु-प्र, To put to flight, Rām. 6, 7, 36. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a " target="_blank">Page0492-a + 40</a>]<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र,<BR> 1. To urge, MBh. 3, 377.<BR> 2. To remove, 5, 745.<BR> --With वि वि,<BR> 1. To strike, to wound, 6, 4846.<BR> 2. To play (as a guitar), Bhāg. P. 4, 8, 38.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To remove, Śiś. 4, 60.<BR> 2. To spend (as a night), MBh. 3 46.<BR> 3. To exhilarate, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 135.<BR> --With अभवि अभि-वि, Caus. To exhilarate, MBh. 12, 898.<BR> --With सम् सम्,<BR> 1. To collect, 6, 777.<BR> 2. To push on, Nal. 20, 42.<BR> 3. To find, Rām. 5, 1, 92.<BR> --Cf. A.S. nydian (to compel), a-nydan (to repel); Goth. niutan; A.S. niótan (originally, to further), not, use, perhaps νύσσα.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0491-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
ऽनुद् -नुद्, latter part of a comp. adj., Removing, Kir. 5, 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद
ऽनुद -नुद + अ, Removing, Rām. 2, 91, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नू
नू नू, see नु,<BR> 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतन|नूतनः
नूतन नू + तन (1. नु, cf. नव), adj., f. ना,<BR> 1. New, Rājat. 5, 7.<BR> 2. Fresh, young, Kathās. 24, 228.<BR> 3. Strange, Hit. 77, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतनय
नूतनय नूतनय, a denomin. derived from नूतन with अय, Par. To renew, Bhāg. P. 3, 8, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूत्न|नूत्नः
नूत्न नूत्न, i. e. नू + तन (q. cf.), adj., f. त्ना,<BR> 1. New, Bhāg. P. 8, 9, 10.<BR> 2. Fresh, young, 6, 1, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनभाव|नूनभावः
नूनभाव नूनभाव, i. e. नूनम्-भाव, abl. ˚वात्, adv. Indeed, MBh. 3, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनम्
नूनम् नूनम् (1. नु and the pronoun न, acc.), adv. Surely, Rām. 3, 51, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूपुर|नूपुरं|नूपुरः
