नूपुरवन्त्|नूपुरवत्
नूपुरवन्त् नूपुर + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Adorned with an ornament for the feet, Amar. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृ
नृ नृ, m. A man; pl. Men, mankind, Man. 3, 81.<BR> --Superlat. नृतम, Most manly, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 87, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृत्
नृत् नृत्, i. 4, Par. (in poetry also Ātm., MBh. 7, 2913),<BR> 1. To dance, Man. 4, 64.<BR> 2. To represent, (as actor), Hariv. 8496.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. नृत्त, n. Dancing, Kathās. 9, 40.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. नृत्य, n. Dancing, acting, Megh. 37.<BR> --Caus. नर्तय, To cause to dance. MBh. 4, 307.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. नर्तित, n. Dancing, 7, 177. Frequent. नरी-नृत् and नरीनृत्य, To dance to and fro, Lass. 84, 9; 67, 7.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु,<BR> 1. To dance after (acc.), Rām. 3, 79, 15.<BR> 2. To dance before somebody (acc.), MBh. 9, 2468.<BR> --With आ आ, Caus. To cause to move softly, Amar. 32.<BR> --With उप उप,<BR> 1. To dance before somebody (acc.), Rām. 6 92, 71.<BR> 2. To mock somebody by dancing before him (acc.), MBh. 9, 3315.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. उप-नृत्य, used to be danced in, Rām. 3, 6, 3.<BR> --With परि परि, To dance round somebody (acc.), MBh. 2, 2532.<BR> --With प्र प्र,<BR> 1. To dance forward, Rām. 1, 45, 26 Gorr.<BR> 2. To begin to dance, MBh. 3, 6087 (read प्रनृत्तवान्).<BR> 3. To dance, Ṛt. 2, 14.<BR> 4. To mock somebody by dancing before him (acc.), MBh. 8, 4250. प्रनृत्त, Having begun to dance, dancing, MBh. 3, 1844.<BR> --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To begin to dance, 3, 6093.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, To mock somebody in one's turn by dancing, (acc.), 8, 4251.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0492-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृतू
नृतू नृत् + ऊ, m. A dancer, a mime, Chr. 294, 4 = Rigv. i. 92, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृत्तमय
नृत्तमय नृत्त + मय (vb. नृत्), adj. Consisting of dancing, Kathās. 23, 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृप|नृपः
नृप नृ-प (vb. 2. पा), A prince, a king, Man. 2, 139.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्नृप|दुर्नृपः
दुस्- + नृप दुस्- + नृप, m. a wicked king, Rājat. 5, 416.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपत्व
नृपत्व नृप + त्व, n. Sovereignty, Hariv. 4891.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवन्त्|नृवत्
नृवन्त् नृ + वन्त्, adj. Manly, Chr. 294, 7 = Rigv. i. 92, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशंस|नृशंसः
नृशंस नृ-शंस् + अ, adj.<BR> 1. Malicious, mischievous, Man. 3, 41.<BR> 2. Base, MBh. 13, 513.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृशंस
अ- + नृशंस अ- + नृशंस, adj. mild, Rām. 2, 62, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनृशंस
सु- + नृशंस सु- + नृशंस, very mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशंसता
नृशंसता नृशंस + ता, f. Mischievousness, baseness, Kathās. 26, 192.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृशंसता
अ- + नृशंसता अ- + नृशंसता, f. mildness, Rām. 3, 58, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशंसवन्त्|नृशंसवत्
नृशंसवन्त् नृशंस + वन्त्, adj. Mischievous, MBh. 4, 925.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0493-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशंस्य
