सावित्री- + पतित सावित्री- + पतित, m. a man of the three first classes, not invested at the proper time with the sacrificial cord, Man. 2, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0503-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पत्
2. पत् पत् (probably a denomin. derived from पति), i. 4, Ātm. To be powerful, to possess.<BR> --Cf. Lat. potiri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

