पति|पतिः
पति पति, i. e. 2. पा + ति (for original पा + तन्, cf. पत्नी).<BR> 1. A master, an owner.<BR> 2. A governor, a lord, Man. 7, 115.<BR> 3. A husband, MBh. 1, 4199.<BR> 4. When latter part of a comp. adj. the fem. is left unchanged, e. g. जीवत्-पति, i. e. जीवन्त्- (vb. जीव्), f. A woman whose husband is alive, Rām. 2, 24, 8 Gorr.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. potis; δες-πότης, πόσις; Goth. faths; cf. पत्नी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

