ग्रहपति|ग्रहपतिः
ग्रह- + पति ग्रह- + पति, m. 1. the sun. 2. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

