दानपति|दानपतिः
दान- + पति दान- + पति, m. a liberal man, Sāv. 1, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

