द्वारपति
द्वार- + पति द्वार- + पति, m. a doorkeeper, a chamberlain, MBh. 3, 10623.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

