प्रजा- + पति प्रजा- + पति, m. 1. lord of the creatures, Vikr. d. 9. 2. a name of the supreme deity, Brahman, Pañc. i. d. 188. 3. a king. 4. a father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपति|प्राणपतिः
