महीपति|महीपतिः
मही- + पति मही- + पति, m. a king, Chr. 47, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगपति|मृगपतिः
