शचीपति|शचीपतिः
शची- + पति शची- + पति, m. a name of Śiva, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 10. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0507-b " target="_blank">Page0507-b + 40</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाल्वपति
शाल्व- + पति शाल्व- + पति, m. the king of the Śālvas, Chr. 18, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रीपति|श्रीपतिः
श्री- + पति श्री- + पति, m. 1. Viṣṇu. 2. a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापति|सभापतिः
सभा- + पति सभा- + पति, m. 1. the president of an assembly. 2. the keeper of a gaming-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिन्धुपति|सिन्धुपतिः
सिन्धु- + पति सिन्धु- + पति, m. the lord of Sindh, i. e. Jayadratha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेनापति|सेनापतिः
सेना- + पति सेना- + पति, m. 1. the general of an army, Śāk. 24, 6. 2. Kārttikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वर्गपति|स्वर्गपतिः
