पद्
3. पद् and पाद् पाद्, i. e. पद्, m. A foot, Man. 4, 207; 6, 46.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. πούς, ποδός, πέδη, πέδιλον, πέζα, πεζός; Lat. pes, pedis, tripudiare, repudiare, impedire; see पद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0511-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

