पदात|पदातः
पदात पदात, i. e. पद-अत् + अ, m. A pedestrian, a foot-soldier, Hariv. 5914.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0512-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदाति|पदातिः
पदाति पदाति, i. e. पद-अत् + इ, m.<BR> 1. A pedestrian, a foot-soldier, Rām. 1, 55, 4.<BR> 2. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0512-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातिन्
पदातिन् पदातिन्, i. e.<BR> I. पदात + इन्, adj., f. नी, Consisting of footsoldiers, MBh. 5, 5703.<BR> II. पद-अत् + इन्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a " target="_blank">Page0513-a + 43</a>] m. A foot-soldier, Rām. 2, 40, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0512-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातीय|पदातीयः
पदातीय पदातीय, i. e. पदाति + ईय, m. A foot-soldier, MBh. 7, 7598.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदान्तर|पदांतर
पदान्तर पदान्तर, i. e. पद-अन्तर, n. The interval of a step. पदान्तरे, Having made a step, Śāk. 12, 6.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदान्तरम्
अ-पदान्तर + म् अ-पदान्तर + म्, adv. immediately after, MBh. 2, 1766.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदार्थ|पदार्थः
पदार्थ पदार्थ, i. e. पद-अर्थ, m.<BR> 1. The meaning of a word, Nyāya S. 2, 131.<BR> 2. Substance, thing, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 2.<BR> 3. A category, Bhāṣāp. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदी
पदी पदी, see 3. पद् and पद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्धति|पद्धतिः
पद्धति पद्धति, i. e. पद्-हन् + ति, f.<BR> 1. A way, a path, Ragh. 11, 87.<BR> 2. A guide, designation of a class of literary compositions.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पादपद्धति|पादपद्धतिः
पाद- + पद्धति पाद- + पद्धति, f. a line of footsteps, Pañc. 35, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्म|पद्मं|पद्मः
पद्म पद्म (curtailed पद् + मन्त्),<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. A lotus flower, MBh. 1, 5412.<BR> 2. Ornament, Rām. 6, 10, 19.<BR> 3. Moles or marks on the body, 5, 32, 11.<BR> 4. A spot, 3, 48, 12.<BR> 5. Coloured marks on the face and trunk of an elephant.<BR> 6. A lotus-like form of array, Man. 7, 188.<BR> 7. A particular sitting posture when absorbed in meditation, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 17.<BR> 8. One of Kuvera's treasures, MBh. 2, 418.<BR> 9. A large number, 1000 billions, 2, 2143.<BR> 10. A certain fragrant plant.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A kind of snake, Suśr. 2, 265, 8.<BR> 2. The name of a Nāga.<BR> 3. A proper name.<BR> III. f. मा,<BR> 1. A name of Śrī, Man. 7, 11.<BR> 2. The name of two plants, Clerodendrum siphonanthus, and Hibiscus mutabilis.<BR> 3. A proper name.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिपद्म
अभि- + पद्म अभि- + पद्म, adj. 1. adorned with lotus-like spots. 2. beautiful in every part of the body, Johns. Sel. 46, 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रातृपद्मवन
भ्रातृ-पद्म-वन भ्रातृ-पद्म-वन, n. a group of lotus-like brothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्म|महापद्मः
महा- + पद्म महा- + पद्म, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b " target="_blank">Page0513-b + 42</a>]<BR> I. m. 1. one of the Nāgas. 2. one of Kuvera's treasures. 3. a Kiṃnara, or attendant on Kuvera. 4. a large number, one hundred thousand millions, MBh. 2, 2143. 5. the name of a lake, Rājat. 5, 68; 103.<BR> II. n. the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपद्म
स- + पद्म स- + पद्म, adj. provided with lotus flowers, Rām. 3, 52, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मक|पद्मकं
पद्मक पद्म + क, m.<BR> 1. An army arrayed in the form of a lotus flower, MBh. 7, 2674.<BR> 2. A certain tree and its wood; m. and n. Costus speciosus or arabicus.<BR> 3. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मज|पद्मजः
पद्मज पद्म-ज (vb. जन्), m. A name of Brahman, Bhāg. P. 8, 16, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मभव|पद्मभवः
पद्मभव पद्मभव, i. e. पद्म-भू + अ,<BR> 1. adj. Sprung up from a lotus flower.<BR> 2. A name of Brahman, Bhāg. P. 8, 21, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्ममय
पद्ममय पद्म + मय, adj., f. यि, Consisting of lotus flowers, Hariv. 9435.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मरागमय
पद्मरागमय पद्म-राग + मय, adj., f. यी, Consisting of rubies, MBh. 5, 3577.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मवन्त्|पद्मवत्
पद्मवन्त् पद्म + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Abounding in lotus flowers, Hariv. 3838.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मशस्
पद्मशस् पद्म + शस्, adv. By hundred thousand millions, MBh. 1, 233.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मावती
पद्मावती पद्मावती, i. e. पद्म + वन्त् + ई, f.<BR> 1. A surname of Lakṣmī, Gīt. 1, 2.<BR> 2. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मिन्
पद्मिन् पद्मिन्, i. e. पद्म + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Having coloured marks, etc. (see पद्म<BR> 5), MBh. 2, 2075.<BR> II. m. An elephant.<BR> III. f. नी,<BR> 1. A lotus, Nelumbium speciosum, MBh. 1, 7228.<BR> 2. A multitude of lotusses, Rām. 2, 52, 98; a lake abounding in them, MBh. 13, 4471.<BR> 3. A woman of the first of the four classes into which the sex is distinguished.<BR> 4. A sort of witchcraft, Mārk. P. 64, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0513-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मेशय|पद्मेशयः
पद्मेशय पद्मेशय, i. e. पद्म + इ-शी + अ, adj. Sleeping in a lotus flower, Hariv. 14119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्य|पद्यं|पद्यः
पद्य पद्य, i. e. पद + य, n. A verse, Häberl. Anth. 529, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्वन्त्|पद्वत्
पद्वन्त् पद् + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Having feet.<BR> 2. Running.<BR> --Cf. Lat. pedes, peditis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्
पन् पन् (cf. पण्), i. 1, Ātm.; base of the pres. पनाय, Par. and Ātm. i. 10 पनय, To praise, Chr. 293, 3 = Rigv. i. 87, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पनस|पनसः
पनस पनस, m.<BR> 1. The bread fruit or Jaka tree, Artocarpus integrifolia Lin.<BR> 2. A kind of snake, Suśr. 2, 265, 12.<BR> 3. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्थ्
† पन्थ् पन्थ्, i. 1 and 10, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्थन्
पन्थन् पन्थन्, पन्थास् पन्थास्, see पथिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्नग|पन्नगः
पन्नग पन्नग, i. e. पद्-न-ग, m.<BR> 1. A snake, Nal. 14, 8.<BR> 2. A snake-shaped demon.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपन्नग
स-पन्नग स-पन्नग, adj. with the snake-shaped demons, Rām. 3, 54, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पम्पा|पंपा
पम्पा पम्पा, f. The name of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पम्ब्
† पम्ब् पम्ब्, i. 1, Par. To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयस्
पयस् पयस् (akin to 1. पा, cf. also पी), n.<BR> 1. Juice.<BR> 2. Water, Bhartṛ. 2, 29.<BR> 3. Milk, Man. 2, 107.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपपयस्
अप- + पयस् अप- + पयस्, adj. without water, Kirāt. 5, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मपयस्|घर्म्मपयस्
घर्म- + पयस् घर्म- + पयस्, n. sweat, Śiś. 9, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयस्वल|पयस्वलः
पयस्वल पयस् + वल, adj., f. ला, Abounding in milk, Hariv. 3798.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयस्विन्
पयस्विन् पयस् + विन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Abounding in milk, Man. 11, 137.<BR> II. f. नी, A cow with abundance of milk, MBh. 13, 703.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोद|पयोदः
पयोद पयोद, i. e. पयस्-द,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A cloud, Śāk. d. 75.<BR> 2. A proper name.<BR> II. f. दा, A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोधर|पयोधरः
पयोधर पयोधर, i. e. पयस्-धर, m.<BR> 1. A cloud, Rājat. 4, 365.<BR> 2. A woman's breast, Ṛt. 1, 6.<BR> 3. An udder, Ragh. 2, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोधस्
पयोधस् पयोधस्, i. e. पयस्-धन्त् (vb. धा, cf. ऊधन् and पयोधि), m.<BR> 1. The occan.<BR> 2. A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोधि|पयोधिः
पयोधि पयोधि, i. e. पयस्-धि, m. The ocean, Kathās. 22, 205.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोमुच्
पयोमुच् पयोमुच्, i. e. पयस्-मुच्,<BR> 1. adj. Yielding milk, MBh. 13, 3754.<BR> 2. m. A cloud, 9, 1506.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोवृध्
पयोवृध् पयोवृध्, i. e. पयस्-वृध्, adj. Superabounding with water, Chr. 290, 11 = Rigv. i. 64, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोष्णी
पयोष्णी पयोष्णी, i. e. an anomal. comp. पयस्-उष्ण + ई, f. The name of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर|परं|परः
पर पर, i. e. perhaps अप + र, or 1. पृ + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Distant.<BR> 2. Opposite, ulterior, Rām. 1, 11, 19 Gorr.<BR> 3. Being beyond, Man. 7, 158.<BR> 4. Exceeding, MBh. 1, 7975; left or remaining, Kathās. 39, 16.<BR> 5. Highest, longest, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 12.<BR> 6. Ancient, Man. 9, 99.<BR> 7. Pre-eminent, superior, higher, Man. 2, 83.<BR> 8. Distinguished, greatest, Man. 1, 106.<BR> 9. Intent, Rām. 5, 24, 13.<BR> 10. Subsequent, following, Man. 3, 37.<BR> 11. Different, Prab. 114, 8; other, Rām. 6, 9, 12.<BR> 12. Inimical, enemy, Man. 7, 94.<BR> II. परम्, adv.<BR> 1. With abl.,<BR> a. Beyond, Ragh. 1, 17.<BR> b. After, Man. 2, 122.<BR> 2. With preceding अतस्,<BR> a. Further from hence, Nal. 9, 23.<BR> b. After that, Man. 8, 129.<BR> c. Next, 9, 56.<BR> 3. Excessively, Rām. 6, 5, 14.<BR> 4. Completely, Mālav. 4, 19. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-a " target="_blank">Page0515-a + 45</a>]<BR> 5. Rather, MBh. 13, 4857.<BR> 6. Most willingly, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 406.<BR> 7. At the most, 993.<BR> 8. With preceding यदि, Perhaps, Kathās. 42, 19.<BR> 9. Only, 40, 8.<BR> 10. But, Pañc. 243, 14.<BR> III. परेण,<BR> 1. with acc. Beyond; परेणास्मान् परैहि, Pass by us, MBh. 1, 8414.<BR> 2. Afterwards, Man. 8, 30.<BR> 3. With abl. After, MBh. 12, 842.<BR> IV. परे, adv. Afterwards, 12, 2880.<BR> V. m. and n. The universal soul, Bhag. 3, 19.<BR> VI. n. Culmen, highest degree, MBh. 1, 2025.<BR> VII. m.<BR> 1. A descendant, Pañc. iii. d. 216.<BR> 2. A proper name.<BR> 3. The name of the palace of Mitravindā, Hariv. 8986.<BR> VIII. f. रा, The name of a river.<BR> IX. When latter part of a comp. it implies often,<BR> 1. Intent on, e. g. शौच-, adj. Intent on purity, Man. 3, 192.<BR> 2. Absorbed in, e. g. चिन्ता-, adj. Thoughtful.<BR> 3. Affected with, e. g. करुणा-, adj. Compassionate.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. πέραν, πέρην, πέρα, πέρηθεν, περαίτερος, etc., περαῖος, πέρας, πεῖρας, ἄπειρος, ἀπείρεσιος, etc.; Lat. perendie, i. e. pere-m + die; see also पृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पर|तत्परः
तत्पर तत्पर, i. e. तद्-, 1. subsequent to that. 2. intent only on that. 3. completely devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दैवपर|दैवपरः
दैव- + पर दैव- + पर, m. a fatalist, Kām. Nītis. 9, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मानपर
मान- + पर मान- + पर, adj., f. रा, arrogant, proud, Śiś. 9, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रहपर
विग्रह- + पर विग्रह- + पर, adj. fighting, Pañc. 117, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0514-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकीय|परकीयं
परकीय परकीय, i. e. पर + क + ईय, adj.<BR> 1. Belonging to another, Śāk. d. 97.<BR> 2. Hostile, Kām. Nītis. 8, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परज
परज पर-ज, m. A stranger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतस्
परतस् पर + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. = abl. of पर, e. g. परतस्-परस्, Higher than the highest, Kumāras. 2, 14; स्वकात् परतो वा गेहात्, From his own house or that of another, Bhāg. P. 1, 13, 25.<BR> 2. Further, Rām. 2, 15, 5 Gorr.<BR> 3. With abl.<BR> a. After, Yājñ. 2, 173.<BR> b. Over, Bhag. 3, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परता
परता पर + ता, f.<BR> 1. Absoluteness, Bhāṣāp. 7.<BR> 2. Highest degree, Rājat. 5, 377.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्परता
तद्-पर + ता तद्-पर + ता, f. intentness, Hit. iv. d. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्र|परत्रं
परत्र पर + त्र, adv. In the other world, Man. 3, 275. परत्राय पर-त्राय, To the other world, MBh. 13, 7688.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्व|परत्वं
परत्व पर + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Condition of being more extensive (as a genus), Bhāṣāp. 7; comprehensive.<BR> 2. Length of distance and time, Bhāṣāp. 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारिन्
परदारिन् परदारिन्, i. e. पर-दार + इन्, m. An adulterer, Rām. 3, 57, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परंतप|परन्तप|परंतपः|परन्तपः
परंतप परंतप, i. e. पर + म्-तप् + अ, adj. subst. Vexing the foe, Bhag. 4, 2. A conqueror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपुष्ट|परपुष्टः
परपुष्ट पर-पुष्ट (vb. पुष्), m. The Cocila or Indian cuckoo, Rām. 3, 78, 29. f. टा, Its female.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभागता
परभागता पर-भाग + ता, f. Excellence, supremacy, Ragh. 5, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभृत|परभृतः
परभृत पर-भृत (vb. भृ), m. The Cocila or Indian cuckoo, Śāk. d. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम|परमः
परम पर + म,<BR> I. superl. of पर, f. मा.<BR> 1. Most excellent, Man. 1, 108; best, 4, 14.<BR> 2. Highest, Man. 9, 319.<BR> 3. Extreme, 8, 302.<BR> 4. Worst, Brāhmaṇav. 1, 15.<BR> 5. With चेतस्, All (the heart), Rām. 2, 34, 36.<BR> 6. With an abl. it has the signification of the comparat., More excellent, superior, worse; को न्यो स्ति परमः शिवात्, Who is higher than Śiva, MBh. 13, 793.<BR> II. परमम्, adv. Yes, MBh. 3, 17056. Very well, Johns. Sel. 37, 20.<BR> III. When latter part of a comp. adj. it implies sometimes,<BR> 1. Amounting at the most to, MBh. 2, 2080.<BR> 2. Consisting principally of, 5, 1143.<BR> 3. Occupied only with, Man. 6, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमक
परमक परम + क, adj., f. इका,<BR> 1. Most excellent, best, Rām. 4, 35, 13.<BR> 2. Highest, MBh. 3, 13695.<BR> 3. Extreme, Chr. 35, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमतस्
परमतस् परम + तस्, adv. Still worse, Bhartṛ. 3, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाणुता
परमाणुता परमाणुता, i. e. परम-अणु + ता, f.<BR> 1. The condition of an atom, Ragh. 15, 22.<BR> 2. An infinitely short moment, Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थतस्
परमार्थतस् परमार्थतस्, i. e. परम-अर्थ + तस्, adv. In the true sense of the word, Vedāntas. in Chr. 218, 19; Pañc. i. d. 152.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्ठिन्
परमेष्ठिन् परमेष्ठिन्, i. e. परम + इ-स्थिन् (vb. स्था),<BR> 1. m. The supreme being, a name of Brahman, Śiva, etc.<BR> 2. m. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परंपर|परम्पर|परंपरः|परम्परः
परंपर परंपर, i. e. पर + म्-पर,<BR> I. adj. Successive, one after another, Suśr. 1, 105, 3.<BR> II. f. रा,<BR> 1. An uninterrupted succession, a chain, Pañc. 251, 9.<BR> 2. A continuous lineage, MBh. 3, 13621.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपरंपरा
कर्ण- + परंपरा कर्ण- + परंपरा, f. rumour, Pañc. 130, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवत्|परवन्त्
परवत् पर + वत्, adv. Like a stranger, Kathās. 27, 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवत्ता
परवत्ता परवत्ता, i. e. परवन्त् + ता, f. Obedience, Vikr. d. 155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवन्त्|परवत्
परवन्त् पर + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Depending on another, Śāk. d. 53.<BR> 2. Deprived of strength, Utt. Rāmac. 80, 11.<BR> 3. Ready to obey, MBh. 13, 2731.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधर्मपरवन्त्
अ-धर्म- + परवन्त् अ-धर्म- + परवन्त्, i. e. अ-धर्म-पर + वन्त्, adj. become a prey to injustice, Rām. 5, 45, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवश्यता
परवश्यता पर-वश्य + ता, f. Dependence on another, Rām. 5, 26, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परवाच्यता
परवाच्यता पर-वाच्य + ता (vb. वच्), f. Condition of being an object of censure to others, MBh. 6, 4476.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परशु|परशुः
परशु परशु, i. e. पर-, compounded with a derivative of शो, m. An axe, a hatchet, Rām. 1, 74, 18.<BR> --Cf. πέλεκυς.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परश्वध|परश्वधः
परश्वध परश्वध (cf. the last), m. An axe, a hatchet, Rām. 6, 27, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परश्वधिन्
परश्वधिन् परश्वधिन्, i. e. पर-श्वध + इन्, adj. Provided with an axe, MBh. 5, 6099.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्
परस् परस् (akin to पर), adv. and prep.<BR> 1. Beyond.<BR> 2. After.<BR> 3. More than.<BR> 4. Without.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोरजस्
परोरजस् परोरजस्, i. e. परस्-रजस्, adj. untouched by passion, Utt. Rāmac. 120, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसात्
परसात् पर + सात्, adv. Into the hands of another, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 931.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्तात्
परस्तात् परस्-तात् (old abl. of तद्), adv. and prep. with the gen.<BR> 1. Beyond, Bhag. 8, 9.<BR> 2. Higher, Mālav. d. 1.<BR> 3. Further on.<BR> 4. Afterward, Bhāg. P. 4, 9, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्पर|परस्परं
परस्पर पर + स्-पर,<BR> I. adj. (sing. and without nom. sing.),<BR> 1. Each other, mutual, Bhag. 3, 11.<BR> 2. One with another, MBh. 12, 2420 (nom. pl.).<BR> II. रम्, adv.<BR> 1. Each other, mutually, Man. 9, 62.<BR> 2. To one after another, Bhāg. P. 1, 8, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्परतस्
परस्परतस् परस्पर + तस्, adv. One by another, mutually, Nal. 5, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परा
परा परा, old instr. sing. of पर, inseparable preposition combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives (immediately with a noun in परासु), Away, over, on, inverted, wrong, back, sideward.<BR> --Cf. παρά, πάλιν; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a " target="_blank">Page0517-a + 40</a>] Lat. per, e. g. in per-dere, per-fidus (cf. परि); Goth. fair- and fra-; A.S. for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0516-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक|पराकः
पराक पराक, i. e. पराञ्च् + अ, m. A sort of penance, fasting for twelve days and nights, Man. 11, 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रम|पराक्रमः
पराक्रम परा-क्रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Prowess, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 498.<BR> 2. Exertion, Rām. 6, 37, 49.<BR> 3. Strength, valour, Man. 7, 11.<BR> 4. Power, Rām. 1, 75, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रमवन्त्|पराक्रमवत्
पराक्रमवन्त् पराक्रम + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Endowed with courage, or power, Mārk. P. 21, 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रमिन्
पराक्रमिन् पराक्रमिन्, i. e. परा-क्रम् + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Exerting one's power, MBh. 6, 1915.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराक्रान्तृ
पराक्रान्तृ पराक्रान्तृ, i. e. परा-क्रम् + तृ, m. Exerting one's power, MBh. 6, 1945.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराग|परागः
पराग पराग, i. e. probably उप or अप-राग, m. The pollen or farina of a flower, Bhartṛ. 1, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्मुखता
पराङ्मुखता पराङ्मुखता, i. e. पराञ्च्-मुख + ता, f. Condition of having averted one's face, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 530.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्मुखत्व
पराङ्मुखत्व पराङ्मुखत्व, i. e. पराञ्च्-मुख + त्व, n. The same figuratively, Aversion, Ragh. 18, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराचीन|पराचीनः
पराचीन पराचीन, i. e. पराञ्च् + ईन, adj.<BR> 1. Turned away, Suśr. 1, 100, 12.<BR> 2. Not minding, MBh. 12, 8159.<BR> 3. Being beyond, Bhāg. P. 5, 20, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजय|पराजयः
पराजय पराजय, i. e. परा-जि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Being deprived of, loss (with abl.), MBh. 3, 2565.<BR> 2. Losing at play, 2, 2170; at a law-suit, Pañc. 167, 5.<BR> 3. Defeat, Man. 7, 199.<BR> 4. Conquering, victory, MBh. 1, 5514.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजिष्णु
पराजिष्णु पराजिष्णु, i. e. परा-जि + स्नु, adj. Victorious, MBh. 10, 632.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराञ्च्|परांच्
पराञ्च् पराञ्च्, i. e. परा-अञ्च्, adj., f. आची.<BR> 1. Turned away, Bhāg. P. 4, 11, 10.<BR> 2. Distant, 5, 5, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराधीनता
पराधीनता पराधीनता, i. e. पर-अधीन + ता, f. Dependence, Mṛcch. 137, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परापरता
परापरता परापरता, i. e. पर-अपर + ता, f. and त्व त्व, n.<BR> 1. The condition of being both a genus and a species, Bhāṣāp. 8.<BR> 2. Priority and posteriority, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराभव|पराभवः
पराभव पराभव, i. e. परा-भू + अ, m.<BR> 1. Disappearance, Rām. 4, 29, 24.<BR> 2. Defeat, Mārk. P. 18, 28.<BR> 3. Mortification, humiliation, MBh. 4, 464; Pañc. pr. d. 11.<BR> 4. Disregard, Lass. Anth. 43, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराभाव|पराभावः
पराभाव पराभाव, i. e. परा-भू + अ, m. Defeat, Arj. 10, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराभूति|पराभूतिः
पराभूति परा-भू + ति, f.<BR> 1. Defeat, Bhāg. P. 2, 6, 9.<BR> 2. Humiliation, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परामर्श|परामर्शः
परामर्श परामर्श, i. e. परा-मृश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Pulling, MBh. 7, 1399.<BR> 2. Drawing (as a bow), Rām. 1, 76, 17.<BR> 3. Injuring, 3, 7, 30.<BR> 4. Assailing, MBh. 3, 15060.<BR> 5. Consideration, reflexion, MBh. 7, 4188.<BR> 6. Knowledge of the minor premiss in its connection with the major, Bhāṣāp. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परायण|परायणं
परायण परायण, i. e. पर-अयन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Chief, principal, MBh. 1, 1624.<BR> 2. with कृ, To do one's utmost, 6, 3929.<BR> II. adj.<BR> 1. Principal, 4, 2269.<BR> 2. Adhering (with accus.), Rām. 1, 7, 9.<BR> 3. Connected with (gen.), MBh. 7, 8252 (leading to victory).<BR> III. When latter part of a comp. adj. it implies,<BR> 1. Wholly occupied with, Man. 4, 10. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a " target="_blank">Page0518-a + 41</a>]<BR> 2. Intent on, MBh. 3, 2482.<BR> 3. Affected by, Nal. 23, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0517-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परायणवन्त्|परायणवत्
परायणवन्त् परायण + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Most elevated, MBh. 1, 8055.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परार्ध
परार्ध परार्ध i. e. पर-अर्ध,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The ulterior part, MBh. 2, 1864.<BR> 2. The other part, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 382.<BR> II. m. and n.<BR> 1. The number 100,000,000,000,000,000.<BR> 2. Fifty years of Brahman (half his supposed æon), Bhāg. P. 3, 11, 33.<BR> III. (inexactly), instead of परार्ध्य, adj. Most excellent, most beautiful, MBh. 4, 2188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परार्ध्य
परार्ध्य परार्ध्य, i. e. परार्ध + य,<BR> I. adj., f. या, Most excellent, most beautiful, best, MBh. 1, 6962; with abl. More excellent than, Ragh. 10, 65.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. An infinite number.<BR> 2. A maximum.<BR> III. as latter part of comp. adj.<BR> 1. Amounting to an infinite number.<BR> 2. Amounting at the most to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावर
परावर परावर, i. e. पर-अवर,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Far and near, MBh. 12, 8336.<BR> 2. Ancestors and descendants, Man. 1, 105.<BR> 3. All-comprising, Vedāntas. in Chr. 218, 15.<BR> 4. Every succeeding one, Bhāg. P. 3, 5, 36.<BR> II. n. That which is far and near, i. e.<BR> 1. The universe, MBh. 1, 23.<BR> 2. Totality, Sāv. 6, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावरत्व
परावरत्व परावर + त्व, n. Condition of being superior or inferior, Bhāg. P. 7, 9, 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावर्तन
परावर्तन परावर्तन, i. e. परा-वृत् + अन, n. Turning, MBh. 9, 3193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावृज्
परावृज् परावृज्, adj. Humbled, miserable(?), Chr. 296, 8 = Rigv. i. 112, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावृत्ति|परावृत्तिः
परावृत्ति परा-वृत् + ति, f. Turning, Hariv. 3138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराशर|पराशरः
पराशर पराशर, m. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परासु|परासुः
परासु परासु, i. e. परा-असु, adj.<BR> 1. Dying, Suśr. 1, 114, 15.<BR> 2. Dead, MBh. 1, 3835.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परासुता
परासुता परासु + ता, f. and परासुत्वा परासु + त्व, n. Apathy, MBh. 5, 715.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परि
परि परि, and often परी परी (akin to पर),<BR> I. adv. Round, all round.<BR> II. prep.<BR> 1. with acc. About, against, to, over.<BR> 2. with abl. From, out, except, after, Man. 3, 119(?); on account, according.<BR> III. combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives, Round, all round.<BR> IV. compounded with nouns, Round about, full, quite, excessively.<BR> --Cf. περί; Lat. per, e. g. in per-idoneus (cf. परा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकम्पिन्
परिकम्पिन् परि-कम्प् + इन्, adj. Trembling violently, Utt. Rāmac. 80, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकर|परिकरः
परिकर परिकर, i. e. परि-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Retinue, dependents, MBh. 10, 274.<BR> 2. Preparation, commencement, Kathās. 26, 200.<BR> 3. Effort, Utt. Rāmac. 125, 2.<BR> 4. Judgment, Rājat. 5, 481.<BR> 5. A girth, Hariv. 3652.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिकर
स- + परिकर स- + परिकर, adj. With (one's) dependents, Pañc. 81, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकर्मन्|परिकर्म्मन्
परिकर्मन् परिकर्मन्, i. e. परि-कृ + मन्,<BR> I. m. A servant.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Adoration, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 29.<BR> 2. Personal decoration, dressing, painting, or perfuming the body, Kumāras. 4, 19.<BR> 3. Preparation, Kathās. 22, 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0518-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकर्मय
