परिक्षय|परिक्षयः
परिक्षय परिक्षय, i. e. परि-क्षि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Vanishing, MBh. 1, 1884.<BR> 2. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0519-b " target="_blank">Page0519-b + 42</a>] Ceasing, Rām. 2, 17, 36 Gorr.<BR> 3. Failure, Man. 9, 59.<BR> 4. Ruin, Pañc. iii. d. 229.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0519-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

