परिग्रहिन्
परिग्रहिन् परिग्रहिन्, i. e. परि-ग्रह + इन्, adj. Attached to (worldly) property, Mārk. P. 47, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रहीतृ
परिग्रहीतृ परि-ग्रह् + ईतृ, m. A husband, Śāk. d. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघ|परिघः
परिघ परि-घ (vb. हन्), m.<BR> 1. An iron bar for shutting a gate, Suśr. 2, 92, 12.<BR> 2. An iron club, or a bludgeon mounted with iron, MBh. 1, 1174.<BR> 3. A line of clouds covering partially the rising or setting sun, 5, 4855.<BR> 4. The gate of a palace, Rām. 2, 72, 1 Gorr.<BR> 5. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघट्टन|परिघट्टनं
परिघट्टन परि-घट्ट् + अन, n. A stirring up, MBh. 3, 17403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघातिन्
परिघातिन् परिघातिन्, i. e. परि-हन्, Caus., + इन्, adj. Trespassing, Rām. 5, 62, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचतुर्दशन्
