परिचय|परिचयः
परिचय परिचय, i. e. परि-चि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Knowledge, Suśr. 1, 28, 17.<BR> 2. Trial, Śāk. 59, 4 (Prākṛ.).<BR> 3. Acquaintance, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b " target="_blank">Page0520-b + 40</a>] familiarity, Kathās. 9, 9.<BR> 4. Accumulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचयवन्त्|परिचयवत्
परिचयवन्त् परिचय + वन्त्, adj. (Endowed with accumulation or collection, i. e.) All, finished, Mālav. d. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर|परिचरः
परिचर परि-चर् + अ, m. An attendant, Suśr. 1, 124, 5.<BR> --Cf. περίπολος.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचरण|परिचरणः
परिचरण परिचरण, i. e. परि-चर् + अन, n. Attention to, MBh. 12, 6991.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्या|परिचर्य्या
परिचर्या परि-चर् + या, f.<BR> 1. Attendance, Bhag. 18, 44.<BR> 2. Adoration, Bhāg. P. 3, 15, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्यावन्त्|परिचर्यावत्
परिचर्यावन्त् परिचर्या + वन्त्, adj. f. वती, Respected, MBh. 12, 3711.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचार|परिचारः
परिचार परिचार, i. e. परि-चर् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Attendance, homage, MBh. 4, 374.<BR> 2. A walking-place, 4, 892.<BR> 3. An attendant, 7, 1261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारक|परिचारकः
परिचारक परिचारक, i. e. परि-चर् + अक,<BR> I. adj. Attending, Rām. 2, 84, 9 Gorr.<BR> II. m. An attendant, a servant, Man. 7, 217.<BR> III. f. रिका, A female servant, Rām. 1, 46, 24 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारण
परिचारण परिचारण, i. e. परि-चर् + अन, m. Attendance, MBh. 13, 6464.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारिक|परिचारिकः
परिचारिक परिचारिक, i. e. परि-चारिन् + क, m. A servant, MBh. 13, 6028.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारिन्
परिचारिन् परिचारिन्, i. e. परि-चर् + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इणि.<BR> 1. Moveable, MBh. 12, 8070.<BR> 2. Attending on, Hariv. 403.<BR> 3. Doing homage.<BR> II. m. An attendant, MBh. 1, 6296.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचिति|परिचितिः
परिचिति परि-चि-ति, f. Acquaintance, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 698.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचिन्तक
परिचिन्तक परि-चिन्त् + अक, m. Meditating on, MBh. 11, 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0520-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचुम्बन|परिचुंबनं
परिचुम्बन परि-चुम्ब् + अन, n. Kissing passionately, Caurap. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिच्छद्
परिच्छद् परिच्छद्, i. e. परि-छद्, in the comp. adj. सेना-, Provided with an army, Ragh. 1, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिच्छद|परिच्छदः|परिछद
परिच्छद परिच्छद, i. e. परि-छद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A cover, a covering, MBh. 2, 798.<BR> 2. Domestic implements, Man. 11, 76.<BR> 3. Implements in general, 6, 3.<BR> 4. Necessaries for travelling, 8, 405.<BR> 5. Retinue, train, Sāv. 3, 16.<BR> 6. When latter part of a comp. adj. it implies often, Provided with, Bhāg. P. 7, 7, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरिच्छद|अग्निपरिच्छदः
अग्नि- + परिच्छद अग्नि- + परिच्छद, m. the implements uses. in oblations to fire, Man. 6, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिच्छद
