परिच्छेद|परिच्छेदः|परिछेद
परिच्छेद परिच्छेद, i. e. परि-छिद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Separation.<BR> 2. Exact discrimination, Kām. Nītis. 11, 33.<BR> 3. Determination.<BR> 4. Decision, Śāk. d. 106.<BR> 5. A chapter (of a book).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाषापरिच्छेद|भाषापरिच्छेदः|भाषापरिछेद
भाषा- + परिच्छेद भाषा- + परिच्छेद, m. title of a philosophical work; definition of (the categories of) speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिजन|परिजनः
परिजन परि-जन, m.<BR> 1. Surrounding company, court attendants, Rām. 2, 77, 14 Gorr.<BR> 2. A servant, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 731.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञप्ति|परिज्ञप्तिः
परिज्ञप्ति परिज्ञप्ति, i. e. परि-ज्ञा, Caus., + ति, f. Conversation, Kathās. 21, 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञातृ
परिज्ञातृ परि-ज्ञा + तृ, m. One who knows, Bhag. 18, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञान|परिज्ञानं
परिज्ञान परिज्ञान, i. e. परि-ज्ञा + अन, n. Learning, Yājñ. 1, 317; knowledge, Rām. 4, 13, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्मन्
परिज्मन् परिज्मन्, i. e. परि-गम् + अन्, adj. Walking round, Chr. 296, 4. = Rigv. i. 112, 4 (the sun; Sch. the wind.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्रि
परिज्रि परि-ज्रि, adj. Hastening about, Chr. 290, 5 = Rigv. i. 64, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणति|परिणतिः
परिणति परिणति, i. e. परि-नम् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Transmutation, Pañc. 97, 13.<BR> 2. Ripening, Megh. 24.<BR> 3. Consequence, effect, Kathās. 22, 82.<BR> 4. End, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 343.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणमयितृ
परिणमयितृ परिणमयितृ, i. e. परि-नम्, Caus., + तृ, m. One who causes something to bow, Megh. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणय|परिणयः
परिणय परिणय, i. e. परि-नी + अ, m. Marriage, (properly, conducting the bride round the sacred fire), Kathās. 33, 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाम|परिणामः
परिणाम परिणाम, i. e. परि-नम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Transformation, change, Prab. 27, 12.<BR> 2. Digestion, Suśr. 1, 245, 10.<BR> 3. Consequence, Vikr. 65, 20.<BR> 4. Termination, end, Śāk. d. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणामक
परिणामक परिणामक, i. e. परि-नम्, Caus., + अक, adj. Causing to change, Hariv. 3357.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणायक|परिणायकः
परिणायक परिणायक, i. e. परि-नी + अक, m.<BR> 1. A guide, Rām. 2, 64, 4.<BR> 2. A husband, Śiś. 9, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाह|परिणाहः
परिणाह and परीणाह परी̆णाह, i. e. परि-नह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Circumference, MBh. 6, 276.<BR> 2. Width, Śāk. d. 18.<BR> 3. Breadth, Yājñ. 2, 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाहवन्त्|परिणाहवत्
परिणाहवन्त् परिणाह + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Big, Vikr. d. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाहिन्
परिणाहिन् परिणाहिन्, i. e. परि-णाह + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Big, large, Hariv. 12174.<BR> 2. Having the circumference of, e. g. मत्तेभकुम्भ-, i. e. मत्त-इभ-कुम्भ-परिणाह + इन्, Having the circumference of the globes of an elephant in rut, Pañc. i. d. 224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिनंसु
परिणिनंसु परिणिनंसु, i. e. परि-निनंस; desider. of नम्, + उ, adj. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a " target="_blank">Page0522-a + 39</a>] Being about to strike with his tusks (viz. an elephant), Śiś. 5, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणेतृ
परिणेतृ परिणेतृ, i. e. परि-नी + तॄ, m. A husband (cf. परिणय), Śāk. d. 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्कण|परितर्कणं
परितर्कण परितर्कण, i. e. परि-तर्क् + अन, n. Consideration, MBh. 13, 7553.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्पण|परितर्पणं
परितर्पण परितर्पण, i. e. परि-तृप् + अन, adj. Satisfying, Bhāg. P. 9, 21, 10; delighting, Utt. Rāmac. 58, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितस्
परितस् परि + तस्,<BR> I. adv. All around, Ṛt. 2, 7; from every part, in every direction.<BR> II. prep. with acc. and gen., Round, MBh. 4, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिताप|परितापः
परिताप and परीताप परी̆ताप, i. e. परि-तप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Heat, warmth, Ṛt. 1, 22.<BR> 2. Sorrow, pain, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 196.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितापिन्
परितापिन् परितापिन्, i. e. परि-तप् + इन्, and परिताप + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Causing much pain or sorrow, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 263.<BR> 2. Very hot, Kām. Nītis. 7, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितोष|परितोषः
परितोष and परीतोष परी̆तोष, i. e. परि-तुष् + अ, m. Satisfaction, Man. 4, 161; gratification, pleasure, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 856.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरितोष
अ- + परितोष अ- + परितोष, adj., f. षा, not satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरितोषम्
स-परितोष + म् स-परितोष + म्, adv. very pleased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितोषण
परितोषण परितोषण, i. e. परि-तुष् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Satisfying, who or what satisfies, Bhāg. P. 1, 5, 35.<BR> II. n. Satisfying, 4, 30, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितोषयितृ
