ऽपरिरम्भिन् -परिरम्भिन्, i. e. -परिरम्भ + इन्, adj. Girt, Bhāg. P. 3, 28, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिरोध|परिरोधः
परिरोध परिरोध, i. e. परि-रुध् + अ, m. Resistance, Rājat. 2, 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलङ्घन
परिलङ्घन परि-लङ्घ् + अन, n. Jumping to and fro, Rām. 4, 52, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवत्सर|परिवत्सरः
परिवत्सर परि-वत्सर, m. A full year, Man. 1, 12.<BR> 2. A year, MBh. 1, 3202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जक
परिवर्जक परिवर्जक, i. e. परि-वृज् + अक, adj. Abstaining from, MBh. 13, 6648.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जन|परिवर्जनं|परिवर्ज्जनं
परिवर्जन परिवर्जन, i. e. परि-वृज् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Careful abstaining from, Man. 5, 54.<BR> 2. Avoiding, Rām. 6, 8, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्त|परिवर्तः|परिवर्त्त|परिवर्त्तः
परिवर्त and परीवर्त परी̆वर्त, i. e. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a " target="_blank">Page0527-a + 43</a>] परि-वृत् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Turning, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 13.<BR> 2. Revolution, Śāk. d. 139; the end of a period.<BR> 3. Destruction of the world, Rām. 2, 76, 8.<BR> 4. Palingenesia, transmigration, Bhāg. P. 1, 3, 39.<BR> 5. Exchange, barter, Hariv. 3331.<BR> 6. An abode, Hariv. 3401.<BR> 7. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0526-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तक|परिवर्तकं|परिवर्त्तक
परिवर्तक परिवर्तक, i. e. परि-वृत्, Caus., + अक,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Causing to revolve, MBh. 3, 13105.<BR> 2. Causing to flow back, Kathās. 46, 143.<BR> II. m. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तन|परिवर्तनं|परिवर्त्तन|परिवर्त्तनं
परिवर्तन परि-वर्तन, i. e. परि-वृत् + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Causing to turn, Kathās. 46, 118.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Turning.<BR> 2. Moving to and fro, Pañc. 188, 10.<BR> 3. Revolution, the end of a period, MBh. 1, 1254.<BR> 4. Exchange, barter, Kathās. 12, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिन्|परिवर्त्तिन्
परिवर्तिन् परिवर्तिन्, i. e. परि-वृत् + इन्, adj. f. नी,<BR> 1. Turning.<BR> 2. Revolving, ever renewing one's self, Bhartṛ. 2, 24.<BR> 3. Standing, abiding, being, Rām. 6, 97, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपरिवर्तिन्
अ- + परिवर्तिन् अ- + परिवर्तिन्, adj. Never showing the heels, Chr. 7, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धन|परिवर्धनं
परिवर्धन परिवर्धन, i. e. परि-वृध् + अन, n. Augmenting, Man. 9, 331.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्ह|परिवर्हः
परिवर्ह परिवर्ह, and परिवर्हण परिवर्हण, see परिबर्ह, and परि-बर्हण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाद|परिवादः
परिवाद and परीवाद परी̆वाद, i. e. परि-वद् + अ, m. Detraction, censure, Man. 2, 179; 201; 7, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादिन्
परिवादिन् परिवादिन्, i. e. परि-वद् + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Slandering, blaming, MBh. 7, 2592.<BR> II. f. नी, A vīṇā or lute with seven strings, Ragh. 8, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवार|परिवारः
परिवार परिवार, i. e. परि-वृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. A cover, MBh. 8, 1474.<BR> 2. Retinue, Pañc. 12, 20 (figur.); Daśak. in Chr. 182, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारण
परिवारण परिवारण, i. e. परि-वृ + अन, n.<BR> 1. A cover, MBh. 5, 2937.<BR> 2. Retinue, 1435.<BR> 3. Keeping off, 9, 3192.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारवन्त्|परिवारवत्
परिवारवन्त् परिवार + वन्त्, adj. Having a great retinue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवास|परिवासः
परिवास परिवास, i. e. परि-वास् + अ, m. Sojourn, Man. 5, 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाह|परिवाहः
परिवाह and परीवाह परी̆वाह, i. e. परि-वह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Overflowing, Ragh. 8, 73.<BR> 2. A water-course, or a drain to carry off excess of water, Rām. 2, 80, 11; Utt. Rāmac. 73, 5 (री).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिवाह
स- + परिवाह स- + परिवाह, adj. brimfull, Śāk. 29, 5 (Prākṛ.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहिन्
परिवाहिन् परिवाहिन्, i. e. परिवाह + इन्, adj., f. इणी, Overflowing, swimming with, Śāk. 51, 10 (figuratively, Prākṛ.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविक्रयिन्
परिविक्रयिन् परिविक्रयिन्, i. e. परि-वि-क्री + इन्, adj. Trading, MBh. 12, 1213.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसपरिविक्रयिन्
मांस- + परिविक्रयिन् मांस- + परिविक्रयिन्, m. a fleshmonger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविक्षोभ
परिविक्षोभ परिविक्षोभ, i. e. परि-वि-क्षुभ् + अ, m. Destroying, MBh. 14, 1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवित्ति|परिवित्तिः
परिवित्ति परिवित्ति, i. e. परि-विद् + ति, m. An unmarried elder brother, the younger being married, Man. 3, 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवित्तिता
