परिवृढ|परिवृढः
परिवृढ परिवृढ, i. e. ptcple. of the pf. pass. of परि-वृह्, m. A master, an owner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्ति|परिवृत्तिः
परिवृत्ति परि-वृत् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Exchange, barter; instr. Alternately, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a " target="_blank">Page0528-a + 37</a>] Bhāg. P. 4, 27, 14.<BR> 2. Dwelling, MBh. 14, 525.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0527-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

