परिवेदक|परिवेदकः
परिवेदक परिवेदक, i. e. परि-विद् + अक, m. A younger brother married before his elder, Yājñ. 3, 238.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदन|परिवेदनं
परिवेदन परिवेदन, n., i. e.<BR> I. परि-विद् + अन, The marrying of a younger brother before his elder, Man. 11, 60.<BR> II. परि-वेदन, Complete knowledge, MBh. 14, 418.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेश|परिवेशः
परिवेश परिवेश, ˚वेशक -वेशक, ˚वेशन -वेशन, ˚वेशवन्त् -वेशवन्त्, see परिवेष, -षक, -षण, -षवन्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष|परिवेषः
परिवेष परिवेष (and erroneously परिवेश परिवेश), i. e. परि-विष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Surrounding; कृताङ्गरक्षा-, Surrounded by a body-guard, Pañc. 258, 6.<BR> 2. A circle, Ragh. 5, 74.<BR> 3. A halo, 11, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषक|परिवेषकः
परिवेषक परिवेषक (and erroneously परिवेशक परिवेशक) i. e. परि-विष् + अक, m. A waiter; one who serves up dinner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषण|परिवेषणं
परिवेषण परिवेषण (and erroneously परिवेशन परिवेशन), i. e. परि-विष् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Serving up dinner.<BR> 2. Circumference, MBh. 14, 1234.<BR> 3. A halo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषवन्त्|परिवेषवत्
