परिव्यय|परिव्ययः
परिव्यय परि-व्यय, m. Condiment.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिव्यय
