परिशङ्किन्|परिशंकिन्
परिशङ्किन् परि-शङ्क् + इन्, adj., f. नी.<BR> 1. Fearing.<BR> 2. Being fearful on account of, Bhāg. P. 3, 17, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशीलन|परिशीलनं
परिशीलन परि-शील् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Frequent touch, Gīt. 1, 27.<BR> 2. Study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्धि|परिशुद्धिः
परिशुद्धि परिशुद्धि, i. e. परि-शुध् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Becoming quite pure, Utt. Rāmac. 99, 10.<BR> 2. Proving innocent, Kathās. 5, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0528-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेष|परिशेषः
