परिषेक|परिषेकः
परिषेक परिषेक, i. e. परि-सिच् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Sprinkling, pouring over water.<BR> 2. A bath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेचन|परिषेचनं
परिषेचन परिषेचन, i. e. परि-सिच् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Sprinkling, pouring over water.<BR> 2. Water for watering trees, MBh. 12, 9116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कर|परिष्करः
परिष्कर परिष्कर, i. e. परि-कृ + अ, m. Ornament, MBh. 8, 1477.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कार|परिष्कारः
परिष्कार परिष्कार, i. e. परि-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Adorning, Lass. Anth. 94, 14.<BR> 2. Ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्क्रिया
परिष्क्रिया परिष्क्रिया, i. e. परि-कृ + या, f.<BR> 1. Adorning.<BR> 2. Attention to, Man. 2, 67 (ed. Calc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

