परिष्वङ्ग परिष्वङ्ग, i. e. परि-स्वञ्ज् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Embrace, Pañc. ii. d. 61; Vikr. 71, 5.<BR> 2. Touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0529-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्
