पर्यन्त|पर्यंत|पर्यन्तः|पर्य्यन्त|पर्य्यन्तः
पर्यन्त पर्यन्त, i. e. परि-अन्त,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A boundary, MBh. 13, 5225.<BR> 2. A skirt, Rām. 3, 55, 11.<BR> 3. A border, Daśak. in Chr. 198, 17.<BR> 4. End, Pañc. i. d. 141.<BR> II. adj., f. ता, Surrounded by (its) boundary, Hariv. 9151 (with its last limits, viz. the earth.)<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0531-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपर्यन्त|अपर्यंत|अपर्य्यन्त
