पाण|पाणः
पाण पाण, i. e. पण् + अ, m. A stake (at a game), MBh. 2, 2037.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणि|पाणिः
