अरिक्तपाणि
अ-रिक्त- + पाणि अ-रिक्त- + पाणि (vb. रिच्), adj. not emptyhanded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रपाणि|चक्रपाणिः
चक्र- + पाणि चक्र- + पाणि, m. a name of Viṣṇu (holding a discus in one hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

