वज्रपाणि|वज्रपाणिः
वज्र- + पाणि वज्र- + पाणि, m. Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्ङ्गपाणि
शार्ङ्ग- + पाणि शार्ङ्ग- + पाणि, m. Viṣṇu, Megh. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिक|पाणिकः
पाणिक पाणि + क,<BR> I. m. A proper name.<BR> II. f. का, A kind of singing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिग्रहणिक
