पाणिज|पाणिजः
पाणिज पाणि-ज, m. A finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिन्
