पाणिनि|पाणिनिः
पाणिनि पाणिनि, m. The name of a great grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिनीय|पाणिनीयं|पाणिनीयः
पाणिनीय पाणिनीय, i. e. पाणिनि + ईय, adj. Connected with, composed by, Pāṇini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिमन्त्|पाणिमत्
पाणिमन्त् पाणि + मन्त्, adj., f. मति, Having hands, MBh. 12, 6701.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाण्डर|पांडर|पाण्डरं|पाण्डरः
पाण्डर पाण्डर, akin to पाण्डु,<BR> I. adj., f. रा, Pale, yellowish, white, Rām. 3, 2, 17 Gorr.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. The name of a [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-b " target="_blank">Page0539-b + 41</a>] mountain.<BR> 2. The name of a Nāga or serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाण्डव|पांडव|पांडवः|पाण्डवः
