स्त्रीपूर्वक
स्त्री- + पूर्वक स्त्री- + पूर्वक, adj. one who has been before a woman, MBh. 5, 5940.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वग
पूर्वग पूर्व-ग, adj. Preceding, Rājat. 1, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वज|पूर्वजः|पूर्व्वज|पूर्व्वजः
पूर्वज पूर्व-ज,<BR> I. adj., f. जा.<BR> 1. Born or produced before, formerly, Man. 9, 31.<BR> 2. Eldest, Bhāg. P. 9, 2, 2.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. An elder brother, Man. 2, 226.<BR> 2. pl. Ancestors, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वतन|पूर्व्वतन
पूर्वतन पूर्व + तन, adj. Former, older.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वतस्
पूर्वतस् पूर्व + तस्, adv.<BR> 1. To the east, MBh. 9, 2361.<BR> 2. First, Bhāg. P. 9, 9, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वत्र
पूर्वत्र पूर्व + त्र = loc. of पूर्व; with जन्मनि, In a former existence, Kathās. 13, 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदेहिक
पूर्वदेहिक पूर्वदेहिक, i. e. पूर्व-देह + इक, adj. Done in a former existence, MBh. 12, 12151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववत्|पूर्ववन्त्|पूर्व्ववत्
पूर्ववत् पूर्व + वत्, adv. As before, Man. 11, 213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वथा
