पूर्वविद्
पूर्वविद् पूर्व-विद्, adj. Knowing former times, Man. 9, 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0569-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

