पौष्टिक पौष्टिक, i. e. पुष्टि + इक, adj., f. की.<BR> 1. Relating to or furthering increase, Kām. Nītis. 4, 32.<BR> 2. Furthering, MBh. 13, 7134.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0578-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्प|पौष्पं
पौष्प पौष्प, i. e. पुष्प + अ, adj., f. पी, Coming from flowers, made of flowers, Vikr. d. 38; Rām. 4, 41, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0578-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्य|पौष्यः
पौष्य पौष्य, i. e. पुष्य + य,<BR> I. adj. Relating to the asterism Puṣya, MBh. 1, 7333.<BR> II. m. The name of a prince.<BR> III. adj. Relating to the prince Pauṣya, MBh. 1, 312.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0578-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्याय्
प्याय् प्याय्, see प्यै.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0578-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्युष्
† प्युष् प्युष्, and प्युस् प्युस्, see 1. 2. and 3. व्युष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0578-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यै
प्यै प्यै, and प्याय् प्यय् (developed out of vedic पी), i. 1, Ātm. To be exuberant, to increase.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass.<BR> I. प्यान.<BR> II. पीन, Fat, bulky, corpulent, Rām. 1, 1, 13.<BR> III. प्यायित.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ,<BR> 1. To increase, MBh. 14, 989.<BR> 2. To cause to prosper, 5, 508. आपीन, Full, abounding in milk, MBh. 1, 3934. n. An udder, Ragh. 2, 18.<BR> --Caus. प्यायय,<BR> 1. To augment, MBh. 3, 13542.<BR> 2. To nourish, Lass. 59, 14.<BR> 3. To refresh, Megh. 45.<BR> 5. To encourage, MBh. 12, 10148. आप्यायित, Fattened, strengthened, Pañc. 9, 4.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, To increase.<BR> --Caus. To refresh, to animate, MBh. 3, 8725.<BR> --Akin are probably A.S. faett; O.H.G. feizt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्र
प्र प्र, prep.<BR> 1. Before.<BR> 2. Forward.<BR> 3. Away.<BR> 4. Pre-eminent.<BR> 5. Excessive.<BR> 6. Beginning.<BR> I. Combined and compounded with verbs and derivatives.<BR> II. Compounded with nouns.<BR> --Cf. πρό; Lat. prŏ, e. g. in pronepos; Goth. frums; A.S. form; see प्रनप्तृ and पुरा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकट्
प्रकट् प्रकट्, a denomin. derived from प्रकट, Par. To appear, Hariv. 15789.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकट|प्रकटं
प्रकट प्र-कट (probably a form of कृत, based on *कर्त),<BR> I. adj., f. टा, Displayed, unfolded, manifest, Mārk. P. 105, 7; discovering one's self, Kathās. 12, 190.<BR> II. m. A proper name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटन|प्रकटनं
प्रकटन प्रकटन, i. e. प्रकटय + अन, n. Making visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटय
प्रकटय प्रकटय, a denomin. derived from प्रकट with अय, Par.<BR> 1. To make visible, Śiś. 9, 40.<BR> 2. To show, Bhartṛ. 1, 50. प्रकटित,<BR> 1. Manifested.<BR> 2. Apparent; प्रकटित-हत-अ-शेष-तमस्, adj. Having evidently destroyed [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b " target="_blank">Page0579-b + 42</a>] all darkness, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1723.<BR> 3. Opened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्प|प्रकंप|प्रकंपः|प्रकम्पः
प्रकम्प प्र-कम्प् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Shaking, trembling, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2216.<BR> 2. Violent motion, Chr. 33, 33.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकम्प|अप्रकंप
अ- + प्रकम्प अ- + प्रकम्प, adj. unshaken, Rājat. 5, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्रकम्प
दुष्प्रकम्प दुष्प्रकम्प, i. e. दुस्-, adj. difficult to be shaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रकम्प|निष्प्रकंप
निष्प्रकम्प निष्प्र˚, i. e. निस्-, 1. adj. motionless. 2. one of the seven Ṛṣis of the thirteenth period.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पन|प्रकंपन|प्रकम्पनः
प्रकम्पन प्र-कम्प् + अन.<BR> I. adj. Causing to tremble.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Wind,<BR> 2. A hell.<BR> III. n. Violent motion, great trembling, shaking, MBh. 12, 3840.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पिन्|प्रकंपिन्
प्रकम्पिन् प्र-कम्प् + इन्, adj. Trembling, Utt. Rāmac. 80, 16; moving to and fro, Mārk. P. 109, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर|प्रकरं|प्रकरः
प्रकर प्रकर, i. e. प्र-कृ̆ + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A heap, a quantity, plenty, Śāk. d. 136.<BR> 2. Aid.<BR> 3. Custom, use.<BR> II. n. Aloe-wood.<BR> III. f. री.<BR> 1. A kind of song, Yājñ. 3, 113.<BR> 2. A short interlude in a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरण|प्रकरणं
प्रकरण प्रकरण, i. e. प्र-कृ + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Treating, expounding.<BR> 2. A chapter.<BR> 3. Subject, Kathās. 6, 111.<BR> 4. Opportunity, occasion, MBh. 12, 768.<BR> 5. Relation, Hariv. 3982.<BR> 6. A kind of dramatic poem, Śāk. p. 4, 12.<BR> 7. Treating with respect.<BR> 8. Doing much or well.<BR> II. f. णी, A kind of drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्तृ
प्रकर्तृ प्रकर्तृ, i. e. प्र-कृ + तृ, m. One who causes, MBh. 9, 3054.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्ष|प्रकर्षः
प्रकर्ष प्रकर्ष, i. e. प्र-कृष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Excellence, Rājat. 5, 381.<BR> 2. Superiority, MBh. 1, 6076.<BR> 3. Intensity, Kathās. 17, 170.<BR> 4. Length, MBh. 13, 2933.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षण
प्रकर्षण प्रकर्षण, i. e. प्र-कृष् + अन,<BR> I. m. One who troubles, MBh. 8, 1971. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a " target="_blank">Page0580-a + 41</a>]<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Drawing off, MBh. 1, 7309.<BR> 2. Length, Suśr. 1, 270, 4.<BR> 3. Realising by the use of a pledge more than the interest of a loan.<BR> 4. Bridle (?), MBh. 7, 6446.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0579-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षिन्
प्रकर्षिन् प्रकर्षिन्, adj., i. e.<BR> I. प्र-कृष् + इन्, Drawing forth, MBh. 6, 2524.<BR> II. प्रहर्ष + इन्. Pre-eminent, Hariv. 6404.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पना
प्रकल्पना प्रकल्पना, i. e. प्र-क्लिप्, Caus., + अन, f. Allotting, allotment, Man. 8, 211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्ड|प्रकांड|प्रकांडं|प्रकांडः|प्रकाण्डः
प्रकाण्ड प्र-काण्ड, m. and n.<BR> 1. The stem of a tree.<BR> 2. As latter part of comp. word, Excellent, e. g. मन्त्रि-प्रकाण्ड, i. e. मन्त्रिन्-, m. An excellent minister, Rājat. 6, 260; cf. Utt. Rāmac. 145, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाम|प्रकामं|प्रकामः
प्रकाम प्र-काम.<BR> I. m. Pleasure, Rām. 3, 2, 8.<BR> II. acc. मम्, adv.<BR> 1. Willingly, Pañc. 191, 16.<BR> 2. According to one's wish, MBh. 4, 401.<BR> 3. Sufficiently, 7, 2767.<BR> 4. Indeed, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3098.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामतस्
प्रकामतस् प्रकाम + तस्, adv. With great delight, Hiḍ. 2, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकार|प्रकारः
प्रकार प्रकार, i. e. प्र-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Kind, MBh. 1, 7412; species, Ṛt. 1, 2.<BR> 2. Speciality, Bhāṣāp. 134.<BR> 3. Way, manner, Pañc. 199, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकारता
प्रकारता प्रकार + ता, f. Speciality, Bhāṣāp. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकालन|प्रकालनः
प्रकालन प्रकालन, i. e. प्र-कल्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj. Driving on, MBh. 1, 2585.<BR> II. m. The name of a Nāga or serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश|प्रकाशं|प्रकाशः
प्रकाश प्र-काश् + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. शा.<BR> 1. Clear, bright, MBh. 3, 12158.<BR> 2. Open, manifest, visible, Rām. 6, 75, 14.<BR> 3. Generally known, Daśak. in Chr. 193, 2.<BR> 4. As latter part of comp. adj. Resembling, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b " target="_blank">Page0580-b + 43</a>] like, MBh. 3, 914.<BR> II. शम्, adv.<BR> 1. Openly, publicly, Man. 8, 193.<BR> 2. (in dramatic language), Aloud, Śāk. 13, 15.<BR> III. m.<BR> 1. Lustre, splendour, light, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2132.<BR> 2. Manifestation.<BR> 3. Publicity.<BR> 4. Renown, Hariv. 5224.<BR> 5. The open air, Śāk. 46, 7.<BR> 6. Loc. शे, In presence, MBh. 12, 8579.<BR> IV. n. White, or bell metal.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाश|अप्रकाशः
अ- + प्रकाश अ- + प्रकाश,<BR> I. adj. 1. obscure, dark, Rām. 2, 125, 2 Gorr. 2. concealed, Man. 8, 251.<BR> II. शम्, adv. secretly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रकाश
अति- + प्रकाश अति- + प्रकाश, adj. generally known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्रकाश
दुष्प्रकाश दुष्प्र्˚, i. e. दुस्-, adj. dark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रकाश
निष्प्रकाश निष्प्र्˚, i. e. निस्-, adj. lightless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रकाश
सु- + प्रकाश सु- + प्रकाश, adj. 1. very visible, Man. 8, 245. 2. manifest. 3. public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशक|प्रकाशकः
प्रकाशक प्र-काश् + अक,<BR> I. adj., f. शिका.<BR> 1. Clear, bright, Bhag. 14, 6.<BR> 2. Renowned, Rājat. 4, 79.<BR> 3. What makes open or apparent, illuminating, MBh. 14, 1066.<BR> II. m. The illuminator, the sun, Kathās. 18, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशता
प्रकाशता प्रकाश + ता, f.<BR> 1. Brightness, shining, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1941.<BR> 2. Renown, Nal. 26, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशत्व|प्रकाशत्वं
प्रकाशत्व प्रकाश + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Brightness.<BR> 2. Appearance.<BR> 3. Renown, MBh. 13, 4730.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशन|प्रकाशनः
प्रकाशन प्र-काश् + अन,<BR> I. m. f. n. One who or what illuminates, epithet of Viṣṇu, MBh. 13, 6978.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Illuminating.<BR> 2. Making manifest, making known, Pañc. 238, 23.<BR> 3. Showing publicly, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशात्मकत्व
प्रकाशात्मकत्व प्रकाशात्मकत्व, i. e. प्रकाश-आत्मक + त्व, n. Condition of having the nature of light, Vedāntas. in Chr. 207, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशिता
प्रकाशिता प्रकाशिता, f., and प्रकाशित्व प्रकाशित्व, n., i. e. प्रकाशिन् + ता, or त्व, Clearness, light, MBh. 12, 6228; 1, 3576.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशिन्
प्रकाशिन् प्रकाशिन्, i. e. प्र-काश्, and प्रकाश, + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Clear, bright, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a " target="_blank">Page0581-a + 42</a>] MBh. 1, 1434.<BR> 2. Making visible, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0580-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशीकरण
प्रकाशीकरण प्रकाशीकरण, i. e. प्रकाश-कृ + अन, n. Illuminating, Rām. 2, 15, 18 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश्य
प्रकाश्य प्रकाश्य,<BR> I. ptcple. fut. pass. of the Caus. of प्र-काश्, To be illuminated, to be manifested.<BR> II. incorrectly, instead of प्राकाश्य (q. cf.), e. g. MBh. 8, 1960.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश्यता
प्रकाश्यता प्रकाश्य + ता, f. Publicity, Rājat. 3, 317.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकिरण|प्रकिरणं
प्रकिरण प्रकिरण, i. e. प्र-कॄ + अन, n. Strewing, scattering, Mārk. P. 31, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णक|प्रकीर्णकं|प्रकीर्णकः
प्रकीर्णक प्र-कीर्ण + क (vb. कॄ), n. The tail of the Bos grunniens, used as a fan and as an ornament of horses (m.), MBh. 7, 1575.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0581-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्तन|प्रकीर्तनं|प्रकीर्त्तन
