प्रगेनिश प्रगे-निश (cf. निशा), and प्रगेशय प्रगे-शी + अ, m. Sleeping in the morning, MBh. 12, 8369; 8396.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रह|प्रग्रहः
प्रग्रह प्र-ग्रह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Stretching out, MBh. 13, 6374.<BR> 2. Taking, seizing, Hariv. 15103.<BR> 3. An arm.<BR> 4. A ray of light.<BR> 5. Favour, kindness, MBh. 13, 6709.<BR> 6. Confinement, captivity.<BR> 7. A prisoner, a captive.<BR> 8. Restraining.<BR> 9. A rein, a rope, MBh. 7, 9567; 13, 3456.<BR> 10. The string suspending a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहण|प्रग्रहणं
प्रग्रहण प्रग्रहण, i. e. प्र-ग्रह् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Seizing, MBh. 5, 1229.<BR> 2. Restraining, MBh. 12, 1991.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहवन्त्|प्रग्रहवत्
प्रग्रहवन्त् प्रग्रह + वन्त्, adj.<BR> 1. Holding, MBh. 12, 1780.<BR> 2. Kind, Rām. 2, 1, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघण|प्रघणः
प्रघण प्रघण, i. e. प्र-हन् + अ, m.<BR> 1. (also प्रघन and प्रघान प्रघा̆न, and प्रघाण प्रघाण), A terrace before [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b " target="_blank">Page0583-b + 40</a>] a house.<BR> 2. A copper pot.<BR> 3. An iron club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्ड|प्रचंड|प्रचण्डः
प्रचण्ड प्र-चण्ड,<BR> I. adj., f. डा.<BR> 1. Excessively violent, Mṛcch. 2, 12.<BR> 2. Passionate, wrathful, Rām. 6, 36, 83.<BR> 3. Terrible, MBh. 3, 15701.<BR> II. m. The name of a Dānava or demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डता|प्रचंडता
प्रचण्डता प्रचण्ड + ता, f. Boldness, Utt. Rāmac. 133, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचय|प्रचयः
प्रचय प्रचय, i. e. प्र-चि + अ, m.<BR> 1. Gathering, Bhāṣāp. 111.<BR> 2. A heap, a quantity, Ṛt. 5, 1; Kir. 5, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचर|प्रचरः
प्रचर प्र-चर् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A road.<BR> 2. pl. The name of a people, Rām. 4, 44 12 (v. r.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचल|प्रचलः
प्रचल प्र-चल् + अ, adj. Trembling, MBh. 1, 1379.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलन|प्रचलनं
प्रचलन प्र-चल् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Trembling.<BR> 2. Moving to and fro, rocking (on the knees), Pañc. 252, 22.<BR> 3. Fleeing, flight, Pañc. iii. d. 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाक|प्रचलाकः
प्रचलाक प्र-चल् + आक, m.<BR> 1. Shooting with arrows.<BR> 2. A snake.<BR> 3. A peacock's tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाकिन्
प्रचलाकिन् प्रचलाकिन्, i. e. प्रचलाक + इन्, m.<BR> 1. A snake.<BR> 2. A peacock, Utt. Rāmac. 49, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलायित|प्रचलायितं
प्रचलायित प्रचलायित, i. e. a ptcple. pf. pass. of प्रचल + य (denomin.), adj. and n. Nodding with the head when sleeping, Rājat. 1, 371.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचार|प्रचारः
प्रचार प्रचार, i. e. प्र-चर् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Proceeding, Rām. 5, 32, 8.<BR> 2. Going, Pañc. 31, 3.<BR> 3. Pasture ground, Man. 9, 219.<BR> 4. Conduct, Man. 7, 153.<BR> 5. Appearance, Prab. 10, 8.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रचार
निष्प्रचार निष्प्र्˚, i. e. निस्-, adj. not moving, MBh. 13, 270. 2. fixed on one point, 12. 7810 (viz. मनस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारिन्
प्रचारिन् प्रचारिन्, i. e. प्र-चर् + इन्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a " target="_blank">Page0584-a + 40</a>] adj.<BR> 1. Proceeding, appearing, MBh. 12, 7480.<BR> 2. Behaving, MBh. 12, 1783.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0583-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालन|प्रचालनं
प्रचालन प्रचालन, i. e. प्र-चल्, Caus., + अन, n. Stirring, stir, Pañc. 248, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिकीर्षु
प्रचिकीर्षु प्रचिकीर्षु, i. e. प्र-चिकीर्ष, desider. of कृ, + उ, adj. Wishing to requite, Bhāg. P. 4, 10, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुर|प्रचुरं|प्रचुरः
प्रचुर प्रचुर, adj., f. रा.<BR> 1. Much, many, Pañc. 141, 18.<BR> 2. Frequent, Bhāg. P. 5, 13, 21.<BR> 3. Abounding in, 1, 18, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरत्व|प्रचुरत्वं
प्रचुरत्व प्रचुर + त्व, n.<BR> 1. Plenty, Hariv. 11143.<BR> 2. Abounding in, Vedāntas. in Chr. 204, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतस्
प्रचेतस् प्र-चेतस्,<BR> I. adj. Wise, intelligent.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A name of Varuṇa.<BR> 2. The name of a Ṛṣi.<BR> 3. (also प्रचेतस् + अ), m. pl. The ten sons of Pracīnavarhis.<BR> 4. The name of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतस
प्रचेतस प्रचेतस् + अ, see the last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोद|प्रचोदः
प्रचोद प्रचोद, i. e. प्र-चुद् + अ, m. Inciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदन|प्रचोदनं
प्रचोदन प्रचोदन, i. e. प्र-चुद् + अन, n. Inciting, directing, order, MBh. 5, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदिन्
प्रचोदिन् प्रचोदिन्, i. e. प्र-चुद् + इन्, f. नी, Driving.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणचक्रप्रचोदिन्
गुण--चक्र- + प्रचोदिन् गुण--चक्र- + प्रचोदिन्, adj. driving the wheel, i. e. possessed of all virtues, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छद|प्रच्छदः|प्रछद
प्रच्छद प्रच्छद, i. e. प्र-छद् + अ, m. A cover, a blanket, Ragh. 19, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छर्दन|प्रच्छर्दनं|प्रच्छर्द्दन
प्रच्छर्दन प्रच्छर्दन, i. e. प्र-छृद् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Vomiting, emitting.<BR> 2. An emetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छर्दिका|प्रच्छर्द्दिका
प्रच्छर्दिका प्रच्छर्दिका, i. e. प्र-छृद् + अक, f. Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादक|प्रच्छादकः
प्रच्छादक प्रच्छादक, i. e. प्र-छद् + अक, adj. Covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादन|प्रच्छादनं
प्रच्छादन प्रच्छादन, i. e. प्र-छद् + अन,<BR> I. adj. Covering, Nal. 17, 10.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Concealment, Pañc. 188, 13.<BR> 2. An upper or outer garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छान|प्रच्छानं
प्रच्छान प्रच्छान, i. e. प्र-छो + अन, n. Cupping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छाय|प्रच्छायं
प्रच्छाय प्रच्छाय, i. e. प्र and छाया, n. Deṇse shadow, Śāk. d. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यवन|प्रच्यवनं
प्रच्यवन प्रच्यवन, i. e. प्र-च्यु + अन, n.<BR> 1. Departing, withdrawing.<BR> 2. (with abl.), Loss, MBh. 4, 646.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्युति|प्रच्युतिः
प्रच्युति प्र + च्यु + ति, f. Loss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रछ्|प्रच्छ्
प्रछ् प्रछ्, i. 6, पृच्छ, Par. (in poetry also Ātm., Man. 2, 132).<BR> 1. To ask, Man. 8, 88.<BR> 2. To ask about (with two accus.), Daśak. in Chr. 179, 18. Anomal. condit. 2. sing. अप्राक्ष्यस्, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 15.<BR> --With the prep. अनु अनु, To ask about, Rām. 2, 57, 29.<BR> --With अभ्यनु अभि-अनु, The same, MBh. 13, 2169.<BR> --With समनु सम्-अनु, The same, MBh. 2, 2142.<BR> --With अभि अभि, The same, MBh. 3, 13339.<BR> --With आ आ, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par.).<BR> 1. To take leave of one (acc.), Rām. 2, 31, 28.<BR> 2. To ask, Bhāg. P. 3, 7, 36 (ved.).<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. आपृछ्य, Praiseworthy, Chr. 291, 13 = Rigv. i. 64, 13.<BR> --With उपा उप-आ, To take leave of one, Rām. 3, 5, 18.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, The same, Rām. 2, 31, 27 Gorr.<BR> --With उप उप, To ask, MBh. 12, 12272.<BR> --With परि परि,<BR> 1. To ask, Man. 11, 195.<BR> 2. To ask about, MBh. 1, 6311.<BR> --With संपरि सम्-परि, To ask, MBh. 14, 576.<BR> --With [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a " target="_blank">Page0585-a + 40</a>] प्रति प्रति,<BR> 1. To ask, Kathās. 26, 121.<BR> 2. To ask about, Rām. 1, 8, 18.<BR> --With वि वि, To ask, Bhāg. P. 2, 4, 25.<BR> --With सम् सम्, Ātm.<BR> 1. To ask, Lass. 41, 10.<BR> 2. To ask about, MBh. 15, 6.<BR> --With उपसम् उप-सम्, To ask, MBh. 5, 2658.<BR> --Cf. Lat. procus, procax, precor, prex, probably posco, postulare, perhaps suf-fragari, rogare, flagitare; Goth. fragan, fraihnan; A.S. fregnan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0584-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजन|प्रजनः
प्रजन प्र-जन् + अ,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. Impregnating, Man. 9, 61.<BR> 2. Impregnation, MBh. 14, 1127.<BR> 3. The season for a cow's taking the bull.<BR> 4. Bringing forth. Man. 9, 96.<BR> II. m. A progenitor, Bhāg. P. 8, 5, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनन|प्रजननं
प्रजनन प्र-जन् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Generating, Bhāg. P. 4, 1, 28.<BR> 2. Children, 9, 14, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्प|प्रजल्पः
प्रजल्प प्र-जल्प् + अ, m. Prattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्पन|प्रजल्पनं
प्रजल्पन प्र-जल्प् + अन, n. Speaking, Pañc. 85, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजवन
प्रजवन प्र-जवन, adj. Very quick, Utt. Rāmac. 119, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजविन्
प्रजविन् प्रजविन्, i. e. प्र-जू + इन्, adj. Quick, Utt. Rāmac. 48, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजस्
प्रजस् प्रजस्, i. e. प्र and vb. जन्, a substitute for प्रजा when latter part of comp. adj.; e. g. अ-, Having no progeny, Yājñ. 2, 144. बहु-, Having a numerous progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजा
प्रजा प्रजा, i. e. प्र and vb. जन्, f.<BR> 1. Progeny, offspring, Man. 3, 42.<BR> 2. Creature, Man. 3, 76.<BR> 3. Subjects, people, 1, 89.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रज
अ-प्रज अ-प्रज,<BR> I. adj., f. जा. 1. not bringing forth, MBh. 1, 4491. 2. childless, Pañc. ii. d. 101.<BR> II. f. जा, a female who has not borne (a child), Man. 9, 161.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्प्रज|सकृत्प्रजः
सकृत्-प्रज सकृत्-प्रज, m. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजागर|प्रजागरः
प्रजागर प्रजागर, i. e. प्र-जागृ + अ, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b " target="_blank">Page0585-b + 41</a>]<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. One who wakes, MBh. 13, 7051.<BR> 2. A guardian, Bhāg. P. 4, 27, 15.<BR> 3. The act of waking, watching, MBh. 1, 330.<BR> 4. Taking care, Rājat. 5, 317.<BR> 5. Awaking, being roused, Kām. Nītis. 7, 58.<BR> II. f. रा, The name of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजागरण
प्रजागरण प्रजागरण, i. e. प्र-जागृ + अन, n. Sleeplessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजाति|प्रजातिः
प्रजाति प्रजाति, i. e. प्र-जन् + ति, f. Generating, Bhāg. P. 2, 6, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजापाल्य
प्रजापाल्य प्रजापाल्य, i. e. प्रजा-पाल + य, n. The office of a king, Rām. 2, 23, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजायिनी
प्रजायिनी प्रजायिनी, प्र-जन् + इन् + ई f.<BR> 1. Being about to bring forth.<BR> 2. Bringing forth, MBh. 13, 4229.<BR> 3. A mother, Nal. 13, 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजावन्त्|प्रजावत्
प्रजावन्त् प्रजा + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj., f. रती, Having progeny, abounding in progeny, Chr. 294, 7 = Rigv. i. 92, 7.<BR> II. f. वती.<BR> 1. Pregnant, Bhāg. P. 9, 8, 3.<BR> 2. A mother, Mārk. P. 125, 7.<BR> 3. A brother's wife, Ragh. 14, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजिहीर्षु
प्रजिहीर्षु प्रजिहीर्षु, i. e. प्र-जिहिर्ष, desider. of हृ, + उ, adj. Being about to strike, Rājat. 3, 510.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजीवन|प्रजीवनं
प्रजीवन प्र-जीव् + अन, n. Livelihood, subsistence, Man. 9, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञ|प्रज्ञः
प्रज्ञ प्र-ज्ञ,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. (vb. ज्ञा), Intelligent.<BR> 2. i. e. प्र-जानु, Bandylegged, having the knees far apart.<BR> II. f. ज्ञा, Understanding, wisdom, Pañc. i. d. 475; knowledge, Man. 4, 41.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीर्घप्रज्ञ
दीर्घ-प्रज्ञ दीर्घ-प्रज्ञ, adj. having a far-seeing understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्रज्ञ
दुष्प्रज्ञ दुष्प्रज्ञ, i. e. दुस्-, adj. foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितप्रज्ञ|स्थितप्रज्ञः
स्थित- + प्रज्ञ स्थित- + प्रज्ञ, adj. calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञप्ति|प्रज्ञप्तिः
प्रज्ञप्ति प्रज्ञप्ति, i. e. प्र-ज्ञा, Caus., + ती, f.<BR> 1. Teaching, Bhāg. P. 3, 25, 1.<BR> 2. A certain magical art, Kathās. 30, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0585-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञान|प्रज्ञानं
प्रज्ञान प्र-ज्ञान, i. e. प्र-ज्ञा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Knowledge, wisdom, MBh. 3, 12693.<BR> 2. A mark, 5, 992.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्रज्ञान
दुष्प्रज्ञान दुष्प्रज्ञान, i. e. दुस्-, n. foolishness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञामय
प्रज्ञामय प्रज्ञा + मय, adj., f. यी, Made of, consisting in intelligence, MBh. 12, 8630.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञावन्त्|प्रज्ञावत्
प्रज्ञावन्त् प्रज्ञा + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Wise, intelligent, Pañc. 132, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञु|प्रज्ञुः
प्रज्ञु प्रज्ञु, i. e. प्र-जानु, adj. Bandy-legged.<BR> --Cf. πρόχνυ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वार|प्रज्वारः
प्रज्वार प्रज्वार, i. e. प्र-ज्वर् + अ, m. The heat of the fever, Bhāg. P. 4, 27, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणति|प्रणतिः
प्रणति प्रणति, i. e. प्र-नम् + ति, f. Salutation, reverence, Rājat. 5, 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणय|प्रणयः
प्रणय प्रणय, i. e. प्र-नी + अ, m.<BR> 1. Guidance, MBh. 12, 3934.<BR> 2. Affection, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 364; friendly or fond regard, love, Vikr. d. 34.<BR> 3. Confidence, familiarity, Bhag. 11, 41.<BR> 4. Desire, MBh. 13, 224.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रणय
अ- + प्रणय अ- + प्रणय, m. want of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रणय
अति- + प्रणय अति- + प्रणय, m. exceeding love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रणय
निष्प्रणय निष्प्रणय, i. e. निस्-, adj. cold, Utt. Rāmac. 70, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रणय
स- + प्रणय स- + प्रणय,<BR> I. adj. affectionate, friendly.<BR> II. यम्, adv. 1. affectionately, Chr. 44, 32. 2. confidently, Kathās. 46, 191.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयन|प्रणयनं
प्रणयन प्रणयन, i. e. प्र-नी + अन, n.<BR> 1. Performing, practising, MBh. 1, 7593.<BR> 2. Sentencing, Man. 8, 277.<BR> 3. Adducing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयवन्त्|प्रणयवत्
प्रणयवन्त् प्रणय + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Attached to, loving, Śāk. d. 143.<BR> 2. Confident, MBh. 12, 13929.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयिता
प्रणयिता प्रणयिता, i. e. प्रणयिन् + ता, f. Desire, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 396.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिप्रणयिता
पाणि- + प्रणयिता पाणि- + प्रणयिता, f. condition of being taken as wife, Rājat. 3, 390 (cf. पाणि-प्रणयिन् + ई).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयिन्
प्रणयिन् प्रणयिन्, i. e. प्रणय + इन्,<BR> I. adj., f. इनी.<BR> 1. Affectionate, attached to, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1762.<BR> 2. Beloved, Bhāg. P. 9, 10, 8.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A friend, Vikr. d. 94; a favourite, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1903.<BR> 2. A husband or lover, Megh. 40.<BR> III. f. इनी, A wife or mistress, Prab. 100, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिप्रणयिनी
पाणि-प्रणयिनी पाणि-प्रणयिनी, f. a wife, Rājat. 3, 307.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणव|प्रणवः
प्रणव प्रणव, i. e. प्र-नु + अ, m.<BR> 1. The holy syllable ॐ, Man. 2, 74.<BR> 2. A small tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणवक|प्रणवकः
प्रणवक प्रणव + क, a substitute for प्रणव when latter part of a comp. adj. स-व्याहृति-प्रणवक, With the holy words and the syllable ॐ, Man. 11, 248.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाद|प्रणादः
प्रणाद प्रणाद, i. e. प्र-नद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A loud noise, MBh. 4, 1684; a shout.<BR> 2. Neighing, MBh. 6, 137.<BR> 3. Roar, Rām. 6, 79, 10.<BR> 4. Tingling in the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाम|प्रणामः
प्रणाम प्रणाम, i. e. प्र-नम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Bowing, a bow, MBh. 1, 5384.<BR> 2. Prostration, Daśak. in Chr. 194, 8.<BR> 3. Respectful salutation, Pañc. 91, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रणामम्
स-प्रणाम + म् स-प्रणाम + म् adv. with a bow, Śāk. 7, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणामिन्
प्रणामिन् प्रणामिन्, i. e. प्र-नम् + इन्, adj. Bowing, worshipping, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 558.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणायक|प्रणायकः
प्रणायक प्रणायक, i. e. प्र-नी + अक, m. A commander, MBh. 10, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाली
प्रणाली प्रणाली, i. e. प्र-नाडी, f. A channel from a pond, a watercourse, Mṛcch. 158, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाश|प्रणाशः
प्रणाश प्रणाश, i. e. प्र-नश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Disappearance, loss, Pañc. 5, 10.<BR> 2. Death, 87, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाशन|प्रणाशनं
प्रणाशन प्रणाशन, i. e. प्र-नश्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj., f. नी, Destroying, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a " target="_blank">Page0587-a + 40</a>] removing, MBh. 1, 354.<BR> II. n. Destroying, destruction, Ragh. 3, 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0586-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाशिन्
प्रणाशिन् प्रणाशिन्, i. e. प्र-नश्, Caus., + इन्, adj. Destroying, removing, MBh. 3, 6054.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधान|प्रणिधानं
प्रणिधान प्रणिधान, i. e. प्र-नि-धा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Putting on, employing.<BR> 2. Respectful behaviour, attendance to, MBh. 3, 17016.<BR> 3. Profound meditation, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 6.<BR> 4. Prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधि|प्रणिधिः
प्रणिधि प्रणिधि, i. e. प्र-नि-धा (cf. निधि), m.<BR> 1. Spying, MBh. 12, 2155.<BR> 2. Sending out (of emissaries), Rām. 1, 4, 103 Gorr.<BR> 3. Request.<BR> 4. A spy, an emissary, Man. 7, 153.<BR> 5. A follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपतन|प्रणिपतनं
प्रणिपतन प्रणिपतन, i. e. प्र-नि-पत् + अन, n. Prostration, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1720.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपात|प्रणिपातः
प्रणिपात प्रणिपात, i. e. प्र-नि-पत् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Prostration, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 442; Vikr. 34, 4.<BR> 2. Submission, Ragh. 4, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपातिन्
प्रणिपातिन् प्रणिपातिन्, i. e. प्र-नि-पत् + इन्, adj. Falling at another's feet, submitting one's self, MBh. 5, 2654.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुद्
प्रणुद् प्रणुद्, i. e. प्र-नुद्, adj.<BR> 1. Forcing away, MBh. 3, 720.<BR> 2. Removing, MBh. 9, 390.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुद
प्रणुद प्रणुद, i. e. प्र-नुद् + अ, Forcing away, Hariv. 7420.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेतृ
प्रणेतृ प्रणेतृ, i. e. प्र-नी + तृ, m.<BR> 1. A leader, MBh. 2, 264.<BR> 2. A creator, MBh. 1, 7277.<BR> 3. An author, 13, 7166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतति|प्रततिः
प्रतति प्रतति, i. e. प्र-तन् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Spreading.<BR> 2. A creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतन|प्रतनः
प्रतन प्र + तन, adj., f. नी, Old.<BR> --Cf. probably πρύτανις cf. पुरातन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतनु
प्रतनु प्र-तनु, adj.<BR> 1. Very thin, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b " target="_blank">Page0587-b + 40</a>] Megh. 104.<BR> 2. Very delicate, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3322.<BR> 3. Very small, Megh. 30; indifferent, Śāk. d. 138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतनुक
प्रतनुक प्रतनु + क, adj. Very delicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतपन|प्रतपनं
प्रतपन प्र-तप् + अन, n. Warming, MBh. 1, 3576.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर|प्रतरः
प्रतर प्रतर i. e. प्र-तॄ + अ, m. Crossing over.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुष्प्रतर
दुष्प्रतर दुष्प्र्˚, i. e. दुस्-, adj., f. रा, difficult to be crossed over, Rām. 2, 71, 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतरण
प्रतरण प्रतरण, i. e. प्र-तृ + अन, n. Crossing over, MBh. 4, 199.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्क|प्रतर्कः
प्रतर्क प्र-तर्क् + अ, m. Supposition, MBh. 1, 7180.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतर्क|सुप्रतर्कः
सु- + प्रतर्क सु- + प्रतर्क, m. great understanding, 5, 3062.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्कण|प्रतर्कणं
प्रतर्कण प्रतर्कण, i. e. प्र-तर्क् + अन, n. Judging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतवस्
प्रतवस् प्र-तवस्, adj. Very strong, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 87, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतान|प्रतानः
प्रतान प्रतान, i. e. प्र-तन् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A tendril, Śāk. d. 170.<BR> 2. A plant having tendrils, a climber, Man. 1, 48.<BR> 3. Spreading, Kathās. 35, 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतानवन्त्|प्रतानवत्
प्रतानवन्त् प्रतान + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.<BR> 1. Having tendrils, Suśr. 1, 4, 17.<BR> 2. Spread, 1, 308, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रताप|प्रतापः
प्रताप प्रताप, i. e. प्र-तप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Heat, Ragh. 4, 12.<BR> 2. Splendour, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 131.<BR> 3. Majesty, dignity, Kām. Nītis. 8, 12.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रताप
निष्-प्रताप निष्-प्रताप, i. e. निस्-, adj. base, Pañc. ii. d. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापन|प्रतापनं|प्रतापनः
प्रतापन प्रतापन, i. e. प्र-तप्, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. adj. Distressing, inflicting pain, Rām. 3, 53, 29.<BR> II. m. A hell.<BR> III. n. Burning, MBh. 13, 3302.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापवन्त्|प्रतापवत्
प्रतापवन्त् प्रताप + वन्त्,<BR> I. adj. Majestic, Bhag. 1, 12.<BR> II. m. A proper name, MBh. 9, 2567.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0587-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापिन्
प्रतापिन् प्रतापिन्, i. e. प्र-तप्, Caus., + इन्, and प्रताप + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Burning, MBh. 9, 1334; distressing, 3, 1685.<BR> 2. shining, majestic, 13, 2149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रताम्र
प्रताम्र प्र-ताम्र, adj. Very red, Śāk. d. 133.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतार|प्रतारः
प्रतार प्रतार, i. e. प्र-तॄ + अ, m. Crossing over, Rām. 1, 3, 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारक|प्रतारकः
प्रतारक प्रतारक, i. e. प्र-तॄ + इक, adj. Cheating, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3328.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारण|प्रतारणं
प्रतारण प्रतारण, i. e. प्र-तॄ + अन, n.<BR> 1. Crossing over, Rām. 1, 3, 28 Gorr.<BR> 2. and f. णा, Cheating, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रति
प्रति प्र + ति,<BR> I. preposition with acc. and abl.<BR> 1. Towards, to, against, Man. 4, 52.<BR> 2. In proportion to, compared with, Kathās. 45, 400; Utt. Rāmac. 116, 14.<BR> 3. Near, Rām. 2, 83, 19.<BR> 4. On, MBh. 3, 15745.<BR> 5. About; फाल्गुनं वाथ चैत्रं वा मासौ प्रति, ‘About the month of Phālguna or Caitra,’ Man. 7, 182.<BR> 6. For, as compensation (with abl.); अस्मात् कपोतात् प्रति, ‘For this pigeon,’ MBh. 3, 13287.<BR> 7. Concerning; सीमां प्रति समुत्पन्ने विवादे, ‘If a contest arises concerning a boundary,’ Man. 8, 245; with respect to, in regard of.<BR> 8. According; धर्मं प्रति, ‘By law,’ Man. 8, 55; मां प्रति, ‘According to my opinion,’ Mālav. d. 50.<BR> 9. In every, each by each; यज्ञं प्रति, ‘In every sacrifice,’ Yājñ. 1, 110.<BR> II. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives, in the same significations as in<BR> I., and besides in the signification Back, returning. again.<BR> III. Compounded with nouns, in the significations of<BR> I., and ‘equally.’ In comp. adv. we find in with a distributive signification, ‘Eac by each,’ ‘every,’ e. g. प्रति-गृह + म्, adv. In every house. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b " target="_blank">Page0588-b + 41</a>]<BR> IV. With following उत, On the contrary.<BR> --Cf. προτί, πρός; Lat. red, e. g. in red-dere, red-ire, and re, e. g. in referre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर|प्रतिकरः
प्रतिकर प्रतिकर, i. e. प्रति-कृ + अ,<BR> I. adj., f. री, Counteracting, Suśr. 2, 270, 6.<BR> II. m. Compensation, Rājat. 5, 169 (read राजाप्रतिकरेण, i. e. राजा अप्रतिकरेण, ‘Without compensation’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्कश
प्रतिकर्कश प्रति-कर्कश, adj., f. शा, Equally hard, of the same hardness as, Mṛcch. 91, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्तृ
प्रतिकर्तृ प्रतिकर्तृ, i. e. प्रति-कृ + तृ, m.<BR> 1. One who requites, Hariv. 11170.<BR> 2. One who opposes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्म|प्रतिकर्म्म
प्रतिकर्म प्रतिकर्म, i. e. प्रति-कर्मन्, adv. In every work, MBh. 12, 2963.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्मन्|प्रतिकर्म्मन्
प्रतिकर्मन् प्रति-कर्मन्, n.<BR> 1. Dress, personal embellishment, Śiś. 5, 27.<BR> 2. Requital, MBh. 4, 1841.<BR> 3. Redress, opposing.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिकर्मन्|अप्रतिकर्म्मन्
अ- + प्रतिकर्मन् अ- + प्रतिकर्मन्, adj. obedient, Rām. 1, 75, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाङ्क्षिन्
प्रतिकाङ्क्षिन् प्रति-काङ्क्ष् + इन्, adj. Desiring, Hariv. 5557.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकामिनी
प्रतिकामिनी प्रति-कामिन् + ई, f. A female rival, Śiś. 9, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाय|प्रतिकायः
प्रतिकाय प्रति-काय, m.<BR> 1. An effigy.<BR> 2. A target for archers to practice at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार|प्रतिकारः
प्रतिकार and प्रतीकार प्रती̆कार, i. e. प्रति-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Obviating, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 370.<BR> 2. Remedying, help, Hit. 85, 6, M.M.; help against, alleviation, Vikr. 20, 9.<BR> 3. A remedy, Man. 10, 185.<BR> 4. Requital, Rām. 4, 27, 20.<BR> 5. A kind of peace or alliance, concluded in the hope that the one part will requite services received from the other, Hit. iv. d. 113, 114.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिकार|अप्रतिकारः
अ-प्रतिकार अ-प्रतिकार, adj. 1. irremediable. 2. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a " target="_blank">Page0589-a + 38</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रतीकारम्
निष्प्रतीकार + म् निष्प्रतीकार + म्, i. e. निस्-, adv. without any trouble, MBh. 1, 8250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0588-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारिन्
प्रतिकारिन् प्रतिकारिन्, i. e. प्रति-कृ + इन्, adj. Counteracting, obviating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाश|प्रतिकाशः
प्रतिकाश and प्रतीकाश प्रती̆काश, i. e. प्रति-काश् + अ, adj. Like, resembling, Utt. Rāmac. 50, 8 (ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकितव|प्रतिकितवः
प्रतिकितव प्रति-कितव, m. An adversary at play, Daśak. in Chr. 185, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकुञ्जर|प्रतिकुंजर|प्रतिकुञ्जरः
प्रतिकुञ्जर प्रति-कुञ्जर, m. A hostile elephant, MBh. 9, 3217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूल|प्रतिकूलं
प्रतिकूल प्रति-कूल,<BR> I. adj., f. ला.<BR> 1. Contrary, Hariv. 11261; disagreeable, Pañc. iii. d. 104.<BR> 2. Contradictory, Rām. 3, 30, 14.<BR> 3. Hostile, Man. 9, 80; प्रतिकूलेषु स्थित, Refractory, 9, 275.<BR> 4. Disastrous, Śāk. 7, 16.<BR> 5. Perverse, MBh. 13, 3403.<BR> II. प्रतिकूलम्, adv.<BR> 1. Contrary, Rām. 6, 90, 26.<BR> 2. Inversely, Man. 10, 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलकृत्
प्रतिकूलकृत् प्रतिकूल-कृ + त्, adj. Opposing, making opposition, in अ-, Rām. 2, 52, 10 Gorr.; not opposing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलतस्
प्रतिकूलतस् प्रतिकूल + तस्, adv. In contradiction, MBh. 12, 8805.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलता
प्रतिकूलता प्रतिकूल + ता, f.<BR> 1. Opposition, Kathās. 31, 85.<BR> 2. Hostility, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1841.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलदैवता
प्रतिकूलदैवता प्रतिकूल-दैव + ता, f. Hostility of fate, Pañc. 192, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलय
प्रतिकूलय प्रतिकूलय, a denomin. derived from प्रतिकूल with अय, Par. To oppose, Rām. 2, 52, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलवन्त्|प्रतिकूलवत्
प्रतिकूलवन्त् प्रतिकूल + वन्त्, adj. Refractory, MBh. 10, 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृति|प्रतिकृतिः
प्रतिकृति प्रति-कृ + ति, f.<BR> 1. An image, Śāk. 90, 2.<BR> 2. Resistance, Hariv. 4211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकोप|प्रतिकोपः
प्रतिकोप प्रतिकोप, i. e. प्रति-कुप् + अ, m. Wrath, anger, MBh. 4, 1929.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रिया
प्रतिक्रिया प्रति-क्रिया, f.<BR> 1. Counteracting, keeping off, Rām. 6, 1, 5.<BR> 2. A fence, Rājat. 5, 92.<BR> 3. Remedying, help, Kathās. 31, 75; Utt. Rāmac. 73, 5.<BR> 4. Care, MBh. 12, 2187.<BR> 5. Requital, Kathās. 4, 124.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यप्रतिक्रिय
अन्-अन्य-प्रतिक्रिय अन्-अन्य-प्रतिक्रिय, adj. having no other help, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1949.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्प्रतिक्रिय
निष्प्रतिक्रिय निष्प्रतिक्रिय, i. e. निस्-, adj. irremediable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रूर
प्रतिक्रूर प्रति-क्रूर, adj. Returning cruelty, in अ-, MBh. 12, 9974; not returning cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षणम्
प्रतिक्षणम् प्रति-क्षण + म्, adv. Every moment, continually, Hit. 59, 17; 97, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षेप|प्रतिक्षेपः
