प्रतिगमन|प्रतिगमनं
प्रतिगमन प्रति-गम् + अन, n. Returning, Rām. 1, 17, title.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्जना
