प्रतिग्रह|प्रतिग्रहः
प्रतिग्रह प्रति-ग्रह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Acceptance, Man. 1, 88.<BR> 2. A present, Śāk. 17, 5.<BR> 3. Friendly reception, MBh. 1, 7556.<BR> 4. Favour, Rām. 1, 62, 29 Gorr.<BR> 5. Hearing, MBh. 3, 8373.<BR> 6. A receiver, Rām. 1, 69, 14.<BR> 7. A spitting pot.<BR> 8. The reserve of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहण|प्रतिग्रहणं
प्रतिग्रहण प्रति-ग्रहण, i. e. प्रति-ग्रह् + अन, n. Receiving, reception, Rām. 1, 45, 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0589-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

