अ- + प्रतिद्वंद्व अ- + प्रतिद्वंद्व, adj. 1. without an adversary, unopposed, Rām. 2, 107, 8. 2. unconquerable, 5, 22, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

