भू
2. भू भू, f.<BR> 1. The earth, Pañc. iii. 77.<BR> 2. pl. Landed property, land, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a " target="_blank">Page0663-a + 41</a>] Hit. iv. d. 121.<BR> 3. Ground, Megh. 65 (at the end of a comp. adj.).<BR> 4. Site, place, Kir. 5, 5.<BR> 5. Sacrificial fire.<BR> 6. Nom. sing. भूस्, indecl.<BR> 1. Earth, Man. 2, 76.<BR> 2. Hell.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0662-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पानभू
पान- + भू पान- + भू, f. a drinking-room, Kathās. 21, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0662-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लभू
मल्ल- + भू मल्ल- + भू, f. an arena for athletic contests.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0662-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचितभू
परिचित- + भू परिचित- + भू, adj. of which the places are known, Utt. Rāmac. 42, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0662-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूक|भूकं|भूकः
