भूकल|भूकलः
भूकल भूकल, m. A restive horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूक्षित्
भूक्षित् भू-क्षित्, m. A hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूचर|भूचरः
भूचर भू-चर, adj. Moving on the ground, Pañc. 114, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूतघ्न|भूतघ्नः
भूतघ्न भूत-घ्न,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A camel.<BR> 2. Garlic.<BR> II. f. घ्नी, Holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूति|भूतिः
भूति भू + ति, f.<BR> 1. State of being.<BR> 2. Production, birth.<BR> 3. Prosperity, Pañc. iii. d. 131; personified, Rām. 3, 52, 27.<BR> 4. Wealth, Man. 3, 59.<BR> 5. Power, dignity.<BR> 6. Superhuman power, as attainable by the practice of austere and magical rites.<BR> 7. The rut of elephants.<BR> 8. A decoration of elephants, consisting in many-coloured stripes, Megh. 19 (Sch.; read मण्डनम् and गजमण्डनम् instead of मण्डलम्).<BR> 9. Ashes.<BR> 10. Fried meat.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. ϕύσις.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

