रङ्ग- + भूति रङ्ग- + भूति f. the day of full moon in the month Āśvina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

