भूमन्
भूमन्<BR> I. i. e. भू + मन्, n. The earth, Chr. 291, 5 = Rigv. i. 85 5.<BR> II. i. e. बहु + इमन्, m. Multitude, majority, Rājat. 5, 165.<BR> --Cf. Lat. hŭmus, hŭmilis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूमय
भूमय भू + मय,<BR> I. adj., f. यी, Made or consisting of earth.<BR> II. f. यी, A name of छाया, or shadow personified, the wife of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

