भूमि भूमि (also भूमी, i. e. भू + म + ई, cf.<BR> I. भूमन्), f.<BR> 1. The earth, Pañc. 165, 16.<BR> 2. Land, estate, Pañc. iii. d. 92; domain (where one governs or works), Bhāg. P. 5, 11, 9.<BR> 3. Place, Pañc. 161, 13; site.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0663-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

