शाखा- + मृग शाखा- + मृग, m. 1. a monkey, Pañc. 94, 3. 2. a squirrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0720-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालामृग|शालामृगः
शाला- + मृग शाला- + मृग, m. a jackal, Rām. 3, 52, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0720-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेममृग
