मृगव्य|मृगव्यं
मृगव्य मृग + व्य, n. Chase, hunting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0720-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगादन|मृगादनः
मृगादन मृगादन, i. e. मृग-अद् + अन, m.<BR> 1. A leopard.<BR> 2. A hyæna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0720-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगाविध्
मृगाविध् मृगाविध्, i. e. मृग-आ-व्यध्, m. A hunter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0720-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृगावती
