रथवाहक
रथ- + वाहक रथ- + वाहक, m. the driver of a carriage, Nal. 22, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशुवाहक|शिशुवाहकः
शिशु- + वाहक शिशु- + वाहक, m. a wild goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्कन्धवाहक|स्कंधवाहक|स्कन्धवाहकः
स्कन्ध- + वाहक स्कन्ध- + वाहक, m. an ox of burthen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहन|वाहनं
वाहन वाहन, i. e. वह् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Carrying, Pañc. 253, 13; bearing, 83, 19.<BR> 2. Governing (of horses), Nal. 15, 2.<BR> 3. A vehicle, Hit. 126, 16; Man. 7, 222; a chariot, Hit. iv. d. 62; a horse, Man. 5, 29; an elephant.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विजवाहन
द्विज- + वाहन द्विज- + वाहन, m, Viṣṇu (having a bird, Garuḍa, as his vehicle), Hariv. 3982.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरवाहन|नरवाहनः
नर- + वाहन नर- + वाहन, adj. drawn by men, epithet and name of Kuvera, MBh. 3, 8358.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महिषवाहन|महिषवाहनः
महिष- + वाहन महिष- + वाहन, m. Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेघवाहन|मेघवाहनः
मेघ- + वाहन मेघ- + वाहन, m. 1. Indra. 2. Śiva. 3. a proper name, Rājat. 5, 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमवाहन|यमवाहनः
यम- + वाहन यम- + वाहन, m. a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारिवाहन|वारिवाहनः
वारि- + वाहन वारि- + वाहन, m. a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालिवाहन|शालिवाहनः
शालि- + वाहन शालि- + वाहन, m. the name of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिखिवाहन|शिखिवाहनः
शिखि(न्)- + वाहन शिखि(न्)- + वाहन, m. Kārttikeya, the god of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतवाहन|श्वेतवाहनः
श्वेत- + वाहन श्वेत- + वाहन, m. 1. the moon. 2. Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हरिवाहन|हरिवाहनः
हरि- + वाहन हरि- + वाहन, m. 1. Garuḍa. 2. Indra, Indr. 5, 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यवाहन|हव्यवाहनः
हव्य- + वाहन हव्य- + वाहन, see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रवाहन
