वाहस|वाहसः
वाहस वाहस (vb. वह्), m. The boa-constrictor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिक|वाहिकः
वाहिक वाहिक (vb. वह्), m.<BR> 1. A car.<BR> 2. A large drum.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भारवाहिक|भारवाहिकः
भार- + वाहिक भार- + वाहिक,<BR> I. adj. carrying burthens.<BR> II. m. a porter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिन्
वाहिन् वाहिन्, i. e. वह् and वाह, + इन्,<BR> I. adj. (at the end of comp. words), Bearing, Pañc. 79, 16; carrying, Śāk. d. 57.<BR> II. f. नी.<BR> 1. An army, Hit. iii. d. 125.<BR> 2. A body of forces, consisting of 81 elephants, 81 cars, 243 horse, and 405 foot.<BR> 3. A river, Rām. 2, 66, 26, ed. Seramp.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवाहिन्|दंडवाहिन्
