वेगवाहिन्
वेग- + वाहिन् वेग- + वाहिन्, adj. swift, Rājat. 5, 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साधुवाहिन्
साधु- + वाहिन् साधु- + वाहिन्, m. a well-trained horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0842-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहीक|वाहीकः
वाहीक वाहीक,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. (vb. वह्), Bearing burthens.<BR> 2. (i. e. वहिस् + ईक), Outer.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. An ox.<BR> 2. The name of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहुक
वाहुक वाहुक, see बाहुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्य|वाह्यं|वाह्यः
वाह्य वाह्य, i. e. वहिस् + य, adj.<BR> 1. Outer, external, Vikr. 72, 5 (स-वाह्य-अन्तर्-आत्मन्, Body and soul, the whole being); Pañc. 60, 7 (तव व्यवसाय-वाह्यं कुतस् तेषां मांसादनम्, How will they be able to feed on flesh except by thy exertion?).<BR> 2. Foreign, a foreigner, Pañc. i. d. 293.<BR> 3. An outcaste, one of a low tribe, Man. 10, 28; 30.<BR> 4. Abl. यात्, From without, Pañc. 193, 14. Cf. वह्.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवाह्य
अ- + वाह्य अ- + वाह्य, adj. inward, Ragh. 14, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकवाह्य
लोक- + वाह्य लोक- + वाह्य, m. an outcaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्यतस्
वाह्यतस् वाह्य + तस्, adv. Externally, being out of (the water), Pañc. 255, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिक|वाह्लिकं|वाह्लिकः
वाह्लिक वाह्लिक, n. Saffron (cf. the next).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लीक|वाह्लीकं|वाह्लीकः
वाह्लीक वाह्लीक,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. The name of a country, Balkh.<BR> 2. A horse from Balkh.<BR> 3. One of the principal गन्धर्वस्.<BR> 4. A proper name, Johns. Sel. 7, 2.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Saffron.<BR> 2. Assafœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वि|विः
1. वि वि, i. e. द्वि, prep.<BR> I. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives.<BR> II. Compounded with nouns. It implies,<BR> 1. Separation, cf. वियोग.<BR> 2. Privation, cf. वि-कच.<BR> 3. Wrongness, cf. विकर्मन्; baseness, cf. वि-योनी; opposition, cf. वि-लोम.<BR> 4. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b " target="_blank">Page0843-b + 44</a>] Difference, cf. विलक्षण.<BR> 5. Spreading; falling in different directions, asunder, cf. वि-कॄ, e. g. वि-कीर्ण-केश.<BR> 6. Manifoldness, much, cf. विकर्मन्.<BR> --Cf. probably Lat. vi, in di-vi-dere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वि|विः
2. वि वि, m., f. वी̆,<BR> 1. A bird, Chr. 287, 6 = Rigv. i. 48, 6.<BR> 2. The eye.<BR> 3. Heaven.<BR> 4. The region of the wind.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. avis; αἰετός, οἰωνίς, ὤϊον, ὠόν; Lat. ovum; O.H.G. ei; A.S. aeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुवि
बहु- + वि बहु- + वि, adj. containing many birds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंश|विंशः
विंश विंश,<BR> 1. Ordinal number (cf. विंशति), m., f. शी, n. Twentieth, Chr. 55, 1. 8; Bhāg. P. iii. 20.<BR> 2. The twentieth part, Man. 8, 398.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोनविंश
एकोन- + विंश एकोन- + विंश, i. e. एक-ऊन-, or ऊन-, ord. num. nineteenth, Chr. 53, 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंश|एकविंशः
एक- + विंश एक- + विंश, twenty-first, Chr. 57, 1, bel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाविंश
द्वा- + विंश द्वा- + विंश, twenty-second, Man. 2, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोविंश
त्रयो-विंश त्रयो-विंश, i. e. त्रयस्-, twenty-third, Kathās. i. p. 378.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्विंश
चतुर्- + विंश चतुर्- + विंश, twenty-fourth, ib. p. 405.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चविंश|पंचविंश|पञ्चविंशः
पञ्चविंश पञ्चविंश, i. e. पञ्चन्-, twenty-fifth, ib. p. 437.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षड्विंश
षड्विंश षड्विंश, i. e. षष्-, twenty-sixth, ib. p. 469, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिंशद्विंश
त्रिंशद्विंश त्रिंशद्विंश, i. e. त्रिंशत्-, comp. card. num. from twenty to thirty, Rājat. 5, 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशक|विंशकः
विंशक विंशक, i. e. विंशति, or विंशत्, + क, adj. Twenty, or an aggregate of twenty.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशक
एक- + विंशक एक- + विंशक, ord. num. twenty-first, Man. 3, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशत्
विंशत् विंशत् (cf. विंशति), card. num. Twenty; in एक-, Twenty-one, Rām. 1, 13, 27. परि-, Full twenty, MBh. 11, 561.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशति|विंशतिः
विंशति विंशति, i. e. द्वि-दशन्त् (original form of दशन्), + इ, card. num. f. Twenty, Hit. iv. d. 33.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Cf. Lat. viginti; ϝίκατι, βείκατι, εἴκοσι.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशति|एकविंशतिः
एक- + विंशति एक- + विंशति, f. twenty-one, Man. 4, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाविंशति|द्वाविंशतिः
द्वा- + विंशति द्वा- + विंशति, f. twenty-two, MBh. 7, 1878.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोविंशति|त्रयोविंशतिः
त्रयो-विंशति त्रयो-विंशति, i. e. त्रयस्-, f. twenty-three, Bhāg. P. 3, 6, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्विंशति
चतुर्- + विंशति चतुर्- + विंशति, f. twentyfour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टाविंशति|अष्टाविंशतिः
अष्टाविंशति अष्टाविंशति, i. e. अष्टन्-, f. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a " target="_blank">Page0844-a + 41</a>] twenty-eight, Yājñ. 1, 302.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0843-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतितम|विंशतितमः
विंशतितम विंशति + तम, ord. num., f. मी, Twentieth.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशतितम
एक- + विंशतितम एक- + विंशतितम, twentyfirst, Rām. iii. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाविंशतितम
द्वा- + विंशतितम द्वा- + विंशतितम, twentysecond, etc., Rām. iii. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतिम
विंशतिम विंशतिम, curtailed for विंशतितम, in पञ्चविंशतिम, i. e. पञ्चन्-, Twenty-fifth, MBh. 12, 11251.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशिन्
विंशिन् विंशिन्, i. e. विंश, in the signification of विंशति (cf. त्रिंशत्-विंश), + इन्, m.<BR> 1. Twenty.<BR> 2. A lord of twenty towns, Man. 7, 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक|विकं
विक विक, n. The milk of a prolific cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकङ्कत|विकंकत|विकंकतः|विकङ्कतः
विकङ्कत विकङ्कत, m. A small tree, Ragh. 11, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकच|विकचः
विकच वि-कच, see s. v. कच.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकट|विकटः
विकट विकट,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Large, Utt. Rāmac. 118, 6.<BR> 2. Large-toothed.<BR> 3. Knitted (as the brows), Prab. 85, 15; formidable, Utt. Rāmac. 150, 13; hideous.<BR> 4. Obsolete, obscure.<BR> 5. Changed in form or appearance.<BR> 6. Beautiful.<BR> 7. i. e. वि-कट, Without a mat, Nal. 10, 6.<BR> II. n. A tumour.<BR> III. m. A proper name, Pañc. 76, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थन|विकत्थनं
विकत्थन वि-कत्थ् + अन,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Boastful.<BR> 2. Praising ironically.<BR> 3. Speaking idly.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Boasting.<BR> 2. Assigning anything to an unreal origin.<BR> 3. Proclaiming, repeating.<BR> 4. Praising.<BR> 5. Irony.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकत्थन
अ- + विकत्थन अ- + विकत्थन, adj. not boasting, modest, Hit. iii. d. 101; Ragh. 14, 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विकत्थन
दुस्- + विकत्थन दुस्- + विकत्थन, adj. boasting in a disagreeable manner, Daśak. 102, 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्था
विकत्था वि-कत्थ् + आ, f.<BR> 1. Boasting.<BR> 2. Proclaiming.<BR> 3. Praise.<BR> 4. Ironical praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्प|विकंप
विकम्प वि-कम्प् + अ, adj.<BR> 1. Trembling.<BR> 2. Unsteady.<BR> 3. Shrinking from.<BR> 4. Heaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकरालता
विकरालता वि-कराल + ता, f. Dreadfulness, Pañc. 218, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्तन|विकर्तनः|विकर्त्तन|विकर्त्तनः
विकर्तन विकर्तन, i. e. वि-कृत् + अन, m.<BR> 1. A son who has usurped his father's kingdom.<BR> 2. The sun, Utt. Rāmac. 124, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्त्तृ|विकर्तृ
विकर्त्तृ विकर्त्तृ, i. e. वि-कृत् + तृ, in गो-, m. A butcher, MBh. 4, 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्मकृत्|विकर्म्मकृत्
विकर्मकृत् विकर्मकृत्, i. e. विकर्मन्-कृ + त्, adj.<BR> 1. One who does forbidden acts, Man. 8, 66.<BR> 2. Busy in various ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्मन्|विकर्म्मन्
विकर्मन् वि-कर्मन्,<BR> I. adj. Not acting, Lass. 2. ed. 68, 40.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Unlawful act, Bhag. 4, 17.<BR> 2. Fraud.<BR> 3. Various business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्मस्थ|विकर्म्मस्थ|विकर्म्मस्थः
विकर्मस्थ विकर्मस्थ, i. e. विकर्मन्-स्थ, adj.<BR> 1. One who has done an illegal or an immoral act, Man. 11, 192.<BR> 2. Addicted to vice, 4, 30; 9, 214.<BR> 3. Engaged in various business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्ष|विकर्षः
विकर्ष विकर्ष, i. e. वि-कृष् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Pulling, pulling out.<BR> 2. An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्षण|विकर्षणं|विकर्षणः
विकर्षण विकर्षण, i. e. वि-कृष् + अन,<BR> 1. Pulling, Kir. 4, 15; drawing (of a bow), Kir. 3, 57.<BR> 2. A throwing across, a cross-buttock, Johns. Sel. 58, 169.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल|विकलः
विकल विकल, i. e. वि-कला,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Defective, Hit. i. d. 201, M.M.<BR> 2. Wanting, failing, Pañc. v. d. 8; Hit. i. d. 200, M.M.; Śāk. d. 152.<BR> 3. Decayed, Utt. Rāmac. 68, 3; impaired.<BR> 4. Confused (cf. कल), Lass. 54, 7; sorrowful, Utt. Rāmac. 18, 1.<BR> II. f. ला and ली, A woman in whom menstruation has ceased.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल
अ- + विकल अ- + विकल, adj. 1. unimpaired, Hit. i. d. 126, M.M. 2. excellent, Megh. 25; 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्प|विकल्पः
विकल्प विकल्प, i. e. वि-कॢप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Option, Daśak. in. Chr. 181, 20 (-उपहार-कर्मन्, Optional offerings, not prescribed); alternative, distinction, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a " target="_blank">Page0845-a + 44</a>] Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 2.<BR> 2. Alternation, Mālav. d. 29.<BR> 3. Doubt, Pañc. i. d. 411; indecision, ib. 71, 20; hesitation, Ragh. 17, 49.<BR> 4. Error, mistake.<BR> 5. Ignorance.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल्प|अविकल्पः
अ-विकल्प अ-विकल्प, adj. not tarrying, Pañc. 88, 6; ˚पम्, adv. 1. in an undoubted (legal?) manner, Pañc. 45, 4. 2. without indecision, i. e. without any delay, Pañc. i. d. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डविकल्प|दण्डविकल्पः
दण्ड- + विकल्प दण्ड- + विकल्प, m. a discretionary punishment, Man. 9, 228.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकल्प|निर्व्विकल्प
निस्- + विकल्प निस्- + विकल्प, adj. allowing no alternative, Bhāṣāp. 57. ˚पम्, adv. without hesitation, Pañc. i. d. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सविकल्प
स- + विकल्प स- + विकल्प, adj. admitting of an alternative, distinguishing, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पक
विकल्पक विकल्प + क, a substitute for विकल्प, at the end of comp. adj. निस्-, adj. Allowing no alternative, no distinction, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 9; Bhāṣāp. 134. स-, adj. Admitting of an alternative, distinguishing, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पिन्
विकल्पिन् विकल्पिन्, i. e. विकल्प + इन्, adj. Endowed with doubt or illusion, Ṛt. 6, 34, v. r. नीलाशोकविकल्पिकेशनिकरः, ‘Having plenty of hair, on account of an illusion caused by the black aśoka,’ i. e. his hair is represented by the black aśoka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकस्वर|विकस्वरः
विकस्वर वि-कस् + वर (also विकश्वर विकश्वर, cf. कस्), adj. Opening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाङ्क्षा
विकाङ्क्षा वि-काङ्क्ष् + आ, f. Hesitation, Rām. 2, 57, 18, ed. Seramp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकार|विकारः
विकार विकार, i. e. वि-कृ + अ, m.<BR> 1. Change, Vedāntas. in Chr. 216, 18; Utt. Rāmac. 23, 7 (perturbation); Śāk. 13, 9 (passion), Mālat. 14, 8.<BR> 2. Change of form, Pañc. 257, 23.<BR> 3. Change of mind, Śāk. 66, 4.<BR> 4. Disease, Nalod. 2, 17; a wound, Pañc. 218, 13.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्तविकार|चित्तविकारः
चित्त- + विकार चित्त- + विकार, m. perturbation of mind, MBh. 18, 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकार|निर्विकारः|निर्व्विकार|निर्व्विकारः
निस्- + विकार निस्- + विकार, adj. unchanged, MBh. 13, 2318.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमविकार|रोमविकारः
रोमविकार रोमविकार, i. e. रोमन्-, m. horripilation (cf. रोमाञ्च).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकारतस्
विकारतस् विकार + तस्, adv. From the change, Hit. iii. d. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकारत्व
विकारत्व विकार + त्व, n. The condition of transforming, transformation, Vedāntas. in Chr. 209, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकारिन्
विकारिन् विकारिन्, i. e. वि-कृ + इन् and विकार, + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Producing a change, Hit. ii. d. 98 (spoiling).<BR> 2. Undergoing a change, Prab. 111, 17; falling in love, Mālat. 11, 10.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकारिन्
अ- + विकारिन् अ- + विकारिन्, adj. faithful, Man. 7, 190.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाल|विकालः
विकाल वि-काल, m.<BR> 1. Twilight, Pañc. 258, 9.<BR> 2. Afternoon (? cf. वैकालिक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकालक|विकालकः
विकालक विकाल + क,<BR> I. m. Twilight, evening.<BR> II. f. लिका, A sort of clepsydra which defines that period.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाश|विकाशः
1. विकाश वि-काश् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Æther, heaven.<BR> 2. Solitude, loneliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाश|विकाशः
2. विकाश विकाश, and (better) विकास विकास, i. e. वि-कस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Opening, expanding, exhibition, Vikr. 35, 8 (स-दोष-, A defective exhibition).<BR> 2. Budding, blowing, Śiś. 9, 41 (श्, of flowers, and of the heart for falling in love); figuratively, Pañc. 187, 2.<BR> 3. Display, splendid appearance, Śiś. 9, 53 (श्).<BR> 4. Pleasure, enjoyment.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सविकाश|सविकाशः
स- + विकाश स- + विकाश, adj. expanded, extensive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाशक
विकाशक विकाशक, better विकासक विकासक, i. e. वि-कस्, Caus., + अक, adj. Causing to expand, Lass. 90, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाशन|विकाशनं
विकाशन विकाशन (cf. 1. 2. विकाश), n.<BR> 1. Manifestation.<BR> 2. Expansion.<BR> 3. Blowing of a flower.<BR> 4. Causing to blow (again), Utt. Rāmac. 23, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकाशिन्
विकाशिन् विकाशिन्, विकाविन् विकाषिन्, and (better) विकासिन् विकासिन्, i. e. वि-कस् + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Expanding, developing itself, Bhartṛ. 3, 70; opening.<BR> 2. Budding, blowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0845-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकास|विकासः
विकास, विकासिन् विकास, वीकासिन्, see विकाश, शिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकिर|विकिरः
विकिर विकिर, m.<BR> I. i. e. वि-कॄ + अ,<BR> 1. A fallen fragment, what has been dropped, Man. 3, 245.<BR> 2. Scattering.<BR> 3. A well.<BR> II. A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकिरण|विकिरणं|विकिरणः
विकिरण विकिरण, i. e. वि-कॄ + अन,<BR> I. n. Scattering.<BR> II. m. Gigantic swallow-wort, Asclepias gigantea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकूजन|विकूजनं
विकूजन वि-कूज् + अन, n. Grumbling, in अन्त्र-, n. Grumbling of the bowels, Suśr. 2, 451, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकूणिका
विकूणिका विकूणिका, f. The nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृति|विकृतिः
विकृति वि-कृ + ति, f.<BR> 1. Change of any kind, Utt. Rāmac. 133, 16 (wrath); of mind, Pañc. 58, 25.<BR> 2. Sickness.<BR> 3. Fear.<BR> 4. Spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृतिमन्त्|विकृतिमत्
विकृतिमन्त् विकृति + मन्त्, adj., f. मती,<BR> 1. Changed, wounded, Nalod. 2, 47.<BR> 2. Changeable, Śāk. d. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रम|विक्रमः
विक्रम वि-क्रम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. A step, Johns. Sel. 95, 67; Śāk. d. 165.<BR> 2. Proceeding. Man. 3, 214 (v. r.).<BR> 3. Overpowering.<BR> 4. Great strength, Johns. Sel. 48, 82.<BR> 5. Strength, Hit. ii. d. 84 (with कृ, To use one's strength).<BR> 6. Heroism, Vikr. 11, 12; Pañc. ii. d. 146; in the title of the drama, विक्रमोर्वशी, i. e. विक्रम-उर्वशि, f. Urvaśī, gained by heroism.<BR> 7. A proper name.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्रम|अविक्रमः
अ- + विक्रम अ- + विक्रम, adj. weak, Kir. 2, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चण्डविक्रम|चंडविक्रम
चण्ड- + विक्रम चण्ड- + विक्रम, adj. possessed of fierce courage, Rām. 5, 39, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यविक्रम
तुल्य- + विक्रम तुल्य- + विक्रम, adj. fought with equal prowess, Hit. iii. d. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिविक्रम|त्रिविक्रमः
त्रि- + विक्रम त्रि- + विक्रम,<BR> I. n. three steps, Rām. 6, 79, 11.<BR> II. adj. and sbst. walking with three steps over the heaven, epithet of Viṣṇu (as sun), Rām. 1, 32, 13 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यविक्रम
सत्य- + विक्रम सत्य- + विक्रम, adj. having real valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रमसेन
विक्रमसेन विक्रमसेन (cf. सेना), and विक्रमादित्य विक्रमादित्य, i. e. विक्रम-आदित्य, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b " target="_blank">Page0846-b + 41</a>] m. Proper names, Lass. 15, 18 (corr. ˚सेनेनो˚); 1, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रमिन्
विक्रमिन् विक्रमिन्, i. e. विक्रम + इन्, m.<BR> 1. A hero.<BR> 2. A lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रय|विक्रयं|विक्रयः
विक्रय विक्रय, i. e. वि-क्री + अ, m. Sale, selling, Pañc. 121, 21.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मविक्रय|आत्मविक्रयः
आत्मविक्रय आत्मविक्रय, i. e. आत्मन्-, m. selling one's self, Man. 11, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयविक्रय|क्रयविक्रयः
क्रय- + विक्रय क्रय- + विक्रय, m. buying and selling, traffic, 8, 401.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रयिक|विक्रयिकः
विक्रयिक विक्रयिक, i. e. विक्रय + इक, adj. One who sells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रयिन्
विक्रयिन् विक्रयिन्, i. e. वि-क्री + इन्, m. A vendor.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्यविक्रयिन्
अपत्य- + विक्रयिन् अपत्य- + विक्रयिन्, m. a seller of his offspring, Man. 3, 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रतुविक्रयिन्
क्रतु- + विक्रयिन् क्रतु- + विक्रयिन्, m. one who sells the reward of his sacrifice, Man. 4, 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसविक्रयिन्
मांस- + विक्रयिन् मांस- + विक्रयिन्, m. a vendor of flesh, a term of reproach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रान्ति|विक्रांति|विक्रांतिः|विक्रान्तिः
विक्रान्ति विक्रान्ति, i. e. वि-क्रम् + ति, f.<BR> 1. A horse's canter or gallop.<BR> 2. Great strength.<BR> 3. Prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रायक|विक्रायकः
विक्रायक विक्रायक, i. e. वि-क्री + अक, m. A seller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रिया
विक्रिया विक्रिया, i. e. वि-कृ + य, and वि-क्रिया, f.<BR> 1. Change, Pañc. i. d. 330; transformation, Śāk. p. 106, 1.<BR> 2. A dish prepared from (milk), Man. 5, 25.<BR> 3. Disease, Daśak. in Chr. 187, 7.<BR> 4. Mischief, Rām. 3, 49, 56.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूतविक्रिया
भूत- + विक्रिया भूत- + विक्रिया, f. epilepsy, possession by evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरोमविक्रिय
स-रोमविक्रिय स-रोमविक्रिय, i. e. स-रोमन्-, adj. affected with horripilation (as a sign of excessive pleasure), Vikr. d. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रेतृ
विक्रेतृ विक्रेतृ, i. e. वि-क्री + तृ, m. A vendor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लव|विक्लवः
विक्लव विक्लव (cf. क्लव्, but this vb. is dubious; I should prefer a derivation from क्लम्), adj.<BR> 1. Overcome with fear or agitation, confused, bewildered, Daśak. in Chr. 200, 16.<BR> 2. Disgusted, Śāk. 22, 5.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्लव
अ- + विक्लव अ- + विक्लव, adj. intrepid, MBh. 1, 2070.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लेद|विक्लेदः
विक्लेद विक्लेद, i. e. वि-क्लिद् + अ, m. Dissolution, Bhāg. P. 3, 20, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षाव|विक्षावः
विक्षाव विक्षाव, i. e. वि-क्षु + अ, m.<BR> 1. Cough.<BR> 2. Sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षेप|विक्षेपः
विक्षेप विक्षेप, i. e. वि-क्षिप् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Casting, or throwing away (चरण-, Casting asunder of the feet, i. e. striding, Vikr. 60, 14).<BR> 2. Dispatching.<BR> 3. Refuting an argument.<BR> 4. Confusion, perplexity, fear, proceeding from ignorance or error, Vedāntas. in Chr. 205, 23; cf. 206, 8; 217, 24.<BR> 5. Looking about wildly.<BR> 6. Celestial latitude.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्तविक्षेप|चित्तविक्षेपः
चित्त- + विक्षेप चित्त- + विक्षेप, m. scattering, diversion of mind, Utt. Rāmac. 52, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिविक्षेप|दृष्टिविक्षेपः
दृष्टि- + विक्षेप दृष्टि- + विक्षेप, m. a leer, a side glance, Śāk. 16, 1, Chezy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षेपण|विक्षेपणं
विक्षेपण विक्षेपण, i. e. वि-क्षिप् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Scattering.<BR> 2. Throwing.<BR> 3. Dispatching.<BR> 4. Confusion, proceeding from ignorance or error, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217, 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख|विखः
विख विख, also विखु विखु, विख्य विख्य, विख्र विख्र, and विख्रु विख्रु (perhaps dialectical forms of विग्र, q. cf.), adj. Noseless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्याति|विख्यातिः
विख्याति वि-ख्या + ति, f.<BR> 1. Fame.<BR> 2. Notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगणन|विगणनं
विगणन वि-गण् + अन, n. Reckoning, computing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगम|विगमः
विगम वि-गम् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Parting, withdrawing. Ṛt. 6, 22.<BR> 2. Separation.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिवसविगम|दिवसविगमः
दिवस- + विगम दिवस- + विगम, m. the decline of the day, Megh. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगर्हण|विगर्हणं
विगर्हण विगर्हण, i. e. वि-गर्ह् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Abusing.<BR> 2. Abuse, blame, Chr. 63, 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगान|विगानं
विगान विगान, i. e. वि-गै + अन, n.<BR> 1. Blame.<BR> 2. Ill report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगाह|विगाहः
विगाह वि-गाह् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Bathing.<BR> 2. Plunging into, literally and figuratively. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b " target="_blank">Page0847-b + 41</a>]<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विगाह
दुस्- + विगाह दुस्- + विगाह,<BR> I. adj. impenetrable, unfathomable, Pañc. i. d. 125.<BR> II. m. a proper name, MBh. 1, 4544.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्र|विग्रः
विग्र विग्र (perhaps anomal, वि-अग्र), adj. Noseless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रह|विग्रहः
विग्रह वि-ग्रह् + अ,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. War, battle, Pañc. 149, 14; Hit. pr. d. 9, M.M.<BR> 2. Opposition, encounter, quarrel, Bhartṛ. 2, 42.<BR> 3. Disfavour, Rājat. 5, 247.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Extension.<BR> 2. Shape, Kir. 5, 43.<BR> 3. The body, Rām. 5, 2, 15.<BR> 4. A portion.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृतविग्रह
आ-वृत- + विग्रह आ-वृत- + विग्रह (vb. वृ), adj., f. हा, whose body is covered, hidden, Vikr. d. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सविग्रह
स- + विग्रह स- + विग्रह, adj. 1. embodied, living, Rājat. 5, 27. 2. meaning, importing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रहवन्त्|विग्रहवत्
विग्रहवन्त् विग्रह + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Embodied, incarnate, Sāv. 1, 22; Mālav. d. 13; Sund. 3, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघटन|विघटनं
विघटन वि-घट् + अन, n. Destruction, Prab. 80, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्टना
विघट्टना वि-घट्ट् + अना f. Separation, Nalod. 4, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्टिन्
विघट्टिन् वि-घट्ट् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Touching, Ragh. 16, 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघस|विघसं|विघसः
विघस वि-घस् + अ, m.<BR> 1. The residue of food offered to the gods, manes (Man. 3, 285), to a venerable guest, or a spiritual teacher.<BR> 2. Food, Utt. Rāmac. 121, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघात|विघातः
विघात विघात, i. e. वि-हन्, Caus., + अ, m. and n.<BR> 1. Prohibition.<BR> 2. Opposition.<BR> 3. Impediment, obstacle, Pañc. 42, 12.<BR> 4. Destruction, Sund. 1, 12; Pañc. 156, 23.<BR> 5. Abandoning, Pañc. 172, 25.<BR> 6. A blow, Vikr. 85, 19 (दृष्टि-, Being dazzled).<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्तविघात
दन्त- + विघात दन्त- + विघात, m. biting, bite, Ṛt. 4, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघातिन्
विघातिन् विघातिन्, i. e. वि-हन् Caus., + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Opposing, impeding.<BR> 2. Removing.<BR> 3. Killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0847-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघोषण
विघोषण विघोषण, i. e. वि-घुष् + अन, n. Proclamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्न|विघ्नः
विघ्न विघ्न, i. e. वि-हन् + अ, m. (n., Sund. 1, 12),<BR> 1. Obstacle, Utt. Rāmac. 35, 19; trouble, Śāk. d. 13.<BR> 2. Impediment, Pañc. 168, 3.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविघ्न
अ- + विघ्न अ- + विघ्न,<BR> I. adj. free from obstacles, unobstructed, Śāk. 13, 23.<BR> II. n. absence of obstruction, Ragh. 1, 91; instr. ˚नेन, without impediment, Rām. 4, 38, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविघ्नम्
अप-विघ्न + म् अप-विघ्न + म्, adv. free from impediments, Ragh. 3, 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणविघ्न
क्षण- + विघ्न क्षण- + विघ्न, m. a delay of a moment, Vikr. d. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नक
ऽविघ्नक -विघ्न + क, at the end of a comp. adj. Obstructing, impeding, Lass. 5, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नवन्त्|विघ्नवत्
विघ्नवन्त् विघ्न + वन्त्, adj., f. वती, Obstructed by obstacles, Śāk. 41, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नित|विघ्नितः
विघ्नित विघ्नित, i. e. विघ्न + इत, adj. Obstructed, impeded, Pañc. 168, 7; Vikr. d. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्
विच् ii. 7, विनच्, विञ्च्, † ii. 3, anomal. वेविच्, Par. Ātm. To separate, to deprive, Bhaṭṭ. 14, 103 (विक्त, Lass. 2, 14, must be changed to रिक्त); cf. 2. विज्.<BR> --With the prep. वि वि,<BR> 1. To remove, MBh. 1, 6372.<BR> 2. To change, MBh. 1, 7396.<BR> 3. To decide, MBh. 2, 2244.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. विविक्त.<BR> 1. Separated.<BR> 2. Solitary, Man. 2, 215; 3, 206; Pañc. 159, 21.<BR> 3. Scattered, Chr. 29, 29 (perhaps it is to be changed to निविष्ट).<BR> 4. Discriminated.<BR> 5. Pure, Bhartṛ. 3, 62.<BR> 6. Discriminative.<BR> 7. Profound (as thought).<BR> 8. Intent on. n. Loneliness, being alone, Vikr. 40, 5.<BR> --With प्रवि प्र-वि, प्रविविक्त,<BR> 1. Separated, Vedāntas. in Chr. 208, 13.<BR> 2. Solitary, Rām. 2, 48, 59, ed. Seramp.<BR> --Cf. O.H.G. wîchan; A.S. wícan, recedere (perhaps rather to 2. विज्); perhaps also O.H.G. wehsal; A.S. wrixl; εἴκειν; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b " target="_blank">Page0848-b + 43</a>] Lat. vicis, invicem, vicissim, and vincere, i. e. to cause to cede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षण|विचक्षणः
विचक्षण विचक्षण, i. e. वि-चक्ष् + अन, adj.<BR> 1. All-seeing, Chr. 289, 8 = Rigv. i. 112, 8; Chr. 296, 4 = Rigv. i. 112, 4.<BR> 2. Discerning, knowing, Pañc. i. d. 59 (cf. Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 984); circumspect, wise, Bhag. 18, 2; clever.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्यविचक्षण
कार्य- + विचक्षण कार्य- + विचक्षण, adj. understanding to manage affairs, Pañc. i. d. 424 (cf. Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 3241).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविचक्षण|सन्धिविचक्षण|संधिविचक्षणः
संधि- + विचक्षण संधि- + विचक्षण, adj. knowing the different kinds of peace-making, Hit. iv. d. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविचक्षण
सु- + विचक्षण सु- + विचक्षण, adj. well-discerning, Hit. i. d. 21, M.M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षस्
विचक्षस् वि-चक्ष् + अस्, m. A preceptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचय|विचयः
विचय विचय, i. e. वि-चि + अ, m. Search, Utt. Rāmac. 15, 4; research.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचयन|विचयनं
विचयन विचयन, i. e. वि-चि + अन, n. Seeking, search.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्षणि
विचर्षणि विचर्षणि (वि, and vb. चर्), adj. Swift, Chr. 291, 12 = Rigv. i. 64, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचलन|विचलनं
विचलन वि-चल् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Deviating from.<BR> 2. Unsteadiness.<BR> 3. Self-praise, conceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचार|विचारः
विचार विचार, i. e. वि-चर् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Consideration, Hit. ii. d. 42; deliberation, Pañc. i. d. 417 (doubt).<BR> 2. Discrimination, selection, Hit. 104, 7 (read सारासारविचारः).<BR> 3. Discussion.<BR> 4. Judging, Hit. ii. d. 72; judgment, Hit. 116, 10; decision.<BR> 5. Prudence, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2891.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविचारम्
अ-विचार + म् अ-विचार + म्, adv. without long consideration, Daśak. in Chr. 188, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचार
निस्- + विचार निस्- + विचार, adj. not reflecting, Rājat. 6, 323. ˚रम्, adv. without long reflection, Rām. 2, 23, 10 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविचार
सु- + विचार सु- + विचार, m. due consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वप्नविचार|स्वप्नविचारः
स्वप्न- + विचार स्वप्न- + विचार, m. interpretation of dreams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारण|विचारणं
विचारण विचारण, i. e. वि-चर्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a " target="_blank">Page0849-a + 41</a>] Caus., + अन,<BR> I. n., and f. णा.<BR> 1. Deliberation, Hit. 51, 22; investigation, Prab. 100, 3.<BR> 2. Hesitation, doubt, Nal. 13, 27.<BR> II. f. णा, The Mīmāṃsā system of philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0848-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारिन्
विचारिन् विचारिन्, i. e. वि-चर् + इन्, adj., f. इणी,<BR> 1. Wandering, Chr. 46, 25.<BR> 2. Discussing, judging.<BR> 3. Lascivious, Cāṇ. 29 in Berl. Monatsb. 1864, 408.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वप्नविचारिन्
स्वप्न- + विचारिन् स्वप्न- + विचारिन्, m. an interpreter of dreams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचाल|विचालं|विचालः
विचाल विचाल, i. e. वि-चल् + अ, adj. Intervening, intermediate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिकित्सा
विचिकित्सा विचिकित्सा, i. e. वि-चिकित्स, desider. of कित्, + आ, f. Doubt, Mālat. 42, 11.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचिकित्सम्
निस्-विचिकित्स + म् निस्-विचिकित्स + म्, adv. without long reflecting, Kull. ad Man. 8, 417.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिति|विचितिः
विचिति वि-चि + ति, f. Searching, Nalod. 4, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रित|विचित्रितः
विचित्रित विचित्रित, see चित्र्; विचीर्ण विचीर्ण, see चर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टा
विचेष्टा वि-चेष्ट् + आ, f. Behaviour.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्विचेष्ट
दुस्- + विचेष्ट दुस्- + विचेष्ट, adj. ill-behaving, MBh. 12, 7033.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचेष्ट
निस्- + विचेष्ट निस्- + विचेष्ट, adj. motionless, Rām. 5, 44, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छन्द|विच्छंद|विच्छंदः|विच्छन्दः|विछन्द
विच्छन्द विच्छन्द, and विच्छन्दक विच्छन्द + क, m.<BR> 1. A palace.<BR> 2. A temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छर्दक|विच्छर्दकः|विच्छर्द्दक|विच्छर्द्दकः|विछर्द्दक
विच्छर्दक विच्छर्दक, m.<BR> 1. A palace.<BR> 2. A temple (cf. ved. छर्दिस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छायय
विच्छायय विच्छायय, a denomin. derived from वि-छाय (cf. छाया), Par. To free from shadow, Häberl. in Anth. 224, 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छित्ति|विच्छित्तिः
विच्छित्ति विच्छित्ति, i. e. वि-चिद् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Cutting, Bhartṛ. 3, 46.<BR> 2. Dividing.<BR> 3. Separation.<BR> 4. Loss.<BR> 5. The boundary of a house.<BR> 6. Colouring the body with coloured unguents, Śāk. d. 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छेद|विच्छेदः
विच्छेद विच्छेद, i. e. वि-चिद् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Cutting.<BR> 2. Dividing, breaking, Kir. 7, 16.<BR> 3. Separation, interruption, Vikr. 60, 5. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b " target="_blank">Page0849-b + 42</a>]<BR> 4. A section, a chapter.<BR> 5. Interval.<BR> 6. Dissension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छेदन|विच्छेदनं
विच्छेदन विच्छेदन, i. e. वि-छिद् + अन, n. Destruction, Pañc. ii. d. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्युति|विच्युतिः
विच्युति वि-च्यु + ति, f. Separation, Nal. 13, 34.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भविच्युति|गर्भविच्युतिः
गर्भ- + विच्युति गर्भ- + विच्युति, f. miscarriage, Suśr. 1, 278, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गविच्युति
सङ्ग- + विच्युति सङ्ग- + विच्युति, f. 1. disunion. 2. separation from worldly attachment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विछ्|विच्छ्
† 1. विछ् विछ् (akin to वी), i. 6, विच्छाय, Par. To go, to approach.<BR> --Cf. οἰχνέω, οἴχομαι.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विछ्|विच्छ्
† 2. विछ् विछ्, i. 10, Par. To speak, to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्
1. विज् विज्, ii. 7, विनज्, विञ्ज्, Par.<BR> 1. To tremble.<BR> 2. To fear.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. विग्न, Trembling, Ragh. 14, 88.<BR> --Caus. वेजय, To terrify, Ragh. 8, 39.<BR> --With the prep. आ आ, आविग्न, Terrified, Arj. 6, 9.<BR> --With उद् उद्, i. 6, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 1, 5549; and i. 1, Ātm., MBh. 3, 2322).<BR> 1. To tremble, to be agitated, MBh. 3, 2322.<BR> 2. To suffer uneasiness, Man. 2, 161.<BR> 3. To fear (with the abl. and gen.), Man. 2, 162; 7, 103; to abhor, Pañc. iii. d. 191; to be reckless of (with abl.), Mālat. 51, 1.<BR> 4. To terrify, MBh. 2, 178. उद्विग्न,<BR> 1. Terrified, Rām. 1, 9, 12.<BR> 2. Afflicted, sorrowful, Hit. 4, 2, M.M.; Chr. 11, 14.<BR> 3. Anxious.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the fut., pass. उद्वेजनीय.<BR> 1. To be feared, Pañc. iii. d. 142; fearful, horrible.<BR> --Caus. To terrify, MBh. 1, 8427. उद्वेजित,<BR> 1. Terrified, Pañc. 209, 23.<BR> 2. Grieved, pained, Pañc. 222, 7.<BR> 3. Caused to loathe, Daśak. in Chr. 181, 16; 185, 5.<BR> --With निरुद् निस्-उद्, निरुद्विग्न, Fearless (rather उद्विग्न with निस्), Rām. 6, 16, 81.<BR> --With पर्युद् परि-उद्, To suffer, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a " target="_blank">Page0850-a + 40</a>] Rām. 2, 66, 9.<BR> --With समुद् सम्-उद्, समुद्विग्न, Terrified, anxious, Lass. 50, 16.<BR> --With वि वि, विविग्न, Agitated, stirred, Rājat. 5, 339.<BR> --With सम् सम्, संविग्न, Very frightened, MBh. 3, 2561.<BR> --Cf. probably ἀΐσσω; A.S. wicelian, vacillare, wince, A winch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्विग्न
अन्- + उद्विग्न अन्- + उद्विग्न, adj. not afflicted, Bhag. 2, 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्
† 2. विज् विज्, ii. 3, वेविज्, Par. Ātm. To be separate, to separate; cf. विच्, at the end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्
3. विज् विज् (m.), A die, for playing with, Chr. 295, 10 = Rigv. i. 92, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजनन|विजननं
विजनन वि-जन् + अन, n. Birth, delivery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजय|विजयः
विजय विजय, i. e. वि-जि + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Victory, Pañc. iii. d. 11.<BR> 2. Overpowering, Pañc. 168, 25.<BR> 3. A name of Arjuna.<BR> 4. Name of an auspicious hour, Rām. 1, 73, 1.<BR> II. f. या<BR> 1. Durgā.<BR> 2. The name of several plants.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्विजय|दिग्विजयः
दिग्विजय दिग्विजय, i. e. दिश्-, m. conquest of the whole earth, Hit. 84, 10, M.M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजयन्त|विजयंत|विजयंतः|विजयन्तः
विजयन्त वि-जयन्त् + अ (vb. जि), m. Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजयिन्
विजयिन् विजयिन्, i. e. विजय + इन्,<BR> I. adj. Victorious, Hit. iii. d. 84.<BR> II. m. Conqueror, Pañc. iii. d. 270.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरविजयिन्
समर- + विजयिन् समर- + विजयिन्, m. one who has been victorious in battle, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2087.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिगीष|विजिगीषः
विजिगीष विजिगीष, i. e. वि-जिगीष, desider. of जि, + अ, adj. Desirous of conquering, emulative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिगीषा
विजिगीषा विजिगीषा, i. e. वि-जिगीष + आ (see the last), f. Wish to surpass, emulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिगीषिन्
विजिगीषिन् विजिगीषिन्, i. e. वि-जिगीष + इन् (see the last), adj. Desirous of victory, Johns. Sel. 56, 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिगीषु|विजिगीषुः
विजिगीषु विजिगीषु, i. e. वि-जिगीष + उ (see the last),<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. One who wishes [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b " target="_blank">Page0850-b + 42</a>] to conquer, Man. 7, 155; Pañc. iii. d. 36.<BR> 2. Desirous to surpass.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A warrior.<BR> 2. An invader.<BR> 3. A disputant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिल|विजिलं|विजिलः
विजिल विजिल, and विजिविल विजिविल, adj. Mixed with rice-water or gruel (sauces, etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजृम्भण|विजृंभण|विजृंभणं|विजृम्भणं
विजृम्भण विजृम्भण, i. e. वि-जृम्भ् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Yawning.<BR> 2. Expanding, extending, Mālat. 144, 20.<BR> 3. Sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजेतृ
विजेतृ विजेतृ, i. e. वि-जि + तृ, m., f. तॄ, n.<BR> 1. A conqueror, Kir. 5, 34; Utt. Rāmac. 62, 14.<BR> 2. Victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्जल|विज्जलं
विज्जल विज्जल,<BR> I. adj. = विजिल.<BR> II. n. An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्ञ|विज्ञः
विज्ञ वि-ज्ञ, adj.<BR> 1. Knowing, Lass. 2. ed. 90, 44.<BR> 2. Wise, Cāṇ. 20 in Berl. Monatsb. 1864, 408; Hit. ii. d. 151 (but cf. Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2042).<BR> 3. Skilful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्ञान|विज्ञानं
विज्ञान विज्ञान, i. e. वि-ज्ञा + अन, n.<BR> 1. Knowledge, Hit. ii. d. 142.<BR> 2. Learning.<BR> 3. Wisdom, Hit. i. d. 167, M.M.<BR> 4. Art, Śāk. d. 2.<BR> 5. Music.<BR> 6. Intelligence, Chr. 6, 9 (at the end of a comp. adj.).<BR> 7. Distinction, Vedāntas. in Chr. 207, 5.<BR> 8. Business, employment.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविज्ञान
अ- + विज्ञान अ- + विज्ञान, n. absence of knowledge; abl. नात्, unknowingly, Man. 2, 220; on a sudden, Lass. 2. ed. 40, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविज्ञान
सु- + विज्ञान सु- + विज्ञान, adj. very wise, Pañc. iii. d. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्ञापक|विज्ञापकः
विज्ञापक विज्ञापक, i. e. वि-ज्ञा, Caus., + अक,<BR> I. adj. Who or what makes known.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. An informant.<BR> 2. An instructor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्ञापन|विज्ञापनं
विज्ञापन विज्ञापन, i. e. वि-ज्ञा, Caus., + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Teaching.<BR> 2. Informing, representing.<BR> II. f. ना, Information, Ragh. 17, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विट्
विट् विट्, see बिट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विट|विटः
विट विट, m.<BR> 1. A catamite, a pathic, a voluptuary, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 13; Bhartṛ. 1, 49.<BR> 2. A paramour, Pañc. 186, 1.<BR> 3. An attendant on a dissolute [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a " target="_blank">Page0851-a + 41</a>] character or courtezan, a bawd, Bhartṛ. 3, 57.<BR> 4. A rogue, Rājat. 5, 202; 351.<BR> 5. A rat.<BR> 6. A branch and its shoot.<BR> 7. The orange tree.<BR> 8. The name of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0850-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विटङ्क|विटंक|विटंकः|विटङ्कः
विटङ्क विटङ्क, m. n. An aviary; the loftiest point, Mālat. 166, 2 (Prākṛ.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विटप|विटपः
विटप विटप,<BR> I. m. and n.<BR> 1. The branch of a tree with its new sprout.<BR> 2. A branch, Vikr. 59, 2; Bhāg. P. 4, 25, 18.<BR> 3. A new shoot, Hit. iv. d. 101.<BR> 4. A bush.<BR> 5. A bunch, a cluster, a tuft.<BR> 6. A thicket, Pañc. 184, 21.<BR> 7. Spreading, expansion.<BR> 8. The septum of the scrotum.<BR> II. m., i. e. विट-प, The keeper of catamites.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नम्रविटप
नम्र- + विटप नम्र- + विटप, adj. the branches of which are bent down, Vikr. d. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विटपशस्
विटपशस् विटप + शस्, adv. In branches, Bhāg. P. 2, 7, 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विटपिन्
विटपिन् विटपिन्, i. e. विटप + इन्,<BR> I. adj. Having branches, MBh. 1, 1775.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A tree, Rājat. 5, 477.<BR> 2. The large Indian fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विट्चर|विट्चरः
विट्चर विट्चर, i. e. विश् (in the ved. signification, family, house), -चर, m. The tame or village hog (cf. विड्वराह).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विट्पति|विट्पतिः
विट्पति विट्पति, i. e. विश्-पति,<BR> 1. A daughter's husband, Man. 3, 148.<BR> 2. A head merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विड्
विड् विड्, see बिट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विड|विडं|विडः
विड विड (perhaps a dialectical form based on वि-द्र, vb. 1. द्रा), n.<BR> 1. Factitious salt.<BR> 2. A particular kind of fetid salt.<BR> 3. A part, a bit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडङ्ग|विडंग|विडङ्गं|विडङ्गः
विडङ्ग विडङ्ग, adj. Clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडम्बन|विडंबन|विडंबनं|विडम्बनं
विडम्बन वि-डम्ब् + अन,<BR> I. n.<BR> 1. Imitation, copying, disguise, Bhartṛ. 3, 23; Rājat. 5, 207.<BR> 2. The supernatural assumption of a borrowed form.<BR> 3. Afflicting, distressing.<BR> 4. Frustrating. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b " target="_blank">Page0851-b + 40</a>]<BR> 5. Vexation, Hit. 99, 18; mortification, Brahmav. 2, 79.<BR> II. f. ना.<BR> 1. Deceiving, fraud, Pañc. iv. d. 9; breach of faith, Pañc. 125, 25.<BR> 2. Pain, distress, Pañc. 220, 14; Bhartṛ. 3, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडम्बिन्
विडम्बिन् वि-डम्ब् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Causing error, like, Utt. Rāmac. 118, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडारक|विडारकः
विडारक विडार + क (see the next), m. A cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडाल|विडालः
विडाल विडाल, m.<BR> 1. A cat, Rām. 3, 53, 57; Hit. 58, 7.<BR> 2. The eyeball.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनविडाल
वन- + विडाल वन- + विडाल, m. a sort of wild cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडालक|विडालकं|विडालकः
विडालक 1. विडाल + क,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A cat.<BR> 2. Application of ointment to the external part of the eye.<BR> II. n. Yellow orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडीनक
विडीनक वि-डीन + क (vb. डी), n. Flying severally, MBh. 8, 1901.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडौजस्
विडौजस् विडौजस् (the last part is ओजस्), m. Indra, Śāk. d. 193; Ragh. 3, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विड्वराह|विड्वराहः
विड्वराह विड्वराह, i. e. विश्-वराह (cf. विट्चर), m. A tame hog, Man. 5, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विण्ट्
† विण्ट् विण्ट्, वुण्ट् वुण्ट्, i. 10, Par.<BR> 1. To kill.<BR> 2. To decay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितंस|वितंसः
वितंस and वीतंस वी̆तंस, i. e. वि-तंस् + अ, m. A cage, a net, or any apparatus for confining birds or beasts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितण्डा|वितंडा
वितण्डा वितण्डा, f.<BR> 1. Controversy.<BR> 2. Criticism, Windischmann, Sancara, 96.<BR> 3. A ladle.<BR> 4. The name of two plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विततत्व
विततत्व वि-तत + त्व (vb. तन्), n. Largeness, Hariv. 12375.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितति|विततिः
वितति वितति, i. e. वि-तन् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Spreading.<BR> 2. Quantity.<BR> 3. A cluster, a clump, Kir. 12, 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितरण|वितरणं
वितरण वितरण, i. e. वि-तॄ + अन, n.<BR> 1. Passing, crossing.<BR> 2. Gift, donation.<BR> 3. Abandoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितर्क|वितर्कः
वितर्क वि-तर्क् + अ, m.<BR> 1. Deliberation, Pañc. i. d. 226.<BR> 2. Consideration. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a " target="_blank">Page0852-a + 41</a>] Hit. iv. d. 96.<BR> 3. Opinion, Johns. Sel. 55, 143; conjecture, Mālat. 20, 3.<BR> 4. Discussion, Prab. 116, 9.<BR> 5. Doubt, Lass. 2. ed. 21, 1.<BR> 6. A teacher in divine knowledge.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्वितर्क
दुस्- + वितर्क दुस्- + वितर्क, adj. difficult to be considered or penetrated, Bhāg. P. 3, 20, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सवितर्कम्
स-वितर्क + म् स-वितर्क + म्, adv. thoughtfully, Śāk. 33, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0851-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितर्कण|वितर्कणं
वितर्कण वितर्कण, i. e. वि-तर्क् + अन, n.<BR> 1. Reasoning.<BR> 2. Discussion.<BR> 3. Doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितर्द्धि
वितर्द्धि and वितर्द्धी वितर्द्धी̆,<BR> 1. A terrace in the centre of a court-yard of a palace or temple.<BR> 2. A seat, a bench.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितस्ता
वितस्ता वितस्ता, f. The name of a river, Rājat. 5, 88; 271.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितस्ति|वितस्तिः
वितस्ति वितस्ति, i. e. वि-तंस् + ति, m. and f. A long span, measured by the extended thumb and little finger, Āśvalāy. Gṛhyas. iv. 1, in Journ. of the German Oriental Society, ix. i. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितान|वितानं|वितानः
वितान वितान, i. e. वि-तन् + अ, m.<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Empty.<BR> 2. Pithless.<BR> 3. Stupid.<BR> II. m. and n.<BR> 1. Spreading, expansion, Nalod. 2, 50.<BR> 2. A heap, a quantity.<BR> 3. A canopy, Vikr. d. 76; Bhartṛ. 3, 93; an awning, Johns. Sel. 40, 37; a cover, Ragh. 9, 50; a cushion, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 2156.<BR> 4. The hearth or hole in which the sacred fires are kept.<BR> 5. Sacrifice, Nalod. 2, 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितानाय
वितानाय वितानाय, a denomin. derived from वितान with य, Ātm. To turn a canopy, Mālat. 148, 7 (pass. refl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्त्
† वित्त् वित्त्, i. 10, Par. To quit, to abandon, to give (cf. वित्त, under विद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्तक
वित्तक वित्त + क (vb. विद्), Known, famous, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्तज
वित्तज वित्त-ज, adj. Produced by wealth, Pañc. ii. d. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्तवन्त्|वित्तवत्
वित्तवन्त् वित्त + वन्त् (vb. विद्), adj. Wealthy, Pañc. 8, 3; ii. d. 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्ति|वित्तिः
वित्ति वित्ति, i. e. विद् + ति, f.<BR> 1. Investigation.<BR> 2. Probability, likelihood.<BR> 3. Knowledge.<BR> 4. Acquisition, gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्रप
वित्रप वित्रप, m. A proper name, Rājat. 5, 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्रास|वित्रासः
वित्रास वित्रास, i. e. वि-त्रस् + अ, m. Fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विथ्
† विथ् विथ्, वेथ् वेथ्, विध् विध्, i. 1, Ātm. To beg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विथुर|विथुरः
विथुर विथुर,<BR> I. probably व्यथ् + उर, adj. Trembling, Chr. 293, 3 = Rigv. i. 87, 3.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A Rākṣasa.<BR> 2. A thief.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविथुर
अ- + विथुर अ- + विथुर, adj. fearless, Chr. 293, 1 = Rigv. i. 87, 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्
1. विद् विद् (originally ‘To see’),<BR> A. ii. 2, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., Rām. 1, 57, 5).<BR> 1. To perceive, to feel, Ragh. 14, 56.<BR> 2. To learn, MBh. 3, 16968.<BR> 3. To find out, MBh. 1, 6040.<BR> 4. To know, Man. 2, 126; imperat. विदां करोतु, He may know, Pañc. v. d. 23; ved. विदा (the final lengthened), Chr. 292, 8 = Rigv. i. 86, 8. Ātm. ved. To be known, Chr. 293, 6 = Rigv. i. 87, 6 (विद्रे, ved. 3. pl. of the the pres.).<BR> 5. To consider, Man. 2, 156; Pañc. iii. d. 231; to value, Hit. iv. d. 52; to take for, Bhag. 2, 19; also ii. 7, Bhaṭṭ. 6, 39.<BR> 6. To ascertain, Man. 7, 135.<BR> B. i. 6, विन्द, Par. Ātm.<BR> 1. (To see =), to find, Hit. i. d. 199, M.M.; also ii. 7, MBh. 3, 15388.<BR> 2. To obtain, MBh. 3, 6016.<BR> 3. Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 1, 4090), To take in marriage, Man. 9, 69; to choose a bridegroom, Man. 9, 90.<BR> C. ii. 7, विनद्, विन्द्, Ātm. (in epic poetry also Par., MBh. 3, 8123).<BR> 1. See<BR> A.<BR> 5.<BR> 2. See<BR> B.<BR> 1.<BR> 3. † To consider, to reason.<BR> D. i. 4, Ātm. (properly pass.).<BR> 1. To be found, to happen, Man. 4, 49.<BR> 2. To exist, Hit. i. d. 116, M.M.; Bhag. 4, 38.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pres. विद्वंस्.<BR> 1. Intelligent, wise, Hit. iii. d. 5.<BR> 2. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0853-a " target="_blank">Page0853-a + 47</a>] Learned, Man. 4, 91; Hit. pr. d. 12, M.M. m.<BR> 1. A sage, Bhartṛ. 2, 96.<BR> 2. A scholar, Śāk. d. 2.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Comp.<BR> --Ptcple. of the pf. pass.<BR> I. विदित.<BR> 1. Known (with gen.), Vikr. 63, 9.<BR> 2. Promised.<BR> 3. Informed.<BR> 4. Represented.<BR> 5. Who or what knows. m. A learned man, a sage. n. Information, representation.<BR> --Comp.<BR> अ-, adj. unknown. n. not knowing, Chr. 5, 6 (loc. ˚ते पितुः, without the knowledge of my father).<BR> II. वित्त.<BR> 1. Known.<BR> 2. Notorious.<BR> 3. Famous, Daśak. in Chr. 179, 20; Lass. 26, 18.<BR> 4. Investigated, discussed, judged.<BR> 5. Acquired, gained. n.<BR> 1. Wealth, property, Johns. Sel. 3, 15; Pañc. 6, 7; iv. d. 30; money, Pañc. 237, 1.<BR> 2. Substance, power, Pañc. i. d. 25 (but cf. Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 1544); thing.<BR> III. विन्न.<BR> 1. Known.<BR> 2. Discussed, judged.<BR> 3. Obtained, gained.<BR> 4. Married.<BR> 5. Placed, fixed.<BR> --Comp. ptcple. of the fut. pass. अ-वेद्य, adj.<BR> 1. Not to be known, unascertainable, secret.<BR> 2. Not to be married, Man. 10, 24. m. A calf. Desider. विविदिष, To desire, to strive to know, Bhāg. P. 2, 9, 40; Vedāntas. in Chr. 203, 1.<BR> --Caus., and i. 10, Par. Ātm. वेदय.<BR> 1. To teach, MBh. 3, 14048.<BR> 2. To report, Man. 11, 31.<BR> 3. To know, MBh. 2, 175.<BR> 4. Ātm. To be perceived, to be sensible, Man. 12, 13.<BR> 5. † To dwell, to inhabit.<BR> --Comp. anomal. ptcple. of the pres. Ātm. अ-वेदयान, adj. One who is not able to show, Man. 8, 32.<BR> --With the prep. अधि अधि, i. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0853-b " target="_blank">Page0853-b + 42</a>] 6, To supersede (a wife), by taking in marriage another, Man. 9, 80. अधि-विन्न, f. ना, A superseded wife, 9, 83.<BR> --With अनु अनु, i. 6,<BR> 1. To find again, Pañc. ii. d. 134.<BR> 2. To find out, to believe. Gīt. 4, 2.<BR> 3. Ātm. To take in marriage, MBh. 1, 5114.<BR> --With अभि अभि, i. 6,<BR> 1. To obtain, MBh. 3, 1933.<BR> 2. To follow, MBh. 3, 13698.<BR> --With आ आ, Caus.<BR> 1. To report, Rām. 1, 20, 5.<BR> 2. To present, Vikr. 82, 18; Sāv. 3, 6.<BR> --With समा सम्-आ, Caus. To report, MBh. 2, 14.<BR> --With नि नि, Caus.<BR> 1. To make known, to report, MBh. 3, 1689.<BR> 2. To betray, MBh. 3, 11322.<BR> 3. To pass one's self off as, Śāk. 13, 21.<BR> 4. To present, Man. 2, 51.<BR> 5. To offer as sacrifice, Pañc. 174, 16.<BR> 6. To know, Pañc. 228, 4 (perhaps it is to be changed to निविदित). निवेद्य, n. An oblation, Rājat. 5, 52.<BR> --Comp. absol. अ-निवेद्य, Without having reported it, Daśak. in Chr. 189, 19. Anomal. infin. निवेदितुम्, MBh. 2, 1723 (but Śāk. 60, 18, read निवेदयितुम्).<BR> --With विनि वि-नि, Caus. To report, Rām. 1, 1, 72.<BR> --With संनि सम्-नि, Caus. To report, MBh. 1, 3224.<BR> --With निस् निस्, i. 4, Ātm.<BR> 1. To be disgusted, Böhtl. Ind. Spr. 528; with one's self, MBh. 3, 14792.<BR> 2. To resign, Bhāg. P. 1, 4, 12. निर्विण्ण,<BR> 1. Disgusted with (gen.), Pañc. 51, 25; 137, 1 (instr.), Śāk. 20, 2 (Prākṛ.).<BR> 2. Despondent. Hit. i. d. 133, M.M.<BR> 3. Emaciate with grief, decayed.<BR> 4. Abused, degraded.<BR> 5. Humble.<BR> 6. Known.<BR> --With परि परि, i. 6, pass. To marry before one's elder brother, Man. 3, 172. परिविण्ण, An unmarried elder brother whose junior is married.<BR> --With प्रति प्रति, ii. 7, To obtain, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a " target="_blank">Page0854-a + 45</a>] MBh. 3, 8420.<BR> --Caus.<BR> 1. To make known, to report, Rām. 2, 45, 15.<BR> 2. To deliver, Rām. 1, 2, 9.<BR> --With संप्रति सम्-प्रति, Caus. To report, to tell, MBh. 1, 3627.<BR> --With सम् सम्, ii. 2, Ātm.<BR> 1. To know, to meditate, Bhaṭṭ. 8, 17.<BR> 2. To teach, MBh. 1, 2114. संविदित,<BR> 1. Known.<BR> 2. Agreed, promised. n. Agreement, concurrence, Mālav. 45, 17. स्व-संवेद्य,<BR> 1. To be known only by one's self, Daśak. in Chr. 182, 14.<BR> 2. To be understood by themselves, Rājat. 5, 366.<BR> --Caus. To perceive, Bhaṭṭ. 17, 63.<BR> --Cf. Lat. videre, vitrum; Goth. vitan; A.S. wítan; Goth. veitvods (= विद्वत्, विद्वंस्); A.S. wíta, gnarus, ge-wit, ge-wittig; O.H.G. weizian, To show; A.S. wisian, ge-wis; Goth. vitôth, in-veitan; A.S. witan, imputare, wite, poena, witnian, punire; O.H.G. wîzago, propheta, wîzagôn; A.S. wítegian; ἴδον, εἶδον (i. e. ἔϝιδον), ἴνδαλμα, ἀειδής, ἀϊδής, ἄϊστος, οἶδα (= वेद), εἰδώς (= विद्वान्[स्]), ἴδμων, ἴστωρ, ἱστορέω, ὕδνης, ὕδω, ὑδέω, ἀείδω (cf. the Zend. use).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविद्
अ- + विद् अ- + विद्, adj. sbst. ignorant, an ignorant man, Man. 4, 191; a fool, Man. 2, 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदविद्
वेद- + विद् वेद- + विद्, 1. adj. skilled in the Vedas, Chr. 12, 2. 2. m. a Brāhmaṇa learned in the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शस्त्रविद्
शस्त्र- + विद् शस्त्र- + विद्, adj. skilled in arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्यमान|विद्यमानः
विद्यमान विद्यमान, 1. existing, Pañc. 139, 4; being preserved, Pañc. i. d. 402. 2. real, actual. 3. being in one's possession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविद्
अ- + विद् अ- + विद्, adj. 1. non-existing, not being alive, Man. 2, 248. 2. not present, absent. 3. not being in one's possession, Man. 11, 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्
2. विद् विद्, adj. Who or what knows; latter part of comp. nouns, अश्व-, adj. sbst. Conversant with the qualities of horses, epithet of Nala, Nal. 1, 1. कृत्स्न-, adj. All-knowing, Bhartṛ. 3, 29. क्षेत्र-,<BR> I. adj. Conversant with any object, Kumāras. 3, 50.<BR> II. m. The soul, Bhāg. P. 4, 22, 37.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्रकर्मविद्|चित्रकर्म्मविद्
चित्रकर्मविद् चित्रकर्मविद्, i. e. चित्र-कर्मन्-, adj. skilled in painting, Hit. ii. d. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिर्विद्
ज्योतिर्विद् ज्योतिर्विद्, i. e. ज्योतिस्-, adj. sbst. knowing the stars, an astrologer, Yājñ. 1, 332.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विद्
तद्- + विद् तद्- + विद्, adj. knowing that, Vikr. d. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्मविद्|धर्म्मविद्
धर्म- + विद् धर्म- + विद्, adj. 1. acquainted with the law, Man. 2, 61. 2. virtuous, ib. 2, 245.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वधर्मविद्|सर्व्वधर्म्मविद्
सर्व-धर्म- + विद् सर्व-धर्म- + विद्, adj. one who knows the whole of duty, Man. 8, 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदविद्
वेद- + विद् वेद- + विद्, adj. conversant with the Vedas, Chr. 13, 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदग्धता
विदग्धता विदग्ध + ता (vb. दह्), f.<BR> 1. Cleverness, Lass. 5, 18.<BR> 2. Elegance, Mālat. 2, 19.<BR> 3. Shrewdness, sharpness, wit, Hit. ii. d. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदथ|विदथः
विदथ विद् + अथ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A wise or learned man.<BR> 2. An ascetic, a devotee.<BR> II. n. Sacrifice, Chr. 290, 1 = Rigv. i. 64, 1; Chr. 291, 1 = Rigv. i. 85, 1.<BR> --Cf. Goth. vitôth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदर|विदरं|विदरः
विदर विदर, i. e. वि-दॄ + अ,<BR> I. m. Tearing, rending.<BR> II. n. A plant, Cactus indicus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदर्भ|विदर्भः
विदर्भ वि-दर्भ, m.<BR> 1. The name of a country, Nal. 1, 5 (pl.); ib. 32 (sing.).<BR> 2. The king of that country, Nal. 1, 32.<BR> 3. Any dry or desert soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदर्शिन्
विदर्शिन् विदर्शिन्, i. e. वि-दृश् + इन्, adj., f. नी, Penetrating, Rām. 2, 116, 27 Gorr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदल|विदलं|विदलः
विदल विदल, i. e. वि-दल and वि-दल् + अ,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Opened, blown (as a flower).<BR> 2. Rent.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. Dividing, separating.<BR> 2. A cake.<BR> 3. Mountain ebony, Bauhinia variegata.<BR> III. n.<BR> 1. The cuttings or chips of any substance, a twig, Man. 9, 230.<BR> 2. Split peas, Lass. 79, 15.<BR> 3. Pomegranate bark.<BR> 4. A basket made of split bambus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदलन|विदलनं
विदलन वि-दल् + अन, n. Tearing, rending, Pañc. i. d. 351.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदा
विदा विद् + आ, f. Knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदार|विदारः
विदार विदार, i. e. वि-दॄ + अ,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. Tearing.<BR> 2. Cutting, Bhartṛ. 2, 23.<BR> 3. War, battle.<BR> 4. The rising of a river above its banks, inundation.<BR> II. f. री, The name of two plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारक|विदारकं|विदारकः
विदारक विदारक, i. e. वि-दॄ + अक,<BR> I. m.<BR> 1. A render, a divider.<BR> 2. A rock in the middle of a stream.<BR> 3. A hole or pit for water, sunk in the middle of a dry river.<BR> II. f. रिका, The name of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0854-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारण|विदारणं|विदारणः
विदारण विदारण, i. e. वि-दॄ + अन,<BR> I. m. The name of a tree.<BR> II. n.<BR> 1. Tearing, breaking, Pañc. i. e. 418.<BR> 2. Killing.<BR> 3. Afflicting.<BR> III. n., and f. णा, War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदाहिन्
विदाहिन् विदाहिन्, i. e. वि-दह् + इन्, adj.<BR> 1. Burning, hot, Bhag. 17, 9.<BR> 2. Pungent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदिशा
विदिशा विदिशा, f. The name of a river and town, Pañc. iii. d. 240 (cf. Wils. Viṣṇu P. 183, 52).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदुर|विदुरः
विदुर विद् + उर,<BR> I. adj. Wise, knowing.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A learned or clever man.<BR> 2. An intriguer.<BR> 3. A proper name, Pañc. i. d. 176; Johns. Sel. 8, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूर|विदूरः
विदूर वि-दूर,<BR> I. m. The name of a mountain and city whence the lapis lazuli is brought.<BR> II. वि-दूर + तस्, adv. Far, Mālat. 61, 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूषक|विदूषकः
विदूषक विदूषक, i. e. वि-दुष्, Caus., + अह,<BR> I. adj.<BR> 1. Censorious, detracting.<BR> 2. Facetious, witty.<BR> II. m.<BR> 1. A jester, a buffoon.<BR> 2. (In dramatic language), The jocose companion of the principal person, Vikr. 15, 1.<BR> 3. A catamite, Daśak. in Chr. 180, 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूषण|विदूषणं
विदूषण विदूषण, i. e. वि-दुष्, Caus., + अन, n.<BR> 1. Censuring.<BR> 2. Abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदेशग
विदेशग वि-देश-ग, adj. Going in a foreign country, Pañc. v. d. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदेह|विदेहः
विदेह वि-देह,<BR> I. adj. Without body.<BR> II. m. The king of Videhā.<BR> III. f. हा, The name of a district.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्या
विद्या विद् + या, f.<BR> 1. Knowledge, learning, Pañc. i. d. 446; 243, 19, sqq.<BR> 2. A magical pill or bolus, by putting which into the mouth, a person has the power of ascending to heaven.<BR> 3. Durgā.<BR> 4. A tree, Premna spinosa.<BR> --Comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविद्या
अ- + विद्या अ- + विद्या,<BR> I. f. want of knowledge, ignorance.<BR> II. adj. unlearned, Man. 9, 205.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मविद्या
आत्मविद्या आत्मविद्या, i. e. आत्मन्-, f. the [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-b " target="_blank">Page0855-b + 41</a>] knowledge of the Supreme Spirit, Man. 7, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यात्मविद्या
अध्यात्म- + विद्या अध्यात्म- + विद्या, f. the same, Bhag. 10, 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BEN&page=0855-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ben" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतविद्य
